SELECT 'agra', 'taj-view-agra', 'published', 'Taj View Agra IHCL SeleQtions – Wedding Cost & Packages Info', 'Taj View Agra IHCL SeleQtions offers iconic wedding venues overlooking the Taj Mahal. Discover cost guides, guest reviews & all-inclusive packages. Book!', 'Taj view Agra IHCL SeleQtions wedding, Tajview Agra IHCL SeleQtions wedding cost, Tajview Agra IHCL SeleQtions review, Tajview Agra IHCL SeleQtions wedding package', '/storage/hotel/seo/3t48NjWOO1rwQ5eg1rhGNGPatiXpqlH71ELSGiom.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/OFuZJ8g04KwjhHPS6ITw4qXDG1bfjAwicyRAw09i.jpg', 'Taj View Agra', 'Fatehabad Rd, Bagichi, Tajganj, Agra, Uttar Pradesh 282001, India', '25 Minutes', '15 minutes', '<p>Just minutes from the Taj Mahal,&nbsp;<strong>Tajview, Agra – IHCL SeleQtions</strong> offers the kind of setting many families look for while planning a refined yet relaxed wedding celebration in Agra. Spread across a peaceful 6-acre estate on Fatehabad Road, the recently renovated 5-star luxury hotel combines landscaped gardens, elegant interiors and easy connectivity to Agra Airport and Agra Fort, making a&nbsp;<strong>wedding at Tajview, Agra IHCL SeleQtions</strong> convenient for both local and travelling guests.</p><p>The hotel is especially well-suited for intimate and mid-sized destination weddings, with expansive outdoor lawns, indoor celebration venues and rooftop spaces that naturally adapt to multi-day festivities. Whether it is a daytime mehendi, a formal family dinner or a reception beneath the evening sky,&nbsp;<strong>Tajview, Agra – IHCL SeleQtions</strong> creates a seamless flow between ceremonies, guest stays and dining experiences.</p><p>A major reason couples choose a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Agra</strong> at&nbsp;<strong>Tajview, Agra – IHCL SeleQtions</strong> is the dependable IHCL SeleQtions hospitality experience. Guests can enjoy Taj Mahal views, heritage walks, wellness therapies at the Tented Spa and thoughtfully curated dining, while families appreciate the attentive service and calm atmosphere throughout the celebrations.</p>', '92 rooms with suites', 'Phoolbagh', 'Mumtaz', '200', '200', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/pXyLHQ37tR3ucMPrSywosA50Zvo74s9RvjDGUsnY.jpg", "title": "4+ dining venues onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/3IeVnCtzSSiPbvDlMR1TL4ys0UHycKFXxb2G9bIK.jpg", "title": "Heritage-style Agra breakfast experiences"}]', '[{"id": 1253, "question": "Which months are most popular for weddings at Tajview, Agra IHCL SeleQtions?", "answer": "<p>The most popular wedding season at&nbsp;<strong>Tajview, Agra IHCL SeleQtions</strong> runs from October to March, when the weather stays pleasant for outdoor celebrations. Summer months are relatively quieter and may offer better venue availability and pricing.</p>"}, {"id": 1254, "question": "Can guests attending a wedding at Tajview, Agra IHCL SeleQtions, get an early check-in?", "answer": "<p>Yes, guests can be accommodated with an early check-in to the property, subject to the hotel’s discretion. The standard time to check-in at&nbsp;<strong>Tajview, Agra IHCL SeleQtions</strong> is 2:00 pm, and the check-out time is 12:00 noon.</p>"}, {"id": 1255, "question": "Can photographers use hotel spaces at Tajview, Agra IHCL SeleQtions, before the wedding day?", "answer": "<p>Yes, pre-wedding and engagement photoshoots are generally allowed at&nbsp;<strong>Tajview, Agra IHCL SeleQtions</strong> with prior approval. Photography access, timings and applicable charges depend on hotel policies and event availability.</p>"}, {"id": 1256, "question": "Does Tajview, Agra IHCL SeleQtions offer salon, laundry and ironing facilities?", "answer": "<p>Yes, the hotel offers salon services, laundry assistance and in-room ironing facilities for guest convenience during wedding stays.</p>"}, {"id": 1257, "question": "What is the standard liquor policy at Tajview, Agra IHCL SeleQtions weddings?", "answer": "<p><strong>Tajview, Agra IHCL SeleQtions</strong> follows an in-house liquor policy for weddings. Bar services and beverage packages are arranged by the hotel separately, while outside alcohol is generally not permitted on the property.</p>"}]', '156', '92'
