SELECT 'agra', 'the-oberoi-amarvilas-agra', 'published', 'The Oberoi Amarvilas Agra Wedding Cost & Hotel Booking', 'The Oberoi Amarvilas Agra wedding cost, booking, price & packages. Plan a luxury Taj view destination wedding in Agra. Check details & book hotel now.', 'the oberoi amarvilas agra wedding cost, the oberoi amarvilas wedding cost, the oberoi amarvilas agra booking, the oberoi amarvilas agra wedding, the oberoi amarvilas agra price', '/storage/hotel/seo/gIEq19k9Vb1XmKQpOYtdQJ4tlslJ2HP0OCHc6bip.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/YvBpLHMRGDl02MAW5W137j4iG0DB8ZSV9nRXyMEJ.jpg', 'The Oberoi Amarvilas Agra', 'Taj East Gate Rd, Paktola, Tajganj, Agra, Uttar Pradesh 282001, India', '30 minutes', '20 Minutes', '<p>Situated minutes away from the Taj Mahal,&nbsp;<strong>The Oberoi Amarvilas, Agra</strong>, showcases a beautiful blend of royal elegance and luxurious comfort. The resort’s architecture draws inspiration from traditional palace design and features terraced lawns, magnificent fountains, and elegant pavilions. Each and every accommodation offers unobstructed views of the Taj Mahal, allowing guests to marvel at its breathtaking grandeur all day long.</p><p>Weddings here are curated to suit both intimate gatherings and grand celebrations. Event spaces open onto landscaped gardens, while gourmet dining, attentive planners, and personalised touches ensure every detail is taken care of. Couples can enjoy a private ‘Renewal of Vows’ ceremony or a starlit dinner with views of the Taj Mahal.</p><p>Beyond celebrations, the hotel is the perfect peaceful retreat for guests. Couples’ spa therapies, wide pools and private dining experiences offer relaxation, while comfortable rooms and suites ensure a restful stay. Every wedding is set against one of the Seven Wonders of the World, creating lasting memories.</p>', '102 rooms with suites', 'Roshnara & Jahanara Ballrooms, The Birbal Room', 'Open Lawns and Terraces, Landscaped Gardens, Pool Deck', '240', '240', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/6CJd7WykQ3krx7BTbtqLVo6dqSUUgXi2E4Z0bj1f.jpg", "title": "4+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/JDtNoRRrQ2wMiOB6uxbVSObpoy7IUdgcWGYMjvCM.jpg", "title": "Starlit dinner by poolside pavilion"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/FVkOjlY9jXlXtJdLutljarkCByhrER3q8HKnH9VN.jpg", "title": "Romantic private balcony dining"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/QVN3qatLQzGh80kpqdj3mq9Jz5mWbkaMZgl3m1Jo.jpg", "title": "Renewal of vows ceremony"}]', '[{"id": 173, "question": "How much does a wedding at The Oberoi Amarvilas, Agra resort cost?", "answer": "<p>On average, a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at The Oberoi Amarvilas, Agra</strong>, costs approximately INR&nbsp; 1 Cr to INR 1.5 Cr for a 3-day, 2-night celebration. To get an exact quote based on your guest capacity, room requirements, etc, refer to our Cost Calculator. Enter your preferred dates and hit ‘calculate hotel cost’ to get a precise and instant estimate.</p>"}, {"id": 174, "question": "Are there any special offers for wedding couples at The Oberoi Amarvilas, Agra?", "answer": "<p>With carefully chosen event spaces overlooking the Taj Mahal, fine dining and individualised planning services, the&nbsp;<strong>Oberoi Amarvilas in Agra&nbsp;</strong>offers opulent wedding packages made for unforgettable celebrations. Couples can also enjoy a 30-minute ‘Renewal of Vows’ ceremony on the property, usually priced at around INR 45,000 plus taxes, which includes traditional attire to make the occasion truly special.</p>"}, {"id": 175, "question": "Should I choose The Oberoi Amarvilas, Agra, or The Oberoi Rajvilas, Jaipur, for my wedding?", "answer": "<p>The Oberoi Amarvilas has 102 rooms and a wedding budget that starts at INR&nbsp; 1 Cr to INR 1.5 Cr. It is a great place for small weddings with the Taj Mahal as a beautiful backdrop. With 71 guest rooms and a budget ranging from INR 1.5–2.25 Cr, The Oberoi Rajvilas suits Intimate, ultra-luxurious celebrations, offering a regal palace-style experience. Owing to their proximity to the Jaipur International Airport, both are within 25 to 45 minutes away; the decision comes down to size, cost and the type of setting you like best.</p>"}, {"id": 176, "question": "What is the check-in time at The Oberoi Amarvilas, Agra, and can guests check-in early?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at The Oberoi Amarvilas, Agra is 2:00 pm, and check-out is by 12:00 noon. Guests attending a wedding at the resort can check in early, but it is recommended to check with the hotel beforehand, as availability is subject to change.</p>"}, {"id": 177, "question": "What is The Oberoi Amarvilas, Agra’s liquor policy for destination weddings?", "answer": "<p>Alcohol is served at The Oberoi Amarvilas, Agra, but all beverages served in the banquet halls and public spaces must be purchased through the hotel. Outside alcohol is not allowed inside the property premises. Standard wedding packages typically do not include beverage charges and are billed separately based on consumption.</p>"}]', '45', '102'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'agra' AND `slug` = 'the-oberoi-amarvilas-agra');
