SELECT 'agra', 'trident-agra', 'published', 'Trident Agra Wedding Cost, Packages & Hotel Booking', 'Trident Agra wedding cost, wedding booking, wedding packages & Trident Hotel Agra details. Explore Trident Agra for wedding planning. Book now.', 'trident agra wedding cost, trident agra wedding booking, trident agra wedding packages, trident hotel agra', '/storage/hotel/seo/f7AbVHTzmTCXHfNFO6iiSuVvc858uraHOFLZeJ01.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/POx8N3ecb2b5q1WOjHzIUXuGTbqNnehoLgbkuCtK.jpg', 'Trident Agra', 'Fatehabad Road Near TDI Mall, Tajganj, Agra, Uttar Pradesh 282006, India', '25 Minutes', '20 Minutes', '<p><strong>Trident, Agra,</strong> takes the stress out of planning a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Agra</strong> from the very beginning. Located on Fatehabad Road, it''s just half an hour away from Agra Airport, making transfers smooth. The Taj Mahal sits only a short drive away from the hotel, almost becoming a part of your wedding festivity. Set in warm red sandstone, the low-rise Mughal-inspired architecture feels extremely elegant. Carved marble detailing and serene courtyards add a sense of calm that runs through the entire property.</p><p>For those looking at a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Agra</strong>,&nbsp;<strong>Trident, Agra</strong>, just feels easy to plan. With 135 premium accommodations, about 300 guests can stay together, which keeps the whole experience close-knit. The main lawn works beautifully for larger celebrations. Smaller lawns and courtyards are perfect for mehendi, sangeet and pheras. Each space feels different in its own way. Nothing feels overused or repetitive, and the entire setting comes together naturally.</p><p>Beyond the venues, it’s the overall experience that comes together seamlessly. Dining spans Indian, continental and wood-fired specialities, service is known to be attentive yet discreet, and the Taj Mahal is just minutes away for those iconic wedding-day moments. It feels organised, well-paced and thoughtfully put together, exactly what you want when hosting something this personal.</p>', '135', 'Meeting Rooms, Glass House', 'Expansive Lawns, Landscaped Courtyards', '270', '320', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/8mqysyy7dV2iOduANnl2EEdoJi5ZTauLSg5stZY9.jpg", "title": "2+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/vCf5gLsRHk0Da78PfXSJwWB7VOyKyMAcCmCHyiDm.jpg", "title": "Private poolside candlelit dining experience"}]', '[{"id": 238, "question": "What is the check-in time at Trident, Agra, and is an early check-in available?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Trident, Agra,&nbsp;</strong>is 2:00 pm, and the check-out time is 12:00 noon. An early check-in can be requested and arranged, subject to hotel availability.</p>"}, {"id": 239, "question": "What is the nearest airport to Trident, Agra?", "answer": "<p>Agra Airport (Kheria), just 10-12 kilometres away, is the closest airport to Trident, Agra, making arrivals quick and convenient. A car ride from the airport to the resort usually takes around 25-30 minutes.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 240, "question": "Which months are most popular for weddings at Trident, Agra?", "answer": "<p>Destination weddings at&nbsp;<strong>Trident, Agra</strong> are most popular from October to March, with November to February being favoured for pleasant weather and vibrant outdoor celebrations.</p>"}, {"id": 241, "question": "Can guests explore local sights during their stay at Trident, Agra?", "answer": "<p>Yes, while staying at<strong> Trident, Agra</strong>, guests can explore the Taj Mahal, Agra Fort, Itimad-ud-Daulah, Mehtab Bagh and Fatehpur Sikri, and browse local markets like Sadar Bazaar for petha, leather goods and marble crafts.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 242, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol to a wedding at Trident, Agra?", "answer": "<p>Outside alcohol isn’t allowed at&nbsp;<strong>Trident, Agra</strong>. All beverages must be arranged through the hotel itself and will be charged separately based on actual consumption.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '166', '135'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'agra' AND `slug` = 'trident-agra');
