SELECT 'ahmedabad', 'doubletree-by-hilton-ahmedabad', 'published', 'DoubleTree Hilton Ahmedabad - Weddings, Banquets & Cost', 'Celebrate your wedding in style at DoubleTree by Hilton Ahmedabad. Find banquet hall, wedding packages, cost breakdowns & easy booking for a great event.', 'doubletree by hilton ahmedabad wedding cost, doubletree by hilton ahmedabad wedding, doubletree hilton ahmedabad, doubletree ahmedabad', '/storage/hotel/seo/pSafvnO8iUnfIGKF6yKcpyVpSfmXdMdkoUo8teXF.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/q4vrD6Xdq1kLg5ZmEV8fH5MyRwzT21SHKls4xPOr.jpg', 'DoubleTree by Hilton Ahmedabad', 'Ambli Rd, Vikram Nagar, Ahmedabad, Gujarat 380058, India', '40 Minutes', '35 Minutes', '<p>Ahmedabad’s fast-moving energy fades the moment you walk into&nbsp;<strong>DoubleTree by Hilton Ahmedabad</strong>. Wrapped in glass, warm lighting and skyline views, this 5-star luxury hotel feels modern without being intimidating. Set along the SG Highway corridor, the property is especially suited for couples planning a&nbsp;<strong>wedding at DoubleTree by Hilton Ahmedabad</strong> or an elegant&nbsp;<strong>wedding in Gujarat</strong> with easy city connectivity and a polished urban atmosphere.</p><p>Inside&nbsp;<strong>DoubleTree by Hilton Ahmedabad</strong>, the mood feels relaxed yet refined, with expansive windows, contemporary interiors and thoughtfully designed social spaces. The hotel offers nearly 702 sq metres of flexible event space, including a pillarless Grand Ballroom that can host up to 600 guests, while the sprawling lawn adds a beautiful open-air setting for starlit pheras and celebrations.</p><p>What makes a wedding stay at&nbsp;<strong>DoubleTree by Hilton Ahmedabad</strong> memorable is how naturally celebrations blend into comfortable stays and relaxed downtime. Guests can start mornings with skyline breakfasts at Wave, unwind beside the rooftop pool and explore Sabarmati Ashram, Science City and Iscon Mega Mall between wedding festivities.</p>', '173 rooms with suites', 'The Grand Ballroom, Ballroom 2', 'The Sprawling Lawn', '400', '400', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/3N1JV83LRxBMPhD96jvjqZ1VZ8mgluQmtHZ7thHo.jpg", "title": "2+ dining venues onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/wu7rCuxEFEGvwEXo5dGLdS8MoK0mjmCnfBxCaGtn.jpg", "title": "Skyline breakfast beside glass windows"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/pyQKi2E1jjKPw2bOtkzyKBvt355rE8n1QUeynbb3.jpg", "title": "Candlelit rooftop poolside dinner moments"}]', '[{"id": 952, "question": "Can we bring our own wedding planner/decorator to DoubleTree by Hilton Ahmedabad?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>DoubleTree by Hilton Ahmedabad</strong> usually lets couples bring their own wedding planner or decorator. Hotel policies and management confirmation are required for final permissions and cooperation.</p>"}, {"id": 953, "question": "What is the check-in time at DoubleTree by Hilton Ahmedabad, and is an early check-in facility available at the property?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>DoubleTree Hilton Ahmedabad</strong> is 2:00 pm, while check-out is by 12:00 noon. Early check-in may be available, subject to the hotel’s availability and discretion.</p>"}, {"id": 954, "question": "Are there nearby attractions or activities for international guests around the DoubleTree Hilton Ahmedabad?", "answer": "<p>International guests staying at&nbsp;<strong>DoubleTree by Hilton Ahmedabad&nbsp;</strong>can explore Sabarmati Riverfront, Adalaj Stepwell and the Gandhi Ashram. Kankaria Lake, Law Garden night markets and the old city’s heritage lanes also offer a lively glimpse into Ahmedabad’s culture.</p>"}, {"id": 955, "question": "What are the timing restrictions for events/music at DoubleTree Hilton Ahmedabad?", "answer": "<p>Events and amplified music at&nbsp;<strong>DoubleTree Hilton Ahmedabad</strong> are usually permitted until 11:00 PM, in line with Gujarat’s local noise regulations. Couples are requested to confirm final timings with the hotel or Viraaya Weddings team.</p>"}, {"id": 956, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol to DoubleTree by Hilton Ahmedabad for a wedding?", "answer": "<p>No, outside alcohol is not allowed at&nbsp;<strong>DoubleTree Hilton Ahmedabad</strong>. Being a dry state, alcohol service at the property is subject to Gujarat permit regulations and hotel policies.</p>"}]', '309', '173'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'ahmedabad' AND `slug` = 'doubletree-by-hilton-ahmedabad');
