SELECT 'ahmedabad', 'gateway-ahmedabad-sindhu-bhavan', 'published', 'Gateway Ahmedabad Sindhu Bhavan – Wedding & Booking Cost', 'Explore wedding packages, cost and booking at Gateway Hotel Ahmedabad Sindhu Bhavan. Discover premium venues for a memorable celebration. Book Now', 'gateway hotel wedding packages​, gateway ahmedabad sindhu bhavan​ wedding, gateway ahmedabad sindhu bhavan​ wedding Cost, gateway ahmedabad sindhu bhavan​ wedding Packages, gateway ahmedabad sindhu bhavan​ booking', '/storage/hotel/seo/Laf2HrgWMeaPdHVmAjddcqT2JsQprLNP53fm7aTS.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/jBGCztVZJSpPO0obVluX8C6T8i7j2imoEHrayKDi.jpg', 'Gateway Ahmedabad Sindhu Bhavan', 'Sindhubhavan Rd, PRL Colony, Bodakdev, Ahmedabad, Gujarat 380059, India', '25 Minutes', '30 Minutes', '<p>A recent addition to Ahmedabad’s luxury hotel scene,&nbsp;<strong>The Gateway Hotel Ahmedabad Sindhu Bhavan</strong> brings a calm, modern feel to Sindhu Bhavan Road. This 5-star property sits amid cafés, boutiques and corporate spaces, giving it a lively yet balanced setting. With clean glass architecture, warm interiors and a simple, uncluttered design, it feels instantly welcoming. It is also well connected, about 30 to 40 minutes from the airport via SG Highway, with easy access to GIFT City and central Ahmedabad.</p><p>A&nbsp;<strong>wedding at The Gateway Hotel, Ahmedabad, Sindhu Bhavan</strong> feels like bringing everyone together in one place. The Samaya and Candela Halls pose as flexible indoor venues for sangeet and receptions, while the open terrace and Latte Lawn seem to be perfect for an outdoor haldi or evening events. With around 116 luxurious accommodations, families usually stay on-site, keeping multi-day celebrations simple and well coordinated.</p><p>What makes a&nbsp;<strong>wedding in Gujarat at The Gateway Hotel Ahmedabad Sindhu Bhavan&nbsp;</strong>feel special is its balance of energy and ease. Outside, Sindhu Bhavan Road is lively and full of life, but inside the hotel, everything feels calm and private. Guests can explore Sabarmati Riverfront, Kankaria Lake and nearby heritage sites, then return to a setting that feels modern, compact and thoughtfully designed for meaningful celebrations.</p>', '116 rooms with 5 executive suites', 'Samaya Banquet Hall, Candela Hall', 'Latte Lawn, The Terrace, Poolside Deck', '300', '300', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/eFMJe995ks7mRNorxqRhkYXyh9JraJ1OvBcETgIz.jpg", "title": "2+ dining venues onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/QfoxbvGp108DHin4UOSyRI8yP12FKASKSNpwNgfq.jpg", "title": "Aura candlelit bespoke dining setups"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/3t1by6VSiwjUUTHq6LzkiNtMu3M0pvalHLYyBu4w.jpg", "title": "Secluded garden picnic experiences"}]', '[{"id": 1263, "question": "When is the peak wedding season at The Gateway Hotel, Ahmedabad, Sindhu Bhavan?", "answer": "<p>Peak wedding season at&nbsp;<strong>The Gateway Hotel Ahmedabad Sindhu Bhavan</strong> is November to February, when the weather is pleasant, and demand is highest. April to September is the off-season, with better availability and comparatively flexible pricing.</p>"}, {"id": 1264, "question": "Can guests attending a wedding at The Gateway Hotel, Ahmedabad, Sindhu Bhavan get an early check-in?", "answer": "<p>Yes, subject to availability, guests can be accommodated with an early check-in at the hotel. The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>The Gateway Hotel, Ahmedabad, Sindhu Bhavan</strong> is 3:00 pm, and check-out time is 12:00 noon.</p>"}, {"id": 1265, "question": "Are there nearby attractions or activities for international guests around The Gateway Hotel, Ahmedabad, Sindhu Bhavan?", "answer": "<p>Yes, guests at&nbsp;<strong>The Gateway Hotel Ahmedabad Sindhu Bhavan</strong> can explore Sindhu Bhavan Road cafés, Vastrapur Lake, Sabarmati Riverfront, SG Highway lifestyle hubs, Kankaria Lake and Adalaj Stepwell, all within convenient driving distance.</p>"}, {"id": 1266, "question": "Can we bring our own wedding planner/decorator to The Gateway Hotel, Ahmedabad, Sindhu Bhavan?", "answer": "<p>Yes, at<strong> The Gateway Hotel Ahmedabad Sindhu Bhavan</strong>, outside wedding planners and decorators are generally allowed, subject to hotel approval. Coordination is done with the hotel events team to ensure smooth execution.</p>"}, {"id": 1267, "question": "What is the standard liquor policy at The Gateway Hotel, Ahmedabad, Sindhu Bhavan?", "answer": "<p>At&nbsp;<strong>The Gateway Hotel Ahmedabad Sindhu Bhavan</strong>, Gujarat’s state prohibition laws apply, so alcohol service follows strict regulations. Beverages, where permitted, are managed only through the hotel as per licensing rules, and outside alcohol is not allowed.</p>"}]', '305', '116'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'ahmedabad' AND `slug` = 'gateway-ahmedabad-sindhu-bhavan');
