SELECT 'ahmedabad', 'itc-narmada-a-luxury-collection-hotel-ahmedabad', 'published', 'ITC Narmada Hotel Ahmedabad Wedding Cost & Booking Details', 'Explore ITC Narmada Hotel Ahmedabad wedding cost, booking info, luxury venues, premium stays & elegant wedding celebrations for a truly memorable day.', 'itc narmada ahmedabad wedding, itc narmada ahmedabad wedding cost, itc narmada wedding, itc narmada ahmedabad booking, itc narmada', '/storage/hotel/seo/vZaERpbcAPGbgoo78zBEtijWDlbuD1FUfEaJIgfJ.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/RIjzfWNxth1MMxfTtt7GjNX3uUEnjPPAVWcsiiyN.jpg', 'ITC Narmada a Luxury Collection Hotel Ahmedabad', 'Survey # 104 A, Judges Bunglow Rd, I I M, Vastrapur, Ahmedabad, Gujarat 380015, India', '40 Minutes', '30 Minutes', '<p>Relatively new to&nbsp;<strong>Ahmedabad’s luxury wedding</strong> circuit,&nbsp;<strong>ITC Narmada, a Luxury Collection Hotel, Ahmedabad</strong>, has quickly built a reputation among couples who want their celebrations to feel sophisticated without losing their cultural identity. Inspired by Gujarat’s historic stepwells, the hotel uses carved stone details, latticework and soft water-inspired design elements to create spaces that feel elegant, grounded and unmistakably connected to the city. Even though it is a contemporary high-rise in Vastrapur, the hotel carries the atmosphere of a modern palace rather than a business hotel.</p><p>For couples planning a&nbsp;<strong>wedding at ITC Narmada Hotel Ahmedabad,</strong> one of the biggest advantages is how comfortably the property handles large-format celebrations while still feeling personal. The pillar-less Narmada Stateroom spans nearly 4,600 sq. ft., giving decorators and planners the flexibility to fully transform the space for receptions, sangeets, or formal wedding functions.</p><p>A&nbsp;<strong>wedding in Ahmedabad</strong> at this 5-star property feels easygoing for guests as well. Between the residential setup, attentive hospitality, acclaimed restaurants and polished event spaces, this luxurious hotel naturally makes way for celebrations that stretch across multiple days without ever feeling exhausting.</p>', '291 rooms with suites', 'Narmada State Room, Pre-Function Area', 'Eastern Lawns', '600', '600', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/hL4qflY3m0jg0XJxiurJ1b1nTXsOecHNnDtq0zoN.jpg", "title": "5+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/ybp09HAM6EkkxgBfRHx7wpDKOVSDbljMBB6VBmmD.jpg", "title": "Romantic poolside dinners for couples"}]', '[{"id": 1072, "question": "Does ITC Narmada Hotel, Ahmedabad, have salons, laundry service and an ironing board in rooms?", "answer": "<p>Yes, guests can easily access hotel amenities such as salons, laundry services and ironing facilities at&nbsp;<strong>ITC Narmada, Ahmedabad.&nbsp;</strong>For further information, you can contact the Viraaya Weddings team to confirm.</p>"}, {"id": 1073, "question": "What are the standard check-in and check-out times at ITC Narmada Hotel, Ahmedabad, and can guests check in early?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>ITC Narmada Hotel Ahmedabad,</strong> is 3:00 pm, while guests can check out by 12:00 noon. Guests can check in early, but accommodation is subject to availability.</p>"}, {"id": 1074, "question": "What are the timing restrictions for events/music at ITC Narmada Hotel, Ahmedabad?", "answer": "<p>Event and music timings at<strong> ITC Narmada Ahmedabad Hotel</strong> are subject to Gujarat state regulations. You can confirm the exact timelines with the Viraaya Weddings team before booking.</p>"}, {"id": 1075, "question": "Can I bring my own wedding planner to the ITC Narmada Hotel, Ahmedabad?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>ITC Narmada Ahmedabad&nbsp;</strong>generally allows couples to bring their own wedding planners and decorators for celebrations. You can connect with the Viraaya Weddings team for vendor approvals and coordination-related details.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 1076, "question": "Does ITC Narmada Hotel in Ahmedabad provide a bar service for weddings?", "answer": "<p>Yes, ITC Narmada Ahmedabad offers a dedicated bar service for weddings. Outside alcohol is not allowed, and all beverages, including liquor, are charged based on consumption and billed separately from the wedding package.</p>"}]', '262', '291'
