SELECT 'ahmedabad', 'novotel-ahmedabad', 'published', 'Novotel Ahmedabad Wedding Costs & Hotel Booking Details', 'Novotel Ahmedabad offers premium event spaces and personalised wedding packages. Explore wedding cost guides & direct booking for your special celebration.', 'novotel ahmedabad wedding, novotel ahmedabad wedding cost, novotel ahmedabad', '/storage/hotel/seo/P0yViwwc2MGDUi05X0IT9DPDVjLTc5klR6Akeuvk.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/d0Zz1P6prWUGK8zK3lkj5r6wHW3MDflYfBUu8Ggl.jpg', 'Novotel Ahmedabad', 'Iscon Cross Roads, Sarkhej - Gandhinagar Hwy, next to Wide Angle Cinema, Ahmedabad, Gujarat 380015, India', '30 minutes', '35 Minutes', '<p><strong>Novotel Ahmedabad</strong> sits on the Sarkhej-Gandhinagar Highway, positioned at the meeting point of the city''s industrial and retail corridors. The hotel''s rooms and suites offer kitchenettes, living rooms and access to the exclusive Premier Lounge. Ode Spa provides a full wellness offering for guests, complemented by an open-air swimming pool and a state-of-the-art fitness centre. The hotel easily accommodates large groups and is notably pet-friendly, with special Alfresco outdoor dining spaces for diverse groups.</p><p>For weddings,<strong> Novotel Ahmedabad</strong> offers a combination of indoor and open-air venues spanning over 10,000 sq ft of event space. The Crystal Ballroom extends across 3,000 sq ft with high ceilings, accommodating up to 700 guests. The adjoining Crystal Lawn adds 5,500 sq ft of open-air space suited to outdoor ceremonies. In-house decorators, customisable menus drawing on Gujarati, pan-Indian and regional cuisines and an experienced events team support each function end to end.</p>', '222 rooms with suites', 'Crystal Ballroom (with pre-function area)', 'Crystal Lawn', '450', '450', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/QFhQfbkpdd4AsjLmNpymP60EN6KLi329h9Y7Xhx5.jpg", "title": "3 in-house diners and bars"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/Uxm4EXqdBdmTi7Et88FagwFdA1Us1mjt9YxLMwUD.jpg", "title": "Pool and lawn settings"}]', '[{"id": 992, "question": "What is the nearest airport to Novotel Ahmedabad?", "answer": "<p>The nearest airport to<strong> Novotel Ahmedabad</strong> is Sardar Vallabhbhai Patel International Airport (IATA: AMD), located approximately 17.5 kilometres from the hotel''s SG Highway address.</p>"}, {"id": 993, "question": "What is the peak wedding season at Novotel Ahmedabad?", "answer": "<p>The peak wedding season at<strong> Novotel Ahmedabad</strong> typically runs from October to February, when Ahmedabad''s weather is cooler and better suited to outdoor celebrations on the Crystal Lawn.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 994, "question": "What are the check-in and check-out timings at Novotel Ahmedabad, and are there early check-in or late check-out options for wedding couples?", "answer": "<p>Standard check-in at&nbsp;<strong>Novotel Ahmedabad</strong> is at 2:00 PM and check-out is at 12:00 noon. Early check-in or late check-out for wedding couples and their guests may be available, subject to room occupancy, and is best arranged in advance through the hotel''s events coordination team.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 995, "question": "Are there any restrictions on music for wedding events at Novotel Ahmedabad?", "answer": "<p><strong>Novotel Ahmedabad</strong> permits live music and DJs within its designated indoor and outdoor event venues, subject to the hotel''s operational guidelines and applicable local regulations. Couples are advised to confirm specific music timings and any sound-level considerations for the Crystal Lawn directly with the events team at the time of booking.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 996, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol for wedding events at Novotel Ahmedabad?", "answer": "<p>Outside alcohol is not permitted at<strong> Novotel Ahmedabad</strong> for weddings or private events. All beverages must be sourced through the hotel''s licensed in-house bar and beverage service.</p>"}]', '280', '222'
