SELECT 'ajmer', 'pratap-mahal-ajmer-an-ihcl-seleqtions-hotel', 'published', 'Pratap Mahal Ajmer IHCL - Wedding Cost, Packages & Booking', 'Pratap Mahal Ajmer offers iconic heritage wedding venues and tailored packages. Discover wedding cost guides & expert planning for a truly regal celebration.', 'pratap mahal ajmer, pratap mahal ajmer wedding,pratap mahal ajmer wedding cost', '/storage/hotel/seo/1p6UvK4xG3bHcNQ3G017VJG4YfFWrPZYqge7Rgoj.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/oTx0GSUA5dyq8uRe1jt82al2mUHAGZgwUG2YBaGC.jpg', 'Pratap Mahal Ajmer  An IHCL SeleQtions Hotel', 'Pushkar Bypass Rd, Road, Honkra, Rajasthan 305001, India', '30 Minutes', '35 Minutes', '<p>A&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at Pratap Mahal, Ajmer,</strong> feels a little removed from the usual city rush, yet easy to get to. Set between Ajmer and Pushkar, the hotel is surrounded by the Aravalli hills and is roughly a 25–30 minute drive from Kishangarh Airport. The design draws from traditional haveli-style architecture, with marble corridors, open courtyards, the Baradari and the Lily Pond coming together to create a setting that naturally works well for wedding celebrations.</p><p>The way the property is laid out makes planning easier. The Mughal Lawn works well for larger ceremonies under the open sky, while the poolside and Biradar are better suited for smaller, more relaxed gatherings. Indoor venues like Darbar Hall and Mayur Hall step in for evenings that need a more structured setup. Between events, experiences such as traditional nagara welcomes, heritage tea rituals and curated dining add something more personal to the overall celebration.</p><p>For a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Ajmer</strong>, it strikes a good balance. Guests can comfortably stay on-site, explore Pushkar or Ajmer nearby, and still return to a setting that feels calm, well-managed and easy to host in.</p>', '85 rooms with 3 suites', 'Darbar Hall, Mayur Hall', 'Poolside, Mughal Lawn, Biradar', '200', '200', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/HHJpyKZqaYB9sPBeK2SWTK4VjpPMurw42BP3Day1.jpg", "title": "2+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/7fcbNJRTA9IJAsw9W2o63HX3de3ymDtaYib7Zrjb.jpg", "title": "Heritage-inspired spiced tea rituals"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/lBMvsa5rXqvTjCzRIfm6tqFznjuIr7yZ9GcV6PYY.jpg", "title": "Royal pavilion family dining experiences"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/i3O7DZlWXJyz1TGRZ5BuApTmPwwuy1XUqbaJR52d.jpg", "title": "Lakeside gourmet dinners under lanterns"}, {"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal06.png", "title": "Ceremonial nagara welcome arrivals"}]', '[{"id": 1288, "question": "How much does a wedding package at Pratap Mahal, Ajmer, cost?", "answer": "<p>A<strong> wedding package at Pratap Mahal, Ajmer - An IHCL SeleQtions Hotel</strong>, typically costs INR 45 lakhs to INR 75 lakhs for a 3-day, 2-night ceremony with approximately 150-200 guests. To get an accurate estimate based on your guest count and room requirements within seconds, enter the logistical details into Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator.</p>"}, {"id": 1289, "question": "Are engagement shoots allowed inside Pratap Mahal, Ajmer - An IHCL SeleQtions Hotel?", "answer": "<p>Yes, engagement and pre-wedding photoshoots are allowed at the property with prior permission. Charges may apply depending on the areas used, so it’s best to book in advance.</p>"}, {"id": 1290, "question": "How much can I save if I book at Pratap Mahal in Ajmer through Viraaya Weddings?", "answer": "<p>When you book&nbsp;<strong>Pratap Mahal, Ajmer,&nbsp;</strong>through Viraaya Weddings, you can save around 10-15% or more, thanks to direct partnerships and negotiated pricing. Additionally, you also get access to trusted vendors and a better overall value for your wedding.</p>"}, {"id": 1291, "question": "What is the check-in time at Pratap Mahal, Ajmer, and can we get an early check-in?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Pratap Mahal, Ajmer,</strong> is 2:00 pm, and check-out time is at 12:00 noon. Guests can request an early check-in, which can be accommodated, subject to availability.</p>"}, {"id": 1292, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol to Pratap Mahal, Ajmer - An IHCL SeleQtions Hotel?", "answer": "<p>No, outside alcohol is not allowed at<strong> Pratap Mahal, Ajmer</strong>. All beverages must be arranged through the hotel and are charged separately based on consumption.</p>"}]', '133', '88'
