SELECT 'amritsar', 'holiday-inn-amritsar-ranjit-avenue-by-ihg', 'published', 'Holiday Inn Amritsar Ranjit Avenue by IHG Wedding Cost', 'Discover Holiday Inn Amritsar Ranjit Avenue by IHG wedding cost, packages & booking details with elegant venues, luxury stays & seamless celebrations.', 'Holiday Inn Amritsar Ranjit Avenue wedding cost, Holiday Inn Amritsar Ranjit Avenue wedding', '/storage/hotel/seo/eAtHZmlBBF4Nr7cic7mKtCuNezmdJPcKL4rkIBjJ.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/ouDHEhV0H7p0R6nKaie3sdoOjQlXHUZUOR3O6rMU.jpg', 'Holiday Inn Amritsar Ranjit Avenue by IHG', 'District Shopping Complex, Ranjit Avenue, Amritsar, Punjab 143001, India', '30 minutes', '15 minutes', '<p>Crystal chandeliers, polished stone interiors and a calm, contemporary atmosphere give&nbsp;<strong>Holiday Inn Amritsar Ranjit Avenue by IHG</strong> the feel of a modern celebration retreat tucked away from the city’s bustle. Located in the upscale Ranjit Avenue district, this 5-star luxury hotel sits just 9 km from Sri Guru Ram Dass Jee International Airport and within easy reach of the Golden Temple, Jallianwala Bagh and Amritsar’s lively food streets. Couples planning a stylish&nbsp;<strong>wedding at Holiday Inn Amritsar</strong> often love how effortlessly accessible yet peaceful the setting feels.</p><p>By sunset,&nbsp;<strong>Holiday Inn Amritsar Ranjit Avenue by IHG</strong> turns into a lively wedding destination, with no less than 750 sq. metres of indoor and outdoor event spaces designed for seamless celebrations. The Grand Ballroom opens directly into a landscaped lawn, creating an easy flow for cocktail evenings, sangeets and elegant receptions beneath the stars.</p><p>There is also something refreshingly easy about hosting a&nbsp;<strong>wedding in Amritsar</strong> at&nbsp;<strong>Holiday Inn Amritsar Ranjit Avenue by IHG</strong>. Guests can gather for rooftop cocktail evenings beside the pool, relax in soundproof suites after long festivities or enjoy generous Punjabi spreads prepared by the hotel’s Ziva culinary team, all paired with dependable IHG hospitality that keeps celebrations warm and personal.</p>', '145 rooms with suites', 'Grand Ballroom', 'Grand Ballroom Lawn', '350', '350', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/0bcNzN1csYOB1aYbRDLV4hMwCmF3BR3ZEdwR2B62.jpg", "title": "3+ dining venues onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/sRzAkvW5EhdcU4KTrhevxr8QStakh0WuJZHSRQ9z.jpg", "title": "Poolside candlelit dining experiences"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/ZWyPDd5FH4O9CkohcC6yFGdgWMEQbUwvWtBvOyeJ.jpg", "title": "Twilight rooftop cocktail evenings"}]', '[{"id": 1163, "question": "Can guests explore local sights during their stay at Holiday Inn Amritsar?", "answer": "<p>Yes, guests staying at&nbsp;<strong>Holiday Inn Amritsar&nbsp;</strong>can explore popular attractions, including Golden Temple, Jallianwala Bagh, Wagah Border, Hall Bazaar, Partition Museum and Gobindgarh Fort. Many couples also plan Punjabi food trails and evening visits to the city’s vibrant local markets.</p>"}, {"id": 1164, "question": "What is the standard check-in time at Holiday Inn Amritsar, and can guests get an early check-in?", "answer": "<p>The standard time to check-in at&nbsp;<strong>Holiday Inn Amritsar</strong> is 3:00 pm, and the check-out time is 12:00 noon. Yes, guests can request an early check-in, but it is subject to hotel availability.</p>"}, {"id": 1165, "question": "What is included in the wedding package at Holiday Inn Amritsar Ranjit Avenue?", "answer": "<p>Wedding packages at&nbsp;<strong>Holiday Inn Amritsar&nbsp;</strong>generally include venue spaces, multi-course catering, basic banquet setups, service staff and select guest room allocations. Decor, entertainment and customised wedding services can be added through curated packages or planning partners.</p>"}, {"id": 1166, "question": "What are the timing restrictions for events/music at Holiday Inn Amritsar?", "answer": "<p>Music and event timings at&nbsp;<strong>Holiday Inn Amritsar Ranjit Avenue</strong> are subject to Punjab government noise regulations and hotel policies. Late-night permissions should be confirmed with the venue and wedding planning team beforehand.</p>"}, {"id": 1167, "question": "Does Holiday Inn Amritsar provide a bar service for weddings?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>Holiday Inn Amritsar</strong> provides in-house bar services for weddings. Outside alcohol is not allowed inside the property, and all beverages are charged separately from wedding packages.</p>"}]', '144', '145'
