SELECT 'amritsar', 'hyatt-regency-amritsar-hotel-and-spa', 'published', 'Hyatt Regency Amritsar Wedding Packages & Booking Details', 'Explore Hyatt Regency Amritsar Hotel & Spa wedding packages, booking details, guest reviews, luxury venues, premium stays & catering. Check availability!', 'Hyatt Regency Amritsar wedding cost, Hyatt Regency Amritsar wedding, Hyatt Regency Amritsar wedding package', '/storage/hotel/seo/ED0n5fs1JJtaGO32ZVIsMTnKFBZcastzK17ZY7WK.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/TGJMLTqG6c35dgn1OTHst3sAXK74P2US8MZZR1d2.jpg', 'Hyatt Regency Amritsar Hotel And Spa', 'MBM Farms, Grand Trunk Rd, Rajinder Nagar, Maqbool Pura, Amritsar, Amritsar Cantt., Punjab 143006, India', '30 minutes', '20 Minutes', '<p>A striking glass-fronted tower rising across a 4-acre estate on historic G.T. Road,&nbsp;<strong>Hyatt Regency Amritsar Hotel &amp; Spa</strong> feels made for grand celebrations from the moment you arrive. The 5-star luxury hotel blends contemporary architecture with warm Punjabi character through open-sky spaces, reflective water features and serene garden pockets tucked away from the city’s bustle. Couples planning a lavish&nbsp;<strong>wedding at Hyatt Regency Amritsar Hotel &amp; Spa</strong> also benefit from its prime location, around 13 km from Sri Guru Ram Dass Jee International Airport and minutes from the Golden Temple.</p><p>Celebrations at&nbsp;<strong>Hyatt Regency Amritsar Hotel &amp; Spa</strong> unfold across nearly 1,100 sq. metres of versatile banqueting spaces. The pillarless Regency Ballroom creates an impressive setting for large receptions, while Regency Garden brings open-air elegance for pheras beneath the evening sky. Regal Hall and Regent Hall are equally suited for intimate mehendi functions, cocktail evenings and family gatherings, allowing every wedding event to flow seamlessly within one property.</p><p>What makes a&nbsp;<strong>wedding in Amritsar</strong> at&nbsp;<strong>Hyatt Regency Amritsar Hotel &amp; Spa</strong> stand out is how effortlessly grand celebrations feel here. Guests can relax in skyline-view rooms, spend quiet moments at Shanti Spa or come together for romantic private cabana dinners, while Hyatt’s warm hospitality keeps the entire experience feeling intimate, welcoming and beautifully personal.</p>', '248 rooms with suites', 'Regent Hall, Regency Ballroom, Regal Hall', 'Regency Garden', '550', '550', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/IjUD4VsNpj0RxDCAtUyLxlZB1HZKzLCPfxK7eaRv.jpg", "title": "2+ dining venues onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/syFfiWoRWaneSiK8aTu4EI1X58L2HT4QzBhncnbx.jpg", "title": "Romantic private cabana dining"}]', '[{"id": 1158, "question": "Can I host a pre-wedding photoshoot at Hyatt Regency Amritsar?", "answer": "<p>Yes, pre-wedding photoshoots are usually allowed at&nbsp;<strong>Hyatt Regency Amritsar</strong> with prior permission. Photography fees, timing and access depend on hotel policies and event availability.</p>"}, {"id": 1159, "question": "What is the standard check-in and check-out time at Hyatt Regency Amritsar?", "answer": "<p>The standard time to check-in at&nbsp;<strong>Hyatt Regency Amritsar</strong> is 3:00 pm, and the check-out time is 12:00 noon. An early check-in can be requested, subject to hotel availability.</p>"}, {"id": 1160, "question": "Is outside catering allowed at Hyatt Regency Amritsar?", "answer": "<p>Outside catering may be allowed at&nbsp;<strong>Hyatt Regency Amritsar&nbsp;</strong>for bespoke wedding events, subject to hotel approval. Policies, corkage charges and approvals should be confirmed directly with the hotel management.</p>"}, {"id": 1161, "question": "Are drones, fireworks or baraat allowed for a Hyatt Regency Amritsar wedding?", "answer": "<p>Baraat processions are generally allowed at&nbsp;<strong>Hyatt Regency Amritsar.</strong> Meanwhile, cold fireworks and drones may require local aviation approvals and hotel permission. Confirm all event regulations with the hotel and wedding team beforehand.</p>"}, {"id": 1162, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol to a wedding at Hyatt Regency Amritsar?", "answer": "<p>No, outside alcohol is generally not permitted at&nbsp;<strong>Hyatt Regency Amritsar</strong>. All beverages must be arranged through the hotel, with liquor packages and bar services charged separately.</p>"}]', '131', '248'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'amritsar' AND `slug` = 'hyatt-regency-amritsar-hotel-and-spa');
