SELECT 'amritsar', 'taj-swarna-amritsar', 'published', 'Taj Swarna Amritsar Wedding Cost & Reviews & Booking Details', 'Discover Taj Swarna Amritsar wedding cost, packages, banquet hall details, booking information, guest reviews, luxury stays, catering & décor. Book Now!', 'Taj Swarna Amritsar wedding cost, Taj Swarna Amritsar wedding, Taj Swarna Amritsar wedding price', '/storage/hotel/seo/Ytf3bSPMSGFzWlKDj7ZDoxPSFmmnolHkzx4dEFQc.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/aE2wcwzhnIfuCLDf1Q47TdNluhiepPA5elwAwhvk.jpg', 'Taj Swarna Amritsar', 'No. C-3 Outer, Circular Rd, opp. Basant Avenue, Nirankari Colony, Amritsar, Punjab 143001, India', '25 Minutes', '15 minutes', '<p>Sunlight reflects off glass as you drive in from the airport, and the pace of the city slowly settles into something calmer. That is usually the first impression of&nbsp;<strong>Taj Swarna, Amritsar</strong>, a 5-star luxury hotel property just 20 minutes from Sri Guru Ram Dass Jee International Airport. It feels conveniently placed, yet slightly removed from the rush, which makes it a practical and comfortable setting for a&nbsp;<strong>wedding in Amritsar</strong>.</p><p>Step inside&nbsp;<strong>Taj Swarna, Amritsar</strong> and the hotel’s vibe immediately starts to feel calm and considered, with soft lighting, marble interiors and subtle Punjabi art adding quiet character throughout the space. The pillarless Grand Trinity Ballroom, spanning around 4,100 sq ft, works well for gatherings of roughly 350 to 750 guests, depending on the setup, while the Grand Trunk Lawns open out into a more relaxed setting for larger, open-air celebrations.</p><p>What people usually remember about&nbsp;<strong>Taj Swarna, Amritsar,</strong> is how smooth the stay feels across the entire celebration. With over 150 rooms and suites, guests move comfortably between events, meals and rest without feeling rushed. The poolside and dining spaces add natural breaks in the day, and when there is time, landmarks like the&nbsp;<strong>Golden Temple, Jallianwala Bagh and Wagah Border</strong> are close enough for an easy visit without changing the flow of the wedding.</p>', '148 rooms with 9 suites', 'Trinity Banquet Hall, Ravi Meeting Room', 'Grand Trunk Lawns, Poolside Lawns', '350', '350', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/6f46W3gM77xl2No7puFlUr4TIIYdHgq1KGstBRda.jpg", "title": "3+ dining venues onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/tGuasMzUtirYOcQV7ZXyb2z0EoeIdhCaE4JGqlGb.jpg", "title": "Signature celebratory dining experiences"}]', '[{"id": 1153, "question": "Are there any recommended excursions or experiences near Taj Swarna in Amritsar?", "answer": "<p>Yes, guests staying at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Swarna in Amritsar&nbsp;</strong>can easily explore The Golden Temple, Jallianwala Bagh, Partition Museum, Wagah Border, Durgiana Temple and Gobindgarh Fort. The best way to learn about the city’s history and culture is to roam through its streets and experience Punjabi hospitality.</p>"}, {"id": 1154, "question": "What is the standard check-in and check-out time at Taj Swarna, Amritsar?", "answer": "<p>The standard time to check-in at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Swarna, Amritsar,</strong> is 2:00 pm, and the check-out time is 12:00 noon. Guests can even request an early check-in to the property, subject to availability.</p>"}, {"id": 1155, "question": "Can I host a pre-wedding photoshoot at Taj Swarna, Amritsar?", "answer": "<p>Yes, pre-wedding photoshoots at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Swarna, Amritsar,</strong> can usually be arranged with prior approval from the hotel, and may involve specific timings and applicable charges.</p>"}, {"id": 1156, "question": "Is this property the right fit for your guest size, style and budget at Taj Swarna, Amritsar?", "answer": "<p><strong>Taj Swarna, Amritsar,</strong> is well-suited for mid to large guest lists, offering easy airport access and smooth city connectivity. It works best for contemporary, elegant weddings and usually aligns with couples who wish to host a premium mid-to-high-budget event.</p>"}, {"id": 1157, "question": "What is the standard liquor policy at Taj Swarna, Amritsar?", "answer": "<p>Outside alcohol is not permitted inside the property premises. All beverages and drinks must be sourced through the in-house bar at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Swarna, Amritsar</strong>. Please note that beverages and drinks are not part of wedding packages and are billed separately.</p>"}]', '130', '157'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'amritsar' AND `slug` = 'taj-swarna-amritsar');
