SELECT 'amritsar', 'welcomhotel-by-itc-hotels-amritsar', 'published', 'Welcomhotel ITC Amritsar Wedding Cost & Booking Details', 'Discover Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels Raja Sansi Amritsar wedding cost, venue details, luxury stays, premium banquet spaces, & elegant wedding celebrations.', 'Welcomhotel ITC Amritsar wedding, Welcomhotel ITC Amritsar wedding cost, Welcomhotel ITC Amritsar wedding price', '/storage/hotel/seo/BD7wukBy0UXGjhcvZfH0A2PABvQ4E2WNMty9wN2U.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/4tJwtMqNRftxt1FQsavWrXIJJb6nzkWvQ7B7mLau.jpg', 'Welcomhotel By ITC Hotels Amritsar', 'Ajnala Rd, Raja Sansi, Amritsar, Punjab 143101, India', '10 Minutes', '25 Minutes', '<p>Set just minutes from Amritsar airport, a&nbsp;<strong>wedding at Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels, Raja Sansi, Amritsar&nbsp;</strong>begins even before you enter the gates, with white colonial arches, long tree-lined drives and an 8-acre stretch of calm green lawns that feel like a quiet estate frozen in time. This 5-star luxury hotel property sits within a restored 1900s aristocratic haveli setting where heritage architecture meets ITC’s contemporary luxury, making a wedding in Amritsar feel rooted in the city’s lively culture.</p><p>As you step into&nbsp;<strong>Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels, Raja Sansi, Amritsar</strong>, the property opens up into celebration-ready spaces, including the 4,100 sq. ft. Sunehri Ballroom and wide lawns that work beautifully for lively Punjabi sangeets. The architecture brings together elegant arched verandas, warm lighting and lush garden backdrops that shift naturally from day to night. Its close proximity to the airport also ensures guests can arrive and settle in without any hassle.</p><p>What really defines&nbsp;<strong>Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels in Amritsar&nbsp;</strong>is its quietly grand atmosphere. Guests unwind in well-appointed rooms that open out to calming garden views, while ITC’s signature dining and warm Punjabi hospitality bring a bright, homely charm to every celebration. With the Golden Temple, Jallianwala Bagh and Wagah Border close by, the stay also extends into the cultural heart of Amritsar</p>', '101 rooms with suites', 'Sunehri Banquet Hall', 'Baradari Lawns, Dough and Co Lawns', '250', '250', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/NZqVBdWf8jGp7suyBzJfFE0z5M0fFagTfmDtNfJ4.jpg", "title": "4+ dining venues onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/DbivTmKXosPw7RroqMfga2fZOp8WsE3h8UkJT5IP.jpg", "title": "Sunset rooftop cocktail lounging experience"}]', '[{"id": 1148, "question": "What is the peak wedding season at Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels, Raja Sansi, Amritsar?", "answer": "<p>The peak wedding season at<strong> Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels, Raja Sansi, Amritsar</strong> usually falls between October and March, when the weather is pleasantly cool and perfect for celebrations.</p>"}, {"id": 1149, "question": "Can guests attending a wedding at Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels, Raja Sansi, Amritsar, get an early check-in?", "answer": "<p>Yes, an early check-in can be accommodated at this property, but it is subject to the hotel’s discretion. The standard time to check-in at&nbsp;<strong>Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels, Raja Sansi, Amritsar</strong> is 3:00 pm, and check-out time is 12:00 noon.</p>"}, {"id": 1150, "question": "Can guests explore local sights during their stay at Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels, Raja Sansi, Amritsar?", "answer": "<p>Yes, guests can easily explore nearby attractions during their wedding stay at&nbsp;<strong>Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels, Raja Sansi, Amritsar.&nbsp;</strong>Popular places include the Golden Temple, Jallianwala Bagh, Partition Museum, Durgiana Temple, Wagah Border, Gobindgarh Fort and Ram Tirath, all within convenient driving distance.</p>"}, {"id": 1151, "question": "Are drones, fireworks or baraat allowed at Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels, Raja Sansi, Amritsar?", "answer": "<p>Yes, baraat processions are generally allowed at&nbsp;<strong>Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels, Amritsar</strong>, with prior permission, but drones and fireworks are mostly restricted due to safety and airport proximity regulations.</p>"}, {"id": 1152, "question": "What is the standard liquor policy at Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels, Raja Sansi, Amritsar?", "answer": "<p>Alcohol is usually served by the hotel’s in-house bar at&nbsp;<strong>Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels, Amritsar</strong>. Outside alcohol is not permitted, and all beverages are arranged and billed separately from the standard wedding package.</p>"}]', '129', '101'
