SELECT 'barwara', 'six-senses-fort-barwara', 'published', 'Six Senses Fort Barwara Wedding Cost & Packages', 'A 14th-century fort, now a luxury wedding haven! Check Six Senses Fort Barwara wedding cost, packages & booking for an extraordinary Rajasthan wedding.', 'six senses fort barwara wedding cost, six senses fort barwara wedding, six senses fort wedding cost, 6 senses fort barwara wedding cost, barwara fort wedding cost, fort barwara wedding package, six senses barwara wedding cost, six senses fort barwara booking for wedding, six senses fort barwara price for wedding, six senses fort barwara wedding cost price, six senses fort barwara wedding package', '/storage/hotel/seo/viRINhwBV5Ps8IR7Ry5jVwDDqg1Q0fweEmc0Vdsz.png', '/storage/hotels/banners/kZSDl1WDhVfuJyYs4m4Q2JknHTIdO7quZeZmmkjq.jpg', 'Six Senses Fort Barwara', '3525+65H, Six Senses Fort Barwara, Chauth Ka Barwara, Rajasthan 322702, India', '150 Minutes', '30 Minutes', '<p>Adorned with stone walls, arches, detailed jaali work and domes, <strong>Six Senses Fort Barwara</strong> is a dreamlike wedding venue rich in royal history and charm. This 14th-century Rajput fort has been restored into a resort that still reflects its heritage and character. As the sun sets, a soft golden light falls on the sandstone walls, creating a warm and breathtaking setting for your wedding celebrations.</p><p>If you listen closely, every part of this resplendent fort will tell you a story. Folk musicians play in candlelit courtyards, and the Stepwell poses as a stunning stage for private ceremonies or Sufi nights. The Zenana Bagh Lawn has a stepped amphitheatre that seems just perfect for grand outdoor events. The pillarless grand ballroom adds a beautiful touch for sangeets or gala dinners, and the viewing gallery lets guests toast together while taking in the stunning views of the Chauth ka Barwara Temple. Lastly, the gardens by the poolside are the picture-perfect venues for Mehendi or Haldi events.</p><p>The<strong> Six Senses Fort Barwara</strong> specialises in residential weddings, with guests usually booking the full 48‑suite property for 2-3 days. With warm, patient hospitality, every guest, national or international, feels cared for, ensuring your wedding experience at the resort feels deeply personal and truly memorable.</p>', '48', 'Barwara State Room, The Cortile and courtyard', 'Zenana Lawn, Rani Bagh, Stepwell, Viewing Gallery', '150', '150', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/NFXAO8F4lPZBRk8lwzYNIMxur1pNaS3U5nDE4BvV.jpg", "title": "5+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/5UtV9v08So806qPaNRCji3fdEal7JCipx8X5Gy9T.jpg", "title": "Private Aravali sunset lake drive"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/exxbOmpF7NIsMhq2zVuB4P0LCwPWLqC8nvCXGIlR.jpg", "title": "Temple Puja ceremony and blessings"}]', '[{"id": 109, "question": "What is the cost of a destination wedding at the Six Senses Fort Barwara?", "answer": "<p>According to reviews, a <strong>wedding at Six Senses Fort Barwara</strong> costs between INR 80 Lakhs and INR 90 Lakhs . However, this budget may differ, depending on your guest count, suites required and other logistical considerations. Use Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator to get an instant quote on the wedding budget. Fill in your preferred dates of stay, rooms required, total number of guests and other details and get a precise estimate within seconds.</p>"}, {"id": 110, "question": "Which celebrity wedding took place at Six Senses Fort Barwara?", "answer": "<p>Renowned Bollywood actors Katrina Kaif and Vicky Kaushal tied the knot at Six Senses Fort Barwara in December 2021.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 111, "question": "Should I choose Six Senses Fort Barwara or Amanbagh, Ajabgarh, for my wedding?", "answer": "<p><strong>Six Senses Fort Barwara&nbsp;</strong>has 48 suites and a wedding budget of INR 80-90 Lakhs . It has a grand, fortress-like setting and hosts heritage-based celebrations. On the other hand, Amanbagh, Ajabarh, has 37 suites and a budget of ₹1.5–2.5 Cr. It is an intimate, calm setting with a royal design. Both properties are about a 2- to 3-hour drive from Jaipur International Airport. Since both properties have fewer accommodations, consider an off-site location to accommodate a larger guest count.</p>"}, {"id": 112, "question": "What is the check-in time at Six Senses Fort Barwara, and can we check-in early?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at Six Senses Fort Barwara is 3:00 pm, and guests are advised to check-out before 12:00 noon. An early check-in facility is available and can be arranged with the hotel authorities, subject to availability.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 113, "question": "What is the liquor policy for destination weddings at Six Senses Fort Barwara?", "answer": "<p>Alcohol is permitted at Six Senses Fort Barwara. However, please note that all beverages served in public areas and banquet halls must be exclusively bought through the hotel. Outside alcohol is not permitted on the property premises. Beverages are charged separately based on consumption and are typically not a part of the standard wedding package.</p>"}]', '167', '48'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'barwara' AND `slug` = 'six-senses-fort-barwara');
--> statement-breakpoint
