SELECT 'bengal', 'itc-royal-bengal', 'published', 'ITC Royal Bengal Kolkata Luxury Wedding Cost & Packages', 'Discover ITC Royal Bengal Kolkata wedding cost, booking details & luxury packages with grand venue ambience, premium stays, décor & catering services.', 'ITC Royal Bengal Kolkata wedding, ITC Royal Bengal Kolkata wedding cost, ITC Royal Bengal Kolkata wedding package', '/storage/hotel/seo/jHFKrYCGHCkV63jySnsFm8eNJ6IwxsB9dwDRXoAK.png', '/storage/hotels/banners/PIddp6tMyEikmsdT54qz0AtYAQJNNxOmCZgpZ94w.jpg', 'ITC Royal Bengal', 'G9WX+G3 ITC Royal Bengal, 1, JBS Haldane Ave, Tangra, Kolkata, West Bengal 700105, India', '45 Minutes', '20 Minutes', '<p>A&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Kolkata</strong> carries a certain depth, and ITC Royal Bengal brings that into the experience without making it feel heavy. The architecture draws from the city’s colonial past, with high ceilings, arches and detailed interiors that quietly reflect Kolkata’s history. You feel it as you move through the spaces, not in an obvious way, but in how everything comes together.</p><p>When planning a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at ITC Royal Bengal, a Luxury Collection Hotel, Kolkata</strong>, the scale works in your favour. Large ballrooms handle big celebrations with ease, while lawns and poolside areas soften the mood for evenings. The hotel sits well within the city, with the airport about 30–40 minutes away, so guest movement stays simple. Between events, places like Victoria Memorial, Kumartuli and the Hooghly riverfront add something extra to the stay.</p><p>When you think of Bengal, food comes to mind almost instantly. Traditional Bengali dishes sit comfortably alongside Indian and regional fare, and the food is consistently good without trying too hard. Guests don’t just move from one event to another; rather, they settle into the property, explore the city at their own pace and slowly, the wedding begins to feel like something you live through, not just attend.</p>', '456', 'Bengal Stateroom, Pre-Function Area, Eastern Court', 'Eastern Lawn, Western Lawn, Poolside Area', '920', '960', '[{"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal02.png", "title": "7+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal03.png", "title": "Intimate modern South Indian dining"}, {"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal04.png", "title": "Romantic Italian dining for couples"}]', '[{"id": 318, "question": "Which is the nearest airport to ITC Royal Bengal, Kolkata?", "answer": "<p>Netaji Subhash Chandra Bose International Airport is located about 15 km from&nbsp;<strong>ITC Royal Bengal, Kolkata</strong>. A car ride usually takes 30–40 minutes, depending on traffic.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 319, "question": "What are the standard check-in and check-out times at ITC Royal Bengal, Kolkata, and is early check-in available?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>ITC Royal Bengal, Kolkata,</strong> is 3:00 pm, and check-out time is at 12:00 noon. Yes, an early check-in can be accommodated, but it is subject to hotel availability.</p>"}, {"id": 320, "question": "Are there nearby attractions or activities around ITC Royal Bengal, Kolkata, for international guests?", "answer": "<p>Yes, guests can visit Science City just across the road, or explore Victoria Memorial and Kumartuli nearby. A morning visit to Howrah Bridge and the flower market is also worth it if you’re staying at&nbsp;<strong>ITC Royal Bengal, Kolkata.</strong></p>"}, {"id": 321, "question": "Are engagement shoots allowed inside the ITC Royal Bengal, Kolkata?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>ITC Royal Bengal, Kolkata,&nbsp;</strong>allows couples to get their engagement shoots clicked, subject to prior approval. It may be chargeable, and permits depend on availability and hotel policy.</p>"}, {"id": 322, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol to ITC Royal Bengal, Kolkata?", "answer": "<p>Outside alcohol isn’t allowed at&nbsp;<strong>ITC Royal Bengal, Kolkata</strong>. All beverages are provided by the hotel and charged as per consumption, since they aren’t included in standard wedding packages.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '91', '456'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'bengal' AND `slug` = 'itc-royal-bengal');
