SELECT 'bengaluru', 'hilton-bangalore-embassy-golflinks', 'published', 'Hilton Bangalore Embassy GolfLinks Wedding Cost & Booking', 'Hilton Bangalore Embassy GolfLinks offers premium event spaces for grand weddings. Explore wedding cost breakdowns, direct booking options & Reserve Now!', 'hilton bangalore embassy golflinks bengaluru weddings, hilton bangalore embassy golflinks bengaluru weddingz, itc grand chola a luxury collection hotel chennai wedding cost, hilton bangalore embassy golflinks bengaluru karnataka', '/storage/hotel/seo/B9wqXKPBwYIexB0UmYotfMilC3EgQH7bPniAyIf3.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/3PAoHPTLAHsCHyWsp9kKDatCtKQVlvabgSgUT5C7.jpg', 'Hilton Bangalore Embassy GolfLinks', 'off Intermediate Ring Road, Embassy Golf Links Business Park, Challaghatta, Bengaluru, Karnataka 560071, India', '70 Minutes', '35 Minutes', '<p>A&nbsp;<strong>wedding at Hilton Bangalore Embassy GolfLinks</strong> feels surprisingly away from the pace of the city, even though it sits right inside one of Bangalore’s busiest business districts. It is a certified 5-star hotel offering uninterrupted views of the Karnataka Golf Association greens, and that sense of openness is often what guests notice first when they arrive for a wedding here in Bangalore.</p><p>Within&nbsp;<strong>Hilton Bangalore Embassy GolfLinks</strong>, celebrations usually shift between the Emerald Ballroom and the poolside area, and each setting brings a very different energy to the same event. The ballroom is where the more formal moments happen, while the poolside becomes a natural pause point for cocktails and evening conversations with the golf course in the background. Because everything sits within&nbsp;<strong>Hilton Bangalore Embassy GolfLinks</strong>, guests aren’t dealing with long transitions, which keeps the day feeling more connected.</p><p>What people usually remember after a&nbsp;<strong>wedding at Hilton Bangalore Embassy GolfLinks&nbsp;</strong>isn’t any single highlight, but how little effort everything seemed to need. Families naturally end up spending time together between rooms, meals and events, which makes the stay feel more connected than coordinated. For a&nbsp;<strong>wedding in Bangalore</strong>, it just works in a very straightforward way, where things are close, organised and easy to manage without anyone constantly planning the next step.</p>', '247 rooms with suites', 'Emerald Banquet Hall, Opal Ballroom', 'Poolside Area, Open Courtyards', '550', '550', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/GaCiij0ASXaz5D1sVrnPnvrA3S4bEahUKYHCR5fd.jpg", "title": "4+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/sAF3ieP4PlHkHKjjXsqjTfDWQ5NEG4nWhb6TL2hu.jpg", "title": "Candlelit golfside dining experience"}, {"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal04.png", "title": "Alfresco Mediterranean sunset tastings"}]', '[{"id": 1107, "question": "Which is the nearest airport to the Hilton Bangalore Embassy GolfLinks?", "answer": "<p>Kempegowda International Airport (BLR) is the nearest airport to&nbsp;<strong>Hilton Bangalore Embassy GolfLinks</strong>. It is located around 40–45 km away, with a drive time of roughly 1 to 1.5 hours depending on traffic, and can extend up to 2 hours during peak hours.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 1108, "question": "Can guests check in early to the Hilton Bangalore Embassy GolfLinks?", "answer": "<p>Yes, an early check-in facility can be arranged, subject to hotel availability. The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Hilton Bangalore Embassy GolfLinks</strong> is 3:00 pm, while guests can check out by 12:00 noon.</p>"}, {"id": 1109, "question": "Is outside catering allowed at the Hilton Bangalore Embassy GolfLinks?", "answer": "<p>Outside catering is generally not permitted at&nbsp;<strong>Hilton Bangalore Embassy GolfLinks</strong>. However, special requests may be considered with prior approval from the hotel management.</p>"}, {"id": 1110, "question": "Does Hilton Bangalore Embassy GolfLinks provide a bar service for destination weddings?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>Hilton Bangalore Embassy GolfLinks&nbsp;</strong>provides full bar service for destination weddings through its in-house team. Outside alcohol is generally not permitted, and all beverages are separately charged from standard wedding packages.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '388', '247'
