SELECT 'bengaluru', 'hilton-garden-inn-bengaluru-embassy-manyata-business-park', 'published', 'Hilton Garden Inn Bangalore Wedding Cost & Details', 'Hilton Garden Inn Bangalore at Embassy Manyata Business Park offers grand wedding venues, clear wedding cost details & premium stays. Enquire Now!', 'hilton garden inn bangalore wedding cost, hilton garden inn bangalore wedding, hilton garden inn bengaluru embassy manyata business park, bangalore hilton garden inn, hilton bengaluru embassy manyata business park', '/storage/hotel/seo/Ld9OAyb0NMYrugeKFTbFY5GAG1wPMUoGzmWRsKGx.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/ap9f2CqkiXhJoYwqJTQz0H9VMArPpuGLkvfPtRSa.jpg', 'Hilton Garden Inn Bengaluru Embassy Manyata Business Park', 'Block A, Hotel Building, 2, Outer Ring Rd, MS Ramaiah North City, Manayata Tech Park, Nagavara, Bengaluru, Karnataka 560045, India', '40 Minutes', '60 Minutes', '<p>A&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at Hilton Garden Inn Bengaluru Embassy Manyata Business Park</strong> feels more like a well-planned city celebration than a typical resort escape. The building itself leans modern, with sharp lines, glass surfaces and wide, open interiors that don’t box you in. This 4-star property does not try to look traditional, and that’s exactly why it works. Here, you get to start with a clean canvas, where lighting, décor and music can completely change the mood of a wedding function.</p><p>For couples planning a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Bangalore,&nbsp;</strong>the appeal of the&nbsp;<strong>Hilton Garden Inn Bangalore Embassy Manyata Business Park</strong> lies in how everything stays connected. The Grand Ballroom is built for scale, but it doesn’t overwhelm. Step out towards the terrace, and the setting loosens up a bit, giving you that feel of moving from a formal to an easygoing, open space. Since it connects with the larger Hilton convention spaces, there’s a sense of depth to the property that you only really notice once events begin.</p><p>What makes the wedding venues at&nbsp;<strong>Hilton Garden Inn, Bengaluru,&nbsp;</strong>click is how practical they feel once guests arrive. With everyone staying in the same complex, there’s no delay between functions. People find themselves at ease, events start when they should and the wedding unfolds in a way that feels natural rather than tightly managed.</p>', '353', 'Grand Ballrooms', 'Open Terrace', '710', '750', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/TlWHjcWWYSMBPCQUDyAhoHi6Kvgs0gKVCYwDACXz.jpg", "title": "2+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/ViOp1JJPhAFwKN06cfqnK6Jfb2PzXAf0Y3WtZ4py.jpg", "title": "Poolside South Indian fine dining"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/olV7wvu8Zt4G642YAyKYEE3d3DWfNjfTcft2wdbo.jpg", "title": "Al fresco global dining experiences"}]', '[{"id": 601, "question": "Which is the nearest airport to Hilton Garden Inn Bengaluru Embassy Manyata Business Park?", "answer": "<p>The nearest airport to Hilton Garden Inn Bengaluru is&nbsp;<strong>Kempegowda International Airport (BLR),</strong> about 30 km away, with a drive of roughly 30 to 45 minutes depending on traffic.</p>"}, {"id": 602, "question": "What is the standard check-in and check-out time at Hilton Garden Inn Bengaluru Embassy Manyata Business Park?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Hilton Garden Inn Bengaluru Embassy Manyata Business Park&nbsp;</strong>is 3:00 pm, and guests can check-out by 12:00 noon. Early check-in can be accommodated, subject to availability.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 603, "question": "Can I host a pre-wedding photoshoot at Hilton Garden Inn Bengaluru Embassy Manyata Business Park?", "answer": "<p>Yes, pre-wedding shoots are usually permitted at&nbsp;<strong>Hilton Garden Inn Bengaluru Embassy Manyata Business Park,</strong> subject to prior approval, location access and applicable charges set by the hotel.</p>"}, {"id": 604, "question": "Is there an indoor backup at Hilton Garden Inn Bengaluru Embassy Manyata Business Park in case of rain?", "answer": "<p>Yes, there is indoor venue backup at Hilton Garden Inn Bengaluru Embassy Manyata Business Park. The Grand Ballroom and adaptable meeting rooms permit rapid changes. All the venues are close together so moving indoors doesn’t feel like a trouble.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 605, "question": "Does Hilton Garden Inn Bengaluru Embassy Manyata Business Park provide a bar service for weddings?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>Hilton Garden Inn Bengaluru Embassy Manyata Business Park&nbsp;</strong>offers in-house bar service for weddings. Outside alcohol isn’t permitted, and all beverages are arranged by the hotel and billed separately.</p>"}]', '381', '353'
