SELECT 'bengaluru', 'itc-gardenia-bengaluru', 'published', 'ITC Gardenia Luxury Collection Bengaluru Wedding Cost', 'ITC Gardenia Bengaluru wedding cost, packages & booking all in one place. Plan your dream wedding at ITC Gardenia Bangalore with luxury experience.', 'itc gardenia bengaluru wedding, itc gardenia bengaluru wedding cost, itc gardenia bengaluru, itc gardenia bangalore', '/storage/hotel/seo/BdrVBJysVhZzons8xq17MXqJ3W7Fh1qmc1Y141zR.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/V82WZnaEbCUeWxJzhiBTWpncuSfsNCVryeldnt9E.jpg', 'ITC Gardenia Bengaluru', '1, Residency Rd, Ashok Nagar, Bengaluru, Karnataka 560025, India', '60 Minutes', '20 Minutes', '<p>A&nbsp;<strong>wedding at ITC Gardenia, a Luxury Collection Hotel, Bengaluru</strong>, doesn’t feel like a hotel event at all. It feels like the city has quietly opened up a green, unexpected pocket just for your celebration. Right in the middle of Residency Road, this 5-star property is layered with trees, water features and open courtyards, so even a simple walk between functions feels calm and unhurried, almost like being in a private garden estate.</p><p>For a&nbsp;<strong>wedding in Bangalore, ITC Gardenia, Bengaluru</strong>, doesn’t feel boxed into a schedule, and that’s what people enjoy most about it. Mysore Hall brings that classic big-wedding feel where everything has a sense of occasion. Botania, on the other hand, is where things naturally ease up, especially as the evening sets in and conversations start to stretch a little longer. Guests move between functions in their own time, stopping when something catches their attention, whether it’s food, a familiar face or just a quiet corner.</p><p>What people tend to talk about later is how relaxed the whole place feels, even during a large celebration. Above all,<strong> ITC Gardenia, Bengaluru</strong>, doesn’t feel like it’s performing for the wedding; it just holds it.</p>', '292 rooms with suites', 'Mysore Hall, The Magnolia Hall', 'Botania - The Open Terrace', '600', '600', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/lUICvpoym0ZHE6NVsGvjJDeqT8jEheDZpUMJunU6.jpg", "title": "7+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/KNS9f4RQYWnlfo1Ag8fmYd1I5lzQh51qmwfhDAay.jpg", "title": "Candlelit garden dining at Lotus Pavilion"}]', '[{"id": 1097, "question": "How to reach ITC Gardenia, a Luxury Collection Hotel, Bengaluru, from the nearest airport?", "answer": "<p>Kempegowda International Airport (BLR) is the nearest to&nbsp;<strong>ITC Gardenia, Bengaluru</strong>. It’s about 35 km away, and the drive usually takes 45 minutes to over an hour, depending on traffic.</p>"}, {"id": 1098, "question": "Can guests check in early at ITC Gardenia, a Luxury Collection Hotel, Bengaluru, and what is the standard check-out time?", "answer": "<p>Yes, guests can get an early check-in, which is subject to hotel availability. The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>ITC Gardenia, a Luxury Collection Hotel, Bengaluru</strong> is 3:00 pm, while guests can check out by 12:00 noon.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 1100, "question": "Can I host a pre-wedding photoshoot at ITC Gardenia, a Luxury Collection Hotel, Bengaluru?", "answer": "<p>Yes, pre-wedding photoshoots at&nbsp;<strong>ITC Gardenia, Bangalore,&nbsp;</strong>are usually allowed with prior permission from the hotel. Charges and approvals depend on availability, timing and selected spaces.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 1101, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol to ITC Gardenia, a Luxury Collection Hotel, Bengaluru, for weddings?", "answer": "<p><strong>ITC Gardenia, a Luxury Collection Hotel, Bengaluru,&nbsp;</strong>generally does not permit outside alcohol for weddings. All beverage service is handled through the hotel’s in-house bar, with customised packages based on your event and guest requirements.</p>"}]', '81', '292'
