SELECT 'bengaluru', 'itc-windsor-a-luxury-collection-hotel-bengaluru', 'published', 'ITC Windsor Bengaluru Luxury Wedding Cost and Venue Info', 'Discover ITC Windsor a Luxury Collection Hotel Bengaluru wedding cost, booking details, luxury venues, premium stays, décor & elegant wedding celebrations.', 'itc windsor bengaluru, itc windsor a luxury collection hotel bengaluru wedding, itc windsor a luxury collection hotel bengaluru wedding cost, itc windsor bengaluru wedding cost, itc windsor bengaluru wedding', '/storage/hotel/seo/iMUQKz9LDh8J8IFMMKPy2JUZEfZ7wTtrfcpNM7QS.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/hBehNKrWo2b85vfbrj2VaOA1KmcUJiJqwoWAjn1H.jpg', 'ITC Windsor a Luxury Collection Hotel Bengaluru', 'Windsor Square, 25, Golf Course Rd, Abshot Layout, Vasanth Nagar, Bengaluru, Karnataka 560001, India', '60 Minutes', '20 Minutes', '<p>If you’ve ever pictured a wedding that feels less like a hotel setup and more like a grand estate celebration,&nbsp;<strong>ITC Windsor, a Luxury Collection Hotel, Bengaluru</strong>, fits that description quite naturally. Built in 1982, it carries a strong British Regency character, with a white façade, tall columns and interiors that feel like an old English manor. Inside, Queen Anne-style furniture and sweeping staircases give it a lived-in, old-world charm that makes the space feel atmospheric the moment you walk in.</p><p>For a&nbsp;<strong>wedding in Bangalore,&nbsp;</strong>what really sets&nbsp;<strong>ITC Windsor, Bengaluru</strong> apart is its calm spot in Vasanth Nagar, right beside the Bangalore Golf Club. It feels tucked away with its tree-lined lanes and quiet surroundings, located minutes from the city centre. The Regency Ballroom, about 430 sq. m., works well for classic indoor ceremonies, while the poolside becomes a more relaxed setting in the evenings, especially for smaller, easy-going celebrations.</p><p>What ties everything together is the experience of staying here. With 239 rooms, renowned dining spaces like The Royal Afghan and Dakshin and service rooted in ITC’s Responsible Luxury philosophy, the hotel brings a sense of calm and old-world hospitality that quietly adds weight to a wedding at<strong> ITC Windsor, Bengaluru</strong>.</p>', '239 rooms with suites', 'Regency Halls, Westminster Hall', 'Poolside Areas', '500', '500', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/elD9wFcfoeLKI5vFT25zxFyg7nrDUSmiNXhFrFlw.jpg", "title": "6+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/zsZ8G479NvPqSwCzv8E18FH8WG2IHDywlCFIZ3W0.jpg", "title": "Alfresco royal Afghan dining experience"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/Az5fZ5Gx3SfxUjVM8ae2S0XdK3riG1kwinLxWcDH.jpg", "title": "Sunlit glasshouse romantic buffet lunches"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/52PaOeeI23n336HG3T7uAcnI0p8AR01Yn49t0X5r.jpg", "title": "Intimate Awadhi and South Indian dining"}]', '[{"id": 1062, "question": "Can guests explore local sights during their stay at ITC Windsor, a Luxury Collection Hotel, Bengaluru?", "answer": "<p>Guests at&nbsp;<strong>ITC Windsor, Bengaluru&nbsp;</strong>can explore nearby highlights like Cubbon Park, Vidhana Soudha, Bangalore Palace, UB City, MG Road and Lalbagh Botanical Garden. Moreover, guests can visit famous cafés and heritage streets, all within a short drive of the hotel.</p>"}, {"id": 1063, "question": "Is early check-in available at ITC Windsor, a Luxury Collection Hotel, Bengaluru, for wedding guests?", "answer": "<p>Yes, an early check-in facility is available at the property; however, it is subject to hotel availability. The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>ITC Windsor, Bengaluru</strong> is 3:00 pm, while guests can check out by 12:00 noon.</p>"}, {"id": 1064, "question": "Can photographers use hotel spaces at ITC Windsor, a Luxury Collection Hotel, Bengaluru, before the wedding day?", "answer": "<p>At&nbsp;<strong>ITC Windsor, a Luxury Collection Hotel, Bengaluru,</strong> pre-wedding shoots are generally allowed with prior hotel approval. Timings, access areas and any applicable charges are confirmed by the hotel team in advance.</p>"}, {"id": 1065, "question": "Is outside catering allowed at ITC Windsor, a Luxury Collection Hotel, Bengaluru, for a wedding?", "answer": "<p>At<strong> ITC Windsor, Bengaluru</strong>, wedding catering is usually handled by the hotel’s in-house team, so outside caterers are generally not allowed. If you have specific preferences, it’s best to check with the hotel in advance to see what can be accommodated.</p>"}, {"id": 1066, "question": "What is the standard liquor policy at ITC Windsor, a Luxury Collection Hotel, Bengaluru?", "answer": "<p><strong>ITC Windsor, Bengaluru,&nbsp;</strong>manages all wedding alcohol service through its in-house bar. Outside alcohol is not permitted, and all beverages are charged separately based on consumption.</p>"}]', '267', '239'
