SELECT 'bengaluru', 'jw-marriott-bengaluru-prestige-golfshire-resort-and-spa', 'published', 'JW Marriott Bengaluru Prestige Golfshire Resort & Spa', 'Looking for a premium wedding venue in Bengaluru? Discover JW Marriott Bengaluru Prestige Golfshire Resort wedding cost, packages & luxury event services', 'jw marriott hotel bengaluru wedding cost, jw marriott hotel bengaluru wedding venue cost, jw marriott hotel bangalore wedding venue cost, wedding cost of jw marriott hotel bangalore, destination wedding in bengaluru at jw marriott hotel, jw marriott hotel bengaluru booking', '/storage/hotel/seo/fhLUts99nI0Afa7LhvyGyItSsvLgOymoXwojk9uw.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/sR9MP2INPFTVQioqCNxLvI7QGMYbKXBgECZ509Sl.jpg', 'JW Marriott Bengaluru Prestige Golfshire Resort And Spa', 'Nandi Hills Road Karahalli Post, Kundana Hobli, Taluk, Devanahalli, Bengaluru, Karnataka 562164, India', '30 Minutes', '125 Minutes', '<p>Located just outside the city near Nandi Hills,&nbsp;<strong>JW Marriott Bengaluru Prestige Golfshire Resort &amp; Spa&nbsp;</strong>offers a setting that feels open and easy to settle into. The scale of the property, paired with its clean, contemporary design and wide green spaces, creates a natural backdrop that already feels celebration-ready, requiring little added décor.</p><p>At a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at JW Marriott Bengaluru Prestige Golfshire Resort &amp; Spa,&nbsp;</strong>functions can be hosted across spacious indoor venues and expansive lawns, giving each event a unique atmosphere of its own. With spacious on-site accommodations, hosting guests is convenient, and the variety of dining options and its nearness to UB City make it an&nbsp;<strong>ideal destination wedding venue in Bangalore</strong>.</p><p>For couples planning a destination wedding in Bangalore, the resort’s proximity to the airport keeps travel simple for everyone. Alongside Marriott’s warm, well-organised hospitality and thoughtfully planned spaces, the overall experience feels smooth, comfortable and well put together.</p>', '301 rooms with suites', 'Durbar Convention Centre, Peregrine Halls, Durbar Halls', 'Savannah Lawns, JW Garden Pavilions', '650', '650', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/kWyoadHRP5dHIeXTEZR7ehfDhOmtdsd26twJANPT.jpg", "title": "6+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/0WZFtLNUluJFEnliGKADvTNeXk6Nio4OixE9MiAH.jpg", "title": "Immersive sunrise and sunset yoga experiences"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/PlhSw23uo0v651VPW0IdPqNhkU3p454e5MzJZidb.jpg", "title": "Curated luxury dining and high tea"}]', '[{"id": 436, "question": "What is the cost of a destination wedding at JW Marriott Bengaluru Prestige Golfshire Resort & Spa?", "answer": "<p>The&nbsp;<strong>JW Marriott Hotel, Bengaluru, wedding venue cost</strong> usually ranges between INR 1.6 Cr and INR 2 Cr for a guest count of approximately 200-300. To get a close estimate of the pricing, use Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator. Enter your preferred dates, duration of stay and other logistical details to get an accurate quote within seconds.</p>"}, {"id": 437, "question": "Which is the nearest airport to the JW Marriott Bengaluru Prestige Golfshire Resort & Spa?", "answer": "<p>Kempegowda International Airport (BLR), located in Devanahalli, about 20–25 minutes (21–28 km) away, is the closest airport to the&nbsp;<strong>JW Marriott Bengaluru Prestige Golfshire Resort &amp; Spa</strong>.</p>"}, {"id": 438, "question": "Should I choose JW Marriott Bengaluru Prestige Golfshire Resort & Spa or Grand Hyatt Kochi Bolgatty for my wedding?", "answer": "<p>Choose&nbsp;<strong>JW Marriott Bengaluru Prestige Golfshire Resort &amp; Spa&nbsp;</strong>for a premium celebration with 301 rooms, an INR 1–1.5 Cr budget and close proximity (21–28 km) to BLR airport. But go for Grand Hyatt Kochi Bolgatty if you prefer a more budget-friendly option (INR 15–20 lakhs), with 264 rooms and about 28–33 km from Cochin International Airport.</p>"}, {"id": 439, "question": "Can guests check in early to the JW Marriott Bengaluru Prestige Golfshire Resort & Spa?", "answer": "<p>Yes, guests can request an early check-in at the&nbsp;<strong>JW Marriott Bengaluru Prestige Golfshire Resort &amp; Spa,&nbsp;</strong>and it may be accommodated, subject to hotel availability. The standard check-in time at the hotel is 3:00 pm, and check-out is by 12:00 noon.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 440, "question": "Does JW Marriott Bengaluru Prestige Golfshire Resort & Spa provide bar service for weddings?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>JW Marriott Bengaluru Prestige Golfshire Resort &amp; Spa</strong> offers bar service for weddings. All alcohol is served through the hotel, and outside liquor isn’t permitted. Beverages are billed separately based on consumption and are not included in standard wedding packages.</p>"}]', '78', '301'
