SELECT 'bengaluru', 'radisson-blu-hotel-bengaluru', 'published', 'Radisson Blu Outer Ring Road Bengaluru Wedding Cost', 'Radisson Blu Outer Ring Road Bengaluru offers modern banquet halls and expert wedding planning. Get detailed Costs and book your dream wedding venue today.', 'radisson blu bengaluru outer ring road wedding, radisson blu bengaluru outer ring road wedding cost, radisson blu bengaluru wedding, radisson blu bengaluru wedding cost', '/storage/hotel/seo/FSDBlAtt3ruENTOjBR2Dvgk3Bt6q7bpvtxUIse4h.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/Yfb9pTjMMFHglMtFdNg0Vc7nkMWNsqc5J1mNOvgP.jpg', 'Radisson Blu Hotel Bengaluru', '90/4, Outer Ring Rd, Marathahalli Village, Marathahalli, Bengaluru, Karnataka 560037, India', '90 minutes', '45 Minutes', '<p>Some venues feel like an escape from the city, but&nbsp;<strong>Radisson Blu Hotel, Bengaluru Outer Ring Road</strong> feels like it moves with it. Set on a compact footprint of about&nbsp;<strong>2.5 acres</strong>, this recently rebranded hotel brings together a glass façade, clean modern lines and warm interiors that reflect the pace of Bengaluru’s tech corridor. With Kempegowda International Airport about 60 to 75 minutes away, it stays well-connected for guests arriving for a contemporary&nbsp;<strong>wedding in Bangalore</strong>.</p><p>Inside&nbsp;<strong>Radisson Blu Hotel, Bengaluru Outer Ring Road</strong>, everything is designed around flow and function. The standout Grand Victoria Ballroom of approximately 503 sqm offers a pillar-free setting that works well for large receptions, elaborate mandaps and structured celebrations. Adjacent pre-function spaces and terrace areas help shift moods easily between ceremonies, cocktail evenings and late-night gatherings, without breaking the continuity of the event.</p><p>What makes a&nbsp;<strong>wedding at Radisson Blu Hotel, Bengaluru Outer Ring Road</strong> feel different is its surroundings. Prestige Tech Park, Embassy TechVillage and Ecospace sit just minutes away, while Phoenix Marketcity and VR Bengaluru add easy leisure stops for guests. HAL Aerospace Museum and nearby entertainment zones give families something to explore between functions. It all comes together as a wedding experience that feels urban, connected and effortlessly organised within the pace of the city.</p>', '218 rooms with suites', 'Grand Victoria Ballroom, Arabica and Robusta Halls', 'Open-Air Terrace', '450', '450', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/ZPaUVcRGOYkJRu8Xn8g7av6YPlLprau6ojZL7KXj.jpg", "title": "6+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/i0wir5aIPbEJwAATbDxpR62ldNtXAoZkRcoUOxhv.jpg", "title": "Romantic multi-cuisine dining journey"}]', '[{"id": 872, "question": "What is the ideal cost of a 2-night wedding at Radisson Blu Hotel, Bengaluru Outer Ring Road?", "answer": "<p>On average, the&nbsp;<strong>Radisson Blu Bengaluru Outer Ring Road</strong>&nbsp;<strong>wedding cost&nbsp;</strong>ranges between INR 45 lakhs and INR 75 lakhs for a 2-night, 3-day celebration. To get an accurate estimate based on your guest count and other logistical considerations, refer to Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator and get a near-accurate budget within seconds.</p>"}, {"id": 873, "question": "What is the standard check-in time at Radisson Blu Bengaluru Outer Ring Road, and can I request an early check-in?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Radisson Blu Bengaluru&nbsp;</strong>is 2:00 pm, and guests can check out by 12:00 noon. Yes, you can request an early check-in, but accommodation is entirely subject to the hotel’s discretion.</p>"}, {"id": 874, "question": "Can photographers use hotel spaces at the Radisson Blu Hotel Bengaluru before the wedding day?", "answer": "<p>Photographers may use the&nbsp;<strong>Radisson Blu Hotel Bengaluru''</strong>s premises for pre-wedding shoots, but permission must be obtained in advance. Hotel availability and permits determine access and times.</p>"}, {"id": 875, "question": "What does the wedding package at Radisson Blu Hotel Bengaluru usually include?", "answer": "<p>Wedding packages at&nbsp;<strong>Radisson Blu Bengaluru Outer Ring Road&nbsp;</strong>usually include venue space, accommodation, curated meals and basic event support. Final inclusions vary and should be confirmed with the hotel.</p>"}, {"id": 876, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol to Radisson Blu Hotel Bengaluru?", "answer": "<p><strong>Radisson Blu Hotel Bengaluru</strong> generally does not allow outside alcohol for weddings. All beverages are served through the hotel’s in-house bar service and billed based on actual consumption.</p>"}]', '287', '218'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'bengaluru' AND `slug` = 'radisson-blu-hotel-bengaluru');
