SELECT 'bengaluru', 'shangri-la-bengaluru', 'published', 'Shangri-La Hotel Bengaluru – Weddings, Cost and Bookings', 'Shangri-La Hotel Bengaluru is a top choice for luxury weddings. Explore customised packages, wedding cost breakdowns & direct booking for a flawless event.', 'shangri la bengaluru wedding, shangri la bengaluru wedding cost, shangri la hotel bengaluru wedding, shangri la hotel bengaluru wedding cost, shangri la hotel bengaluru', '/storage/hotel/seo/u3aYQc1xOMDuZdOOo36uTwNLbkHh90dhiNekbQXK.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/ks90q4hIAjBJkKS5jdnvvqm2ue4y41BbfLVg42PA.jpg', 'Shangri La Bengaluru', '56-6B, Palace Road, Yelahanka Satellite Town, Yelahanka New Town, Bengaluru, Karnataka 560001, India', '45 Minutes', '15 Minutes', '<p><strong>Shangri-La Bengaluru</strong> feels like a wedding venue that rises with the city instead of sitting away from it. Located on Palace Road in Vasanth Nagar, this 19-story glass landmark sits between the greenery of Bangalore Palace Grounds and some of the city’s most central neighbourhoods. Opened in 2015,&nbsp;<strong>Shangri-La Hotel Bengaluru&nbsp;</strong>blends polished marble, soft gold accents and wide skyline views, giving every celebration a strong city backdrop while still holding on to a quiet sense of calm.</p><p>Inside&nbsp;<strong>Shangri-La Bengaluru</strong>, the scale is what surprises most couples. The 7,300 sq. ft. Grand Ballroom offers height, light and presence that works well for large wedding ceremonies and receptions, while elevated spaces like the Pool Deck and HYPE rooftop shift the mood into more open, relaxed celebrations under the Bengaluru sky. With 397 rooms and suites, this 5-star property is designed for full wedding weekends where guests stay on-site and move easily between functions without stepping out of the property.</p><p>Guests at&nbsp;<strong>Shangri-La Bengaluru</strong> get to dine across Shang Palace, Ssaffron and Caprese, with seamless service between venues. Large events like sangeet and receptions are managed in the Grand Ballroom and rooftop spaces. Located about 45-50 minutes from Kempegowda International Airport, the hotel keeps celebrations well-connected, organised and easy to manage.</p>', '397 rooms with suites', 'Grand Ballroom, Krishna Hall, Pennar Halls', 'Skydeck, HYPE Rooftop Lounge', '850', '850', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/KLUZelxWMHCGeoaXJemGbQJY5XXP7SWEPIkZPzTh.jpg", "title": "6+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/nluKPEiapIsISOiBRZGcQpvuG6UoPfoefvlWB9Sd.jpg", "title": "Curated rooftop candlelit dining"}]', '[{"id": 857, "question": "Is there an indoor backup at Shangri-La Bengaluru in case of rain?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>Shangri-La Bengaluru</strong> offers indoor backup venues like the Grand Ballroom, Krishna Hall and Pennar Halls for seamless wedding celebrations. These spaces are well-connected within the hotel for easy event transitions.</p>"}, {"id": 858, "question": "What is the standard check-in and check-out time at Shangri-La Bengaluru, and can guests get an early check-in?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Shangri-La Hotel Bengaluru&nbsp;</strong>is 2:00 pm, and guests can check out by 12:00 noon. Yes, guests can get an early check-in, but it is subject to the hotel’s discretion.</p>"}, {"id": 859, "question": "Are there vendor restrictions at Shangri-La Bengaluru?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>Shangri-La Bengaluru</strong> has vendor guidelines, especially for food, beverages and décor. However, external planners can coordinate with the hotel team for a smooth execution.</p>"}, {"id": 860, "question": "How early should I book the Shangri-La Bengaluru?", "answer": "<p>Booking&nbsp;<strong>Shangri-La Bengaluru for a wedding</strong> should be done 6 to 9 months in advance, especially for the busiest wedding season periods of October through February.</p>"}, {"id": 861, "question": "What is the standard liquor policy at Shangri-La Hotel Bengaluru?", "answer": "<p><strong>Shangri-La Bengaluru&nbsp;</strong>follows an in-house liquor service policy for weddings. All beverages are provided and billed by the hotel based on actual consumption, separate from wedding packages.</p>"}]', '284', '397'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'bengaluru' AND `slug` = 'shangri-la-bengaluru');
