SELECT 'bengaluru', 'taj-west-end-bengaluru', 'published', 'Taj West End Bangalore Wedding Cost - Reserve Your Venue', 'Taj West End Bangalore wedding cost — transparent, tailored & worth every rupee. Reserve Bangalore''s most iconic garden wedding venue today. Call Us Now!', 'taj west end bengaluru wedding cost , taj west end bangalore wedding cost, taj west end bangalore booking, taj west end bangalore wedding, taj west end bengaluru wedding venue cost', '/storage/hotel/seo/qHyfl9dfKXk7LPrUDMWs07LFEh4RVtmyn3z61Szr.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/2xqScOgNa4OMr8AukFqgYqaqySBAjbiHOtDW4gur.jpg', 'Taj West End Bengaluru', '41, Race Course Rd, near Indian Foundation, High Grounds, Bengaluru, Karnataka 560001, India', '60 Minutes', '10 minutes', '<p>A&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at Taj West End, Bengaluru,</strong> feels like a celebration set within a living heritage garden. Century-old trees, open lawns and colonial-era architecture make a naturally elegant backdrop that already feels ready for wedding festivity, even before décor is added.</p><p>A&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Bangalore</strong> here brings together open lawns like the Prince of Wales Lawn and indoor venues framed by lush greenery. The gardens, shaded pathways and heritage design give each celebration its own distinct mood, whether it’s a grand evening function or a simple daytime ritual.</p><p>What stays with guests is the ease of the experience, supported by Taj’s signature hospitality. Between celebrations, there’s space to slow down amidst the gardens or step out to nearby landmarks like Cubbon Park, Bangalore Palace and UB City. Despite being centrally located, the property holds on to a rare sense of quiet, green seclusion.</p>', '95 rooms with 22 suites', 'Gulmohar Hall, Tamarind Banquet Hall, Ballroom, West End Court, Plumeria', 'Prince of Wales Lawn, Tulip Poolside, Blue Ginger Lawn, Raintree', '280', '280', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/odnMDYMS507HNpTVfS1TFmDI70V2knE0OHUemQmR.jpg", "title": "4+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/NDd9liyrRMnXV4GxO3knmYQHzh3y95uBUcdw0okb.jpg", "title": "Alfresco garden dining experience"}]', '[{"id": 431, "question": "What is the cost of a destination wedding at Taj West End, Bengaluru?", "answer": "<p>The&nbsp;<strong>Taj West End, Bengaluru, wedding cost&nbsp;</strong>ranges from INR 80 lakhs to INR 1.2 CR for a 3-day, 2-night celebration. To get a closer estimate, enter your preferred dates of stay, room requirements and other details into Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator and get an exact quote within seconds.</p>"}, {"id": 432, "question": "Which is the nearest airport to the Taj West End, Bengaluru?", "answer": "<p>Kempegowda International Airport (BLR) is the nearest airport to Taj West End, Bengaluru, located about 36 km away. It usually takes around an hour by road to reach the hotel.</p>"}, {"id": 433, "question": "Are there any nearby attractions or activities around Taj West End in Bengaluru for international guests?", "answer": "<p>Yes, Taj West End is close to Cubbon Park, Vidhana Soudha and Bangalore Palace, with UB City shopping and dining options located in proximity for easy exploration.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 434, "question": "Can guests check in early to the Taj West End, Bengaluru?", "answer": "<p>Yes, an early check-in facility at the&nbsp;<strong>Taj West End, Bengaluru,&nbsp;</strong>can be arranged, subject to hotel availability. The standard check-in time at the hotel is 2:00 pm, and guests can check out by 11:00 am.</p>"}, {"id": 435, "question": "Does Taj West End in Bengaluru provide bar service for weddings?", "answer": "<p>Yes,<strong> Taj West End, Bengaluru,&nbsp;</strong>offers bar service for destination weddings. Alcohol is served within the property, and all beverages must be arranged through the hotel. Outside alcohol isn’t allowed and beverages are charged separately per consumption.</p>"}]', '82', '117'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'bengaluru' AND `slug` = 'taj-west-end-bengaluru');
