SELECT 'bengaluru', 'the-leela-bhartiya-city-bengaluru', 'published', 'The Leela Bhartiya City Bengaluru Wedding Cost & Packages', 'Discover The Leela Bhartiya City Bengaluru wedding cost, luxury venue details, premium stays, catering, décor & elegant wedding celebrations in Bengaluru.', 'The Leela Bhartiya City Bengaluru wedding, The Leela Bhartiya City Bengaluru wedding cost, The Leela Bhartiya City Bengaluru wedding price', '/storage/hotel/seo/0cuCkCqCJFD2MZJFVRMTi89TTfbWIYvX9h8XwBqs.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/oohkhpNLDuDLDq6Fawzl0TeEmdCmiRrz35DdivHq.jpg', 'The Leela Bhartiya City Bengaluru', '6/2, Thanisandra Main Rd, Devin Paradise Enclave, Kannuru, Thirumenahalli, Bengaluru, Karnataka 560064, India', '30 minutes', '45 Minutes', '<p>What makes&nbsp;<strong>The Leela Bhartiya City Bengaluru&nbsp;</strong>stand out for a&nbsp;<strong>wedding in Bangalore</strong> is not just its scale, but how it sits inside a planned 125-acre township in North Bengaluru. Instead of feeling isolated like a typical city hotel, it opens into the larger Bhartiya City ecosystem, where landscaped greens, retail spaces and the 4-acre Central Park sit just steps away. That balance of city access and open-air breathing space is what couples often end up valuing most once they visit.</p><p>The hotel itself is renowned for its Grand Ballroom, which spans 12,776 square feet and can host up to 2,000 guests, making it one of the more flexible large-scale wedding venues in the city. Despite the size, the design does not feel overwhelming; the interiors stay calm and contemporary, with soft lighting, clean geometry and an easy flow between pre-function areas and main event spaces. This makes it particularly useful for weddings that need multiple functions under one roof without logistical stress.</p><p>At&nbsp;<strong>The Leela Bhartiya City Bengaluru,</strong> Leela’s hospitality keeps everything smooth, while nearby spots like Jakkur and Hebbal Lake offer quick escapes between wedding festivities. With Kempegowda International Airport located nearby, only 30-45 minutes away, guests can get quick and smooth airport transfers to reach the venue for your big day.</p>', '281 rooms with suites', 'Grand Ballroom with a Pre-Function Area, Royal Ballroom', 'The Terrace', '600', '600', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/U0H1CCNt2vyxcVIVEj63F0q6VXjZnHQXnqnR7mYo.jpg", "title": "5+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/p3raAo2koRDmljUjAUYpO0IiyE9EGEn0I3LpAzvP.jpg", "title": "Skyline dinners with panoramic views"}]', '[{"id": 1087, "question": "Can I bring my own wedding planner or decorator to The Leela Bhartiya City Bengaluru?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>The Leela Bhartiya City Bengaluru&nbsp;</strong>allows external wedding planners, but the hotel needs to approve and coordinate with them. It is recommended to confirm with the Viraaya Weddings team before you book.</p>"}, {"id": 1088, "question": "What is the standard check-in time at The Leela Bhartiya City Bengaluru, and can guests request an early check-in?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>The Leela Bhartiya City Bengaluru</strong> is 2:00 pm, while guests can check out by 12:00 noon. An early check-in facility is available at the property, but it is subject to the hotel’s discretion.</p>"}, {"id": 1089, "question": "How much can I save if I book at The Leela Bhartiya City Bengaluru?", "answer": "<p>Savings at&nbsp;<strong>The Leela Bhartiya City Bengaluru&nbsp;</strong>can vary as per dates, guest count and event scale. If you book through Viraaya Weddings'' partnerships, you can save around 10-15% or more on negotiated prices. You also get easier access to curated vendors and smoother end-to-end coordination.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 1090, "question": "⁠How early should I book The Leela Bhartiya City Bengaluru for a wedding?", "answer": "<p>For a wedding at&nbsp;<strong>The Leela Bhartiya City Bengaluru</strong>, it’s best to book 12-18 months in advance, especially for peak wedding seasons and preferred dates.</p>"}, {"id": 1091, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol to The Leela Bhartiya City Bengaluru?", "answer": "<p>For a wedding at&nbsp;<strong>The Leela Bhartiya City Bengaluru</strong>, all alcohol is served through the hotel’s in-house bar service. Outside alcohol isn’t permitted, and beverages, including liquor, are billed separately based on actual consumption.</p>"}]', '264', '281'
