SELECT 'bengaluru', 'the-leela-palace-bengaluru', 'published', 'The Leela Palace Bangalore Wedding Cost Estimates & Booking', 'From royal ballrooms to garden ceremonies, The Leela Palace Bengaluru offers transparent wedding cost & unbeatable booking price details. Contact Us!', 'the leela palace bangalore wedding cost, the leela palace bangalore wedding price, the leela palace bangalore booking price, the leela palace bangalore wedding venue cost', '/storage/hotel/seo/QIeSsbdOze0Kkle1qFOAdGIpeCyuEjV9abGUIp0K.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/URu23uMNWH4Z0F5Dy4LKgUeEPHrGzEglUF0TKPzc.jpg', 'The Leela Palace Bengaluru', '23, HAL Old Airport Rd, HAL 2nd Stage, Kodihalli, Bengaluru, Karnataka 560008, India., India', '75 Minutes', '30 Minutes', '<p>Set in the heart of the city,<strong> The Leela Palace Bengaluru</strong> is renowned as the Garden City’s only modern palace hotel, spread across 7.5 acres of lush greens and a natural lagoon. Having taken inspiration from the rich grandeur of the Vijayanagara Empire and the Mysore Palace, its domes, arches and intricate detailing create a setting that feels regal without being overwhelming.</p><p>The&nbsp;<strong>Leela Palace in Bangalore</strong> is one of the&nbsp;<strong>finest venues for a destination wedding in the city</strong>. While the Maharaja Ballroom is well-suited to larger events, the Lotus Courtyard and the open terraces seem perfect for smaller, more intimate wedding functions. The hotel’s intricate architecture and landscaped grounds add enough character, so you don’t have to invest in extensive décor.</p><p>What makes the experience seamless is how comfortable your guests feel at this property. Luxurious accommodations, multiple dining options and warm hospitality make the stay feel easy from the very start. Additionally, the hotel is also well-connected to the airport and key parts of the city, making travel convenient for everyone.</p>', '357 rooms with suites', 'The Grand Ballroom, The Royal Ballroom, Maharaja Ballroom', 'Lotus Courtyard, Diya Terrace, Surya Terrace', '760', '760', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/Wye2AHwbiQ5Q24ZxTd3UWHF4MykAPTk0oqfHXxUo.jpg", "title": "6+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/kQFLGsoDRjD3y3hTvaL41diGK8ZHUPvVMpXgtTWv.jpg", "title": "Intimate candlelight poolside dining experience"}]', '[{"id": 421, "question": "What is The Leela Palace Bengaluru wedding venue cost?", "answer": "<p>The standard price of a destination wedding at The Leela Bengaluru usually ranges from INR 85 lakhs to INR 1.3 Cr for 250-300 guests. To get a better idea of the package price for a 3-day, 2-night event, use Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator, enter the relevant details and get a close quote within seconds.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 422, "question": "Which celebrity hosted their wedding reception at The Leela Palace Bengaluru?", "answer": "<p>Actors Deepika Padukone and Ranveer Singh hosted their wedding reception at The Leela Palace Bengaluru in November 2018.</p>"}, {"id": 423, "question": "Should I choose The Leela Bengaluru or JW Marriott Bengaluru Prestige Golfshire Resort & Spa for my wedding?", "answer": "<p>Go with<strong> The Leela Bengaluru</strong> if you want a more luxurious feel, with 357 rooms and a budget of INR 85 lakh–1.3 Cr. If you’re going with a slightly lower budget (INR 50 lakh–INR 1 Cr+) with 301 rooms and easier airport access, JW Marriott Bengaluru Prestige Golfshire Resort &amp; Spa works well.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 424, "question": "What is the check-in time at The Leela Palace Bengaluru, and can guests get an early check-in?", "answer": "<p>The standard time to check-in at&nbsp;<strong>The Leela Palace Bengaluru</strong> is 2:00 pm, and guests can check-out by 12:00 noon. Guests can request an early check-in, but it is subject to hotel availability.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 425, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol to The Leela Palace Bengaluru?", "answer": "<p>Alcohol is served by The Leela Palace Bengaluru, but all beverages should be exclusively purchased through the hotel. Outside alcohol isn’t permitted, and beverages are charged separately based on consumption, separate from standard wedding packages.</p>"}]', '77', '357'
