SELECT 'bengaluru', 'the-ritz-carlton-bangalore', 'published', 'The Ritz Carlton Bangalore – Wedding Cost & Details', 'The Ritz-Carlton Bangalore wins hearts with iconic venues. Discover honest wedding cost, transparent pricing & superb five-star service. Contact Us Now!', 'the ritz carlton bangalore wedding, the ritz carlton bangalore wedding cost, the ritz carlton bangalore wedding price', '/storage/hotel/seo/f4zqrM3uJVljVUNLsbTKQwVnSn0JRBqpaI1RLLcl.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/IuInuMYtTkYunc04eE3mUyPoTUt4wbUoQEwPyT7i.jpg', 'The Ritz Carlton Bangalore', '99, Residency Rd, Shanthala Nagar, Ashok Nagar, Bengaluru, Karnataka 560025, India', '60 Minutes', '25 Minutes', '<p>A<strong> wedding at The Ritz-Carlton, Bangalore&nbsp;</strong>doesn’t feel staged; it just unfolds in its own rhythm. Right on Residency Road, The Ritz-Carlton, Bangalore offers a calm escape from the city with marble interiors, soft lighting and art-filled spaces that set an easy, elegant mood. From ballroom celebrations to rooftop cocktails at Bang and relaxed moments on the lawn, this 5-star property makes every part of the wedding feel naturally connected and unhurried.</p><p>For a&nbsp;<strong>wedding in Bangalore, The Ritz-Carlton, Bangalore</strong> feels best when you don’t try to over-script the day. One moment, the pillarless ballroom is full of music and movement, and before you know it, everyone has drifted to Bang for cocktails with the skyline right there in front of you. The lawn slows things down a bit, giving people space to just sit, talk and take it all in. Even the suites and dining spaces at The Ritz-Carlton, Bangalore naturally keep families close, so the celebration never feels scattered or rushed, just easy and connected.</p><p>What really stays with you about a&nbsp;<strong>wedding at The Ritz-Carlton, Bangalore&nbsp;</strong>is how effortless it all feels. With the hotel staff and wedding team surrounding you as and when required, the spaces quietly set the tone for a celebration without trying too hard. Nothing feels forced or overly planned, yet the wedding somehow moves along smoothly, like it’s unfolding on its own.</p>', '277 rooms with suites', 'The Ritz-Carlton Ballroom, Ballrooms', 'The Ritz-Carlton Lawn, Ballroom Outdoor Foyer, The Pool Bar', '600', '600', '[{"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal02.png", "title": "9+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal03.png", "title": "Private bridal styling sanctuaries"}, {"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal04.png", "title": "Chef-curated wedding tasting experiences"}, {"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal05.png", "title": "Candlelit wine-library dinners for couples"}]', '[{"id": 1092, "question": "How to reach The Ritz-Carlton, Bangalore, from the nearest airport?", "answer": "<p>The nearest airport to The Ritz-Carlton, Bangalore, is Kempegowda International Airport (BLR). The hotel is around 35 kilometres away, taking approximately 50 minutes by car.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 1093, "question": "Is an early check-in available at The Ritz-Carlton, Bangalore, and what are the standard check-in and check-out times?", "answer": "<p>Yes, guests can request an early check-in, which is subject to hotel availability. The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>The Ritz-Carlton, Bangalore</strong> is 2:00 pm, while guests can check out by 12:00 noon.</p>"}, {"id": 1094, "question": "Which months are most popular for weddings at The Ritz-Carlton, Bangalore?", "answer": "<p>October to February is the most popular wedding season at&nbsp;<strong>The Ritz-Carlton, Bangalore</strong>. November and December see especially high demand for elegant outdoor celebrations and rooftop events.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 1096, "question": "What is the standard liquor policy at The Ritz-Carlton, Bangalore, for weddings?", "answer": "<p>The Ritz-Carlton, Bangalore typically manages liquor service through its in-house team for weddings. Alcohol packages are customised separately based on the event requirements and guest count.</p>"}]', '80', '277'
