SELECT 'bhopal', 'courtyard-by-marriott-bhopal', 'published', 'Courtyard Marriott Bhopal Weddings Cost & Booking', 'Courtyard Marriott Bhopal offers premium wedding spaces and personalised event packages. Explore cost guides, inclusions & direct booking for your big day.', 'courtyard marriott bhopal wedding cost, courtyard marriott bhopal wedding packages, marriott bhopal wedding cost, courtyard by marriott bhopal wedding', '/storage/hotel/seo/Whov0hge2OoKB5iJ2KifbhJ1ekYwFemApdhfuaFD.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/bYAKokkpEIDaij2Q7tJ88EIxBo4YpuszLPHPh53e.jpg', 'Courtyard by Marriott Bhopal', 'Dainik Bhaskar Mall, DB City Mall, Zone-I, Arera Hills, Bhopal, Madhya Pradesh 462011, India', '30 minutes', '20 Minutes', '<p>At&nbsp;<strong>Courtyard by Marriott Bhopal</strong>, the city’s fast pace softens the moment you step into its warm, contemporary spaces overlooking Arera Hills. Connected to DB City Mall and just a short drive from Raja Bhoj Airport, this 5-star luxury hotel brings together modern design, rooftop views and the easy convenience couples look for while planning a&nbsp;<strong>wedding in Madhya Pradesh</strong>. The glass-heavy architecture, polished interiors and lively social spaces give the property an energetic yet welcoming atmosphere for multi-day celebrations.</p><p>A&nbsp;<strong>wedding at Courtyard by Marriott Bhopal</strong> moves seamlessly between grand indoor celebrations and relaxed outdoor moments. Spread across nearly 26,300 square feet of event space, the pillar-less Grand Ballroom sets the tone for lavish receptions, while the Marigold Terrace feels perfect for sundowner pheras, mehendi functions and cocktail evenings under the open sky. Marriott’s experienced hospitality teams ensure every event feels organised without losing warmth or personality.</p><p>What makes&nbsp;<strong>Courtyard by Marriott Bhopal</strong> stand out is how effortlessly the celebrations spill into the overall stay experience. The rooftop pool, stylish dining spaces, spacious suites and lively atmosphere give the hotel an easy sense of comfort and sophistication. Paired with Bhopal’s scenic lakes and cultural attractions nearby, the property feels polished yet relaxed, making wedding celebrations feel more personal and enjoyable for everyone staying there.</p>', '160 rooms with suites', 'Lotus Ballroom, Lotus Pre-Function Area, The Grand Ballroom, The Grand Ballroom Pre-Function Area', 'Marigold Terrace', '350', '350', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/Ve9NH1JTsYb76BtBluvhYya921yxkNdLEvi1dMV3.jpg", "title": "5+ dining venues onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/HlOAPJhFNkFyYACsVjeQaA8TXMdgIyOWfzF4Wu0I.jpg", "title": "Italian-Japanese fusion date night experience"}]', '[{"id": 1198, "question": "Which months are most popular for weddings at Courtyard by Marriott Bhopal?", "answer": "<p>October to February is usually the busiest wedding season at&nbsp;<strong>Courtyard by Marriott Bhopal</strong>, thanks to the pleasant weather and high demand for celebrations.</p>"}, {"id": 1199, "question": "What is the standard check-in time at Courtyard by Marriott Bhopal, and is early check-in available?", "answer": "<p>The standard time to check-in at&nbsp;<strong>Courtyard by Marriott Bhopal</strong> is 2:00 pm, and the check-out time is 12:00 noon. Guests can get an early check-in, but it is entirely subject to the hotel’s discretion.</p>"}, {"id": 1200, "question": "Can I host a pre-wedding photoshoot at Courtyard by Marriott Bhopal?", "answer": "<p>Pre-wedding photoshoots are usually allowed at&nbsp;<strong>Courtyard by Marriott Bhopal</strong> with prior permission. Additional charges, timing restrictions and photography guidelines may apply.</p>"}, {"id": 1201, "question": "Are drones, fireworks or baraat allowed at Courtyard by Marriott Bhopal?", "answer": "<p>Baraat processions are generally permitted at&nbsp;<strong>Courtyard by Marriott Bhopal</strong>, while drone usage and fireworks are subject to hotel policies and state regulations. Confirm with the hotel or Viraaya Weddings team to avoid any last-minute hassles.</p>"}, {"id": 1202, "question": "Does Courtyard by Marriott Bhopal provide a bar service for weddings?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>Courtyard by Marriott Bhopal&nbsp;</strong>has an in-house bar, as outside alcohol is not permitted on the property premises. All beverages and drinks are charged separately based on consumption, separate from wedding packages.</p>"}]', '241', '160'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'bhopal' AND `slug` = 'courtyard-by-marriott-bhopal');
