SELECT 'bhopal', 'radisson-hotel-bhopal', 'published', 'Radisson Hotel Bhopal - Luxury Weddings Cost and Booking', 'Radisson Hotel Bhopal offers elegant wedding spaces and personalised event planning. Explore wedding cost guides, pricing and direct booking options today.', 'radisson hotel bhopal wedding cost, radisson hotel bhopal wedding, radisson bhopal, hotel radisson bhopal, radisson blu bhopal', '/storage/hotel/seo/yjGgqn0HqqtDCCBmoB2J8HlSG00aokwvewwlveng.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/OBi2sSbHHYS46vVQCIIoPlDnBYfg6qSYQmbmqqTH.jpg', 'Radisson Hotel Bhopal', 'E-8, Gulmohar Main Rd, opposite Savoy Complex, Bawadiya Kalan, Gulmohar Colony, Bhopal, Madhya Pradesh 462039, India', '40 Minutes', '25 Minutes', '<p>There’s something instantly inviting about&nbsp;<strong>Radisson Hotel Bhopal</strong>. Maybe it’s the sleek glass façade, the warm lighting after sunset or the subtle Gond-inspired artwork woven through the interiors. Recently opened as Radisson’s 100th hotel in India, this 5-star luxury property sits in the upscale Bawadiya Kalan neighbourhood, around 18 km from Raja Bhoj Airport and a short drive from Rani Kamalapati Railway Station. For couples planning a&nbsp;<strong>wedding in Madhya Pradesh</strong>, the location feels convenient without losing its premium, celebratory charm.</p><p>A&nbsp;<strong>wedding at Radisson Hotel Bhopal</strong> feels beautifully versatile from the very first function. Spread across nearly 3,900 square metres of event space, the hotel balances grand celebrations with intimate moments effortlessly. The pillar-less ballroom sets the stage for lavish receptions, while the Grand Terrace and Infinity Terrace bring in open skies, city views and breezy evening celebrations perfect for cocktail nights, pheras or sundowner gatherings.</p><p>What makes&nbsp;<strong>Radisson Hotel Bhopal</strong> memorable is how naturally the celebrations continue beyond the wedding venues. Guests can relax by the rooftop pool, stop for desserts at Just Baked or enjoy intimate dinners at Wok Thai and Urzza Lounge Bar between functions. With 104 luxurious rooms and attractions like Upper Lake and Van Vihar National Park nearby, the hotel feels more like a warm, upscale wedding retreat than a typical city venue.</p>', '104 rooms with suites', 'Grand Ballrooms, Renew Hall, Revive Hall, Nurture Hall, Nirvana Hall', 'Grand Terrace, Infinity Terrace', '250', '250', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/JnDUF7b6mSxjWNjxKTMJeUzY2N3zF1Z1NPaVCPMT.jpg", "title": "3+ dining venues onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/n1NDEgNt0V9XfJinsXxOZFRGUuf4EyJ23jiI1IlS.jpg", "title": "Skyline infinity terrace sundowner experience"}]', '[{"id": 1203, "question": "What is included in a wedding package at Radisson Hotel Bhopal?", "answer": "<p>Wedding packages at&nbsp;<strong>Radisson Hotel Bhopal&nbsp;</strong>usually include venue spaces, guest stays, catering and basic event services. Exact inclusions can be confirmed with the Viraaya Weddings team.</p>"}, {"id": 1204, "question": "What are the standard check-in and check-out times at Radisson Hotel Bhopal, and is early check-in available?", "answer": "<p>The standard time to check-in at&nbsp;<strong>Radisson Hotel Bhopal</strong> is 2:00 pm, and the check-out time is 12:00 noon. Yes, guests can request an early check-in to the hotel, but it is completely subject to hotel availability.</p>"}, {"id": 1205, "question": "Is outside catering allowed for weddings at Radisson Hotel Bhopal?", "answer": "<p>Outside catering may be allowed at&nbsp;<strong>Radisson Hotel Bhopal</strong> for certain wedding functions and customised celebrations. It’s best to check the latest catering policies with the hotel or Viraaya Weddings team.</p>"}, {"id": 1206, "question": "How much can I save if I book the Radisson Hotel Bhopal through Viraaya Weddings?", "answer": "<p>Booking&nbsp;<strong>Radisson Hotel Bhopal&nbsp;</strong>through Viraaya Weddings can help couples save 10-15% or more through exclusive hotel partnerships, negotiated rates and easier access to trusted wedding vendors.</p>"}, {"id": 1207, "question": "What is the standard liquor policy at Radisson Hotel Bhopal?", "answer": "<p><strong>Radisson Hotel Bhopal&nbsp;</strong>follows an in-house liquor policy for weddings, with bar services managed by the hotel. Outside alcohol is generally not permitted, and liquor service is charged separately.</p>"}]', '242', '104'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'bhopal' AND `slug` = 'radisson-hotel-bhopal');
