SELECT 'bhopal', 'taj-lakefront-bhopal', 'published', 'Taj Lakefront Bhopal - Wedding Cost & Venue Booking', 'Taj Lakefront Bhopal offers scenic lakefront wedding venues & tailored packages. Find wedding cost, price guides & direct booking for your big day. Book!', 'taj lakefront bhopal wedding cost, taj lakefront bhopal wedding, taj lakefront bhopal wedding price, taj lakefront bhopal wedding package, hotel taj lakefront bhopal', '/storage/hotel/seo/U6iZZIhrjxddluzF1WfOqZLoB8qXtRXzxSI2UOc3.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/E4DQEtcuiuFFAKcfpjGPvtK1D9AUSVETc8Yf0z5f.jpg', 'Taj Lakefront Bhopal', 'Ground Floor, Main Road, Chouraha, Prempura, Bhopal, Madhya Pradesh 462003, India', '35 Minutes', '25 Minutes', '<p>The Upper Lake defines the setting at Taj Lakefront Bhopal, and&nbsp;<strong>Taj Lakefront, Bhopal</strong> is positioned right along this edge where water, sky and city meet in a quiet balance. As a 5-star luxury hotel property, it brings a composed, well-structured environment for a&nbsp;<strong>wedding at Taj Lakefront, Bhopal</strong>, with smooth airport access of around 25 minutes from Raja Bhoj International Airport, ensuring guests arrive comfortably even during peak wedding seasons.</p><p>Spread across a wide lakeside estate<strong>, Taj Lakefront, Bhopal,</strong> is designed to feel open yet organised in a unique flow. The 9,418 sq ft Rajmahal Ballroom is set to host large wedding celebrations, while the lawns stretch out towards uninterrupted views of the lake and Satpura ranges. Daylight filters through full-height glass, and subtle regional touches sit quietly within the décor. With Taj’s signature hospitality running through every detail, the setting feels calm and effortless on the big day.</p><p>Beyond the event spaces,&nbsp;<strong>Taj Lakefront, Bhopal</strong> brings together 152 rooms and suites, lakeside dining at Machan, rooftop evenings at the Infinity Bar and easy access to Van Vihar and Sanchi. Everything feels close, connected and easy to settle into, which is really what makes the property work so well for multi-day wedding celebrations.</p>', '142 rooms with 10 suites', 'Raj Mahal, Sheesh Mahal, Narmada Banquet Hall', 'Vindhya Lawn, Satpura Terrace', '350', '350', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/er6kVcI68G5CcFSDmxXe9cYJW5M6AoTRxjKU1EzQ.jpg", "title": "4+ dining venues onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/uKSSWKsm8gAkNXNisvCI13fD9HXfangxXYoSMhX6.jpg", "title": "Poolside romantic dining experience"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/cYe12PTbhXA7QxinJvC02DPGdb14ACJdumu6ImLP.jpg", "title": "Starlit couple dining evenings"}]', '[{"id": 1248, "question": "⁠How early should I book the Taj Lakefront, Bhopal, for a wedding?", "answer": "<p>For&nbsp;<strong>Taj Lakefront, Bhopal,</strong> it is best to book at least 12 to 18 months in advance, especially for peak seasons. Popular weekends and high-demand seasons can get reserved even earlier due to its lakeside setting and limited premium availability.</p>"}, {"id": 1249, "question": "What is the standard time to check-in at Taj Lakefront, Bhopal, and can I get an early check-in?", "answer": "<p>The standard time to check-in at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Lakefront, Bhopal</strong> is 2:00 pm, and the check-out time is 12:00 noon. An early check-in facility can be arranged; however, it is entirely subject to the hotel’s discretion.</p>"}, {"id": 1250, "question": "Can we bring our own wedding planner or decorator to Taj Lakefront, Bhopal?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>Taj Lakefront, Bhopal</strong> does allow external wedding planners and decorators. The hotel’s events team works closely with them, with all approvals and setup guidelines to ensure everything runs smoothly.</p>"}, {"id": 1251, "question": "Are there suggested excursions or experiences near Taj Lakefront, Bhopal?", "answer": "<p>Yes, guests staying at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Lakefront, Bhopal</strong> can explore Van Vihar National Park for close wildlife encounters, take peaceful walks at the Upper Lake promenade, visit Tribal Museum for local culture or head to Shahpura Lake cafés for relaxed evenings nearby.</p>"}, {"id": 1252, "question": "Does Taj Lakefront, Bhopal, provide a bar service for weddings?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>Taj Lakefront, Bhopal,&nbsp;</strong>offers an in-house bar service for weddings, with curated beverage menus and in-house mixology setups managed by the hotel. All bar arrangements are handled and billed separately from wedding packages. Outside alcohol is generally not permitted.</p>"}]', '239', '152'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'bhopal' AND `slug` = 'taj-lakefront-bhopal');
