SELECT 'chandigarh', 'hyatt-regency-chandigarh', 'published', 'Hyatt Regency Chandigarh Wedding Cost, Packages & Reviews', 'Discover Hyatt Regency Chandigarh with booking help, genuine hyatt regency chandigarh reviews & wedding cost details. Contact us today for best offers now!', 'hyatt regency chandigarh wedding, hyatt regency chandigarh wedding cost, hyatt regency chandigarh booking, hyatt chandigarh packages, hyatt chandigarh room booking', '/storage/hotel/seo/dEYCBKh0xWIKmQLTLxFjYGEBroxJNoa9J815rG8G.png', '/storage/hotels/banners/Atqpy6RRkVVwEEQkyCNZKaaGnzOvA64pu4ILEdTb.jpg', 'Hyatt Regency chandigarh', '178, 1, Industrial Area Phase I, Chandigarh, 160002, India', '35 Minutes', '15 Minutes', '<p>At&nbsp;<strong>Hyatt Regency Chandigarh</strong>, the design reveals itself the moment you arrive. Inspired by the city’s modernist roots, its structured façade gives the building a distinct presence, while the marble-floored interiors, warm wood panelling and soft lighting create spaces that feel polished and inviting.</p><p>The event spaces at Hyatt Regency Chandigarh are thoughtfully planned. Pillarless banquet halls allow décor to come together seamlessly, whether it is an elegant reception or a large sangeet. Natural light throughout the day lends a bright, open feel to ceremonies, while evenings take on a softer, more atmospheric setting, creating a fairytale stage for the celebration.</p><p>Step outdoors and experience the shift in mood as it changes with the ambience. The poolside deck and lush green surroundings make for a beautiful setting for intimate gatherings and pre-wedding functions. With Hyatt’s signature hospitality and spacious rooms, national and international guests feel well cared for. Each celebration is timed and managed smoothly, so you can focus on the experience while everything else falls into place.</p>', '211', 'Regency Ballrooms, Satluj Banquet Halls', 'Upper Terrace, Lower Terrace', '425', '425', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/QTu3jq4xl3zvEHNHUhkCTGKyeWrJFjBI1WjvWM9i.jpg", "title": "4+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/Hm3y2WLxBN1EkxOq8XZ1gWoRUte6s7IyVOjPProD.jpg", "title": "Sukhna Lake boating experience"}]', '[{"id": 328, "question": "Which is the nearest airport to the Hyatt Regency Chandigarh?", "answer": "<p>The&nbsp;<strong>Hyatt Regency Chandigarh</strong> is closest to Chandigarh Airport (IXC), which is also known as Shaheed Bhagat Singh International Airport. It is about 8 to 10 kilometres away and usually takes 25 to 35 minutes to get there by car, depending on traffic.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 329, "question": "What is the check-in time at Hyatt Regency Chandigarh, and can we check-in early?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at Hyatt Regency Chandigarh is 2:00 pm, and guests can check out by 12:00 noon. Guests can request an early check-in, but it is subject to hotel availability.</p>"}, {"id": 330, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol to a destination wedding at Hyatt Regency Chandigarh?", "answer": "<p>No, outside liquor is not allowed at Hyatt Regency Chandigarh. All beverages and drinks served in banquet areas should be purchased by the hotel. Beverages are charged separately based on consumption and are not part of the standard wedding package.</p>"}]', '59', '211'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'chandigarh' AND `slug` = 'hyatt-regency-chandigarh');
