SELECT 'chandigarh', 'novotel-chandigarh-tribune-chowk', 'published', 'Novotel Chandigarh Tribune Chowk - Wedding Cost & Booking', 'Novotel Chandigarh Tribune Chowk blends contemporary comfort with exceptional service. Check guest reviews, wedding cost & direct booking. Reserve Now!', 'novotel chandigarh tribune chowk wedding, novotel chandigarh tribune chowk wedding cost, novotel chandigarh tribune chowk booking, novotel chandigarh tribune chowk cost', '/storage/hotel/seo/WB44DgfsXZILEv2foEzblnerezJh8icJhYaW4tAC.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/UyHpqfFyAp65v9OjivEEbtcQxlwiyXW9TtLYylEp.jpg', 'Novotel Chandigarh Tribune Chowk', 'Plot 181, 3B, Industrial Area Phase I, Chandigarh, 160002, India', '35 Minutes', '15 minutes', '<p>If your idea of a celebration includes stylish spaces, smooth hospitality and guests actually enjoying the stay, then&nbsp;<strong>a wedding at Novotel Chandigarh Tribune Chowk</strong> feels like a natural fit. Opened in 2021 as a contemporary 5-star Accor property,&nbsp;<strong>Novotel Chandigarh Tribune Chowk</strong> combines sleek glass-fronted architecture with modern interiors, warm lighting and quieter green surroundings near the city’s busy Tribune Chowk area.</p><p>Big celebrations feel especially effortless at&nbsp;<strong>Novotel Chandigarh Tribune Chowk</strong>. The pillarless Grand Ballroom spans nearly 750 sq. metres, giving decorators and production teams complete flexibility for large receptions, sangeets and indoor wedding functions. Couples planning a&nbsp;<strong>wedding in Chandigarh</strong> also appreciate how convenient the hotel feels for guests arriving from Delhi, Punjab, Haryana and Himachal Pradesh, while Chandigarh International Airport remains around 30 minutes away.</p><p>What guests often remember most about&nbsp;<strong>Novotel Chandigarh Tribune Chowk</strong> is how social and relaxed the stay feels between events. The 120 contemporary rooms and suites overlook the city skyline or peaceful green spaces, while Curves, Alfresco and Food Exchange naturally become gathering spots long after the celebrations end. With Sukhna Lake, Elante Mall and Rock Garden nearby, guests always have something to explore during their stay.</p>', '120 rooms with suites', 'The Grand Ballroom', 'The Terrace, Mango Grove', '300', '300', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/5vkuOFuTp7KA01XfBPAuKdoyB84m3gW9UMY2gdxi.jpg", "title": "3+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/8of3xe9hF5WTY70nARvHU2XySA59DWO3a7atN9VF.jpg", "title": "Velvet lounge cocktail evenings"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/lT8NUuOzAcVsK9LBIxm9zYOCKycDS6zj5XVbFVz4.jpg", "title": "Starlit alfresco tasting table experiences"}]', '[{"id": 1017, "question": "Are there nearby attractions or activities for international guests around the Novotel Chandigarh Tribune Chowk?", "answer": "<p>International guests staying at&nbsp;<strong>Novotel Chandigarh Tribune Chowk</strong> can explore nearby Sukhna Lake, Rock Garden, Elante Mall and Chandigarh’s famous Capitol Complex. Popular outings also include the Zakir Hussain Rose Garden and rooftop dining around the city. Short drives also lead to the Timber Trail, Morni Hills and Pinjore Gardens.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 1018, "question": "What is the standard check-in time at Novotel Chandigarh Tribune Chowk, and can guests get an early check-in?", "answer": "<p>The standard time to check-in to&nbsp;<strong>Novotel Chandigarh Tribune Chowk</strong> is 2:00 pm, and check-out is at 12:00 noon. An early check-in facility can be arranged, but it is subject to hotel availability.</p>"}, {"id": 1019, "question": "Does Novotel Chandigarh Tribune Chowk have salons, laundry service and an iron board in rooms?", "answer": "<p>Yes,<strong> Novotel Hotel Chandigarh&nbsp;</strong>provides laundry service and in-room ironing facilities. The hotel currently does not have an operational salon or spa on-site.</p>"}, {"id": 1020, "question": "What are the timing restrictions for events/music at Novotel Chandigarh Tribune Chowk?", "answer": "<p>At&nbsp;<strong>Novotel Chandigarh Tribune Chowk</strong>, outdoor music usually ends by 10:00 pm as per Chandigarh regulations. Indoor event timings may vary depending on hotel permissions and approvals.</p>"}, {"id": 1021, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol to Novotel Chandigarh Tribune Chowk for a destination wedding?", "answer": "<p><strong>Novotel Chandigarh Tribune Chowk</strong> usually serves alcohol through its own bar service for weddings. Outside liquor is generally not permitted, and beverage packages are managed directly by the hotel.</p>"}]', '139', '120'
