SELECT 'chandigarh', 'taj-chandigarh', 'published', 'Taj Chandigarh Wedding Cost, Packages & Hotel Booking', 'Check Taj Chandigarh wedding cost & booking options. Plan your dream destination wedding at Taj Hotel Chandigarh with best packages & exclusive deals.', 'taj hotel chandigarh wedding cost, taj hotel chandigarh wedding, taj chandigarh booking, taj hotel chandigarh, taj chandigarh photos, taj chandigarh price', '/storage/hotel/seo/oV5a15Nf3gFghEbbolGXcMP89EJe3AaSdJTHMq1q.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/OpnDfJw7ZSV0lgsC27b5n1HqwzkqAUSq0Awf07T8.jpg', 'Taj Chandigarh', 'No. 9, near Zakir Hussain Rose Garden, Sector 17A, 17A, Sector 17, Chandigarh, 160017, India', '25 Minutes', '20 Minutes', '<p>Taj Chandigarh sits in Sector 17, placing you right within one of the most active parts of Chandigarh, surrounded by gardens, boulevards and civic spaces. You step into a sunlit lobby with marble floors and regional artwork that immediately sets the tone of the stay, which is warm and indulgent. The hotel brings together an exquisite mix of dining options, serving Punjabi, Chinese, Mediterranean and global cuisines, making it easy to host different gatherings without stepping out.</p><p>The hotel offers five venues, including the Grand Ballroom, banquet halls and the expansive GBR Lawn, allowing you to plan different wedding functions. Indoor spaces feature high ceilings and elegant layouts suited for formal ceremonies and receptions, while the lawns work well for larger gatherings. The option to combine select venues also helps accommodate bigger guest lists, making the property a practical choice for multi-day celebrations.</p>', '149', 'The Grand Ballroom, The Ballroom I, The Ballroom II, The Terrace Hall', 'GBR Lawn', '300', '340', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/RaDhS0qAPA7sCR29JdXnO7j8HEe3Ee1C7UQMjoXa.jpg", "title": "4 in-house global cuisine restaurants and lounges"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/f9QRE2O4DXqfoLpH0z2CYk8R4jbaZCathn6iXf6m.jpg", "title": "Rose Garden wedding photoshoot venue"}]', '[{"id": 223, "question": "What are the Taj Chandigarh’s check-in and check-out timings? Are late check-out or early check-in facilities available for wedding couples?", "answer": "<p>At Taj Chandigarh, check-in is 2:00 PM, and check-out is 12:00 noon. Early arrival and late departure for wedding couples are available upon request, subject to hotel availability. For specific wedding arrangements, you can contact the Taj Chandigarh front desk.</p>"}, {"id": 224, "question": "Which airport is located nearest to Taj Chandigarh?", "answer": "<p>Shaheed Bhagat Singh International Airport is the closest airport to&nbsp;<strong>Taj Chandigarh</strong>, located roughly 14 kilometres away. The hotel offers convenient airport transfer services for guests upon prior request.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 225, "question": "re there any special offers for wedding couples at Taj Chandigarh?", "answer": "<p><strong>Taj Chandigarh</strong> offers ‘Timeless Weddings’ packages that include romantic staycations and customised bridal services. Couples may also enjoy flexible check-in timings and honeymoon experiences for their special celebrations.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 226, "question": "Can I host a pre-wedding photo shoot at Taj Chandigarh?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>Taj Chandigarh</strong> permits pre-wedding shoots. Stunning venues include the grand lobby, poolside, the rose garden and the Grand Ballroom, which provide a luxurious backdrop for capturing your truly timeless romantic memories.</p>"}, {"id": 227, "question": "What is the Taj Chandigarh’s policy in relation to alcohol?", "answer": "<p>The&nbsp;<strong>Taj Chandigarh&nbsp;</strong>permits alcohol consumption on its property, but the drinks need to be bought from the hotel’s in-house restaurants and bars. These are charged separately and are not a part of your wedding package. Outside alcohol is not permitted inside the hotel.&nbsp;</p>"}]', '138', '149'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'chandigarh' AND `slug` = 'taj-chandigarh');
--> statement-breakpoint
