SELECT 'chandigarh', 'the-oberoi-sukhvilas', 'published', 'The Oberoi Sukhvilas Spa Resort New Chandigarh Wedding Cost', 'Experience The Oberoi Sukhvilas Spa Resort New Chandigarh wedding with cost insights & premium wedding package deals. Book now for luxury stays today!', 'the oberoi sukhvilas spa resort new chandigarh wedding, the oberoi sukhvilas spa resort new chandigarh wedding cost, the oberoi sukhvilas spa resort new chandigarh wedding package, the oberoi sukhvilas chandigarh wedding, the oberoi sukhvilas new chandigarh, the oberoi sukhvilas resort & spa chandigarh, the oberoi sukhvilas resort chandigarh', '/storage/hotel/seo/i94HQUDMPwp9KXuK2vcLh7u4ypDhiJ7oMCbk59ql.png', '/storage/hotels/banners/uAp4MoGLDDvZ6iQcFVXnbBsnIyOlNYaYU0kDUMHD.jpg', 'The Oberoi Sukhvilas', 'Pallanpur P.O, Sialba Majri Road, New Chandigarh, Punjab 140110, India', '30 Minutes', '45 Minutes', '<p>At&nbsp;<strong>The Oberoi Sukhvilas Resort &amp; Spa in New Chandigarh</strong>, the first thing you notice is how calm everything feels. Surrounded by the Siswan Forest Range from all sides, the space feels cosy and away from the rush of the city, almost like your wedding exists in its own world. Pathways open into courtyards, courtyards lead to water bodies and every turn reveals carved details and soft golden accents that echo old palace design.</p><p>A wedding at this property does not rely solely on décor, because the setting itself holds the guests in a state of awe with its elegant architecture. The Durbar Hall exudes a sense of grandeur, ideal for evening celebrations, while Anant Mahal opens onto an expansive lawn, where pheras feel more intimate and deeply rooted in tradition. Haldi, mehendi and late-night gatherings find their place across the property, making each space feel naturally suited for the wedding festivities.</p><p><strong>The Oberoi Sukhvilas Resort &amp; Spa, New Chandigarh,&nbsp;</strong>has a boutique, cottage-style setting, with tents and villas spread across the property to make guests feel as if they are in their own private space. Oberoi''s impeccable and efficient hospitality ensures that both local and international guests feel comfortable and cared for, with everything unfolding at a pace that feels calm and well considered.</p>', '60', 'Durbar Halls', 'Intimate Terraces, Lakeside Lawns', '120', '150', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/Bahj7iHHT3GRnwfnJ4LGV1VpuYmxRLc2QNcm8QMR.jpg", "title": "3+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/EaQmGYafXZS8z4SRzeCocujzoEoCn4ISiA6l9zJ2.jpg", "title": "Romantic gazebo candlelit dining experience"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/w1vLIVVqHf9Qv8XOYIOw0ViTRsaGVwqGg4G6LuWy.jpg", "title": "Curated garden picnic dining experience"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/zgRrhqEjAfcjei9yF0Z1t1pi3FV41UmcILJLF1tK.jpg", "title": "Bonfire courtyard dining with live Bhangra"}]', '[{"id": 582, "question": "How much does a wedding at The Oberoi Sukhvilas Resort & Spa, New Chandigarh cost?", "answer": "<p>The standard cost of&nbsp;<strong>The Oberoi Sukhvilas Resort &amp; Spa, New Chandigarh, wedding package&nbsp;</strong>usually starts from INR 60 lakhs. However, for a premium destination wedding experience, and depending on your guest count and requirements, the budget can go as high as INR 1 Cr. To get an instant estimate of the final budget, refer to Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator. Enter the necessary details and hit ‘Calculate Hotel Cost’ to get a precise quote within seconds.</p>"}, {"id": 583, "question": "Which celebrity wedding took place at The Oberoi Sukhvilas Resort & Spa, New Chandigarh?", "answer": "<p>Actors Rajkumar Rao and Patralekha Paul got married at&nbsp;<strong>The Oberoi Sukhvilas Resort &amp; Spa, New Chandigarh,&nbsp;</strong>in November 2021.</p>"}, {"id": 584, "question": "Can guests check-in early at The Oberoi Sukhvilas Resort & Spa, New Chandigarh?", "answer": "<p>Yes, subject to hotel availability, early check-in is available for guests attending a wedding at&nbsp;<strong>The Oberoi Sukhvilas Resort &amp; Spa, New Chandigarh.&nbsp;</strong>Please note that the standard check-in time at the resort is 2:00 pm, and check-out time is 12:00 noon.</p>"}, {"id": 585, "question": "What is the liquor policy for destination weddings at The Oberoi Sukhvilas Resort & Spa, New Chandigarh?", "answer": "<p>Alcohol is served exclusively at&nbsp;<strong>The Oberoi Sukhvilas Resort &amp; Spa, New Chandigarh</strong>, and all beverages in public areas and banquet spaces must be purchased through the hotel. Outside liquor is not permitted on the property. Beverages are charged separately based on consumption and are not a part of the standard wedding package.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '61', '60'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'chandigarh' AND `slug` = 'the-oberoi-sukhvilas');
