SELECT 'chennai', 'hilton-chennai', 'published', 'Hilton Chennai Wedding Cost, Packages & Booking', 'Hilton Chennai offers elegant wedding halls & world-class event spaces. Discover wedding costs & buffet prices. Check availability & reserve your slot!', 'hilton chennai wedding hall price, hilton chennai wedding​, hilton chennai wedding dinner, wedding weekend hilton chennai​, hilton chennai events​, hilton chennai buffet price', '/storage/hotel/seo/DGvU3OzQUX95UpK8oJOrs4JOyFehjiIjXibx1aFW.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/M2T72jaFSxWExpKDcxZkNOqDJJHAxwCoeo7c0Bhw.jpg', 'Hilton chennai', '124, 1, Jawaharlal Nehru Salai, Poomagal Nagar, Guindy, Chennai, Tamil Nadu 600032, India', '40 Minutes', '45 Minutes', '<p>A striking glass atrium, rooftop celebrations overlooking the city and polished contemporary interiors give a&nbsp;<strong>wedding at Hilton Chennai</strong> a distinctly modern character. This 5-star luxury hotel property in Guindy blends sleek architecture with warm hospitality, creating a setting that feels refined without losing the comfort of a family celebration. Couples can host elegant ballroom functions, lively sangeets by the poolside lawns and intimate cocktail evenings at Q Bar, all within nearly 1,200 sq. metres of versatile event spaces.</p><p>For families planning a&nbsp;<strong>wedding in Chennai</strong>,&nbsp;<strong>Hilton Chennai</strong> makes hosting guests remarkably convenient. The hotel is closely connected to Chennai International Airport, major railway stations and Ekkattuthangal Metro Station, making arrivals and city travel seamless for both Indian and regional guests. Between celebrations, guests can explore Marina Beach, Phoenix Marketcity, St. Thomas Mount and Guindy National Park nearby.</p><p>At&nbsp;<strong>Hilton Chennai,</strong> the experience extends far beyond the venues themselves. Rooftop candlelight cabanas, skyline pool views, multiple dining experiences and spacious contemporary rooms create the feeling of a complete wedding retreat within the city. It is the kind of place where every function naturally flows into the next, keeping guests together throughout the celebration.</p>', '202 rooms with suites', 'Hilton Grand Ballrooms, Ballroom Pre-Function Area', 'Open Poolside Lawns, Q Bar Rooftop Lounge', '450', '450', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/TZUij2pvKpnekb60TFkCrlZJxHg27mO3LFFhYAEC.jpg", "title": "5+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/G7yd3SSlWt9UopYt9JyIQTpx1QgrQje8N7VcsDIb.jpg", "title": "Private rooftop candlelight cabanas"}]', '[{"id": 987, "question": "Are there nearby attractions or activities for international guests around the Hilton Chennai?", "answer": "<p>A&nbsp;<strong>wedding weekend at Hilton Chennai&nbsp;</strong>gives guests plenty to explore nearby, from Marina Beach and Kapaleeshwarar Temple to Fort St. George, stylish cafés, local dining spots and Chennai’s vibrant cultural side.</p>"}, {"id": 988, "question": "Is early check-in to the Hilton Chennai available for wedding guests?", "answer": "<p>Yes, guests can be accommodated with an early check-in, which is subject to hotel availability. The standard time to check-in at&nbsp;<strong>Hilton Chennai&nbsp;</strong>is 3:00 pm, and check-out is by 12:00 noon.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 989, "question": "Are drones, fireworks or baraat allowed at Hilton Chennai?", "answer": "<p>Baraat entries are usually allowed with prior permissions, while drones and special effects may require approvals. Firecrackers are usually not allowed at&nbsp;<strong>Hilton Chennai.</strong></p>"}, {"id": 990, "question": "Is outside catering allowed for weddings at the Hilton Chennai?", "answer": "<p>Outside catering is generally not permitted at&nbsp;<strong>Hilton Chennai.&nbsp;</strong>Wedding menus and dining experiences are usually managed exclusively by the hotel’s in-house catering team.</p>"}, {"id": 991, "question": "What is the standard liquor policy at Hilton Chennai for destination weddings?", "answer": "<p>At&nbsp;<strong>Hilton Chennai,&nbsp;</strong>liquor service for weddings is handled by the hotel’s in-house bar team. Outside alcohol is not permitted, and beverages are billed separately from wedding packages.</p>"}]', '293', '202'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'chennai' AND `slug` = 'hilton-chennai');
