SELECT 'chennai', 'hyatt-regency-chennai', 'published', 'Hyatt Regency Chennai Wedding Package & Hotel Booking', 'Hyatt Regency Chennai offers world-class wedding halls and expert event planning. Discover hall prices, wedding cost breakdowns and seamless booking today.', 'hyatt regency chennai wedding, hyatt regency chennai wedding cost, hyatt regency chennai wedding hall, hyatt regency chennai wedding hall price, hyatt regency chennai reviews', '/storage/hotel/seo/LS4nSqyD9opMotkkw6zurdgEmLZfuYHCTyHAul6X.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/wxI8aVEOowBvFn275Xo5rYXIXiNLc5eKgBu9ozrx.jpg', 'Hyatt Regency Chennai', '365, Anna Salai, Rostrevor Garden, Teynampet, Chennai, Tamil Nadu 600018, India', '40 Minutes', '20 Minutes', '<p>Tall glass façades, contemporary silhouettes and softly lit interiors give&nbsp;<strong>Hyatt Regency Chennai</strong> a polished city character that immediately feels suited for a grand celebration. Set along Anna Salai, this&nbsp;<strong>5-star luxury hotel property</strong> balances the energy of Chennai with calm, thoughtfully designed spaces filled with art installations, water features and relaxed lounge areas. With metro access nearby and Chennai International Airport within driving distance, the hotel makes city weddings feel smooth and well-connected for guests arriving from across India.</p><p>Celebrations at&nbsp;<strong>Hyatt Regency Chennai</strong> are held across sophisticated banquet areas, cosy dining spaces and a chic poolside location ideal for Mehendi events, cocktail parties, and Sangeet nights. While places like Abbotsbury Hall feel cosy and intimate for smaller family get-togethers and pre-wedding moments, the pillarless Regency Ballroom is ideal for larger wedding celebrations.</p><p>A wedding at&nbsp;<strong>Hyatt Regency Chennai</strong> seems quietly immersive with Ayurvedic wellness therapies at Siddh Spa, landscaped poolside spaces and dining experiences that range from Italian favourites to Asian and South Indian cuisine. Nearby attractions like Kapaleeshwarar Temple and Santhome Cathedral Basilica also give guests a chance to experience Chennai beyond the wedding celebrations.</p>', '325 rooms with suites', 'Regency Ballroom, Abbotsbury Hall, Private Dining Area', 'Poolside Deck', '700', '700', '[{"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal02.png", "title": "7+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal03.png", "title": "Romantic poolside under-the-stars dining"}]', '[{"id": 1173, "question": "What are some nearby attractions for guests staying at Hyatt Regency Chennai?", "answer": "<p>Guests staying at<strong> Hyatt Regency Chennai</strong> can visit Kapaleeshwarar Temple and Santhome Cathedral Basilica nearby. Nearby attractions include the Government Museum, Kalakshetra Foundation and DakshinaChitra, all known for their connection to South Indian art and culture.</p>"}, {"id": 1174, "question": "What are the standard check-in and check-out times at Hyatt Regency Chennai, and is early check-in allowed?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at Hyatt Regency Chennai is 3:00 pm, and check-out is at 12:00 noon. An early check-in facility can be arranged, but it is entirely subject to the hotel’s discretion.</p>"}, {"id": 1175, "question": "Are there any restrictions on music for wedding guests at Hyatt Regency Chennai?", "answer": "<p>Outdoor music&nbsp;<strong>Hyatt Regency Chennai&nbsp;</strong>follows local sound regulations and is usually permitted until 10:00 pm. Meanwhile, indoor celebrations can continue within approved venue timings and guidelines.</p>"}, {"id": 1176, "question": "Which is the nearest airport to Hyatt Regency Chennai?", "answer": "<p><strong>Hyatt Regency Chennai</strong> is around 14 km from Chennai International Airport, with a typical travel time of 30 to 40 minutes depending on traffic.</p>"}, {"id": 1177, "question": "What is the standard liquor policy at Hyatt Regency Chennai?", "answer": "<p><strong>Hyatt Regency Chennai&nbsp;</strong>serves alcohol at wedding and banquet events, though all beverages must be arranged through the hotel. Outside liquor is generally not permitted on the property.</p>"}]', '294', '325'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'chennai' AND `slug` = 'hyatt-regency-chennai');
