SELECT 'chennai', 'le-royal-meridien-chennai', 'published', 'Le Royal Méridien Chennai Wedding Package & Cost', 'Le Royal Méridien Chennai wedding packages, cost & hotel booking made easy. Plan with premium banquet options & luxury hospitality in Tamil Nadu. Book!', 'le royal méridien chennai wedding package, le royal méridien chennai wedding cost, le royal méridien chennai wedding, le royal méridien chennai review, le royal méridien chennai booking, le royal méridien chennai hotel booking', '/storage/hotel/seo/dNEIyd0UP0UWeQkVhAqPqhPy9JF8wdBl62Uzw4BY.png', '/storage/hotels/banners/OkkIwoZ5KL99hibIzQB78HFym863chApdK6Lgn3o.jpg', 'Le Royal Meridien Chennai', '1, Grand Southern Trunk Rd, Ramapuram, Alandur, St.Thomas Mount, Chennai, Tamil Nadu 600016, India', '20 Minutes', '15 minutes', '<p>The&nbsp;<strong>Le Royal Méridien Chennai&nbsp;</strong>is one of the most accessible luxury properties in the city for travelling guests. The hotel belongs to the Le Méridien family, known for European glamour and impeccable service. Bespoke dining addresses cover the full range of occasions a wedding party needs. A travel desk in the lobby assists guests with city itineraries, and additional guest services include currency exchange, babysitting and a gift shop, making<strong> Le Royal Méridien Chennai</strong> a top choice for international wedding parties.</p><p>The property has 19,103 sq mt of total event space distributed among eight venues. The Grand Madras Ballroom is pillarless and has a banquet capacity of 1,000 guests, making it one of the largest contiguous wedding spaces in Chennai. What particularly distinguishes the property from a logistics standpoint is its outdoor pool and lawn, which accommodates up to 300 guests and serves as a natural cocktail and baraat venue when weather permits. Complimentary parking for up to 200 cars and a dedicated group check-in counter for parties of ten rooms or more adds a layer of operational ease that larger weddings depend on.</p>', '240 rooms with suites', 'The Grand Madras Ballroom, Jasmine Hall, Lotus Hall, Dharani Hall, Madras-1, Madras-2, Madras-3', 'Outdoor pool with lawns', '500', '500', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/97hhqtBNhWjgjTLAeVFHMgcxWPi0PUhQhgv3o2kR.jpg", "title": "4 in-house dining and bar settings"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/W6BZo0MRtylo6rELiJtKjuQZnZMF108zzbG8Wk5i.jpg", "title": "On-site florist, décor and bridal makeup services"}]', '[{"id": 1057, "question": "Are there nearby attractions or activities for international guests visiting Le Royal Méridien Chennai?", "answer": "<p><strong>Le Royal Méridien Chennai</strong> is ideally positioned for international guests wishing to explore the city. Experiences within easy reach include Marina Beach, the Kapaleeshwarar Temple in Mylapore, the Mahabalipuram Shore Temple complex (a UNESCO World Heritage Site) and the Government Museum in Egmore.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 1058, "question": "Can we bring our own wedding planner and decorator to Le Royal Méridien Chennai?", "answer": "<p><strong>Le Royal Méridien Chennai</strong> allows external wedding planners and decorators to work with its in-house team. It''s best to confirm vendor restrictions with the hotel’s management before booking.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 1059, "question": "How early should I book Le Royal Méridien Chennai for my wedding?", "answer": "<p>Couples are advised to contact&nbsp;<strong>Le Royal Méridien Chennai''</strong>s events team at least 12 months in advance. Early booking also allows greater flexibility in venue configuration and catering customisation.</p>"}, {"id": 1060, "question": "What are the check-out timings at Le Royal Méridien Chennai, and is a late check-out available?", "answer": "<p>Standard check-out at&nbsp;<strong>Le Royal Méridien Chennai</strong> is at 12:00 noon. Late check-out may be available upon request and is subject to room availability on the day of departure.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 1061, "question": "What is the official alcohol policy at Le Royal Méridien Chennai for wedding events?", "answer": "<p>As a Marriott International property,<strong> Le Royal Méridien</strong> operates a licensed in-house bar and beverage service, and all alcohol consumed on the premises at events must be sourced through the hotel. These drinks will be charged separately.&nbsp;</p>"}]', '90', '240'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'chennai' AND `slug` = 'le-royal-meridien-chennai');
