SELECT 'chennai', 'novotel-chennai-omr', 'published', 'Novotel Chennai OMR –  Banquets & Wedding Cost and Reviews', 'Novotel Chennai OMR offers premium banquet halls & tailored wedding packages. Check wedding costs, guest reviews & seamless booking for your wedding day.', 'novotel chennai omr reviews​, hotel novotel omr chennai​, novotel, chennai omr banquet hall, novotel chennai omr buffet', '/storage/hotels/thumbnails/vk4avVrQgSdUjHv9cYTMcYiMLII9sGt2Jg64JmZk.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/01D3SFrYm8jqjpegx37DPbTjzZ1t2h2slOaWTrPV.jpg', 'Novotel Chennai OMR', 'It Expressway, opp. Elcot Sez, Sholinganallur, Chennai, Tamil Nadu 600119, India', '50 Minutes', '60 Minutes', '<p>Set along Chennai’s OMR IT Expressway,&nbsp;<strong>Novotel Chennai OMR</strong> feels like a calm 3-acre 5-star urban resort property designed for modern celebrations. Its glass-lined architecture, soft lighting and open green pockets create a refreshing contrast to the surrounding tech corridor, making it a relaxed choice for a<strong> wedding in Chennai</strong> where guests can stay, celebrate and unwind in one place.</p><p>At&nbsp;<strong>Novotel Chennai OMR</strong>,&nbsp;<strong>weddings&nbsp;</strong>flow across over 3,000 sq metres of versatile banqueting space, including the pillarless Cappuccino Ballroom and expansive poolside lawns. The design leans contemporary with clean lines, marble textures and warm ambient tones, allowing décor themes to truly stand out without visual clutter. Well connected to the Chennai International Airport and ECR beaches, just a short drive away, it offers strong connectivity while still feeling like a resort escape within the city.</p><p>Guests can settle into modern, tech-enabled rooms at Novotel Chennai OMR, enjoy global dining at The Square or unwind at NICO Asian Bar without stepping outside the property. Nearby attractions like Marina Mall, VGP Universal Kingdom and coastal stretches along ECR add easy leisure options, making it a well-rounded destination for a&nbsp;<strong>wedding at Novotel Chennai OMR</strong>, where everything feels close, convenient and thoughtfully connected.</p>', '156 rooms with suites', 'The Grand Ballroom, Espresso Mini Hall', 'Lawn & Poolside Gardens', '350', '350', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/aIhXJfEuv1mw6MNPTwOx5rKQWSNU0DGO5iTd0wQ1.jpg", "title": "2+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/FB6ZpOGU7TOzVhjltygS7XjBcLTCRibv3msrpygG.jpg", "title": "Private poolside candlelit dining"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/zGYa2XtPJgRRGptSvG2AeFvJhvlOMq80PJkybWpV.jpg", "title": "Resort-style Sunday brunch indulgence"}]', '[{"id": 1037, "question": "Can I host a pre-wedding photoshoot at Novotel Chennai OMR?", "answer": "<p>Yes, photographers can use hotel spaces at&nbsp;<strong>Novotel Chennai OMR</strong> for pre-wedding shoots, subject to prior approval, availability and applicable hotel charges and permits.</p>"}, {"id": 1038, "question": "What are the standard check-in and check-out times at Novotel Chennai OMR, and is early check-in possible?", "answer": "<p>The standard time to check-in at&nbsp;<strong>Novotel Chennai OMR&nbsp;</strong>is 2:00 pm, and check-out is by 12:00 noon. An early check-in can be accommodated; however, it is subject to hotel availability.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 1039, "question": "Is outside catering allowed at Novotel Chennai OMR?", "answer": "<p>At&nbsp;<strong>Novotel Chennai OMR,&nbsp;</strong>outside catering is generally not permitted, as the hotel prefers to manage all food and beverage in-house for consistency and quality. For details on the&nbsp;<strong>Novotel Chennai OMR buffet price</strong>, it’s best to check directly with the hotel, as menus and pricing are customised based on event requirements and guest count.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 1040, "question": "Which months are most popular for weddings at Novotel Chennai OMR, and how early should I secure a booking?", "answer": "<p>The busiest times of year for weddings at&nbsp;<strong>Novotel Chennai OMR&nbsp;</strong>are usually November through February, with another busy period during auspicious dates from April to June. The most popular weekends fill up rapidly, so reservations should be made at least 12 to 18 months in advance.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 1041, "question": "Does Novotel Chennai OMR provide a bar service for weddings?", "answer": "<p>At&nbsp;<strong>Novotel Chennai OMR</strong>, bar service is offered in-house for weddings, with no outside alcohol permitted and beverages billed separately from standard wedding packages.</p>"}]', '291', '156'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'chennai' AND `slug` = 'novotel-chennai-omr');
