SELECT 'chennai', 'taj-club-house-chennai', 'published', 'Taj Club House Chennai Wedding Cost & Banquet Hall Info', 'Planning a wedding or event in Chennai? Taj Club House provides premium banquet halls, wedding packages & competitive costs. Get all details & Book now!', 'taj club house chennai dinner buffet price, taj club house hotel booking​, taj club house chennai​ wedding, taj club house chennai​ wedding cost, taj club house chennai banquet hall', '/storage/hotel/seo/HhHDYgmyzrrFTMA6UgtHcutcvdhTVnqOeupRH6sQ.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/1YGqQQRJ6uhUvVmqE9hLcUIsIVFW65GudAnhD83j.jpg', 'Taj Club House Chennai', '2, Club House Rd, near Bank of Baroda, Express Estate, Royapettah, Chennai, Tamil Nadu 600002, India', '45 Minutes', '10 minutes', '<p>Blue-glass curves, dramatic lighting and a buzzing rooftop atmosphere give a&nbsp;<strong>wedding at Taj Club House, Chennai,&nbsp;</strong>a very different personality from Chennai’s traditional luxury venues. This 5-star luxury hotel property in the heart of the city feels youthful and unmistakably metropolitan. From the moment guests step into its soaring sunlit atrium, the hotel carries the energy of a modern social hub designed for cocktail evenings, intimate wedding functions and glamorous celebrations that flow from indoors to rooftop spaces.</p><p>For couples planning a contemporary&nbsp;<strong>wedding in Chennai, Taj Club House</strong> balances convenience with a strong lifestyle appeal. Located near Anna Salai and only a short drive from Chennai International Airport, the hotel also offers seamless access to Thousand Lights Metro Station, Chennai Central and key city landmarks. The Summit Hall and poolside venues together offer nearly 650 sq. metres of celebration space suited for sangeets, receptions and close-knit wedding gatherings.</p><p>At&nbsp;<strong>Taj Club House, Chennai,</strong> the experience extends beyond the wedding functions themselves. Guests can unwind with rooftop cocktails, curated dining experiences, spa treatments and city-view stays between celebrations. Marina Beach, Express Avenue Mall, Spencer Plaza and Kapaleeshwarar Temple are all easily accessible for guests looking to explore Chennai during the wedding weekend.</p>', '220 rooms with 16 suites', 'Tango Hall, Summit Banquet Hall', 'The Poolside Deck', '500', '500', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/qDgmkZpTHjqAIgviCoQ4xKXKcFsFgdJ8cLirRKus.jpg", "title": "4+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/X4KNEa2EbaAGJHlbXjYXePdwtGPiViDoGW8TkNfO.jpg", "title": "Intimate rooftop cocktails and dining"}]', '[{"id": 982, "question": "Can I host a pre-wedding photoshoot at Taj Club House, Chennai?", "answer": "<p>Yes, pre-wedding photoshoots can usually be arranged at the&nbsp;<strong>Taj Club House, Chennai,&nbsp;</strong>with prior approval. Charges, timings and permissions depend on hotel availability and guidelines.</p>"}, {"id": 983, "question": "What is the standard time to check-in and check-out at Taj Club House, Chennai, and can guests get an early check-in?", "answer": "<p>The standard time to check-in at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Club House, Chennai&nbsp;</strong>is 2:00 pm, and the check-out time is 12:00 noon. Yes, guests can be accommodated with an early check-in to the hotel; it is entirely subject to hotel availability.</p>"}, {"id": 984, "question": "How much can I save if I make a booking at Taj Club House, Chennai, through Viraaya Weddings?", "answer": "<p><strong>Booking the Taj Club House, Chennai</strong>, through Viraaya Weddings can help couples get access to negotiated rates and added wedding benefits. Savings can often range between 10-15%, depending on dates and requirements.</p>"}, {"id": 985, "question": "Are there suggested excursions or experiences near the Taj Club House, Chennai?", "answer": "<p>Guests staying at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Club House, Chennai,</strong> can explore Marina Beach, Fort St. George, Kapaleeshwarar Temple, Government Museum, Express Avenue Mall and Chennai’s lively café scene nearby. Evening cultural performances and local South Indian dining spots are also popular experiences around the hotel.</p>"}, {"id": 986, "question": "Does the Taj Club House, Chennai, provide a bar service for weddings?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>Taj Club House, Chennai</strong> usually provides in-house bar service for weddings and celebrations. Outside alcohol is generally not permitted, and beverages are billed separately from wedding packages.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '292', '220'
