SELECT 'chennai', 'taj-connemara-chennai', 'published', 'Taj Connemara Chennai - Wedding Booking, Buffet & Best Rates', 'Taj Connemara Chennai offers iconic heritage charm with world-class weddings. Get wedding cost, verified reviews & best room rates. Book your package now!', 'taj connemara wedding, taj connemara chennai booking, taj connemara chennai dinner buffet price, taj connemara chennai buffet, taj connemara chennai best rates', '/storage/hotel/seo/OwP3ZsJitJ6IKak2jn8KdqTfkPK8kh5Aa98gYlkP.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/UgP9rV7mtNTVPhZLveFiL96h01u7ynRQIw1zLUgT.jpg', 'Taj Connemara Chennai', 'Binny Rd, Anna Salai, Chennai, Tamil Nadu 600002, India', '45 Minutes', '15 Minutes', '<p><strong>Taj Connemara, Chennai,&nbsp;</strong>feels like a place where time slows down, letting you settle in and de-escalate the pace of your wedding ceremonies. Once a garden house in 1799, it grew into one of South India’s earliest luxury hotels and now stands as its oldest operating luxury property. Ivory façades, rain-tree courtyards and warm heritage interiors give it a lived-in charm, with colonial and Art Deco details that feel naturally integrated.</p><p><strong>Weddings at Taj Connemara, Chennai,</strong> move through spaces that already feel storied on their own. Rain-tree courtyards soften the light, long corridors in ivory tones slow everything down, and the Connemara Ballroom brings a kind of old-world drama without trying too hard. Across its heritage acres, British colonial architecture blends into Geoffrey Bawa’s tropical modern poolside design, creating a setting that feels layered, lived-in and unmistakably Chennai. It’s a backdrop that naturally suits a&nbsp;<strong>wedding at Taj Connemara Chennai</strong> and a meaningful&nbsp;<strong>wedding in Chennai</strong>.</p><p>What makes a stay at Taj Connemara, Chennai, so memorable is how naturally everything settles into place. Dining feels unhurried, service is attentive without ever being intrusive and Taj hospitality just never seems to falter. For couples, celebrations at this 5-star property gently shift from planned events into lived moments that feel personal and quietly unforgettable.</p>', '134 rooms with 13 suites', 'Arcot Room, Wallajah Room, Binny Room, Ballroom', 'Outdoor Terrace, The Poolside Deck', '350', '350', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/RyVaDZ1S8EceOOER595L4Nn6QfyCH1cRynfO490i.jpg", "title": "3+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/7Q1lOIIrYG8YLPBT2DYq5ocSe88ctw3GtR8lOqvL.jpg", "title": "Traditional afternoon tea experience"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/PtTmwhfVQKKpogtxstqaSGq63SpFoLXNaLBap7wy.jpg", "title": "Starlit poolside private dining"}]', '[{"id": 1032, "question": "Can I host a pre-wedding photoshoot at Taj Connemara, Chennai?", "answer": "<p>Pre-wedding photoshoots at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Connemara, Chennai,</strong> can usually be arranged with prior hotel approval, depending on availability, timing and applicable guidelines.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 1033, "question": "What are the standard times to check-in and check-out at Taj Connemara, Chennai, and is early check-in possible?", "answer": "<p>Guests can check-in at<strong> Taj Connemara, Chennai,</strong> from 2:00 pm and check-out by 12:00 noon. An early check-in facility can be arranged; however, it is entirely subject to hotel availability.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 1034, "question": "Are there nearby attractions or activities for international guests around the Taj Connemara Hotel in Chennai?", "answer": "<p>Guests staying at the&nbsp;<strong>Taj Connemara Hotel, Chennai,&nbsp;</strong>can easily explore Marina Beach, Kapaleeshwarar Temple, San Thome Basilica, Fort St George and the Government Museum in Egmore nearby. Many also enjoy heritage walks around Anna Salai, sunset visits to Elliot’s Beach in Besant Nagar and café hopping in the historic neighbourhoods close to the hotel.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 1035, "question": "Are there vendor restrictions for a destination wedding at Taj Connemara Chennai?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>Taj Connemara Chennai</strong> usually allows external vendors for destination weddings. All planners, decorators and services must be coordinated and approved in advance with the hotel management.</p>"}, {"id": 1036, "question": "Does Taj Connemara, Chennai, provide a bar service for weddings?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>Taj Connemara, Chennai,&nbsp;</strong>provides a bar service for weddings, but it is managed entirely in-house. Outside alcohol is generally not permitted, and all beverages are charged separate from wedding packages.</p>"}]', '289', '147'
