SELECT 'chennai', 'the-leela-palace-chennai', 'published', 'The Leela Palace Chennai Wedding Cost & Packages', 'The Leela Palace Chennai wedding cost, banquet hall price, marriage hall rent & packages. Book your luxury wedding venue with pricing & premium service.', 'the leela palace chennai wedding cost, the leela palace chennai wedding package, the leela palace chennai review, the leela palace chennai buffet price, the leela palace chennai marriage hall, the leela palace chennai banquet hall price', '/storage/hotel/seo/FlaxkQZiyEjakYxEgWL4tOuRGICOhSA5I6Ia8rze.png', '/storage/hotels/banners/dmSBWdMprO8zHxNYqqguBUAI0LJWRYdWPf8baQ8l.jpg', 'The Leela Palace Chennai', 'Adyar Sea Face, Leela Palace Rd, MRC Nagar, Raja Annamalaipuram, Chennai, Tamil Nadu 600028, India', '30 minutes', '15 minutes', '<p><strong>The Leela Palace Chennai</strong> holds a distinction that no other luxury hotel in the city can claim: it is Chennai''s only seafront palace hotel. Its architecture draws from the Chettinad tradition, one of Tamil Nadu''s most celebrated design legacies. Multiple dining addresses are present on the property: China XO for Cantonese and Sichuan, Jamavar for contemporary Indian cuisine, Spectra for multicuisine dining and Library Blu for cocktails and conversation.</p><p><strong>The Leela Palace Chennai&nbsp;</strong>brings together two landmark ballrooms and a suite of supporting event spaces to accommodate weddings. The Grand Ballroom, spanning 12,300 sq ft with a soaring 20-foot ceiling, is the hotel''s principal wedding stage. A procession-assembly area on a private road allows uninterrupted baraat arrivals, while a large open terrace is available for the vedi and other outdoor ceremonial requirements.</p>', '325 rooms with suites', 'Grand Ballroom, Royal Ballroom', 'Na', '650', '650', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/MxGmtvJu3iZJyqj8bexA2vHpfEbbICoxsGuneac9.jpg", "title": "6 bespoke dining and bar destinations"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/G2QOuk3nxlVeXuu4sRmNir66Euxvzow8kbGVJ8bK.jpg", "title": "Personal butler for wedding couples"}]', '[{"id": 1052, "question": "What is the nearest airport to The Leela Palace Chennai?", "answer": "<p>The nearest airport to&nbsp;<strong>The Leela Palace Chennai</strong> is Chennai International Airport (also known as Meenambakkam Airport), located approximately 20 kilometres from the hotel''s MRC Nagar address. The drive takes around 30 to 45 minutes, depending on traffic conditions.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 1053, "question": "What is the peak wedding season at The Leela Palace Chennai?", "answer": "<p>The peak wedding season at The Leela Palace Chennai runs from November to February, coinciding with Chennai''s cooler and more temperate months.</p>"}, {"id": 1054, "question": "What are the check-in and check-out timings at The Leela Palace Chennai, and are there any privileges for wedding guests?", "answer": "<p>Standard check-in at&nbsp;<strong>The Leela Palace Chennai&nbsp;</strong>is at 2:00 PM, and check-out is at 12:00 noon. Wedding guests and the bridal party requiring early check-in or late check-out may request these arrangements through The Leela Palace Chennai''s wedding coordinator, subject to room availability on the relevant dates.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 1055, "question": "Are there any restrictions on music for wedding events at The Leela Palace Chennai?", "answer": "<p>Music, including live performances, DJ sets and choreographed entertainment, is permitted at&nbsp;<strong>The Leela Palace Chenna</strong>i for wedding events within the hotel''s designated indoor venues. The Grand Ballroom and Royal Ballroom are equipped to support a full range of entertainment arrangements. Music in outdoor areas is subject to the hotel''s operational guidelines and applicable local noise regulations.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 1056, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol for wedding events at The Leela Palace Chennai?", "answer": "<p><strong>The Leela Palace Chennai</strong> does not allow outside liquor on its property. You will have to purchase all bottles and cocktails from the hotel’s licensed bars and restaurants. These will be billed separately from your wedding package.&nbsp;</p>"}]', '88', '325'
