SELECT 'daman', 'praveg-lake-resort-daman', 'published', 'Praveg Lake Resort Daman – Wedding Cost & Event Packages', 'Praveg Lake Resort Daman offers scenic lakeside wedding venues & personalised packages. Discover cost guides, guest reviews & direct booking for your day.', 'Praveg Lake Resort Daman wedding, Praveg Lake Resort Daman wedding cost, Praveg Lake Resort Daman, Praveg Lake Resort Daman wedding packages', '/storage/hotel/seo/07adMCj5HhoN0RhOotmSNvmSg7CAmPqW8lLmDvZp.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/wwu3a6HGNQXn3VLHE3jVO2z5yunLrcUKLNcVubAD.jpg', 'Praveg Lake Resort Daman', 'Damanganga Garden, Daman -3, nearby Kachigam, Talab, Kachigam, Daman, Dadra and Nagar Haveli and Daman and Diu 396210, India', '150 Minutes', '35 Minutes', '<p>At&nbsp;<strong>Praveg Lake Resort, Daman</strong>, the first impression is shaped more by its setting than anything else, with low-rise cottages and timber walkways sitting gently across nearly 22 acres of landscaped island terrain. This newly opened 5-star luxury hotel property in Kachigam is built around a private lake where water, greenery and architecture come together in a very natural way. About 2 to 3 hours from Mumbai via NH48 and close to Vapi station, it offers the feel of a&nbsp;<strong>wedding in Daman &amp; Diu</strong> that is peaceful yet still easy to reach.</p><p>Inside&nbsp;<strong>Praveg Lake Resort, Daman</strong>, the design stays open and closely connected to its natural surroundings. The amphitheatre, around 900 to 1,000 sq metres in size, is well-suited for daytime celebrations like haldi and mehendi, while the indoor banquet hall provides a more private option for smaller gatherings. The layout is planned in a way that allows guests to move easily between water-facing decks, gardens and covered areas, with the lake remaining visible throughout and shaping the overall experience.</p><p>What defines&nbsp;<strong>Praveg Lake Resort, Daman</strong> is not scale alone but how the environment slows down time. Between ceremonies, guests often explore Devka Beach, Jampore Beach and Moti Daman Fort, then return to a resort that feels quiet, self-contained and designed for multi-day celebrations that feel unhurried and easy to settle into.</p>', '50 rooms with suites', 'Banquet Hall', 'Amphitheatre, Wedding Venue', '150', '50', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/9hzHVZsw9Yk9K3dNoIefc5lsP7R2FORdb2VwzlCs.jpg", "title": "2+ dining venues onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/w95RDbjopou7ycXcaVrRIdU7dlJaRLe2WENanuZW.jpg", "title": "Lakeside starlit dining escapes"}]', '[{"id": 1223, "question": "Which months are most popular for weddings at Praveg Lake Resort, Daman?", "answer": "<p>November through February are the most popular wedding months at&nbsp;<strong>Praveg Lake Resort in Daman</strong> because of the chilly weather that is perfect for outdoor events. Since this is the busiest time of year, reservations fill up quickly, and prices are usually higher.</p>"}, {"id": 1224, "question": "Can guests attending a wedding at Praveg Lake Resort, Daman, get an early check-in?", "answer": "<p>Yes, guests can request an early check-in to the hotel, subject to hotel availability. The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Praveg Lake Resort, Daman</strong> is 1:00 pm, and check-out time is 10:30 am.</p>"}, {"id": 1225, "question": "Does Praveg Lake Resort, Daman have salons, laundry service and ironing boards in rooms?", "answer": "<p>At&nbsp;<strong>Praveg Lake Resort, Daman,</strong> laundry and ironing services are available on request, while salon facilities are usually arranged on call, subject to availability.</p>"}, {"id": 1226, "question": "Is there an indoor backup in case of rain at Praveg Lake Resort, Daman?", "answer": "<p>At&nbsp;<strong>Praveg Lake Resort,</strong> indoor banquet spaces or covered setups are usually arranged as a backup in case of rain. The exact plan depends on the size of the event and is finalised with the hotel team.</p>"}, {"id": 1227, "question": "What is the standard liquor policy at Praveg Lake Resort, Daman?", "answer": "<p>At&nbsp;<strong>Praveg Lake Resort,</strong> weddings usually feature an in-house bar service where all beverages are provided and managed by the hotel as per licensing rules. Outside alcohol is not permitted, and bar billing is handled separately from the wedding package.</p>"}]', '302', '50'
