SELECT 'daman', 'silver-waves-resort-and-spa-daman', 'published', 'Silver Waves Beach Resort Daman - Wedding Cost & Stay Info', 'Silver Waves Resort Daman offers beautiful beachside wedding venues. Discover wedding cost, genuine guest reviews & direct booking options. Check out Now!', 'silver waves resort daman wedding, silver waves daman wedding, silver waves beach resort daman wedding, silver waves beach resort daman wedding cost, silver waves resort daman booking', '/storage/hotel/seo/ZCE2jsUvTuzKf2daZHWvAUjZoZtU31s1NuZ4SvvP.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/o3PwqsZA7yPAIzRVAaw2eyQzAJ4SzIzcqkQo97kX.jpg', 'Silver Waves Resort And Spa Daman', 'Survey No 16/1, Devka Road, Katheria, Daman, Marwad, Dadra and Nagar Haveli and Daman and Diu 396210, India', '150 Minutes', '25 Minutes', '<p>Glass-fronted spaces, swaying palms and uninterrupted sea views give&nbsp;<strong>Silver Waves Resort &amp; Spa, Daman</strong> the feeling of a lively coastal escape rather than a typical wedding venue. One moment, you could be taking pheras beside the Arabian Sea, and the next, joining your guests for rooftop cocktails and live music at sunset. Set along the beachfront in Nani Daman, this recently refreshed 5-star resort blends relaxed seaside energy with warm hospitality, making celebrations feel effortlessly festive and personal.</p><p>For couples planning a luxurious&nbsp;<strong>wedding in Daman &amp; Diu</strong>, Silver Waves Resort &amp; Spa offers a beautiful mix of open seaside celebrations and elegant indoor gatherings. The sprawling lawns can host up to 1,000 guests, while the Coral Banquet Hall adds a more refined setting with modern interiors and chandeliers. Palm-lined walkways, sea-facing corners and softly lit spaces across the resort make almost every part of the property feel naturally celebration-ready.</p><p>Stylish ocean-view rooms and private balcony stays at&nbsp;<strong>Silver Waves Resort &amp; Spa, Daman</strong> make the celebration feel like a relaxed coastal holiday for your guests. Between wedding events, they can unwind at the spa, enjoy poolside cocktails or explore nearby spots like Devka Beach and Moti Daman Fort. Located around 12-15 km from Vapi Railway Station, the resort is easily accessible from both Mumbai and Surat.</p>', '84 rooms with suites', 'Coral Banquet Hall', 'Palms Lawns, Poolside Deck, Air Deck Lounge', '200', '200', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/JQyVFKfavGSrgfqkgP4tSUm6tmaj7E0qHeKXtw4R.jpg", "title": "2+ dining venues onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/ZHX9xCPKsSkYEDKDEGiTrjjAcQr35BGtxJlzpF7f.jpg", "title": "Sunset cocktails with live acoustics"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/B9lipyZgRcf7oK0lLcwhIYTg79dCvrxinbLLkm2o.jpg", "title": "Seaside pheras during golden hour"}]', '[{"id": 1243, "question": "Are there any nearby attractions or activities for international guests around Silver Waves Beach Resort in Daman?", "answer": "<p>Yes, guests staying at&nbsp;<strong>Silver Waves Resort &amp; Spa Daman&nbsp;</strong>can explore Devka Beach, Jampore Beach and the historic Portuguese forts and churches nearby. They can also enjoy seafood dining and water activities around Daman’s scenic coastline.</p>"}, {"id": 1244, "question": "What is the standard check-in and check-out time at Silver Waves Resort & Spa Daman, and can I get an early check-in?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Silver Waves Resort &amp; Spa Daman</strong> is 02:30 pm, and check-out time is 10:30 am. Yes, you can request an early check-in; it is entirely subject to availability.</p>"}, {"id": 1245, "question": "Can photographers use hotel spaces at Silver Waves Resort & Spa, Daman, before the wedding day?", "answer": "<p>Yes, pre-wedding photoshoots can generally be arranged at&nbsp;<strong>Silver Waves, Daman,</strong> with prior permission. The beachfront lawns, sea-facing spaces and sunset backdrops make it a lovely setting for wedding photography.</p>"}, {"id": 1246, "question": "What are the timing restrictions for events/music at Silver Waves Resort & Spa Daman?", "answer": "<p>Outdoor music and entertainment at&nbsp;<strong>Silver Waves Resort &amp; Spa, Daman,</strong> is generally allowed until 10:00 pm, as per local regulations. Couples are advised to coordinate event timelines and performances with the hotel in advance.</p>"}, {"id": 1247, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol to Silver Waves Resort & Spa Daman?", "answer": "<p>At&nbsp;<strong>Silver Waves Resort &amp; Spa Daman</strong>, alcoholic beverages are generally managed through the resort’s in-house bar service, as per local licensing guidelines. Outside alcohol is not permitted, and all beverages are usually billed separately from wedding packages.</p>"}]', '301', '84'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'daman' AND `slug` = 'silver-waves-resort-and-spa-daman');
