SELECT 'daman', 'the-deltin-daman', 'published', 'The Deltin Daman – Wedding Cost, Packages & Reviews Details', 'The Deltin Daman offers premium beachside wedding venues & personalised packages. Discover cost guides, guest reviews & booking for your big day. Book!', 'the deltin daman booking, the deltin daman wedding​, the deltin daman wedding​ cost, the deltin daman review, the deltin daman wedding​ packages', '/storage/hotel/seo/s5UouqTGaLNwDkPiqHUviQvNR7ffFrWDe4Qy0Mwy.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/Pe0saYNqf1szOBxgWA0NbxuN2YFCAkQzJX2lI3F3.jpg', 'The Deltin Daman', 'Varkund, Nani Daman, Daman, Dadra & Nagar Haveli and Daman & Diu 396210, India', '150 Minutes', '15 minutes', '<p>A wedding at&nbsp;<strong>The Deltin Hotel, Daman</strong> opens with an atmosphere that feels spacious, breezy and unhurried, where landscaped greens, palm-lined walkways and a wide central pool deck set a relaxed yet celebratory tone. Spread across nearly 10 acres, this 5-star luxury hotel property in Varkund feels like a self-contained destination, ideal for a memorable&nbsp;<strong>wedding in Daman &amp; Diu</strong>. Located around 2.5 to 3 hours from Mumbai via NH48 and close to Vapi station, it offers the ease of a drive-in celebration with a distinct resort escape feel.</p><p>Inside&nbsp;<strong>The Deltin Hotel, Daman</strong>, each space carries its own character without breaking the flow of the celebration. The Grandice Ballroom, spanning approximately 1,300 sq metres, accommodates large gatherings with ease, while themed halls like Hearts and Spades work well for smaller, more personal functions. Outdoors, the lawns and poolside areas become natural settings for haldi ceremonies, cocktails and evening gatherings under open skies.</p><p>What stays with guests at&nbsp;<strong>The Deltin Hotel, Daman</strong> is the ease of switching between celebration and leisure. Devka Beach, Jampore Beach and historic forts are just a short drive away, letting guests step out for a while and return to a setting that feels lively, contained and thoughtfully designed for multi-day weddings.</p>', '176 rooms with suites', 'Grandice Ballroom, Hearts Hall, Spades Hall', 'Poolside Area, Sky Terrace', '400', '400', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/Oe8U4Kt04XoNPU2dvpJ7PE6CNK8BsMCUGWkmNJ4g.jpg", "title": "5+ dining venues onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/9fNapEv7wZ6t3KzI9ER4qNXEtOETlAsQR4OIWnVs.jpg", "title": "Sunken poolside cabana dining"}]', '[{"id": 1258, "question": "Are there any recommended excursions or experiences near The Deltin Hotel in Daman?", "answer": "<p>Guests at&nbsp;<strong>The Deltin Hotel, Daman,&nbsp;</strong>can explore Devka Beach, Jampore Beach, Moti Daman Fort, St Jerome Fort and local seafood shacks, all within a short drive, offering a relaxed coastal experience.</p>"}, {"id": 1259, "question": "What is the standard time to check-in at The Deltin Hotel, Daman, and can guests get an early check-in?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>The Deltin Hotel, Daman</strong> is 3:00 pm, and check-out time is 11:00 am. Subject to availability, guests can be accommodated with an early check-in at the hotel.</p>"}, {"id": 1260, "question": "Are engagement shoots allowed at The Deltin Hotel, Daman?", "answer": "<p>Yes, engagement shoots at&nbsp;<strong>The Deltin Hotel, Daman&nbsp;</strong>are usually allowed, but they require prior approval from the hotel to ensure everything is scheduled smoothly.</p>"}, {"id": 1261, "question": "Is outside catering allowed at The Deltin Hotel, Daman?", "answer": "<p>At&nbsp;<strong>The Deltin Hotel,</strong> outside catering is generally not permitted, as in-house culinary teams manage all event dining. It is best to confirm specific requirements directly with the hotel management.</p>"}, {"id": 1262, "question": "Does The Deltin Hotel, Daman, provide a bar service for weddings?", "answer": "<p>At&nbsp;<strong>The Deltin Hotel, Daman</strong>, an in-house bar is available for weddings, with all beverages served by the hotel in accordance with local licensing rules. Outside alcohol is not allowed, and all beverages are charged separate from wedding packages.</p>"}]', '439', '176'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'daman' AND `slug` = 'the-deltin-daman');
