SELECT 'dehradun', 'hyatt-regency-dehradun-resort-and-spa', 'published', 'Hyatt Regency Dehradun Resort and Spa Wedding Cost', 'Hyatt Regency Dehradun Resort & Spa wedding cost, venue details, packages & booking. Plan a luxury hill destination wedding in Dehradun. Book now today.', 'hyatt regency dehradun wedding, hyatt dehradun wedding, hyatt regency dehradun booking, hyatt regency dehradun resort and spa wedding, hyatt regency dehradun resort and spa wedding cost', '/storage/hotel/seo/cdWmpTOsGGlZ5XCc1YGQJOLsIbRXMmlKW9NBHQC7.png', '/storage/hotels/banners/fMikSVY2QyXwJ6fWlSdgfBeFKLu6UyuZWGip5EI8.jpg', 'Hyatt Regency Dehradun Resort and Spa', 'Forest Edge, Mussoorie Rd, Salan Gaon, Malsi, Dehradun, Danion Ka Danda, Uttarakhand 248009, India', '75 Minutes', '35 Minutes', '<p>When you picture a destination wedding, you probably first think of what surrounds a venue. The Hyatt Regency Degradun delivers spectacularly in this regard. Stretched across 5 acres, the property offers stunning views of the Shivalik foothills and serves as an elegant, comfortable retreat, helping put your guests at ease. The resort’s indoor and outdoor venues, featuring wide lawns and elegant ballrooms, give couples the freedom to plan celebrations exactly as they wish.</p><p>Ceremonies at the resort can be held under open skies or in well-designed halls adjoined by landscaped gardens, letting nature be part of your fairytale story. Hyatt’s dedicated events team works closely with you, customising every detail to your specifications so the experience feels personal and meaningful. Culinary offerings draw on regional favourites and global inspirations, bringing flavours your guests will remember.</p><p>Hospitality at the resort is warm and attentive, welcoming families from across India and beyond with genuine care. National and international guests praise their impeccable services, making the stay feel special and worthwhile.&nbsp;</p>', '239 rooms with 24 suites', 'Regency Ballroom, Pre-Function Area, Pinnacle Lounge, The Studios', 'Vista Lawns, Regency Lawns', '550', '550', '[{"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal02.png", "title": "5+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal03.png", "title": "Devbhoomi wedding helicopter ride experience"}, {"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal04.png", "title": "Riverside picnic and cooking activity"}]', '[{"id": 119, "question": "How much does a destination wedding at Hyatt Regency Dehradun Resort and Spa cost?", "answer": "<p>For a <strong>Hyatt Regency Dehradun Resort and Spa wedding,</strong> the average cost ranges from INR 1.4 to 1.8 Cr for a 3-day, 2-night wedding celebration. To get an exact quote, enter your preferred dates, room requirements, guest capacity and other important details in Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator. Instantly, you will be able to get a precise estimate for your wedding budget.</p>"}, {"id": 120, "question": "Can photographers use hotel spaces at Hyatt Regency Dehradun Resort and Spa before the wedding day?", "answer": "<p>Yes, the wedding couple can use the hotel spaces before the wedding day for a pre-wedding photoshoot. However, it is recommended to contact the hotel authorities in advance to obtain details on the hotel''s policies, additional costs, booking procedures, available rooms, etc.</p>"}, {"id": 121, "question": "How does the Hyatt Regency Dehradun Resort and Spa compare to the JW Marriott Mussoorie Walnut Grove Resort & Spa?", "answer": "<p>With 115 rooms and a stunning mountain-facing design, JW Marriott Mussoorie Walnut Grove Resort &amp; Spa is ideal for luxury weddings, with budgets between INR 90 lakhs and INR 1.35 Cr. It is a 2–2.5-hour drive from the city. Hyatt Regency offers 263 rooms, easier 1-hour access from the airport, and a modern resort style at a more affordable range of INR 1.4 to 1.8 Cr. Choose Hyatt for convenience and bigger capacity, or JW Marriott for its breathtaking setting and exclusive, high-end experience.</p>"}, {"id": 122, "question": "What is the check-in time at Hyatt Regency Dehradun Resort and Spa, and can we check-in early?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at Hyatt Regency Dehradun Resort and Spa is by 3:00 pm, and guests can check out by 12:00 noon. If required, guests can ask for an early check-in. Requests are accommodated subject to hotel availability.</p>"}, {"id": 123, "question": "Does the Hyatt Regency Dehradun Resort and Spa provide a bar service for weddings?", "answer": "<p>Yes, Hyatt Regency Dehradun Resort &amp; Spa offers alcoholic beverages. However, bringing alcohol from outside the hotel premises is not allowed. All beverages and drinks must be purchased from the hotel. Please note that beverages are charged separately, based on consumption, and are usually not part of the standard wedding package.</p>"}]', '67', '263'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'dehradun' AND `slug` = 'hyatt-regency-dehradun-resort-and-spa');
