SELECT 'dehradun', 'le-meridien-dehradun-resort-and-spa', 'published', 'Le Meridien Dehradun Wedding Price & Resort Packages', 'Experience Le Meridien Dehradun with premium resort & spa comfort and le meridien dehradun wedding price offers. Contact us today now!', 'le meridien dehradun resort & spa, le méridien dehradun wedding , le méridien dehradun wedding cost, le meridien dehradun wedding price', '/storage/hotel/seo/LuJ0d9EyIaZfg1rgbwHBFl3YIxCaPfN8JTF8x0tW.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/AAnj3gq3YAE3xQy2BmCIh8uy8rOtSoc9Qq8eeVdY.jpg', 'Le Meridien Dehradun Resort And Spa', 'Santladevi Resorts, Mauja Galjwadi, Khabarwala, Santla Devi Mandir Marg, Dehradun, Uttarakhand 248141, India', '120 Minutes', '45 Minutes', '<p>Relatively new to the region,&nbsp;<strong>Le Méridien Dehradun Resort &amp; Spa''s wedding</strong> celebrations carry a fresh, contemporary energy that sets it apart from older hill properties. The design takes cues from the iconic arches of the Forest Research Institute, reworked into a cleaner, more modern aesthetic, featuring wide, open spaces and large windows that offer breathtaking hillside and river views.</p><p>For a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Dehradun</strong>, the layout of the property completely works in your favour. The Shivalik Grand Ballroom anchors larger functions, while the lawns and riverside areas open up for ceremonies that feel more scenic and relaxed. Each function can take on a different setting without feeling disconnected.</p><p>With premium accommodations and Marriott’s impeccable hospitality, the stay experience remains organised throughout. A dedicated team manages timelines, coordination and transitions between events smoothly, so the celebration feels well-paced and thoughtfully put together.</p>', '104', 'Shivalik Grand Ballroom, Serene Ballroom', 'Shivalik Grand Lawn, Serene Lawn', '210', '250', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/viserSRNNzoHu1EYuCgJMp4nFdNFg8Z568cOO2AT.jpg", "title": "3+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/PlwCDM9YU4xLNDoKUqDVFEpXmTjviSKTNe2ASqN9.jpg", "title": "Santala Devi Temple scenic hike"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/mDhwsh9HWM9v8pGpV9sSZSHvEiPRrJxmo1umqjFV.jpg", "title": "Himalayan uplands nature experience"}]', '[{"id": 577, "question": "How much does a Le Méridien Dehradun Resort & Spa wedding cost?", "answer": "<p>The average budget for a&nbsp;<strong>Le Méridien Dehradun Resort &amp; Spa wedding</strong> ranges from INR 80 lakhs to INR 1 Cr for a 3-day, 2-night celebration. To get a precise estimate on the wedding budget, you can use Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator. Enter your room requirements, total guest count, preferred dates of stay, etc, to get an exact quote within seconds.</p>"}, {"id": 578, "question": "Can I host a pre-wedding photoshoot at the Le Méridien Dehradun Resort & Spa?", "answer": "<p>Yes, Le Méridien Dehradun Resort &amp; Spa offers a comprehensive wedding package that includes a pre-wedding photoshoot. Contact the hotel authorities beforehand to get an idea of pricing, required permits, available spaces for photoshoots, etc.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 579, "question": "Should I choose Le Méridien Dehradun Resort & Spa or Taj Mussoorie Foothills, Dehradun?", "answer": "<p>Choose Le Méridien Dehradun Resort &amp; Spa for a slightly lower wedding budget between INR 80 lakhs and 1 Cr, with 104 rooms and quicker access from Jolly Grant Airport. Opt for Taj Mussoorie Foothills, Dehradun, if you prefer a higher-budget setting (INR 90 lakhs to 1.25 Cr), with 115 rooms, Taj’s signature hospitality and strong connectivity.</p>"}, {"id": 580, "question": "Is early check-in available for wedding guests at Le Méridien Dehradun Resort & Spa?", "answer": "<p>Yes, early-check in at&nbsp;<strong>Le Méridien Dehradun Resort &amp; Spa&nbsp;</strong>is subject to availability. As per the hotel policy, the standard check-in time is by 3:00 pm, and check-out is by 12:00 noon.</p>"}, {"id": 581, "question": "What is the liquor policy for destination weddings at Le Méridien Dehradun Resort & Spa?", "answer": "<p>Alcohol is permitted; however, all beverages must be sourced through the hotel. Outside liquor is not allowed and is charged separately based on consumption.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '137', '104'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'dehradun' AND `slug` = 'le-meridien-dehradun-resort-and-spa');
