SELECT 'dehradun', 'taj-mussoorie-foothills-dehradun', 'published', 'Taj Mussoorie Foothills Dehradun Wedding Cost & Booking', 'Discover wedding cost, hill venues & packages at Taj Mussoorie Foothills Dehradun. Plan your dreamy destination wedding surrounded by lush green Himalayan.', 'taj mussoorie foothills dehradun wedding cost, taj mussoorie foothills dehradun wedding, taj mussoorie foothills wedding cost, taj mussoorie foothills', '/storage/hotel/seo/nhcICpd3ixfrh1KS0CjEqoHxiNZ2QoiSvrHASMkb.png', '/storage/hotels/banners/2qgxnNI567exBZj883duzOtAvqcuW5m81Zlf4gVC.jpg', 'Taj Mussoorie Foothills Dehradun', 'Pargana Pachawadoon, Diversion Road, near Max Hospital, Mauza, Malsi, Mussoorie, Dehradun, Uttarakhand 248009, India', '60 Minutes', '20 Minutes', '<p>A&nbsp;<strong>Taj Mussoorie Foothills, Dehradun wedding</strong> unfolds at the point where the city gives way to the hills, creating a setting that feels open, grounded and quietly scenic. The architecture leans towards contemporary, clean lines, expansive glass and wide outdoor spaces that constantly draw the guests’ attention to the surrounding greens and valley views.</p><p>Plan a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Dehradun</strong> at this resort-style property, where each celebration finds its own place. Daytime functions feel open and unhurried on decks and lawns, while golden-hour evenings shift into a more intimate mood, with soft lighting, mountain air and a sense of calm that lingers through every gathering.</p><p>What shapes the experience is the incredible balance that it strikes. The scale comfortably accommodates larger guest lists, yet the flow of spaces and Taj’s intuitive hospitality ensure the wedding never feels overwhelming, instead remaining warm, fluid and thoughtfully paced throughout.</p>', '115', 'Monal Banquet Hall, Antelope, Pre-Function Area', 'The Deck, The Pines, The Woods', '230', '250', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/x5HHaTrZ49vWDUIcD8vI9KA5aR1yqE4apYLzKAwA.jpg", "title": "4+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/HfVamYyM0TW9hkRLFajllCUhO6pJ9m03Q14KYVXP.jpg", "title": "Malsi forest gourmet picnic experience"}]', '[{"id": 549, "question": "What is the cost of a wedding at Taj Mussoorie Foothills, Dehradun?", "answer": "<p>The cost of a<strong> destination wedding at Taj Mussoorie Foothills in Dehradun&nbsp;</strong>ranges from INR 90 lakh to INR 1.25 Cr for 250 guests. To get a closer estimate of the wedding budget for a 3-day, 2-night celebration, you can use Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator to get an instant quote.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 550, "question": "How do guests reach Taj Mussoorie Foothills, Dehradun?", "answer": "<p>The nearest airport to&nbsp;<strong>Taj Mussoorie Foothills</strong> is Jolly Grant Airport (DED), situated about 33–38 km away. The car ride from the airport to the resort takes about 1 hour.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 551, "question": "How does Taj Mussoorie Foothills, Dehradun, compare to The Westin Resort & Spa, Himalayas?", "answer": "<p>Choose<strong> Taj Mussoorie Foothills, Dehradun,&nbsp;</strong>if you’re looking for a more budget-friendly celebration (INR 90 lakh–1.25 Cr) with 115 rooms and about an hour’s drive from the airport. Go with The Westin Resort &amp; Spa, Himalayas if you prefer a larger, more premium 141-room setting, closer to the airport, with a higher INR 2–2.25 Cr budget.</p>"}, {"id": 552, "question": "Is an early check-in facility available at Taj Mussoorie Foothills, Dehradun?", "answer": "<p>Yes, the hotel allows early check-ins, but they are subject to hotel availability. The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Mussoorie Foothills, Dehradun,</strong> is 2:00 pm, and guests can check out by 12:00 noon.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 553, "question": "What is Taj Mussoorie Foothills, Dehradun''s liquor policy for destination weddings?", "answer": "<p>At&nbsp;<strong>Taj Mussoorie Foothills, Dehradun</strong>, alcohol and beverages are managed solely by the hotel. Outside liquor is not allowed on the premises, and all beverages are billed separately based on consumption, as they are not included in standard wedding packages.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '154', '115'
