SELECT 'delhi-ncr', 'andaz-new-delhi', 'published', 'Hyatt Andaz Delhi Aerocity Wedding Cost & Booking', 'Andaz Delhi Aerocity Concept by Hyatt wedding cost, wedding & venue details. Explore Andaz Hotel Delhi Aerocity for your wedding planning. Book Now!', 'andaz delhi aerocity concept by hyatt wedding cost, andaz delhi aerocity concept by hyatt wedding, andaz delhi aerocity concept by hyatt, hyatt andaz delhi, andaz hotel delhi, andaz delhi aerocity', '/storage/hotel/seo/m6ssCF05AOLvXSm9M42sZ4bSq67uZlMXs13ruTfs.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/NfST0A9dlsFaGpEfTB6F9jkeWYapZU2vpmSI34vk.jpg', 'Andaz New delhi', 'Asset No. 1, Aerocity, New Delhi, Delhi 110037, India', '10 Minutes', '45 Minutes', '<p>A&nbsp;<strong>wedding at Andaz Delhi, by Hyatt</strong>, feels very much in sync with the city it sits in. Right in Aerocity, just minutes from the airport, it’s one of those venues where logistics fall into place effortlessly, especially for guests flying in. The hotel leans into a more contemporary, design-led aesthetic, with each room carrying its own artwork inspired by Delhi, which adds a subtle sense of character to the hotel.</p><p>The banquet spaces at&nbsp;<strong>Andaz Delhi, Aerocity,&nbsp;</strong>feel refreshingly modern. The Grand Ballroom is expansive without being overwhelming, while the courtyard suits more social, open gatherings. Hyatt is open to custom menus, bar concepts and styling, so you don’t feel boxed into standard wedding formats. This&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding venue in Delhi&nbsp;</strong>works well for couples who want a celebration that feels deeply personal and thoroughly put together.</p><p>What guests usually notice is how quickly they settle at&nbsp;<strong>Andaz Delhi, by Hyatt</strong>. Hyatt’s service is easygoing yet attentive, so even well-travelled guests feel at ease. Dining experiences excel consistently, and with Aerocity’s cafés just steps away, you’re never short of good places to eat. Between events, guests get to explore the city, so the stay feels more like a short, relaxed break than a busy schedule.</p>', '401', 'The Grand Ballroom, Andaz Ballroom', 'Event Courtyard', '805', '805', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/HGZOnbwHVxOwcdyVxnofR4w5cgP4g0eNX4Tszqhb.jpg", "title": "3+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/bCsJkzAlEmbygb51kOWIHpOAxLaKgpRQ6fhrVMbm.jpg", "title": "Grand baraat entry through courtyard"}]', '[{"id": 298, "question": "How to reach Andaz Delhi, by Hyatt, from the nearest airport?", "answer": "<p>Indira Gandhi International Airport is located about 2-5 km from&nbsp;<strong>Andaz Delhi, by Hyatt</strong>. A car ride from the airport to the hotel takes 8–10 minutes, depending on traffic.</p>"}, {"id": 299, "question": "What is the standard check-in time at Andaz Delhi, by Hyatt, and is early check-in available?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Andaz Delhi, by Hyatt,</strong> is 2:00 pm, and the check-out time is 12:00 noon. Guests can request an early check-in, but accommodation is subject to hotel availability.</p>"}, {"id": 300, "question": "How much can I save if I book the Andaz Delhi by Hyatt through Viraaya Weddings?", "answer": "<p>Booking&nbsp;<strong>Andaz Delhi by Hyatt</strong> through Viraaya Weddings can help you save<strong>&nbsp;</strong>10–15% or more. You also get smoother planning, trusted vendors and better overall coordination.</p>"}, {"id": 301, "question": "Are there any nearby attractions or activities for international guests near Andaz Delhi by Hyatt?", "answer": "<p>Yes, while staying at&nbsp;<strong>Andaz Delhi Aerocity,&nbsp;</strong>guests can explore Qutub Minar, Mehrauli Archaeological Park and Hauz Khas Village. For shopping and dining, DLF Emporio and Worldmark Aerocity are close by.</p>"}, {"id": 302, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol to Andaz Delhi, by Hyatt, for a destination wedding?", "answer": "<p>No, you can’t bring your own alcohol to&nbsp;<strong>Andaz Delhi, by Hyatt.</strong> The hotel provides its own bar service, with all beverages arranged in-house and charged separately.</p>"}]', '230', '401'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'delhi-ncr' AND `slug` = 'andaz-new-delhi');
--> statement-breakpoint
