SELECT 'delhi-ncr', 'courtyard-by-marriott-aravali-resort-delhi-ncr', 'published', 'Courtyard By Marriott Aravali Resort Gurgaon Wedding Cost', 'Check Courtyard by Marriott Aravali Resort Gurgaon wedding packages, luxury hospitality, décor, catering services & unforgettable wedding experiences.', 'Courtyard By Marriott Aravali Resort Gurgaon wedding, Courtyard By Marriott Aravali Resort Gurgaon wedding cost, Courtyard By Marriott Aravali Resort Gurgaon', '/storage/hotel/seo/Gx9qytJ6lajrFBvk0OTD0Y3JzolWsbxmLB7ze4qa.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/4I1C7YSFLQoPwAuq5Vzd1eYjnB5PkWy3HgEggegN.jpg', 'Courtyard by Marriott Aravali Resort Delhi Ncr', '1, Pakhal, Faridabad, Gothda Mohbtabad, Haryana 121004, India', '60 Minutes', '45 Minutes', '<p>Recently rebranded from Courtyard by Marriott Aravali Resort, Gurgaon,&nbsp;<strong>Aravali Marriott Resort &amp; Spa, Delhi NCR</strong> sits right by the Aravalli Hills. This resort property is just far enough from the city to feel like a proper break. The drive from Delhi is straightforward, which makes arrivals easy for guests. Once you’re in, it feels greener, quieter, and a lot more open than you’d expect this close to NCR.</p><p>Weddings here don’t feel staged. One function spills into the next, from the lawn in the evening to a quieter indoor dinner later, without needing a big shift in the staging area.&nbsp;<strong>Aravali Marriott Resort &amp; Spa, Delhi NCR,</strong> is home to an expansive ballroom and expansive lawns, enveloped by lush greenery and well- lit to keep things warm as the day turns into night.</p><p>The stay at this Marriott property is just as easy to settle into. Rooms are spacious, hospitality is generous and guests quickly find themselves at ease. Dining experiences are well-planned and consistently good, and between events, people usually drift between the pool, their rooms and onto the next celebration without feeling rushed.</p>', '158', 'Sapphire Ballroom, Pre-Function Areas', 'Sapphire Lawn, Patio', '340', '340', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/4G4Ak8LTP1I7tSh4sYtY54OaqTbY7j0HIcMy8tBZ.jpg", "title": "3+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/8jQEacLLJG424wQEtZRAhxP2fpauM9d9fV9UTQSn.jpg", "title": "Historic palace excursion experience"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/sIAtNWxQmr8DgaYb3L7xQdodieatbCqBCfnN7wfp.jpg", "title": "Alfresco Aravali dining indulgence"}]', '[{"id": 323, "question": "Which is the nearest airport to Aravali Marriott Resort & Spa, Delhi NCR?", "answer": "<p>Indira Gandhi International Airport (DEL) is about 36-40 km away from&nbsp;<strong>Aravali Marriott Resort &amp; Spa, Delhi NCR</strong>. A car ride from the airport to the resort usually takes 45 to 60 minutes by road, depending on traffic conditions.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 324, "question": "What are the standard check-in and check-out times at Aravali Marriott Resort & Spa, Delhi NCR, and is early check-in available?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Aravali Marriott Resort &amp; Spa, Delhi NCR,</strong> is 3:00 pm, and check-out time is at 12:00 noon. Yes, an early check-in can be arranged, but availability is subject to change.</p>"}, {"id": 325, "question": "Can guests explore local sights during their stay at Aravali Marriott Resort & Spa, Delhi NCR?", "answer": "<p>Guests can visit the nearby Raja Nahar Singh Palace, Surajkund and Badkhal Lake. For a longer outing, Damdama Lake or Asola Bhatti Wildlife Sanctuary makes for an easy half-day trip.</p>"}, {"id": 326, "question": "How much can I save if I book the Aravali Marriott Resort & Spa, Delhi NCR through Viraaya Weddings?", "answer": "<p>Booking&nbsp;<strong>Aravali Marriott Resort &amp; Spa</strong> through Viraaya Weddings can help you save around 10-15% or more. You also get better coordination, trusted vendors and smoother planning overall.</p>"}, {"id": 327, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol to Aravali Marriott Resort & Spa, Delhi NCR?", "answer": "<p>Outside alcohol isn’t permitted at the property. All beverages are arranged through&nbsp;<strong>Aravali Marriott Resort &amp; Spa, Delhi NCR</strong> and billed separately based on consumption.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '103', '158'
