SELECT 'delhi-ncr', 'grand-hyatt-gurgaon', 'published', 'Grand Hyatt Gurgaon Grand Wedding Cost and Venue Packages', 'Explore Grand Hyatt Gurgaon wedding cost, packages & booking details with luxury venues, premium stays, décor & unforgettable celebration experiences.', 'grand hyatt gurgaon wedding, grand hyatt gurgaon wedding cost, grand hyatt gurgaon wdding price, grand hyatt gurgaon wedding package, grand hyatt gurgaon booking, grand hyatt gurgaon residences', '/storage/hotel/seo/aE0boHJYbLpBNtMfpPCWo9beAx97x382edAO4E5g.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/FxcMHq6E25P58eoQrlJN36MdxiThWimY9NKvCpVo.jpg', 'Grand Hyatt Gurgaon', 'Golf Course Ext Rd, Sector 58, Gurugram, Ghata, Haryana 122098, India', '40 Minutes', '70 Minutes', '<p>If your idea of a wedding is less palace nostalgia and more champagne towers, skyline views and after-parties that stretch past midnight, a&nbsp;<strong>wedding at Grand Hyatt Gurgaon</strong> fits that mood instantly. The hotel has a distinctly modern personality that stands out in the&nbsp;<strong>Delhi NCR wedding&nbsp;</strong>scene. Designed by Foster + Partners and spread across a massive lifestyle precinct on Golf Course Extension Road,&nbsp;<strong>Grand Hyatt Hotel Gurgaon</strong> replaces heavy ornamentation with soaring glass walls, contemporary textures and dramatic open spaces that feel effortlessly international.</p><p>A&nbsp;<strong>wedding in Gurgaon</strong>&nbsp;<strong>at Grand Hyatt</strong> moves with a different kind of energy. Guests drift from sunlit terrace celebrations to immersive ballroom receptions without ever feeling confined to one part of the hotel. The Grand Ballroom feels especially impressive because of its scale and clean architectural design, allowing décor and lighting to take the centre stage. Since the property opened recently, everything still feels polished, fresh and intentionally built for large-format celebrations. Its location also makes guest logistics easier, with the airport, Cyber City and central Delhi all comfortably accessible.</p><p>What really stays with guests after a&nbsp;<strong>wedding in Delhi NCR</strong> at&nbsp;<strong>Grand Hyatt Gurgaon</strong> is the atmosphere around the celebrations. Some spend evenings over rare whiskies and live jazz at Bar Musui, while others settle into poolside sundowners or long late-night dinners, making the entire wedding weekend feel social, vibrant and genuinely memorable.</p>', '442 rooms with suites', 'The Grand Ballroom, Grand Ballroom Pre-Function Area, Whitehall, Event Villa', 'Terrace Lawns, The Attached Grand Ballroom Terrace', '900', '900', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/FB1dPLB3zMKqtiHbk7uSOIw2WW7HLUfylfYWA303.jpg", "title": "4+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/eFOHpVoXUwGhcZs5gBvLl1bwkT9um0oJ2seEWyUR.jpg", "title": "Sunset cocktails by elevated poolside"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/CVAQ3q5imSBgwOz5GgL6t6f0Ulww8PwhggMAbbQk.jpg", "title": "Private bridal suites beside ballrooms"}]', '[{"id": 937, "question": "Are there nearby attractions or activities for international guests around the Grand Hyatt Gurgaon?", "answer": "<p>Guests staying at&nbsp;<strong>Grand Hyatt Gurgaon</strong> can visit Cyber Hub for dining and nightlife, visit Qutub Minar, shop at Ambience Mall or unwind at Aravalli Biodiversity Park. Delhi landmarks like India Gate and Humayun’s Tomb are also within comfortable driving distance.</p>"}, {"id": 938, "question": "What is the check-in and check-out time at Grand Hyatt Gurgaon, and can guests get an early check-in?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Grand Hyatt Gurgaon</strong> is 2:00 pm, and guests can check out by 12:00 noon. An early check-in facility is available at the hotel, but it can be accommodated subject to hotel availability.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 939, "question": "Is outside catering allowed at Grand Hyatt Gurgaon?", "answer": "<p>No, outside catering is generally not permitted at<strong> Grand Hyatt Gurgaon</strong>. The hotel usually provides all food and beverage services through its in-house culinary team.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 940, "question": "Does Grand Hyatt Hotel Gurgaon have salons, laundry service iron board in rooms?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>Grand Hyatt Gurgaon</strong> offers salon and laundry services for guests. Rooms are also equipped with ironing facilities, though it is best to confirm specific amenities with the hotel.</p>"}, {"id": 941, "question": "What is the standard liquor policy at Grand Hyatt Gurgaon?", "answer": "<p>Outside alcohol is not allowed inside&nbsp;<strong>Grand Hyatt Gurgaon.&nbsp;</strong>All beverages and drinks served in public areas and banquet spaces must be exclusively bought through the hotel. Beverages are charged per consumption, separate from wedding packages.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '270', '442'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'delhi-ncr' AND `slug` = 'grand-hyatt-gurgaon');
