SELECT 'delhi-ncr', 'itc-grand-bharat-delhi-ncr', 'published', 'ITC Grand Bharat Gurgaon Wedding Cost & Resort Offers', 'Experience luxury stays with destination wedding in ITC Grand Bharat and wedding cost details. Book now for unforgettable celebrations today!', 'itc grand bharat gurgaon wedding cost, itc grand bharat wedding cost, itc grand bharat wedding price, itc grand bharat gurgaon wedding, destination wedding in itc grand bharat, weddings at itc grand bharat', '/storage/hotel/seo/bR98pmiZgeEYUHDq1BLpgrN1euFSRHxWZAgiHurZ.png', '/storage/hotels/banners/tNXNRD0sK2azB9cOPMHG9K2eu4A4jMA0qjWg6nS2.jpg', 'ITC Grand Bharat Delhi NCR', 'Hassanpur Tauru, Gurugram, Haryana 122105, India', '60 Minutes', '25 Minutes', '<p>Spread across the lush Aravalli foothills, a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at ITC Grand Bharat, Gurgaon</strong> feels detailed and rooted in Indian heritage. The property has been designed like a modern-day palace. It draws inspiration from intricately built stepwells, temples and royal residences, creating a setting that carries depth without requiring excessive décor.</p><p>The indoor and outdoor venues available at the<strong> ITC Grand Bharat in Gurgaon</strong> give you more options for your wedding festivities. The Prithvi Grand Ballroom is perfect for larger, formal celebrations. Meanwhile, the property’s expansive lawn areas serve as ideal locations for the wedding pheras. The hotel is set on landscaped grounds, which makes it feel quieter and more private, making it perfect for traditional ceremonies.</p><p>Known for its premium stays and thoughtful experiences, guests feel comfortable and well looked after throughout their stay. A dedicated team at ITC pays close attention to detail, ensuring the dining experiences stand out and making each element of a wedding celebration come together with ease.</p>', '104', 'Prithvi Grand Ballroom', 'Vrindavan Lawns, Firdaus Lawns, Shatranj Lawns, Vatika Lawns', '230', '250', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/55nFsIL3jvTgltOzG9i32w0g3yPWe18sNgzIQVVN.jpg", "title": "3+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/knxD0frZe9rDKLpm12g6cIO82OIA0qauEU4CIxC7.jpg", "title": "Private mixology sessions at Peacock Bar"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/eI1tXMWeBHgijWWK3ezyDmkcILxt3S9HxectWm87.jpg", "title": "Romantic gazebo dining by Yamuna Ghats"}]', '[{"id": 574, "question": "How much does an ITC Grand Bharat, Gurgaon wedding cost?", "answer": "<p>A<strong> destination wedding in ITC Grand Bharat, Gurgaon,</strong> falls within a budget of INR 1.8 Cr and INR 2.5 Cr for a 3-day, 2-night celebration, or a full property buyout. Use Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator to get a precise estimate based on your guest count, total number of guests and duration of stay within seconds.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 575, "question": "What is the check-in time at ITC Grand Bharat, Gurgaon, and can we get an early check-in?", "answer": "<p>The check-in time at ITC Grand Bharat, Gurgaon, is by 3:00 pm, and guests can check out by 12:00 noon. Yes, an early check-in facility is available, subject to hotel availability.</p>"}, {"id": 576, "question": "Does ITC Grand Bharat, Gurgaon, provide a bar service for weddings?", "answer": "<p>Alcohol is permitted at ITC Grand Bharat, Gurgaon; however, all beverages must be purchased through the hotel. Outside alcohol is not allowed, and drinks are charged separately based on consumption, as they are not included in wedding packages.</p>"}]', '97', '104'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'delhi-ncr' AND `slug` = 'itc-grand-bharat-delhi-ncr');
