SELECT 'delhi-ncr', 'itc-maurya-a-luxury-collection-hotel-new-delhi', 'published', 'ITC Maurya New Delhi Grand Wedding Cost & Venue Pricing', 'Discover ITC Maurya a Luxury Collection Hotel New Delhi wedding cost, booking, luxury venues, premium stays, catering & elegant celebrations. Book Now!', 'itc maurya delhi wedding cost, itc maurya delhi wedding, itc maurya delhi booking, itc maurya hotel delhi, itc maurya hotel new delhi, itc maurya new delhi', '/storage/hotel/seo/AsQwxLmZ99yMRgCKU7bqZuIftmI9nof32V0JHTlw.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/5rQxcWraNVPU1Qk4O9YGdUxgzwWYhpVlNslmWdpa.jpg', 'ITC Maurya a Luxury Collection Hotel New Delhi', 'ITC MAURYA, Sardar Patel Marg, Akhaura Block, Diplomatic Enclave, Chanakyapuri, New Delhi, Delhi 110021, India', '30 minutes', '35 Minutes', '<p>Some wedding venues impress you with size. A&nbsp;<strong>wedding at ITC Maurya, a Luxury Collection Hotel, New Delhi,</strong> impresses you with its presence. From its stupa-inspired architecture to the towering domes, carved detailing and museum-like interiors, the hotel feels deeply connected to India’s regal past while still carrying the polish of a world-class luxury address. Tucked within the green, secure lanes of Chanakyapuri,&nbsp;<strong>ITC Maurya</strong> instantly feels removed from the rush of the city, which makes every celebration here feel more private and immersive.</p><p>What makes a&nbsp;<strong>wedding in Delhi at ITC Maurya Hotel&nbsp;</strong>truly memorable is the aura it reflects for each function. Morning ceremonies at Nandiya Garden unfold against the backdrop of the Delhi Ridge, while evening celebrations are held in the Kamal Mahal ballroom, within its grand scale and elegant lighting. Between events, guests gather over legendary meals at Bukhara, rooftop dinners at Ottimo and quiet conversations in beautifully designed lounges that make the celebrations feel unhurried and intimate.</p><p><strong>ITC Maurya, a Luxury Collection Hotel, New Delhi,</strong> also understands hospitality in a way few luxury hotels do. The service feels warm without being intrusive, the wedding planning feels seamless and the 437 premium accommodations allow families and guests to settle in comfortably for an entire celebration weekend rather than just a single event.</p>', '437 rooms with suites', 'Kamal Mahal, Sakya Banquet Hall', 'Nandiya Garden', '900', '900', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/FimFl96xPhRuFjCIvD8tIwZN4hnwQXa5GClVtzly.jpg", "title": "9+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/GBGHDq9fCzJPVgPcUqKMo37FELTxHTsp5mObAkPl.jpg", "title": "Romantic rooftop evenings for couples"}]', '[{"id": 947, "question": "When is peak season for weddings at ITC Maurya, a Luxury Collection Hotel, New Delhi?", "answer": "<p>Peak wedding season at&nbsp;<strong>ITC Maurya Hotel, New Delhi</strong>, runs from October to February with pleasant weather and high demand. May to September is quieter, with better availability and lower pricing.</p>"}, {"id": 948, "question": "Is an early check-in allowed at ITC Maurya, a Luxury Collection Hotel, New Delhi?", "answer": "<p>Yes, guests can request an early check-in, but it is subject to hotel availability. The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>ITC Maurya Hotel, Delhi,</strong> is 3:00 pm, and guests can check out by 12:00 noon.</p>"}, {"id": 949, "question": "Are there any special offers for wedding couples at ITC Maurya, a Luxury Collection Hotel, New Delhi?", "answer": "<p><strong>ITC Maurya Hotel, New Delhi,</strong> occasionally offers seasonal wedding packages and curated benefits for couples, depending on the season and celebration scale. You can also explore the latest wedding deals and exclusive offers through Viraaya Weddings.</p>"}, {"id": 950, "question": "Is there an indoor backup at ITC Maurya Delhi in case of rain?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>ITC Maurya Hotel, New Delhi,</strong> hosts guests inside Kamal Mahal and Sakya Banquet Hall in case of rain or unfavourable weather conditions. These venues are located in proximity to one another, making movement from outdoor to indoor venues smooth.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 951, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol to ITC Maurya, a Luxury Collection Hotel, New Delhi?", "answer": "<p>No, outside alcohol is not permitted at the&nbsp;<strong>ITC Maurya Hotel, Delhi</strong>. All alcoholic beverages must be arranged through the hotel and are usually charged separately from wedding packages.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '268', '437'
