SELECT 'delhi-ncr', 'jaypee-greens-golf-and-spa-resort-delhi-ncr', 'published', 'Jaypee Greens Golf & Spa Resort Wedding Cost & Booking', 'Planning a wedding near Delhi NCR? Jaypee Greens Golf & Spa Resort Greater Noida delivers stunning venues, clear wedding cost & luxury spa stays. Book Now!', 'jaypee greens golf & spa resort wedding cost, jaypee greens golf & spa resort wedding, jaypee greens golf & spa resort noida wedding, jaypee greens golf & spa resort, jaypee greens golf and spa resort', '/storage/hotel/seo/S94LpLbTtQ4FgW25LziVVM5NoTxqBzE3GZ8Xv4UH.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/rPXb9JHv4PY0zjKZ7FEZ9MasaIqADpF7banGgkzf.jpg', 'Jaypee Greens Golf And Spa Resort Delhi Ncr', 'G Block, Surajpur Kasna Road, Greater Noida, Uttar Pradesh – 201306, India, India', '90 Minutes', '70 Minutes', '<p>A&nbsp;<strong>wedding at Jaypee Greens Golf &amp; Spa Resort, Greater Noida</strong>, feels like stepping into a private estate rather than a city hotel. Spread across expansive greens with tree-lined avenues and water bodies, the setting brings a sense of calm, which is often rare amidst the buzz of Delhi NCR. The Mediterranean-inspired architecture, high ceilings and open views of the golf course create a space that feels both grand and easy to settle into.</p><p>For couples planning a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Delhi NCR,</strong> this 5-star luxury property’s 452-acre scale is bound to work in your favour. While the Royal Ballroom is renowned for hosting up to 1,100 guests, the Royal Garden opens out to lush greens, making the pheras ceremony feel staged against a natural backdrop. The golden hour hits differently here, with the fairways and lakes turning into a soft, glowing background that needs little to no decor.</p><p>What guests tend to remember about&nbsp;<strong>Jaypee Greens Golf &amp; Spa Resort, Greater Noida,&nbsp;</strong>though, is how comfortable everything feels. Rooms overlook the expansive lawns, dining ranges from indulgent Indian to European cuisines and Jaypee’s hospitality ensures you feel taken care of. It’s the kind of place where celebrations flow smoothly and guests genuinely unwind between functions.</p>', '170', 'Royal Ballroom, Mape, Cedar & Maple Halls', 'Royal Garden', '340', '360', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/wdWv6TL8W6zEKNfXJEBzNUovVf2AeYX55zvYH8nF.jpg", "title": "6+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/MS5Et8FwTXfsMTUBLv9PaJhKfot1PVD8TaZkwcQt.jpg", "title": "Starlit garden dining experiences"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/D1x5AfNM52Kxx2on2kwwCyDKGSBMHt6D8SaL5F7c.jpg", "title": "Royal frontier dining at Paatra"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/xy09Ozk45xBjoXYTkHdzcqFDlJsF3vrqb0qJcjvh.jpg", "title": "Private lakeside pavilion dinners"}]', '[{"id": 631, "question": "How to reach the Jaypee Greens Golf & Spa Resort, Greater Noida, from the nearest airport?", "answer": "<p>Indira Gandhi International Airport is the nearest airport to&nbsp;<strong>Jaypee Greens Golf &amp; Spa Resort, Greater Noida.&nbsp;</strong>It is located around 50 km away, and a car ride takes roughly 1 hour and 15 minutes.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 632, "question": "What is the standard check-in and check-out time at Jaypee Greens Golf & Spa Resort, Greater Noida?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Jaypee Greens Golf &amp; Spa Resort, Greater Noida,</strong> is 3:00 pm, and check-out is at 12:00 noon. Guests can request an early check-in, which can be arranged subject to availability.</p>"}, {"id": 633, "question": "Are there nearby attractions or activities for international guests around Jaypee Greens Golf & Spa Resort, Greater Noida?", "answer": "<p>Yes, guests staying at&nbsp;<strong>Jaypee Greens Golf &amp; Spa Resort in Greater Noida&nbsp;</strong>can visit the Buddh International Circuit, relax at Surajpur Bird Sanctuary or explore The Grand Venice Mall. You can also enjoy golfing within the resort, indulge in spa therapies or indulge in a lakeside dining experience.</p>"}, {"id": 634, "question": "Are drones, fireworks or baraat allowed at Jaypee Greens Golf & Spa Resort, Greater Noida?", "answer": "<p>Baraat entries are usually permitted at&nbsp;<strong>Jaypee Greens Golf &amp; Spa Resort, Greater Noida</strong>. Drone use and fireworks are restricted. Please confirm permissions with the hotel and Viraaya Weddings team in advance.</p>"}, {"id": 635, "question": "Does Jaypee Greens Golf & Spa Resort, Greater Noida, provide a bar service for destination weddings?", "answer": "<p>Yes,<strong> Jaypee Greens Golf &amp; Spa Resort in Greater Noida&nbsp;</strong>provides in-house bar service for weddings. Outside alcohol isn’t permitted, and all beverages are arranged by the hotel and billed separately.</p>"}]', '368', '170'
