SELECT 'delhi-ncr', 'jw-marriott-hotel-new-delhi-aerocity', 'published', 'JW Marriott New Delhi Aerocity Wedding Cost & Booking', 'JW Marriott Hotel New Delhi Aerocity wedding cost, wedding packages, booking & venue details. Plan your wedding at JW Marriott Aerocity New Delhi.', 'jw marriott hotel new delhi aerocity wedding cost, jw marriott hotel new delhi aerocity wedding, jw marriott hotel new delhi aerocity booking, jw marriott hotel new delhi aerocity wedding packages, jw marriott hotel new delhi aerocity aerocity new delhi delhi', '/storage/hotel/seo/qNTzKdovz4fOVlUfGvgAC4uwK3jY09eUSePpsle1.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/ex7jlxSjhddkl0PcoZsMSlk7BZcquv3VNi6ppOmc.jpg', 'JW Marriott Hotel New Delhi Aerocity', 'Asset Area 4, Hospitality District, Aerocity, New Delhi, Delhi 110037, India, India', '10 Minutes', '40 Minutes', '<p>A&nbsp;<strong>wedding at JW Marriott Hotel New Delhi Aerocity</strong> feels seamless right from the start. Set in the heart of Aerocity, just minutes from the airport, it’s one of those venues where guests arrive without stress and settle in quickly. This 5-star property carries a polished, contemporary feel, with expansive interiors, marble finishes and spacious rooms, which makes longer wedding stays far more comfortable.</p><p>The scale here works in your favour. The Grand Crystal Ballroom is one of the largest pillarless spaces in the city, making it ideal for big celebrations, while outdoor areas like the courtyard and poolside bring in a more relaxed, open setting for smaller functions. There’s flexibility in how events are planned, so each function can feel distinct without needing a complete reset of the space.</p><p>What stands out is how well everything comes together during the stay. Dining is a highlight, especially at K3, where multiple cuisines are done consistently well. Marriott’s hospitality ensures that guests feel taken care of, and between events, guests have the option to unwind at the spa, pool or step out into Aerocity, making the entire experience feel easy and well-paced.</p>', '511', 'Grand Crystal Ballroom, Crystal Ballrooms', 'Event Courtyard, Outdoor Lawn, Poolside Areas', '1050', '1050', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/1THZNQOd3WqQr76PTO6nNHwAlw4gm1Ypp8fZO3ke.jpg", "title": "3+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/QpfKGDZ9ErbJudAlXNdS8hTIAWxX2XlRGIkuknqb.jpg", "title": "Curated romantic dining and private celebrations"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/qpa0S3KU1NUMAXnVxfDn0cZwsND1uzBuulPIyn7y.jpg", "title": "Multi-cuisine interactive dining experiences"}]', '[{"id": 293, "question": "Which is the nearest airport to JW Marriott Hotel New Delhi Aerocity?", "answer": "<p>Indira Gandhi International Airport is the nearest airport to&nbsp;<strong>JW Marriott Hotel New Delhi Aerocity</strong>, just 2–4 km away. It’s a quick 5–10 minute drive.</p>"}, {"id": 294, "question": "What is the standard check-in time at JW Marriott Hotel New Delhi Aerocity, and is early check-in available?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>JW Marriott Hotel New Delhi Aerocity</strong> is 3:00 pm, and the check-out time is 12:00 noon. Early check-in facility can be arranged, subject to hotel availability.</p>"}, {"id": 295, "question": "Which months are most popular for weddings at JW Marriott Hotel New Delhi Aerocity?", "answer": "<p>The most popular months for weddings at&nbsp;<strong>JW Marriott Hotel New Delhi Aerocity</strong> are from November to February, when the weather is cooler and more comfortable for outdoor celebrations.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 296, "question": "Can I host a pre-wedding photoshoot at JW Marriott Hotel New Delhi Aerocity?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>JW Marriott Aerocity</strong> usually allows pre-wedding shoots. Prior permission is required, and charges may apply depending on the areas used and availability.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 297, "question": "What is JW Marriott Hotel New Delhi Aerocity’s liquor policy?", "answer": "<p><strong>JW Marriott Hotel New Delhi Aerocity</strong> follows an in-house liquor policy. Outside alcohol isn’t allowed, and all beverages are provided by the hotel and billed separately based on consumption.</p>"}]', '357', '511'
