SELECT 'delhi-ncr', 'karma-lakelands-gurugram', 'published', 'Karma Lakelands Manesar, Gurgaon Wedding Cost & Booking', 'From serene lakeside ceremonies to grand receptions, Karma Lakelands covers it all. Explore wedding cost, price packages & seamless booking today!', 'karma lakelands wedding cost, karma lakelands wedding, karma lakelands booking, karma lakelands gurgaon, karma lakelands price, karma lakelands manesar', '/storage/hotel/seo/wC3j45A24tyh9l1XpPma84bdpZSzJhtDjdaXuAEz.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/2AQGch9tUOLOdzOXaIz9xCJji4ln0qK7RsSAti0p.jpg', 'Karma Lakelands Gurugram', 'Sector 80, NH-8, Naurangpur Road, Manesar, Gurugram, Haryana – 122051, India, India', '50 Minutes', '40 Minutes', '<p>A&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at Karma Lakelands</strong> doesn’t feel like a typical hotel celebration. Set across 270 acres of greens, lakes and forest cover, it feels quieter, more spread out and far more personal than most venues around Delhi. The no-horn policy and natural surroundings make a noticeable difference, especially during multi-day weddings when guests want space to relax between functions.</p><p>The venues at Karma Lakelands work beautifully for layered celebrations. You get to host sundowners alongside Lake 360, plan a laid-back mehendi on the lawns and consider moving into elegant indoor spaces like the Pavilion for receptions or sangeet events. Dining leans towards a fresh, farm-grown produce, which adds a thoughtful, slightly different touch to the overall experience.</p><p>For couples looking at a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Delhi NCR</strong>, this is a strong option if you want something green, spacious and well-connected. With 95 rooms, suites and private villas, it accommodates wedding groups comfortably while still feeling low-key and unhurried, which is rare this close to the city.</p>', '95', 'Grand Ballroom, The Chamber', 'Lake 360, The Pavilion', '240', '240', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/VRvED5NikGzxKu2UEbrtKEhIFFmwu2X1PX5GFTyv.jpg", "title": "3+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/ZFT5z4A6nM6mK5SKTuEb8NaKTV6nmBhf4nvqxt9o.jpg", "title": "Floating breakfast and serene lake moments"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/lJnKMscdwDNJCsswZiOrr8KDFPOLeTnNIu3AT1M9.jpg", "title": "Leisure boating and canoeing experiences"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/LkdokdMRdp6M1YNfg7pWxbYSuUN2y8vQ06Puiui6.jpg", "title": "Guided farm, nature and eco tours"}]', '[{"id": 621, "question": "How to reach Karma Lakelands from the nearest airport?", "answer": "<p>From Indira Gandhi International Airport, Karma Lakelands is about 30 km away. A car ride takes around 40–45 minutes, depending on traffic conditions.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 622, "question": "What is the check-in time at Karma Lakelands, and is an early check-in allowed for wedding guests?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Karma Lakelands&nbsp;</strong>is 3:00 pm, and guests can check-out by 11:00 am. An early check-in facility is available, subject to hotel availability.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 623, "question": "Are drones, fireworks or baraat allowed at Karma Lakelands?", "answer": "<p>Drone shoots, fireworks and baraat processions may be permitted at<strong> Karma Lakelands</strong>, subject to local regulations and venue policies. It’s best to confirm details with the hotel and Viraaya Weddings team.</p>"}, {"id": 624, "question": "Can we bring our own wedding planner to Karma Lakelands?", "answer": "<p>Yes, you can bring your own wedding planner or decorator to<strong> Karma Lakelands</strong>. The hotel team typically coordinates with external vendors, but it’s best to confirm any guidelines in advance.</p>"}, {"id": 625, "question": "What is the standard liquor policy at the Karma Lakelands for weddings?", "answer": "<p><strong>Karma Lakelands</strong> offers in-house bar services for weddings. Outside alcohol is not allowed, and all drinks are billed as per consumption.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '369', '95'
