SELECT 'delhi-ncr', 'pullman-new-delhi-aerocity', 'published', 'Pullman New Delhi Aerocity Wedding Cost & Packages', 'Pullman New Delhi Aerocity blends contemporary style with luxury wedding experiences. Discover wedding cost, exclusive packages & booking for your wedding.', 'pullman new delhi aerocity wedding cost, pullman new delhi aerocity wedding packages, pullman new delhi aerocity reviews, pullman new delhi aerocity aerocity new delhi delhi', '/storage/hotel/seo/P6XzEa0etVIXajBmNdwqAQU0J7F2M9L4maBfJ63H.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/Z2z2A3AzGOKbsv8SwQreZ0NKSAGcbya80b7uTI3v.png', 'Pullman New Delhi Aerocity', 'Asset No 2, Indira Gandhi International Airport, Gmr Hospitality District, Aerocity, New Delhi, Delhi 110037, India', '10 Minutes', '40 Minutes', '<p>A&nbsp;<strong>wedding at Pullman New Delhi Aerocity</strong> comes with a certain ease that’s hard to ignore. Located in the heart of Aerocity and just minutes from the airport, it simplifies arrivals for guests flying in. The hotel’s contemporary design, clean lines and open layouts set the tone for a modern, well-put-together celebration.</p><p>The venues at&nbsp;<strong>Pullman New Delhi Aerocity&nbsp;</strong>handle large celebrations comfortably without feeling impersonal. The Peacock Ballroom is spacious but still feels well thought through, while the courtyard is great for outdoor functions and evening ceremonies. A&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at Pullman New Delhi Aerocity</strong> feels easy to plan, with enough flexibility for each function to have its own vibe without starting from scratch.</p><p>A dedicated team is hands-on and used to this scale, so you’re not chasing things throughout the day. Covering over 40,000 sq. ft. of event space and one of the largest pillarless ballrooms in the city, the hotel comfortably handles big, multi-function weddings without feeling cramped. The design stays modern and uncluttered, and with Aerocity right outside, guests can step out or settle in without feeling confined.</p>', '270', 'Peacock Ballrooms', 'Courtyard', '550', '550', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/xnyZ96mGb9nj4bXweC23P28eccbZpsmQQRCDFP26.jpg", "title": "6+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/4AzJOUiyzlmwdP7SqjXWIa6egY1yrDKsCkbzF28J.jpg", "title": "Private cabana-style romantic dining"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/JieBu9pnxHWqEhm8gv2urbqMoNjJZrsUvdjbWroA.jpg", "title": "Farm-fresh gourmet dining experiences"}]', '[{"id": 288, "question": "Which is the nearest airport to Pullman New Delhi Aerocity?", "answer": "<p>Indira Gandhi International Airport is just 1.1 km from&nbsp;<strong>Pullman New Delhi Aerocity</strong>. It’s a quick 5-minute drive, making arrivals and departures very convenient.</p>"}, {"id": 289, "question": "Is an early check-in or late check-out facility available at Pullman New Delhi Aerocity?", "answer": "<p>Yes, an early check-in or a late check-out can be arranged, subject to hotel availability. The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Pullman New Delhi Aerocity</strong> is 3:00 pm, and the check-out time is 12:00 noon.</p>"}, {"id": 290, "question": "How much can I save if I make a booking at Pullman New Delhi Aerocity through Viraaya Weddings?", "answer": "<p>Booking&nbsp;<strong>Pullman New Delhi Aerocity</strong> through Viraaya Weddings can help you save around 10–15% or more. You also get smoother planning, trusted vendors and better coordination.</p>"}, {"id": 291, "question": "Can guests explore local sights during their stay at Pullman New Delhi Aerocity?", "answer": "<p>Yes, guests staying at&nbsp;<strong>Pullman New Delhi Aerocity</strong> can step out to Worldmark Aerocity or visit Qutub Minar and Humayun’s Tomb. For shopping, DLF Emporio and Sarojini Nagar Market are close by.</p>"}, {"id": 292, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol to Pullman New Delhi Aerocity?", "answer": "<p>No, you can’t bring your own alcohol to&nbsp;<strong>Pullman New Delhi Aerocity</strong>. All beverages are arranged by the hotel and charged separately on a consumption basis.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '232', '270'
