SELECT 'delhi-ncr', 'radisson-blu-plaza-hotel-delhi-airport', 'published', 'Radisson Blu Plaza Delhi Airport Wedding Cost & Reviews', 'Radisson Blu Plaza Delhi Airport offers premium wedding venues near IGI Airport. Explore wedding cost, guest reviews & tailored packages for your big day.', 'radisson blu plaza delhi airport wedding, radisson blu plaza delhi airport wedding cost, radisson blu plaza delhi airport wedding price, radisson blu plaza delhi airport reviews, radisson blu plaza delhi, hotel radisson blu plaza delhi', '/storage/hotel/seo/1KN2JZ8bxz77yZTZE8u8cnKydWkKW2vuh1ppZQf5.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/xtv2iMK1jpA162zKR96P0npuYfeQrZnEVjLTqfpO.jpg', 'Radisson Blu Plaza Hotel Delhi Airport', 'Near, Nh 8, Block R, Mahipalpur Extension, Mahipalpur, New Delhi, Delhi 110037, India', '10 Minutes', '40 Minutes', '<p>Low-rise architecture, marble-lined interiors and softly lit corridors give&nbsp;<strong>Radisson Blu Plaza Hotel, Delhi Airport</strong> a calm, almost unexpected sense of grandeur so close to one of the city’s busiest gateways. Set across nearly 4 acres along the Delhi-Gurugram Expressway, this 5-star flagship property feels spacious without being overwhelming, with crystal chandeliers, warm wood detailing, and open event areas that flow naturally from one function to the next. Even with its proximity to IGI Airport, the interiors feel hushed and contained, almost like a quiet resort tucked within the city’s movement.</p><p>At&nbsp;<strong>Radisson Blu Plaza Hotel, Delhi Airport</strong>, weddings take place across venues that each have their own distinct character. The Crystal Ballroom spans 675 square metres and is ideal for larger celebrations, while the Ebony halls feel better suited to smaller, more personal ceremonies. The poolside lawns bring in a relaxed outdoor space for daytime functions. With 261 rooms and suites, including executive and presidential suites, the hotel easily accommodates residential weddings with guests staying close to the celebrations.</p><p>What stands out about&nbsp;<strong>Radisson Blu Plaza Hotel, Delhi Airport</strong> is how naturally everything connects. Aerocity is just minutes away, Worldmark and DLF Promenade are within easy reach, and the airport sits practically next door. It is this balance of architecture, access and atmosphere that makes celebrations here feel smooth, well-paced and quietly personal.</p>', '261 rooms with suites', 'Crystal Ballroom, Ebony Hall', 'The Poolside Lawn', '550', '550', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/p1xTTbJOwAVmBHMWLPnLfpwylm7C0aPWnQsR9O3g.jpg", "title": "7+ dining venues onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/bxQjwPuBiXv9LeTBUNEHsbDlMbG7RK1zI8VJYiju.jpg", "title": "Intimate gourmet dining experiences"}]', '[{"id": 1143, "question": "Which months are most popular for weddings at Radisson Blu Plaza Delhi Airport?", "answer": "<p>At&nbsp;<strong>Radisson Blu Plaza Hotel,&nbsp;</strong>the<strong>&nbsp;</strong>peak wedding season runs from October to March, with the highest demand in November, December and February.</p>"}, {"id": 1144, "question": "What is the check-in time, and can we get an early check-in at Radisson Blu Plaza Delhi Airport?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at the property is 3:00 pm, and check-out time is 12:00 noon. An early check-in facility can be arranged at<strong> Radisson Blu Plaza Delhi Airport,&nbsp;</strong>subject to availability.</p>"}, {"id": 1145, "question": "Can I host a pre-wedding photoshoot at Radisson Blu Plaza Delhi?", "answer": "<p>Yes, you can host a pre-wedding photoshoot at&nbsp;<strong>Radisson Blu Plaza Hotel,&nbsp;</strong>but it requires prior permission and may involve location charges based on the areas used.</p>"}, {"id": 1146, "question": "What is included in the wedding package at Radisson Blu Plaza Delhi Airport?", "answer": "<p>The&nbsp;<strong>wedding package at Radisson Blu Plaza Delhi&nbsp;</strong>typically includes venue spaces, customised multi-cuisine catering, curated live food counters and hospitality support for guests. Inclusions vary based on event scale and final booking details.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 1147, "question": "Does Radisson Blu Plaza Delhi Airport provide a bar service for weddings?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>Radisson Blu Plaza Delhi&nbsp;</strong>provides an in-house bar service for weddings, and all beverages are served exclusively through the hotel. Outside alcohol is not permitted, and bar services are billed separately from the wedding package.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '306', '261'
