SELECT 'delhi-ncr', 'resort-country-club-manesar', 'published', 'Resort Country Club Manesar Wedding Cost & Booking', 'Celebrate your big day at Resort Country Club Manesar. Best Western quality, unbeatable wedding cost packages & world-class venues await. Enquire & Book!', 'resort country club manesar wedding cost, resort country club manesar wedding, best western resort country club manesar, western resort country club manesar', '/storage/hotel/seo/ayw0M2MsW2s3FChCJPXVZsXzBaPWmCHAegiLV9Ia.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/Ew7OJP2VeOsQqK87S9WHoHrlm4v5GSnwHf4clya1.jpg', 'Resort Country Club Manesar', '132, Major District Road, Near Manesar, Panchgaon, Gurugram, Haryana – 122015, India, India', '50 Minutes', '45 Minutes', '<p>A&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at Resort Country Club, Manesar,</strong> unfolds across 50 acres, giving you the kind of space that naturally lends itself to multi-day celebrations. Opened in 1990 and recently refreshed, the resort brings together vintage character and lighter, more contemporary interiors that feel easy, welcoming and well put together.</p><p>The property features over 150,000 sq. ft. of landscaped lawns, including a grand outdoor space that can host up to 3,000 guests, alongside nine indoor venues such as the high-ceiling Conservatory and the 9,000 sq. ft. Shamiyana hall. With 115 rooms and suites, including private pool options, it comfortably accommodates wedding groups while keeping events and stay experiences closely connected.</p><p>For couples considering a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Agra&nbsp;</strong>or anywhere in Delhi NCR, the&nbsp;<strong>Resort Country Club in Manesar&nbsp;</strong>offers excellent connectivity. The resort sits about 45–60 minutes from Delhi airport via NH48. With farm-to-table dining, an on-site spa and a wide range of recreational spaces, it supports grand as well as relaxed, in-between moments with ease.</p>', '115', 'Shamiyana, The Conservatory, Regency Halls', 'Central Greens, The Grand Lawn, The Sukabumi Terrace, The Resort Garden, The Colour Court, The Garden Court', '230', '250', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/HQqbozPw87P5oDy3fKMqlHJsRXBbEpx2mdkWhGk4.jpg", "title": "3+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/d8L6M2CPBQpQdXBBHDubXWPgMOKwqQSx9NloMZwN.jpg", "title": "Romantic dining, bar and spa retreats"}]', '[{"id": 616, "question": "How to reach Resort Country Club, Manesar, from the nearest airport?", "answer": "<p>The nearest airport to&nbsp;<strong>Resort Country Club in Manesar&nbsp;</strong>is Indira Gandhi International Airport. From there, it’s a 34–35 km drive via NH48, taking around 45-60 minutes depending on traffic.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 617, "question": "What is the check-in time at Resort Country Club, Manesar, and is an early check-in allowed?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Resort Country Club, Manesar&nbsp;</strong>is 2:00 pm, and guests can check-out by 11:00 am. An early check-in facility can be arranged, subject to hotel availability.</p>"}, {"id": 618, "question": "Does Resort Country Club, Manesar, have salons, laundry service and an ironing board in rooms?", "answer": "<p><strong>Resort Country Club, Manesar,</strong> offers laundry services and provides ironing facilities on request. For salon services, it’s best to check directly with the hotel or confirm with the Viraaya Weddings team.</p>"}, {"id": 619, "question": "Is outside catering allowed at Resort Country Club, Manesar?", "answer": "<p>Outside catering may be accommodated for more personalised wedding experiences at&nbsp;<strong>Resort Country Club, Manesar.</strong> It’s best to confirm specifics and permissions directly with the hotel management.</p>"}, {"id": 620, "question": "Does the Resort Country Club, Manesar, provide a bar service for weddings?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>Resort Country Club, Manesar,&nbsp;</strong>provides in-house bar services for weddings. Outside alcohol isn’t permitted, and all beverages are arranged and billed separately based on consumption.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '370', '115'
