SELECT 'delhi-ncr', 'sheraton-new-delhi-hotel', 'published', 'Sheraton New Delhi Hotel - Wedding Packages, Cost & Booking', 'Sheraton New Delhi Hotel offers premium wedding venues & world-class hospitality. Discover wedding prices, guest reviews & tailored packages for your day.', 'sheraton new delhi hotel wedding, sheraton new delhi hotel wedding cost, sheraton new delhi hotel wedding price, sheraton new delhi, sheraton new delhi hotel reviews', '/storage/hotel/seo/JAr8x9OUFKqeTSmv0T2sZHzEZQWYSl4qfJ3KZde0.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/I26uaEa0qNtIfU26JMuWqS9X8hSGxAXYMureXDV9.jpg', 'Sheraton New Delhi Hotel', 'Saket District Centre, District Centre, Sector 6, Saket, New Delhi, Delhi 110017, India', '35 Minutes', '40 Minutes', '<p>Red sandstone architecture, arched courtyards and softly lit interiors give&nbsp;<strong>Sheraton New Delhi Hotel</strong> a sense of calm that feels surprisingly rare in South Delhi. Located in Saket District Centre, this 5-star luxury hotel sits close to Qutub Minar and Delhi’s cultural hotspots while still maintaining the warmth of a private retreat. For couples planning a&nbsp;<strong>wedding at Sheraton New Delhi Hotel</strong> or wishing to host a sophisticated&nbsp;<strong>wedding in Delhi</strong>, the property balances elegant city living with deeply personal hospitality.</p><p>Inside&nbsp;<strong>Sheraton New Delhi Hotel</strong>, contemporary styling blends with warm wooden accents, crystal chandeliers and serene social spaces designed for intimate celebrations. The hotel offers over 372 sq metres of banquet space, including elegant indoor venues and landscaped outdoor settings suited for cocktail evenings, pheras and refined wedding functions. Its separate banquet entrance also allows seamless baraat arrivals without disrupting the hotel’s quieter atmosphere.</p><p>What makes&nbsp;<strong>Sheraton New Delhi Hotel</strong> memorable is the feeling of comfort woven through the entire stay. Guests can move from long celebratory dinners at Dakshin and Yi Jing to relaxed evenings by the pool, spa therapies at Kaya Kalp and nearby explorations of Hauz Khas Village, India Gate and Delhi’s iconic heritage landmarks between wedding festivities.</p>', '220 rooms with suites', 'The Ballroom, Dynasty Banquet Hall', 'Dynasty with Lawns, Blue Bay (The Poolside)', '500', '500', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/0apVHrQBCv6uyEhZ2hMEBXz95C5ztx67m9XqJUSO.jpg", "title": "4+ dining venues onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/6oErYOaweDqsph0sxMIwCPJNykhU5vgju9hEEOtv.jpg", "title": "Signature cocktails at an elegant lounge"}]', '[{"id": 1123, "question": "Does Sheraton New Delhi Hotel have salons, laundry service and an ironing board in rooms?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>Sheraton New Delhi Hotel&nbsp;</strong>offers salon access, laundry services and in-room ironing facilities for guest convenience. Guests can confirm specific room amenities directly with the hotel or Viraaya Weddings team.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 1124, "question": "What are the standard check-in and check-out times at Sheraton New Delhi Hotel, and is early check-in available?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Sheraton New Delhi Hotel</strong> is 3:00 pm, while check-out is by 12:00 noon. Guests can be accommodated with an early check-in, but it is entirely subject to hotel availability.</p>"}, {"id": 1125, "question": "Are drones, fireworks or baraat allowed at Sheraton New Delhi Hotel?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>Sheraton New Delhi Hotel</strong> usually allows baraat processions with prior coordination. Fireworks and drone usage are subject to Delhi regulations, hotel permissions and vendor approvals.</p>"}, {"id": 1126, "question": "Can guests explore local sights during their stay at Sheraton New Delhi Hotel?", "answer": "<p>Guests at&nbsp;<strong>Sheraton New Delhi Hotel&nbsp;</strong>can visit Qutub Minar, Lotus Temple, Humayun’s Tomb, India Gate and Lodhi Garden during their stay. Hauz Khas Village, Dilli Haat and Select Citywalk Mall are also popular spots for shopping and cultural experiences.</p>"}, {"id": 1127, "question": "Does Sheraton New Delhi Hotel provide a bar service for weddings?", "answer": "<p>Yes, alcohol at&nbsp;<strong>Sheraton New Delhi Hotel&nbsp;</strong>is served by the hotel’s in-house bar. Outside alcohol is strictly prohibited inside the hotel premises, and all beverages and drinks are charged per consumption.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '308', '220'
