SELECT 'delhi-ncr', 'taj-damdama-lake-resort-and-spa-gurugram', 'published', 'Taj Damdama Lake Resort Wedding Cost & Venue Booking', 'Taj Damdama Lake Resort & Spa Gurugram wedding cost, venue & booking details. Plan a lakeside destination wedding near Gurgaon. Check packages now.', 'taj damdama lake resort & spa gurugram wedding cost, damdama lake resort gurgaon, damdama lake gurgaon resort, taj damdama lake gurgaon reviews', '/storage/hotel/seo/cDwQEkl9B06Mh6cao5M851xA6QOAtHsvOFzf1mCp.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/4WF1SlCIneaq1YsNcDMIMjJdAO2Nun38LekaBHKH.jpg', 'Taj Damdama Lake Resort And Spa Gurugram', 'PO Damdama, Off Sohna-Gurgaon Rd, Gurgaon, Haryana 122102, India., India', '60 Minutes', '30 Minutes', '<p>A&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Gurgaon at Taj Damdama Lake Resort &amp; Spa</strong> feels a little away from the city without being difficult to reach. It’s about an hour from the Indira Gandhi International Airport, so guests usually get in without much hassle. The setting is quieter, with the Aravallis in the background and Damdama Lake close by, which gives people the option to step out for a bit between events or just stay within the property and relax.</p><p>The property’s design leans into natural tones and open spaces, with luxurious villas, courtyards and pathways that don’t feel boxed in. Venues are spread across lawns, terraces and banquet halls, so larger functions and smaller gatherings each find their own place. At&nbsp;<strong>Taj Damdama Lake Resort &amp; Spa</strong>, the whole setup feels easy to move through, without anything feeling forced or overdone.</p><p>The overall wedding and stay experience at the resort comes easily. Taj hospitality ensures that you feel taken care of, food quality is consistently impeccable across events and guests tend to settle in rather than feel like they’re just there for a brief celebration and leaving.</p>', '130', 'Bargad Hall, Kachnar Hall', 'Bargad Lawn, Ashoka Lawn, Aravali Terrace', '340', '340', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/GrKzvlZIAnGRyzAGUyuB8hJpVZjLsl4EDoyXFe5k.jpg", "title": "3+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/5YTg94zoZY8ZC1ZRQ5WPZtifVfH9gnYfrLVawf9n.jpg", "title": "Elegant garden picnic escape"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/2UzOMOtdHqXfOc2BMhRFQ2FIVKrX5kRcnDmvdIt7.jpg", "title": "Private floating breakfast indulgence"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/2fkobuFMpo1yhwpImlZu878QRT9udaowqYnBXSHY.jpg", "title": "Luxury bridal preparation lounge"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/nL9BrvpsOJNKzBrT1vHQODBNikIFOOnmgScIjVK0.jpg", "title": "Exclusive wedding planning studio"}]', '[{"id": 376, "question": "How much does a wedding cost at Taj Damdama Lake Resort & Spa, Gurugram?", "answer": "<p>Usually, the average cost of a destination wedding at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Damdama Lake Resort &amp; Spa, Gurugram,</strong> falls within the range of INR 1.8 Cr and INR 2.2 Cr for a 3-day, 2-night celebration. Use Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator to get a precise quote based on your wedding requirements instantly.</p>"}, {"id": 377, "question": "Is an early check-in available at Taj Damdama Lake Resort & Spa, Gurugram?", "answer": "<p>Yes, an early check-in facility can be arranged, but it is subject to availability. The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Damdama Lake Resort &amp; Spa, Gurugram,</strong> is 2:00 pm, and check-out time is at 12:00 noon.</p>"}, {"id": 378, "question": "Can photographers use hotel spaces before the wedding day at Taj Damdama Lake Resort & Spa, Gurugram?", "answer": "<p>At&nbsp;<strong>Taj Damdama Lake Resort &amp; Spa</strong>, pre-wedding shoots are allowed with prior approval, subject to availability, with possible additional charges depending on usage.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 379, "question": "How is Taj Damdama Lake Resort & Spa, Gurugram, compared to The Westin Sohna Resort & Spa, Gurgaon?", "answer": "<p>Taj Damdama Lake Resort &amp; Spa offers a larger, more premium destination wedding (INR 1.8–2.2 Cr, 143 keys) with a secluded setting but longer airport transfers. Meanwhile, The Westin Sohna Resort &amp; Spa is more budget-friendly (INR 1.2-1.4 Cr, 97 keys) and far better connected, ideal for smaller, intimate celebrations.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 380, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol to Taj Damdama Lake Resort & Spa, Gurugram?", "answer": "<p>No, outside alcohol is not allowed on the property premises. All beverages must be exclusively purchased through&nbsp;<strong>Taj Damdama Lake Resort &amp; Spa, Gurugram.</strong>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '98', '130'
