SELECT 'delhi-ncr', 'taj-mansingh-new-delhi', 'published', 'Taj Mansingh Delhi – Weddings Costs, Packages & Booking', 'Wondering about Taj Mansingh Delhi wedding cost? Explore hotel packages, check booking availability & plan your dream day with confidence. Explore Today!', 'taj mansingh delhi wedding, taj mansingh delhi wedding cost, taj mansingh delhi booking, taj mansingh hotel, taj mansingh hotel delhi', '/storage/hotel/seo/zrmWzG9p1mSeTgiPn5D4DWVZ9M7bjjSbZH3PBfhk.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/IOOO5JpMMb5yP49HA0SUiIhcxGzYS4oSS4ZZtBYR.jpg', 'Taj mansingh New Delhi', 'South Block, Man Singh Road Area, New Delhi, Delhi 110011, India', '30 minutes', '40 Minutes', '<p>Standing in the heart of Lutyens’ Delhi, the&nbsp;<strong>Taj Mansingh Delhi</strong> looks out over tree-lined boulevards and some of the capital’s most recognisable landmarks. The hotel has a long-standing legacy, which it displays through contemporary interiors and Indian craftsmanship, featuring jamdani-inspired motifs, detailed inlay work and curated artworks influenced by Delhi’s culture and history. Dining remains one of the property’s attractions, with venues such as Varq and House of Ming adding variety to wedding-related gatherings and guest experiences. Wellness spaces, a pool and the J Wellness Circle further complete longer celebration stays.</p><p>The hotel offers 6 venues along with expansive lawns and poolside spaces that suit different wedding functions within the same property. Natural daylight, garden-facing settings and elegant banquet spaces create an environment that works well for formal ceremonies as well as evening celebrations.&nbsp;</p>', '213 rooms with suites', 'Mansingh I, Mansingh II, Mansingh III & IV', 'Gulab Bagh, Kamal Bagh, Terrace Garden', '450', '450', '[{"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal02.png", "title": "6 multi-cuisine restaurants and lounges"}, {"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal03.png", "title": "Starry night dining experience for couples"}, {"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal04.png", "title": "Special couple massages"}]', '[{"id": 1273, "question": "What is the nearest airport to Taj Mansingh Delhi?", "answer": "<p>The nearest major airport to<strong> Taj Mansingh Delhi</strong> is the Indira Gandhi International Airport (DEL), located approximately 14 km away. It takes around 30–45 minutes to reach the property by car.</p>"}, {"id": 1274, "question": "What are the check-in and check-out timings at the Taj Mansingh Delhi? Are there any early check-in or late check-out privileges available for the wedding couple?", "answer": "<p>Standard check-in at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Mansingh Delhi&nbsp;</strong>is 2:00 PM, and check-out is 12:00 noon. Early check-in and late check-out for wedding couples are subject to availability upon request.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 1275, "question": "Can I conduct a pre-wedding photoshoot at the Taj Mansingh Delhi?", "answer": "<p>Yes, you can conduct a pre-wedding photoshoot at<strong> Taj Mansingh Delhi</strong>. Prior management permission is mandatory, and specific event or room bookings may be required to access premium locations.</p>"}, {"id": 1276, "question": "Are there any attractions near the Taj Mansingh Delhi for international wedding guests?", "answer": "<p>Nearby&nbsp;<strong>Taj Mansingh Delhi</strong>, guests can explore India Gate, Lodhi Garden and the shopping hub of Khan Market. Humayun’s Tomb and Rashtrapati Bhavan are also historic landmarks within minutes.</p>"}, {"id": 1277, "question": "What is Taj Mansingh Delhi’s official liquor policy?", "answer": "<p>Alcohol consumption is allowed inside the&nbsp;<strong>Taj Mansingh, Delhi.&nbsp;</strong>However, you must buy all drinks and cocktails from the hotel’s in-house restaurants and bars. These will be charged separately and are not included in your standard wedding package.&nbsp;</p>"}]', '260', '213'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'delhi-ncr' AND `slug` = 'taj-mansingh-new-delhi');
