SELECT 'delhi-ncr', 'taj-palace-new-delhi', 'published', 'Taj Palace New Delhi Luxury Wedding Cost & Booking Guide', 'Explore Taj Palace New Delhi wedding cost, booking & reviews with luxury venues, premium stays, catering, décor & elegant wedding celebrations. Book Now!', 'taj palace new delhi wedding cost, taj palace new delhi wedding, taj palace new delhi wedding price, taj palace hotel new delhi wedding, taj palace new delhi booking, taj palace hotel new delhi, taj palace new delhi reviews', '/storage/hotel/seo/0Pp6FSgUycxK3IzFTCcuSXhLOkaUDIa1ajOTxoYc.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/go254BS6TCXHMvdhTYbpuIjGepKuxuzPpBiAZsk7.jpg', 'Taj Palace New Delhi', '2, Sardar Patel Marg, Diplomatic Enclave, Chanakyapuri, New Delhi, Delhi 110021, India', '30 minutes', '40 Minutes', '<p>Most luxury hotels in Delhi feel impressive for a few hours.&nbsp;<strong>Taj Palace, New Delhi,</strong> is the kind of place that slowly takes over the mood of the entire wedding weekend. The moment guests enter the expansive six-acre estate lined with palms, fountains and quiet pockets of greenery, the city noise almost disappears. Inside, the hotel blends grand chandeliers, regal detailing and warm golden lighting in a way that feels elegant without trying too hard. It is luxurious, but still welcoming enough for families to truly relax into the celebrations.</p><p>A&nbsp;<strong>wedding at Taj Palace, New Delhi,&nbsp;</strong>works beautifully for couples who want a celebration that feels lavish yet personal at the same time. Durbar Hall brings in the grandeur with its scale and regal setting, while the garden venues create a calmer, more intimate atmosphere against the lush greens of the Delhi Ridge. What also makes&nbsp;<strong>Taj Palace, New Delhi,</strong> especially convenient for destination weddings is its location within Chanakyapuri, just a short drive from the airport and central Delhi, making guest arrivals and wedding logistics far smoother.</p><p>What stays with most guests after a&nbsp;<strong>wedding at Taj Palace, New Delhi,&nbsp;</strong>is the hospitality. The staff remember names, families feel looked after and the celebrations unfold with the kind of ease that only comes from a hotel deeply experienced in hosting world leaders, celebrities and grand Indian weddings alike.</p>', '411 rooms with 57 suites', 'Durbar, Shahjehan, Mumtaz, Roshanara, Jahanara, Sheesh Mahal, Jehangir, Alamgir, Vazir, Nizwan', 'Rani Bagh, Raja Bagh', '950', '950', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/7MudcVlkUTCF0PIgDE3s4AYwGYY7geQUAroZXTP5.jpg", "title": "5+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/sw84zBqd7AuWxXW4cB0bBnbUVMNhJ1V6WOOpz1T7.jpg", "title": "Curated royal private dining experiences"}]', '[{"id": 942, "question": "Can I host a pre-wedding photoshoot at Taj Palace, New Delhi?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>Taj Palace, New Delhi,&nbsp;</strong>does allow couples to get their pre-wedding photoshoots done, but prior permission from the hotel is essential. Shoot charges and venue access rules may vary.</p>"}, {"id": 943, "question": "What is the check-in time at Taj Palace, New Delhi, and can guests get an early check-in?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Palace, New Delhi,</strong> is 2:00 pm, and guests can check out by 12:00 noon. Guests can request an early check-in, but the accommodation is entirely subject to hotel availability.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 944, "question": "What are the timing restrictions for events/music at Taj Palace, New Delhi?", "answer": "<p>Event and music timings at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Palace, New Delhi,&nbsp;</strong>follow local Delhi regulations and hotel policies. It is best to confirm the latest permitted timings with the Viraaya Weddings team.</p>"}, {"id": 946, "question": "Does Taj Palace, New Delhi, provide a bar service for weddings?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>Taj Palace, New Delhi,</strong> provides bar service for weddings through the hotel’s in-house catering and beverage team. Alcohol packages are usually customised separately based on the celebration requirements.</p>"}]', '269', '411'
