SELECT 'delhi-ncr', 'the-lalit-mangar-delhi-ncr', 'published', 'The Lalit Mangar Faridabad Wedding Cost & Booking Details', 'Discover The Lalit Mangar Faridabad wedding cost, booking details, guest reviews, luxury venue features, premium accommodations & hospitality. Reserve!', 'the lalit mangar wedding, the lalit mangar wedding cost, the lalit, mangar booking, the lalit mangar, the lalit mangar reviews', '/storage/hotel/seo/oPUbX2wUBXZstXusuiu6PiYtgYph4IKyTUNbzDxg.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/N5THI9zdQuxf35rhy9Bn5QvsROispJ3T59M6wfNz.jpg', 'The Lalit Mangar Delhi Ncr', 'Camp Wild Road, Mangar, Faridabad, Haryana 121004, India', '90 minutes', '40 Minutes', '<p>If you’re picturing a wedding at&nbsp;<strong>The LaLiT Mangar, Faridabad</strong>, it is likely to feel more like a private valley escape than a typical hotel venue, with the Aravallis quietly wrapping around every celebration. Spread across a 677-acre eco-luxury estate near Mangar Bani forest, the property keeps things intentionally intimate with just 35 suites and gatherings of about 100-120 guests. Its rammed-earth architecture, raw stone detailing and wide-open valley views create a setting that already feels warm and complete, even before anything is styled or set up.</p><p>What makes&nbsp;<strong>The LaLiT Mangar, Faridabad,</strong> special is how effortlessly the outdoors becomes your venue. With over 6,000+ sq metres of open lawns and courtyard spaces, celebrations unfold against quartzite hills and forest edges that feel untouched and timeless. It suits couples planning a&nbsp;<strong>wedding in Delhi NCR</strong> who want a setting rooted in nature, where styling feels organic, whether bohemian, contemporary or minimal.</p><p>Last but not least, a stay at&nbsp;<strong>The LaLiT Mangar in Faridabad&nbsp;</strong>is inherently leisurely and relaxing, with suites facing the valley and dimly lit areas that make it difficult to move quickly. This 5-star hideaway is located peacefully among the Aravallis, close to nature but easily connected, making it a suitable option for small festivities. It is around 45 minutes from the Delhi airport.</p>', '35 suites', 'The Banquet Hall', 'The Aravallis, Central Courtyard', '100', '100', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/gSPvV7xlQ0uaeQiLtvhCpoV2sL9U3dvEmCASd49T.jpg", "title": "3+ dining venues onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/ENEfWt718x3YXmafwcoubEtHK29q2oy9rCxIPA3l.jpg", "title": "Secluded valley private dining"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/Bbfszs2gFimoV47Z8Nfzjz23X0HobGtPKlpfzdGi.jpg", "title": "Bohemian courtyard mehendi celebration"}]', '[{"id": 1133, "question": "Are there suggested excursions or experiences near The LaLiT Mangar, Faridabad?", "answer": "<p>Near&nbsp;<strong>The LaLiT Mangar, Faridabad,&nbsp;</strong>guests can explore Mangar Bani forest trails, Asola Bhatti Wildlife Sanctuary, Surajkund craft village, Anangpur Dam, Damdama Lake boating, Aravalli rock walks and Peacock Lake birding, all offering a raw nature escape just minutes away from this 5-star property.</p>"}, {"id": 1134, "question": "Can guests get an early check-in to The LaLiT Mangar, Faridabad?", "answer": "<p>Yes, an early check-in facility can be arranged at<strong> The LaLit Mangar, Faridabad,&nbsp;</strong>subject to availability. The standard check-in time at the property is 3:00 pm, and check-out time is 12:00 noon.</p>"}, {"id": 1135, "question": "Is there an indoor backup at The LaLiT Mangar, Faridabad, in case of rain?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>The LaLiT Mangar, Faridabad</strong> has a cosy indoor backup area located in close vicinity to the main lawns, ideal for intimate gatherings during rain, though with limited seating capacity.</p>"}, {"id": 1136, "question": "Is The LaLiT Mangar, Faridabad, the right fit for your guest size, style and budget?", "answer": "<p><strong>The LaLiT Mangar, Faridabad</strong>, suits 50-150 guests, ideal for intimate weddings near Delhi NCR with easy international access, best for bohemian or contemporary styles, and positioned in a premium boutique luxury budget range.</p>"}, {"id": 1137, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol to The LaLiT Mangar, Faridabad, for weddings?", "answer": "<p>No, outside alcohol is strictly prohibited at&nbsp;<strong>The LaLiT Mangar, Faridabad.&nbsp;</strong>All drinks and beverages are exclusively served through the hotel’s in-house bar and are charged separately from standard wedding packages.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '319', '35'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'delhi-ncr' AND `slug` = 'the-lalit-mangar-delhi-ncr');
