SELECT 'delhi-ncr', 'the-leela-ambience-convention-hotel-gurugram', 'published', 'The Leela Ambience Delhi Wedding Cost & Booking Details', 'Explore The Leela Ambience Convention Hotel Delhi wedding cost, booking & reviews with luxury venues, premium stays, décor, catering & grand celebrations.', 'The Leela Ambience Delhi wedding, The Leela Ambience Delhi  wedding cost, The Leela Ambience Delhi  wedding package, The Leela Ambience Delhi booking', '/storage/hotel/seo/IIyGVRJaH0UaBws4tjfy5NqEdqmLj7CT9cCEODi3.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/BuL6rdNNbAX3cUIGI51frWfQv4oZrcDaMcqBULDP.jpg', 'The Leela Ambience Convention Hotel gurugram', 'National Highway 8, Ambience Island, DLF Phase 3, Sector 24, Gurugram, Haryana 122010, India', '15 Minutes', '30 Minutes', '<p>Delhi has a way of making even simple moments feel grand, and weddings here naturally carry that same scale.&nbsp;<strong>The Leela Ambience Convention Hotel Delhi</strong> fits right into this setting, but still feels balanced and easy to move through. The design is modern and clean, with warm touches that keep it from feeling too formal, even though the property itself is quite large.</p><p>Planning a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at The Leela Ambience Convention Hotel Delhi</strong> is really about the freedom of space. The pillarless ballroom is one of the largest in the country, and it shows when you step in, high ceilings, uninterrupted layouts and enough room to bring big ideas to life. Outdoor lawns balance this out for more relaxed functions, so each event can feel different without having to move too far.</p><p>What stays with guests is how easy everything feels once they arrive. Rooms are spacious, food is consistently good across cuisines and the service keeps things running quietly in the background. Between events, guests often head out to Old Delhi, Akshardham or central city spots, which adds another layer to the celebration.&nbsp;</p>', '480', 'Jade Ballroom, Emerald Ballroom, Turquoise Ballroom, Grand Sapphire Ballroom, Ruby Ballroom, Coral Banquet Hall', 'City Lawn, Park Lawn, Frangipani Lawn', '1000', '1000', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/0F2trvgOcHnj9wZ9QVBMSFzAieWZPVDqIx9X3Uao.jpg", "title": "5+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/eRYkzGAufGSOepz3gNrgPRkDYy70Q48cZVdqIhZo.jpg", "title": "Romantic poolside dinners and Taj visits"}]', '[{"id": 313, "question": "How much can I save if I book The Leela Ambience Convention Hotel Delhi through Viraaya Weddings?", "answer": "<p>Booking&nbsp;<strong>The Leela Ambience Convention Hotel Delhi&nbsp;</strong>through Viraaya Weddings can help you save 10-15% or more, along with smoother planning, trusted vendors and better coordination.</p>"}, {"id": 314, "question": "Can guests explore local sights during their stay at The Leela Ambience Convention Hotel Delhi?", "answer": "<p>Yes, while staying at&nbsp;<strong>The Leela Ambience Convention Hotel Delhi</strong>, you can visit popular tourist sites such as the Akshardham Temple, Red Fort and India Gate. Wander around markets like Chandni Chowk if you’re into street food and thrifting.</p>"}, {"id": 315, "question": "When is peak season for The Leela Ambience Convention Hotel Delhi?", "answer": "<p>Peak season at&nbsp;<strong>The Leela Ambience Convention Hotel Delhi</strong> runs from October to March. This period sees high demand for weddings, events and holidays due to pleasant weather.</p>"}, {"id": 316, "question": "Is an early check-in allowed at The Leela Ambience Convention Hotel Delhi?", "answer": "<p>Yes, guests can request an early check-in, but accommodation is completely subject to hotel availability. The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>The Leela Ambience Convention Hotel Delhi</strong> is 2:00 pm, and check-out time is at 12:00 noon.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 317, "question": "Does The Leela Ambience Convention Hotel Delhi provide a bar service for weddings?", "answer": "<p>No, outside alcohol isn’t permitted at&nbsp;<strong>The Leela Ambience Convention Hotel Delhi.</strong> All beverages are arranged by the hotel and billed separately, as they’re not included in standard wedding packages.</p>"}]', '104', '480'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'delhi-ncr' AND `slug` = 'the-leela-ambience-convention-hotel-gurugram');
