SELECT 'delhi-ncr', 'the-oberoi-gurgaon', 'published', 'The Oberoi Gurgaon Wedding Cost & Venue Booking', 'The Oberoi Gurgaon wedding cost, wedding packages & hotel details. Plan your wedding at The Oberoi Hotel Gurgaon with premium venue options.', 'the oberoi gurgaon wedding cost, the oberoi gurgaon wedding, the oberoi gurgaon wedding packages, the oberoi hotel gurgaon', '/storage/hotel/seo/Yjuw2oXTCdtcdQ0eYYGTvEpwhs99kgCBTDRsmkRz.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/RcxrV5TdtWpybdRQ5JGOyiBIg0KQfZarvakeCLhZ.jpg', 'The Oberoi Gurgaon', '443, Shankar Chowk Rd, opposite Metro Station, Phase V, Udyog Vihar, Sector 19, Gurugram, Haryana 122016, India', '20 Minutes', '30 Minutes', '<p>Just a short drive from the airport,&nbsp;<strong>The Oberoi, Gurgaon</strong> feels like a quiet pause within NCR’s constant movement. Glass architecture, long water bodies and manicured greens take the edge off the city, so even a large-scale&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Gurgaon</strong> feels calmer the moment you arrive.</p><p>Weddings here don’t feel boxed into a fixed format. Spread across 9 acres, the property gives guests room to actually move between spaces instead of being tied to one setting. The Grand Ballroom works well for larger events, while the pre-function areas and water-facing decks come alive for cocktails, mehendi or more relaxed evenings. Lighting looks warm and understated, and décor usually sits comfortably within the architecture rather than trying to dominate it.</p><p>What stays with guests is how easy the stay experience at&nbsp;<strong>The Oberoi, Gurgaon,</strong> feels, without ever feeling staged. The Oberoi team is present but never intrusive, so events flow naturally. Dining experiences move between Indian favourites, global dishes and live counters, while bars and poolside areas set a relaxed mood. Between functions, guests return to their rooms, unwind in lounges or step out briefly, making the wedding stay feel unhurried and comfortable.</p>', '202', 'Grand Ballroom, Ballroom', 'Expansive Lawns, Poolside Deck', '405', '405', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/D0eoYkJRaFAbGgtpbfsD5tZ7blLffd2JZeg6V9e4.jpg", "title": "5+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/le8lLbtq01eSYj4CwXMmiV0bAYfGKgRKkBVN01F5.jpg", "title": "Couples’ candlelit alfresco dining experience"}]', '[{"id": 308, "question": "How much can I save if I book The Oberoi, Gurgaon through Viraaya Weddings?", "answer": "<p>Booking&nbsp;<strong>The Oberoi, Gurgaon</strong> through Viraaya Weddings can help you save around 10-15% or more. You also get better coordination, reliable vendor support and a much smoother planning experience overall.</p>"}, {"id": 309, "question": "Is an early check-in allowed at The Oberoi, Gurgaon?", "answer": "<p>Yes, an early check-in can be requested, but accommodation is subject to hotel availability. The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>The Oberoi, Gurgaon</strong> is 2:00 pm, and the check-out time is 12:00 noon.</p>"}, {"id": 310, "question": "Which celebrity wedding was held at The Oberoi, Gurgaon?", "answer": "<p>Shahid Kapoor and Mira Rajput got married at a Chhatarpur farmhouse. However, their wedding reception was later hosted at&nbsp;<strong>The Oberoi, Gurgaon</strong>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 311, "question": "Is outside catering allowed at The Oberoi, Gurgaon?", "answer": "<p>Outside catering at&nbsp;<strong>The Oberoi, Gurgaon,</strong> is restricted and subject to hotel approval. It’s best to confirm details directly with the hotel based on your wedding requirements.</p>"}, {"id": 312, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol to The Oberoi, Gurgaon, for a destination wedding?", "answer": "<p>Outside alcohol isn’t allowed at<strong> The Oberoi, Gurgaon</strong>. All beverages are arranged by the hotel and billed separately, as they are not part of the standard wedding package.</p>"}]', '107', '202'
