SELECT 'delhi-ncr', 'the-roseate-new-delhi', 'published', 'The Roseate New Delhi Wedding Cost & Hotel Booking', 'The Roseate New Delhi blends floral elegance with five-star luxury. Get clear wedding cost, read guest reviews & complete your booking today. Enquire!', 'the roseate new delhi wedding, the roseate new delhi wedding cost, the roseate delhi wedding, the roseate delhi booking, the roseate new delhi, the roseate delhi, the roseate new delhi price, the roseate new delhi reviews', '/storage/hotel/seo/aruQZWtKAVZJXBSSrVT8BIIhrIfjuigzD9cSRJG3.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/I1iCWhSR0YH73JqOreMMqwRj3tmgJOB4deaH2BT1.jpg', 'The Roseate New Delhi', 'National Highway 8, D Block, Samalka, New Delhi, Delhi 110097, India', '15 Minutes', '60 Minutes', '<p>A&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at The Roseate, New Delhi</strong>, doesn’t feel like a typical Delhi venue. The moment you turn in, the noise drops, and you’re surrounded by water, trees and open space. It’s quiet in a way that’s hard to find in the city, and that shift in pace makes a difference right from the start.</p><p>For couples planning a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Delhi,&nbsp;</strong>the spaces at&nbsp;<strong>The Roseate in New Delhi</strong> work without trying too hard. The lawns run alongside long water bodies, so ceremonies already have a natural setting. You don’t need to overthink decor. As the light changes through the evening, the reflections and open sky do most of the work. Everything feels easy to move between, without that stop-start feeling between functions.</p><p>With only 65 accommodations, this 5-star property suits intimate celebrations, with a close-knit circle. Guests aren’t scattered, and the whole wedding feels more connected. Service is warm and straightforward, and the food is well done without being over the top. It’s a place where things just flow the way you’d want them to.</p>', '65', 'Ballroom and Banquet Space', 'Expansive Lawns', '125', '150', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/vqX5q6nPJC4Q6SEcrspXv3fyfRbuhW2a39HLuZDI.jpg", "title": "3+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/kECzN6SjaUYStI4lw4THjacqqM8kag0EzS1AERUc.jpg", "title": "Curated couples’ gourmet dining experiences"}]', '[{"id": 626, "question": "How to reach The Roseate, New Delhi, from the nearest airport?", "answer": "<p>From Indira Gandhi International Airport, The Roseate, New Delhi is located just 8-10 minutes away, around 5 km by car, depending on traffic.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 627, "question": "Is early check-in available for wedding guests at The Roseate, New Delhi?", "answer": "<p>Yes, guests can request an early check-in, but it is subject to hotel availability. The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>The Roseate, New Delhi,</strong> is 3:00 pm, and check-out is by 12:00 noon.</p>"}, {"id": 628, "question": "Is outside catering allowed at The Roseate, New Delhi?", "answer": "<p>Yes, outside catering may be accommodated for bespoke events, but it’s best to confirm directly with The Roseate team before booking.</p>"}, {"id": 629, "question": "When is peak season for destination weddings at The Roseate, New Delhi?", "answer": "<p>Peak wedding season at&nbsp;<strong>The Roseate, New Delhi</strong>, spans October to February with ideal weather, while April to September is quieter, offering better availability and value.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 630, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol to The Roseate, New Delhi, for a destination wedding?", "answer": "<p>No, you can’t bring your own alcohol to&nbsp;<strong>The Roseate, New Delhi.</strong> All beverages are served through the hotel’s in-house bar and charged separately, based on consumption.</p>"}]', '259', '65'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'delhi-ncr' AND `slug` = 'the-roseate-new-delhi');
