SELECT 'delhi-ncr', 'welcomhotel-by-itc-hotels-delhi', 'published', 'ITC Welcomhotel Gurgaon – Wedding Cost, Banquets & Buffet', 'ITC Welcomhotel Gurgaon offers world-class banquet halls & customised wedding packages. Discover buffet prices, wedding costs & direct booking options.', 'welcomhotel delhi​, welcomhotel new delhi​, itc welcomhotel banquets, welcomhotel buffet dinner', '/storage/hotel/seo/48acWbHdTLsPc6vZLZnmy6JB5biDzyzRI1ZXv64A.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/tsRIhtMmN6AQSMk7y0Ub0tmZylvLqgCyrrRbvIqL.jpg', 'Welcomhotel By ITC Hotels Delhi', 'Gurgaon - Delhi Expy, near Toll Plaza, D Block, Kapas Hera, New Delhi, Delhi 110097, India', '15 Minutes', '50 Minutes', '<p>Airport arrivals, grand baraat entries and multi-day celebrations feel remarkably effortless at a&nbsp;<strong>wedding at Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels, Gurgaon</strong>. Positioned right along the Delhi-Gurugram border, this 5-star luxury hotel property is designed for large-format celebrations where logistics matter just as much as aesthetics. Contemporary banquet halls, polished interiors and expansive event layouts give the hotel a refined yet highly practical character, especially for families planning lavish residential weddings with guests flying in from different cities.</p><p>For couples hosting a premium&nbsp;<strong>wedding in Delhi NCR</strong>,<strong> Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels, Delhi - Gurugram Highway</strong> offers one of the region’s strongest location advantages. The hotel sits just minutes from Indira Gandhi International Airport and directly off NH-48, making guest movement seamless throughout the celebrations. With nearly 3,250 sq. metres of banquet and event spaces, including Raj Mahal, Kamal Mahal and open-air poolside venues, the property comfortably accommodates everything from cocktail evenings to large wedding receptions.</p><p>At&nbsp;<strong>Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels, Gurgaon</strong>, the entire stay experience revolves around warm ITC hospitality and memorable dining. Signature culinary experiences, spacious modern rooms and streamlined event coordination create the feeling of a complete wedding hub within the city. Between celebrations, guests can also explore CyberHub, Ambience Mall and Gurugram’s vibrant dining scene nearby.</p>', '81 rooms with suites', 'Raj Mahal, Kamal Mahal, Ballroom', 'The Open Terrace Lounge, The Open Poolside Deck', '200', '200', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/feysEJ2HTtGHdJvhzXP3KwpslWIVqT7GpTFlRUuf.jpg", "title": "2+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/pnvVRfOnXopzvAbxXdpqyqWzVqak3MLx6gYc5BrN.jpg", "title": "Romantic candlelit dinners for couples"}]', '[{"id": 977, "question": "Can I host a pre-wedding photoshoot at Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels, Gurgaon?", "answer": "<p>Yes, couples can book a pre-wedding photoshoot at&nbsp;<strong>Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels, Gurgaon,</strong> with prior approval from the hotel authorities. Charges and access to hotel areas for shoots are dependent on hotel policies.</p>"}, {"id": 978, "question": "Can guests request an early check-in to Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels, Gurgaon?", "answer": "<p>Yes, guests can get an early check-in to the hotel; it is entirely up to the hotel’s discretion. The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels, Gurgaon&nbsp;</strong>is 2:00 pm, and guests can check out by 12:00 noon.</p>"}, {"id": 979, "question": "Is outside catering allowed at Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels, Gurgaon?", "answer": "<p>Outside catering is generally not permitted at&nbsp;<strong>Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels, Delhi - Gurugram Highway.</strong> Wedding menus and catering services are usually managed by the hotel’s in-house culinary team.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 980, "question": "Are there vendor restrictions at Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels, Gurgaon?", "answer": "<p>For weddings,&nbsp;<strong>Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels, Gurgaon,</strong> often collaborates with approved vendors and carefully chosen event partners. Couples who want to put up entertainment or outdoor décor should work directly with the hotel staff in advance.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 981, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol to weddings at Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels, Gurgaon?", "answer": "<p>No, bringing alcohol to&nbsp;<strong>Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels, Gurgaon,</strong> from outside is not allowed. All beverages must be sourced through the hotel’s in-house bar itself and are billed separately based on consumption.</p>"}]', '313', '81'
