SELECT 'goa', 'alila-diwa-goa', 'published', 'Alila Diwa Goa – Explore Packages, Venue Costs & Bookings', 'Host your dream wedding at Alila Diwa Goa. Explore curated wedding packages, get transparent venue cost details & plan your perfect day. Get Details Now!', 'alila diwa goa wedding packages, alila diwa wedding cost, alila diwa goa destination wedding goa, alila diwa goa wedding venue cost, alila diwa goa wedding cost', '/storage/hotel/seo/e1ZRb8bKTtbTFDlrd59cjGGhZTtq4heh8YQu0KDe.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/fOjPK0ZSn1Q9GWXSpZFx7zMWMTNofI9YAAuA0UEE.jpg', 'Alila Diwa Goa', '48/10, Adao Waddo, Pacheco Vaddo, Majorda, Gansua, Goa 403713, India', '33 Minutes', '25 Minutes', '<p>Located among swaying palm trees and lush paddy fields in the state’s southside, the&nbsp;<strong>Alila Diwa Goa&nbsp;</strong>is an escape to a more tranquil pace of life. Inspired by contemporary Goan architecture, the resort has high-pitched roofs and open verandas that are skillfully made from warm laterite stone and teak. It is also a mere 500 metres away from the white sands of the Gonsua Beach.</p><p><strong>Weddings at Alila Diwa Goa&nbsp;</strong>are fusions of scenic outdoor venues and beautifully adorned indoor spaces. The resort has 2,137 sq. metres of event space, which includes the largest indoor banquet hall in Goa. Black-tie and cocktail evenings are complemented by bespoke menus curated by the in-house culinary team. Spacious rooms with attached balconies overlooking gardens ensure guests remain comfortable and enchanted. Designed as a self-contained retreat within the main property, The Diwa Club offers exclusive two-bedroom suites complemented by poolside views.</p>', '153', 'Alila Ballroom (with a pre-function area)', 'Udeta, Alila Lawns', '300', '331', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/TjxVfFQOTDYMw01HPZ9ziovfdx78in6uRDh9hsZW.jpg", "title": "5 distinct diners with poolside views"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/irGMBtrRvrboGlmlvzjkUhge0duaoAUZBLT6qmGR.jpg", "title": "Bridal therapies at Spa Alila"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/IEpvM44PUTPcNrC8ctHfy1ZEjdjKSI0AkV6NIb7h.jpg", "title": "Pillarless ballroom for large events"}]', '[{"id": 646, "question": "Are late check-out or early check-in facilities available for wedding groups?", "answer": "<p>While standard check-in and check-out times of 3:00 PM and 12:00 noon apply, both late check-out and early check-in are subject to availability and may incur extra fees. It is better to confirm this with&nbsp;<strong>Alila Diwa Goa’s&nbsp;</strong>reception beforehand.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 647, "question": "Is outside catering allowed at the Alila Diwa Goa?", "answer": "<p>No, outside catering is not allowed at the&nbsp;<strong>Alila Diwa Goa.&nbsp;</strong>The resort has exclusive in-house catering services for events, with both vegetarian and non-vegetarian options available.</p>"}, {"id": 648, "question": "What hotel is better suited for wedding ceremonies: Alila Diwa Goa or the W Goa?", "answer": "<p>If you are looking for a larger or more traditional wedding, the&nbsp;<strong>Alila Diwa Goa</strong> is perfect, with its extensive event space and accommodations. However, if you want a smaller and high-energy wedding, the W Goa is a unique venue that offers a trendy ambience and in-house DJ nights.&nbsp; Both of these properties are great for your celebrations, but the ideal one depends on the kind of ceremonies and package you want.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 649, "question": "How much does an Alila Diwa wedding cost?", "answer": "<p>A wedding at Alila Diwa Goa can cost between ₹1 Cr to over ₹1.5 crores for a standard 2-night event. Your cost can vary depending on the number of guests and the month in which you choose to hold your wedding. If you want a transparent and realistic estimate, you can make use of our Cost Calculator. Just enter the details concerning your check-in, check-out, destination and guest count for a near-accurate budget.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 650, "question": "What is the liquor policy at the Alila Diwa Goa?", "answer": "<p>The&nbsp;<strong>Alila Diwa Goa&nbsp;</strong>allows alcohol consumption inside the premises. However, liquor for public and banquet events should be bought in-house. These drinks will be billed separately and are not included in your standard wedding package.&nbsp;</p>"}]', '17', '153'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'goa' AND `slug` = 'alila-diwa-goa');
--> statement-breakpoint
