SELECT 'goa', 'azaya-beach-resort-goa', 'published', 'Azaya Beach Resort Goa Wedding Cost Estimates & Booking', 'Discover Azaya Beach Resort Goa wedding cost estimates, booking details, luxury venues, premium stays, décor, and catering for dream beach weddings.', 'azaya beach resort goa wedding cost, azaya beach resort goa wedding, azaya beach resort goa wedding venue cost, azaya beach resort goa wedding price, azaya beach resort goa booking', '/storage/hotel/seo/aDqQy4UxZKcoipOI0u8vQEUr1jdrxob33m52wo1V.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/t7yRdUpmyQ5hNdImkRwMbSb12nNUHS3TnxU7tES1.jpg', 'Azaya Beach Resort Goa', '336/0, Village Calwaddo, Benaulim, Goa 403716, India, India', '45 Minutes', '20 Minutes', '<p>The&nbsp;<strong>Azaya Beach Resort</strong> is set within South Goa, along the shores of Benaulim Beach. Its low-rise architecture and open layouts have been inspired by Maldivian island living. Soft white sands extend into the property, while uninterrupted sea views and breezy, sunlit spaces create an immersive setting. The design keeps the outdoors close at all times, giving the resort a unique coastal character that sets it apart from more traditional properties in Goa.</p><p>The resort offers splendid wedding venues, each with beachfront lawns and pool decks. The in-house lawns make the perfect setting for formal ceremonies, while beachside locations can be used for their serene ambience. The versatile layout makes it convenient to move between functions. With the sea always in view, every celebration feels connected to the setting and visually memorable.</p>', '114 rooms with suites', 'NA', 'Oasis Beachfront Lawn, Azaya Central Beach, Palacio, Pool Deck, Pool Lawn, La Concha Alfresco, The Palm Lawn', '270', '270', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/MYgODbgTkwKy8nHyU1xXFGfAHrycTSI51Vm9WKjY.jpg", "title": "4+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/bXbf18srky47Ogv3wieiDwyISZGEgFuwbaPj3Nu7.jpg", "title": "Private beachfront venue for ceremonies"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/C0z6ZdEc4FPzgA4Gu4lwuWkfflVZWeYQlkiWsVTH.jpg", "title": "Exclusive beach dining for couples"}]', '[{"id": 446, "question": "How do guests reach the Azaya Beach Resort, Goa?", "answer": "<p>Guests reach&nbsp;<strong>Azaya Beach Resort</strong> via Dabolim Airport, which is a 45-minute drive away (26 km), using pre-booked resort transfers, prepaid taxis or private car rentals.</p>"}, {"id": 447, "question": "What months are the most popular for weddings at the Azaya Beach Resort, Goa?", "answer": "<p>Destination weddings at the<strong> Azaya Beach Resort, Goa</strong>, are usually held from November to February. During these months, Goa has pleasant temperatures and dry weather that is ideal for beachfront ceremonies.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 448, "question": "Does the Azaya Beach Resort in Goa offer late check-out or early check-in facilities for wedding couples?", "answer": "<p><strong>Azaya Beach Resort</strong> offers early check-in and late check-out for wedding couples; however, these facilities are subject to room availability. The standard check-in time is 3:00 pm and check-out time is 12:00 noon.</p>"}, {"id": 449, "question": "How does the Azaya Beach Resort, Goa, compare to the Alila Diwa Goa?", "answer": "<p>Alila Diwa (153 rooms) features a serene, paddy-view aesthetic. Azaya (114 rooms) offers a Maldivian-inspired beachfront setting. Moreover, a wedding at Alila Diwa Goa can cost between INR 1.5 Cr to over INR 1.75 Cr for a standard 2-night event. However, for the&nbsp;<strong>Azaya Beach Resort,&nbsp;</strong>prices range from INR 90 lakhs to over INR 1.4 Cr depending on the venue and room usage.</p>"}, {"id": 450, "question": "What is the Azaya Beach Resort’s liquor policy?", "answer": "<p>Consuming alcohol is permitted inside the&nbsp;<strong>Azaya Beach Resort, Goa.&nbsp;</strong>However, drinks and cocktails for wedding celebrations have to be purchased from the property’s licensed restaurants and bars. These are charged separately and not included in your wedding package.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '353', '114'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'goa' AND `slug` = 'azaya-beach-resort-goa');
