SELECT 'goa', 'itc-grand-goa', 'published', 'ITC Grand Goa Luxury Wedding Packages & Venue Costs', 'Discover ITC Grand Goa luxury wedding packages & venue costs with premium stays, beachside venues, catering, décor, and elegant wedding experiences.', 'itc grand goa wedding cost, itc grand goa wedding, itc grand goa wedding packages, itc grand goa booking, itc grand goa, itc grand goa a luxury collection', '/storage/hotel/seo/te2AxCfi8lLFH2S0C2qVcRBkVqeFuaTtLlPIO1Ty.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/PIJNgpVdaIAHK6LUHgJNJ3WdH39HTLeXFJiQPHaq.jpg', 'ITC Grand Goa', 'Arossim Beach Rd, Arossim, Goa 403712, India', '20 Minutes', '25 Minutes', '<p>There’s something about&nbsp;<strong>ITC Grand Goa</strong> that immediately feels immersive rather than just impressive. Spread across 45 acres, the resort is designed like a charming Indo-Portuguese village, with winding pathways, open courtyards, quiet lagoons and coconut-lined walkways leading towards Arossim beach. It doesn’t feel like a single structure, but a vast, layered space that feels relaxed, sun-soaked and distinctly Goan.</p><p>A&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at ITC Grand Goa, a Luxury Collection Resort &amp; Spa,</strong> makes the most of this scale. With multiple lawns, waterfront settings and elegant indoor venues across the property, you’re not limited to one or two spaces. Each function can feel like it’s in a completely different setting, which adds a natural sense of progression to the celebrations.</p><p>For couples planning a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Goa</strong>, this wide variety of experiences becomes the real standout. Paired with ITC’s signature hospitality and strong F&amp;B, it creates a wedding experience that feels grand, well-managed and genuinely memorable for everyone involved.</p>', '246 rooms and suites', 'Salcete, Cansaulim Room', 'Seaside Lawns, Magical Forest', '540', '540', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/82adIAFJMrhniTKRI3oovADlTrEXtkOBIrLcgEn6.jpg", "title": "6+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/W8SFXq18SSbrJ5sbwX16JXVa25AUfUGsOAXhxYnX.jpg", "title": "Romantic beachfront curated dining experiences"}]', '[{"id": 451, "question": "What is the cost of a wedding package at ITC Grand Goa, a Luxury Collection Resort & Spa?", "answer": "<p>On average,<strong> ITC Grand Goa wedding packages cost&nbsp;</strong>between INR 1.5 Cr and INR 2.25 Cr+&nbsp; for a 3-day, 2-night event. Use Viraaya Weddings'' cost calculator to get a close quote instantly based on your guest count, room requirements and other logistical details.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 452, "question": "Should I choose ITC Grand Goa, a Luxury Collection Resort & Spa or Taj Exotica Resort & Spa, Goa for my wedding?", "answer": "<p>Go with&nbsp;<strong>ITC Grand Goa, a Luxury Collection Resort &amp; Spa</strong> if you’re planning a larger celebration (INR 1.5–2.25 Cr+), need 246 rooms and prefer quicker airport access (14–15 km, 20–30 mins). Choose Taj Exotica Resort &amp; Spa, Goa for a more intimate wedding (INR 1.5–2.2 Cr), with 140 rooms and a slightly longer 35–40 minute drive (26 km).</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 453, "question": "What is the booking price for ITC Grand Goa, a Luxury Collection Resort & Spa, through Viraaya Weddings?", "answer": "<p>If you secure your<strong> booking at ITC Grand Goa, a Luxury Collection Resort &amp; Spa,</strong> through Viraaya Weddings, then you can save up to&nbsp; 10-15% or more on negotiated rates. Get access to trusted vendors and smoother, end-to-end planning support.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 454, "question": "What is the check-in time at ITC Grand Goa, a Luxury Collection Resort & Spa, and can I check-in early?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>ITC Grand Goa, a Luxury Collection Resort &amp; Spa,&nbsp;</strong>is 3:00 pm, and check-out time is at 12:00 noon. You can request an early check-in, and it is subject to hotel availability.</p>"}, {"id": 455, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol to ITC Grand Goa, a Luxury Collection Resort & Spa?", "answer": "<p>No, outside alcohol is not permitted on the property premises. All beverages and drinks must be purchased directly from the hotel and will be charged for consumption, as they are not included in standard wedding packages.</p>"}]', '157', '246'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'goa' AND `slug` = 'itc-grand-goa');
--> statement-breakpoint
