SELECT 'goa', 'jw-marriott-goa', 'published', 'JW Marriott Goa – Dream Beach Wedding Venue Cost', 'JW Marriott Goa wedding cost Easy Breakdown. Explore honest venue cost details, stunning beach wedding packages Reviews & royal service. Book Now Today!', 'jw marriott goa wedding, jw marriott goa wedding cost, jw marriott goa wedding packages, jw marriott goa wedding venue cost, cost of destination wedding in jw marriott goa', '/storage/hotel/seo/gIKfUMq5cmLNDvzrnrhMyQ74NMEfv0ATz7dWHPVB.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/GKoxy2G0Ks70MctuiJ3Rqw1Hy0GCxTBjIcglIbzZ.jpg', 'JW Marriott Goa', 'Vagator Beach Road, Bardez, Goa 403509, India, India', '75 Minutes', '45 Minutes', '<p>Located in the lively neighbourhood of Vagator,<strong> JW Marriott Goa</strong> offers a unique setting that strikes a perfect balance of coastal views and easy access to North Goa’s famous spots. Overlooking Chapora Fort and the River, with Anjuna Beach and the Saturday Night Market close by, the hotel places wedding groups in the heart of Goa’s social and cultural circuit. Opened in 2023, the property is popularly known as the ‘Pearl of Goa’ and features a spa by L’Occitane, a salon and a dedicated entertainment centre, offering guests various ways to relax and stay busy between the festivities.</p><p>For destination weddings, the hotel brings together over 32,000 sq. ft. of indoor and outdoor event space, including a 5,000 sq. ft. ballroom and multiple breakout venues suited for different functions. This allows couples to host a complete wedding itinerary, including welcome gatherings and receptions, within one location. Four distinct dining venues further help with your celebrations, be it formal dinners or relaxed mehendi functions, creating a wedding experience that feels indulgent and luxurious.</p>', '151 rooms with suites', 'Grande Salão, Salão 1, Salão 2', 'JW Garden Outdoor, JW Garden Indoor, Salão Terrace', '340', '340', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/LCzhCpv5jvMjjbrPVYbxiqu9QG0nwT79Aq3doeuK.jpg", "title": "4 on-property restaurants and diners"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/s25sGzje3GKzoQMB9F0SLfCIGBK5r6Uub5tOcaE7.jpg", "title": "2 exclusive banquet halls"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/992qJoS64W8zlb5TiwtFRO5ye1yvigLimJcekx67.jpg", "title": "Beachside pre-wedding events and photoshoots"}]', '[{"id": 416, "question": "Which is the nearest airport to the JW Marriott Hotel Goa?", "answer": "<p>The nearest airport to the&nbsp;<strong>JW Marriott Hotel Goa&nbsp;</strong>in Vagator is the Manohar International Airport (GOX) in Mopa. It is located roughly 25 kilometres away from the property, and is the nearest accessible airport.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 417, "question": "What are the check-in timings at JW Marriott Goa? Are early check-in facilities available?", "answer": "<p><strong>JW Marriott Goa&nbsp;</strong>follows the standard check-in timing of 3:00 PM. Early check-in is not guaranteed and should be confirmed with the hotel’s management, who might charge you based on availability.</p>"}, {"id": 418, "question": "Are fireworks and drone photography allowed in JW Marriott Goa Vagator?", "answer": "<p>Drone usage is restricted inside&nbsp;<strong>JW Marriott Goa Vagator.&nbsp;</strong>Guests can only shoot non-commercial photos and videos for their own personal use. Fireworks are also banned in accordance with the orders of North Goa’s District Magistrate.</p>"}, {"id": 419, "question": "Should I choose JW Marriott Goa or W Goa for my wedding?", "answer": "<p>JW Marriott offers more rooms (151) for larger groups with a chic, elevated skyline vibe. W Goa (121 rooms) offers nearby beachside photo shoots and high-energy, cliffside party aesthetics. Both are located around 25–45 km from the MOPA airport. The better choice thus depends on the kind of celebrations you wish to have.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 420, "question": "What is the official liquor policy of JW Marriott Goa?", "answer": "<p>Alcohol consumption is allowed on the grounds of&nbsp;<strong>JW Marriott Goa.&nbsp;</strong>However, liquor for official events and public celebrations should be purchased from the property’s in-house restaurants and bars. These drinks are billed separately and are not included in your standard wedding package.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '352', '151'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'goa' AND `slug` = 'jw-marriott-goa');
--> statement-breakpoint
