SELECT 'goa', 'radisson-blu-resort-goa-cavelossim-beach', 'published', 'Radisson Blu Resort Cavelossim Goa Beach Wedding Cost', 'Radisson Blu Cavelossim beach wedding cost in Goa — explore venue packages, per-plate pricing, décor options & more. Plan your perfect Goa wedding now!', 'radisson blu resort goa cavelossim beach wedding cost, radisson blu resort goa cavelossim beach wedding packages, radisson blu resort goa cavelossim beach wedding price, radisson blu goa destination wedding cost, radisson blu resort goa wedding cost', '/storage/hotel/seo/DmgdGFCzFr1TgkMvUduTbzCIERpDZ1V3TimSeGjA.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/mIOSUPbrcLwm8otZEj7VAXQXvckId0oiXCEMiFhI.jpg', 'Radisson Blu Resort Goa Cavelossim Beach', 'Beach, Cavelossim, Mobor Beach, Goa 403731, India', '60 Minutes', '25 Minutes', '<p>Located in South Goa, near the Arabian Sea,&nbsp;<strong>Radisson Blu Resort Goa Cavelossim</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Beach</strong> is inspired by Goan architecture and Portuguese influences. The property’s design is best represented by its event spaces, featuring an 850 sq. metre covered banquet hall and wide lawns that offer a unique backdrop for wedding functions. Thoughtfully curated global dining options for different thematic setups allow each celebration to reflect your personal style.</p><p>Weddings at the resort are centred around its expansive beach lawns, which can host up to 2,000 guests in a floating setup or around 1,200 in cluster-style seating. In addition, 6,000 sq. ft. of indoor event space offers an alternative for more formal gatherings. The property allows couples to plan different functions by the sea, supported by flexible venue options and customised setups.</p>', '132', 'Braga, Lisboa, Lisboa I, Lisboa II, Sagres', 'Haystack Lawns, Beach Lawns', '290', '290', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/wzqJk1vJgwLKrdAtQT6GgJG0cRKhM2poZKKCnMuO.jpg", "title": "3+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/0CUwQ6EvuGDfZuilXoFuVfFU0oD6bfg6HberwJ5j.jpg", "title": "Private candlelight dining experiences"}]', '[{"id": 491, "question": "Are there any special offers for wedding couples at Radisson Blu Resort Goa Cavelossim Beach?", "answer": "<p><strong>Radisson Blu Resort Goa</strong> offers wedding couples group booking discounts, personalised wedding suites, and Radisson Rewards points. Additional perks include 25% off dining via Zomato and entourage packages.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 492, "question": "Are there any early check-in/late check-out facilities available at the Radisson Blu Resort South Goa?", "answer": "<p>The Radisson Blu Resort South Goa offers early check-in and late check-out facilities, subject to availability. The standard check-in time at the hotel is 3:00 pm and check out is by 12:00 noon.</p>"}, {"id": 493, "question": "Does the Radisson Blu Beach Resort Goa have salons, laundry service, iron board in rooms?", "answer": "<p>Yes, the&nbsp;<strong>Radisson Blu Resort Goa Cavelossim Beach</strong> offers in-room irons/ironing boards, laundry/dry cleaning services and an on-site hair salon. The resort also features the Sohum Spa and 24-hour room service.</p>"}, {"id": 494, "question": "How does Radisson Blu South Goa compare to Holiday Inn Resort Goa?", "answer": "<p>Radisson Blu is well-suited for an intimate setting with 132 rooms, providing Mediterranean-style boutique ambience just a short walk from the shore. Whereas Holiday Inn Resort is slightly larger, featuring 205 rooms across 25 acres. It offers a spacious, laid-back colonial vibe with direct access to Mobor beach. The wedding budget for both properties ranges between INR 60 lakhs and INR 90 lakhs.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 495, "question": "What is Radisson Blu South Goa’s liquor policy?", "answer": "<p>Alcohol is allowed in&nbsp;<strong>Radisson Blu South Goa.&nbsp;</strong>However, drinks and cocktails for public events and celebrations should be purchased from the hotel’s in-house restaurants and bars. These will be charged separately and are not part of wedding packages.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '158', '132'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'goa' AND `slug` = 'radisson-blu-resort-goa-cavelossim-beach');
