SELECT 'goa', 'taj-cidade-de-goa-heritage-goa', 'published', 'Taj Cidade De Goa Heritage Goa Wedding Cost & Booking', 'Discover Taj Cidade De Goa Heritage Goa wedding cost, venue pricing, and guest reviews with luxury stays, beachside venues, décor, and catering services.', 'Taj Cidade De Goa Heritage Goa wedding, Taj Cidade De Goa Heritage Goa wedding cost, Taj Cidade De Goa Heritage Goa wedding price', '/storage/hotel/seo/azt3FyMM7Tb4rBmZhTy6rQ4rLbajxNb0VCvBPZBI.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/YNx7uJmiX2wkVLbTgo0pV8jDhudIu47LQiefNxC7.jpg', 'Taj Cidade De Goa Heritage Goa', 'Dona Paula, Vainguinim Beach, Panaji, Durgavado, Goa 403004, India', '50 Minutes', '40 Minutes', '<p>The&nbsp;<strong>Taj Cidade De Goa Horizon, Goa,&nbsp;</strong>lies amidst a hillside just above the Vainguinim Beach, providing panoramic views of the Arabian Sea and Zuari River. Guests enter through vertical gardens and an elegant fountain into a striking lobby with a suspended boat hull inspired by Goa’s coastal spirit. A rooftop infinity pool, three dining venues, the J Wellness Circle and an in-house cinema offer wedding groups plenty to enjoy between functions, while the sea-facing setting keeps the property visually impressive throughout the stay.</p><p>The resort offers multiple wedding venues supported by one of Goa’s largest convention facilities, including pillarless halls, rooftop spaces and breakout areas. Couples can host different functions within one property while giving each event its own setting. Rooftop celebrations with sunset views and blue horizons add to the experience, while the scale of the event spaces makes the resort the perfect choice for larger destination weddings.</p>', '186', 'Grande Sala, Sala de Banquete', 'Mandovi and Zuari Lawns, Sunset Lawns, Poolside Lawns', '400', '400', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/CVAiA4xZcGIrkCFqYu3RZLtCfw1f38uSEtl7CYDL.jpg", "title": "6+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/jO0KL5cn5ly2E8GwJF9Skenbi7X8yFuw7hxOGiBN.jpg", "title": "In-house couple photoshoot services"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/7TDSAXjmjFQJM4hDhx0rlvx3fZmkzxNUn4CtsVWW.jpg", "title": "Personalised bridal showers"}]', '[{"id": 671, "question": "What is the nearest airport to Cidade de Goa, IHCL Seleqtions?", "answer": "<p>The nearest airport to&nbsp;<strong>Cidade de Goa, IHCL Seleqtions</strong> is Dabolim Airport (GOI), located approximately 26–28 km away. While Goa has two airports, Dabolim is significantly closer than the Manohar International Airport (MOPA) in North Goa for this Panaji-area resort.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 672, "question": "Are engagement shoots allowed in the Cidade de Goa, IHCL Seleqtions?", "answer": "<p>Yes, engagement shoots are allowed at<strong> Cidade de Goa, IHCL Seleqtions</strong>. The resort offers romantic backdrops for professional engagement shoots, though prior management approval and additional fees apply.</p>"}, {"id": 673, "question": "How does Cidade de Goa, IHCL Seleqtions compare to JW Marriott Goa?", "answer": "<p>Both&nbsp;<strong>Cidade de Goa, IHCL Seleqtions&nbsp;</strong>and JW Marriott Goa<strong>&nbsp;</strong>have direct beach access and heritage charm.&nbsp;<strong>Cidade de Goa, IHCL Seleqtions&nbsp;</strong>has a slightly bigger residential capacity of 186 rooms, as compared to Marriott’s 151 rooms. Both hotels are well connected to the airport, though JW Marriott Goa is slightly more expensive.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 674, "question": "Does Cidade de Goa, IHCL Seleqtions provide any late check-out or early check-in privileges to wedding couples?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-out and check-in at&nbsp;<strong>Cidade de Goa, IHCL Seleqtions,&nbsp;</strong>is at 12:00 noon and 2:00 PM. However, couples booking through the Timeless Weddings by Taj program or special Honeymoon Packages may receive more flexible considerations.</p>"}, {"id": 675, "question": "What is the official liquor policy of Cidade de Goa, IHCL Seleqtions?", "answer": "<p>Alcohol is permitted inside the grounds of&nbsp;<strong>Cidade de Goa, IHCL Seleqtions.&nbsp;</strong>However, all drinks and cocktails for wedding celebrations should be purchased from the hotel’s restaurants and bars. Bringing in outside liquor is prohibited. These drinks are charged separately and are not included in your standard wedding package.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '356', '186'
