SELECT 'goa', 'taj-cidade-de-goa-horizon-goa', 'published', 'Taj Cidade De Goa Horizon Premium Wedding Cost & Packages', 'Explore Taj Cidade De Goa Horizon wedding cost, luxury venue, premium stays, décor, catering & elegant beachside wedding experiences in Goa. Book Now!', 'taj cidade de goa horizon goa wedding cost, taj cidade de goa horizon wedding price, taj cidade de goa horizon wedding, taj cidade de goa, cidade de goa taj', '/storage/hotel/seo/AsWB3ttoEDAdFfE37HFnx6vwbHkDDLsZX5zzUT5B.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/zfUHcxKINjMgy6uMuSaEVJ1chAjRbVU7ORI9PBpM.jpg', 'Taj Cidade De Goa Horizon Goa', 'Dona Paula, Vainguinim Plateau, Panaji, Goa 403004, India', '40 Minutes', '50 Minutes', '<p>The&nbsp;<strong>Taj Cidade De Goa Horizon, Goa,&nbsp;</strong>lies amidst a hillside just above the Vainguinim Beach, providing panoramic views of the Arabian Sea and Zuari River. Guests enter through vertical gardens and an elegant fountain into a striking lobby with a suspended boat hull inspired by Goa’s coastal spirit. A rooftop infinity pool, three dining venues, the J Wellness Circle and an in-house cinema offer wedding groups plenty to enjoy between functions, while the sea-facing setting keeps the property visually impressive throughout the stay.</p><p>The resort offers multiple wedding venues supported by one of Goa’s largest convention facilities, including pillarless halls, rooftop spaces and breakout areas. Couples can host different functions within one property while giving each event its own setting. Rooftop celebrations with sunset views and blue horizons add to the experience, while the scale of the event spaces makes the resort the perfect choice for larger destination weddings.</p>', '283', 'Assembleia', 'Sky Gaze', '630', '630', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/28Psl8CX0aNvEZJiwykE4Jr6GbtYH6jePL7RYqIZ.jpg", "title": "4+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/iXHcbpjAvLWcJFhMIhuqA36LR8fSI9XZ0U4l6pFl.jpg", "title": "Private beachfront breakfast experience"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/8RbKlVACncWN5sZzaWFuvwUFyxiZ0T4wt1efAJew.jpg", "title": "Romantic rooftop infinity pool setting"}]', '[{"id": 666, "question": "What is the peak season for Taj Cidade de Goa Horizon?", "answer": "<p>The peak season for destination weddings at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Cidade de Goa, Horizon&nbsp;</strong>falls between November and February. The weather during these months is pleasant, making it ideal for weddings in Goa.</p>"}, {"id": 667, "question": "Are there any late check-out or early check-in facilities available at Taj Cidade de Goa Horizon for wedding couples?", "answer": "<p><strong>Taj Cidade De Goa Horizon&nbsp;</strong>follows the check-in timings of 2:00 pm and check-out timings of 12:00 noon. Wedding couples can enjoy priority early arrival and late departure upon negotiation with the management. This is subject to availability and may incur some extra charges.</p>"}, {"id": 668, "question": "Can I host a pre-wedding photoshoot at Taj Cidade de Goa Horizon?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>Taj Cidade de Goa Horizon&nbsp;</strong>offers ‘Picture-Perfect Shoots’ at picturesque spots, such as the Sky Gaze rooftop infinity pool. Professional sessions require prior approval and additional charges for exclusive access.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 669, "question": "Are there any suggested excursions or experiences near Taj Cidade de Goa Horizon?", "answer": "<p>Guests can explore the Fontainhas Latin Quarter, visit UNESCO-listed Old Goa or enjoy kayaking and dolphin watching in the Zuari backwaters, all located within a short 20-minute drive from&nbsp;<strong>Taj Cidade de Goa Horizon.</strong></p>"}, {"id": 670, "question": "What is Taj Cidade de Goa Horizon’s official liquor policy?", "answer": "<p>Consuming alcohol is allowed inside&nbsp;<strong>Taj Cidade de Goa Horizon.&nbsp;</strong>However, all the drinks and cocktails for celebrations should be purchased from the hotel’s licensed restaurants and bars. These will be billed separately from your wedding package.&nbsp;</p>"}]', '437', '283'
