SELECT 'goa', 'taj-exotica-resort-and-spa-goa', 'published', 'Taj Exotica Resort & Spa - Destination Wedding in Goa', 'Plan your Taj Exotica Resort & Spa destination wedding in Goa. Explore venue booking and costs for a royal beachfront gala on lush lawns. Start your forever!', 'taj exotica goa wedding cost, taj exotica goa wedding package, taj exotica goa wedding, taj exotica goa price, taj exotica goa rates, resort and spa in goa, taj exotica resort and spa, taj exotica resort spa, exotica the beach resort, exotica resort goa, exotica beach resort, taj exotica goa buffet price, taj exotica resort & spa south goa, goa packages taj exotica, taj exotica goa booking, taj exotica goa packages, taj exotica goa offers', '/storage/hotel/seo/rp13WERiUqCYTvMo2QJBnJNjW1Pl0qtf3YegKSZB.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/vbRGWjMHHNOBECuHDQL5HXC13460R7fq2OOjpugX.jpg', 'Taj Exotica Resort And Spa Goa', 'Beach Road, Calwaddo, Benaulim, Goa 403716, India', '45 Minutes', '25 Minutes', '<p>Situated on the calm shores of Benaulim, <strong>Taj Exotica Resort &amp; Spa, Goa,</strong> embodies the timeless soul of ancient Goan architecture with terracotta rooftops and sun-drenched colonnades, all set against the gentle sway of giant palm trees. Spread across 56 hectares, the resort offers a breathtaking canvas for a wedding that is both grand and personal.</p><p>At <strong>Taj Exotica Resort Spa,</strong> you get the opportunity to exchange vows on a beachside lawn with the sound of gushing waves in the background. Expansive lawns, elegant banquet halls and sunlit courtyards come together to create a breathtaking setting, shaping a <strong>destination wedding venue in Goa</strong> that seems truly dreamy.</p><p><strong>Taj Exotica Resort &amp; Spa, Goa</strong>, offers curated menus, beachfront venues, elegant décor setups and attentive service. Wedding guests can also feel at ease here with their luxury villa accommodations, spa access, and a variety of hospitality experiences.</p>', '140 rooms with suites', 'Saleta 1, Saleta 2, Sala Grande', 'Beach Lawns, Lobster Village Lawns, Rain Forest Lawn', '350', '350', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/rBmU0EmpveIXdFlawVa8pMLrcATUa6yYKtOsNgWA.jpg", "title": "4+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/iB3iUgTrUvVF84VcUcd4ImZ5kgfCXXcL0hJnY4Ee.jpg", "title": "Floating breakfast for villa stays"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/AbKiXNOddQuC8QW0CcuVg5EBQSFBZDPc4fNkfSzJ.jpg", "title": "Romantic culinary classes for couples"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/2IcecSMHAwT3kowNZetymg2K8LYx46RRRuGlPuSq.jpg", "title": "Gourmet Goan dining experience"}]', '[{"id": 153, "question": "What is the average cost of a wedding at Taj Exotica, Goa?", "answer": "<p>On average, a <strong>wedding at Taj Exotica, Goa,</strong> usually ranges from INR 1.5 Cr to INR 2.2 Cr for a 3-day and 2-night ceremony. If you’re looking for a personalised quote, enter your preferred dates, room requirements and guest capacity in our Cost Calculator to receive an estimate within seconds.</p>"}, {"id": 154, "question": "What is the check-in time at the Taj Exotica Resort & Spa, South Goa, and can we check-in early?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at Taj Exotica Resort &amp; Spa, Goa is 2:00 pm, and check-out is at 12:00 noon. If you wish to get an early check-in at the hotel, you can request it from the hotel authorities, which may be accommodated, subject to hotel availability.</p>"}, {"id": 155, "question": "Which is better: Taj Exotica Resort & Spa, Goa, or The St. Regis Goa Resort?", "answer": "<p>Taj Exotica Resort &amp; Spa, Goa, with its 132 Mediterranean-style rooms and 8 suites, costs between INR 1.3 Cr and INR 1.7 Cr for a 3-day, 2-night wedding celebration. Offering coastal lawns and vibrant Goan charm, this property is located within 30 km of the Dabolim Airport. On the other hand, the St. Regis Goa Resort, with 218 rooms, fits within a budget of INR 1.5 to 2.25 crore, standing out for its modern luxury and versatile event spaces. Taj feels colourful and relaxed, while St. Regis leans sleek and sophisticated.</p>"}, {"id": 156, "question": "How to check the availability of the Taj Exotica Resort & Spa, Goa, for a wedding?", "answer": "<p>Simply enter your desired dates, lodging needs and total number of guests using our Venue Availability Check feature to see if the Taj Exotica Resort &amp; Spa in Goa is available for a destination wedding. Almost instantaneously, our team will get back to you with available dates and other important details.</p>"}, {"id": 157, "question": "What is the liquor policy at Taj Exotica Resort & Spa, Goa?", "answer": "<p>Alcohol is permitted at <strong>Taj Exotica Resort &amp; Spa, South Goa</strong>. However, please note that any beverages served in public spaces and banquet venues should only be sourced through the hotel. Bringing in outside alcohol is not allowed on the property premises. All beverages are charged based on consumption and are generally excluded from the standard wedding packages.</p>"}]', '20', '140'
