SELECT 'goa', 'taj-fort-aguada-resort-and-spa-goa', 'published', 'Taj Fort Aguada Goa Wedding Packages & Booking Prices Online', 'Explore Taj Fort Aguada Goa wedding packages & booking with luxury venues, beachside celebrations, premium stays, décor & catering. Book online today!', 'taj fort aguada wedding cost, taj fort aguada beach resort goa wedding packages, taj aguada goa booking, taj fort aguada resort & spa goa booking, taj fort aguada goa, taj aguada fort goa, hotel taj fort aguada goa', '/storage/hotel/seo/qs7iGhDO4meTH7PeW3p9fizPN9Yg0IrTw3jhPQgk.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/NBY7oIshyBZ5geHaOyMZbYHNza0mn1pNSpkah6lh.jpg', 'Taj Fort Aguada Resort And Spa Goa', 'Sinquerim Beach, Candolim, North Goa, Goa 403515, India, India', '90 minutes', '60 Minutes', '<p>Taj Fort Aguada carries a sense of history that’s hard to replicate. Set along the Sinquerim and Candolim stretch, with the 16th-century fort nearby, the property looks out over uninterrupted views of the Arabian Sea. The red-tiled roofs, arched walkways and open lawns give it a distinct Portuguese character that feels rooted in place rather than styled for effect.</p><p>A&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at Taj Fort Aguada Resort &amp; Spa, Goa,</strong> takes full advantage of this setting. Beachside ceremonies, sea-facing celebrations and open-air functions across the lawns create a natural flow between events, with the backdrop doing much of the work.</p><p>For couples planning a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Goa</strong>, the appeal also lies in how easy everything feels. Taj’s attentive service, well-known dining venues and prime location in North Goa ensure that guests have plenty to experience, both within the resort and just beyond it.</p>', '131 rooms, villas with suites', 'The Aguada Ballroom, Halstead Hall', 'Bay View Lawns, Fishtail', '310', '310', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/2UHp6soFij6N8I3nSXF7SRvi5Sr3ORhMTQWxtcYY.jpg", "title": "5+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/PaIg4GHi6dm2oNvqvFagE4pmHS4KenS4NdqcRQSf.jpg", "title": "Private banyan tree candlelit dining"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/IBX3YLL1ggJfl5txc1MzyNZ96GLMTC0R2nFKLZzl.jpg", "title": "Couple’s chef-led cooking session"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/yzRCUXGNtYWa5b81DbpzLjkG8IVcyLqYK1hxmLPv.jpg", "title": "Beachside picnic with gourmet dining"}]', '[{"id": 456, "question": "What is the cost of a destination wedding at Taj Fort Aguada Resort & Spa, Goa?", "answer": "<p><strong>Taj Fort Aguada Resort &amp; Spa, Goa, offers wedding packages&nbsp;</strong>that usually range from INR 1.3 Cr to INR 2 Cr for a 3-day, 2-night ceremony. To get a closer estimate, use Viraaya Weddings'' cost calculator. Enter your room requirements, guest count, check-in and check-out dates, to get an estimate within seconds.</p>"}, {"id": 457, "question": "Which is the nearest airport to Taj Fort Aguada Resort & Spa, Goa?", "answer": "<p>Manohar International Airport (GOX), Mopa, is located around 35–37 km from&nbsp;<strong>Taj Fort Aguada Resort &amp; Spa, Goa</strong>. The drive from the airport to the resort usually takes about 1 hour 15 minutes.</p>"}, {"id": 458, "question": "What is the booking price for Taj Fort Aguada Resort & Spa in Goa through Viraaya Weddings?", "answer": "<p><strong>Booking Taj Fort Aguada Resort &amp; Spa, Goa&nbsp;</strong>through Viraaya Weddings can help you save 10-15% or more with exclusive negotiated prices. You also benefit from trusted vendor access and seamless, end-to-end planning support.</p>"}, {"id": 459, "question": "What is the check-in time at Taj Fort Aguada Resort & Spa, Goa, and can I check-in early?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Fort Aguada Resort &amp; Spa, Goa,&nbsp;</strong>is 2:00 pm, and check-out time is at 12:00 noon. Guests can request an early check-in, which is subject to hotel availability.</p>"}, {"id": 460, "question": "What is Taj Fort Aguada Resort & Spa, Goa’s liquor policy?", "answer": "<p>At&nbsp;<strong>Taj Fort Aguada Resort &amp; Spa, Goa,</strong> outside alcohol is not permitted within the property. All beverages must be purchased through the hotel and are charged separately based on consumption, as they are not included in standard wedding packages.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '354', '131'
