SELECT 'gwalior', 'taj-usha-kiran-palace-gwalior', 'published', 'Taj Usha Kiran Palace Gwalior Royal Wedding cost & Packages', 'Discover Taj Usha Kiran Palace Gwalior wedding cost, royal venue details, luxury stays, heritage architecture, décor, unforgettable wedding experiences.', 'taj usha kiran palace wedding cost, taj usha kiran palace gwalior wedding, taj usha kiran palace gwalior wedding cost, usha kiran palace gwalior wedding price, taj usha kiran palace wedding, taj usha kiran palace, taj usha kiran palace gwalior india', '/storage/hotel/seo/HPAreE2OecVdwPb22EMWnteel0AZqNSLVCy8YRa0.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/1Ydjob5hSssUnUVXInCU47AUc03oCB1RhXIOA1kD.jpg', 'Taj Usha Kiran Palace Gwalior', 'near Saraswati Shishu Mandir, Jayendraganj, Lashkar, Gwalior, Madhya Pradesh 474009, India', '25 Minutes', '10 minutes', '<p>Not every heritage hotel manages to feel genuinely lived-in, but&nbsp;<strong>Taj Usha Kiran Palace, Gwalior,</strong> still carries the mood of an old royal residence in which tales have unfolded for generations. Set beside the Jai Vilas Palace across a beautifully maintained 9-acre estate, this 5-star property was originally built in 1880 and today remains one of Gwalior’s most recognisable heritage addresses. You notice the details slowly here, the sandstone jaalis catching the midday light, vintage corridors opening into quiet courtyards and musicians filling the evenings with melodies from the Gwalior Gharana.</p><p>For couples considering a&nbsp;<strong>wedding at Taj Usha Kiran Palace, Gwalior</strong>, the setting works especially well for celebrations that feel intimate, elegant and deeply rooted in place. The indoor venues are relatively intimate at nearly 990 sq. ft., while the Navtaal Lawns create a far grander backdrop for open-air functions and royal-style receptions.</p><p>A&nbsp;<strong>wedding in Madhya Pradesh&nbsp;</strong>at this luxurious hotel feels less like checking into a hotel and more like hosting guests at a royal estate. Between heritage suites, traditional welcomes and heirloom cuisine, the celebrations naturally slow down in the best possible way.</p>', '50 rooms, suites with luxury tents', 'The State Room', 'The Navtaal Lawns', '150', '150', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/TKqnkYdIcXBFkyvfYGLhdKbpVOqS2UzaiXBr0vFw.jpg", "title": "3+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/9FK3j0HnKClbciMNjwzTsqtM6q226cDE2ByWto7U.jpg", "title": "Regal welcome with royal traditions"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/iPfYsMPg9wKbez5Qg7Hl4X9wYoSDUW9hDfCQATkU.jpg", "title": "Intimate royal feasts for couples"}]', '[{"id": 1077, "question": "Are there any nearby attractions or activities for international guests near Taj Usha Kiran Palace in Gwalior?", "answer": "<p>Yes, guests staying at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Usha Kiran Palace, Gwalior,&nbsp;</strong>can explore nearby attractions such as the majestic Gwalior Fort, Jai Vilas Palace, Gujari Mahal and the intricate Saas Bahu Temples. International guests can also visit local bazaars, attend the evening light-and-sound show at the fort and experience regional cuisine across the city.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 1078, "question": "What is the standard check-in time at Taj Usha Kiran Palace, Gwalior, and can guests get an early check-in?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Usha Kiran Palace, Gwalior,</strong> is 2:00 pm, while guests can check out by 12:00 noon. Guests can get an early check-in, but it is fully subject to the hotel''s discretion.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 1079, "question": "Can I host a pre-wedding photoshoot at Taj Usha Kiran Palace, Gwalior?", "answer": "<p>Yes, pre-wedding photoshoots are usually allowed at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Usha Kiran Palace.&nbsp;</strong>Permissions, timings and applicable charges can be confirmed with the Viraaya Weddings team.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 1080, "question": "What is the history of Taj Usha Kiran Palace, Gwalior?", "answer": "<p><strong>Taj Usha Kiran Palace in Gwalior</strong> was originally built in the late 19th century as a royal guest residence for the Scindia dynasty. Surrounded by lush greens, this heritage palace was later turned into one of Gwalior’s most celebrated luxury hotels while preserving its regal architecture and old-world charm.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 1081, "question": "What is the standard liquor policy of Taj Usha Kiran Palace, Gwalior, for weddings?", "answer": "<p><strong>Taj Usha Kiran Palace, Gwalior,</strong> offers an in-house bar service for weddings. Outside alcohol is generally not permitted, while liquor and beverages are billed separately based on consumption.</p>"}]', '275', '50'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'gwalior' AND `slug` = 'taj-usha-kiran-palace-gwalior');
--> statement-breakpoint
