SELECT 'hyderabad', 'hyderabad-marriott-hotel-and-convention-centre', 'published', 'Hyderabad Marriott Hotel Reviews, Wedding Cost and Venue', 'Discover Hyderabad Marriott Hotel & Convention Centre wedding cost, packages, guest reviews, luxury venues & memorable wedding celebrations. Book Now!', 'marriott hyderabad hotel wedding Cost, marriott hyderabad hotel review, marriott hyderabad hotel wedding package, marriott hotel hyderabad price​, marriott hotel hyderabad rooms', '/storage/hotel/seo/Z5MPsnlWwPXoZD2Ng7cia2V3T0QstLTVgEMGl2oX.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/d2KtFR0CgkTCAm6kZVvUdgneo491u9BhdFu5aYLV.jpg', 'Hyderabad Marriott Hotel And Convention Centre', 'Tank Bund Rd, opposite Hussain Sagar, Bhagyalaxmi Nagar, Lake, Hyderabad, Telangana 500080, India', '45 Minutes', '10 minutes', '<p>Positioned directly opposite Hussain Sagar Lake, the&nbsp;<strong>Hyderabad Marriott Hotel</strong> is one of the most visually striking addresses in the city. The lake is a shimmering presence across the property, providing a striking backdrop for functions and photoshoots. The dining spread here is notably distinct, including restaurants like Bidri, the hotel''s celebrated Indian restaurant and Altitude, a rooftop sky lounge and bar that looks out over Hussain Sagar and the city skyline.&nbsp;</p><p>The&nbsp;<strong>Hyderabad Marriott Hotel &amp; Convention Centre</strong> earns its reputation as one of the city''s foremost wedding venues on the strength of sheer scale and genuine versatility. Its total event footprint exceeds 46,000 sq ft, with a mix of indoor and outdoor spaces capable of hosting up to 1,400 guests. The Sapphire Ballroom, the property''s largest indoor venue, can accommodate banquet-style events with live performances and ceremonial processions. Outdoors, the Amethyst Garden provides a lakeside-adjacent setting for al fresco receptions and cocktail evenings.</p>', '295 room with suites', 'Sapphire Ballroom I, Sapphire Ballroom II, Sapphire Ballroom III, Emerald Hall, Diamond Hall, Ruby Hall, Topaz, Jade, Opal, Amber, Coral, Turquoise', 'Pearl Gardens, Amethyst Gardens', '600', '600', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/6KjawVbAWHbEpHvxMQ6W6aro81QrE6S1vsjs0rdG.jpg", "title": "4 in-house dining and bar destinations"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/kalvt3AHb7gzKGPPtBk92NDEnoWqm15mohQvdX9T.jpg", "title": "Marriott Certified Wedding Planners"}]', '[{"id": 917, "question": "Are there any special offers for wedding couples at Hyderabad Marriott Hotel & Convention Centre?", "answer": "<p><strong>Hyderabad Marriott Hotel &amp; Convention Centre</strong> offers wedding couples a range of privileges that vary based on the scale and nature of the booking. These may include complimentary stays, attractive group accommodation rates, dining experiences at Bidri or Altitude, spa access and chauffeur-driven transfers.</p>"}, {"id": 918, "question": "What is the peak wedding season at Hyderabad Marriott Hotel & Convention Centre?", "answer": "<p>The peak wedding season at&nbsp;<strong>Hyderabad Marriott Hotel &amp; Convention Centre</strong> is October through February, when the city''s weather is at its most agreeable for outdoor celebrations in the Amethyst Garden and large gatherings in the Sapphire Ballroom.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 919, "question": "What are the check-in and check-out timings at Hyderabad Marriott Hotel & Convention Centre, and are there early check-in or late check-out privileges for wedding couples?", "answer": "<p>Standard check-in at the&nbsp;<strong>Hyderabad Marriott Hotel &amp; Convention Centre&nbsp;</strong>is at 3:00 PM, and check-out is at 12:00 noon. Wedding couples and members of the bridal party may request early check-in or late check-out, subject to room availability on the relevant dates.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 920, "question": "Can I host a pre-wedding photoshoot at Hyderabad Marriott Hotel & Convention Centre?", "answer": "<p><strong>Hyderabad Marriott Hotel &amp; Convention Centre</strong> offers several compelling backdrops for pre-wedding photography. Couples with confirmed event or accommodation bookings at the hotel may request photoshoot access, subject to prior approval from the events team and venue availability.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 921, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol for wedding celebrations at Hyderabad Marriott Hotel & Convention Centre?", "answer": "<p>Outside alcohol is not permitted at Hyderabad Marriott Hotel &amp; Convention Centre for wedding or private events. All beverages are to be sourced exclusively through the hotel''s licensed in-house bar and beverage service.&nbsp;</p>"}]', '114', '295'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'hyderabad' AND `slug` = 'hyderabad-marriott-hotel-and-convention-centre');
--> statement-breakpoint
