SELECT 'hyderabad', 'itc-kohenur-a-luxury-collection-hotel-hyderabad', 'published', 'ITC Kohenur Luxury Collection Hyderabad Wedding Cost', 'Explore ITC Kohenur Hyderabad wedding cost, price & booking. Plan your royal wedding at ITC Kohenur A Luxury Collection Hotel Hyderabad at best rates.', 'itc kohenur hyderabad wedding cost, itc kohenur hyderabad wedding price, itc kohenur hyderabad booking, itc kohenur a luxury collection hotel hyderabad wedding cost, itc kohenur hyderabad"', '/storage/hotel/seo/wC7ceLhqrCqEkg4H0Rf4DdZ1ikHXhcdr8S30Cs4T.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/hVWc3FDdhbSKg1TS4AWIqwC99AZODqXPEVhSRNdp.jpg', 'ITC Kohenur a Luxury Collection Hotel Hyderabad', 'Plot No. 5, Survey No. 83/1, Hyderabad Knowledge City, Madhapur (HITEC City), Hyderabad, Telangana – 500032, India, India', '50 Minutes', '35 Minutes', '<p>Overlooking the Durgam Cheruvu Lake in HITEC City,&nbsp;<strong>ITC Kohenur in Hyderabad</strong> takes its inspiration from the famed Koh-i-Noor diamond.</p><p>A large share of the rooms and suites face the lake, mirroring its brilliance and bringing in natural light and open views. The hotel also stands out for its green credentials, with GRIHA 5-star and LEED Platinum ratings that reflect its conscious approach to luxury.</p><p>The hotel offers more than 31,000 sq. ft. of event space, including the Deccan State Room, one of the largest pillarless halls in the city, which can be divided into two sections and includes its own pre-function area. Outdoor venues such as the Pearl Deck and Golconda Greens add open-air options for celebrations, giving couples the flexibility to plan different events within the same property while keeping the experience comfortable for guests.</p>', '274', 'Deccan State Room', 'Golconda Greens, Dresden Green, Pearl Deck', '550', '560', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/2NUa6zX6Mbe0ls57pLeKWSFOh1TQnUxTflcTOGQw.jpg", "title": "8 in-house luxury restaurants and bars"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/Z3oor6g0oLuKSEbcnMc0fsV380xJyv9Olo7iU8D0.jpg", "title": "Pillarless ballroom venue"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/WjGEK4m96VOhZH6mcz4jgi4Q4G3QLZX22279O30S.jpg", "title": "Specialised couple massages"}]', '[{"id": 218, "question": "What is the nearest airport to ITC Kohenur, a Luxury Collection Hotel, Hyderabad?", "answer": "<p>The nearest airport to the&nbsp;<strong>ITC Kohenur, Hyderabad,&nbsp;</strong>is Rajiv Gandhi International Airport (HYD). It is approximately 37 kilometres away, usually a 35–40 minute drive from the hotel.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 219, "question": "What are the timing restrictions for events in ITC Kohenur, a Luxury Collection Hotel, Hyderabad?", "answer": "<p><strong>ITC Kohenur</strong> permits wedding events from 7:00 AM to 12:00 AM. Sound restrictions apply after 10:00 PM, and specific timings depend on your chosen banquet hall or outdoor venue.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 220, "question": "Does the ITC Kohenur, a Luxury Collection Hotel, Hyderabad, have laundry and salon services for wedding guests?", "answer": "<p>Yes,<strong> ITC Kohenur, a Luxury Collection Hotel, Hyderabad</strong>, offers both professional laundry and salon services for wedding guests. Through Lavanderia, guests have access to signature in-house dry cleaning and premium laundry care for their event attire. For beauty and grooming, the Kaya Kalp Salon provides a full range of hair and make-up services from 8:00 AM to 8:00 PM, ensuring wedding attendees are camera-ready.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 221, "question": "What are the official check-in and check-out timings at the ITC Kohenur, a Luxury Collection Hotel, Hyderabad?", "answer": "<p>The typical check-in and check-out timings at the<strong> ITC Kohenur, Hyderabad</strong>, are 3:00 PM and 12:00 noon. Wedding couples can request extensions through their coordinator, which are granted based on room availability or Marriott Bonvoy elite status.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 222, "question": "What is the official liquor policy of the Hyatt Regency Lucknow?", "answer": "<p>The&nbsp;<strong>ITC Kohenur, Hyderabad,&nbsp;</strong>allows alcohol consumption inside the property<strong>.&nbsp;</strong>However, liquor can only be supplied by the hotel’s in-house restaurants and bars. These will be billed separately.</p>"}]', '367', '274'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'hyderabad' AND `slug` = 'itc-kohenur-a-luxury-collection-hotel-hyderabad');
