SELECT 'hyderabad', 'le-meridien-hyderabad', 'published', 'Le Méridien Hyderabad Grand Wedding Cost & Venue Pricing', 'Discover Le Méridien Hyderabad wedding cost, booking & wedding packages with luxury venues, premium stays, catering & stylish décor. Check Out. Book Now!', 'le méridien hyderabad wedding, le méridien hyderabad wedding cost, le méridien hyderabad booking, le méridien hyderabad wedding package, le méridien hyderabad hotel wedding package', '/storage/hotel/seo/PnS3KuHirlUIu4J0CTMDVsKWrkV6BBTcaUqAQHg9.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/NRIzhxh2oM3gUub4AhtzkIf0qzyXB6N1n17Hr1gB.jpg', 'Le Meridien Hyderabad', 'Plot No: 25, 132, Gachibowli - Miyapur Rd, Jayabheri Enclave, Gachibowli, Hyderabad, Telangana 500032, India', '40 Minutes', '20 Minutes', '<p>The Le Méridien brand was born in a glamorous era of travel, celebrating all things cosmopolitan. At&nbsp;<strong>Le Méridien Hyderabad</strong> in Gachibowli, that philosophy takes root in one of the city''s most consequential neighbourhoods: the Financial District and HITEC City corridor. Its ISO 14001 certification reflects a strong commitment to sustainability, an increasingly important consideration for couples planning thoughtful celebrations. The hotel has also been recognised with the MakeMyTrip Customer Choice Award in the Luxury category, a distinction that is entirely dependent on guest experience and feedback.</p><p>Across 17,300 sq ft of dedicated event space,&nbsp;<strong>Le Méridien Hyderabad</strong> offers a well-serviced wedding environment for celebrations of varied scale. The Sapphire Ballroom can accommodate up to 800 guests in reception format, while the LM Lawn adds an outdoor dimension for evening events.&nbsp;</p>', '241 rooms with suites', 'Sapphire, Sapphire 1, Sapphire 2, Ruby, Emerald, Amber', 'LM Lawn', '500', '500', '[{"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal02.png", "title": "4 in-house dining and bar destinations"}, {"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal03.png", "title": "Couple massages at Tattva Spa"}, {"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal04.png", "title": "Marriott Certified Wedding Planners"}]', '[{"id": 912, "question": "What is the nearest airport to Le Méridien Hyderabad?", "answer": "<p>The nearest airport to&nbsp;<strong>Le Méridien Hyderabad&nbsp;</strong>is Rajiv Gandhi International Airport (IATA: HYD), located approximately 33.8 kilometres from the hotel''s Gachibowli address.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 913, "question": "Are there any restrictions on music for wedding events at Le Méridien Hyderabad?", "answer": "<p><strong>Le Méridien Hyderabad</strong> permits live music and DJ performances within its designated indoor event spaces, including the Sapphire Ballroom and its sub-sections. For outdoor events on the LM Lawn or the rooftop terrace, music is subject to the hotel''s operational guidelines and applicable local noise regulations.</p>"}, {"id": 914, "question": "How soon should I book Le Méridien Hyderabad for my wedding?", "answer": "<p>Gachibowli''s growing profile as Hyderabad''s premium business and lifestyle district has made L<strong>e Méridien Hyderabad</strong> increasingly sought after for weddings, particularly during the October-to-February peak season when the city''s weather is most conducive to outdoor celebrations.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 915, "question": "What are the check-in and check-out timings at Le Méridien Hyderabad? Can I avail early checkin or late check-out?", "answer": "<p>Standard check-in at&nbsp;<strong>Le Méridien Hyderabad</strong> is at 2:00 PM, and check-out is at 12:00 noon. Early check-in or late check-out for wedding couples may be available, subject to room availability on the relevant dates, and are best arranged in advance through the hotel''s front desk or the dedicated wedding coordinator.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 916, "question": "What is the official liquor policy at Le Méridien Hyderabad for wedding events?", "answer": "<p>As a Marriott International property,&nbsp;<strong>Le Méridien Hyderabad</strong> requires that all alcoholic and non-alcoholic beverages served at weddings and private events on the premises be sourced through the hotel''s licensed in-house bar and beverage service. Outside alcohol is not permitted.&nbsp;</p>"}]', '115', '241'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'hyderabad' AND `slug` = 'le-meridien-hyderabad');
