SELECT 'hyderabad', 'novotel-hyderabad-convention-centre', 'published', 'Novotel Hyderabad Convention Centre Luxury Wedding Cost', 'Discover Novotel Hyderabad Convention Centre wedding cost, wedding packages, guest reviews, venue details & luxury accommodations. Contact Us to Book Now!', 'novotel hyderabad convention centre wedding, novotel hyderabad convention centre wedding cost, novotel hyderabad convention centre wedding price, novotel hyderabad convention centre wedding package, novotel hyderabad convention centre marriages', '/storage/hotel/seo/o4kBj1BjAGZSBSv6OUAK9tHk9PXR0C8s1QBsgQNY.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/yjjZLK61hv1S5jjxid3yydyjtYmAsTNiD5i1qkqB.jpg', 'Novotel Hyderabad Convention Centre', 'Novotel Hotel Rd, Izzathnagar, Shilpa Hills, Kothaguda, Hyderabad, Telangana 500084, India', '60 Minutes', '45 Minutes', '<p>Most hotels in HITEC City offer a corporate address.&nbsp;<strong>Novotel Hyderabad Convention Centre</strong> is something different: 15 acres of landscaped gardens in the middle of Hyderabad''s IT district. The property is ECO-certified, managed by Accor and directly connected to the Hyderabad International Convention Centre. Guests can access multiple dining options, a fully equipped O2 Spa, a large outdoor pool and a 24-hour fitness centre without leaving the property.&nbsp;</p><p>For over 19 years, the Hyderabad International Convention Centre at Novotel Hyderabad has been the city''s most sought-after wedding destination. The HICC''s full hall accommodates over 5,000 guests, while the hotel''s own Convention Halls and Ballroom handle everything from 276 to 2,050 guests in between. Outdoor weddings take place in lawn and garden spaces, with baarat processions and open-air receptions fitting naturally into the 15-acre grounds. Event managers at&nbsp;<strong>Novotel Hyderabad Convention Centre&nbsp;</strong>work directly alongside the property''s approved panel of decorators to execute custom setups.&nbsp;</p>', '287 rooms with suites', 'HICC All Halls, Granite (1.2,3,4,5), Ballroom', 'Lawns, Gardens, Poolside', '500', '500', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/HGLl70BO5ivq7mC6zdRq7XhsYbWE9EYEUZjfND8Q.jpg", "title": "5 dining and bar destinations"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/eJwjSG2a1JKi8FsXzeD4RIoHjkHiYTABE1uOflXB.jpg", "title": "24/7 AV support for events"}]', '[{"id": 997, "question": "What are the check-in and check-out timings at Novotel Hyderabad Convention Centre, and are there any early check-in or late check-out privileges for wedding guests?", "answer": "<p>Check-in and check-out timings at<strong> Novotel Hyderabad Convention Centre</strong> are standard, with check-in being at 2:00 PM and checkout being at noon. Wedding guests and the bridal party requiring early check-in or late check-out are advised to request this in advance through the hotel''s reservations or wedding coordination team, subject to availability on the relevant dates.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 998, "question": "Are drones and fireworks allowed at Novotel Hyderabad Convention Centre for wedding events?", "answer": "<p>Firecrackers and fireworks are not permitted at Novotel Hyderabad Convention Centre. Baraat processions are allowed at the property. The use of drones is subject to applicable civil aviation regulations in Hyderabad and requires prior written approval from the hotel’s events team.</p>"}, {"id": 999, "question": "How early should I book the Novotel Hyderabad Convention Centre for a wedding?", "answer": "<p>Approach the&nbsp;<strong>Novotel Hyderabad Convention Centre</strong> events team at least 12 to 18 months in advance. Early engagement is always advisable to secure preferred dates and venue configurations.</p>"}, {"id": 1000, "question": "Does Novotel Hyderabad Convention Centre offer laundry and salon services for wedding guests?", "answer": "<p>Novotel Hyderabad Convention Centre provides laundry and dry-cleaning services for in-house guests, available through the hotel''s housekeeping team. For beauty and grooming, the O2 Spa offers a range of treatments.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 1001, "question": "What is the official liquor policy at Novotel Hyderabad Convention Centre for wedding events?", "answer": "<p>All alcoholic beverages served at weddings and private events at&nbsp;<strong>Novotel Hyderabad Convention Centr</strong>e must be sourced through the hotel''s licensed in-house bar and beverage service. Outside alcohol is not permitted on the premises. These drinks will be billed separately from food and venue charges.</p>"}]', '290', '287'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'hyderabad' AND `slug` = 'novotel-hyderabad-convention-centre');
