SELECT 'hyderabad', 'radisson-blu-plaza-hotel-hyderabad-banjara-hills', 'published', 'Radisson Blu Hyderabad Banjara Hills – Wedding Cost & Stay', 'Radisson Blu Banjara Hills Hyderabad offers sophisticated event spaces for grand weddings. Explore wedding cost guides, venue options & direct booking.', 'radisson blu hyderabad wedding, radisson blu hyderabad wedding cost, radisson blu hyderabad, radisson blu plaza hyderabad, radisson blu banjara hills hyderabad, radisson blu hotel hyderabad', '/storage/hotel/seo/lpn9QpucSe32ZEiu5q3eNJpNaDBWv2nLlKX6YDpf.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/Y2VX4VahbGH4vrTDxyc4bWPlQtnKlUJDwkdA2Ttt.jpg', 'Radisson Blu Plaza Hotel Hyderabad Banjara Hills', '8-2-409, Road No.6, Green Valley, Banjara Hills, Hyderabad, Telangana 500034, India', '45 Minutes', '25 Minutes', '<p>Glass façades, glowing city lights and sleek contemporary interiors give&nbsp;<strong>Radisson Blu Plaza Hotel Hyderabad Banjara Hills</strong> the feel of a modern urban celebration space designed for stylish weddings. Set in one of Hyderabad’s most premium neighbourhoods, this 5-star luxury hotel places guests close to GVK One, Hussain Sagar Lake and the city’s buzzing social scene while still feeling calm once you step inside. For couples planning a&nbsp;<strong>wedding at Radisson Blu Hyderabad</strong> or a&nbsp;<strong>wedding in Hyderabad</strong>, the location brings together convenience, energy and polished luxury.</p><p>Inside&nbsp;<strong>Radisson Blu Plaza Hotel Hyderabad Banjara Hills</strong>, the atmosphere leans sophisticated and cosmopolitan, with dramatic lighting, floor-to-ceiling windows and refined contemporary styling throughout the property. The Azure Ballroom spans nearly 3,563 sq metres, creating an elegant setting for receptions, cocktail nights and intimate wedding functions, while the poolside deck adds a relaxed open-air touch for smaller celebrations.</p><p>What makes&nbsp;<strong>Radisson Blu Plaza Hotel Hyderabad Banjara Hills</strong> memorable is the way everything feels easy and well put together. From dinners at Holy Basil to laid-back evenings at Chill Restaurant &amp; Terrace and skyline-view rooms, the hotel creates a wedding atmosphere that feels stylish, lively and genuinely welcoming.</p>', '158 rooms with suites', 'Azure Ballrooms', 'The Poolside', '350', '350', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/QoHSvfsGoEMuPTkXTahKKcMdUMTc2WfVARj2JTRi.jpg", "title": "4+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/YOfl4vgR4K3RP9wieJITI4JOX3LR0fp0qN7VoTQN.jpg", "title": "Skyline bay-window breakfast moments"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/8nXafqsFaz13AD43Q3uhRVf6XU253PwVrFixvMzl.jpg", "title": "Candlelit terrace dining under stars"}]', '[{"id": 957, "question": "Which months are most popular for weddings at Radisson Blu Hotel Hyderabad?", "answer": "<p>November to February are usually the busiest wedding months at&nbsp;<strong>Radisson Blu Hotel Hyderabad.</strong> April and May also remain popular because of favourable Muhurtham dates.</p>"}, {"id": 958, "question": "What is the check-in time, and can we get an early check-in to Radisson Blu Plaza Hotel Hyderabad Banjara Hills?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Radisson Blu Plaza Hyderabad</strong> is 2:00 pm, while check-out is by 12:00 noon. Guests can get an early check-in to the hotel, but it is entirely subject to the hotel’s discretion.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 959, "question": "Are there suggested excursions or experiences near the Radisson Blu Plaza Hotel Hyderabad?", "answer": "<p>Guests can explore Charminar, Golconda Fort, Hussain Sagar Lake, Laad Bazaar and Chowmahalla Palace near&nbsp;<strong>Radisson Blu Plaza Hotel Hyderabad</strong>. Ramoji Film City also makes for a popular day excursion.</p>"}, {"id": 960, "question": "Is outside catering allowed at Radisson Blu Plaza Hyderabad?", "answer": "<p>Since&nbsp;<strong>Radisson Blu Plaza Hyderabad</strong> offers an in-house culinary experience, outside catering is usually not allowed. However, couples can confirm special dining requests directly with the hotel team.</p>"}, {"id": 961, "question": "What is the standard liquor policy at Radisson Blu Plaza Hotel Hyderabad?", "answer": "<p>Outside alcohol is not allowed at Radisson Blu Plaza Hyderabad. All beverages and drinks must be sourced through the hotel’s in-house bar, and they will be billed separately from standard wedding packages.</p>"}]', '310', '158'
