SELECT 'hyderabad', 'sheraton-hyderabad-hotel', 'published', 'Sheraton Hyderabad Hotel Wedding Cost, Reviews & Bookings', 'Discover Sheraton Hyderabad Hotel wedding cost, banquet hall details, booking info, guest reviews & elegant celebrations for weddings & special events.', 'sheraton hotel rooms hyderabad, sheraton hyderabad hotel booking, sheraton hyderabad hotel gachibowli review​, sheraton hyderabad hotel Wedding, sheraton hyderabad hotel Wedding Cost', '/storage/hotel/seo/LSw6554Y8vXrqqWltrOu3FDgtf4eCWFzUwpAnX1T.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/Lv3CtkQ7WIaNqhpDYiMyW1WUrWF4v28msBhKNt1y.jpg', 'Sheraton Hyderabad Hotel', '115/1, Nanakramguda Rd, Financial District, Gachibowli, Hyderabad, Nanakramguda, Telangana 500032, India', '40 Minutes', '45 Minutes', '<p>Big glass panels, clean vertical lines and a skyline that feels close enough to touch give&nbsp;<strong>Sheraton Hyderabad Hotel</strong> a very specific kind of presence in Gachibowli. Set in Nanakramguda, right inside the Financial District, this 5-star luxury hotel sits in the middle of Hyderabad’s corporate core but still manages to feel composed once you step inside. The Nehru Outer Ring Road makes airport access straightforward at about 25 to 30 minutes, while HITEC City, Jubilee Hills cafés and Inorbit Mall are all an easy drive away.</p><p>A&nbsp;<strong>wedding at Sheraton Hyderabad Hotel</strong> is very much shaped by its modern, city-facing design. The Jade Ballroom, about 409 square metres in size, works well for larger gatherings, while the terrace and poolside deck are often chosen for more relaxed moments like haldi functions or evening cocktails. With 284 rooms and suites, including 56 serviced apartments, it suits residential weddings where families stay together and the entire celebration moves across a few days without feeling rushed.</p><p>What stands out about a&nbsp;<strong>wedding in Hyderabad at Sheraton Hyderabad Hotel</strong> is how it sits in the middle of everything yet never feels chaotic. Guests often end up exploring nearby spots like Golconda Fort, Hussain Sagar Lake and the restaurants of Jubilee Hills between functions, before returning to a hotel that feels steady, modern and easy to settle into.</p>', '284 rooms with suites, including 56 serviced apartments', 'Jade Banquet Halls', 'The Poolside Lawn Deck, The Open Terrace', '600', '600', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/qANuGmv7Z5VF3D5h3cgAc07qc6AUwFMLW196LxZw.jpg", "title": "4+ dining venues onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/uXz2lXHg4MKFB9ZC0qmdJVrVJwbdSz3jdu3YkVde.jpg", "title": "Couples skyline dining experience"}]', '[{"id": 1238, "question": "Can guests explore local sights during their stay at Sheraton Hyderabad Hotel?", "answer": "<p>Guests at&nbsp;<strong>Sheraton Hyderabad Hotel</strong> can visit Hyderabad’s key attractions during their stay. Popular places near the hotel include Golconda Fort, Charminar, Hussain Sagar Lake, Birla Mandir, Shilparamam, Salar Jung Museum and Inorbit Mall, all within convenient driving distance.</p>"}, {"id": 1239, "question": "What is the standard check-in and check-out time at Sheraton Hyderabad Hotel, and can I get an early check-in?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Sheraton Hyderabad Hotel</strong> is 2:00 pm, and check-out time is 12:00 noon. Yes, you can be accommodated with an early check-in, provided that the hotel has availability.</p>"}, {"id": 1240, "question": "What are the timing restrictions for events/music at Sheraton Hyderabad Hotel?", "answer": "<p>At&nbsp;<strong>Sheraton Hyderabad Hotel</strong>, music and event timings are guided by Telangana state rules as well as hotel policies. The exact cut-off times are shared closer to the event by the hotel events team, depending on the venue and setup.</p>"}, {"id": 1241, "question": "How much can I save if I book the Sheraton Hyderabad Hotel through Viraaya Weddings?", "answer": "<p><strong>Booking at Sheraton Hyderabad Hotel&nbsp;</strong>through Viraaya Weddings can offer around 10-15 per cent savings through negotiated pricing, along with smoother vendor coordination.</p>"}, {"id": 1242, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol to Sheraton Hyderabad Hotel?", "answer": "<p>At&nbsp;<strong>Sheraton Hyderabad Hotel</strong>, outside alcohol is not permitted for events. All beverages are served through the hotel’s in-house bar, with billing managed separately from the wedding package.</p>"}]', '296', '284'
