SELECT 'hyderabad', 'taj-deccan-hyderabad', 'published', 'Taj Deccan Hyderabad - Weddings, Cost & Hotel Booking', 'Taj Deccan Hyderabad offers iconic event spaces & personalised wedding packages. Explore cost guides, venue options & easy booking for your big day today.', 'taj deccan hyderabad booking​, taj deccan hyderabad events​, taj deccan hyderabad banquet hall​, taj deccan hyderabad wedding, taj deccan hyderabad package, taj deccan hyderabad reservation​, taj deccan hyderabad reviews', '/storage/hotel/seo/TXo2YKDYGUfI25IGwCKiIlrF2UZLPd6tMMwBnz9s.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/SPuFwG5t8rMIFXORFU8WUuMcGWCl05comSTy7dHS.jpg', 'Taj Deccan Hyderabad', 'Road No. 1, Balapur Basthi, Banjara Hills, Hyderabad, Telangana 500034, India', '45 Minutes', '25 Minutes', '<p>A quiet sense of greenery, softened stone architecture and a central atrium lobby set the tone the moment you enter&nbsp;<strong>Taj Deccan, Hyderabad</strong>. Spread across nearly 6 acres in Banjara Hills, this 5-star luxury hotel feels like a calm pause within Hyderabad’s most active neighbourhood. Recently refreshed with modern interiors while retaining its classic mid-rise design, the property balances understated elegance with everyday ease, all just 40 to 45 minutes from Rajiv Gandhi International Airport and close to GVK One Mall, Hussain Sagar Lake and Birla Mandir.</p><p>A&nbsp;<strong>wedding at Taj Deccan, Hyderabad</strong> usually moves between a few very different settings, and that is what makes it interesting. The Kohinoor Ballroom and other indoor spaces work well for formal celebrations, while the lawns bring in a more relaxed, open-air feel for larger gatherings or daytime functions. With around 151 to 156 rooms and suites, it works well for residential weddings.</p><p>What people often notice about a&nbsp;<strong>wedding in Hyderabad at Taj Deccan, Hyderabad,</strong> is how unhurried everything feels once you are inside. The service is present but never intrusive, and there is a quiet rhythm to how events unfold across the day. You are still close to the city, with shopping, lakeside walks and heritage spots nearby, but within the hotel, it feels contained, familiar and easy to settle into for a few days of celebration.</p>', '156 rooms with suites', 'The Kohinoor, Synergy Banquet Hall, Goldenmile, Evoque Hall', 'The Main Lawns', '350', '350', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/iKWqCdtKrB0EVhJKgsM5IrBgPiEyG4csGlBRzhCs.jpg", "title": "3+ dining venues onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/cnQNz4RzDRfBH3KlfAzV1k9cVpSX7ORoQxLA4Nbf.jpg", "title": "Couples private dining indulgence"}]', '[{"id": 1138, "question": "Is outside catering allowed at Taj Deccan, Hyderabad?", "answer": "<p>No, outside catering is not allowed at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Deccan, Hyderabad,</strong> as an in-house culinary teams handle all event dining, so it is best to confirm specifics with hotel management.</p>"}, {"id": 1139, "question": "What is the check-in and check-out time at Taj Deccan, Hyderabad, and can guests avail an early check-in?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Deccan, Hyderabad,</strong> is 2:00 pm, and check-out time is 12:00 noon. Guests can get an early check-in to the hotel, but it is entirely subject to the hotel’s discretion.</p>"}, {"id": 1140, "question": "Can we bring our own wedding planner or decorator to Taj Deccan, Hyderabad?", "answer": "<p>Subject to hotel approval and coordination, outside wedding planners and decorators are usually allowed at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Deccan, Hyderabad</strong>. Final arrangements are confirmed in advance with the hotel management to ensure everything runs smoothly.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 1141, "question": "How early should I book Taj Deccan, Hyderabad, for a wedding?", "answer": "<p>It is advisable to book<strong> Taj Deccan, Hyderabad,</strong> at least 12 to 18 months in advance, especially for peak wedding dates, to ensure preferred venues and better availability.</p>"}, {"id": 1142, "question": "What is the standard liquor policy at Taj Deccan, Hyderabad?", "answer": "<p>At<strong> Taj Deccan</strong>,&nbsp;<strong>Hyderabad</strong>, in-house bar service is available for weddings, and all beverages are served through the hotel. Outside alcohol is not permitted, and bar billing is handled separately from the wedding package.</p>"}]', '303', '156'
