SELECT 'hyderabad', 'taj-falaknuma-palace-hyderabad', 'published', 'Taj Falaknuma Palace Hyderabad Wedding Cost Explained', 'Why dream small? Taj Falaknuma Palace Hyderabad offers India''s most iconic palace wedding, honest cost details & smooth booking. Get Details Now!', 'taj falaknuma palace hyderabad wedding cost, taj falaknuma palace hyderabad wedding, taj falaknuma palace hyderabad booking, taj falaknuma palace hyderabad india, taj falaknuma palace hyderabad photos', '/storage/hotel/seo/x9ffT9T9IKOL3RuQtpJgc7ATERSuE7AcEqCkZ6f5.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/2acHZjo41aFJWFjzFarY6R6pHjISVWBhQaK4xNtD.jpg', 'Taj Falaknuma Palace Hyderabad', 'Engine Bowli, Falaknuma, Hyderabad, Telangana 500053, India', '40 Minutes', '5 Minutes', '<p>A&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at Taj Falaknuma Palace</strong> begins long before the first function. You arrive at the base of the hill and make your way up, slowly leaving the city behind. By the time you reach the palace, set nearly 600 metres above sea level, the mood has already shifted. Built in the late 19th century and later home to the Nizam, the palace-turned-luxury hotel still carries that sense of arrival, with sweeping staircases, intricate interiors and views that stretch across the city.</p><p>For couples planning an intimate&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Hyderabad</strong>, the scale at<strong> Taj Falaknuma Palace&nbsp;</strong>may help out. With only 60 accommodations, it naturally leans towards more private, close-knit celebrations. Venues like the Durbar Hall and 101 Dining Hall bring a sense of occasion without much decor, while the terraces and gardens open up for mehendi, haldi and sangeet functions, offering an atmospheric feel as the sun sets.</p><p>Taj’s hospitality is steady and thoughtful, without seeming overwhelming. Quick and smooth service quietly moves forward in the background, dining feels well-thought and the entire stay experience at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Falaknuma Palace in Hyderabad</strong> feels like it’s been hosted, not managed.</p>', '60', '101 Dining Hall, Coronation Hall, Durbar Hall, Jade Room', 'Main Lawns, Rajasthani Gardens, Jade Terrace, Pool Lawns', '120', '150', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/gaz5Et4cpCr3iaB1MYwbqNGC7oorY8CvOivukBwL.jpg", "title": "4+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/qCK7d0j1kGgFNkkR6bzs7D6lda1y2Ma28nDTeta5.jpg", "title": "Grand carriage arrival with rose petals"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/gEwlXJeK2QPGMWm9gFjPu1MeoUNnFG0CrKBP9FW6.jpg", "title": "Heritage high tea with live music"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/SwzVbsO4n5HF60AXNg8X8nNGjsqWAJkFVUXOvAvv.jpg", "title": "Private starlit dining experiences"}]', '[{"id": 636, "question": "How to reach the Taj Falaknuma Palace in Hyderabad from the nearest airport?", "answer": "<p>The closest airport to&nbsp;<strong>Taj Falaknuma Palace&nbsp;</strong>is Rajiv Gandhi International Airport (RGIA). It’s located about 13-15 km away, about a 25–30-minute drive.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 637, "question": "Is early check-in available for wedding guests at the Taj Falaknuma Palace in Hyderabad?", "answer": "<p>Yes, guests can check in early at the hotel, subject to availability. The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Falaknuma Palace, Hyderabad</strong> is 2:00 pm, and check-out is at 12:00 noon.</p>"}, {"id": 638, "question": "What is the history of the Taj Falaknuma Palace, Hyderabad?", "answer": "<p><strong>Taj Falaknuma Palace, Hyderabad,</strong> was built in 1894 as the Nizam’s residence, later restored by Princess Esra, preserving its Edwardian interiors and turning it into a luxury heritage hotel in 2010.</p>"}, {"id": 639, "question": "What is the ideal budget for a 2-night wedding at Taj Falaknuma Palace, Hyderabad?", "answer": "<p>The standard cost of a<strong> destination wedding at Taj Falaknuma Palace, Hyderabad,</strong> falls somewhere between INR 1.5 Cr and INR 2.5 Cr. Use Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator to get an exact quote tailored to your budget and requirements.</p>"}, {"id": 640, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol to Taj Falaknuma Palace, Hyderabad?", "answer": "<p>No, outside alcohol is not allowed at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Falaknuma Palace, Hyderabad.</strong> All beverages must be arranged through the hotel’s in-house bar and are billed separately from standard wedding packages based on consumption.</p>"}]', '112', '60'
