SELECT 'hyderabad', 'taj-krishna-hyderabad', 'published', 'Taj Krishna Hyderabad Luxury Wedding Cost & Package Details', 'Discover Taj Krishna Hyderabad wedding cost, banquet hall prices & booking details with luxury venues, premium stays, catering & décor. Check Out Now!', 'taj krishna hyderabad wedding cost​, taj krishna hotel hyderabad buffet price​, taj krishna hyderabad banquet hall prices, taj krishna hyderabad wedding​, taj krishna hyderabad buffet price, taj krishna hyderabad banquet hall', '/storage/hotel/seo/atO7paqFqcIsQ9QC4wfoI7fMph9HM4HbZP64fkqx.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/bKXP4hGTbbdBvejbRfwT5P46QffgmvlDaMtJazRS.jpg', 'Taj Krishna Hyderabad', 'Road No 1, Mada Manzil, Banjara Hills, Hyderabad, Telangana 500034, India', '40 Minutes', '15 minutes', '<p><strong>Taj Krishna, Hyderabad</strong> sits on 14 acres of immaculately maintained lawns on Banjara Hills. It is one of the oldest Taj properties in the city, with butler service and 24-hour in-room dining available for guests. Moreover, it offers guests extra privacy and elite perks through its exclusive business club, The Chambers. For relaxation and fitness, the hotel features traditional Indian spa treatments at J Wellness Circle, an outdoor pool, yoga sessions and a complete gym. Together, these premium amenities make the property one of the most self-contained luxury hotels in Hyderabad.</p><p>For weddings, the 14 acres of grounds at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Krishna, Hyderabad</strong> are the starting point. The Lawns make for one of the finest outdoor wedding settings in the city, with the hotel''s grand facade as a natural backdrop. Indoors, the property ranges from The Garden Room, with a sun-filled space for mid- to large-scale functions, to the Grand Ballroom for full-scale celebrations of up to 1,000 guests. Taj''s Timeless Weddings programme brings dedicated wedding specialists who manage everything, drawing on a tradition of hosting landmark weddings across India.</p>', '261 rooms with suites', 'Grand Ballroom, The Emerald, The Garden Room, The Sapphire, The Golden Room, The Pearl Room', 'The Gardenia', '600', '600', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/utSxK0V6FS3HKvZsF3MPJpXBm8YyFjAcfqG2VPI7.jpg", "title": "5 global cuisine lounges and bars"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/Kjh5CMmvUWolvEy1kqKptm2t5vPIZziWF4Dc8DeJ.jpg", "title": "Specialised bridal spas at J Wellness Circle"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/4k10lC7hYrI0yU12fj0JiwzWyJHmPz3wKgATP365.jpg", "title": "In-house pre-wedding photoshoots"}]', '[{"id": 817, "question": "What is the nearest airport to Taj Krishna, Hyderabad?", "answer": "<p>The nearest airport to&nbsp;<strong>Taj Krishna, Hyderabad,</strong> is Rajiv Gandhi International Airport, located approximately 25 kilometres from the hotel''s Banjara Hills address, with a drive time of roughly 45–50 minutes depending on traffic and the route taken.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 818, "question": "Does Taj Krishna, Hyderabad, offer laundry and salon services for wedding guests?", "answer": "<p>Yes.&nbsp;<strong>Taj Krishna, Hyderabad,</strong> provides both laundry and dry-cleaning services for in-house guests, available on request through the hotel''s housekeeping team.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 819, "question": "What are the check-in and check-out timings at Taj Krishna, Hyderabad, and are there early check-in or late check-out privileges?", "answer": "<p>Standard check-in at Taj Krishna, Hyderabad is at 2:00 PM, and check-out is at 12:00 noon. Guests requiring early check-in or late check-out are advised to notify the hotel in advance, as these are subject to availability on the day. Taj InnerCircle Neupass members may be eligible for preferential treatment on such requests.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 820, "question": "Can I host a pre-wedding photoshoot at Taj Krishna, Hyderabad?", "answer": "<p><strong>Taj Krishna&nbsp;</strong>offers some of the most naturally photogenic settings of any hotel in the city. Couples with confirmed event or accommodation bookings may request photoshoots, subject to prior approval from the events team and applicable fees for specific venue spaces.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 821, "question": "What is the official liquor policy at Taj Krishna, Hyderabad, for wedding events?", "answer": "<p><strong>Taj Krishna, Hyderabad</strong> operates a fully licensed in-house bar and beverage facilities, and all alcohol served at weddings and private events on the premises is required to be sourced through the hotel. Outside alcohol is not permitted.</p>"}]', '117', '261'
