SELECT 'hyderabad', 'the-leela-hyderabad', 'published', 'The Leela Hyderabad Grand Wedding Cost & Venue Booking', 'Discover The Leela Hyderabad hotel wedding cost, packages & booking details, premium stays, catering, décor & elegant wedding celebrations. Book with us!', 'the leela hyderabad Hotel Wedding, the leela hyderabad Hotel Wedding Cost, the leela hyderabad wedding cost, the leela hyderabad wedding package, the leela hyderabad prices​, the leela palace hyderabad', '/storage/hotel/seo/su0Jy8dE3dqRZRpNp7asI2jUsf3Y6TWVDrehMKLr.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/A7JrGTZDSbASdtFNHAc4X6LnI77OHiIZjmQ4PSkR.jpg', 'The Leela Hyderabad', 'Road No. 2, Sagar Society, Sri Nagar Colony, Aurora Colony, Banjara Hills, Hyderabad, Telangana 500034, India', '50 Minutes', '15 minutes', '<p>Despite opening only in late 2024, a&nbsp;<strong>wedding at The Leela Hyderabad&nbsp;</strong>has already become a much sought-after choice among couples looking for a regal celebration in the city. The hotel’s palace-like aesthetic, featuring Turkish chandeliers, gilded ceilings, hand-painted murals and Warangal architecture, creates cinematic zones that feel deeply connected to Hyderabad’s royal heritage. More than simply a luxury venue, the 5-star property feels made for celebrations that value exclusivity, warmth and a real sense of place.</p><p>For couples planning a&nbsp;<strong>wedding in Hyderabad</strong>, the property offers the kind of setting where celebrations naturally flow from one experience to another. Spread across 2.5 acres in Banjara Hills, the hotel feels intimate yet grand, with over 930 sq. m. of event space designed for elegant, highly curated celebrations. Families gather over heirloom Deccan cuisine, guests move between atmospheric terraces and the Isfahan Ballroom and every event feels deeply connected to the city’s old-world charm.</p><p><strong>The Leela Hyderabad</strong> is especially suited for couples who want a lavish yet thoughtfully curated wedding experience. With elegant ballrooms, atmospheric outdoor spaces, personalised hospitality and 156 luxurious accommodations, the hotel creates a celebration that feels warm, polished and deeply memorable without losing its sense of intimacy.</p>', '156 rooms with suites', 'Isfahan Ballroom, Isfahan Pre-Function Area, Raya Ballroom', 'Raen Terrace', '350', '350', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/sOYLtrEn8kBHbKEmES9hRoBLZMQXWUpqN4vTnBjt.jpg", "title": "4+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/UOtj9952lPECJ8lHfOSp7lgGeqydXqcwq6eO2AaY.jpg", "title": "Romantic evenings beneath glowing lamps"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/UM1ntRfUcKK0PoNW9wVePq7f0veRpT66o9jSchFV.jpg", "title": "Couples’ dining at Raen Terrace"}]', '[{"id": 1111, "question": "What are the standard check-in and check-out times at The Leela Hyderabad, and is early check-in allowed?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>The Leela Hyderabad</strong> is 2:00 pm, while guests can check out by 12:00 noon. An early check-in facility can be arranged, subject to hotel availability.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 1112, "question": "Are there suggested excursions or experiences near The Leela Hyderabad?", "answer": "<p>Yes, guests staying at&nbsp;<strong>The Leela Hyderabad</strong> can explore Charminar, Chowmahalla Palace and the bustling Laad Bazaar. Couples often enjoy heritage walks, sunset drives around Hussain Sagar Lake and curated culinary experiences across Hyderabad’s old and new cities.</p>"}, {"id": 1113, "question": "When is the peak wedding season at The Leela Hyderabad?", "answer": "<p>Peak wedding season at<strong> The Leela Hyderabad</strong> usually runs from November to February, when Hyderabad enjoys pleasant weather and the most sought-after wedding dates. April and May also see strong demand before Chaturmas begins.</p>"}, {"id": 1114, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol to a wedding at The Leela Hyderabad?", "answer": "<p>No, outside alcohol is not allowed at weddings hosted at&nbsp;<strong>The Leela Hyderabad.&nbsp;</strong>The hotel manages bar and beverage service through its in-house team, with liquor consumption billed separately from the wedding package.</p>"}]', '118', '156'
