SELECT 'hyderabad', 'the-park-hyderabad', 'published', 'The Park Hyderabad Booking, Events and Wedding Cost', 'Discover The Park Hyderabad wedding Cost, banquet hall prices, booking details, event spaces, luxury stays, & stylish celebrations. Contact Us for Bookings', 'the park hyderabad booking, the park hyderabad events, the park hyderabad wedding​, the park hyderabad online booking​, the park hyderabad price marriage', '/storage/hotel/seo/oO29mY6peRZ87MlKx7yS5kBjx6jmdOlwRpL8N4i3.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/n50o8ekGvsAMJJ8sP2LTvankrMV0pRCZ1lzMQ9c5.jpg', 'THE PARK HYDERABAD', '22, Raj Bhavan Rd, Somajiguda, Hyderabad, Telangana 500082, India', '60 Minutes', '15 minutes', '<p>On Raj Bhavan Road in Somajiguda,&nbsp;<strong>The Park Hyderabad</strong> occupies a position that is both central and culturally deliberate. As a member of Design Hotels™, the globally curated collection of design-led properties, The Park is recognised for its distinctive creative identity. The interiors draw from Hyderabad''s traditions of precious stone and textile craft, with Nizami-era influences.&nbsp;</p><p>The Trillion Ballroom is The Park Hyderabad''s headline wedding space, with 902 sq mt of flexible, high-ceilinged settings that can hold up to 1,400 guests in reception format. The venue is divided into multiple sections and comes fully equipped with AV facilities, DJ and console setup, floral décor, themed catering, photography support and dedicated travel assistance. Smaller and more intimate functions can be held in the Open Dining Court, which opens out onto the infinity pool with a green wall backdrop; a distinctive setting for a mehendi, haldi or private dinner. The hotel''s subterranean nightclub, Kismet, is also available for wedding after-parties and sangeet events, giving the celebration a nightlife dimension that most hotel wedding venues simply cannot offer.&nbsp;</p>', '263', 'Trillion Ballroom, Kismet Meeting Room, Residence Boardroom', 'Open Dining Court', '550', '550', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/4ZQBa89MZWITViJ1hDphumKSDaAwbcBu7sCIjRcF.jpg", "title": "6 in-house dining and nightlife destinations"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/Ckf7lnEqkBP5H8TVv8EFOfxd2ioLZxb8c6bqwm76.jpg", "title": "Poolside venue"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/XbvaWVqHoAuhoj5hos2zyCAvegBczZDZIKawQ9nk.jpg", "title": "Themed catering services"}]', '[{"id": 907, "question": "When is the peak wedding season for The Park Hyderabad?", "answer": "<p>The peak wedding season for&nbsp;<strong>The Park Hyderabad</strong> spans from October to February, when pleasant winter weather creates high demand for events.</p>"}, {"id": 908, "question": "Does The Park Hyderabad allow pre-wedding photoshoots?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>The Park Hyderabad</strong> allows pre-wedding photoshoots, but couples must coordinate with the banquet team as specific permissions, charges or booking packages apply.</p>"}, {"id": 909, "question": "Are fireworks and drones allowed for events at The Park Hyderabad?", "answer": "<p><strong>The Park Hyderabad&nbsp;</strong>restricts heavy fireworks and drones due to safety and city regulations; clients must secure formal local authority clearances and hotel approvals beforehand.</p>"}, {"id": 910, "question": "What are the check-in timings at The Park Hyderabad, and can we avail an early check-in?", "answer": "<p>Check-in at T<strong>he Park Hyderabad</strong> is at 2:00 PM. Early check-in can be requested but is subject to room availability and additional charges. It is advisable to arrange for this through the wedding planning team directly.</p>"}, {"id": 911, "question": "What is The Park Hyderabad''s official liquor policy?", "answer": "<p><strong>The Park Hyderabad</strong> serves alcohol through its licensed bars. For private events, outside liquor requires an official permit and is subject to mandatory corkage fees. Liquor from the outside is strictly not permitted.</p>"}]', '116', '263'
