SELECT 'indore', 'radisson-blu-hotel-indore', 'published', 'Radisson Blu Indore - Luxury Wedding Cost & Direct Booking', 'Explore wedding packages & pricing at Radisson Blu Hotel Indore. Discover all-inclusive wedding cost guides & hassle-free booking for a memorable event.', 'radisson blu indore wedding package, radisson blu hotel indore wedding, radisson blu hotel indore wedding cost, radisson blu hotel indore wedding price, radisson blu indore room booking', '/storage/hotel/seo/AoCiGRwSrfmgzdX8VaFUyscLsJDfbFyMfFgsWmGC.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/QjnBYug85iPZsHHxgOtvqmIWuBV5l55SDSCjU5ea.jpg', 'Radisson Blu Hotel Indore', 'No 94 C, 12, Scheme, Ring Rd, Scheme 94 Sector CA, Indore, Madhya Pradesh 452010, India', '30 minutes', '20 Minutes', '<p><strong>Radisson Blu Hotel Indore</strong> feels like a natural pick for couples planning a stylish, well-connected wedding in the heart of the city. Located in Vijay Nagar, this 5-star luxury hotel sits within Indore’s most vibrant commercial and lifestyle district, surrounded by malls, cafés and business hubs. Spread across a significant urban footprint with more than 35,000 sq ft of banquet spaces, it blends contemporary glass architecture with marble interiors, high ceilings and warm lighting that sets an easy celebratory mood. With the airport around 17 km away, it also works well for outstation guests attending a wedding in Madhya Pradesh.</p><p>Inside the&nbsp;<strong>Radisson Blu Hotel Indore</strong>, every venue serves a different purpose. The Grand Summit Ballroom is where the big moments come alive, especially receptions and sangeet nights that need space and energy. On the other hand, the Courtyard lawn and smaller banquet studios feel more relaxed and work well for Haldi ceremonies, cocktail evenings and intimate family gatherings.</p><p>What makes&nbsp;<strong>Radisson Blu Hotel Indore</strong> stand out is how seamlessly everything comes together beyond the wedding functions. Guests can relax and sit back in well-appointed rooms whilst enjoying the spa and pool, or step out to explore nearby landmarks like Rajwada Palace and Sarafa Bazaar, turning the celebration into a complete Indore experience.</p>', '200 rooms with suites', 'Summit Halls, Grand Summit Hall', 'Outdoor Lawns, The Courtyard', '450', '450', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/uPuRQ0kF48CdJAeYPow0smKS8ZVjiwL7gXwaz1da.jpg", "title": "5+ dining venues onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/eNL8DdlYWEH3Anknp7bYsOlqMqtpopjYiuSccElO.jpg", "title": "Poolside evenings and lounge experiences"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/4lf6ubo5OQQwsfBcQh9x8gBmLuzU21gdknbBAAYj.jpg", "title": "Contemporary dining with vibrant ambience"}]', '[{"id": 1188, "question": "Is outside catering allowed at Radisson Blu Hotel Indore?", "answer": "<p>Outside catering at the&nbsp;<strong>Radisson Blu Hotel Indore</strong> is usually not allowed. That said, it can sometimes depend on the type of event, so it’s best to check directly with the hotel’s events team for the latest policy.</p>"}, {"id": 1189, "question": "What is the check-in time at Radisson Blu Hotel Indore, and is an early check-in available?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Radisson Blu Hotel Indore</strong> is 2:00 pm, and the check-out time is 12:00 noon. An early check-in request can be accommodated, subject to hotel availability.</p>"}, {"id": 1190, "question": "Is Radisson Blu Hotel Indore right for your guest size, style and budget?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>Radisson Blu Hotel Indore&nbsp;</strong>works well for medium to large gatherings, with flexible indoor venues ideal for both intimate and grand weddings. Its central location makes travel easy for outstation guests. It generally fits mid to premium wedding budgets, depending on scale and services chosen.</p>"}, {"id": 1191, "question": "When is peak season for weddings at Radisson Blu Hotel Indore?", "answer": "<p>Peak wedding season at&nbsp;<strong>Radisson Blu Hotel Indore&nbsp;</strong>runs from October to February, when the weather in Indore is pleasant and ideal for celebrations. Dates during weekends and festive months get booked quickly, so early planning is recommended.</p>"}, {"id": 1192, "question": "What is the standard liquor policy at Radisson Blu Hotel Indore?", "answer": "<p>Outside alcohol is not permitted at&nbsp;<strong>Radisson Blu Hotel Indore</strong>, and all beverages must be arranged through the hotel’s in-house bar. All beverages and drinks are charged based on consumption, separate from standard wedding packages.</p>"}]', '298', '200'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'indore' AND `slug` = 'radisson-blu-hotel-indore');
