SELECT 'indore', 'sheraton-grand-palace-indore', 'published', 'Sheraton Grand Palace Indore – Wedding Cost & Packages Info', 'Planning a luxury wedding in Indore? Sheraton Grand Palace provides elegant spaces, transparent wedding costs & tailored packages. Check & book today!', 'sheraton grand palace indore wedding cost, sheraton indore wedding, sheraton indore wedding package, sheraton grand palace indore wedding', '/storage/hotel/seo/1JJUN43cHkoT7TdqT5mh0BR7dtn1QlcZvRRGlkeY.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/NT5Ge37QdkwGWtMkf6mXcm7DAJs47UsYrMsR9C6j.jpg', 'Sheraton Grand Palace Indore', 'Bypass Road, Omaxe City 1, Mayakhedi, Indore, Madhya Pradesh 452016, India', '35 Minutes', '25 Minutes', '<p>Set along the Indore-Dewas Bypass,&nbsp;<strong>Sheraton Grand Palace Indore</strong> feels less like a hotel and more like a grand European estate unfolding across nearly 20 acres of landscaped calm. The moment you arrive, a&nbsp;<strong>wedding at Sheraton Grand Palace Indore</strong> begins to feel like an event designed on a different scale altogether. Featuring white colonnades, marble staircases and crystal-lit interiors, setting a regal tone. With Devi Ahilya Bai Holkar International Airport just about 35-40 minutes away, it stays surprisingly accessible for a full-scale&nbsp;<strong>wedding in Madhya Pradesh</strong>.</p><p>Step inside&nbsp;<strong>Sheraton Grand Palace Indore</strong>, and the architecture immediately takes over the narrative. Over 116,000 sq. ft. of event space opens into pillarless grand halls like The Great Hall and Grand Palace, while expansive lawns stretch into 65,000 sq. ft. of open greenery made for evening celebrations under the sky. The 115 rooms and suites carry the same palace-like detailing, giving guests a seamless stay-through experience that defines a true&nbsp;<strong>wedding in Indore</strong>.</p><p>What stands out at<strong> Sheraton Grand Palace Indore</strong> is how everything feels within easy reach yet still full of depth, from Araana’s exquisite dining and S Café’s live counters to relaxed evenings at the Oasis pool deck and calming spa experiences. Its location also keeps the Rajwada Palace, Sarafa Bazaar and Ujjain within a short drive. For couples planning something grand yet effortless, this 5-star luxury hotel property brings that idea to life in a very real way.</p>', '115 rooms with suites', 'Ambience Hall, The Grand Palace, The Great Hall, The Great Hall Ballrooms', 'Oasis Lawn, The Palace Lawns', '300', '300', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/Cjjm9ouMOcawueekaHnmajuvLq4OOm3JwWAUxd8t.jpg", "title": "4+ dining venues onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/8aiDPmTABsk4xy7lDoBZKJ3HufZ8nKSHX4a7XEvz.jpg", "title": "Poolside starlit dining experience"}]', '[{"id": 1233, "question": "Is there an off-season for weddings at Sheraton Grand Palace Indore?", "answer": "<p>Peak wedding season at&nbsp;<strong>Sheraton Grand Palace Indore</strong> is November to February and April to May, while July to September monsoon season sees lower demand with better availability and pricing.</p>"}, {"id": 1234, "question": "What is the standard time to check-in at Sheraton Grand Palace Indore, and can I get an early check-in?", "answer": "<p>The standard time to check-in at&nbsp;<strong>Sheraton Grand Palace Indore</strong> is 3:00 pm, and the check-out time is 12:00 noon. Yes, you can get an early check-in; it is entirely subject to the hotel’s discretion.</p>"}, {"id": 1235, "question": "Is outside catering allowed at Sheraton Grand Palace Indore?", "answer": "<p>Outside catering is generally not permitted at&nbsp;<strong>Sheraton Grand Palace Indore</strong>, as in-house catering is preferred, with exceptions only subject to hotel approval.</p>"}, {"id": 1236, "question": "Are drones, fireworks or baraat allowed at Sheraton Grand Palace Indore?", "answer": "<p>Drones and fireworks are usually restricted at&nbsp;<strong>Sheraton Grand Palace Indore</strong> and require prior approval, while baraat celebrations are usually allowed within designated venue areas.</p>"}, {"id": 1237, "question": "What is the standard liquor policy at Sheraton Grand Palace Indore?", "answer": "<p><strong>Sheraton Grand Palace Indore&nbsp;</strong>follows an in-house liquor policy for weddings, where all bar services are managed by the hotel with curated beverage menus. Outside alcohol is generally not permitted, and all bar arrangements are billed separately from wedding packages.</p>"}]', '299', '115'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'indore' AND `slug` = 'sheraton-grand-palace-indore');
