SELECT 'jaipur', 'alila-fort-bishangarh-jaipur', 'published', 'Alila Fort Bishangarh Jaipur Wedding Cost & Venue Booking', 'Planning an Alila Fort Bishangarh wedding? Check wedding cost, booking options & packages for a stunning hilltop destination wedding near Jaipur today!', 'alila fort bishangarh jaipur wedding cost, alila fort bishangarh jaipur wedding, alila fort bishangarh booking, alila fort bishangarh price, alila fort bishangarh jaipur', '/storage/hotel/seo/YeBPOCfOulPpqdRxDc79RPmOptWrDjKNbaTyVMYB.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/EE7SmcLgQxeSlY8hRuTnhBfLLFiPevZbn49pkmIO.jpg', 'Alila Fort Bishangarh Jaipur', 'Manoharpur - Bishangarh Link Rd, off Nh-8, At, Bishangarh, Rajasthan 303104, India', '90 Minutes', '50 Minutes', '<p>Set inside a restored 230-year-old warrior fort, <strong>Alila Fort Bishangarh&nbsp;</strong>is known for its preservation of authentic Rajput heritage. This warrior fort-turned-hotel is renowned for offering sweeping 360-degree views of the Aravalli Range with a quiet, secluded hilltop setting.</p><p>Rich courtyards and open terraces are among the many ceremonial spaces on the property. Carved stone walls and open skies come together to frame wedding celebrations at the property. The entire mandap is beautifully framed against a timeless backdrop of dramatic forts and ambient fairylights, creating a breathtaking scene.</p><p>Backed by Hyatt’s hospitality legacy, <strong>Alila Fort Bishangarh, Jaipur</strong>, offers smooth, attentive service, curated dining and comfortable luxury stays designed for both national and international guests. With a responsive concierge team and careful attention to detail, the experience blends the fort’s heritage character with the ease and comfort of modern living.</p>', '87 rooms with suites', 'Haveli Porch & Lounge', 'Kachchawa Deck, Aravalli Lawn', '220', '220', '[{"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal02.png", "title": "5+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal03.png", "title": "360-degree view of Aravallis"}]', '[{"id": 39, "question": "How much does a wedding at Alila Fort Bishangarh, Jaipur, cost?", "answer": "<p>On average, an <strong>Alila Bishangarh wedding cost&nbsp;</strong>ranges from INR 1.25 Cr to INR 1.5 Cr for a 3-day and 2-night celebration, or for a complete property buyout. To get an exact estimate, you can use our Cost Calculator. Enter your preferred dates, room requirements and total guest capacity to get a precise quote within seconds.</p>"}, {"id": 40, "question": "Where did Aditi Rao Hydari and Siddharth get married?", "answer": "<p>Aditi Rao Hydari and Siddharth tied the knot at Alila Fort Bishangarh, choosing the venue because it reminded Aditi of her childhood home. Alila Fort Bishangarh in Jaipur is known primarily for its restored 230-year-old architecture and secluded location, which attracts couples seeking full buyouts.</p>"}, {"id": 41, "question": "Which is better: Alila Fort Bishangarh, Jaipur, or Hyatt Regency Mansarovar?", "answer": "<p>Although it is 69-75 km from Jaipur International Airport, Alila Fort Bishangarh offers a more intimate, heritage-led wedding experience in a restored 230-year-old warrior fort setting with 87 rooms. Meanwhile, the Hyatt Regency Jaipur Mansarovar boasts 245 rooms, a modern, palatial design and better connectivity (9–10 km from the airport). Both properties fall within a wedding budget of INR 1.25 Cr to INR 2.5 Cr, but Hyatt is better suited to large, well-connected events, while Alila is better suited to heritage weddings, rooted in tradition.</p>"}, {"id": 42, "question": "What is the check-in time at Alila Fort Bishangarh, and can we check-in early?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at Alila Fort Bishangarh in Jaipur is 3:00 pm, and check-out time is 12:00 noon. If you require an early check-in or a late check-out, then you can contact the hotel authorities and your request will be accommodated, subject to availability.</p>"}, {"id": 43, "question": "What is the liquor policy for destination weddings at Alila Fort Bishangarh, Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>Alcohol is allowed at Alila Fort Bishangarh, but all drinks served across public areas and event spaces must be sourced directly through the hotel. Outside liquor is not permitted on the property. Beverage costs are charged separately on a per-consumption basis and are usually not included in the standard wedding package.</p>"}]', '40', '87'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'jaipur' AND `slug` = 'alila-fort-bishangarh-jaipur');
