SELECT 'jaipur', 'ananta-spa-and-resort-jaipur', 'published', 'Ananta Spa & Resorts Jaipur Wedding Cost and Venue Packages', 'Plan your destination wedding at Ananta Spa & Resort Pushkar. Check wedding cost, exclusive packages & booking for a divine Pushkar wedding experience.', 'ananta resort and spa jaipur wedding cost, ananta resort and spa jaipur wedding, ananta resort and spa jaipur wedding price, ananta resort and spa wedding, ananta resort and spa jaipur', '/storage/hotel/seo/quIxJecPF12Qw7sc9x6nvlKZSpydipcMEE2Aa3DR.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/5EHspPyE8NoQKrYVXoIn1SIxFgwY9MyAnSVZv8w1.jpg', 'Ananta Spa And Resort Jaipur', '6KM, National Highway, off Delhi, near Jaipur Dental College, Jaipur, Ghata Jaldhari, Rajasthan 302001, India', '60 Minutes', '50 Minutes', '<p>The&nbsp;<strong>Ananta Spa &amp; Resort, Jaipur,&nbsp;</strong>is located in the valley of Jaipur’s hills, away from the Pink City’s busier areas. The property has a special connection with the region’s heritage and is located near famous landmarks, such as the Amer and Nahargarh forts. Moreover, its lush gardens and a centrally located pool create an ambience that feels well-suited for gatherings and long stays.</p><p>The&nbsp;<strong>Ananta Spa &amp; Resort, Jaipur,&nbsp;</strong>offers venues designed to host grand celebrations. The banquet areas at the resort span 16,000 sq. ft., while the lush gardens create a beautiful ambience for outdoor ceremonies, allowing different functions to take place in distinct settings. With landscaped backdrops, well-planned stage areas and the flexibility to customise vegetarian menus and layouts, the resort makes it easy to host seamless, multi-day festivities in one place.</p>', '230 rooms with suites', 'Sakura Banquet Hall', 'Ikigai Lawn, Satori Lawn', '490', '490', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/o8mFtQg3f7FkEZvhhst8CpKcyROX56tx7TOkHpXi.jpg", "title": "1+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/XTwbgTFBohEqHEC5kHJiT89Gkt1bZk75q7bTEtaz.jpg", "title": "Personalised bridal spa treatments"}]', '[{"id": 406, "question": "Which months are the most popular for weddings at the Ananta Spa & Resort, Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>The most popular months for weddings at&nbsp;<strong>Ananta Spa &amp; Resort&nbsp;</strong>are October to March. November, December, and February are peak times due to the perfect winter weather for outdoor garden celebrations.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 407, "question": "What are the check-in and check-out timings at Ananta Spa & Resort, Jaipur? Are there any special privileges available for wedding couples?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in at&nbsp;<strong>Ananta Spa &amp; Resort, Jaipur,&nbsp;</strong>is 2:00 PM, and check-out is 11:00 AM. Any demand for early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may incur additional charges.</p>"}, {"id": 408, "question": "What is the nearest airport to Ananta Spa & Resort, Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>The nearest airport to the&nbsp;<strong>Ananta Spa &amp; Resort, Jaipur,&nbsp;</strong>is Jaipur International Airport (JAI), located approximately 28 kilometres away. It takes about 45 to 60 minutes to reach the resort by car or taxi.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 409, "question": "Can I host a pre-wedding photoshoot at Ananta Spa & Resort, Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>Yes. The resort’s authorities allow pre-wedding shoots at&nbsp;<strong>Ananta Spa &amp; Resort, Jaipur,&nbsp;</strong>provided guests obtain approval in advance and pay the location fee. It is recommended to book in advance to ensure venue availability.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 410, "question": "What is Ananta Spa & Resort, Jaipur’s policy regarding alcohol?", "answer": "<p>Alcohol consumption is allowed inside&nbsp;<strong>Ananta Spa &amp; Resort, Jaipur.&nbsp;</strong>However, all drinks and cocktails meant for wedding celebrations should be purchased in-house, as alcohol from outside is prohibited. These are charged separately and are not included in your standard wedding package.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '181', '230'
