SELECT 'jaipur', 'bhanwar-singh-palace-jaipur', 'published', 'Bhanwar Singh Palace Wedding Cost & Hotel Booking', 'Explore Bhanwar Singh Palace Jaipur wedding cost, wedding price details, guest reviews, luxury venues, décor, catering, and royal wedding experiences. Book Now!', 'bhanwar singh palace jaipur wedding cost, bhanwar singh palace jaipur wedding price, bhanwar singh palace jaipur wedding, bhanwar singh palace jaipur price, bhanwar singh palace wedding cost', '/storage/hotel/seo/yrB7x95yHUMDcekR82PQXg59CvLqejXescCtQF0l.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/si3pqOIBQwO3fVIY7GxN735xMePHBaACSUTmivLj.jpg', 'Bhanwar Singh Palace Jaipur', 'opposite Solitaire Industrial Park, Bagru, Dahmi Kalan, Rajasthan 303007, India', '50 Minutes', '60 Minutes', '<p><strong>Bhanwar Singh Palace, Jaipur,&nbsp;</strong>has the feel of a grand, modern palace set across a large expanse just off the Ajmer–Jaipur Expressway. The design takes inspiration from traditional palace architecture, with imposing facades, landscaped gardens and water features that make an immediate impression. While it isn’t a historic property, it still delivers that sense of scale and occasion that works beautifully for larger celebrations.</p><p>A&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at Bhanwar Singh Palace in Jaipur&nbsp;</strong>works particularly well for larger gatherings. Wide lawns, multiple outdoor venues and spacious banquet halls give you plenty of room to plan each function in a setting that feels distinct. The scale of the property means you’re not confined to one area, which allows the wedding to feel spread out and thoughtfully planned.</p><p>What stands out here is how easy the overall experience feels for both you and your guests. The rooms are comfortable, dining options are varied and the service is attentive without being intrusive. At the same time, the scale of the property ensures the celebrations still feel grand, without coming across as excessive.</p>', '76 rooms and 44 villas', 'Darbar Hall, Vatika Hall, Diwan Hall', 'Char Bagh, Saheliyon Ki Baadi, Maharaja Lawn, Poolside Lawn', '290', '290', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/6z7JKanDkINuX8TBDQs7579AHAzRveeGn5Mee4dq.jpg", "title": "2+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/Sriyv1Nh7EK9GO4OOmewUJ4pKNrPal8CDLtg3igZ.jpg", "title": "Dramatic bride and groom wedding entries"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/HPXu2od5LQlNBT8jD85QXsc8r0buXVqt7hDu1cLz.jpg", "title": "Curated live music for wedding celebrations"}]', '[{"id": 476, "question": "How much does a destination wedding at Bhanwar Singh Palace, Jaipur cost?", "answer": "<p>On average, the cost of a<strong> destination wedding at Bhanwar Singh Palace, Jaipur,&nbsp;</strong>falls within the range of INR 55 lakhs and INR 90 Lakhs for a 3-day, 2-night ceremony. Use Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator for an accurate estimation of the wedding cost based on your guest count, room requirements, etc.</p>"}, {"id": 477, "question": "Can guests explore local sights during their stay at Bhanwar Singh Palace, Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>Yes, guests at Bhanwar Singh Palace, Jaipur, can explore local sights such as camel safaris, Jaipur Ri Dhani and key city sights, including City Palace and Jal Mahal.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 478, "question": "Should I choose Bhanwar Singh Palace, Jaipur, or The Westin Jaipur Resort & Spa for my wedding?", "answer": "<p>Choose Bhanwar Singh Palace (INR 85 lakhs to INR 90 lakhs) for a more private, villa-led setup with quicker airport access and a resort-style feel. Pick The Westin Jaipur Resort &amp; Spa (INR 1 Cr to 1.5 Cr) for larger room inventory, Marriott services and a slightly more flexible budget range.</p>"}, {"id": 479, "question": "What is the check-in time at Bhanwar Singh Palace, Jaipur, and is early check-in available for wedding guests?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Bhanwar Singh Palace, Jaipur,</strong> is 2:00 pm, and check-out time is at 11:00 am. An early check-in can be arranged, subject to hotel availability.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 480, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol to a wedding at the Bhanwar Singh Palace, Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>No, outside alcohol is not allowed at<strong> Bhanwar Singh Palace, Jaipur</strong>. All beverages for wedding events must be purchased exclusively through the hotel. Beverages and alcohol are charged separately based on consumption, as they are not included in standard wedding packages.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '148', '150'
