SELECT 'jaipur', 'buena-vista-luxury-garden-spa-resort', 'published', 'Buena Vista Resort Jaipur Wedding Cost for Venue', 'Explore Buena Vista Resort Jaipur wedding cost with luxury venues, premium stays, décor, catering & elegant destination wedding experiences. Reserve Now!', 'buena vista resort jaipur wedding cost, buena vista resort jaipur weding, buena vista luxury garden spa resort jaipur', '/storage/hotel/seo/vKYxPR18jvvbHkBQFvSHG2sWjsvpFX8MyTw1hAqt.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/KGA4HiJxR9FqzE9Fnh48u1QQvameHTUNARA9TYcN.jpg', 'Buena Vista Luxury Garden Spa Resort', 'XWQ4+CRF, Delhi - Jaipur Expressway Pilli Ki Talai, Kunda, Amer, Jaipur, Rajasthan 302028, India', '60 Minutes', '25 Minutes', '<p>A<strong> destination wedding at Buena Vista Resort, Jaipur,&nbsp;</strong>feels like stepping into a private retreat set against the rugged Aravalli landscape. The resort adds on a quiet charm, with tree-lined pathways, open greens and architecture that balances grandeur with a more intimate, relaxed feel. There’s a natural sense of calm at this property that sets the tone for celebrations.</p><p>The venues are thoughtfully spread out, which works well when you’re planning multiple events. Lawns like Serenade are ideal for larger functions, while spaces like the pool deck, Zen Garden and Nolita Sky Lounge bring in variety for smaller gatherings and evening celebrations. The layout allows each function to feel distinct without having to leave the property, which makes planning far more convenient.</p><p>Stay is a big part of the&nbsp;<strong>wedding experience at Buena Vista Resort, Jaipur</strong>. With private pool villas and luxury tents, guests have space to unwind between events rather than just pass through them. Add to that well-curated dining, multiple restaurants and attentive service, and a destination wedding in Jaipur here feels not just well planned, but genuinely enjoyable for everyone attending.</p>', '52 villas with 25 luxury tents', 'Imperial Banquet Hall, Concorde Banquet Hall', 'Serenade Lawn, Bonfire, Pool Deck, Zen Garden, Nolita Sky Lounge', '200', '200', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/ybZZlFnBpsW9jNXkZLM4oJabhynCr7n2M1tpuAoM.jpg", "title": "4+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/rv5pTjOzZKaEYNHSqebiadAdBlDFyYs6TFfoCH8O.jpg", "title": "Candlelit private dinners for romance"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/DK96KpaErLbORxE6ePa8cdOriWbwm9Mp3SrhCzX5.jpg", "title": "Skyline Italian lounge under starlight"}]', '[{"id": 466, "question": "How much does a wedding at Buena Vista Resort in Jaipur cost?", "answer": "<p>On average,&nbsp;<strong>the wedding cost at Buena Vista Resort, Jaipur,</strong> ranges from INR 70 lakhs to INR 90 lakhs for a 3-day, 2-night ceremony with approximately 200 guests. To get an accurate quote within seconds, enter your logistical details into Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 467, "question": "Which is the nearest airport to Buena Vista Resort, Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>Jaipur International Airport (Sanganer) lies about 25–26 km from&nbsp;<strong>Buena Vista Resort, Jaipur</strong>. Expect a 40–55 minute drive, depending on traffic conditions.</p>"}, {"id": 468, "question": "Which months are most popular for weddings at Buena Vista Luxury Garden Spa Resort, Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>The best time for a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at Buena Vista Resort in Jaipur&nbsp;</strong>is from November to February, when the weather is pleasant and the holidays are festive. Expect higher prices and fewer options; early reservations are recommended.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 469, "question": "What is the check-in time at Buena Vista Luxury Garden Spa Resort, Jaipur, and is early check-in available for wedding guests?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Buena Vista Resort, Jaipur,</strong> is 2:00 pm, and check-out time is at 11:00 am. An early check-in facility can be arranged, subject to hotel availability.</p>"}, {"id": 470, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol to a wedding at the Buena Vista Resort, Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>No,&nbsp;<strong>Buena Vista Resort, Jaipur,</strong> does not permit outside alcohol. All beverages must be sourced through the hotel and are billed separately on consumption, as they are not part of standard wedding packages.</p>"}]', '245', '75'
