SELECT 'jaipur', 'chomu-palace-hotel-jaipur', 'published', 'Chomu Palace Jaipur Wedding Cost & Packages Details', 'Chomu Palace Jaipur wedding cost, wedding packages, marriage & venue details. Explore weddings in Chomu Palace Jaipur for your celebration. Book today!', 'chomu palace jaipur wedding cost, chomu palace jaipur wedding, chomu palace jaipur marriage, weddings in chomu palace jaipur, chomu palace hotel jaipur, chomu palace jaipur wedding packages', '/storage/hotel/seo/7jXZVKqYi9ih1OnXovNmwemrr7PZXW7YeOQIDuK1.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/TDQcppxoxzCyavQH1OjuNAH3QJaizfg29jnmeWGg.jpg', 'Chomu Palace Hotel Jaipur', 'Sikar Rd, Naya BaJar, Chomu, Jaipur, Rajasthan 303702, India', '90 minutes', '60 Minutes', '<p>A&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at Chomu Palace, Jaipur,</strong> unfolds inside a 16th-century fortified estate that has seen nearly 350 years of evolution. Once Chomugarh Fort, built under Rajput design principles, still holds on to its original character while carrying the ease of a lived-in palace. Located on NH-11, around 255 km from Delhi, the journey itself feels like a gradual arrival into heritage, with sandstone walls, courtyards and arches slowly coming into view.</p><p>The scale of the property works well for multi-day celebrations. Spaces like Darbar Hall and Sheesh Mahal suit indoor functions with a regal backdrop, while Chaar Bagh, Manoharpole Garden and the Pratishtha terrace are often used for outdoor ceremonies. Each venue has its own mood, which naturally adds variety to different wedding events.</p><p>For a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Jaipur</strong>, the experience extends beyond the venue itself. With premium suites styled in heritage detailing, marble finishes and antique furnishings, guests get to stay within a lived-in royal setting. Warm hospitality, traditional dining and a calm, heritage-first atmosphere make it feel less like a hotel stay and more like a private royal residence.</p>', '100', 'Darbar Hall, Sheesh Mahal, Chhattishdari, Swaimaan Mahal, Mantrana', 'Pratishtha (The Terrace), Chaar Bagh, Manoharpole Garden, Poolside', '250', '250', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/6v2rppup7QCEgowIQ7BrmXANexNbcczVDtQ0XXmo.jpg", "title": "2+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/orM7kWuTFrTTgqKkDwGtFQTlaGsRDQRWLTbzJSAd.jpg", "title": "Regal bridal showers"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/Vl7wHXOh28XRpxPKCN4Y28WfDhIMFZvGGdmeMrSK.jpg", "title": "Martini nights for bachelor''s parties"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/oSoAMClNFv3RS0SoLoLarDuHhMNQ1Std2iKbpFaK.jpg", "title": "Heritage-setting grand gala dinners"}]', '[{"id": 351, "question": "How much does a destination wedding at Chomu Palace, Jaipur cost?", "answer": "<p>On average, a wedding package at&nbsp;<strong>Chomu Palace in Jaipur</strong> costs between INR 70 lakhs and INR 90 lakhs for a 3-day, 2-night celebration. To get an accurate estimate based on your guest count, enter your requirements in Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator to get an exact quote instantly.</p>"}, {"id": 352, "question": "Is an early check-in available for wedding guests at Chomu Palace, Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>Yes, an early check-in facility is available at the palace, and accommodation is subject to availability. The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Chomu Palace, Jaipur,</strong> is 2:00 pm, and check-out time is at 11:00 am.</p>"}, {"id": 353, "question": "Where was Priyadarshan’s Bhool Bhulaiyaa filmed?", "answer": "<p>Among the many places where the film was shot, Chomu Palace was one of the prominent shooting locations for Bhool Bhulaiyaa.</p>"}, {"id": 354, "question": "How old is the Chomu Palace, Jaipur, and when was it built?", "answer": "<p><strong>Chomu Palace,&nbsp;</strong>over 350 years old, dating back to the mid-16th-century has now evolved from a fort into a restored royal residence and heritage hotel.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 355, "question": "What is the liquor policy of Chomu Palace, Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>Outside alcohol isn’t permitted at&nbsp;<strong>Chomu Palace, Jaipur.&nbsp;</strong>All beverages are served through the hotel and billed separately as per consumption, and are generally not part of standard wedding packages.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '197', '100'
