SELECT 'jaipur', 'doubletree-by-hilton-jaipur-amer', 'published', 'DoubleTree by Hilton Jaipur Amer Wedding Cost & Packages', 'Host a grand wedding at DoubleTree by Hilton Jaipur. Check wedding cost, luxury packages & venue booking options for your Pink City destination wedding.', 'hotel doubletree by hilton jaipur wedding cost, hotel doubletree by hilton jaipur wedding, hotel doubletree by hilton jaipur wedding packages', '/storage/hotel/seo/tI6KunXj7frcAcLdrzKGkzmZq9atGivsEbYgYDx9.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/JQfUygQp12Hh9s7QmCR3xVMBUNl7h20dD1n85CVg.jpg', 'DoubleTree by Hilton Jaipur Amer', '935, Delhi Road, Kukas, Jaipur, Rajasthan 302028, India', '60 Minutes', '50 Minutes', '<p>A&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at DoubleTree by Hilton Jaipur</strong> is easy to get to, yet feels closely tucked away. Set along the Jaipur-Delhi highway, the hotel overlooks the rugged Aravalli landscape, with Amber Fort about 15 minutes away and the airport around 30 kilometres away. The property’s overall vibe is elegant and contemporary, with open terraces and rooftop spaces that make the most of the views without feeling overdone.</p><p>Once you start mapping out the celebrations, the mix of indoor and outdoor venues offers you a sense of flexibility. While the Emerald Ballroom works well for larger ceremonies, the Amber Greens Lawn and the rooftop terraces are chosen for open-air functions and sundowner events. The rooftop poolside which adds a relaxed yet polished setting for smaller gatherings or post-event dinners.</p><p>For a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Jaipur,&nbsp;</strong>the stay experience is equally comfortable. With 150+ rooms, varied dining options like Amber Kitchen and a rooftop bar, along with curated in-house experiences, guests have enough to enjoy between events without needing to step out.</p>', '151', 'Emerald Ballroom, Jade Room, Emerald Ballroom Pre-function', 'The Amber Greens Lawn, Rooftop Terrace', '302', '350', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/SAFDQ1hBgbfkp7y0Kk0GKXgUc5HrHrRfXZEKOXQS.jpg", "title": "4+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/mleJ2kyD8Pdr2nIb7bfkJ4jNJSdqP20lMs1Hbzta.jpg", "title": "Rooftop candlelit dining beneath starlit skies"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/YptRk5iZiR3fP7mNTbTjU1qv7OwepP4SHwE1jZ1A.jpg", "title": "Lavish baraat entries with grand effects"}]', '[{"id": 356, "question": "What is the cost of a destination wedding at DoubleTree by Hilton Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>Typically,&nbsp;<strong>Hotel DoubleTree by Hilton Jaipur wedding packages</strong> range from INR 50 lakhs to INR 90 lakhs for a 3-day, 2-night celebration for approximately 150-200 guests. Use Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator to get an accurate estimate within seconds, based on your logistical requirements.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 357, "question": "Is an early check-in available for wedding guests at DoubleTree by Hilton Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>Yes, an early check-in facility can be arranged, subject to hotel availability. The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>DoubleTree by Hilton Jaipur</strong> is 3:00 pm, and check-out time is at 12:00 noon.</p>"}, {"id": 358, "question": "Which months are most popular for weddings at Hotel DoubleTree by Hilton Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>November to February are the most preferred months at&nbsp;<strong>DoubleTree by Hilton Jaipur</strong>, thanks to pleasant weather. This season works especially well for outdoor wedding functions.</p>"}, {"id": 359, "question": "How much can I save if I make a booking at DoubleTree by Hilton Jaipur through Viraaya Weddings?", "answer": "<p>Booking&nbsp;<strong>DoubleTree by Hilton Jaipur</strong> through Viraaya Weddings can help you save around 10-15% with negotiated rates. You also get easier planning and access to trusted vendors.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 360, "question": "What is the liquor policy at DoubleTree by Hilton Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>Outside alcohol isn’t permitted at&nbsp;<strong>DoubleTree by Hilton Jaipur.&nbsp;</strong>All beverages are served by the hotel and billed separately based on consumption, as they are not part of standard wedding packages.</p>"}]', '187', '151'
