SELECT 'jaipur', 'fairmont-jaipur', 'published', 'Fairmont Jaipur Wedding Cost, Packages & Booking', 'Plan your luxury destination wedding at Fairmont Jaipur. Check wedding cost, packages, venue details, pre wedding & booking for a royal celebration today.', 'fairmont jaipur wedding cost, fairmont jaipur booking, fairmont hotel jaipur wedding, fairmont hotel jaipur wedding cost, wedding at, fairmont jaipur, fairmont jaipur packages, fairmont jaipur pre wedding, fairmont wedding jaipur, fairmont jaipur wedding cost, cost of wedding at fairmont jaipur, fairmont hotel jaipur wedding packages, fairmont jaipur destination wedding cost, fairmont jaipur pre wedding cost', '/storage/hotel/seo/Jw4q3tYXWjfQ1lleA0JwRlfpaPoaI0Z3YT4UqMlP.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/X3StAYjfC3vRn5LaG2bE9C89gkCtpaZJIfEbDHdD.jpg', 'Fairmont Jaipur', 'Manoharpur - Bishangarh Link Rd, off Nh-8, At, Bishangarh, Rajasthan 303104, India', '60 Minutes', '40 Minutes', '<p>Framed by the majestic Aravalli Hills, the Fairmont Jaipur reflects Rajasthan’s royal heritage, creating a perfect setting for wedding celebrations. Massive wooden gates open into intricately designed spaces decorated with hand-painted frescoes. Couples can celebrate amid the venue’s iconic carved accents and the signature pink stone of Jaipur. This is a setting as vibrant and colourful as the city itself.</p><p>The wedding venues at <strong>Fairmont Hotel in Jaipur&nbsp;</strong>are built to host celebrations of every scale. Expansive lawns, pillared courtyards and striking ballrooms set the stage for lively functions and meaningful moments.&nbsp;</p><p>The attentive team at the Fairmont ensures that international guests are looked after with care at every step of their stay. The hotel provides a welcoming setting that resonates with guests, creating an experience that feels truly special.</p>', '245 rooms with suites', 'The Grand Ballroom, Vruti Ballroom, Sulek, Viti Ballroom, Avi', 'Lawn 1, Lawn 2, GBR Lawn, Osma', '530', '530', '[{"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal02.png", "title": "3+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal03.png", "title": "Romantic private candlelight dinners"}]', '[{"id": 44, "question": "What is the Fairmont Jaipur wedding cost for a 3-day 2-night celebration?", "answer": "<p>On average, a <strong>destination wedding at Fairmont Hotel, Jaipur</strong>, usually costs between INR 1.2 Cr and INR 2.5 Cr for a 3-day 2-night celebration. If you wish to get an exact quote, you can enter your preferred dates, total rooms required, total guest capacity and other details in our Cost Calculator. Click on ‘Calculate Venue Cost’ and get the precise budget instantly.</p>"}, {"id": 45, "question": "Which property is better-suited for a wedding celebration: Fairmont Jaipur or The Leela Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>Fairmont Jaipur is located around 26 to 28 km from the airport and has 245 luxurious rooms. Wedding budgets typically range from INR 1.2 to 2.5 crore, offering a lavish yet approachable option. The Leela Jaipur is located about 30 km from the airport and has 200 premium rooms. It''s ideal for a more exclusive wedding, with budgets ranging from INR 2.1 to 3.25 crore.</p>"}, {"id": 46, "question": "What is the check-in time at Fairmont Jaipur, and can we check-in early?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at Fairmont Jaipur is 3:00 pm, and you can check-out by 12:00 noon. Guests can request an early check-in, which may be accommodated subject to hotel availability.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 47, "question": "What is the liquor policy for a wedding at Fairmont Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>Alcohol is served at Fairmont Jaipur, with all beverages for events and public areas exclusively managed by the hotel. Bringing in outside liquor is not permitted. Charges are based on consumption and are usually separate from the standard wedding package.</p>"}, {"id": 48, "question": "Are there nearby attractions or activities for international guests?", "answer": "<p>Out -of-state and international guests at Fairmont Udaipur can enjoy many of the city’s highlights. They can take in the beauty of Lake Pichola, explore the historic City Palace or visit temples like Nathdwara and Eklingji. The Sajjangarh Wildlife Sanctuary is nearby, offering a calm and scenic escape for your guests.</p>"}]', '42', '245'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'jaipur' AND `slug` = 'fairmont-jaipur');
--> statement-breakpoint
