SELECT 'jaipur', 'hyatt-regency-jaipur-mansarovar', 'published', 'Hyatt Regency Jaipur Wedding Cost, Venue & Booking', 'Explore Hyatt Regency Mansarovar Jaipur wedding cost, venue options, packages & hotel booking. Host your grand Jaipur wedding & secure your date now.', 'hyatt regency jaipur mansarovar wedding cost, hyatt regency jaipur wedding cost, hyatt regency mansarovar wedding, hyatt regency mansarovar wedding cost, hyatt jaipur, hyatt residency, the hyatt regency, hyatt booking, hyatt regency jaipur price, hyatt regency jaipur wedding cost, hyatt regency jaipur mansarovar price', '/storage/hotel/seo/V8AO3NuEJxsu5FUmJtbdxDHWuLkXeV8AGUinBMQB.png', '/storage/hotels/banners/PN2jmB8qKEFVQx86k1YMTQE08BIy6E7IHI0kSD7Z.jpg', 'Hyatt Regency Jaipur Mansarovar', 'Iskcon Rd, Mansarovar, Jaipur, Rajasthan 302020, India', '15 Minutes', '20 Minutes', '<p><strong>Hyatt Regency Jaipur Mansarovar&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong>Hyatt Regency Jaipur Mansarovar</strong> sets the stage for celebrations that embody the Pink City’s timeless charm. Inspired by the grandeur of the dynasties that once ruled the region, its architecture features intricate thikri work and over 2,000 hand-carved marble pillars. International guests can savour locally sourced and regional delicacies and enjoy the sights of the beautiful city.</p><p>The property’s indoor and outdoor event space is a grand 5,000 sq. metres, consisting of 5 resplendent venues for every ceremony. With palatial backdrops and venues inspired by Rajputana inner chambers, a&nbsp;<strong>wedding at Hyatt Regency Jaipur Mansarovar&nbsp;</strong>feels truly royal. A 24/7 concierge service and bar backed by the Hyatt Hotels Corporation complete the experience, bringing your dreams to life with effortless precision.&nbsp;</p>', '245, including 34 exquisite suites', 'Regency Ballroom, The Imperial Room, The Manor', 'Chauras Bagh, Navras Bagh', '500', '500', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/498xonDFkOkYxtDhYpbCCk6XilX4TpQIsdFrsqIM.jpg", "title": "4 dining venues serving regional delicacies"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/m7s16GKnnFAner6p0hV5R9DzkCufdwymLrDRIiNB.jpg", "title": "Modern palace heritage ambience"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/rtTnP3QzUdvtOqR9LejTk3qGOvToHG3VFTaKLClp.jpg", "title": "Custom wedding souvenir tokens"}]', '[{"id": 30, "question": "How much does a wedding at Hyatt Regency Jaipur cost?", "answer": "<p>A wedding at Hyatt Regency Jaipur costs around ₹1.7 to 2.5 Crore for a 2-day celebration with 350-400 guests. However, the exact cost can depend on the number of guests and your wedding date. For a transparent estimate, refer to our Cost Calculator. It uses your check-in and check-out dates, along with your destination choice and the number of guests, to give you an accurate estimate based on your budget.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 31, "question": "How early should I book Hyatt Regency Jaipur Mansarovar for a wedding?", "answer": "<p>You should book 6 to 12 months in advance, especially for peak season (November to March). For destination weddings requiring large room blocks (200+ rooms in season), booking 8 to 12 months early is ideal to secure preferred dates and competitive group rates.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 32, "question": "What are the check-in timings at the Hyatt Regency Jaipur Mansarovar?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Hyatt Regency Jaipur Mansarova</strong>r is 3:00 PM, and check-out is at 12:00 noon. Early check-in or late check-out may be available upon request, subject to availability and additional charges.</p>"}, {"id": 33, "question": "Which venue is better for hosting a wedding: The Hyatt Regency Jaipur Mansarovar or The Leela Palace Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>Both of these venues are good for premium weddings.&nbsp;<strong>Hyatt Regency Jaipur Mansarovar</strong> is ideal for larger celebrations, and typically falls in the range of ₹1.7 to 2.5 crore for a standard wedding. It is also centrally located within the city.&nbsp;</p><p>The Leela Palace Jaipur offers a more exclusive, palace-style experience away from the main city, with pricing that can range from ₹3.5 to ₹4 crore depending on the scale and customisation. The better choice depends on your choice of celebrations and venues.</p>"}, {"id": 34, "question": "Is outside liquor allowed at the Hyatt Regency Mansarovar Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>The&nbsp;<strong>Hyatt Regency Jaipur Mansarovar&nbsp;</strong>offers alcohol at its in-house bars and restaurants. For public and banquet events, drinks must be exclusively bought from these venues. These are billed separately and not included as part of your standard wedding package.&nbsp;</p>"}]', '27', '245'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'jaipur' AND `slug` = 'hyatt-regency-jaipur-mansarovar');
--> statement-breakpoint
