SELECT 'jaipur', 'indana-palace-jaipur', 'published', 'Indana Palace Jaipur Hotel Booking & Wedding Venue Cost', 'Explore Indana Palace Jaipur wedding cost, booking details, guest reviews, royal décor, catering & destination wedding experiences. Check Availability!', 'indana palace jaipur wedding cost, indana palace jaipur wedding, indana palace jaipur wedding price, indana palace jaipur booking, indana palace jaipur photos, hotel indana palace jaipur', '/storage/hotel/seo/uR6bBDBhJTU6BHdn9fG37KrgfpMzjU3xoLKjGNFa.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/AKvy34zxZ1FmlYTjolt9nHV0GdKWi008GF8FdQlu.jpg', 'Indana Palace Jaipur', 'Jaipur - Delhi Highway, Amer, Jaipur, Rajasthan 302028, India', '60 Minutes', '50 Minutes', '<p>Indana Palace Jaipur carries a quiet sense of grandeur that reveals itself in layers. Inspiration for the property’s design is drawn from Marwar and Mewar influences, with carved stone façades, gold-leaf detailing and hand-painted interiors that feel rooted in Rajasthan’s royal past. Set within the Pink City, the property has a strong architectural identity, one that feels immersive without being overwhelming.</p><p>A&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at Indana Palace, Jaipur</strong>, works well with how the property is set up. The central courtyard is ideal for daytime functions, with ample space for décor, while sangeet nights and receptions are better suited to the banquet halls, which bring in that grand, regal feel. Since all the venues are close to each other, planning multiple events is fairly straightforward, and guests can move easily between functions without any hassle.</p><p>For guests, the experience feels just as thoughtfully put together. The rooms echo the same heritage aesthetic, service is attentive and intuitive, and everything moves at a comfortable pace. For couples who are thinking of hosting a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Jaipur</strong>, it offers the perfect setting that feels regal, well-composed and genuinely memorable.</p>', '118', 'Grand Banquet Hall, Mewar Hall, Rang Mahal, Hawa Mahal', 'Amer Lawn, Central Courtyard, Patio Lawn', '260', '260', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/FIS9rYMELZTX5pLaLg3Vhrd3Y0ZEqOAIXzMUMUIV.jpg", "title": "3+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/xPYyDl5wVG7LCcrJioExqO33DnG88mjSoLjsG7ew.jpg", "title": "Bespoke royal-style wedding arrivals"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/AlGNEQhhaPzK60M5TJSXsmCKS955eg8hUp7ZBHQn.jpg", "title": "Pre-wedding photoshoots in palace interiors"}]', '[{"id": 496, "question": "How much does a destination wedding at Indana Palace, Jaipur cost?", "answer": "<p>The cost of a destination wedding at Indana Palace Jaipur usually ranges from INR 70 lakhs to INR 80 lakhs for a 3-day, 2-night ceremony, for about 150-200 guests. To get an accurate quote within seconds, refer to Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 497, "question": "How to reach Indana Palace, Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>Jaipur International Airport (JAI) is about 25-26 km from&nbsp;<strong>Indana Palace, Jaipur.&nbsp;</strong>The drive usually takes around 50 to 60 minutes, depending on traffic.</p>"}, {"id": 498, "question": "How does Indana Palace Jaipur compare to ITC Rajputana, a Luxury Collection Hotel, Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>Go with Indana Palace Jaipur (INR 80 lakhs to INR 1.2 Cr) for a more intimate, palace-style wedding with a tighter budget and quieter setting. Consider ITC Rajputana, a Luxury Collection Hotel, Jaipur (INR 80 lakhs to INR 1.25 Cr) for a larger celebration, a central location and faster airport access.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 499, "question": "What is the check-in time at Indana Palace in Jaipur, and is early check-in available for wedding guests?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at Indana Palace Jaipur is 2:00 pm, and check-out time is at 11:00 am. Guests can request an early check-in, and it can be arranged subject to availability.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 500, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol to a wedding at the Indana Palace, Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>No, outside alcohol is not allowed at<strong> Indana Palace, Jaipur</strong>. All beverages for wedding events must be arranged through the hotel and are charged separately based on consumption, as they are not included in standard wedding packages.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '183', '118'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'jaipur' AND `slug` = 'indana-palace-jaipur');
--> statement-breakpoint
