SELECT 'jaipur', 'intercontinental-jaipur-tonk-road-by-ihg', 'published', 'InterContinental Jaipur Tonk Road – Royal Wedding Cost', 'InterContinental Jaipur Tonk Road delivers grand wedding venues with transparent cost details & world-class hotel amenities in Pink City. Enquire Now!', 'intercontinental jaipur tonk road wedding cost, intercontinental jaipur tonk road wedding, intercontinental jaipur tonk road by ihg wedding, intercontinental jaipur tonk road by ihg wedding cost, intercontinental jaipur', '/storage/hotel/seo/Uz0CyG4YnzM4DBEHchrjyBC1l2MCl64f8xf2enTs.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/qs9Rim5Hi72krp9XE5Gdu4vGiSq5r6XNMV0niXZ6.jpg', 'InterContinental Jaipur Tonk Road by IHG', 'Tonk Rd, Sitapura Industrial Area, Sitapura, Jaipur, Rajasthan 302022, India', '15 Minutes', '25 Minutes', '<p>Facing the Jaipur Exhibition and Convention Centre and connected to the Delhi–Mumbai Expressway,&nbsp;<strong>InterContinental Jaipur Tonk Road</strong> combines city accessibility with wide greenbelt views that bring a serene feel to the property. The hotel stands out for its large spaces and distinct dining experiences, with speciality restaurants, bars and lounges that make wedding stays more engaging for guests. Between functions, guests can unwind at the open-air pool or spa, while the property''s scale keeps celebrations feeling spacious without sacrificing convenience.</p><p>Wedding events here take place in 51,000 sq. ft. of indoor and outdoor venue space. The pillarless ballroom is perfect for receptions and formal functions, while the 31,000 sq. ft. lawn allows you to organise larger celebrations. The property’s three separate venues make it easier to shape different moods for each ceremony and delight guests, rather than recreating the same setting throughout the wedding celebrations.&nbsp;</p>', '218 rooms with suites', 'Convergence Ballroom, Inspire, Insight', 'Indulge Lawn, Socorro Lawn', '500', '500', '[{"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal02.png", "title": "3 in-house diners and lounges"}, {"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal03.png", "title": "Dedicated bridal studio"}]', '[{"id": 782, "question": "What is the peak season for InterContinental Jaipur Tonk Road?", "answer": "<p>The peak wedding season for<strong> InterContinental Jaipur Tonk Road</strong> is November to February. This period offers ideal weather for grand outdoor ceremonies and private gatherings.</p>"}, {"id": 783, "question": "What is the nearest airport to InterContinental Jaipur Tonk Road?", "answer": "<p>The nearest airport to&nbsp;<strong>InterContinental Jaipur Tonk Road</strong> is Jaipur International Airport (JAI), located approximately 5 km away, with a travel time of 10 to 15 minutes by car.</p>"}, {"id": 784, "question": "What is the check-in time at InterContinental Jaipur Tonk Road, and can we get early check-in?", "answer": "<p>Standard check-in at<strong> InterContinental Jaipur Tonk Road</strong> is 3:00 PM. Early check-in is subject to room availability upon arrival and may incur additional charges depending on your arrival time.</p>"}, {"id": 785, "question": "Does InterContinental Jaipur Tonk Road have in-house salon and laundry facilities?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>InterContinental Jaipur Tonk Road</strong> offers both facilities. Guests can enjoy professional grooming at the in-house salon and utilise convenient laundry and dry-cleaning services during their stay.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 786, "question": "What is InterContinental Jaipur Tonk Road’s official liquor policy?", "answer": "<p>Any drinks or cocktails you purchase for your banquet events have to be sourced from&nbsp;<strong>InterContinental Tonk Road Jaipur’s&nbsp;</strong>in-house restaurants and bars. These are charged separately and are not included in your wedding package.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '192', '218'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'jaipur' AND `slug` = 'intercontinental-jaipur-tonk-road-by-ihg');
