SELECT 'jaipur', 'itc-rajputana-jaipur', 'published', 'ITC Rajputana Jaipur Wedding Cost & Venue Packages', 'Plan your luxury stay at ITC Rajputana a luxury collection hotel jaipur with wedding price and venue cost insights. Explore today online!', 'itc rajputana jaipur wedding cost, itc rajputana jaipur wedding price, itc rajputana jaipur wedding, itc rajputana jaipur venue cost, itc rajputana wedding', '/storage/hotel/seo/9SjQR5OYvYAEPDbYOUHFGzNUDFJ267hw4tsAsZEf.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/Rw1fOaPZpBMwT9glu8JGd2bkvhJGJroRmgQxy9Ee.jpg', 'ITC Rajputana Jaipur', 'Palace Road, Jaipur, Rajasthan, 302006, India', '30 minutes', '10 minutes', '<p>At&nbsp;<strong>ITC Rajputana, a Luxury Collection Hotel, Jaipur</strong>, a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Jaipur</strong> takes on a distinctly royal character. Inspired by traditional Rajasthani architecture, the property features arched corridors, jharokhas and warm sandstone tones that create a setting reminiscent of a palace celebration.</p><p>For an&nbsp;<strong>ITC Rajputana Jaipur wedding</strong>, the property lets each part of a wedding find its own space without feeling like it''s all over the place. Suryavanshi Mahal works well for formal indoor events, while the courtyards and gardens come alive for pheras, mehendi and evening celebrations, each space bringing a slightly different mood to the overall experience.</p><p>As the evening sets in, the well-lit courtyards, bathed in soft light, begin to buzz with soulful music and conversation. National and international guests, no matter how well-travelled, find the setting easy to settle into, enjoying both the familiarity of ITC’s warm hospitality and the charm of a truly local, cultural experience.</p>', '218', 'Suryavanshi Mahal, Hawa Mahal, Resident Lounge', 'Hawa Mahal Courtyard, Hotel Lawns and Gardens', '435', '460', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/3y5praL7K6o9Z1i5y4ZDtoBeYRjRoxe7ZMIKkLQa.jpg", "title": "5+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/fcL9cmQojDzB9b0nPXql2jL2WKHAgqv0k2Ixvz2J.jpg", "title": "Royal couple spa and wellness rituals"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/pkaU6mSh022mUUhEXm7b8NSSAEvIDsfPIVKwYzc0.jpg", "title": "Sheesh Mahal bar for regal evenings"}]', '[{"id": 531, "question": "What is the ITC Rajputana Jaipur wedding cost?", "answer": "<p>On average, the cost of a destination wedding at ITC Rajputana, Jaipur, ranges from INR 80 lakhs to INR 1.25 Cr for a 3-day, 2-night celebration. To get an exact estimate, refer to Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator, enter your guest count, duration of stay and other details to get an instant quote.</p>"}, {"id": 532, "question": "How to reach ITC Rajputana, a Luxury Collection Hotel, Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>The distance from Jaipur International Airport (JAI) to the hotel is approximately 13 km, and the trip by car takes around 25 to 30 minutes.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 533, "question": "How does ITC Rajputana, a Luxury Collection Hotel, Jaipur, compare to Le Méridien Jaipur Resort & Spa?", "answer": "<p>Pick<strong> ITC Rajputana, Jaipur,&nbsp;</strong>for better connectivity, a wider budget range of INR 75 lakhs to 1.5 Cr and 218 rooms suited for a bigger guest count. On the other hand, consider Le Méridien Jaipur Resort &amp; Spa for a resort-style setting, with a budget of around INR 60 Lakhs to INR 1 Cr, and 126 rooms with a slightly longer airport transfer.</p>"}, {"id": 534, "question": "What is the check-in time at ITC Rajputana, a Luxury Collection Hotel, Jaipur, and can we check-in early?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>ITC Rajputana Jaipur</strong> is 3:00 pm, and guests can check out by 12:00 noon. An early check-in can be requested and accommodated, subject to hotel availability.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 535, "question": "What is the liquor policy for a destination wedding at ITC Rajputana Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>Alcohol is permitted at ITC Rajputana Jaipur; however, all beverages must be exclusively sourced through the hotel. Outside alcohol is not allowed, and drinks are charged separately based on consumption.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '125', '218'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'jaipur' AND `slug` = 'itc-rajputana-jaipur');
