SELECT 'jaipur', 'jai-mahal-palace-jaipur', 'published', 'Jai Mahal Palace Jaipur Wedding Cost & Packages', 'Plan your royal wedding at Jai Mahal Palace Jaipur. Explore packages, venue costs & décor options for an unforgettable regal celebration in Jaipur. Book!', 'jai mahal palace jaipur wedding, jai mahal palace wedding cost, jai mahal palace jaipur wedding cost, jai mahal palace jaipur prices, jai mahal palace, jai palace jaipur, jai mahal jaipur, jal mahal resort jaipur, jal mahal booking, jal mahal jaipur wedding, jai mahal palace wedding, jai mahal palace in jaipur', '/storage/hotel/seo/z3TQqYHHMoeXpRMP26Hm5TQuJz0EUdYjKjRmRQkb.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/Ofl8qa0bPkCIBeybvpKlepOwvTStQWk09q6qgWg0.jpg', 'Jai Mahal Palace Jaipur', 'Gound Floor, Jacob Rd, near Bharat Petroleum, Civil Lines, Jaipur, Rajasthan 302006, India', '30 Minutes', '10 Minutes', '<p>Spread across 18 acres, <strong>Jai Mahal Palace in Jaipur</strong> is an authentic 270-year-old Indo-Saracenic palace with a soul no modern venue can manufacture. Marble corridors, intricate jaali work and heritage frescoes hold centuries of stories within their walls, waiting to become a part of yours.</p><p>Sprawling gardens and magnificent banquet halls make an enchanting setting for a royal wedding at the<strong> Jai Mahal Resort</strong>. With a beautifully crafted mandap set amidst the vast lawns, watch the holy fire glow as the sacred pheras take place under the sun-kissed golden hour. Encircled by the rich aroma of fresh flowers and the gentle shimmer of traditional lamps, this <strong>destination wedding venue in Jaipur</strong> feels straight out of a fairytale.</p><p>Every wedding celebration at <strong>Jai Mahal Palace in Jaipur&nbsp;</strong>is held in a variety of sophisticated indoor venues, large gardens and heritage-inspired areas. This palace-turned-resort offers a seamless, unforgettable wedding experience in Jaipur, with custom décor, immersive dining and a setting steeped in regal Rajasthani charm.</p>', '100 Rooms With Suites', 'Durbar Hall, Silver Oak, Sterling', 'Celebration Lawns, Lotus Pond, Palace Lawns, Fountain Lawns, Poolside Lawns', '200', '200', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/A0A5FPEOiCSg3zEQkoHKDO1GnedEaVmsNrJHTVr4.jpg", "title": "3+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/mks3b63jl9w8N2WQLKBNfbDhxFppoSLuaUsiroBR.jpg", "title": "18 acres of landscaped gardens and lawns"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/GRSFvG0KJuF2pzlT64efXrAeeh285fPhyBQDlNUU.jpg", "title": "Royal welcome ceremony"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/VzZJEQDDIpVJMouLtcN46OiyJywFmJ8WYwTsywMN.jpg", "title": "Private dining experience for couples"}]', '[{"id": 158, "question": "What is the average cost of a wedding at Jai Mahal Palace, Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>On average, a <strong>destination wedding at Jai Mahal Palace in Jaipur&nbsp;</strong>ranges between INR 1.5 Cr and INR 2.5 Cr for a 2-night and 3-day ceremony. For a more personalised estimate, simply enter your preferred dates, number of rooms and total guests in our Venue Cost Calculator to receive an instant quote.</p>"}, {"id": 159, "question": "What is the check-in time at Jai Mahal Palace in Jaipur, and is a delayed check-out allowed?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at Jai Mahal Palace in Jaipur is 2:00 pm, and you must check out by 12:00 noon. In case of any delay, you can contact the hotel authorities directly and request a check-out extension, which may be accommodated, subject to availability.</p>"}, {"id": 160, "question": "How to book Jai Mahal Palace for a wedding celebration?", "answer": "<p>Owing to heavy demand during the wedding season, customers are usually advised to book at least 12 to 18 months in advance. You can contact the relevant authorities directly via their official email ID to make a reservation or connect with Viraaya Weddings for seamless booking assistance, competitive pricing and exclusive seasonal deals.</p>"}, {"id": 161, "question": "4.\tWhich is better for a destination wedding: Jai Mahal Resort, Jaipur, or Alila Fort, Bishangarh?", "answer": "<p>With wedding budgets of INR 1.5 Cr to INR 2.5 Cr,<strong> Jai Mahal Resort in Jaipur</strong> offers 94 rooms and 6 suites. It boasts of grand heritage charm, authentic palace gardens, curated dining experiences and seamless city connectivity. On the other hand, with budgets ranging from INR 90 lakh to INR 1.5 Cr, Alila Fort Bishangarh offers 87 rooms and suites. Located in a renovated warrior fort, it provides a more dramatic, remote setting with equally excellent dining options and moderate access from Jaipur.</p>"}, {"id": 162, "question": "What is the liquor policy at the Jai Mahal Resort, Jaipur, for a destination wedding?", "answer": "<p>Jai Mahal Resort in Jaipur allows alcohol, but all drinks served in banquet areas and public areas must be purchased through the hotel itself. Alcohol from outside is not permitted on the property. Beverages are typically not included in the standard wedding package and are billed separately based on consumption</p>"}]', '35', '100'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'jaipur' AND `slug` = 'jai-mahal-palace-jaipur');
