SELECT 'jaipur', 'le-meridien-jaipur-resort-and-spa', 'published', 'Le Meridien Jaipur Resort & Spa Luxury Wedding Deals Online!', 'Explore Le Méridien Jaipur Resort & Spa wedding cost, luxury venue details, premium stays, décor, catering, and elegant destination wedding experiences.', 'le meridien jaipur resort and spa wedding cost, le meridien jaipur resort and spa wedding price, le meridien jaipur resort and spa wedding, hotel le meridien jaipur', '/storage/hotel/seo/utzq96jRolegjggY0fRjf1dmdPIVZsQozbhBYV1I.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/h4IQOr8MKh1btDChuZWk5Wa4HA5qaOE33EXQXnNr.jpg', 'Le Meridien Jaipur Resort And Spa', 'Number 1, Riico, Kukas, Rajasthan 302038, India', '50 Minutes', '40 Minutes', '<p><strong>Le Méridien Jaipur Resort &amp; Spa</strong> has a calm, spacious feel that you notice as you move through it. Set over 25 acres in Kukas, the property is lined with fountains, frangipani trees and sandstone details that create a relaxed ambience rather than a dramatic first impression. The design draws from Rajasthani palace architecture but keeps things contemporary, so it feels rooted in tradition without coming across as heavy or overdone.</p><p>While hosting a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at Le Méridien Jaipur Resort &amp; Spa, Jaipur,</strong> you can make good use of its different venues. The Amer Ballroom and Diwan E Aam are well-suited for larger indoor celebrations, while the lawns work beautifully for daytime functions under open skies with the Aravallis in the background. Because everything sits within the same property, it’s easy to host multiple functions without things feeling disconnected.</p><p>For guests, the stay feels easy and comfortable from the start. Rooms are generously sized, dining options offer good variety and the service stays attentive without being intrusive, backed by Marriott hospitality standards. It caters well to both national and international guests, so everything from check-in to daily comfort tends to feel smooth and well-managed throughout the stay.</p>', '126 rooms and suites', 'Diwan E Aam, Amer Ballroom, Diwan E Khas, Aravali Hall', 'Amer Lawn, Aravali Lawns', '300', '300', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/p5wszjSie6RM3J0oxcR6CoS3uJw57j59Lkycpr5x.jpg", "title": "3+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/8nCViJrssQP1r00zyzFfTeQO7vBlyWCQnsNzQeVn.jpg", "title": "Signature gourmet menus for wedding celebrations"}]', '[{"id": 471, "question": "What is the cost of a destination wedding at Le Méridien Jaipur Resort & Spa?", "answer": "<p>The cost of a 3-day, 2-night destination wedding at&nbsp;<strong>Le Méridien Jaipur Resort &amp; Spa&nbsp;</strong>ranges between NR 60 lakhs and INR 1 Cr for a guest list of 150-200 people. To get an accurate estimate within seconds, use Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator by entering your guest count, room requirements, etc.</p>"}, {"id": 472, "question": "Which is the nearest airport to Le Méridien Jaipur Resort & Spa?", "answer": "<p>Jaipur International Airport (JAI) is the nearest airport to&nbsp;<strong>Le Méridien Jaipur Resort &amp; Spa</strong>. It is about 25–30 km away, usually a 1-hour car ride from Kukas.</p>"}, {"id": 473, "question": "Should I choose Le Méridien Jaipur Resort & Spa or The Palace By Park Jewels Hotels And Resorts for my wedding?", "answer": "<p>Choose Le Méridien Jaipur Resort &amp; Spa (INR 60 lakhs to INR 1 Cr) for a 150–200 guest, slightly more premium celebration with a quieter Kukas setting. Pick The Palace By Park Jewels Hotels And Resorts (INR 70 lakhs to INR 1.1 Cr) for better value, more rooms and quicker airport access, making guest movement easier.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 474, "question": "Is an early check-in available at Le Méridien Jaipur Resort & Spa?", "answer": "<p>Yes, an early check-in facility is available at&nbsp;<strong>Le Méridien Jaipur Resort &amp; Spa</strong>, and can be accommodated subject to availability. The standard check-in time is 3:00 pm, and check-out time is at 12:00 noon.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 475, "question": "What is the Le Méridien Jaipur Resort & Spa liquor policy?", "answer": "<p>At<strong> Le Méridien Jaipur Resort &amp; Spa,</strong> outside alcohol is not permitted within the property premises. All beverages for wedding events must be arranged through the hotel and are billed separately based on consumption.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '124', '126'
