SELECT 'jaipur', 'mementos-by-itc-hotels-jaipur', 'published', 'Mementos by ITC Hotels Jaipur Wedding Cost & Venue Details', 'Discover Mementos by ITC Hotels Jaipur with wedding cost details, wedding price insights and premium venue options. Book now for luxury stays!', 'mementos by itc hotels jaipur wedding cost, mementos by itc hotels jaipur wedding, mementos by itc hotels jaipur wedding price, mementos by itc hotels jaipur venue', '/storage/hotel/seo/7MKjvUyjM3t1ODbdXjNdgEkuV1a58aejzuiSj3We.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/o1d4t0UD4ec81JiTG7RPViK3m4ZFFwpK6VAttK0i.jpg', 'Mementos by ITC Hotels Jaipur', 'Khasra No. 66, near Kukas, Natata, Amer Chak No.2, Rajasthan 302028, India', '75 Minutes', '60 Minutes', '<p>At&nbsp;<strong>Mementos by ITC Hotels Jaipur,</strong> the design takes inspiration from Jaipur’s regal forts, with natural stone lending a timeless charm to the venue. The intricate thikri mirrorwork and marble-covered interiors give the venue a balanced sense of elegance. For a destination wedding at this property, these elements become part of the experience, making each event feel unique.</p><p>Throughout the day, natural sunlight does most of the storytelling. Sun-kissed rituals transition into soft, glowing evenings, with lanterns and subtle facade lighting adding warmth to the surroundings without detracting from the architecture. Set within the charm of the Pink City, it creates a setting that feels rooted, elegant and perfectly suited for a regal&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Jaipur.</strong></p><p>What makes it easy is how comfortable everything feels. ITC’s hospitality is warm and attentive, the amenities are well thought out for multi-day celebrations and guests, whether travelling from within India or abroad, settle in with ease. With good connectivity and key sights of Jaipur close by, it also allows for relaxed sightseeing alongside the wedding.</p>', '64', 'Jalsa Mahal', 'Shahi Bagh', '130', '150', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/INJb90LDrzpWGSM8ge59XME4hfra4xpVtolXeJhF.jpg", "title": "2+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/2k8ioueh3FV8IfPf0VuJmOZ7TdVImEze0he1LPlh.jpg", "title": "Private starlit garden dining experience"}]', '[{"id": 569, "question": "What is the average cost of a wedding at Mementos by ITC Hotels, Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>On average, a destination wedding at&nbsp;<strong>Mementos by ITC Hotels, Jaipur&nbsp;</strong>usually falls within the range of INR 70 lakhs to INR 1.2 Cr for a 3-day, 2-night celebration. Use Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator to get an instant quote on the wedding budget, based on your guest count, room requirements and other logistics.</p>"}, {"id": 570, "question": "Which is the nearest airport to Mementos by ITC Hotels in Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>Jaipur International Airport (JAI) is the nearest airport to the&nbsp;<strong>Mementos by ITC Hotels, Jaipur.&nbsp;</strong>Located about 28 km from the hotel, the airport is a 45 to 60-minute car ride from the resort.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 571, "question": "Should I choose Mementos by ITC Hotels, Jaipur or Raffles Jaipur for my wedding?", "answer": "<p>Go for&nbsp;<strong>Mementos by ITC Hotels, Jaipur</strong>, if you have a larger budget range of INR 70 lakhs to 1.2 Cr and 64 rooms, offering more flexibility. Choose Raffles Jaipur for a more boutique, exclusive setting with 50 rooms and a starting budget of INR 1 Cr to INR 1.5 Cr. For larger guest lists, off-site accommodation may be required at both properties due to fewer on-site rooms.</p>"}, {"id": 572, "question": "Is early check-in available for wedding guests at Mementos by ITC Hotels, Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>Yes, guests can request an early check-in at&nbsp;<strong>Mementos by ITC Hotels in Jaipur,&nbsp;</strong>subject to hotel availability. As per hotel policy, the standard check-in time is 3:00 pm and the check-out time is 12:00 noon.</p>"}, {"id": 573, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol to Mementos by ITC Hotels, Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>Alcohol is allowed at&nbsp;<strong>Mementos by ITC Hotels, Jaipur;</strong> however, all beverages must be purchased through the hotel. Outside alcohol is not permitted on the property premises, and drinks are billed separately based on consumption.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '179', '64'
