SELECT 'jaipur', 'mundota-fort-and-palace-jaipur', 'published', 'Mundota Fort & Palace Jaipur Wedding Cost & Booking', 'Say your vows at a real Jaipur fort! Mundota Fort & Palace offers royal wedding venues, competitive costs & exclusive packages. Check booking details now.', 'mundota palace jaipur wedding cost, mundota fort and palace wedding venue, mundota fort wedding, mundota fort wedding cost, mundota fort and palace wedding cost, mundota palace booking, mundota palace wedding cost, mundota palace wedding', '/storage/hotel/seo/VPzbYjdaOko6BbkEq8xALReIS1WQtKUoxQFvlcFw.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/4a2p7xo0k7HLPxFG0qJFYH7ziIxV2V0ztqcBGZ3S.jpg', 'Mundota Fort and Palace Jaipur', 'Mundota Rd, Mundota, Rajasthan 303706, India', '50 Minutes', '30 Minutes', '<p>A&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at Mundota Fort &amp; Palace, Jaipur</strong> has a certain drama to it, the moment you arrive. The fort rises on a hilltop, while the palace sits below, both part of a 450-year-old estate that still carries its original character. Walk through it, and you notice hand-painted frescoes, old courtyards, arched corridors and quiet terraces that feel untouched in parts. It doesn’t feel like a typical hotel, more like stepping into a place that has its own story.</p><p>Once you start planning the wedding festivities, the venues at the property give you enough room to work with. The Polo Lawn comfortably handles larger gatherings, while Noorbagh and Firdaus feel better suited for smaller, more personal events. What really adds to the experience are the peaceful moments in between, including a relaxed sundowner or an evening set up around the stepwell.</p><p>A&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Jaipur</strong> offers something distinct. Guests can stay across the palace and the hilltop-fort, enjoy the setting at their own pace and still be within comfortable reach of the city when required.</p>', '125', 'Rang Mahal, Grand Ballroom', 'Polo Lawn, Bagh-e-Inayat, Firdaus Garden, Noorbagh, Poolside', '250', '300', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/ScoB4jX6AMo2mExjUckqse1xfeVlM70yz0T0NSKd.jpg", "title": "2+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/ch7MvEVXJDpbWFdOzYbuW4m4urZwLpa6QV848ej2.jpg", "title": "Stepwell-inspired heritage dining experience"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/OeJhGGl30m3N3c6qaZXhcEBbBzoCDGqJmZGWeoq6.jpg", "title": "Private sunset cocktails with sweeping views"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/y8O4RdvmrAxXABMxmjI6Oi7anKngKn0nHfrG31Jy.jpg", "title": "Turret-top intimate dining under stars"}]', '[{"id": 341, "question": "What is the cost of a destination wedding at Mundota Fort & Palace in Jaipur?", "answer": "<p><strong>Booking a wedding venue at Mundota Fort &amp; Palace in Jaipur&nbsp;</strong>usually costs between INR&nbsp; 80 lakhs and INR 90 lakhs for a 3-day, 2-night celebration for 150–250 guests. Get an accurate quote within seconds through Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator, based on your guest count and room requirements.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 342, "question": "Can guests explore local sights during their stay at Mundota Fort & Palace, Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>Yes, guests can visit nearby attractions like Amer Fort, Jaigarh Fort, Nahargarh Fort and explore the old city markets of Jaipur between wedding festivities.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 343, "question": "How much can I save if I book the Mundota Fort & Palace in Jaipur through Viraaya Weddings?", "answer": "<p><strong>Booking the Mundota Fort &amp; Palace&nbsp;</strong>through Viraaya Weddings can help you save 10-15% while making planning easier and providing access to trusted vendors.</p>"}, {"id": 344, "question": "Can guests check-in early at the Mundota Fort & Palace, Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>Yes, an early check-in can be arranged, subject to hotel availability. The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Mundota Fort &amp; Palace, Jaipur,</strong> is 2:00 pm, and check-out time is at 10:00 am.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 345, "question": "Does the Mundota Fort & Palace in Jaipur offer bar service for weddings?", "answer": "<p>Outside alcohol is not allowed at<strong>&nbsp;</strong>the&nbsp;<strong>Mundota Fort &amp; Palace, Jaipur</strong>. All beverages must be exclusively sourced through the hotel and will be charged separately based on consumption.</p>"}]', '186', '125'
