SELECT 'jaipur', 'novotel-jaipur', 'published', 'Novotel Jaipur Convention Centre Luxury Wedding Cost & Deals', 'Explore Novotel Jaipur Convention Centre wedding cost, luxury wedding venues, premium packages, décor, catering, and elegant destination wedding experiences.', 'novotel jaipur convention centre wedding cost, novotel jaipur convention centre wedding venue, novotel jaipur convention centre wedding price, novotel jaipur convention centre wedding packages, novotel jaipur wedding cost', '/storage/hotel/seo/1v7hG1jeBQDQ3oj4vz1r7yFNPi8FjHsB4IxayP6g.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/CnWSdiWhRi36YHzRHvlCDVMuCIEfUo3ZglBfJkV9.jpg', 'Novotel Jaipur', 'Nh 12, Tonk Rd, Sitapura Industrial Area, Sitapura, Jaipur, Rajasthan 302022, India', '20 Minutes', '40 Minutes', '<p><strong>Novotel Jaipur Convention Centre&nbsp;</strong>offers one of the largest event setups in the city. The property is part of the larger JECC complex spread across 42 acres, managed by Accor. The property focuses on hosting large gatherings with ease, combining well-planned event spaces with comfortable accommodations. Its location also keeps you within reach of Jaipur’s main attractions, while still offering enough space for large groups to stay and celebrate together.</p><p>Couples planning a destination wedding here can host multiple functions without frequently changing venues. The hotel allows you to organise ceremonies, receptions, black-tie and pre-wedding events within the same space, giving an enjoyable and convenient experience to the guests.&nbsp;<strong>Novotel Jaipur Convention Centre&nbsp;</strong>is especially well-suited for large guest lists, with flexible indoor venues and well-planned arrangements that help each event run smoothly. The property is also very well connected, around a 10-15 minute drive from the Jaipur International Airport. This provides much-needed relief to international and long-distance attendees.&nbsp;</p>', '226 rooms with suites', 'Mugdha - The Grand Ballroom, JECC Exhibition Halls', 'Mugdha Lawns', '500', '500', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/115jVDBzI2z2mJTl7vl7RUs1WF0JcchsPCW1x2aJ.jpg", "title": "2+ gourmet bars and restaurants onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/KpLWtQlkfLIcx6pXJxpvGm77kjB3Q0aHHq4S7hu4.jpg", "title": "Ballroom venue with retractable auditorium"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/4vOI1ME3nNhTJo12tUXxN0YQiNXmGYzxcbpPtrWe.jpg", "title": "Presidential suite retreat for couples"}]', '[{"id": 486, "question": "Which is the nearest airport to the Novotel Jaipur Convention Centre?", "answer": "<p>The nearest airport to the&nbsp;<strong>Novotel Jaipur Convention Centre&nbsp;</strong>is the Jaipur International Airport (JAI), which is located just 10 kilometres away. The property is a mere 15-minute drive from the airport.</p>"}, {"id": 487, "question": "What are the check-in and check-out timings at the Novotel Jaipur Convention Centre? Are there any special privileges provided to wedding couples?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in and check-out times at the&nbsp;<strong>Novotel Jaipur Convention Centre&nbsp;</strong>are 2:00 PM and 12:00 noon, respectively. Any late check-out or early check-in requests should ideally be negotiated with the management. These are subject to availability and can lead to additional charges.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 488, "question": "Are there any activities or attractions near the Novotel Jaipur Convention Centre for international guests?", "answer": "<p>Definitely. The&nbsp;<strong>Novotel Jaipur Convention Centre</strong> is located close to famous city attractions, such as Amer Fort, Hawa Mahal and City Palace, allowing guests to experience Jaipur’s rich heritage and vibrant culture.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 489, "question": "How does the Novotel Jaipur Convention Centre compare to the InterContinental Jaipur Tonk Road by IHG?", "answer": "<p>Both the hotels fall around the same budget range of ₹40–50 lakhs for a standard 2-night celebration. They also contain around the same number of rooms, with the&nbsp;<strong>Novotel Jaipur Convention Centre&nbsp;</strong>having around 226, and the InterContinental possessing 218. Both properties have excellent connectivity and are located a few kilometres from the Jaipur International Airport (JAI).&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 490, "question": "What is the official liquor policy of the Novotel Jaipur Convention Centre?", "answer": "<p>Alcohol consumption is allowed inside the&nbsp;<strong>Novotel Jaipur Convention Centre.&nbsp;</strong>However, all the drinks and cocktails for public events should be purchased from the property’s in-house restaurants and bars. These are billed separately and are not included as part of your standard wedding package.&nbsp;</p>"}]', '184', '226'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'jaipur' AND `slug` = 'novotel-jaipur');
