SELECT 'jaipur', 'pride-amber-vilas-resort-and-convention-centre-jaipur', 'published', 'Pride Amber Vilas Jaipur - Wedding Cost & Resort Stay Info', 'Explore wedding costs, resort amenities & booking at Pride Amber Vilas Jaipur. Discover premium convention venues for a memorable celebration. Book Now!', 'pride amber vilas resort, pride amber vilas resort jaipur, amber vilas jaipur wedding cost, pride amber vilas jaipur wedding cost, pride amber vilas resort wedding', '/storage/hotel/seo/FOr3vIkFUJ8B0TlHvXURFguORny2SjkWNCaK5TkA.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/m4fN3B8IPms3G0jEiqR1pQEsqGhDGZWnyuTL9jBZ.jpg', 'Pride Amber Vilas Resort And Convention Centre Jaipur', 'Vatika Mod, 12 Mile, Tonk Rd, Sitapura Industrial Area, Sitapura, Jaipur, Laxmipura at Nataniwala, Rajasthan 303905, India', '20 Minutes', '50 Minutes', '<p>Grand arched gateways, sandstone-toned courtyards and beautifully lit haveli-style facades make&nbsp;<strong>Pride Amber Vilas Resort &amp; Convention Centre</strong> feel like a private royal estate tucked away on the quieter side of Jaipur. A&nbsp;<strong>wedding at Pride Amber Vilas Resort</strong> often begins with traditional welcomes and folk music before unfolding into lavish celebrations beneath crystal chandeliers and open desert skies. Recently renovated and spread across nearly 13-17 acres, the resort blends old-world Rajasthani charm with the comfort of a modern luxury retreat.</p><p>For couples planning a lavish&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Jaipur</strong>,&nbsp;<strong>Pride Amber Vilas Resort &amp; Convention Centre</strong> offers the kind of space that comfortably hosts both grand celebrations and intimate gatherings. The Central Lawn works beautifully for large receptions, while Rangmahal and Rajwada together provide nearly 465 sq. metres of elegant indoor event space for pre-wedding functions. With its haveli-style courtyards and sprawling lawns, the resort naturally lends itself to festive, multi-day wedding celebrations.</p><p>One of the nicest things about hosting a&nbsp;<strong>wedding at Pride Amber Vilas Resort</strong> is how effortless the experience feels for guests. The resort is located around 12 km from Jaipur International Airport and is easily accessible via Tonk Road, making arrivals simple and convenient. From welcoming guests with traditional Rajasthani touches to smoothly coordinating ceremonies and celebrations, the hospitality here feels warm, organised and genuinely attentive throughout the wedding festivities.</p>', '95 rooms with suites', 'Rangmahal, Rajwada, Hawa Mahal', 'Central Lawn, Havali Lawn', '250', '250', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/Ax2T6RzUJo5IEAqDPmGI913elqUUM5NjICy9p2ha.jpg", "title": "2+ dining venues onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/GiW8IxuG4sZcNB9kBuSr4XVFhJSKSWDu0mshyEfP.jpg", "title": "Starlit dining with royal flavours"}]', '[{"id": 1228, "question": "Is outside catering allowed at Pride Amber Vilas Resort & Convention Centre?", "answer": "<p><strong>Pride Amber Vilas Resort &amp; Convention Centre</strong> generally offers in-house catering for weddings and events. Outside catering may not be permitted, as food services are usually managed by the hotel’s culinary team.</p>"}, {"id": 1229, "question": "What are the standard check-in and check-out times at Pride Amber Vilas Resort, and can guests get an early check-in?", "answer": "<p>The standard time to check-in at&nbsp;<strong>Pride Amber Vilas Resort &amp; Convention Centre</strong> is 2:00 pm, and check-out time is 11:00 am. Guests can be accommodated with an early check-in, but it is entirely subject to the hotel’s discretion.</p>"}, {"id": 1230, "question": "Can we bring our own wedding planner/decorator to Pride Amber Vilas Resort, Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>Yes, couples can work with their own wedding planners and decorators at&nbsp;<strong>Pride Amber Vilas Resort &amp; Convention Centre</strong>. Coordination is generally managed between the external vendors and the hotel team to ensure smooth event execution and venue compliance.</p>"}, {"id": 1231, "question": "Are drones, fireworks or baraat allowed at Pride Amber Vilas Resort in Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>Baraat processions are generally permitted at&nbsp;<strong>Pride Amber Vilas Resort, Jaipur</strong>, subject to event planning and local regulations. Fireworks and drone usage may require prior permits and are usually handled on a case-by-case basis.</p>"}, {"id": 1232, "question": "Does the Pride Amber Vilas Resort & Convention Centre provide a bar service for weddings?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>Pride Amber Vilas Resort&nbsp;</strong>generally offers an in-house bar service for wedding celebrations and events. Alcoholic beverages are managed by the resort as per local licensing regulations, and are usually charged separately from wedding packages.</p>"}]', '248', '95'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'jaipur' AND `slug` = 'pride-amber-vilas-resort-and-convention-centre-jaipur');
