SELECT 'jaipur', 'raffles-jaipur', 'published', 'Raffles Jaipur Wedding Cost, Venues & Hotel Booking', 'Book your luxury destination wedding at Raffles Jaipur. Explore wedding cost, opulent palace venues & packages for an unforgettable Pink City wedding.', 'raffles jaipur wedding, raffles jaipur wedding cost, raffles hotel jaipur, raffles jaipur booking, raffles hotels & resorts jaipur', '/storage/hotel/seo/m45xWKLyNNnf7AWh367OvXjCH1ZQpOMx09MUPLqv.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/VicCU98yYIPDcUXjP0eFw2JIt1O0NXQxseAT0W7U.jpg', 'Raffles Jaipur', 'Khasara No 2060, 2061/2267, Amer, Kukas, Jaipur, Rajasthan 302028, India', '45 Minutes', '35 Minutes', '<p>Set against the rugged Aravalli landscape, <strong>Raffles Jaipur</strong> is designed as a reimagined queen’s palace, or <i>zenana</i>. The all-white façade, intricate detailing and balanced symmetry give it a soft, elegant look, blending classic influences with a more contemporary finish that photographs beautifully across every wedding function.</p><p><strong>Raffles Hotel, Jaipur,&nbsp;</strong>is ideal for intimate celebrations, with a mix of indoor and outdoor spaces that flow easily from one event to the next. Open terraces and atmospheric courtyards make up the main celebration spaces, while the Safir indoor venue serves as an elegant dining setting, allowing you to host your guests more easily.</p><p>What truly sets <strong>Raffles Jaipur</strong> apart is its impeccable hospitality services. With personalised attention and a calm, polished atmosphere, the experience feels seamless for both hosts and guests. Its warm, welcoming setting also helps out-of-state guests feel instantly at ease, offering a destination wedding experience in Jaipur that feels both luxurious and traditional.</p>', '50 rooms with suites', 'Safir Indoor Venue', 'Sehara Rooftop Terrace, Raffles Lawns', '150', '150', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/bmNJmSOpTMWIRfA3UUYBZwjYwWwKiJBj7AEwWxhJ.jpg", "title": "1.\t4+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/j8d0BqME1yTuZVeZwcwIv212C7oIboazHexLjklB.jpg", "title": "2.\tCouple’s romantic retreat package"}]', '[{"id": 64, "question": "1.\tHow much does a wedding at Raffles Jaipur cost?", "answer": "<p>On average, the&nbsp;<strong>Raffles Jaipur wedding cost</strong> can cost between INR 1 Cr to INR 1.5 Cr for a 3-day, 2-night event (for a full hotel buyout). To get a precise estimate on the wedding budget, consider using our Cost Calculator. Simply, enter your room requirements, total number of guests and check-in, check-out details and click on ‘calculate hotel cost,’ to instantly get a quote.</p>"}, {"id": 65, "question": "2.\tWhat is the check-in time at Raffles Hotel, Jaipur, and is an early check-in permitted?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at <strong>Raffles Jaipur</strong> is at 3:00 pm, and check-out is by 12:00 noon. Early check-in can be requested and is accommodated, subject to hotel availability.</p>"}, {"id": 66, "question": "3.\tWhich is better for a destination wedding: Raffles Jaipur or ITC Mementos, Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>With 50 rooms and the wedding can cost between INR 1 Cr to INR 1.5 crore, Raffles Jaipur is perfect for small, ultra-luxurious weddings, offering an intimate experience. With 64 suites and villas and a wedding budget ranging from INR 70 lakhs to INR 1.2 Cr, ITC Mementos Jaipur caters to a wider variety of festivities. Given their similar locations (27-28 km from the airport), the decision comes down to their budgets, flexibility and scale.</p>"}, {"id": 67, "question": "4.\tHow to check the availability of Raffles, Jaipur, for a destination wedding?", "answer": "<p>Contact the hotel directly or consult Viraaya Weddings for a quicker, more seamless experience. With Viraaya Weddings'' Venue Availability Check service, you can get real-time updates, explore competitive pricing and secure your dates with a smooth booking process.</p>"}, {"id": 68, "question": "5.\tWhat is the liquor policy for destination weddings at Raffles Hotel, Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>Alcohol is allowed at Raffles Jaipur; however, all beverages served in public areas and banquet spaces must be arranged solely through the hotel. Outside alcohol is not permitted within the premises. Beverage costs are charged separately based on consumption and are generally not included in the standard wedding packages.</p>"}]', '36', '50'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'jaipur' AND `slug` = 'raffles-jaipur');
--> statement-breakpoint
