SELECT 'jaipur', 'rajasthali-resorts-jaipur', 'published', 'Rajasthali Resort & Spa Jaipur Wedding Cost & Venue', 'Rajasthali Resort and Spa Jaipur wedding cost, wedding venue, destination wedding & reviews. Plan your wedding at Rajasthali Resort Jaipur. Book now!', 'rajasthali resort and spa wedding, rajasthali resort and spa wedding cost, rajasthali resort wedding, rajasthali resort wedding cost, rajasthali spa and resort jaipur, rajasthani resort and spa jaipur, rajasthali resort and spa wedding venue, rajasthali resort and spa destination wedding, rajasthali resort and spa reviews', '/storage/hotel/seo/EWzK2UJSYh3TdfG6RqJ5wqiLF7xiMO30amjXaDNF.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/lRbj9btnK3lBp3s5z3dogyDbm9ZtBjky0nVdFtB2.jpg', 'Rajasthali Resorts Jaipur', '3W23+JW9, Delhi - Jaipur Expressway, Kukas, Kookas, Rajasthan 302038, India', '60 Minutes', '50 Minutes', '<p><strong>Rajasthali Resort &amp; Spa, Jaipur,&nbsp;</strong>is set in Kukas along the Jaipur–Delhi Highway, making it fairly easy to reach while still offering a sense of distance from the city’s rush. Jaipur International Airport is about 25–32 km away, so guests travelling in for a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at Rajasthali Resort &amp; Spa, Jaipur</strong> usually find the connectivity quite convenient. As you enter the property, the setting opens up into wide Aravalli views, sandstone-inspired architecture and open courtyards that feel rooted in Rajasthan’s landscape.</p><p>Each space at this resort adds a unique character to each of the wedding ceremonies. While the Aravali Lawn is often chosen for larger outdoor functions, the Poolside and Oval Lawn suit more intimate gatherings like mehendi or sundowners. For indoor functions, Swarn Mahal offers a more formal backdrop for receptions and sangeet.</p><p>For those planning a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Jaipur,&nbsp;</strong>the location also works well for short excursions. Amer Fort, Nahargarh Fort and other heritage sites are within driving distance, giving guests the option to explore Jaipur between festivities without long travel times.</p>', '115', 'Swarn Mahal, Vice Regal', 'Aravali Lawn, Poolside Area, Oval Lawn', '230', '250', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/Q7Rw0dy8GExMnQepS9QvnQ0LeqeaBEgKZZBod0eR.jpg", "title": "1+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/F0ntyV7jExkdqqWKok0EIwJUaQiwqZ48RoZ03k0t.jpg", "title": "Curated sunset dining with Aravalli views"}]', '[{"id": 346, "question": "How much does a destination wedding at Rajasthali Resort & Spa, Jaipur cost?", "answer": "<p>As per&nbsp;<strong>Rajasthali Resort and Spa reviews,&nbsp;</strong>a destination wedding at Rajasthali Resort in Jaipur costs within the range of INR 65 lakhs and INR 80 lakhs for 150-200 guests. To get an accurate budget, refer to Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator, enter all the logistical details and get a near-exact quote.</p>"}, {"id": 347, "question": "Is early check-in available for wedding guests at Rajasthali Resort & Spa, Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>Yes, an early check-in facility is available at the resort, and accommodation is subject to availability. The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Rajasthali Resort &amp; Spa, Jaipur,</strong> is 2:00 pm, and check-out time is at 12:00 noon.</p>"}, {"id": 348, "question": "Which is the nearest airport to Rajasthali Resort & Spa, Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>Jaipur International Airport (JAI), located in Sanganer, is around 25–32 km from&nbsp;<strong>Rajasthali Resort &amp; Spa, Jaipur</strong>, with a typical drive time of 45 minutes to about an hour.</p>"}, {"id": 349, "question": "Which months are most popular for weddings at Rajasthali Resort & Spa, Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>November to February are among the most popular months for destination weddings at&nbsp;<strong>Rajasthali Resort &amp; Spa, Jaipur,</strong> due to the city’s pleasant weather.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 350, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol to Rajasthali Resort & Spa, Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>No, bringing outside alcohol to the resort is not allowed. All drinks and beverages must be purchased exclusively through the hotel. Beverages are charged separately based on consumption and are typically not included in the standard wedding package.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '185', '115'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'jaipur' AND `slug` = 'rajasthali-resorts-jaipur');
