SELECT 'jaipur', 'rambagh-palace-jaipur', 'published', 'Rambagh Palace Jaipur Wedding Cost & Venue Booking', 'Discover Rambagh Palace Jaipur wedding cost, venue booking & luxury packages. Check pricing, plan your royal celebration & book your dream wedding now.', 'rambagh palace jaipur wedding cost, rambagh palace wedding cost, cost of wedding at rambagh palace​, rambagh palace jaipur india, rambagh palace wedding, rambagh palace booking, rambagh palace jaipur price, rambagh palace jaipur reviews', '/storage/hotel/seo/9tpT7AbB5jxud2wJoDVzB0FksKjNmNHfJQqCMbs8.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/T22SV4dKceiops8VRom4EYlDpmceXu9hPv8JDq4l.jpg', 'Rambagh Palace  Jaipur', 'Bhawani Singh Rd, Rambagh, Jaipur, Rajasthan 302005, India', '30 min', '20 Min', '<p>Spread across 47 acres, the<strong> Rambagh Palace in Jaipur</strong> showcases a beautiful fusion of Rajputana and Indo-Saracenic architecture. The palace’s sprawling courtyards and intricately designed interiors make it a true testament to the royal elegance of Rajasthan, where each corner echoes a story of its own.</p><p>Renowned as the ‘Jewel of Jaipur’, the<strong> Rambagh Palace</strong> is one of the most popular <strong>destination wedding venues in Jaipur</strong>. Surrounded by the lush greens of the Aravallis, the Palace Hotel is set in the heart of the city, rendering a scenic backdrop for a wedding celebration. From sun-kissed mandaps to golden-hour portraits by fountains and terraces, witness the magic unfold as the sprawling lawns and regal courtyards set the scene for an awe-inspiring ceremony.</p><p>With a dedicated in-house team, <strong>Rambagh Palace Jaipur</strong> ensures that every detail of the wedding is thoughtfully planned and executed on time. The palace features a mix of intimate indoor and expansive outdoor spaces that make the celebration feel personal yet grand. Here, each celebration is steeped in romance, marking not just a wedding, but the beginning of a beautiful forever.</p>', '78 rooms with suites', 'Maharaja Mahal, Maharani Mahal, Chandra Mahal, Chambers of Princes', 'Oriental Terrace, Panghat Lawn, Sunken Lawn, Mughal Garden, Mughal Terrace, Oriental Garden, Naksha Garden', '200', '200', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/fMpinqd2994gp60BqeEKT6LJ1Hlx7o2hU5eKwDM6.jpg", "title": "5+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/Oi1j1UKtNB9WFxa9bPWRdadT1KZQxLVKbTfkjA7X.jpg", "title": "Couples’ horse-drawn carriage rides across the palace grounds"}]', '[{"id": 163, "question": "How much does a destination wedding at the Rambagh Palace, Jaipur, cost?", "answer": "<p>On average, the cost of a <strong>destination wedding at Rambagh Palace in Jaipur</strong> is usually between INR 3.75 Cr and INR 4.25 Cr for a 3-day 2-night celebration. To get a precise quote, you can use our Wedding Cost Calculator, enter your preferred dates, total number of rooms required and other details, click on ‘calculate hotel cost’, and there you go.</p>"}, {"id": 164, "question": "What is the check-in time at Rambagh Palace, Jaipur, and can we get a late check-out?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at Rambagh Palace, Jaipur, is 2:00 pm, and you can check-out by 12:00 noon. However, according to<strong> Rambagh Palace Jaipur reviews, i</strong>f you need an extension of your check-out time, you can contact the hotel directly, and your request is most likely to be accommodated, subject to availability.</p>"}, {"id": 165, "question": "Which is a better venue for a destination wedding in Jaipur: Rambagh Palace or Jai Mahal Palace?", "answer": "<p>Your guest list and budget are key considerations when choosing a <strong>destination wedding venue in Jaipur,</strong> especially in terms of residential capacity. Both Rambagh Palace, Jaipur and Jai Mahal Palace, Jaipur, accommodate&nbsp;around, 200 residential guests. Rambagh Palace, with wedding budgets ranging from INR 3.75 to 4.25 crore, is known for its iconic, opulent setting, while Jai Mahal Palace, typically costs between INR 1.5 and 2.5 crore, stands out for its picturesque landscapes and expansive gardens.</p>"}, {"id": 166, "question": "What is the liquor policy at Rambagh Palace, Jaipur?", "answer": "<p><strong>Rambagh Palace in Jaipur</strong> offers a fine selection of wines, whiskies and cocktails at its licensed venues, including the Polo Bar, which is open daily from noon to 11:45 pm. Alcohol is served in these areas, ensuring a classy and sophisticated experience throughout the palace.</p>"}, {"id": 167, "question": "How to secure a booking for a wedding at Rambagh Palace, Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>To secure <strong>a booking at Rambagh Palace for a destination wedding</strong>, contact the hotel authorities via their official email ID at least 8 to 12 months in advance. For a smoother experience, consider consulting Viraaya Weddings, which offers efficient booking services, competitive rates and exclusive deals customised for wedding celebrations.</p>"}]', '37', '78'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'jaipur' AND `slug` = 'rambagh-palace-jaipur');
