SELECT 'jaipur', 'samode-bagh-jaipur', 'published', 'Samode Bagh Jaipur Royal Wedding Cost and Venue Details', 'Explore Samode Bagh Jaipur wedding cost, luxury packages, guest reviews, royal architecture, décor, catering & elegant destination wedding experiences.', 'samode bagh wedding cost, samode bagh wedding, samode bagh wedding packages, samode bagh reviews', '/storage/hotel/seo/f8MBxd2VvhFs5jYL7rSzJPMITdbL8ZJHn95iATXz.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/1SvgpGYDSFErqZD4rHgcFTGrNBYBW7uDxWu6rxEg.jpg', 'Samode Bagh Jaipur', 'Tehsil, Village Samode, Chomu, Rajasthan 303806, India', '90 minutes', '60 Minutes', '<p>A&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at Samode Bagh, Jaipur,</strong> doesn’t begin with a ballroom; it begins with a walk through a 250-year-old Mughal garden once used as a royal retreat. Located away from the main city, yet close enough to the Pink City, the setting feels quiet, almost untouched, with water channels, old trees and pathways that have been part of its story for generations.</p><p>Weddings here feel more intimate, set within a palace-turned-hotel that still holds on to its original garden layout. Most functions take place across the lawns and terraces, with spaces like the arched gazebo and garden courtyards working well for smaller, more personal gatherings. Samode Palace is just a short drive away, which adds another layer to the experience, whether for a visit or an extended celebration.</p><p>What guests tend to remember is how naturally everything comes together. The tented accommodation sits right within the gardens, meals are well curated and the service feels attentive without being overdone. For a destination wedding in the Pink City,&nbsp;<strong>Samode Bagh, Jaipur,</strong> offers a setting that feels more personal and rooted in heritage than a typical hotel.</p>', '44 luxury tents and 27 suites', 'Banquet Suite', 'Arched Terrace Gazebo, Expansive Lawns', '190', '190', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/FdUJ5SCuLJ9hKTLCkxpb9qEPbpVlQK3vUwPDXzet.jpg", "title": "2+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/LycZohCfxln3kBJeR21fmm3UL7ZHUMRku4kGae0k.jpg", "title": "Romantic garden dinners under lanterns"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/NY8RW6ocsfQf145qgVCUp1H975rXu41u2QWn2Dvp.jpg", "title": "Rustic farm picnics with local flavours"}]', '[{"id": 481, "question": "What is the average cost of a wedding at Samode Bagh, Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>The standard cost of a destination wedding at<strong> Samode Bagh, Jaipur,</strong> ranges from INR 35 lakhs to INR 55 lakhs for a 3-day, 2-night ceremony with approximately 200 guests. To get an instant quote on the budget, based on your guest count and requirements, use Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator.</p>"}, {"id": 482, "question": "How to reach Samode Bagh, Jaipur from the nearest airport?", "answer": "<p>Samode Bagh is about 40-50 km away from Jaipur International Airport (JAI). Take a private taxi from the airport to the heritage hotel, roughly 1–1.5 hours via Sikar Road.</p>"}, {"id": 483, "question": "Can I host a pre-wedding photoshoot at Samode Bagh, Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>Yes, pre-wedding photoshoots are permitted at&nbsp;<strong>Samode Bagh, Jaipur,</strong> only with prior permission. Charges apply based on the space used, and advance booking is recommended.</p>"}, {"id": 484, "question": "Is early check-in available at Samode Bagh, Jaipur, and what is the check-out time?", "answer": "<p>Yes, an early check-in can be arranged, subject to hotel availability. The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Samode Bagh, Jaipur,</strong> is 2:00 pm, and check-out time is at 12:00 noon.</p>"}, {"id": 485, "question": "What is Samode Bagh, Jaipur’s standard liquor policy?", "answer": "<p>Outside alcohol is not allowed inside&nbsp;<strong>Samode Bagh, Jaipur</strong>. All beverages must be exclusively sourced through the hotel and are billed separately based on consumption, as they are not part of standard wedding packages.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '246', '44'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'jaipur' AND `slug` = 'samode-bagh-jaipur');
--> statement-breakpoint
