SELECT 'jaipur', 'taj-amer-jaipur', 'published', 'Taj Amer Jaipur Destination Wedding Cost & Packages', 'Get complete details on Taj Amer Jaipur destination wedding cost & packages, including venue pricing, guest capacity & premium services for your big day.', 'taj amer jaipur destination wedding cost, taj amer destination wedding cost, taj amer jaipur destination wedding, Taj Amer Jaipur wedding & events, Taj Amer Jaipur wedding venue booking, taj amer wedding, taj amer wedding cost, taj amer jaipur price for wedding, resort in amer jaipur, Taj Amer Jaipur online booking"', '/storage/hotel/seo/MndXoUlvk4CSc3tMNzmiz2xW7ZXU7pULhIpdavHj.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/0xHGEapD738Q9bo5cmZUQpx4OTFptpp6O6fEM28d.jpg', 'Taj Amer Jaipur', 'No. 54, 55 & 56, Delhi Highway, near Indana Palace, Kunda, Amer, Jaipur, Rajasthan 302028, India', '57 Min', '47 Min', '<p>The <strong>Taj Amer in Jaipur</strong> is located away from the busy markets of the Pink City, embodying the same cultural richness as its surroundings. The historic Amer Fort is situated nearby, standing as an unmistakable symbol of royalty and grandeur. The hotel’s rooms and suites contain elaborate detailing inspired by the peacock, with many opening out to stunning Aravalli views. Throughout the property, picturesque lawns and pools create a peaceful setting for relaxation and celebration.</p><p>A <strong>destination wedding at the Taj Amer, Jaipur</strong>, is nothing short of a dream come true. The hotel offers premium access to 9 venues, including the grand Jaigarh Hall and an expansive lawn covering 3,241 sq. metres. Panoramic views of the Fort and the Hills provide a majestic backdrop to your intimate ceremonies. Moreover, diverse dining spaces provide a range of culinary experiences for your guests, with live music and performances offering immersive entertainment.&nbsp;</p>', '245 rooms with suites', 'Jaigarh Hall, Samwaadi (1,2,3), Raas (1,2,3), Kundanvan Ballroom', 'Kundanvan Lawn', '500', '500', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/6axqY4xoXOohYvdi7OEPRw1JRhDGONCbuiWvfeLG.jpg", "title": "Private dining service Aravalli views"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/slMIq7xvD6I3WUxR9yFS2aE4TH0btoR3Mgo58rx6.jpg", "title": "Abhisarana therapy for couples"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/6h1V8LXiw3tnZf6SWHHj9kJddjre1ZVv8ERxmjT4.jpg", "title": "5 exquisite dining venues"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/By9H1dkbGvAnueyQkkI0U5YXj7AHmXkK9YFO4VbV.jpg", "title": "Largest banquet hall in Jaipur"}]', '[{"id": 144, "question": "Are there any special check-in and check-out privileges at the Taj Amer Jaipur?", "answer": "<p><strong>Taj Amer Jaipur</strong> operates with a check-in time of 2:00 PM and check-out by 12:00 noon. While special, guaranteed early check-in or late check-out privileges are not explicitly listed for all guests, the hotel offers 24-hour front desk service to assist with such requests.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 145, "question": "Which hotel is better for hosting a wedding: Taj Amer Jaipur or Hyatt Regency Jaipur Mansarovar?", "answer": "<p>It really depends on the type of celebration you see yourself having. Both hotels are perfectly matched for large groups, as Taj Amer and Hyatt Regency Mansarovar each offer 245 rooms. However, they differ in ambience: <strong>Taj Amer Jaipur</strong> is located near the Aravalli hills &amp; more business style hotel. In contrast, the Hyatt Regency feels like a grand heritage estate right in the city, perfect for a high-energy, classic royal wedding. The <strong>Taj Amer Jaipur&nbsp;</strong>also has more varied options when it comes to in-house catering.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 146, "question": "How much does a wedding at the Taj Amer cost?", "answer": "<p>A wedding <strong>at Taj Amer, Jaipur</strong> generally costs between ₹1.75 crore and ₹2.5 crore (or more) for a three-day, two-night celebration for 400 to 500 guests.&nbsp;The exact cost depends on the number of guests and venues you use. If you want a transparent and instantaneous estimate, enter your details into Viraaya Weddings'' Venue Cost Calculator.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 147, "question": "What is the Taj Amer Jaipur’s policy when it comes to liquor?", "answer": "<p>The <strong>Taj Amer Jaipur&nbsp;</strong>offers in-house alcohol in restaurants and poolside bars. This is billed separately and not included in the standard wedding package. All drinks and beverages for public events should be purchased only from the hotel’s licensed venues.&nbsp;</p>"}]', '32', '245'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'jaipur' AND `slug` = 'taj-amer-jaipur');
--> statement-breakpoint
