SELECT 'jaipur', 'taj-devi-ratn-resort-and-spa-jaipur', 'published', 'Taj Devi Ratn Jaipur Wedding Cost for Royal Events', 'Experience Taj Devi Ratn Resort & Spa Jaipur with elegant stays and detailed wedding cost information. Contact us today for luxury deals now!', 'taj devi ratn resort spa jaipur wedding cost, taj devi ratn resort & spa jaipur wedding cost, taj devi ratn jaipur wedding cost, taj devi ratan hotel jaipur, taj devi ratn jaipur', '/storage/hotel/seo/4qrQJRMR5BeGpIGZzxOYMlpXZtRPljln38FhcmjW.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/5BRrao09r1wCLgQxNCaVOqOUvTH3HDp9YL0jWTAS.jpg', 'Taj Devi Ratn Resort And Spa Jaipur', 'Ballupura Farms, No. 8 & 9, Agra Road, Jamdoli, Balloopura, Jaipur, Rajasthan 302031, India', '40 Minutes', '35 Minutes', '<p>A&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Jaipur at Taj Devi Ratn Resort &amp; Spa&nbsp;</strong>feels grounded in the landscape rather than built to impress at first glance. The property is built along the rugged Aravallis and uses local stone, angular layouts, and jaali work to blend in with the surrounding landscape, making the views and architecture feel like part of this scenic setting.</p><p>At&nbsp;<strong>Taj Devi Ratn Resort &amp; Spa Jaipur,&nbsp;</strong>celebrations take place across various venues, giving the resort a calm, easy-on-the-eye feel rather than an overly styled one. The Centre Pavilion becomes the heart of larger celebrations, comfortably hosting 300 to 350 guests under expansive skies. Throughout the day, sunlight lights up the open corridors. After the sun dips, soft, warm lighting takes centre stage, exuding a golden glow.</p><p>A wedding here keeps things simple, but never plain. The food feels well thought through, Taj hospitality is polished yet unobtrusive, and everything works together to make the celebration feel intimate and relaxed.</p>', '145', 'Adya Ballroom, Dhara, Bhoomi', 'Centre Pavilion', '290', '340', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/PMKXzR8mu4ph57ULi5lzI0UjZIJ5zTcGgwIwb9hL.jpg", "title": "4+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/jh03zVtY21med9QY8qJ2taZRHVeShJIAIqmIfbGg.jpg", "title": "Floating pool breakfast experience"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/eEM3HHoU5kXk0DwBP8ewBqZiAtLnqhHHhhTUIclU.jpg", "title": "Romantic villa dining under stars"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/AOXMn8EM4QeIgXgK2jEPvd0xoqAsnH3vNDY1zWK5.jpg", "title": "Intimate backyard barbecue dining"}]', '[{"id": 564, "question": "How much does a destination wedding at Taj Devi Ratn Resort & Spa, Jaipur cost?", "answer": "<p>The standard cost of a destination wedding at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Devi Ratn Resort &amp; Spa, Jaipur,&nbsp;</strong>ranges from INR 1.2 Cr to INR 1.7 Cr for 300 guests. To find out the exact budget for a 3-day, 2-night celebration, use Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator, enter the necessary details and get a precise quote based on your requirements.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 565, "question": "Which is the nearest airport to Taj Devi Ratn Resort & Spa, Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>Jaipur International Airport (JAI) is the closest airport to&nbsp;<strong>Taj Devi Ratn Resort &amp; Spa in Jaipur</strong>. The airport is about 21 kilometres from the property, and it takes around 40 to 50 minutes to get there.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 566, "question": "Should I choose Taj Devi Ratn Resort & Spa, Jaipur or Hyatt Regency Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>Choose&nbsp;<strong>Taj Devi Ratn Jaipur</strong> for an intimate wedding with 125 rooms, 17 suites and 3 villas, a budget of INR 1.2–1.7 Cr and airport access in about 40–50 minutes. Opt for Hyatt Regency Jaipur Mansarovar if you want a larger guest count, 245 rooms and villas along with quicker airport access within 15-20 minutes.</p>"}, {"id": 567, "question": "Can guests check in early at Taj Devi Ratn Resort & Spa, Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>Yes, an early check-in facility can be arranged through the hotel, subject to availability. The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Devi Ratn Resort &amp; Spa, Jaipur</strong> is 2:00 pm, and check-out time is 12:00 noon.</p>"}, {"id": 568, "question": "What is Taj Devi Ratn Resort & Spa, Jaipur’s liquor policy for destination weddings?", "answer": "<p>Alcohol is permitted at Taj Devi Ratn Resort &amp; Spa Jaipur, but all beverages must be purchased through the hotel. Outside alcohol is not allowed, and drinks are charged separately based on consumption, usually not included in standard wedding packages.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '146', '145'
