SELECT 'jaipur', 'the-gold-palace-and-resorts-jaipur', 'published', 'The Gold Palace & Resorts Jaipur Wedding Cost & Bookings', 'Planning a royal wedding in Jaipur? Hotel The Gold Palace & Resorts provides stunning venues, transparent Wedding Costs & tailored packages. Book your date!', 'hotel the gold palace & resorts wedding, hotel the gold palace & resorts wedding cost, the gold palace & resorts, the gold palace and resort', '/storage/hotel/seo/A3AujXaqCm85P0irQPjlGgO08f7vwnqeD1HSdOZn.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/xoFBuSI5SpLNydrDwGfXCmhUDpW0EhYLdhY33r8s.jpg', 'The Gold Palace And Resorts Jaipur', '8th Mile, Jaipur Road, Jaipur, Rajasthan 302038, India', '50 Minutes', '40 Minutes', '<p>Not every&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Jaipur</strong> needs to feel like a crowded palace event in the middle of the city. Tucked into the quieter Kukas valley and framed by the Aravali hills,&nbsp;<strong>Hotel The Gold Palace &amp; Resorts</strong> offers a setting that feels far more relaxed, private and immersive. The moment guests enter through its towering sandstone gates and symmetrical regal-style courtyards, the property begins to feel less like a hotel and more like a festive royal estate designed entirely for celebrations.</p><p>A&nbsp;<strong>wedding at Hotel The Gold Palace &amp; Resorts</strong> is perfect for couples who want to host a large celebration that still feels warm and personal. The Mughal Gardens come alive during sangeet nights and outdoor receptions, while the Main Banquet Hall works well for traditional functions and family dinners. Some of the nicest moments here are often the simplest ones, like gathering for a late-night barbecue or watching the baraat make its way through the beautifully lit palace-style entrance.</p><p>One of the biggest strengths of&nbsp;<strong>Hotel The Gold Palace &amp; Resorts</strong> is how easily guests can enjoy the destination without complicated travel logistics. Located around 31 km from Jaipur International Airport, the resort stays well-connected while still offering a peaceful escape near Amer Fort and Nahargarh Biological Park for guests extending their stay.</p>', '70 rooms with suites', 'Main Banquet Hall', 'Majestic Mughal Gardens, Gala Dinner Lawn, Poolside Lawn Area', '200', '200', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/jiAFZYIj5w4ScXN8BCRTvFtUIhWbsr5ScWQA22Ij.jpg", "title": "4+ dining venues onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/AxTpDffyqjlu71RRad5X50QrYD1gCyR4EiKTokE1.jpg", "title": "Candlelit waterfall dining for couples"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/Ir2rLMFbpi8ZehfEf7mHGPrOkiFIfiyASfhTBADC.jpg", "title": "Palatial baraat welcomes with traditions"}]', '[{"id": 1213, "question": "How early should I book the Hotel The Gold Palace & Resorts for a wedding?", "answer": "<p>It is best to book&nbsp;<strong>The Gold Palace &amp; Resort, Jaipur,</strong> around 12 to 18 months in advance, especially for peak wedding season dates. Popular winter weekends and large celebrations tend to get reserved much earlier.</p>"}, {"id": 1214, "question": "Is an early check-in available at Hotel The Gold Palace & Resorts?", "answer": "<p>Yes, guests can get an early check-in to the hotel, subject to availability. The standard check-in and check-out time at&nbsp;<strong>Hotel The Gold Palace &amp; Resorts&nbsp;</strong>is 12:00 noon.</p>"}, {"id": 1215, "question": "What is the ideal cost of a 2-night wedding at Hotel The Gold Palace & Resorts, Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>For about 150-200 guests, a&nbsp;<strong>Hotel The Gold Palace &amp; Resorts wedding&nbsp;</strong>cost ranges between INR 35 lakhs to INR 65 lakhs, depending on season, décor and event scale. Use Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator to get a closer estimate based on your guest count, room and F&amp;B requirements.</p>"}, {"id": 1216, "question": "Are engagement shoots allowed at Hotel The Gold Palace & Resorts in Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>Yes, engagement and pre-wedding shoots can usually be arranged at&nbsp;<strong>Hotel The Gold Palace &amp; Resorts, Jaipur,</strong> with prior permission. Timings, access and applicable charges may vary depending on hotel availability and event schedules.</p>"}, {"id": 1217, "question": "What is the standard liquor policy at the Hotel The Gold Palace & Resorts?", "answer": "<p><strong>Hotel The Gold Palace &amp; Resorts&nbsp;</strong>generally manages alcoholic beverages through its in-house bar service for weddings and events. Drinks are served as per local licensing regulations and are usually billed separately from the wedding package.</p>"}]', '194', '70'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'jaipur' AND `slug` = 'the-gold-palace-and-resorts-jaipur');
