SELECT 'jaipur', 'the-jaibagh-palace-jaipur', 'published', 'The Jaibagh Palace Jaipur - Heritage Weddings Cost Details', 'Host a majestic wedding at The Jaibagh Palace Jaipur. Explore heritage wedding costs, regal venues & bespoke packages for a royal celebration in Kukas.', 'jaibagh palace wedding cost, jaibagh palace jaipur wedding, jaibagh palace jaipur wedding cost, jaibagh palace wedding, the jaibagh palace wedding cost, jai bagh palace jaipur wedding cost', '/storage/hotel/seo/cJDWjug6Q5cigi1KEmCWZYwATYLCSYv1tPa0SQ7O.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/ItHbwSGOCjXpIuOI5AMcsibQDDp6V4TaQyBae3Ha.jpg', 'The JaiBagh Palace Jaipur', 'Tehsil, Village Kacherawalla, Amer, Jaipur, Rajasthan 303805, India', '60 Minutes', '40 Minutes', '<p>Planning a&nbsp;<strong>wedding at The JaiBagh Palace</strong> feels like stepping into a private royal world set against the Aravalli foothills. This 5-star luxury hotel property in Kukas, Jaipur, is spread across expansive landscaped grounds where sandstone courtyards, domes and water features create a timeless palace-like atmosphere. With over 60 rooms and suites, it’s designed to host large guest lists while still keeping the celebration warm, personal and connected.</p><p>At&nbsp;<strong>The JaiBagh Palace</strong>, weddings flow across beautifully designed open spaces and grand lawns that together stretch across 1,400 sq metres of event area. From the expansive Bageecha Lawn to the lakeside charm of Sarovar Lawn and the intimate Chowk Courtyard, each venue brings a different mood to your&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Jaipur</strong>. The Aravalli backdrop and open skies make every ceremony feel cinematic, especially during sunset pheras.</p><p>What makes a&nbsp;<strong>palace setting, an intimate wedding in Jaipur,</strong> here truly special is the experience around it. Guests are welcomed with traditional Rajasthani warmth, live dhol and celebratory rituals, then retreat into rooms that open to gardens or hill views. With Amer Fort, Jaigarh Fort and Nahargarh Fort just a short drive away, the location adds a cultural layer to the celebration. At&nbsp;<strong>The JaiBagh Palace</strong>, every moment feels thoughtfully framed for a once-in-a-lifetime wedding.</p>', '60 rooms with suites', 'Indoor Banquet Hall', 'Bageecha Lawn, Sarovar Lawn, The Chowk Courtyard', '150', '150', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/je5wTMiEYRDL0MaHPNpmj2KCAfiWaZ73oF2i2nJC.jpg", "title": "2+ dining venues onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/Ly0CMxinx6YpMvJ8DaVt0KinTfrVrbYO3ZMpaujt.jpg", "title": "Private poolside dinners under stars"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/HpYvbsVeyKp3EwTxWfdBSzzy2VzeFFhTZu1QfCYc.jpg", "title": "Grand palace-style baraat welcomes"}]', '[{"id": 1268, "question": "How early should I book the JaiBagh Palace for a wedding?", "answer": "<p>It is best to book&nbsp;<strong>JaiBagh Palace, Jaipur,</strong> around 9 to 12 months in advance, especially for winter wedding dates and popular marriage season weekends.</p>"}, {"id": 1269, "question": "What is the standard time to check-in at The JaiBagh Palace, and can I get an early check-in?", "answer": "<p>The standard time to check-in at&nbsp;<strong>The JaiBagh Palace</strong> is 2:00 pm, and check-out time is 12:00 noon. Guests can request an early check-in to the hotel in advance, and it can be arranged subject to hotel availability.</p>"}, {"id": 1270, "question": "What is the ideal cost of a 2-night wedding at The JaiBagh Palace, Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>The standard cost of&nbsp;<strong>The JaiBagh Palace Jaipur wedding&nbsp;</strong>ranges between INR 45 lakhs to INR 85 lakhs, for a 2-night, 3-day celebration. To get an accurate cost based on your requirements, you can use Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator and get an instant quote to work with.</p>"}, {"id": 1271, "question": "What is the history of the JaiBagh Palace in Jaipur?", "answer": "<p><strong>JaiBagh Palace, Jaipur,&nbsp;</strong>is a modern heritage-style palace resort inspired by traditional Rajput architecture rather than an original royal residence. Built in 2014, it features grand courtyards, domes and palace-like facades, recreating royal Jaipur charm with contemporary hospitality.</p>"}, {"id": 1272, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol to The JaiBagh Palace in Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>At&nbsp;<strong>The JaiBagh Palace in Jaipur,</strong> guests are generally not permitted to bring their own alcohol. All beverages are arranged through the property’s in-house bar service for weddings and events. Drinks are usually billed separately from the main wedding package.</p>"}]', '193', '60'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'jaipur' AND `slug` = 'the-jaibagh-palace-jaipur');
