SELECT 'jaipur', 'the-leela-palace-jaipur', 'published', 'The Leela Palace Jaipur Wedding Cost & Venue Booking', 'Looking for a royal wedding in Jaipur? Explore The Leela Palace Jaipur wedding cost, destination wedding venues & packages for your grand Pink City wedding.', 'leela palace wedding jaipur, the leela palace jaipur wedding, the leela palace jaipur wedding cost, the leela palace jaipur wedding venue, leela jaipur wedding cost, leela palace jaipur destination wedding cost, wedding leela palace jaipur', '/storage/hotel/seo/oNjKnzVCOy7nt7ENzwiwa4nhoUYZYbsOcvgIY8nV.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/xHpUQh6TgqG8opRjgZrck3OCiBQZc1XQeZVLHZ4e.jpg', 'The Leela Palace Jaipur', 'Jaipur-Delhi Highway, NH 11, Kukas, Jaipur, Rajasthan 302038, India', '60 Minutes', '50 Minutes', '<p><strong>The Leela Palace Jaipur&nbsp;</strong></p><p>Spanning 8 acres of landscaped grounds at the foothills of the Aravallis, the&nbsp;<strong>Leela Palace Jaipur</strong> is a tribute to the regal years of the Maharajahs. Presenting a modern expression of Rajputana and Mughal heritage, the Palace captivates with its luminous ivory exteriors and intricate jaalis.</p><p>Rajasthani cultural artefacts and murals adorn the walls, making every stroll an immersive experience. &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Plan an iconic&nbsp;<strong>Leela Palace wedding&nbsp;</strong>where every celebration finds its perfect setting. With 10 distinct event spaces, the Palace is perfect for intimate ceremonies as well as grand receptions. Its crystal-lit ballrooms, sprawling lawns and terraces create scenic backdrops for sangeet nights and formal banquets. Exclusive dining venues and cocktail hours create memorable evenings for families and guests alike. Airport transfers and convenient connectivity from Delhi guarantee a comfortable arrival for your wedding celebrations.</p>', '200, with royal villas and suites', 'Vikram Aditya Grand Ballrooms with a pre-function area, Hawa Mahal', 'Sundarban Lawns, Kanishka Bagh', '400', '1500 (Sundarban Lawns)', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/VlhbclkIrnpbExdI8YmGNYtPUC61pgt0H4NFwn2K.jpg", "title": "8 distinct global cuisine lounges"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/LYpBpbEKkNNaYo6cBDhtMRaddauPPLEuZeI3OzFv.jpg", "title": "Chauffeur-driven limousine transfers"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/24V6o77NHeAWMo3bRHWuAKmvcEAUq7nmvJ5bVile.jpg", "title": "In-house catering and wedding planners"}]', '[{"id": 656, "question": "Which hotel in Jaipur is best suited for weddings: The Leela Palace or the Taj Amer?", "answer": "<p>Both&nbsp;<strong>The Leela Palace Jaipur&nbsp;</strong>and Taj Amer Jaipur are good wedding venues. The final choice rests entirely on your preference. The Leela Palace is known for its palatial setting and highly personalised luxury service. Taj Amer is known for larger event spaces and modern amenities. What is best for your celebrations depends on guest count, budget and preferred celebration style.</p>"}, {"id": 657, "question": "What facilities are present in the guest rooms and villas?", "answer": "<p>The&nbsp;<strong>Leela Palace Jaipur wedding venue&nbsp;</strong>provides guests with in-room dining, concierge, laundry, dry cleaning and doctor-on-call services. Guests can also access the Salon, which offers a number of services by trained professionals. Bicycles are available for leisure activities upon request.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 658, "question": "How much does a Leela Palace Jaipur destination wedding package cost?", "answer": "<p>A wedding at&nbsp;<strong>The Leela Palace Jaipur</strong> usually costs between ₹3 crore and ₹4 crore for a 2-night celebration. If you initiate a full hotel buyout for 2 nights, it can also range between ₹3,5–4 Crore. However, prices vary according to guest lists and venue usage. For an accurate and transparent reading, you can make use of our Cost Calculator.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 659, "question": "What is the Leela Palace Jaipur’s liquor policy?", "answer": "<p>Alcohol is permitted at&nbsp;<strong>The Leela Palace Jaipur</strong>; however, all beverages served in public areas and banquet spaces must be purchased exclusively through the hotel. Outside alcohol is not permitted on the premises. Beverages are charged separately based on consumption and are typically not included in the standard wedding package.</p>"}, {"id": 660, "question": "What is the check-in time at the Leela Palace Jaipur, and is early check-in available?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>The Leela Palace Jaipur&nbsp;</strong>is 3:00 PM, with the checkout time being 12:00 noon. Early check-in and late check-out can be requested and are accommodated subject to hotel availability.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '28', '200'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'jaipur' AND `slug` = 'the-leela-palace-jaipur');
--> statement-breakpoint
