SELECT 'jaipur', 'the-oberoi-rajvilas-jaipur', 'published', 'The Oberoi Rajvilas Jaipur Wedding Cost & Venue Deals', 'Plan your stay at the Oberoi Rajvilas Jaipur with destination wedding ideas and venue cost details. Explore today for luxury celebrations!', 'the oberoi rajvilas jaipur wedding cost, the oberoi rajvilas jaipur wedding, the oberoi rajvilas jaipur destination wedding, the oberoi rajvilas jaipur venue cost, the oberoi rajvilas jaipur booking', '/storage/hotel/seo/T6K1dW1Pan0GK2hyMHs7N6zUDsRl9OyYCe5GY1c6.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/hVJQ5yIUMg0XM0WPhch4d9AkdOQTmCnATbrIGoT8.jpg', 'The Oberoi Rajvilas Jaipur', 'Babaji Ka Modh, Goner Rd, Jagdish Colony, Prem Nagar, Jaipur, Rajasthan 302031, India', '35 Minutes', '35 Minutes', '<p>When you step into a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at The Oberoi Rajvilas Jaipur</strong>, it feels like you''re setting foot into a royal palace. The hand-painted frescoes, arched gateways and wide, extensive gardens set the mood for a wedding celebration that looks both rooted in heritage and luxurious. This resort property’s scale appears quite grand, yet every corner echoes with history and a deeply personal charm.</p><p>Plan a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Jaipur</strong> at this 5-star resort, where wedding vows are exchanged under sun-kissed skies, followed by intimate gatherings lit by warm lanterns and soft music. The resort''s open rhythm and regal ambience allows each event to feel distinct yet beautifully connected to one another.</p><p>What stands out is the signature Oberoi hospitality, paired with world-class service that feels intuitive rather than intrusive, ensuring the celebration feels seamless and smooth, all the while remaining warm, personal and thoughtfully executed.</p>', '71', 'Suryavanshi, Chandravanshi', 'The Rajwada Palace Lawns, Main Lawns', '142', '190', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/UhUT2t19ZlpIvEn7x6K2j1uTEHLVTyO85yjyA3Ac.jpg", "title": "3+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/Nef2Jq5AY8r9swrqvtFN5uFFl7tVzL7eL6sAs1yH.jpg", "title": "Private pool sunset indulgence"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/W0P2dCebekV5rXwVnqMskFWEyY5U5cHYPdA1PvgP.jpg", "title": "Royal Fort sunset high tea"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/h0z8IiUC4LyjI5Yu42LShLQ6gzSLwoURyGknIR63.jpg", "title": "Intimate poolside royal dining"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/ksGGJNlm0vhi2imCXu01dLsWB97yVOfRtIwETuP1.jpg", "title": "Bespoke vow renewal experience"}]', '[{"id": 544, "question": "How much does a wedding at The Oberoi Rajvilas Jaipur cost?", "answer": "<p>On average, a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at The Oberoi Rajvilas Jaipur</strong> costs somewhere between INR 1 Cr and INR 1.5 Cr for approximately 120 guests. To get a precise estimate on the wedding budget for a 3-day, 2-night celebration, use Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator. Enter the logistical information and get an exact quote instantly.</p>"}, {"id": 545, "question": "Which is the nearest airport to The Oberoi Rajvilas Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>Jaipur International Airport (JAI) is the nearest airport to&nbsp;<strong>The Oberoi Rajvilas Jaipur,&nbsp;</strong>situated approximately 15 km away. A taxi ride from the airport to the resort takes about 40 minutes.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 546, "question": "Should I choose The Oberoi Rajvilas, Jaipur, or The Oberoi Amarvilas, Agra, for my wedding?", "answer": "<p>Choose<strong> The Oberoi Rajvilas, Jaipur,&nbsp;</strong>for an intimate, heritage-led wedding with 71 rooms and easy access, just 15 km from Jaipur airport. However, opt for The Oberoi Amarvilas, Agra, if you want a grander setting with 102 rooms, closer to Agra Airport and iconic Taj-facing views. Both venues fall within a similar INR 1.5-2.25 Cr wedding budget range.</p>"}, {"id": 547, "question": "What is the check-in time at The Oberoi Rajvilas Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>At&nbsp;<strong>The Oberoi Rajvilas, Jaipur</strong>, standard check-in is 2:00 pm, and check-out is by 12:00 noon. Early check-in and late check-out are available on request, subject to availability.</p>"}, {"id": 548, "question": "What is the liquor policy for destination weddings at The Oberoi Rajvilas Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>At&nbsp;<strong>The Oberoi Rajvilas Jaipur</strong>, alcohol is permitted, but all beverages must be purchased through the hotel. Outside alcohol is not allowed, and drinks are charged separately, as they are usually not included in standard wedding packages.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '180', '71'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'jaipur' AND `slug` = 'the-oberoi-rajvilas-jaipur');
