SELECT 'jaipur', 'the-palace-aravali-by-park-jewels-hotels-and-resorts-jaipur', 'published', 'The Palace by Park Jewels Jaipur Wedding Cost & Booking', 'The Palace by Park Jewels Hotels & Resorts Jaipur offers regal wedding venues & tailored packages. Check wedding cost & booking options for your wedding.', 'the palace by park jewels hotels and resorts wedding cost, the palace by park jewels hotels and resorts wedding, the palace by park jewels wedding cost, the palace by park jewels wedding, the palace by park jewels', '/storage/hotel/seo/XfzqtLoG3UazMcobiTSmpBtQT162XLVjfHAIlql5.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/D7jouR1xIPqkRR83bykQ3fu5WB0SSOuwEz5BHA7Q.jpg', 'The Palace Aravali By Park Jewels Hotels and Resorts Jaipur', 'Jaipur Delhi Highway, Mod, near Tala, Achrol, Rajasthan 303002, India', '40 Minutes', '50 Minutes', '<p>A&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at The Palace by Park Jewels Hotels &amp; Resorts in Jaipur</strong> brings together the charm of the Pink City with a more contemporary, polished setting. The architecture reflects a strong Rajasthani influence, with grand façades, detailed interiors and open spaces that feel well put together. The overall vibe feels easy and unforced, which makes the celebrations seem elegant without feeling too formal.</p><p>When it comes to hosting a wedding at&nbsp;<strong>The Palace by Park Jewels Hotels &amp; Resorts in Jaipur</strong>, the entire layout makes planning much easier. The Lotus Courtyard works well for outdoor haldi and mehendi ceremonies, while the banquet halls suit sangeet nights and receptions that require a larger setup. Due to its well-connected location in the city, it offers quick access from the airport and key parts of Jaipur.</p><p>For those planning a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Jaipur,</strong> the stay here adds real convenience. With over 106 rooms and cottages on-site, accommodating guests in one place seems manageable. Comfortable rooms, varied dining experiences and consistent service ensure guests can relax between events and enjoy the celebrations without any hassle.</p>', '106', 'Sapphire Halls, Town Hall, Main Banquet Hall', 'Lotus Courtyard, Jaigarh Garden, Poolside Area, Rooftop Lawn', '300', 'Na', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/WOhTvkLwZhYIl43vZakFAjDXg5ZowAyJD3Ff6KIM.jpg", "title": "3+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/KPNsQ6f4Z8h9H2DhdLelXWfnV4aAzU4LnGgqKmM4.jpg", "title": "Romantic poolside candlelight dinner"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/LRUylMVIO9eME9bC2gsos7ZdMcs6VA5xL2Ogctwz.jpg", "title": "Mesmerising sunset views across gardens"}]', '[{"id": 331, "question": "What is the cost of a destination wedding at The Palace by Park Jewels Hotels & Resorts, Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>A<strong> destination wedding at The Palace by Park Jewels Hotels &amp; Resorts, Jaipur,</strong>&nbsp;<strong>costs&nbsp;</strong>between INR 95 lakhs and INR 1.2 Cr for a 3-day, 2-night celebration. You can use Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator to get a more accurate budget estimate within seconds, based on your guest count, room requirements and more.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 332, "question": "Which is the nearest airport to The Palace by Park Jewels Hotels & Resorts, Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>Jaipur International Airport (JAI) is the closest airport to&nbsp;<strong>The Palace by Park Jewels Hotels &amp; Resorts, Jaipur</strong>, located around 14–21 kilometres from the property. The drive typically takes about 30-40 minutes.</p>"}, {"id": 333, "question": "How much can I save if I book The Palace by Park Jewels Hotels & Resorts in Jaipur through Viraaya Weddings?", "answer": "<p>When you book&nbsp;<strong>The Palace by Park Jewels Hotels &amp; Resorts</strong> through Viraaya Weddings, you can typically save 10-15% or more, and may offer better pricing through partnerships and vendor access.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 334, "question": "What is the check-in time at The Palace by Park Jewels Hotels & Resorts, Jaipur, and can we get early check-in?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>The Palace by Park Jewels Hotels &amp; Resorts, Jaipur,</strong> is 2:00 pm, and check-out time is at 11:00 am. Early check-in facility can be arranged, subject to availability.</p>"}, {"id": 335, "question": "What is The Palace by Park Jewels Hotels & Resorts, Jaipur’s standard liquor policy?", "answer": "<p><strong>The Palace by Park Jewels Hotels &amp; Resorts in Jaipur</strong> does not permit outside alcohol. All beverages must be arranged through the hotel and are charged separately, as they are not included in standard wedding packages.</p>"}]', '247', '106'
