SELECT 'jaipur', 'the-westin-jaipur-kant-kalwar-resort-and-spa', 'published', 'The Westin Jaipur Wedding Cost & Luxury Booking Deals', 'Discover the Westin Jaipur with wedding cost details, wedding price insights and easy booking options. Book now for a luxury stay experience today!', 'the westin jaipur wedding cost, the westin jaipur wedding price, the westin jaipur booking, the westin jaipur kant kalwar resort & spa', '/storage/hotel/seo/qiadT5wLaqd0qVpwbHMdzRHgCEg8hG1VE9r7jTxG.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/RsFhHaMeSB1njA3OgyHWhhbpPmX4M3oTnh2Uvf1V.jpg', 'The Westin Jaipur Kant Kalwar Resort and Spa', 'Plot no 1T, 5, Kalwar Industrial area, Kant, Jaipur, Rajasthan 303002•0141 691 3333, India', '90 Minutes', '60 Minutes', '<p>In a city known for its regal palaces and heritage venues,&nbsp;<strong>The Westin Jaipur Resort &amp; Spa</strong> offers a rejuvenating alternative for a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Jaipur</strong>. The resort’s design leans towards modern, clean lines, open layouts and a more contemporary feel that suits couples looking for something different from traditional palace settings.</p><p>At&nbsp;<strong>The Westin Jaipur Kant Kalwar Resort &amp; Spa</strong>, the setting shifts naturally with each function. A wide variety of spaces within one property makes this possible. You can host pheras on the lawns, plan a ballroom reception and keep pre-wedding functions by the pool, without changing venues. This makes the entire celebration feel more organised and easy for guests to follow.</p><p>What stands out here is how the experience is managed on-site. The Marriott team coordinates timelines, guest movement and multiple functions across venues, so nothing feels rushed. With Marriott’s hospitality, both national and international guests settle in comfortably, with services and dining that meet varied expectations throughout the celebration.</p>', '135', 'Grand Ballroom, Crystal Ballroom, The Amphitheatre, Studio 1 & 2', 'GBR Garden, Alfresco Patio, The Central Lawn, The Pool Lawn', '300', '300', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/utCt4w50owdl75v145hW1DBtqkUWRErw1F13Vwa0.jpg", "title": "4+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/f7f2JN3cWgG5kLD8FRh4AXJn6cc8Ae5m6HXIkYGp.jpg", "title": "Stylish lounge and poolside dining experiences"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/3QH49ankaRBY0ypdvQjUzyFEPiQlIZAXVlFJElHU.jpg", "title": "Bridal spa rituals and relaxation sessions"}]', '[{"id": 539, "question": "What is The Westin Jaipur Resort & Spa wedding cost?", "answer": "<p>On average, the cost of a destination wedding at&nbsp;<strong>The Westin Jaipur Resort &amp; Spa&nbsp;</strong>ranges from INR 1 Cr to INR 1.5 Cr for a 3-day, 2-night celebration. To get an exact quote, refer to Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator, enter your requirements, and get a precise estimate instantly.</p>"}, {"id": 540, "question": "Is there an off-season for weddings at The Westin Jaipur Resort & Spa?", "answer": "<p>Yes, the Westin Jaipur Resort &amp; Spa has a slower wedding season from April to September due to extreme heat and monsoon. Prices are usually lower than they are during the peak season, which spans from October to March.</p>"}, {"id": 541, "question": "How does The Westin Jaipur Resort & Spa compare to Hyatt Regency Jaipur Mansarovar?", "answer": "<p>Consider&nbsp;<strong>The Westin Jaipur Resort &amp; Spa</strong> for a relaxed resort setting, with a budget of INR 70 lakhs to 1.5 Cr, and 135 rooms, though it is about 1.5 hours from the airport. Choose Hyatt Regency Jaipur Mansarovar for a higher budget, ranging from INR 1.75 to 2.5 Cr, with 245 rooms and suites and a convenient 15–20-minute airport access.</p>"}, {"id": 542, "question": "Can guests get an early check-in at The Westin Jaipur Resort & Spa?", "answer": "<p>Yes, an early check-in at&nbsp;<strong>The Westin Jaipur&nbsp;</strong>can be requested, subject to availability. The standard check-in time at the hotel is 3:00 pm, and guests can check out by 12:00 noon.</p>"}, {"id": 543, "question": "What is the liquor policy for a destination wedding at The Westin Jaipur Resort & Spa?", "answer": "<p>Alcohol is permitted at The Westin Jaipur; however, all beverages must be arranged through the hotel. Outside alcohol is not permitted on the property, and drinks are charged separately based on consumption.</p>"}]', '178', '135'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'jaipur' AND `slug` = 'the-westin-jaipur-kant-kalwar-resort-and-spa');
