SELECT 'jaisalmer', 'gobindgarh-jaisalmer', 'published', 'Gobindgarh Jaisalmer Wedding Cost – Your Dream Fort Wedding', 'Gobindgarh Fort Jaisalmer — Elegant Wedding Venue in the midst of Rajasthan''s golden desert. Check transparent wedding cost, Reviews & Availability Now!', 'gobindgarh jaisalmer wedding cost, gobindgarh jaisalmer destination wedding cost  , gobindgarh fort jaisalmer wedding , gobindgarh jaisalmer wedding venue', '/storage/hotel/seo/QouFcKYNpthIll98bPlVAWNct0hiFaNXbjV9TiKM.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/TShfSv0sW5wRKFHuSrJDB98UjKJuhxfOnL6aV6V0.jpg', 'Gobindgarh Jaisalmer', 'Jaisalmer - Sam - Dhanana Rd, Jaisalmer, Moolsagar, Rajasthan 345001, India', '25 Minutes', '35 Minutes', '<p>Jaisalmer brings a certain old-world charm to weddings, and Gobindgarh Fort captures it beautifully with its heritage-inspired design and desert setting. With sandstone textures, carved jharokhas and open courtyards, the space feels rooted in Rajasthan’s royal past while still offering the comfort of a modern stay.</p><p>With the Thar Desert surrounding it,&nbsp;<strong>a destination wedding at Gobindgarh Fort</strong> in Jaisalmer offers a more private, retreat-style setting. With just 45 suites, it works well for close-knit guest lists, where functions can be spread across courtyards, lawns and banquet spaces without feeling crowded.</p><p>For couples planning a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Jaisalmer,&nbsp;</strong>Gobindgarh Fort is one of the most popular wedding venues in the city, thanks to its easy access to Jaisalmer Airport and its proximity to the Jaisalmer Fort, local markets and the Amar Sagar Lake &amp; Jain Temple. This allows guests to explore the city between functions, while still enjoying a calm, resort-style stay within the property.</p>', '45 suites', 'Banquet Halls, Ballrooms', 'The Bawri Courtyard, Resort Grounds, Landscaped Gardens', '140', '140', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/aEnfNdqiQVYHaYlgyDrMsF6SNkMGbMwiJxsDiUgh.jpg", "title": "3+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/pMHqfMuYxHJiEdvhRwtx22Hg36JMcerc6CW99xOA.jpg", "title": "Private starlit desert dining experience"}]', '[{"id": 426, "question": "What is the cost of the Gobindgarh Fort Jaisalmer wedding venue?", "answer": "<p>The&nbsp;<strong>Gobindgarh Fort Jaisalmer wedding cost&nbsp;</strong>ranges from INR 70 lakhs to INR 1.1 Cr for a 3-day, 2-night celebration. To get a closer estimate, enter your preferred dates of stay, room requirements and other details into Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator and get a precise budget within seconds.</p>"}, {"id": 427, "question": "Which is the nearest airport to the Gobindgarh Fort in Jaisalmer?", "answer": "<p>Jaisalmer Airport (JSA) is the nearest airport to the Gobindgarh Fort in Jaisalmer, located 23–24 km away. A car ride from the airport to the fort takes around 30 to 45 minutes.</p>"}, {"id": 428, "question": "How does Gobindgarh Fort Jaisalmer compare to the Taj Gorbandh Palace, Jaisalmer?", "answer": "<p>Choose<strong> Gobindgarh Fort, Jaisalmer, for a destination wedding</strong> if you want an intimate setup with 45 suites, a budget of&nbsp; 70 lakhs to INR 1.1 Cr and a location about 23–24 km from the airport. Whereas, Taj Gorbandh Palace suits larger gatherings, with 83 rooms, a budget of INR 80 lakhs to 1.2 Cr, and is closer, at about 14–15 km.</p>"}, {"id": 429, "question": "Can guests check in early to the Gobindgarh Fort, Jaisalmer?", "answer": "<p>Yes, early check-in to the&nbsp;<strong>Gobindgarh Fort, Jaisalmer,&nbsp;</strong>can be arranged, subject to hotel availability. The standard check-in time at the hotel is 2:00 pm, and guests can check-out by 11:00 am.</p>"}, {"id": 430, "question": "What is the liquor policy of Gobindgarh Fort Jaisalmer?", "answer": "<p>Alcohol is allowed at&nbsp;<strong>Gobindgarh Fort in Jaisalmer,</strong> but all beverages must be purchased exclusively through the hotel. Outside alcohol isn’t permitted, and beverages are charged separately based on consumption, not included in standard wedding packages.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '161', '45'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'jaisalmer' AND `slug` = 'gobindgarh-jaisalmer');
