SELECT 'jaisalmer', 'jaisalmer-marriott-resort-and-spa', 'published', 'Jaisalmer Marriott Resort & Spa Wedding Cost & Booking', 'Dreaming of a royal desert wedding? Discover cost, packages & venue details at Jaisalmer Marriott Resort & Spa. Book your special day with Viraaya Weddings today!', 'jw marriott jaisalmer wedding, marriott jaisalmer wedding, marriott jaisalmer booking, marriott resort and spa jaisalmer', '/storage/hotel/seo/QwTdLHrQEHSkKeRYE47Jx6l2oU92EK1BnXwQ9xSo.png', '/storage/hotels/banners/4SSKky77mfWkEbCMHMTWxF1nSXVU3XoBStVuH3Fx.jpg', 'Jaisalmer Marriott Resort And  Spa', 'Jaisalmer - Sam - Dhanana Rd, Police Line, Jaisalmer, Kishan Ghat, Rajasthan 345001, India', '25 minutes', '15 Minutes', '<p>Cradled by the dunes of the Thar Desert,<strong> Jaisalmer Marriott Resort &amp; Spa</strong> is a charming fusion of luxury and Rajasthan’s heritage architecture. The resort features hand-carved sandstone façades and a central courtyard that evokes the spirit of the ‘Golden City’. Spacious rooms and suites offer comfort with desert-inspired décor, private balconies and sweeping views of the surrounding landscape.</p><p>Couples can choose between multiple types of wedding venues, including intimate indoor banquet halls and open lawns that capture the desert sky at sunset. Personalised experiences are available to couples, such as intimate evening celebrations beneath the stars or private breakfasts by tranquil waters. Modern amenities like a spa, pool and children''s playroom ensure that guests have an opulent stay, while curated dining experiences feature both local and international flavours.</p><p>Located just 2 km from Jaisalmer Fort and close to Jaisalmer Airport, the resort is easily accessible yet wonderfully secluded. Owing to its high-end location, it seems an ideal destination wedding venue in Jaisalmer, Rajasthan, and leaves a lasting impression on every guest.</p>', '135 rooms and suites', 'Golden Ballroom', 'Palm Garden, Oasis (Open Central Courtyard)', 'Approximately 290 to 310 guests', 'Approximately 290 to 310 guests', '[{"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal02.png", "title": "Restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal03.png", "title": "Signature celebration experiences"}, {"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal04.png", "title": "Private dining and hospitality"}]', '[{"id": 59, "question": "How much does it cost to get married at Jaisalmer Marriott Resort & Spa?", "answer": "<p>The standard cost of a Jaisalmer Marriott Resort &amp; Spa wedding is typically between INR 50 lakhs and INR 1 Cr for a 3-day 2-night celebration. If you wish to get an exact quote based on your room requirements, total guest capacity and preferred dates, you can use our Cost Calculator to get an instant estimate.</p>"}, {"id": 60, "question": "Is early check-in available for wedding guests at Jaisalmer Marriott Resort & Spa?", "answer": "<p>Yes, an early check-in can be requested and can be accommodated, subject to hotel availability. The standard check-in time at Jaisalmer Marriott Resort &amp; Spa is 3:00 pm, and guests can check out by 12:00 noon.</p>"}, {"id": 61, "question": "Should I choose Jaisalmer Marriott Resort & Spa or Storii by ITC Hotels, Jaisalmer, for my wedding?", "answer": "<p>It depends on your vision, budget and the size of your celebration. Jaisalmer Marriott Resort &amp; Spa has 135 rooms, making it ideal for couples seeking a luxurious, private wedding for 300–350 guests, though it requires a higher budget of INR 50 lakhs to INR 1 Cr. On the other hand, Storii by ITC Hotels, with 131 rooms, suits couples looking for an elegant celebration, with slightly easier airport connectivity and a budget of around INR 50 lakhs per day.</p>"}, {"id": 62, "question": "How do guests reach Jaisalmer Marriott Resort & Spa?", "answer": "<p>The nearest airport to the Jaisalmer Marriott Resort &amp; Spa is the Jaisalmer Airport (JSA) and can be reached via a private transfer or taxi ride, which will take you approximately 15 to 20 minutes.</p>"}, {"id": 63, "question": "What is the liquor policy for destination weddings at Jaisalmer Marriott Resort & Spa?", "answer": "<p>Alcohol is offered at Jaisalmer Marriott Resort &amp; Spa, but all drinks served in public areas and event spaces must be bought directly from the hotel. Bringing outside alcohol is not allowed on the property premises. Beverages are billed separately according to consumption and are generally not included in the standard wedding package.</p>"}]', '49', '137'
