SELECT 'jaisalmer', 'storii-by-itc-hotels-jaisalmer', 'published', 'Storii by ITC Hotels Jaisalmer Wedding Cost & Booking', 'Book your desert wedding at Storii by ITC Hotels Jaisalmer — unique venues, competitive wedding cost & exclusive packages. Check prices & book today now!', 'storii by itc hotels jaisalmer wedding cost, storii by itc hotels jaisalmer wedding, storii by itc hotels jaisalmer prices, storii by itc hotels jaisalmer photos, storii by itc hotels jaisalmer reviews', '/storage/hotel/seo/9cQbJ0gRL6wkbuFxD4cjIU1R23ckdxd3R9ovDBt5.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/TcYSikLaEnEUkVMXv4WXzPs7w6Nfp68wngeEVSQb.jpg', 'Storii by ITC Hotels Jaisalmer', 'Hotel complex, Storii By ITC Hotels, Plot no 7, Jodhpur - Jaisalmer Rd, Jaisalmer, Rajasthan 345001, India', '20 Minutes', '10 minutes', '<p>A&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at Storii by ITC Hotels, Jaisalmer,</strong> stands out because it actually feels like Jaisalmer, not a hotel placed anywhere. Built in a haveli-style layout with sandstone, jharokhas and chhatris, the nine-acre property mirrors the city’s architecture, so every function feels visually rooted in the desert.</p><p>For couples planning a<strong> destination wedding in Jaisalmer,</strong> the setting changes as the day goes on, and that naturally shapes each function. Daytime ceremonies on the lawns feel open and easy, while evenings shift towards the Sunset Patio as the light softens and the sky turns a deep gold. The spaces don’t need much staging here; the desert does most of the work. Mehendi, pheras and evening gatherings all carry a different mood as the light fades, with the open horizon and dry air adding a warmth that just feels right.</p><p>What also sets it apart is the ITC hospitality. At Storii by ITC Hotels, Jaisalmer, staff service feels intuitive and personal, so celebrations are held smoothly and guests feel genuinely looked after throughout the stay.</p>', '80', 'Banquet Halls', 'Sunset Patio, Poolside Area, Front Lawn', '160', '200', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/1ycOaPFPvsFz1kSvXiibkl9hOCDRm7FyYpS5duFG.jpg", "title": "2+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/dQ5hcs3mL9JHIQsQ7DDtiahk3Lz9kly5dsTcPAWy.jpg", "title": "Desert starlit dining experience"}]', '[{"id": 391, "question": "Which is the closest airport to Storii by ITC Hotels, Jaisalmer?", "answer": "<p>The closest airport to&nbsp;<strong>Storii by ITC Hotels, Jaisalmer,</strong> is Jaisalmer Airport (JSA), about 12-14 km away and a 20-25-minute drive from the boutique resort.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 392, "question": "Is an early check-in available at Storii by ITC Hotels, Jaisalmer?", "answer": "<p>Yes, an early check-in can be accommodated, subject to hotel availability. However, the standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Storii by ITC Hotels, Jaisalmer</strong> is 3:00 pm, and check-out time is by 12:00 noon.</p>"}, {"id": 393, "question": "Are there any nearby attractions or activities for international guests around Storii by ITC Hotels in Jaisalmer?", "answer": "<p>Yes, guests staying at&nbsp;<strong>Storii by ITC Hotels in Jaisalmer&nbsp;</strong>can explore the Jaisalmer Fort, visit Patwon Ki Haveli, enjoy Gadisar Lake, go on desert safaris at Sam Dunes and enjoy sunset views at Vyas Chhatri.</p>"}, {"id": 394, "question": "What is the cost of a destination wedding at Storii by ITC Hotels, Jaisalmer?", "answer": "<p>On average, the cost of a destination wedding at&nbsp;<strong>Storii by ITC Hotels, Jaisalmer,</strong> for a 3-day, 2-night celebration, ranges between INR 80 lakhs and INR 1.2 Cr. To get an accurate estimate, enter your requirements into Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator and get a closer estimate within seconds.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 395, "question": "Does Storii by ITC Hotels in Jaisalmer offer bar service for destination weddings?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>Storii by ITC Hotels in Jaisalmer</strong> offers in-house bar service for weddings. Outside alcohol isn’t allowed, and all beverages are arranged through the hotel and billed separately.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '127', '80'
