SELECT 'jaisalmer', 'suryagarh-palace-jaisalmer', 'published', 'Suryagarh Palace Jaisalmer Wedding Cost & Hotel Booking', 'Check Suryagarh Palace Jaisalmer wedding cost, hotel booking, packages & venue details. Plan a luxury desert destination wedding in Jaisalmer Rajasthan.', 'suryagarh jaisalmer wedding cost, suryagarh palace jaisalmer wedding cost, suryagarh jaisalmer wedding, suryagarh jaisalmer destination wedding, suryagarh jaisalmer hotel booking, cost of wedding in suryagarh jaisalmer, jaisalmer palace hotel wedding price, suryagarh jaisalmer wedding package, wedding cost at suryagarh jaisalmer', '/storage/hotel/seo/LIBU4DZOjSLJ9kh9XR8EMQNEY4k4zAjrdXiSsx6X.png', '/storage/hotels/banners/3q8gHICYkVm8bGhBlqJxkc9l4tx6pbh3JayWEtbb.jpg', 'Suryagarh Palace jaisalmer', 'Kahala Phata, Sam Dhanana Road, roughly 15 km from Jaisalmer city centre, India', '40 Minutes', '30 Minutes', '<p>A spectacular estate along the Thar Desert, Suryagarh Jaisalmer looks right at home within the desert landscape. Built in hand-carved yellow sandstone, the property glows in warm golden hues, especially in the evenings. The property’s architecture draws from traditional Rajasthani design, with detailed stonework and spaces that feel rooted in Jaisalmer’s rich cultural heritage.</p><p>The luxury hotel''s venues offer a wide variety of settings for wedding functions. Indoor courtyards are great for small events, while the Celebration Garden and Lakeside Garden are perfect for larger events and gatherings. The Bawdi and Sunset Patio form a beautiful backdrop for the holy pheras, each exuding its own distinctive charm.&nbsp;</p><p>At Suryagarh Jaisalmer, hospitality is notably considerate and intimate. Customary greetings, personalised service and thoughtfully selected experiences ensure visitors feel taken care of at every stage of their stay. Families travelling from all over the world resonate with this setting, making for an immersive and unforgettable destination wedding experience.</p>', '72 rooms and suites', 'Indoor Courtyards', 'Celebration Garden, Bawdi, Champa Garden, Lakeside Garden, Organic Garden, Poolside, Sunset Patio', 'Approximately 160 to 180 guests', 'Approximately 160 to 180 guests', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/LcdhJBCwTMnB8Qyag3sWEsft0ROwuXtUu46VpZgQ.jpg", "title": "1.\t8+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/16sDGkNy5yMgf7HC26XRsrI6VZvnm9hBHzKZ5DqU.jpg", "title": "2.\tRomantic dining along sand dunes"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/7MGs79S4xZjCMXfm2lESG01J8nMvU5it6YXqwFpX.jpg", "title": "3.\tSundowners with Kuldhara views"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/HtrfXmIt4PGeuXHr9XF4TPDmqDfEIDhaK5uJaSQt.jpg", "title": "4.\tDesert picnic by a tranquil oasis"}]', '[{"id": 84, "question": "What is the total cost of a destination wedding at Suryagarh Jaisalmer?", "answer": "<p>According to popular reviews, the <strong>Suryagarh Palace Jaisalmer wedding package costs</strong> between INR 1.2 Cr and INR 1.5 Cr for a 3-day, 2-night wedding celebration. To get an exact quote, you can take the help of Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator. Enter your preferred dates of stay, required rooms, total residential guest capacity and any other details to get a precise estimate instantly.</p>"}, {"id": 85, "question": "Which is better-suited for a destination wedding in Rajasthan: Suryagarh Jaisalmer or Rambagh Palace?", "answer": "<p>Suryagarh Jaisalmer offers 90 rooms with a strong, immersive desert aesthetic, wedding budgets of INR 2.7 to 3.5 Cr, and a 30–40-minute drive from the airport for those drawn to a more intimate desert setting. However, Rambagh Palace stands out as a location for an opulent, palace-style celebration, providing a more conventional royal Jaipur experience, with 78 rooms, higher budgets of INR 3.75 to INR 4.5 Cr and closer airport access. Due to a lower residential capacity, couples may need to host some guests at neighbouring properties for both venues.</p>"}, {"id": 86, "question": "Can I host a pre-wedding photoshoot at Suryagarh Palace, Jaisalmer?", "answer": "<p>Pre-wedding photoshoots are usually allowed at Suryagarh Jaisalmer, but it is recommended to obtain prior permission from the hotel to secure a booking. Contact the hotel’s official authorities to book the venue, understand the cost, duration of the shoot and other logistics that may require your attention.</p>"}, {"id": 87, "question": "What are the check-in and check-out times at Suryagarh Palace, Jaisalmer, and can we check in early?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at Suryagarh Jaisalmer is 3:00 pm, and the check-out time is 12:00 noon. However, guests can request an early check-in and late check-out, which can be accommodated, subject to hotel availability</p>"}, {"id": 88, "question": "What is the liquor policy for destination weddings at Suryagarh Jaisalmer?", "answer": "<p>Suryagarh Jaisalmer allows alcohol on its premises, with all drinks in banquet halls and public areas exclusively arranged through the hotel. Bringing outside alcohol is not allowed on the property premises. Beverages are billed separately based on consumption and are generally not part of the standard wedding package.</p>"}]', '47', '72'
