SELECT 'jaisalmer', 'taj-gorbandh-palace-jaisalmer', 'published', 'Taj Gorbandh Palace Jaisalmer – Wedding Cost & Booking', 'Explore Taj Gorbandh Palace Jaisalmer for weddings. Check wedding cost, room details, reviews & distance from Jaisalmer airport before booking.', 'taj gorbandh palace jaisalmer, taj gorbandh palace jaisalmer wedding, taj gorbandh palace jaisalmer wedding cost', '/storage/hotel/seo/SNw3jNn18wkxkLrFL4w6WuCQoihCh5X6AJmmYUVX.png', '/storage/hotels/banners/T9l63jkQVN9zlbUHYT1r4Zl1kic6N5QdpU40cxZO.jpg', 'Taj Gorbandh Palace Jaisalmer', 'Tourist Complex, Jaisalmer - Sam - Dhanana Rd, near Kishan Ghat, Ram Kund, Jaisalmer, Kishan Ghat, Rajasthan 345001, India', '30 minutes', '15 minutes', '<p>Originally built in 1992 and reimagined under the Taj brand in 2023,<strong> Taj Gorbandh Palace, Jaisalmer&nbsp;</strong>draws inspiration from the traditional Gorbandh ornament, a symbol of celebration deeply rooted in Rajasthan’s culture. The 5-star luxury property blends golden sandstone architecture, carved jharokhas and palace-style courtyards with contemporary comforts. Located just 15 minutes from Jaisalmer Airport, it offers easy accessibility while surrounding guests with the charm, tranquillity and timeless beauty of the Thar Desert.</p><p>A&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at Taj Gorbandh Palace, Jaisalmer</strong> is ideal for couples looking for an intimate yet regal celebration. The property features approximately 790 sq m of event space across elegant indoor and outdoor venues, complemented by 83 rooms and suites for exclusive wedding buyouts. Guests can also enjoy desert dining experiences, cultural performances and easy access to Jaisalmer Fort, Gadisar Lake and the Sam Sand Dunes.</p><p>What guests often remember most about&nbsp;<strong>Taj Gorbandh Palace, Jaisalmer</strong> is how effortlessly the experience extends beyond the wedding itself. From private dune dining and desert safaris to poolside cocktails and visits to Jaisalmer Fort, Gadisar Lake and Patwon Ki Haveli, every moment feels woven into the destination. Combined with 83 well-appointed rooms and suites, warm Taj hospitality and immersive dining experiences, the property creates celebrations that feel personal, exclusive and unmistakably Jaisalmer.</p>', '80 rooms with 3 suites', 'Mewar Room', 'Mewar Lawn, Mewar Lawns 1, 2, 3', '200', '200', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/BvaoQG2CgU2xQQUNMPfuPyMggB6LTpjyJU3byF8x.jpg", "title": "3+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/EBhM4xiQGFcNHf2wUHyCr0i45Qy1QnAyBwZAQLjt.jpg", "title": "Intimate meals amid desert horizons"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/CK604eT0rwiA2u9mmiAY9oLyab7Sk1qWjNwsYhzu.jpg", "title": "Couples'' sundowners overlooking Jaisalmer Fort"}]', '[{"id": 1298, "question": "Is an early check-in available at Taj Gorbandh Palace, Jaisalmer?", "answer": "<p>Yes, guests can get an early check-in at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Gorbandh, Jaisalmer;&nbsp;</strong>however, accommodation is subject to availability. The standard check-in and check-out times at the property are 2:00 pm and 11:00 am, respectively.</p>"}, {"id": 1299, "question": "What is the ideal cost of a 2-night wedding at Taj Gorbandh Palace, Jaisalmer?", "answer": "<p>The&nbsp;<strong>Taj Gorbandh Palace, Jaisalmer, wedding cost</strong> for a 3-day, 2-night celebration usually ranges from INR 90 lakhs to INR 1.25 Cr. Enter your logistical details into Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator to get an accurate quote within seconds.</p>"}, {"id": 1300, "question": "Can we bring our own wedding planner/decorator to Taj Gorbandh Palace, Jaisalmer?", "answer": "<p>Yes, you can usually work with your preferred wedding planner or decorator at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Gorbandh Palace, Jaisalmer.</strong> Coordination requirements may apply, so it is best to confirm vendor policies and approvals with the Viraaya Weddings team.</p>"}, {"id": 1301, "question": "How much can I save if I book Taj Gorbandh Palace, Jaisalmer through Viraaya Weddings?", "answer": "<p>Through Viraaya Weddings'' hospitality partnerships, couples may save 10-15% or more on a wedding at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Gorbandh Palace, Jaisalmer</strong>. You also benefit from negotiated pricing, trusted vendor connections and a smoother planning experience from start to finish.</p>"}, {"id": 1302, "question": "Does Taj Gorbandh Palace, Jaisalmer, provide a bar service for weddings?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>Taj Gorbandh Palace, Jaisalmer&nbsp;</strong>provides alcohol and beverages through the hotel’s in-house bar. Outside alcohol is generally not permitted inside the property, and drinks are typically charged separately based on consumption.</p>"}]', '126', '83'
