SELECT 'jim-corbett', 'lemon-tree-premier-jim-corbett', 'published', 'Lemon Tree Premier Jim Corbett Wedding Cost & Booking', 'Plan a unique wedding at Lemon Tree Premier Jim Corbett. Explore wedding cost, nature-themed venues & packages for your perfect destination wedding escape.', 'lemon tree premier jim corbett wedding, lemon tree premier jim corbett wedding cost, lemon tree premier resort jim corbett, lemon tree premier corbett resort', '/storage/hotel/seo/JDwYO2nwN78RdQNube3qWxVXTrMjz0owAiYp8v8H.png', '/storage/hotels/banners/2hzatXKz2igAf0mu3NRSfXs2KRVYvM0jVwy348Zm.jpg', 'Lemon Tree Premier Jim Corbett', 'Zero Milestone, Jim Corbett National Park, Mohaan, Ranikhet Rd, Ramnagar, Uttarakhand 244715, India', '135 Minutes', '45 Minutes', '<p>At Lemon Tree Premier Jim Corbett, weddings feel warm, thoughtfully curated and perfect for couples who appreciate the impact of a well-hosted ceremony. Set within one of India’s most iconic nature reserves, you can begin your celebrations on the open lawns, surrounded by lush forest greens, where every moment feels relaxed and effortless.</p><p>Move into a riverside ceremony by the lyrical Kosi River, where a warmly styled mandap, soft mountain light and the gentle sound of flowing water create a calm, meaningful setting for your pheras. As a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding venue in Uttarakhand, Lemon Tree Premier Jim Corbett</strong> brings together the charm of a mountain retreat with the ease of a well-run celebration where everything feels just right.</p><p>After the wedding, poolside high teas and casual dinners under the stars make the celebration feel intimate and unique. The staff ensures that everything, from the food and decorations to the overall high-end feel, looks perfect.&nbsp;</p>', '68 Rooms With Suites', 'Tangerine', 'Open Lawns', '150', '150', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/Vi6bjRD5hql6QMe2XOPSAIrtgSe6wZsmWvI2UvN0.jpg", "title": "3+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/Bo7BIg02bbM6JaQyi1loTZl9gLUVKMqcGTesgWRJ.jpg", "title": "Private poolside or riverside dining"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/1iQM11C0SvC4kY0ShtQnFegKUagoMtDbBRIlR01q.jpg", "title": "Sunset high tea by the pool"}]', '[{"id": 104, "question": "How much does a wedding at Lemon Tree Premier, Jim Corbett cost?", "answer": "<p>On average, for a 3-day, 2-night <strong>destination wedding at the Lemon Tree Premier, Jim Corbett,</strong> the budget usually falls within the range of INR 30 lakhs to INR 50 lakhs. To get an exact estimate based on your guest count and room requirements, enter your details in Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator and get the precise quote instantly.</p>"}, {"id": 105, "question": "Are there any special offers for wedding couples at Lemon Tree Premier, Jim Corbett?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong> Lemon Tree Premier, Jim Corbett</strong> offers customised destination wedding packages for couples who want an intimate celebration in the wilderness. To enquire further, contact the hotel directly.</p>"}, {"id": 106, "question": "How does the Lemon Tree Premier, Jim Corbett, compare to The Riverview Retreat, Corbett?", "answer": "<p>With 68 rooms and a typical wedding budget of INR 30–50 lakhs, Lemon Tree Premier, Jim Corbett offers a well-organised experience. It is about 2 hours and 15 minutes from Pantnagar Airport, and limited room availability may require off-site stays. The Riverview Retreat Corbett, with up to 105 rooms and a budget range of INR 50–75 lakhs, is better suited for larger celebrations. Located around 85 km from the airport, it takes roughly 3 hours to reach.</p>"}, {"id": 107, "question": "What is the check-in time at Lemon Tree Premier, Jim Corbett, and can guests check-in early?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at<strong> Lemon Tree Premier Corbett Resort&nbsp;</strong>is 2:00 pm, and check-out time is by 12:00 noon. Guests can request an early check-in by contacting the hotel, subject to hotel availability.</p>"}, {"id": 108, "question": "What is the liquor policy for destination weddings at Lemon Tree Premier, Jim Corbett?", "answer": "<p>Alcohol is permitted, but all beverages must be purchased through the hotel. Outside alcohol is not allowed at Lemon Tree, Premier Resort, Jim Corbett, and drinks are charged separately from the wedding package.</p>"}]', '54', '68'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'jim-corbett' AND `slug` = 'lemon-tree-premier-jim-corbett');
