SELECT 'jim-corbett', 'namah-jim-corbett', 'published', 'Namah Jim Corbett Wedding Cost & Venue Booking', 'Surrounded by jungle & wildlife, Namah Jim Corbett is your ultimate wedding escape. Discover wedding cost, exclusive venues & packages for a nature wedding.', 'namah jim corbett wedding cost, namah jim corbett wedding, namah jim corbett booking, namah resort wedding cost, namah resort destination wedding, namah hotel jim corbett, namah jim corbett', '/storage/hotel/seo/uldRgpm5Z8PdPnmbotyBcHasFrJ5SCygMzhumtVM.png', '/storage/hotels/banners/9WQqjiimedrAqY5W5WRvWOM76EhE5wvMLGACyBHC.jpg', 'Namah Jim Corbett', 'Jim Corbett National Park, Dhikuli, Ramnagar, Uttarakhand 244715, India', '135 Minutes', '25 Minutes', '<p>At&nbsp;<strong>Namah Resort Jim Corbett,</strong> you can almost map out your wedding the moment you walk in. A haldi event set up across the lawns, with mango trees casting shade and the hills in the distance. A mehendi ceremony that is celebrated with complete gush and awe in airy verandas, with guests moving easily between indoor and outdoor spaces. A riverside ceremony on the Kosi River featuring a simple mandap, soft colours, the hills behind you and the sound of water running alongside your pheras.</p><p>With a name inspired by Lord Shiva, the resort carries a calm, ambient feel. Low-rise cottages, open corridors and large windows keep it closely connected to the outdoors, while views of the Shivalik hills and soft blues and greens inside reflect the natural surroundings in a simple, understated way.</p><p>With Radisson''s warm hospitality taking care of everything, the experience feels smooth and efficient. The atmosphere stays warm and welcoming, with bonfires, soft music and open skies bringing everyone together in a setting that feels perfect for a destination wedding in the lush mountains of Uttarakhand.</p>', '48 rooms with suites', 'Kosi Grand Ballroom, Ampitheatre', 'Pratha Lawn, Poolside Lawn', '150', '150', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/0PpqvXEglQeloUYKgy6HXifSUqiSxMdz6DpF7IMl.jpg", "title": "2+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/RPczru61DhJB3jXAKIVMUU88HrWel2PnjzEhxgdT.jpg", "title": "Private bonfire and barbecue nights"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/gYuzQz1ZPJyybak1WQMoB4CHoViLakpirCbg2UrW.jpg", "title": "Riverside candlelight dining experience"}]', '[{"id": 1283, "question": "How much does a wedding at Namah, Jim Corbett resort cost?", "answer": "<p>The standard&nbsp;<strong>wedding package at Namah Resort Jim Corbett</strong> typically ranges from INR 55 lakhs to INR 75 lakhs for a 3-day, 2-night celebration. To get an instant estimate on the wedding budget, use our Cost Calculator. Enter your preferred dates of stay, the number of rooms required and any other necessary details to get an instant quote.</p>"}, {"id": 1284, "question": "Which is the nearest airport to Namah, Jim Corbett?", "answer": "<p>The nearest airport to the Namah Resort Jim Corbett is the Pantnagar Airport (PGH), located approximately 89 km from the resort. Depending on traffic conditions, a taxi ride from the airport to the resort usually takes around 2 hours and 15 minutes.</p>"}, {"id": 1285, "question": "How does Namah, Jim Corbett compare to Aahana - The Corbett Wilderness?", "answer": "<p><strong>Namah Resort Jim Corbett&nbsp;</strong>offers a premium, design-led wedding experience with 48 rooms and a budget of INR 55 lakhs to INR 75 lakhs. Located about 2 hours and 15 minutes from Pantnagar Airport, it is also well-connected. Aahana The Corbett Wilderness, with 48–72 rooms and a budget of 40 lakhs to INR 60 lakh, is better suited for nature-led, mid-scale weddings. It lies around 90 km from the airport (2–3 hours by taxi). At both venues, larger guest lists may require off-site accommodations.</p>"}, {"id": 1286, "question": "Is an early check-in facility available at Namah in Jim Corbett?", "answer": "<p>Yes, guests can check in before 2:00 pm at&nbsp;<strong>Namah, Jim Corbett;</strong> however, early check-in is subject to hotel availability. Ensure that you contact the hotel directly before showing up to make the reservation.</p>"}, {"id": 1287, "question": "What is the liquor policy for destination weddings at Namah, Jim Corbett?", "answer": "<p>Alcohol is allowed at&nbsp;<strong>Namah Resort Jim Corbett</strong>, but all drinks must be sourced through the hotel. Outside alcohol isn’t permitted on the property premises, and beverages are billed separately on consumption, not included in standard wedding packages.</p>"}]', '55', '48'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'jim-corbett' AND `slug` = 'namah-jim-corbett');
