SELECT 'jim-corbett', 'resorts-by-the-baagh-jim-corbett', 'published', 'Corbett The Baagh Spa & Resort  – Wedding Cost & Booking', 'Corbett The Baagh Spa & Resort is Jim Corbett''s most loved wedding destination. Check real wedding cost & make your resort booking today. Explore Now!', 'corbett the baagh spa & resort wedding cost, corbett the baagh spa & resort wedding, corbett the baagh spa & resort booking, corbett the baagh, the baagh jim corbett, the baagh resort, the baagh resort jim corbett, corbett the baagh spa and resort', '/storage/hotel/seo/uHXSaoS09YcI1pc21S5a9ouIBgn6ojyZFNwCMp7J.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/LLCgnHDoBJrAT91CyDXgyoXM6sqXASbBYChPuXbZ.jpg', 'Resorts By The Baagh Jim Corbett', 'Jim Corbett National Park, near Government School, Patkote, Ramnagar, Uttarakhand 244715, India', '90 minutes', '60 Minutes', '<p>A&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at Resorts By The Baagh Corbett</strong> feels less like booking a venue and more like taking over a quiet forest estate for a few days. Set along the edge of the Sitabani buffer zone, the resort opens out into wide lawns, forest views and uninterrupted skies, with the Shivalik range sitting in the background.</p><p>For couples planning a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Jim Corbett</strong> or a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Uttarakhand</strong>, what really works here is how the spaces are laid out. The larger lawns comfortably take on big wedding functions, while smaller pockets like gazebos feel right for mehendi afternoons or sundowner setups. The indoor banquet doesn’t feel like a separate box either, so the flow of events stays natural. With around 90 rooms and suites within the property, most guests stay together, which makes moving between functions far easier and keeps everything feeling connected.</p><p>Beyond the wedding functions, what really stays with guests at Resorts By The Baagh Corbett is how the days naturally unfold. Some head out early for a safari in Jim Corbett National Park, others take slow walks around the Sitabani forest edge and many just linger by the pool or gardens without a plan. It never feels structured, and that’s exactly why it works so well.</p>', '90', 'Banquet Halls', 'Outdoor Lawns, Outdoor Gazebo', '210', '250', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/YADOjuur7gtyiGndLCNRO3CJy3sjwMSdop5Uy8LF.jpg", "title": "2+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/GYFiQ54XnR5HuO1juH2J2T73zQdctAxu0moQyrxS.jpg", "title": "Bespoke themed wedding celebrations"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/52XvazJAlgKp1UVxOwUmIGsa6lOu11BcpGeDKbzD.jpg", "title": "Cinematic pre-wedding shoot locations"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/ce4oD8qPomG7MLhywc28zCSlWXaAHccg3xVcGymm.jpg", "title": "Private candlelit dining under stars"}]', '[{"id": 686, "question": "Which is the nearest airport to the Resorts By The Baagh, Jim Corbett?", "answer": "<p>The nearest airport to&nbsp;<strong>Resorts By The Baagh in Jim Corbett&nbsp;</strong>is Pantnagar Airport. It is about 85–108 km away and takes roughly 2-3 hours by road.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 687, "question": "Is an early check-in available for wedding guests at Resorts By The Baagh?", "answer": "<p>Yes, an early check-in facility can be arranged, subject to hotel availability. The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Resorts By The Baagh, Corbett,</strong> is 1:00 pm, and guests can check out by 11:00 am.</p>"}, {"id": 688, "question": "What is the ideal budget for a 2-night wedding at Corbett, Resorts By The Baagh?", "answer": "<p>The standard cost of a 2-night destination wedding at&nbsp;<strong>Resorts By The Baagh in Jim Corbett</strong> ranges from INR 40 lakhs to INR 70 lakhs. To get a closer estimate, enter all logistical details into Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator.</p>"}, {"id": 689, "question": "Can guests explore local sights during their stay at Resorts By The Baagh?", "answer": "<p>Yes, guests at&nbsp;<strong>Resorts By The Baagh, Jim Corbett&nbsp;</strong>can visit Jim Corbett National Park for safaris, or head to Sitabani Forest Reserve for quieter nature trails. You can also see the Garjiya Devi Temple or unwind by waterfalls and rivers nearby.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 690, "question": "Does Corbett, Resorts By The Baagh, provide a bar service for weddings?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>Resorts By The Baagh in Jim Corbett&nbsp;</strong>offers in-house bar service for weddings. Outside alcohol is not allowed, and drinks are billed on actual consumption, separate from wedding packages.</p>"}]', '236', '90'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'jim-corbett' AND `slug` = 'resorts-by-the-baagh-jim-corbett');
