SELECT 'jim-corbett', 'taj-corbett-resort-and-spa-jim-corbett', 'published', 'Taj Corbett Resort & Spa Wedding Cost & Booking', 'Explore Taj Corbett Resort & Spa wedding cost & all booking options. Plan your dream destination wedding amid Jim Corbett''s lush jungle in Uttarakhand.', 'taj corbett resort & spa uttarakhand', '/storage/hotel/seo/GX6nE9bAP5dxibMhXeR1LG2I8dctNHwJF3LkN5yW.png', '/storage/hotels/banners/1qisBg3gYNZjuh7FzESiBQ2s5peuheTtdA5sf3DP.jpg', 'Taj Corbett Resort And Spa Jim Corbett', 'Zero Garjia, Dhikuli, Ramnagar, Jim Corbett, Uttarakhand, 244715, India', '120 Minutes', '20 Minutes', '<p>The gentle flow of the Kosi River, the cool mountain air and the dense forest set the tone for a truly immersive destination wedding at <strong>Taj Corbett Resort &amp; Spa in Uttarakhand</strong>. Beautiful architecture with sloping roofs, wood, and stone blends into the landscape, while cottages offer views of uninterrupted greenery.</p><p>A ceremony at the Kosi Lawn feels leisurely and warm, with the river flowing nearby and the hills forming an awe-inspiring backdrop. As the sun goes down, ceremonies take place in the Woods Ballroom, a more intimate setting for the evening. With the natural sounds of the Corbett Reserve all around, each celebration feels special and offers a genuine connection with nature.</p><p>Taj hospitality brings a sense of ease to every moment, with a team that anticipates guests’ needs before they are voiced. Whether travelling from within India or from abroad, guests settle in comfortably in the lap of India’s first national park, taking in the lush surroundings and the gentle pace of the celebrations.</p>', '75 rooms with suites', 'Woods', 'Kosi Lawn', '200', '200', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/Uw03psPqCudHlUfCJSJBVlGAXTdpsaUNQnbwB1JL.jpg", "title": "4+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/ipVTpZSoFwBbxRYHWvzjbmepsRp2ardyo6DjSzWO.jpg", "title": "Candlelit forest dining under stars"}]', '[{"id": 124, "question": "How much does a wedding at Taj Corbett Resort & Spa, Uttarakhand resort cost?", "answer": "<p>The standard cost of a <strong>wedding at Taj Corbett Resort &amp; Spa, Uttarakhand,</strong> is usually in the range of INR 90 lakhs to INR 1.5 Cr+ for a 3-day, 2-night celebration. To get an exact estimate based on your budget and guest count, you can refer to Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator. Simply enter your details, such as your preferred dates of stay, total guest capacity, and total number of rooms required, and get an instant budget estimate within seconds.</p>"}, {"id": 125, "question": "Which is the nearest airport to the Taj Corbett Resort & Spa, Uttarakhand?", "answer": "<p>The closest airport to <strong>Taj Corbett Resort &amp; Spa in Uttarakhand&nbsp;</strong>is Pantnagar Airport (PGH). This domestic airport is located approximately 80-86 km away, with most of the flights coming from New Delhi. The taxi journey from the airport to the resort will take about 2 hours.</p>"}, {"id": 126, "question": "Should I consider the Taj Corbett Resort & Spa in Uttarakhand or the Jim Corbett Marriott Resort & Spa for my wedding?", "answer": "<p><strong>Taj Corbett Resort &amp; Spa in Uttarakhand</strong> has 75 rooms and a wedding budget of INR 90 lakhs to 1.5 Cr. Situated by the riverside, this property has a more intimate setting. With 99 rooms and a budget of INR 1.25 Cr to 1.5 Cr, Jim Corbett Marriott is better suited to slightly larger gatherings and exudes a modern feel. Both are located about 80–86 km from Pantnagar Airport, making access easy. Since both hotels have similar connectivities, the choice comes down to whether you like Taj''s quieter, more scenic charm or Marriott''s modern size and flexibility.</p>"}, {"id": 127, "question": "What is the check-in time at Taj Corbett Resort & Spa, Uttarakhand, and can we check-in early?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at Taj Corbett Resort &amp; Spa, Uttarakhand, is 2:00 pm, and check-out is at 12:00 noon. Guests can request an early check-in, which the hotel can arrange, subject to availability.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 128, "question": "What is the liquor policy for destination weddings at Taj Corbett Resort & Spa, Uttarakhand?", "answer": "<p>Alcohol is allowed at Taj Corbett Resort &amp; Spa, Uttarakhand, but all drinks served in banquet venues and public areas must be sourced through the hotel. Bringing in outside alcohol is not permitted. Beverage costs are charged on consumption and are usually not part of the standard wedding package.</p>"}]', '53', '75'
