SELECT 'jim-corbett', 'tarangi-jim-corbett-resort-and-spa', 'published', 'Tarangi Resort & Spa Jim Corbett Wedding Cost & Stay Info', 'Discover tarangi resort & spa jim corbett with tarangi resort wedding cost insights and a tarangi resort and spa jim corbett package. Explore online today!', 'tarangi jim corbett, tarangi resort jim corbett, tarangi resort in jim corbett, tarangi resort jim corbett wedding', '/storage/hotel/seo/8UAy3Is7CNCBbwINAlLmyMhtzKkvqmZt9TH1zLxh.png', '/storage/hotels/banners/ePKWtClxhwwTFiGVrkLi2JLXFb6uiN88vcSfdxmm.jpg', 'Tarangi Jim Corbett Resort and Spa', 'Ramnagar, Dhikuli, Mailani Range, Uttarakhand 244715, India', '120 Minutes', '25 Minutes', '<p>The<strong> Tarangi Resort &amp; Spa, Jim Corbett</strong>, is set beside the serene Kosi River, which is an oasis framed by the sounds of the forest. Its riverside lawn, backed by the Himalayan foothills, provides a stunning setting for pheras or sunset functions, making it an ideal choice for a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Uttarakhand</strong>.</p><p>Ceremonies take place on well-kept lawns and in quiet corners of the garden. Cottages with sloping roofs, stone walls and wooden accents provide intimate spaces for close friends and families, making them the perfect mountain retreat. The Jal Pool Villa offers a touch of private luxury for couples looking to relax before their wedding.</p><p>As dusk sets, lanterns and fairy lights glow along the riverbank, with riverside bonfires adding a sense of warmth to the evening. With Tarangi’s amiable staff ensuring everything goes as per plan, be it dining or the décor, couples and their guests get a chance to sit back and immerse themselves in a wedding that feels uniquely tied to this riverside retreat.</p>', '105', 'Indoor Banquet Hall', 'Outdoor Lawn, Outdoor Lawn Garden, Riverside Settings', '210', '250', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/a0YZzhOAxiHlpzUPfrzGR7iR6eAkfhL7rk0XzLF4.jpg", "title": "2+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/3P9G3T0zvVhUPSWM9RYPkJguRFdYxonjvrtsOvSL.jpg", "title": "Live band nights with drinks"}]', '[{"id": 586, "question": "How much does a destination wedding at Tarangi Resort & Spa, Jim Corbett cost?", "answer": "<p>The standard cost of a destination wedding package at&nbsp;<strong>Tarangi Resort &amp; Spa in Jim Corbett&nbsp;</strong>for a 3-day, 2-night celebration ranges from INR 50 lakhs to INR 90 lakhs. Consider using our Cost Calculator, where you can enter your check-in and check-out details, total number of guests and other details to get an instant quote.</p>"}, {"id": 587, "question": "How to reach Tarangi Resort & Spa, Jim Corbett?", "answer": "<p>The nearest airport to the resort is the Pantnagar Airport (PGH). The drive from Pantnagar Airport (PGH) to Tarangi Resort &amp; Spa usually takes around 1.5 to 2.5 hours by road.</p>"}, {"id": 588, "question": "Should I choose Tarangi Resort & Spa, Jim Corbett, or The Riverview Retreat, Corbett for my wedding?", "answer": "<p>If we compare the two resorts, then we find that&nbsp;<strong>Tarangi Resort &amp; Spa, Jim Corbett</strong> is suited for larger, more premium weddings, with a budget of INR 50–90 lakhs and 105 rooms and suites, offering greater scale and smoother access, with a 1.5-2.5-hour drive from Pantnagar Airport. On the other hand, The Riverview Retreat, Corbett, with 105 rooms and suites and a budget of INR 70–90 lakhs, works better for smaller, more budget-friendly celebrations, though the travel time from the airport is slightly longer, at around 3 hours.</p>"}, {"id": 589, "question": "Is early check-in available for wedding guests at Tarangi Resort & Spa, Jim Corbett?", "answer": "<p>Yes, guests can request an early check-in at the resort, which can be accommodated, subject to hotel availability. Contact the hotel authorities directly to request early check-in. The standard check-in time at Tarangi Resort &amp; Spa, Jim Corbett, is 2:00 pm, and check-out time is at 11:00 am.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 590, "question": "What is the liquor policy for destination weddings at Tarangi Resort & Spa, Jim Corbett?", "answer": "<p>Alcohol is permitted at Tarangi Resort &amp; Spa, Jim Corbett, but all drinks must be arranged through the hotel. Outside alcohol is not allowed, and beverages are charged separately based on consumption, as they are not a part of the standard wedding package.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '58', '105'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'jim-corbett' AND `slug` = 'tarangi-jim-corbett-resort-and-spa');
--> statement-breakpoint
