SELECT 'jim-corbett', 'the-riverview-retreat-jim-corbett', 'published', 'Riverview Retreat Jim Corbett Wedding Cost & Booking', 'The Riverview Retreat Corbett is a serene jungle wedding destination. Explore wedding cost, packages & hotel booking for your dream Jim Corbett wedding.', 'the riverview retreat corbett wedding cost, the riverview retreat corbett wedding, the riverview retreat corbett hotel booking, the riverview retreat corbett wedding packages, the riverview retreat jim corbett', '/storage/hotel/seo/3l9OTUNx3VjuoOGqNEX39l25adQJxuX6K0yP76J8.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/gPMtct66hhUTzXLRkYITE02GbDJcep0reT7PVsfY.jpg', 'The Riverview Retreat Jim Corbett', 'Jim Corbett National Park, Zero, Distt, Ramnagar, Garjiya, Dhikuli, Uttarakhand 244715, India', '150 Minutes', '25 Minutes', '<p>A&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at Riverview Retreat, Corbett by Leisure Hotels,</strong> naturally unfolds along the banks of the Kosi River. Seated quietly within Jim Corbett’s forested landscape, the hotel features picturesque river views, lush greens and open skies. Built in a cottage-style layout with stone textures, wooden accents and sloping roofs, it carries a grounded, almost homely charm that blends naturally with its surroundings rather than competing with them.</p><p>While planning a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Jim Corbett</strong>, this cottage resort is most likely to appeal to couples who wish to plan an intimate celebration. Expansive lawns like The Riverview Lawn, Estate Lawn and Kosi Lawn sit right by the river, giving pheras and evening gatherings a calm, open-air backdrop. Indoor spaces like Arundel Hall offer a more structured setting when needed, while decks and courtyards bring in quieter, more intimate moments between functions. The scale feels generous, yet never overwhelming.</p><p>Once the festivities are done with, the guests reminisce about their comfortable and calming stay experience at&nbsp;<strong>Riverview Retreat, Corbett by Leisure Hotels.</strong> Even simple moments, a sunset drink at the bar or a walk by the river, feel like part of the celebration rather than an add-on.</p>', '93', 'Arundel Hall', 'Estate Lawn, Kosi Lawn, The Riverview Lawn, Kosi Court, Kosi Deck', '186', '230', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/0BuCC1Iq7mqxUAZkL9MkQFs21NbuuDIEGAxbfewj.jpg", "title": "3+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/GRVMSsf3exPRGI6tfI0Yvm2colKY7F2ngcz2HHbV.jpg", "title": "Curated celebratory dining menus"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/9BM5hMcXrf04XMTjtep8gpcIIhHLbKacezUr1VA2.jpg", "title": "Dedicated wedding planning specialists"}]', '[{"id": 213, "question": "Which is the closest airport to Riverview Retreat, Corbett by Leisure Hotels?", "answer": "<p>The closest airport to&nbsp;<strong>The Riverview Retreat, Corbett by Leisure Hotels</strong> is Pantnagar Airport (PGH). It is around 95 km away, taking roughly 2 hours by road, depending on traffic and route.</p>"}, {"id": 214, "question": "What are the check-in and check-out times at Riverview Retreat, Corbett by Leisure Hotels, and is early check-in available?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at the property is 2:00 pm, and check-out time is 11:00 am. An early check-in can be arranged at&nbsp;<strong>Riverview Retreat, Corbett by Leisure Hotels</strong>, subject to availability.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 215, "question": "Is there an off-season for weddings at Riverview Retreat, Corbett by Leisure Hotels?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>Riverview Retreat, Corbett by Leisure Hotels</strong> sees an off-season for weddings during July to September due to the monsoon and travel disruptions. However, the best time for destination weddings at this property is from October to March.</p>"}, {"id": 216, "question": "What is the ideal budget for a 2-night wedding at Riverview Retreat, Corbett by Leisure Hotels?", "answer": "<p>The standard cost of a 2-night wedding at&nbsp;<strong>Riverview Retreat, Corbett by Leisure Hotels,</strong> typically ranges from INR 50 lakhs to INR 80 lakhs for approximately 200-250 guests. Use Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator to get a closer estimate.</p>"}, {"id": 217, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol to the Riverview Retreat, Corbett by Leisure Hotels, for a destination wedding?", "answer": "<p>No, outside alcohol is not permitted at<strong> Riverview Retreat, Corbett by Leisure Hotels</strong> for destination weddings. The hotel provides its own in-house bar service, and all beverages are served by the property and charged based on consumption.</p>"}]', '234', '93'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'jim-corbett' AND `slug` = 'the-riverview-retreat-jim-corbett');
