SELECT 'jim-corbett', 'welcomhotel-by-itc-hotels-jim-corbett', 'published', 'Welcomhotel ITC Jim Corbett Wedding Cost & Venue Booking', 'Plan your destination wedding at Welcomhotel ITC Jim Corbett. Check wedding cost, jungle venues & booking options for an unforgettable Corbett wedding.', 'Welcomhotel ITC Jim Corbett, Welcomhotel ITC Jim Corbett wedding, Welcomhotel ITC Jim Corbett wedding cost', '/storage/hotel/seo/WDIrZzxXlzrV4SLq88hE7vSXUNb7kWmggduRNZxs.png', '/storage/hotels/banners/1IULpnHA8he1HViSGSSnaMFqm7yARCf0vOCTVD5W.jpg', 'Welcomhotel By ITC Hotels Jim Corbett', 'Village Kyari, Tehsil Salt, Betalghat Road, Ramnagar, Uttarakhand 263646, India', '135 Minutes', '45 Minutes', '<p>Perched high above the valley,&nbsp;<strong>Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels, Jim Corbett</strong> stages weddings right within the mountains. The first thing you notice is the view, opening out into the Kosi River valley, with hills stretching endlessly in the background.&nbsp;</p><p>Visualise this: a slow morning, surrounded by your closest people, with warm sunlight glowing above your head as the festivity begins. As the afternoon goes on, all of your near and dear ones come to the edge of the property to watch the sky change colours while you take your pheras in front of a beautiful valley view. No rush, no noise, just a place that naturally brings everyone together in the moment.</p><p>The resort keeps everything simple and comfortable, with bright, open spaces, warm ITC hospitality and thoughtful detailing. From local Kumaoni meals to time spent by the pool or out in nature, the experience feels relaxed, well-paced and easy for everyone to enjoy.</p>', '53 rooms with 9 suites', 'Ballroom', 'Banquet Lawns, Pool Lawns', '170', '170', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/RKqDCffZp6u3CDBTxpQWy50BNXfjIuEz73lIO4kZ.jpg", "title": "3+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/Q8rmUdvdYAN5yvOMsWz6JPJoW5C3JmtUVAnQT1V3.jpg", "title": "Sunset high tea experience"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/iUnKA8zHrXVvFxSp1AJVenVdy3gRD2hpfEz3wVbP.jpg", "title": "Alfresco dining with local cuisine"}]', '[{"id": 208, "question": "How much does a wedding at Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels, Jim Corbett cost?", "answer": "<p>The standard cost of a destination wedding package at Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels, Jim Corbett, ranges from INR 40 lakhs to INR 60 lakhs, for a 3-day, 2-night celebration. The cost may vary depending on your guest count, dates of stay and other factors. To get an instant estimate on the wedding budget, enter all necessary details in Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator and get an exact quote within seconds.</p>"}, {"id": 209, "question": "Which months are most popular for weddings at Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels, Jim Corbett?", "answer": "<p>The peak season for destination weddings at&nbsp;<strong>Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels, Jim Corbett,&nbsp;</strong>is from October to February. If you are planning to host a wedding in the same period, consider securing a booking at least 6-12 months in advance.</p>"}, {"id": 210, "question": "Should I choose Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels, Jim Corbett, or Taj Corbett Resort & Spa, Uttarakhand?", "answer": "<p><strong>Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels Jim Corbett</strong> is ideal for mid-sized weddings, with 53 rooms, 9 suites and a budget of INR 40–60 lakhs. About 2–3 hours from Pantnagar Airport, larger guest lists may require off-site accommodations. Taj Corbett Resort and Spa is a more premium option, with 75 rooms and a budget of INR 80 lakhs–1.15 crore, suited for bigger celebrations with a similar travel time.</p>"}, {"id": 211, "question": "Is early check-in available for wedding guests at Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels, Jim Corbett?", "answer": "<p>Yes, guests can request an early check-in by contacting the hotel directly, but availability is subject to the hotel''s discretion. The standard check-in time at Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels, Jim Corbett is 3:00 pm, and check-out is at 12:00 noon.</p>"}, {"id": 212, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol to a wedding at Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels, Jim Corbett?", "answer": "<p>Alcohol is allowed at Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels, Jim Corbett, but all drinks are served exclusively by the hotel. Bringing in outside alcohol isn’t permitted, and beverages are billed separately based on consumption rather than being part of the standard wedding package.</p>"}]', '56', '62'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'jim-corbett' AND `slug` = 'welcomhotel-by-itc-hotels-jim-corbett');
