SELECT 'jim-corbett', 'zana-a-luxury-escape-dhikuli-jim-corbet', 'published', 'ZANA Luxury Escapes Jim Corbett Wedding Cost & Packages', 'Book your wedding at ZANA Luxury Escapes Dhikuli Jim Corbett. Get detailed wedding packages, cost & easy booking for a magical jungle luxury celebration.', 'ZANA  A Luxury Escape Dhikuli Jim Corbett wedding, ZANA  A Luxury Escape Dhikuli Jim Corbett wedding cost', '/storage/hotel/seo/atgcbHjXe3BbhuxY4qnHtd3NTPOUdEzU18d311mc.png', '/storage/hotels/banners/eLHtdLo8ouyP6GQj1YarZ67rc5It3lqc6wRm7qgT.jpg', 'ZANA  A Luxury Escape  Dhikuli  Jim Corbet', 'Ramnagar, Dhikuli, Ramnagar, Uttarakhand 244715, India', '130 Minutes', '25 Minutes', '<p>Set along the quieter side of Dhikuli,&nbsp;<strong>ZANA - A Luxury Escape, Jim Corbett&nbsp;</strong>lets you ease into it from the moment you arrive. Cottages with sloping roofs and stone textures give it the charm of an English country home, set against the wild greens near the iconic Jim Corbett National Park.</p><p>A mehendi function finds its place in a shaded lawn, surrounded by tall trees, while the larger functions take over open spaces or shift indoors to the ballroom as the evening sets in. Treehouse stays add a playful, intimate touch for close family, making the experience feel personal right from the start.</p><p>What stays with you is the feeling of being in the right place. The setting, the details, and the ease of each moment make everything feel effortless. Backed by Espire Hospitality, the service is warm and attentive for both national and international guests, with scenic dining and quiet corners that make the wedding feel intimate, relaxed and thoughtfully curated.</p>', '57', 'The Arcade', 'Outdoor Lawn', '120', '160', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/shipulUhHYUgg1LohJn6MP9zs0f7bRaELIXzk7Pk.jpg", "title": "2+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/DOWzhX1PWj228LFgM6MZz4GklnmQo7LxWskuWA18.jpg", "title": "Boutique cottages with treehouse stays"}]', '[{"id": 641, "question": "How much does a wedding at ZANA - A Luxury Escape - Dhikuli, Jim Corbett cost?", "answer": "<p>The standard cost of a destination wedding at ZANA - A Luxury Escape - Dhikuli for a 3-day, 2-night celebration usually starts from INR 60 lakhs to INR 80 lakhs. If you need an exact quote, enter your preferred dates, the total number of guests and the number of rooms required in Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator to get an instant estimate.</p>"}, {"id": 642, "question": "Which is the nearest airport to ZANA - A Luxury Escape - Dhikuli, Jim Corbett?", "answer": "<p>The closest airport to&nbsp;<strong>ZANA - A Luxury Escape - Dhikuli, Jim Corbett,&nbsp;</strong>is Pantnagar Airport (PGH), located about 85 km from the resort. Depending on traffic and weather conditions, a car ride from the airport to the resort may take approximately 2-3 hours.</p>"}, {"id": 643, "question": "Which months are most popular for weddings at ZANA - A Luxury Escape - Dhikuli, Jim Corbett?", "answer": "<p>October to March are considered the peak season for hosting a wedding at<strong> ZANA - A Luxury Escape - Dhikuli, Jim Corbett.&nbsp;</strong>During this season, comfortable temperatures and lush green surroundings create a pleasant outdoor setting, making it ideal for wedding ceremonies.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 644, "question": "Can I request an early check-in at ZANA - A Luxury Escape - Dhikuli, Jim Corbett?", "answer": "<p>Yes, you can request an early check-in at&nbsp;<strong>ZANA - A Luxury Escape - Dhikuli, Jim Corbett,&nbsp;</strong>which is subject to hotel availability. The standard check-in time at ZANA Dhikuli is 3:00 pm, and the check-out time is 11:00 am.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 645, "question": "What is the liquor policy for destination weddings at ZANA - A Luxury Escape - Dhikuli, Jim Corbett?", "answer": "<p>Alcohol is permitted at&nbsp;<strong>ZANA - A Luxury Escape, Jim Corbett</strong>, but all beverages must be purchased through the hotel. Outside alcohol is not allowed on the property premises, and drinks are charged separately, as they are not a part of the standard wedding package.</p>"}]', '57', '57'
