SELECT 'jodhpur', 'indana-palace-jodhpur', 'published', 'Indana Palace Jodhpur Wedding Cost & Booking', 'Check Indana Palace Jodhpur wedding cost, wedding packages, price & booking details. Plan a royal destination wedding in Jodhpur with luxury venue.', 'indana palace jodhpur wedding cost, indana palace jodhpur wedding, indana palace jodhpur wedding price, indana palace jodhpur booking, indana palace jodhpur price', '/storage/hotel/seo/b4Gobakj2WPMlJ1D8JkU7R8Se0U8pYI0rvTR6zTm.png', '/storage/hotels/banners/UsNnyjlXVdGHhTn3MWlgUH484w0FotKl9A9LG0iu.jpg', 'Indana Palace Jodhpur', 'Opp. Military Officer Quarters, Benayakiya Road, Shikargarh, Jodhpur, Rajasthan 342015, India', '10 Minutes', '20 Minutes', '<p>In the heart of the ‘Blue City’,<strong> Indana Palace Jodhpur</strong> spans six acres and is inspired by 16th-century royal Rajasthani architecture, with grand domes, jaali screens and huge, open courtyards. Long corridors and subtle details add depth and character to the resort, and every corner reflects the city’s royal heritage.</p><p>As guests assemble for the pheras outside, sunlight streams through the jaali screens onto a mandap stage decorated with flowers. The courtyards are illuminated by gentle lanterns during evening ceremonies, creating a fairytale-like atmosphere. The layout of the palace guarantees that every moment feels purposeful and unforgettable, and indoor halls offer a cosy setting for post-ceremony gatherings.</p><p>With the Zodiac Spa offering relaxing treatments, and restaurants and bars bringing local and international flavours to the table, this property allows families to truly come together and celebrate. Guests can savour meaningful moments, cherishing each experience as it plays out.</p>', '88 rooms and suites', 'Inner Courtyard, Main Banquet Hall', 'Landscaped Lawn, Open Courtyard', 'Approximately 200 to 220 guests', 'Approximately 200 to 220 guests', '[{"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal02.png", "title": "1.\t4+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal03.png", "title": "2.\tCamel safari with temple visit"}]', '[{"id": 54, "question": "How much does a destination wedding at Indana Palace Jodhpur resort cost?", "answer": "<p>The standard price for an <strong>Indana Palace Jodhpur wedding</strong> ranges from INR 30 lakhs to INR 80 lakhs for a 3-day, 2-night event. To get an exact quote for the hotel you wish to host your wedding in, you can use our Cost Calculator. Enter your preferred dates, required rooms, total guest capacity and any other necessary details to instantly get a precise estimate.</p>"}, {"id": 55, "question": "What are nearby attractions or activities for international guests around Indana Palace Jodhpur?", "answer": "<p>The grand Umaid Bhawan Palace, the historic Mehrangarh Fort and lively local markets are all easily accessible from Indana Palace Jodhpur, owing to its proximity to the city centre. Additionally, private city tours, desert excursions and architectural exploration of the ‘Blue City’ are some popular activities that international visitors can take part in.</p>"}, {"id": 56, "question": "Should I choose Indana Palace, Jodhpur, or Taj Hari Mahal, Jodhpur, for my wedding?", "answer": "<p>With 88 premium accommodations and a wedding budget ranging from INR 30 lakhs to INR 80 lakhs, Indana Palace Jodhpur is located 10 minutes away from the Jodhpur Airport. With its beautifully designed courtyards and architecture inspired by history, this property could be the perfect setting for a royal wedding. However, the Taj Hari Mahal, Jodhpur, offers 93 luxurious rooms and suites, with budgets ranging between INR 85 lakhs and INR 1.45 Cr. Located within 10 to 15 minutes of the airport, this property is the perfect getaway for a softer, classic aesthetic wedding.</p>"}, {"id": 57, "question": "What is the check-in time at Indana Palace Jodhpur? Is early check-in available for wedding guests?", "answer": "<p>As per the hotel policy, the standard check-in time at Indana Palace Jodhpur is 2:00 pm, and check-out is by 12:00 noon. Guests coming to attend a wedding at Indana Palace in Jodhpur can request an early check-in, which may be accommodated based on availability.</p>"}, {"id": 58, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol to the wedding at Indana Palace, Jodhpur?", "answer": "<p>Although alcohol is allowed at Indana Palace Jodhpur, all drinks served in banquet halls and public spaces must be bought directly from the hotel. Liquor from outside is not permitted on the property. Beverages are usually not included in the standard wedding package and are billed separately based on consumption.</p>"}]', '44', '88'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'jodhpur' AND `slug` = 'indana-palace-jodhpur');
--> statement-breakpoint
INSERT INTO `hotels` (city, slug, status, seo_title, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, banner_image, name, address, airport_time, station_time, description, room_inventory, indoor_venues, outdoor_venues, guest_capacity, reception_capacity, highlights, faqs, external_hotel_id, total_rooms)
SELECT 'jodhpur', 'radisson-hotel-jodhpur', 'published', 'Radisson Hotel Jodhpur Wedding Packages, Cost & Venues', 'Explore Radisson Hotel Jodhpur wedding packages, cost, and venue options. Compare pricing, check inclusions, and book your perfect destination wedding easily.', 'radisson hotel jodhpur wedding package, radisson hotel jodhpur wedding, radisson hotel jodhpur wedding price, radisson jodhpur, radisson jodhpur price, radisson hotel jodhpur booking, radisson jodhpur booking, radisson jodhpur booking', '/storage/hotel/seo/kItl7M5fOWkZ9kTPCCjj5w5uoW4FV3ivFaoTGmAY.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/RRLEdKPACfp56gP1woimkFnvuP7KDiAWNrsCaQHu.jpg', 'Radisson Hotel Jodhpur', '8, Residency Rd, Gaurav Path, Jodhpur, Rajasthan 342001, India', '10 Minutes', '15 minutes', '<p><strong>Radisson Hotel Jodhpur</strong></p><p>Inspired by traditional haveli-style architecture, the&nbsp;<strong>Radisson Hotel Jodhpur</strong> stands out with its red sandstone exterior and intricate carvings. Jharokas and sweeping golden-accented archways decorate the hallways, creating a regal and inviting atmosphere. Located close to iconic landmarks such as Mehrangarh Fort, Ghanta Ghar and Mandore Garden, the hotel offers an experience that feels distinctly Rajasthani: something that international guests tend to appreciate all the more.</p><p>6 versatile venues are located at the property, serving as elegant settings for your receptions and ceremonies. A varied menu with rich Rajasthani flavours and global favourites is thoughtfully curated for those planning their&nbsp;<strong>wedding at the Radisson Hotel&nbsp;</strong>Jodhpur. The hotel’s courtyards and grand entrances serve as striking locations for bridal entries and wedding photography, adding visual splendour to your celebrations.&nbsp;</p>', '96 rooms with suites', 'Jashn, Samaroh, Utsav', 'Rooftop, Lawns', '220', '220', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/cNRkJIeBExktER0qJ5OMY6c3Sdyb22YaRgDS8u8K.jpg", "title": "Innovative wedding studio"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/93iMTpAZ0sCFzrk9bCgnl0hdKuB4jaFTskjxrNFr.jpg", "title": "Personalised wedding suite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/lfL9JXFX4YO2CtMmeElHorY0dsQOkrXTP4PsJGRw.jpg", "title": "Local sweets or delicacies for gifting"}]', '[{"id": 25, "question": "Does the Radisson Hotel Jodhpur offer any special wedding services?", "answer": "<p>Yes, the Radisson Hotel Jodhpur offers a unique blend of Indian and cross-cultural traditions for those looking to celebrate their special day. The Art of Weddings is a comprehensive service that provides couples with a wedding butler and access to an innovative wedding studio. This studio acts as a creative hub where you can visualise every detail and select authentic Rajasthani gift hampers. The goal is to provide a stress-free planning experience along with an event that feels truly unique.<br>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 26, "question": "When is the peak wedding season for the Radisson Hotel Jodhpur?", "answer": "<p>The peak wedding season for Radisson Hotel Jodhpur is between October and March, when the weather is cool and pleasant. However, the most popular months for weddings are November to February, which often see the highest demand and cost increases of 15–20%.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 27, "question": "Are there any early check-in services available at Radisson Hotel Jodhpur?", "answer": "<p><strong>Radisson Jodhpur</strong> offers early check-in upon request, but it depends heavily on room availability. You might also be charged extra. While standard check-in is at 3:00 PM, it is recommended to contact the hotel directly to confirm in advance.</p>"}, {"id": 28, "question": "What is the price of hosting a wedding at the Radisson Hotel Jodhpur?", "answer": "<p>The average price of a wedding at the Radisson Hotel Jodhpur is around ₹40 –70 Lakhs for a 3 day and 2 night event. However, prices can vary greatly depending on the number of guests, wedding date and number of rooms. For a transparent estimate, you can refer to our Cost Calculator. Just enter the details concerning your check-in, check-out, guest count and location for an immediate and near-accurate budget.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 29, "question": "What are the alcohol-related policies at the Radisson Hotel Jodhpur?", "answer": "<p>The&nbsp;<strong>Radisson Hotel Jodhpur</strong> is not a dry hotel. It has on-site bars serving a full range of spirits and beer. All beverages and drinks for the public gatherings have to be sourced in-house, where they are billed separately from your standard package. Outside liquor is not permitted on the premises.&nbsp;</p>"}]', '31', '96'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'jodhpur' AND `slug` = 'radisson-hotel-jodhpur');
--> statement-breakpoint
