SELECT 'jodhpur', 'ranbanka-palace-jodhpur', 'published', 'Ranbanka Palace Jodhpur – Weddings, Cost & Reviews', 'Ranbanka Palace offers regal wedding experiences in Jodhpur. Read trusted reviews, compare wedding costs, and find your perfect venue. Book Your Date Now!', 'ranbanka palace wedding cost, ranbanka palace jodhpur wedding, ranbanka palace jodhpur wedding cost, ranbanka palace wedding, ranbanka palace jodhpur, ranbanka palace jodhpur india, ranbanka palace reviews', '/storage/hotel/seo/BCbP2bLJr6Fo5ci8ftu8WyHlCNxMjef71loU1Akb.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/j1sOIA3D1ZpzoNQVPooiKOvFgSvF7wLr3Zv8Crx7.jpg', 'Ranbanka Palace Jodhpur', 'Circuit House Rd, Ajit Colony, Jodhpur, Rajasthan 342001, India', '15 Minutes', '10 minutes', '<p><strong>Ranbanka Palace</strong> works well if you want a palace setting without the scale becoming difficult to manage. Built in 1927 as a royal residence, it still holds its original Indo-Deco character with red sandstone facades, jali work and naturally ventilated interiors suited to Jodhpur’s climate.</p><p>The mix of indoor and outdoor venues at&nbsp;<strong>Ranbanka Palace&nbsp;</strong>seems ideal for a grand yet intimate destination wedding in Jodhpur. While the courtyard can easily accommodate large gatherings, the poolside suits evening events and Rajput Hall seems like the perfect venue for smaller, more intimate ceremonies. All spaces are in close proximity to one another, which makes guest movement and event transitions straightforward.</p><p>Hosting a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at Ranbanka Palace</strong> is easy to manage, with the airport just a short drive away. The property sits in a quieter neighbourhood, yet remains close to Umaid Bhawan and Mehrangarh Fort. The hotel’s hospitality is warm and reliable, whereas in-house dining keeps guests in awe of the entire experience.</p>', '90', 'Rajput Hall', 'Poolside Lawn, Fountain Lawn, Open Courtyard', '200', '230', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/nUh7Kr9U81gFaku4gsXocqXTaV3QZq7BKfT0TAWO.jpg", "title": "3+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/9dM5HiQKM7kOR6upKBzkopr5tJ9TPRbuK3LJ26kr.jpg", "title": "Traditional Thar folk music evenings"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/1CUZtHbeaYtmgzgxDpoXQcPnVo1BTzcMp8WERFkd.jpg", "title": "Private curated dining experiences"}]', '[{"id": 711, "question": "Which is the nearest airport to the Ranbanka Palace?", "answer": "<p>The nearest airport to<strong> Ranbanka Palace</strong> is about 3-5 km away. A car ride from the airport to the hotel takes around 10-12 minutes by car.</p>"}, {"id": 712, "question": "What is the standard check-in time at Ranbanka Palace, and is an early check-in available?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Ranbanka Palace</strong> is 2:00 pm, and guests can check out by 12:00 noon. Yes, an early check-in facility can be accommodated at the hotel, subject to hotel availability.</p>"}, {"id": 713, "question": "What is the history of the Ranbanka Palace?", "answer": "<p><strong>Ranbanka Palace&nbsp;</strong>was built in 1927 by Maharajadhiraj Sir Ajit Singh Ji and is full of stories from Jodhpur’s royal past. The architecture of the palace is a fine blending of Rajput and Victorian styles. It has been designed by Sir Henry Lanchester. Today it is still a heritage hotel, run by the descendants of the royal family.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 714, "question": "What is the ideal budget for a 2-night wedding at Ranbanka Palace?", "answer": "<p>The standard cost of a destination wedding at Ranbanka Palace for a 3-day, 2-night celebration ranges between INR 30 lakhs and INR 60 lakhs. Enter your guest count and room details in Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator and get a quote within seconds.</p>"}, {"id": 715, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol to Ranbanka Palace for a destination wedding?", "answer": "<p>No, you cannot bring your own alcohol to&nbsp;<strong>Ranbanka Palace.&nbsp;</strong>The hotel provides in-house bar service, with drinks charged on actual consumption and billed separately from wedding packages.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '145', '90'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'jodhpur' AND `slug` = 'ranbanka-palace-jodhpur');
--> statement-breakpoint
