SELECT 'jodhpur', 'taj-hari-mahal-jodhpur', 'published', 'Taj Hari Mahal Jodhpur – Destination Wedding Venue', 'Taj Hari Mahal Jodhpur offers heritage wedding venues, curated menus & signature Taj hospitality for a royal destination wedding in Rajasthan. Book Now!', 'taj hari mahal jodhpur wedding, taj hari mahal jodhpur wedding cost, taj hari mahal, taj hari mahal jodhpur price, taj hari mahal jodhpur, hari mahal palace, hari mahal palace jodhpur, taj hari mahal jodhpur booking, taj hari mahal jodhpur contact number', '/storage/hotel/seo/QrrWRJZzOYAoKTJrSIIVHzBu2YrS6T9FJ1KJYRba.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/mbuLQUZRbbCX61I0XOG5lvxqDwhxkG2dr6VGQ7EN.jpg', 'Taj Hari Mahal jodhpur', '5th Residency Road, Surya Colony, Jodhpur, Rajasthan 342011, India', '5 Minutes', '5 Minutes', '<p>Inspired by Marwar''s rich history, <strong>Taj Hari Mahal, Jodhpur,&nbsp;</strong>is a royal retreat set amidst 6 acres of landscaped gardens at the heart of the ‘Blue City.’ The hotel’s grand domes, arched hallways and elaborate jharokhas, all set against the rustic charm of Jodhpur''s desert landscape, reflect the architectural splendour of Rajasthan’s varied and unique traditional heritage.</p><p>A<strong> wedding at Taj Hari Mahal</strong>, one of the most prestigious venues for <strong>destination weddings in Jodhpur,&nbsp;</strong>takes place in an ambience of classic Rajputana elegance. Every event combines regal tradition with elegant luxury, from lively mehendi parties on verdant lawns to the seven holy pheras in elaborate courtyards and premium indoor receptions.</p><p>Designed to look like a royal palace, the Taj Hari Mahal, Jodhpur, impresses from the moment guests arrive. Its opulent interiors and sweeping spaces create an ambience that captivates international guests and discerning travellers. Every type of wedding celebration at this venue becomes an authentic and unforgettable experience.</p>', '93 rooms with suites', 'Meherangarh Hall, Amar Hall', 'Pali Lawn, Mandore Lawn, Meherangarh Terrace', '200', '200', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/QXPlgOuSnnwVpmDPLYwOpDEnjkVCLfXrPX8sT4VG.jpg", "title": "4+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/VreVsMmdrisSBTA73MsN0gUyrExQR0ak5tdoh7eR.jpg", "title": "Baajot bonfire & folk dining experience"}]', '[{"id": 139, "question": "What is the cost of a destination wedding at the Taj Hari Mahal, Jodhpur?", "answer": "<p>For two nights and three days, the <strong>Taj Hari Mahal wedding costs range</strong> from INR 85 lakhs to INR 1.45 Cr. Enter your wedding dates and your room requirements in our Cost Calculator to get an instant estimate of your costs.</p>"}, {"id": 140, "question": "How can I check the availability of the Taj Hari Mahal in Jodhpur for a wedding?", "answer": "<p>To check the availability of the<strong> Hari Mahal Palace</strong>, contact the hotel directly, or simply enter your dates and preferences in our Venue Availability Check feature. Our team at Viraaya Weddings will coordinate with the hotels to provide detailed insights and suitable alternatives instantly, if required.</p>"}, {"id": 141, "question": "What is the check-in time at the Hari Mahal Palace in Jodhpur, and is early check-in allowed?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at the Hari Mahal Palace in Jodhpur is 2:00 pm, with check-out at 12:00 noon. If you need to check in earlier than 12:00 pm, you can request the hotel authorities directly, who can accommodate your request, subject to availability.</p>"}, {"id": 142, "question": "Which is better: Taj Mahal Palace in Jodhpur or ITC Welcomhotel, Jodhpur?", "answer": "<p>The Taj Hari Mahal, Jodhpur, suits a heritage-style wedding, with 93 rooms, royal architecture, and budgets ranging from INR 85 lakh to INR 1.45 crore. It is around 4 km from Jodhpur Airport, making it very convenient for guests. Meanwhile, Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels, Jodhpur, offers 98 rooms with a modern-meets-traditional feel and wedding costs ranging from INR 80 lakh to INR 1.2 crore. It is about 11 km from the airport, requiring a slightly longer transfer.</p>"}, {"id": 143, "question": "What is the liquor policy at Taj Hari Mahal, Jodhpur? Is outside alcohol allowed?", "answer": "<p>Alcohol is permitted at Taj Hari Mahal, Jodhpur; however, all beverages served across public areas and banquet spaces are exclusively provided by the hotel. External alcohol is not allowed within the hotel premises. All drinks are billed on a consumption basis and are generally not part of the standard wedding package.</p>"}]', '26', '93'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'jodhpur' AND `slug` = 'taj-hari-mahal-jodhpur');
