SELECT 'jodhpur', 'umaid-bhawan-palace-jodhpur', 'published', 'Umaid Bhawan Palace Jodhpur Wedding Cost & Venue Booking', 'Explore Umaid Bhawan Palace Jodhpur wedding cost & venue booking. Host a royal Art Deco wedding. Plan your dream palace celebration today!', 'umaid bhawan palace wedding, umaid bhawan palace wedding cost, umaid bhawan jodhpur, jodhpur''s umaid bhawan palace, jodhpur umaid palace, umaid palace jodhpur, the umaid bhawan palace jodhpur, the umaid bhawan palace, bhawan palace jodhpur, umaid bhawan palace booking, umaid bhawan booking, umaid bhawan palace marriage cost, cost of umaid bhawan palace, umaid bhawan destination wedding cost, umaid bhawan jodhpur wedding cost, umaid bhawan wedding cost, umaid bhawan palace jodhpur wedding cost', '/storage/hotel/seo/pF9Q6TCLf4Zokx96dNeGjfXotnzpulNzA55c1d4L.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/zXv05ZGQq2IEOBsOyB3KAc2fZb2HgOEGUwJLSY5t.jpg', 'Umaid Bhawan Palace Jodhpur', 'Circuit House Rd, near Umaid Bhawan Museum, Cantt Area, Jodhpur, Rajasthan 342006, India', '10 Minutes', '11 Minutes', '<p>Situated atop Chittar Hill, spanning 26 acres, <strong>Umaid Bhawan Palace in Jodhpur</strong> was designed by Henry Vaughan Lanchester in the late 1920s. Surrounded by Jodhpur’s golden landscape, the palace-turned-hotel offers breathtaking views of the ‘Blue City’. Inspired by Art Deco and Indo-Saracenic architecture, the palace is built from golden-yellow sandstone and Makrana marble, which sparkle under the golden hour light.</p><p>Renowned as one of the most iconic wedding destinations in Jodhpur, a <strong>wedding at Umaid Bhawan Palace&nbsp;</strong>unfolds against a backdrop of manicured gardens, expansive lawns and thoughtfully designed indoor halls. Whether it’s the golden-hour pheras framed by panoramic sunsets or an opulent reception set amid regal interiors, every celebration feels like a true balance of charm and royalty.</p><p>Managed by Taj Hotels, <strong>weddings at Umaid Bhawan Palace</strong> are carefully organised with attention to detail. Thoughtfully designed décor, curated menus and smooth, attentive service come together to create a well-run celebration that reflects the palace’s character and heritage while offering guests a comfortable and memorable&nbsp;</p>', '71 rooms with suites', 'Marwar Hall, Rathore Hall', 'Baradari Lawn, Fountain Courtyard', '200', '200', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/XB9Y6zJGNjykpq3GUxEl3KSJim2KJrowgWOWQeyF.jpg", "title": "3+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/AQY301VMHYDsds7fuT4PAf34YMqvjBJr5trKcbuD.jpg", "title": "Royal bath ritual experience"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/Gpl4UWHxkGQBRdNTw8APYgl0LVxjjVF8C5ZQ5NOP.jpg", "title": "Grand palace proposal setting"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/vgAzdXAKQYcTZ77bYd2hYM4Q7SmhJfxNZt8xc8vJ.jpg", "title": "Intimate sundeck lawn with views"}, {"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal06.png", "title": "Exclusive poolside dinner setting"}]', '[{"id": 134, "question": "What is the cost of a wedding at the Umaid Bhawan Palace, Jodhpur?", "answer": "<p>On average, a <strong>destination wedding at Umaid Bhawan Palace costs&nbsp;</strong>between INR 3 Cr and INR 4 Cr for a 3-day 2-night event. You can also use our Wedding Venue Cost Calculator to get an estimate. Enter your check-in and check-out dates, along with your room requirements and click on ‘calculate hotel cost.’ Within seconds, you will be able to get a fair estimation of the price.</p>"}, {"id": 135, "question": "How to book Umaid Bhawan Palace, Jodhpur, for a destination wedding?", "answer": "<p>To secure a <strong>wedding event booking at Umaid Bhawan Palace, Jodhpur,</strong> you must contact the Taj Hotels at least 9 to 12 months in advance. For a hassle-free booking process, consult Viraaya Weddings for personalised assistance to get the best deals.</p>"}, {"id": 136, "question": "Which is better: Umaid Bhawan Palace, Jodhpur, or Rambagh Palace, Jaipur?", "answer": "<p>Both have a distinct charm and are popular venues for weddings. Umaid Bhawan Palace, which has 71 rooms, grand Art Deco-meets-royal architecture and a more private desert setting, is only 10 kilometres from Jodhpur Airport. Rambagh Palace has 78 rooms, a lush garden setting and easy access to the city. Rambagh and Umaid Bhawan have budgets of INR 3 Cr to INR 4 Cr, respectively. Nearby heritage hotels like the Taj Hari Mahal or Sawai Man Mahal, respectively, for Umaid Bhawan and Rambagh Palace, may be considered for additional guest accommodations.</p>"}, {"id": 137, "question": "What is the check-in time at the Umaid Bhawan Palace in Jodhpur, and can we check-in early?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at the Jodhpur Umaid Palace is 2:00 pm, and the check-out time is by 12:00 noon. If you need an early check-in or a late check-out, you can contact the hotel directly, as availability is subject to change.</p>"}, {"id": 138, "question": "What is the liquor policy at Umaid Bhawan Palace, Jodhpur?", "answer": "<p>Alcohol is permitted at Umaid Bhawan, Jodhpur; however, all beverages served across public areas and banquet spaces are to be arranged exclusively through the hotel. Outside alcohol is strictly not allowed on the premises. Beverages are charged separately on a consumption basis and are typically not part of the standard wedding package.</p>"}]', '25', '71'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'jodhpur' AND `slug` = 'umaid-bhawan-palace-jodhpur');
