SELECT 'jodhpur', 'welcomhotel-by-itc-hotels-jodhpur', 'published', 'Welcomhotel ITC Jodhpur Wedding Price & Booking', 'Check Welcomhotel by ITC wedding price, cost, and packages in Jodhpur. Discover venue details, ITC hotel booking, and luxury wedding planning options.', 'welcomhotel by itc jodhpur wedding price, welcomhotel by itc jodhpur wedding cost, welcomhotel by itc jodhpur wedding, itc jodhpur hotel booking, itc hotels in udaipur, itc welcomhotel jodhpur, welcomhotel itc jodhpur, welcome by itc jodhpur, itc jodhpur price', '/storage/hotel/seo/z1PSR7y3AZwp8NzOtdpO6YLSFi1RMLB4cKZCTujL.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/Xz0Vt14NHFLRf8flT0DmkxIr8S03F4kvyWyZ87xx.jpg', 'Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels Jodhpur', '53, Uchiyarda Rd, Dev Nagar, Jodhpur, Nandara Kalan, Rajasthan 342027, India', '30 Minutes', '25 Minutes', '<p>Heavily inspired by the grandeur of Marwar, <strong>Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels, Jodhpur</strong> is a sandstone masterpiece set against the golden views of the Thar Desert. Graceful arches, carved details and expansive courtyards reflect Rajasthan’s royal heritage, while sweeping desert views create a cinematic backdrop for wedding ceremonies.</p><p>Celebrations can take place in large, open courtyards and exquisitely landscaped lawns beneath the clear desert skies. For larger celebrations, guests can be easily accommodated in expansive banquet halls adorned with breathtaking chandeliers that serve as the focal point.</p><p>The <strong>ITC Welcomhotel, Jodhpur&nbsp;</strong>spans 4.05 hectares, giving the <strong>destination wedding venue</strong> an open, spacious feel. Thoughtfully designed interiors, ambient lighting and carefully planned catering ensure that every celebration impresses even the most discerning and well-travelled guests.&nbsp;</p>', '140 rooms with suites', 'Jodha Hall, Akbar Hall', 'Mandore Lawn, Bistro Lawn, Residential Lawn', '300', '300', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/uYb81NRzJrx4ie3ET4vkKfziqFr7fPJRBtWZsojj.jpg", "title": "4+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/5Tmu9Xg7JLHQa3fZ9BiYiuTmbRYH6GgbbrHCnsh2.jpg", "title": "11 acres of landscaped gardens and heritage courtyards"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/BYhUwRTF4RM0lKGuZ1UoJsMzUhUd3chRwznkqR9t.jpg", "title": "Luxurious accommodations with exquisite chambers and villas"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/ldPGE0Lqz2n50nASw8DM0z12CYLAWyD7Whfg3nGP.jpg", "title": "Expansive lawns for outdoor wedding celebrations"}]', '[{"id": 148, "question": "What is the cost of a wedding at Welcomhotel ITC, Jodhpur?", "answer": "<p>On average, the starting <strong>wedding price at Welcomhotel ITC, Jodhpur,</strong> for 3 days and 2 nights is INR 80 lakhs to 1.2 cr. Depending on the scale and season, the pricing may vary. To get a clear cost estimate, use our Cost Calculator. Simply enter your scheduled dates, the total number of guests and the number of rooms required to get a precise estimate within seconds.</p>"}, {"id": 149, "question": "What is the standard check-in time at Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels, Jodhpur, and can we check-in early?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels, Jodhpur is 3:00 pm, and check-out is at 12:00 noon. Early check-in or late check-out timings can be requested and are accommodated, subject to hotel availability.</p>"}, {"id": 150, "question": "How to check availability for a wedding at Welcomhotel by ITC, Jodhpur?", "answer": "<p>To check availability for a <strong>Welcomhotel by ITC, Jodhpur wedding</strong>, you can contact the relevant authorities directly via their official email ID. To coordinate your plan more smoothly, you can also use Viraaya Weddings'' Venue Availability Check service. Simply enter your preferred dates and room requirements, and our team will coordinate with your chosen venues to provide instant insights and suitable alternatives.</p>"}, {"id": 151, "question": "What is the liquor policy at Welcomhotel by ITC, Jodhpur?", "answer": "<p>Alcohol is allowed at Welcomhotel by ITC, Jodhpur; however, all beverages served in public and banquet areas are sourced solely through the hotel. Outside alcohol is strictly prohibited on the premises. Drinks are billed on a per-consumption basis and are generally excluded from the standard wedding package.</p>"}, {"id": 152, "question": "Which is better: ITC Welcomhotel, Jodhpur, or Taj Hari Mahal, Jodhpur?", "answer": "<p>With 93 rooms, heritage-inspired architecture and wedding budgets ranging from INR 90 lakh to INR 1.5 crore, Taj Hari Mahal in Jodhpur offers convenient access to the city while delivering a regal, traditional setting. In contrast, the 98 rooms at Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels, Jodhpur, blend contemporary comfort with classic style. With budgets from INR 80 lakh to INR 1.2 crore and easy access from key transport hubs, this property is ideal for couples seeking a refined, slightly modern celebration in Jodhpur.</p>"}]', '30', '140'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'jodhpur' AND `slug` = 'welcomhotel-by-itc-hotels-jodhpur');
--> statement-breakpoint
