SELECT 'karnal', 'noormahal-palace-karnal', 'published', 'Noormahal Palace Karnal Wedding Cost & Venue Booking', 'Noormahal Palace Hotel Karnal is your ultimate destination wedding venue. Get honest wedding cost details & royal packages tailored for you. Contact Us!', 'noor mahal karnal wedding cost, noor mahal karnal destination wedding cost, noor mahal karnal price for wedding, noor mahal karnal wedding, noor mahal karnal wedding price, wedding cost at noor mahal karnal, wedding at noor mahal karnal, wedding noor mahal karnal, noormahal palace karnal wedding cost, noormahal palace karnal wedding, noormahal palace hotel karnal wedding, noormahal palace karnal', '/storage/hotel/seo/mvUjwPc6KWDxPEsU7cHAi1T64RrJl1sBKEPmLYt1.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/dFWvabKXWCmznStfcidifjb6PVUnTc0Bt0ZfIrTT.png', 'Noormahal Palace Karnal', 'Nirmal Kutia Chowk, Sector-32, Karnal, Haryana – 132001, India, India', '180 Minutes', '20 Minutes', '<p>A&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at Noormahal Palace Hotel</strong> stands out because it doesn’t feel like a typical wedding hotel at all. It feels closer to a palace you get to stay in, featuring long corridors, carved arches and courtyards that were clearly designed for slow, ceremonial living rather than quick events. The architecture is not just decorative; it sets the pace of everything that happens here.</p><p>What you notice quite quickly at&nbsp;<strong>Noormahal Palace Hotel</strong> is that every space has its own personality. Darbar Hall feels quite formal, almost like a royal court, while Sheesh Mahal feels more intricate and enclosed, with mirrorwork that catches light in a soft, natural way. Outside, the lawns are simply large, well-kept gardens with greenery all around, and they already feel ready for functions like sangeet or reception without needing a lot of work.</p><p>For a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Karnal,</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Noormahal Palace Hotel&nbsp;</strong>works because it never feels strained by scale. Big celebrations stay organised, while smaller functions still feel personal and well-set. Guests, even those who’ve travelled far and wide, tend to settle in with ease because of the warmth and hospitality.</p>', '125', 'Darbar Hall, Rang Mahal, Sheesh Mahal', 'Rani Ka Bagh Lawn, Hazuribagh, Dera, Raja Ka Bagh, Amphitheatre', '250', '280', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/G1MrDfyko2R5197EgCD1uT57uWO0m2zsQjy3ZLU9.jpg", "title": "7+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/B4jQHUFyWiYxhkzpozpqVQt38ky5LjiymG4D2ayT.jpg", "title": "Chef-curated gazebo dining experiences"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/TtUJy1mOAWst5Oc4JlNriCtzeInOL6M9l7OqPDLS.jpg", "title": "Bespoke private dining celebrations"}]', '[{"id": 606, "question": "Which is the nearest airport to Noormahal Palace Hotel?", "answer": "<p>The closest airport to&nbsp;<strong>Noormahal Palace Hotel</strong> is the Indira Gandhi International Airport, which is located approximately 150-160 km away, roughly a 2.5-hour drive by road.</p>"}, {"id": 607, "question": "Is an early check-in available for guests at Noormahal Palace Hotel?", "answer": "<p>Yes, an early check-in is available, subject to availability. The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Noormahal Palace Hotel&nbsp;</strong>is 2:00 pm, and guests can check-out by 11:00 am.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 608, "question": "Are there nearby attractions or activities for international guests around the Noormahal Palace Hotel?", "answer": "<p>Guests at&nbsp;<strong>Noormahal Palace Hotel</strong> can explore Karna Lake, Brahma Sarovar, Kurukshetra sites, local Karnal markets and heritage spots nearby.</p>"}, {"id": 609, "question": "What is the ideal budget for a 2-night wedding at Noormahal Palace Hotel?", "answer": "<p>The standard cost of a destination wedding at&nbsp;<strong>Noormahal Palace Hotel&nbsp;</strong>ranges from INR 80 lakhs to INR 1.2 Cr for a 200-250 guest list. Use Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator to get an approximate range as per your requirements.</p>"}, {"id": 610, "question": "What is the standard liquor policy of the Noormahal Palace Hotel?", "answer": "<p>Outside alcohol is not allowed at&nbsp;<strong>Noormahal Palace Hotel</strong>. All beverages are provided through the hotel’s in-house bar and billed separately based on consumption.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '377', '125'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'karnal' AND `slug` = 'noormahal-palace-karnal');
--> statement-breakpoint
INSERT INTO `hotels` (city, slug, status, seo_title, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, banner_image, name, address, airport_time, station_time, description, room_inventory, indoor_venues, outdoor_venues, guest_capacity, reception_capacity, highlights, faqs, external_hotel_id, total_rooms)
SELECT 'karnataka', 'coorg-marriott-resort-and-spa', 'published', 'Coorg Marriott Resort & Spa Wedding Cost & Packages', 'Coorg Marriott Resort & Spa wedding cost, packages & hotel booking at best prices. Plan your dream wedding at Coorg Marriott with luxury resort venues.', 'coorg marriott resort & spa booking cost, coorg marriott resort & spa wedding cost, coorg marriott resort & spa wedding package, coorg marriott resort wedding, coorg marriott resort wedding package', '/storage/hotel/seo/vGTImOlbEzjr2bDJgLRfLpcl6yZr6MyldwPHUdSg.png', '/storage/hotels/banners/5yDNWqk4IuBlqWzMtTELu4rRi36lj7ZggO8mXhfD.jpg', 'Coorg Marriott Resort And Spa', 'Somwarpet Rd, Post, Makkanduru, Madikeri, Karnataka 571201, India', '240 Minutes', '180 Minutes', '<p>Tucked into the Makkandur forest and surrounded by the Western Ghats, the&nbsp;<strong>Coorg Marriott Resort &amp; Spa&nbsp;</strong>offers the kind of immersive natural backdrop that no amount of décor can manufacture. Mist-draped hills and the scent of coffee and spice create an indulgent atmosphere, with the resort''s cottages and villas preserving this connection to the landscape. The resort offers the full breadth of luxury amenities that a destination wedding demands: an infinity pool with private cabanas, a full-service spa, a 24-hour fitness centre and diverse dining experiences ranging from al fresco barbecue to artisanal Coorg coffee.</p><p>What makes&nbsp;<strong>Coorg Marriott Resort &amp; Spa particularly</strong> compelling for destination weddings is its venues. The Kote Betta Terrace is a standout, offering a sprawling open-air setting with an amphitheatre and sweeping views of the surrounding hills. Marriott Certified Wedding Planners manage the celebrations end-to-end, supported by dedicated on-site photography and event services.&nbsp;</p>', '108 rooms with villas', 'Silver Oak Banquet Hall, Mahogany Spaces, Magnolia Meetings', 'Kote Betta Terrace', '200', '200', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/lCy4WpbNU1MiMxwxzw2ESKJuu2BTy2eQfiZPpvVc.jpg", "title": "4 dining and bar destinations"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/xsmfS2BjUtuv2yuIfau7yok3shpAxDmy7GtBiyJ8.jpg", "title": "Quan Spa with couples massages"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/w8sIFK9kw1YkaUxcKhrtJY4ZN9VlYJ5VVzscsFSI.jpg", "title": "Dedicated Marriott Certified Wedding Planners"}]', '[{"id": 922, "question": "Are there any special offers for wedding couples at Coorg Marriott Resort & Spa?", "answer": "<p>The&nbsp;<strong>Coorg Marriott Resort &amp; Spa</strong> offers a range of privileges to wedding couples depending on the scale and nature of the booking. These may include complimentary accommodation nights, access to early check-in and late check-out for the bridal party, complimentary breakfast arrangements and curated in-room experiences for the couple.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 923, "question": "What is the peak season for weddings at Coorg Marriott Resort & Spa?", "answer": "<p>The peak wedding season at the&nbsp;<strong>Coorg Marriott Resort &amp; Spa</strong> runs from October to February, when Coorg''s post-monsoon landscape is at its most lush, and the weather is well-suited to outdoor celebrations on the Kote Betta Terrace and amphitheatre.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 924, "question": "What are the check-in and check-out timings at Coorg Marriott Resort & Spa, and are there any late check-out or early check-in privileges for wedding guests?", "answer": "<p>Standard check-in at the<strong> Coorg Marriott Resort &amp; Spa</strong> is at 3:00 PM, and check-out is at 12:00 noon. Early check-in and late check-out are available to wedding guests, subject to room availability, and are best arranged in advance through the resort''s wedding coordination team.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 925, "question": "Can I host a pre-wedding photoshoot at Coorg Marriott Resort & Spa?", "answer": "<p>The&nbsp;<strong>Coorg Marriott Resort &amp; Spa</strong> offers some of the most naturally photogenic settings available at any luxury resort in South India. Couples with confirmed bookings at the resort may request access for a pre-wedding photoshoot, subject to availability and prior approval from the events team.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 926, "question": "What is the official alcohol policy at Coorg Marriott Resort & Spa for wedding events?", "answer": "<p>As a Marriott International property, the&nbsp;<strong>Coorg Marriott Resort &amp; Spa</strong> operates a licensed in-house bar and beverage service, and all alcohol served at wedding events on the premises is required to be sourced through the hotel.&nbsp;</p>"}]', '92', '108'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'karnataka' AND `slug` = 'coorg-marriott-resort-and-spa');
--> statement-breakpoint
INSERT INTO `hotels` (city, slug, status, seo_title, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, banner_image, name, address, airport_time, station_time, description, room_inventory, indoor_venues, outdoor_venues, guest_capacity, reception_capacity, highlights, faqs, external_hotel_id, total_rooms)
SELECT 'karnataka', 'gateway-coorg-karnataka', 'published', 'Gateway Coorg Madikeri, Karnataka Wedding Cost & Packages', 'Plan your wedding at Gateway Coorg Madikeri, Karnataka. Explore packages, venue cost & booking details for a stunning hill resort celebration in Coorg.', 'Gateway Coorg wedding,  Gateway Coorg wedding cost, Gateway Coorg wedding price, Gateway Coorg wedding packages', '/storage/hotel/seo/WLNcsTMeXWUEYoQHnRVTo3EgcrGyrmMH3Vhw7U4K.png', '/storage/hotels/banners/Wop9sI6AO8MXBPvXUos1D0ZFkYYaVktFdgMQYOIG.jpg', 'Gateway Coorg Karnataka', '1st, Monnageri, Galibeedu, Karnataka 571202, India', '180 Minutes', '180 Minutes', '<p>A&nbsp;<strong>wedding at Gateway Coorg&nbsp;</strong>doesn’t feel like it’s happening inside a resort as much as it feels like it’s unfolding on a quiet hillside. Set across about 20 acres of coffee estates and rainforest in Madikeri, Gateway Coorg sits above the valley where mist moves in and out through the day, and the air carries that unmistakable coffee scent.</p><p>At&nbsp;<strong>Gateway Coorg,</strong> the Highland Hub brings a grand scale to celebrations while still feeling rooted in the hills, and the Poolside Lawns offer a softer, more relaxed setting as the day moves on. The property sits close enough to Madikeri town for quick access, yet feels aloof, away in a world of its own. Guests wander between venues in their own time, often pausing to soak in the views or carry on conversations as they go.</p><p>What guests often find themselves reminiscing about at this 5-star luxury resort in Madikeri,&nbsp;<strong>Gateway Coorg</strong>, aren’t the big moments, but the quieter ones in between. The view of the valley from the room and that unhurried feeling you settle into without even realising it. The resort simply lets a destination wedding in Karnataka unfold at its own pace against a sweeping hillside backdrop.</p>', '54 rooms with 1 suite', 'Ballrooms', 'Highland Hub, Poolside Lawns', '150', '150', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/T9Nu47WCwVVGLddZ115OpEqxG96u5xG4jSYFDGBc.jpg", "title": "3+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/wyvZ3NicH0CdGHpMPn6DPZMRkTw16irlVVHvADTh.jpg", "title": "Curated forest proposal experiences"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/TNQ8o5kmh7MKvHVE7b4qk9qEgX8mtW4WNJhp2ACJ.jpg", "title": "Fireside artisanal coffee cupping"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/vR1xYwbt0vjeYniIWKVXkI3YSmLP2UabqFOxMiK9.jpg", "title": "Candlelit Kodava dining under stars"}]', '[{"id": 1115, "question": "Which is the nearest airport to Gateway Coorg, and what is the travel time?", "answer": "<p>Kannur International Airport (CNN) is the nearest airport to&nbsp;<strong>Gateway Coorg.&nbsp;</strong>It is around 90–110 km away, with a travel time of approximately 2.5 to 3.5 hours depending on road and traffic conditions.</p>"}, {"id": 1116, "question": "Can guests check in early at Gateway Coorg, and what are the standard times to check-in and check-out?", "answer": "<p>Yes, guests can get an early check-in to the property, but it is subject to hotel availability. The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Gateway Coorg</strong> is 2:00 pm, while guests can check out by 12:00 noon.</p>"}, {"id": 1117, "question": "Are there nearby attractions or activities for international guests staying at Gateway Coorg?", "answer": "<p>Yes, guests at&nbsp;<strong>Gateway Coorg</strong> can explore Abbey Falls, Raja’s Seat, Madikeri Fort, Dubare Elephant Camp, coffee plantations, Nisargadhama and local spice estates. The region also offers scenic nature walks and river experiences, and is considered ideal for relaxed sightseeing and outdoor activities.</p>"}, {"id": 1118, "question": "Does Gateway Coorg provide a bar service for destination weddings?", "answer": "<p><strong>Gateway Coorg&nbsp;</strong>manages all bar and beverage service through its in-house team for destination weddings. Outside alcohol is generally not permitted, and curated drink packages are offered based on your guest list and celebration style.</p>"}]', '93', '55'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'karnataka' AND `slug` = 'gateway-coorg-karnataka');
--> statement-breakpoint
INSERT INTO `hotels` (city, slug, status, seo_title, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, banner_image, name, address, airport_time, station_time, description, room_inventory, indoor_venues, outdoor_venues, guest_capacity, reception_capacity, highlights, faqs, external_hotel_id, total_rooms)
SELECT 'karnataka', 'taj-madikeri-resort-and-spa', 'published', 'Taj Madikeri Resort & Spa Coorg – Reviews, Cost & Venues', 'Taj Madikeri Resort & Spa Coorg is Coorg''s finest wedding destination. Discover exclusive packages, banquet hall options & wedding cost details. Book Now!', 'Taj Madikeri Resort & Spa Coorg wedding, Taj Madikeri Resort & Spa Coorg wedding cost, Taj Madikeri Resort wedding cost, Taj Madikeri Resort wedding, Taj Madikeri Resort & Spa Coorg banquet halls', '/storage/hotel/seo/CsH08X4Ak4ZYjI9bidnxapy0aI6jYuLAuPAJqEtS.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/7N0dqsJAr33W94PsRn1yhPmgtUyh9tpJl5Du4KgR.jpg', 'Taj Madikeri Resort And Spa', '1st Monnangeri, Galibeedu Post, Madikeri, Karnataka 571201, India', '210 Minutes', '180 Minutes', '<p>Clouds drifting past your villa balcony, rainforest trails scented with coffee and cardamom, and wedding celebrations surrounded by nothing but forested valley views. A&nbsp;<strong>wedding at Taj Madikeri Resort &amp; Spa, Coorg</strong> feels wonderfully removed from city life, yet every detail carries the polish of a 5-star luxury hotel property. Spread across 180 acres of rainforest in the hills of Coorg, the resort was thoughtfully designed around the landscape, giving the entire property a calm, deeply immersive character.</p><p>For couples planning an intimate yet lavish destination wedding, this is one of the most sought-after settings&nbsp;<strong>in Coorg</strong>. The elegant Soiree Hall and scenic Poolside Deck together offer nearly 500 sq. metres of event spaces suited for pheras, cocktail evenings and close-knit family functions. Guests arriving from different cities can reach&nbsp;<strong>Taj Madikeri Resort &amp; Spa, Coorg&nbsp;</strong>via Kannur International Airport or Mysore Junction, followed by a scenic mountain drive through Coorg’s misty hills.</p><p>At&nbsp;<strong>Taj Madikeri Resort &amp; Spa, Coorg</strong>, private starlit dining setups, forest-view infinity pools, the award-winning J Wellness Circle spa and spacious villas with fireplaces create the feeling of a secluded luxury retreat. Between celebrations, guests can also explore Abbey Falls, Raja’s Seat and Coorg’s iconic coffee plantations nearby.</p>', '63 rooms with suites', 'Soiree', 'Poolside Deck', '150', '150', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/1iYUAlxI1Tf4Jj9MoYV5etMfewrL0RxNk48VIFi1.jpg", "title": "5+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/E0ZNvfogczI4ESBKifRPGAqSbqFcRHxVRVS2glDW.jpg", "title": "Bespoke starlit dining experiences"}]', '[{"id": 1119, "question": "Which months are most popular for weddings at Taj Madikeri Resort & Spa, Coorg?", "answer": "<p>The most popular months for weddings at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Madikeri Resort &amp; Spa, Coorg</strong> are October to March, when the weather stays pleasant, and the rainforest looks especially lush. Weekend dates during this season are usually booked well in advance.</p>"}, {"id": 1120, "question": "What is the standard time to check-in at Taj Madikeri Resort & Spa, Coorg, and can we check-in early?", "answer": "<p>The standard time to check-in at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Madikeri Resort &amp; Spa, Coorg&nbsp;</strong>is 2:00 pm, and check-out time is 12:00 noon. Yes, an early check-in can be arranged for you at the hotel, but it is entirely subject to the hotel’s discretion.</p>"}, {"id": 1121, "question": "Can guests explore local sights during their stay at Taj Madikeri Resort & Spa, Coorg?", "answer": "<p>Guests staying at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Madikeri Resort &amp; Spa, Coorg</strong>, can explore Abbey Falls, Raja’s Seat, Dubare Elephant Camp, Mandalpatti Viewpoint, Namdroling Monastery and nearby coffee plantations during the wedding celebrations. The scenic drives around Coorg are equally memorable.</p>"}, {"id": 1122, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol to Taj Madikeri Resort & Spa, Coorg?", "answer": "<p>No, guests are generally not allowed to bring their own alcohol for&nbsp;<strong>weddings at Taj Madikeri Resort &amp; Spa, Coorg</strong>. Liquor service is usually managed by the resort’s in-house bar team and billed separately from wedding packages.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '315', '63'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'karnataka' AND `slug` = 'taj-madikeri-resort-and-spa');
--> statement-breakpoint
INSERT INTO `hotels` (city, slug, status, seo_title, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, banner_image, name, address, airport_time, station_time, description, room_inventory, indoor_venues, outdoor_venues, guest_capacity, reception_capacity, highlights, faqs, external_hotel_id, total_rooms)
SELECT 'kasauli', 'fortune-select-forest-hill-mahiya-kasauli', 'published', 'Fortune Select Forest Hill Mahiya Kasauli Wedding Cost', 'Check Fortune Select Forest Hill wedding cost & booking. Plan your destination wedding at Fortune Select Forest Hill Mahiya Kasauli with best packages.', 'fortune select forest hill wedding cost, fortune select forest hill wedding, fortune select forest hill kasauli, fortune select forest hill mahiya kasauli, fortune select forest hill mahiya, fortune select forest hill solan', '/storage/hotel/seo/GgY0oluMhogz8xNrjh5lGLPDv2FIptFdHAvcunyy.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/0aolnqYp66D8JUXxBUuker2oocyCG5Y4YthXv0dU.jpg', 'Fortune Select Forest Hill Mahiya Kasauli', 'Village Mahiya, P.O. Bhojnagar, District Solan, Himachal Pradesh 173229, India, India', '150 Minutes', '90 Minutes', '<p>A&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at Fortune Select Forest Hill, Mahiya,</strong> begins the moment you start driving up from Shimla, where the air gets cooler, and the roads start winding through thicker pine cover. It’s tucked into Mahiya, just far enough from the city to feel peaceful, yet still reachable with Shimla Airport about three hours away. The property itself doesn’t feel overdesigned. Sloped roofs, wood and stone finishes and soft earthy tones make it blend into the hills in a very natural way, almost like it has always been there.</p><p>At&nbsp;<strong>Fortune Select Forest Hill, Mahiya,&nbsp;</strong>the wedding venues define the entire ambience. The ballrooms are better suited to smaller, more intimate functions. Wide windows keep the mountain views present even when you’re inside. Outside, Pine-O-Rama and Zodiac lawns spread among the pine trees, making them a natural setting for pheras or evening gatherings that feel more personal.</p><p>What guests usually remember is how smoothly everything is handled in the background. Backed by ITC’s hospitality standards, the food is well-prepared and familiar in the best way, and the team quietly takes care of the details, so multi-day celebrations feel relaxed and well looked after rather than managed.</p>', '75', 'Pinecrest Ballroom, Mulberry Ballroom', 'Pine-O-Rama Lawn, Zodiac Lawn', '150', '190', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/198lt3qX2AAO6fw53ngFBUdtOVtXxDVoEivAuMNm.jpg", "title": "3+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/Ra1x2Xwihe9eAMCUpIgRvcmd8gTdA62sVyup0sbP.jpg", "title": "Personalised Himachali cultural celebrations"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/OwJ3zDBSIHnSjvoVhP9hfyjHx9kvJFmKXXUki9DY.jpg", "title": "Cliffside varmala with valley views"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/dtjcBTNHnBoSQF7FA3klymAKBcmlNahF2yKCEhZi.jpg", "title": "Sundowner cocktail evenings"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/3RfwNEFtXbPcVgdIAGEfzkDpiEud2rZmkg7s20Hq.jpg", "title": "Private starlit dining experiences"}]', '[{"id": 228, "question": "Which is the closest airport to Fortune Select Forest Hill, Mahiya?", "answer": "<p>The closest airport to F<strong>ortune Select Forest Hill, Mahiya</strong> is Shimla Airport (SLV). It is located about 77 km away and takes roughly 2-2.5 hours by road, depending on traffic and weather conditions.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 229, "question": "Are there nearby attractions or activities for international guests staying at Fortune Select Forest Hill, Mahiya?", "answer": "<p>Yes, guests staying at&nbsp;<strong>Fortune Select Forest Hill, Mahiya&nbsp;</strong>can explore Dagshai cantonment, Kasauli Brewery, Gilbert Trail, Manki Point viewpoints and the Timber Trail Ropeway, and ride the Kalka–Shimla Toy Train nearby.</p>"}, {"id": 230, "question": "What is the ideal budget for a 2-night wedding at Fortune Select Forest Hill, Mahiya?", "answer": "<p>The standard cost of a 2-night wedding at Fortune Select Forest Hill, Mahiya, is typically INR 35 lakhs to INR 60 lakhs for approximately 150-200 guests. Refer to Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator to get a final estimate.</p>"}, {"id": 231, "question": "Is an early check-in available at Fortune Select Forest Hill, Mahiya, for wedding guests?", "answer": "<p>Yes, an early check-in request can be arranged at&nbsp;<strong>Fortune Select Forest Hill, Mahiya</strong>, subject to availability. The standard check-in time at the hotel is 2:00 pm, and the check-out time is 11:00 am.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 232, "question": "Does Fortune Select Forest Hill, Mahiya, offer a bar service for destination weddings?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>Fortune Select Forest Hill, Mahiya&nbsp;</strong>does offer in-house bar service for destination weddings. Outside alcohol isn’t permitted, and all beverages are arranged through the hotel and billed based on consumption, separate from standard wedding packages.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '358', '75'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'kasauli' AND `slug` = 'fortune-select-forest-hill-mahiya-kasauli');
