SELECT 'kerala', 'taj-bekal-resort-and-spa-kerala', 'published', 'Taj Bekal Resort & Spa Kerala Wedding Cost & Booking', 'Taj Bekal Resort & Spa Kerala blends backwater beauty with royal elegance. Explore wedding cost, luxury spa packages & tailored wedding experiences. Book!', 'taj bekal wedding cost, taj bekal resort & spa kerala wedding, taj bekal resort & spa kerala wedding cost, taj bekal resort wedding cost', '/storage/hotel/seo/bSaDUgbpHHHrVQs3TwXuG0sreb74OdLNdRb458mu.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/aJCHaN1hmBy59slr0UFee2CxMVxh43nuGc82cqYs.jpg', 'Taj Bekal Resort And Spa Kerala', 'Kappil Beach, Bekal, Kasaragod District, Kerala – 671319, India, India', '90 minutes', '25 Minutes', '<p>Set between the Kappil River and the Arabian Sea,&nbsp;<strong>Taj Bekal Resort &amp; Spa, Kerala</strong> moves at an easy, unhurried pace with backwaters, palms and sea breeze blending into the surroundings. Spread across 26 acres, it was once a coconut plantation and still holds on to that grounded, natural character. For a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Kerala</strong>, it offers a calm coastal setting where celebrations feel personal and relaxed.</p><p>The design takes cues from Kerala’s Kettuvallam houseboats, and you notice it in the sloping bamboo-style roofs, laterite stone walls and carved wooden details that appear throughout the property. Nothing feels overly polished in a corporate sense; instead, it leans into texture, craft and warmth. Even the interiors, with their silk murals and quiet marble finishes, feel more like a well-loved home than a hotel.</p><p><strong>Weddings at Taj Bekal Resort &amp; Spa</strong> move easily between spaces, from open lawns near the water to the Soiree Hall for more intimate gatherings. Add in river views, soft coastal light and villas that open into private sit-outs, and a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at Taj Bekal Resort &amp; Spa, Kerala</strong> starts to feel less like a venue choice and more like a feeling you step into.</p>', '77', 'Soiree Hall', 'Poolside Lawn, Activity Lawn, By The Bay Lawn', '150', '200', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/gobfPd1ugAIP7p6AHzJQb4U6tIKYNTumqeUtYQAn.jpg", "title": "4+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/eyJ144kfYcn1FmPw6OwMow3ZXS63UDsldA68U4ve.jpg", "title": "Intimate courtyard candlelit dining"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/S01eyGNdDNURn3NMUHf6opOVMdfwb1BYO6XIXKt9.jpg", "title": "Gourmet backwater rafting dining journey"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/MAVcUDgHA9uUATVMxAYVUXCgAqW6hWdgoy4XAcAV.jpg", "title": "Floating breakfast served in the room"}]', '[{"id": 716, "question": "How to reach Taj Bekal Resort & Spa, Kerala from the nearest airport?", "answer": "<p>The&nbsp;<strong>Taj Bekal Resort &amp; Spa, Kerala,&nbsp;</strong>is about 70-75 km from Mangalore International Airport. It takes around 1.5-2.5 hours by taxi via NH66.</p>"}, {"id": 717, "question": "Is an early check-in available at Taj Bekal Resort & Spa, Kerala?", "answer": "<p>Yes, an early check-in request can be accommodated, subject to hotel availability. The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Bekal Resort &amp; Spa, Kerala,</strong> is 2:00 pm, and guests can check out by 12:00 noon.</p>"}, {"id": 718, "question": "Can I host a pre-wedding photoshoot at Taj Bekal Resort & Spa, Kerala?", "answer": "<p>Yes, pre-wedding photoshoots are allowed at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Bekal Resort &amp; Spa, Kerala,</strong> subject to prior permission and applicable resort charges.</p>"}, {"id": 719, "question": "What is the ideal budget for a 2-night wedding at Taj Bekal Resort & Spa, Kerala?", "answer": "<p>The standard cost of a destination wedding at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Bekal Resort &amp; Spa, Kerala,</strong> for a 3-day, 2-night celebration ranges between INR 60 lakhs and INR 90 lakhs. To get an accurate quote within seconds, enter your guest count and room details in Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator.</p>"}, {"id": 720, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol to Taj Bekal Resort & Spa, Kerala, for a destination wedding?", "answer": "<p>No, outside alcohol is not permitted at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Bekal Resort &amp; Spa, Kerala</strong>. All beverages for destination weddings are served through the in-house bar and billed separately based on consumption.</p>"}]', '374', '77'
