SELECT 'kerala', 'taj-kumarakom-resort-and-spa-kerala', 'published', 'Taj Kumarakom Resort & Spa Kerala Wedding Cost & Booking', 'Plan your backwater wedding at Taj Kumarakom Resort & Spa Kerala. Check wedding cost, venues & exclusive packages for your dream destination day. Book!', 'taj kumarakom resort & spa kerala, taj kumarakom resort & spa kerala wedding cost, taj kumarakom resort & spa kerala wedding', '/storage/hotel/seo/7wGJrXmiTmWT0cir1ZaBgYeZgGB3d7Q1k8xc8isn.png', '/storage/hotels/banners/KIpQ0hRETe3POdUblgma06engBb9Ot9DqPFjfCRE.jpg', 'Taj Kumarakom Resort And Spa Kerala', 'No. 1/404, Main Road, Kavanattinkara, Kumarakom, Kerala 686563, India', '150 Minutes', '30 Minutes', '<p>A&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at Taj Kumarakom Resort &amp; Spa, Kerala,&nbsp;</strong>feels quietly intimate from the moment you arrive. Set along the banks of Vembanad Lake, the resort is surrounded by paddy fields, still waters and trees that move gently with the breeze. What was once an 1881 colonial bungalow now sits within a small, thoughtfully kept estate with just 28 villas and cottages, which naturally keeps weddings here more personal than grand.</p><p>For a<strong> destination wedding in Kerala,</strong> this resort works well for intimate celebrations rather than large-scale events. The resort’s architecture reflects Kerala’s traditional style in a simple, grounded way, paired with excellent service that keeps the wedding festivities running smoothly. Connectivity to Kochi Airport is easy, and guests get to indulge in backwater cruises and village walks between events.</p><p>The stay at<strong> Taj Kumarakom Resort &amp; Spa</strong> feels easy and comfortable for both Indian and regional guests, with Taj’s warm hospitality keeping everything in place. Weddings here feel deeply intimate, with the backwaters adding a calm backdrop to each celebration.</p>', '28', 'Baker’s Bungalow, Waterside Cafe', 'Lake Bed Venue, Wedding Lawn', '100', '100', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/uS6HeTM5dWwAJ3eQU0N2jYX6DnHMyO9fKsFjOLDo.jpg", "title": "3+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/aYQoKLbwjFawwG4ZL41j0iLdB3kjpzZjItXTRp4R.jpg", "title": "Private moonlit waterfront dining experiences"}]', '[{"id": 366, "question": "What is the wedding cost at Taj Kumarakom Resort & Spa, Kerala?", "answer": "<p>The cost of a destination wedding at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Kumarakom Resort &amp; Spa, Kerala,</strong> falls within the range of INR 60 lakhs to INR 90 lakhs for a 3-day, 2-night celebration. Get an accurate quote instantly based on your logistical requirements by entering all details in Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 367, "question": "What is the standard check-in and check-out time at Taj Kumarakom Resort & Spa, Kerala?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Kumarakom Resort &amp; Spa, Kerala,&nbsp;</strong>is 2:00 pm, and check-out time is at 12:00 noon.</p>"}, {"id": 368, "question": "When is peak season for a destination wedding at Taj Kumarakom Resort & Spa, Kerala?", "answer": "<p>November to February is the perfect time to host a wedding at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Kumarakom Resort &amp; Spa in Kerala,&nbsp;</strong>with pleasant weather that is ideal for outdoor ceremonies and backwater settings.</p>"}, {"id": 369, "question": "How to reach Taj Kumarakom Resort & Spa, Kerala?", "answer": "<p>Cochin International Airport (COK) is about 70-75 km from Taj Kumarakom Resort &amp; Spa. The drive usually takes 1.5 to 2.5 hours. Transfers can be arranged easily.</p>"}, {"id": 370, "question": "Does Taj Kumarakom Resort & Spa, Kerala, provide a bar service for weddings?", "answer": "<p>Outside alcohol isn’t allowed at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Kumarakom Resort &amp; Spa, Kerala</strong>. All beverages are arranged by the hotel and billed separately based on consumption, as they are not part of standard wedding packages.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '87', '28'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'kerala' AND `slug` = 'taj-kumarakom-resort-and-spa-kerala');
