SELECT 'kerala', 'taj-wayanad-resort-and-spa-kerala', 'published', 'Taj Wayanad Resort & Spa – Wedding Cost & Booking Guide', 'Taj Wayanad Resort & Spa Kerala is the ultimate romantic wedding destination. Explore bespoke packages, transparent pricing & hassle-free booking options.', 'taj wayanad resort & spa kerala wedding, taj wayanad resort & spa kerala wedding cost, taj hotel wayanad booking, taj wayanad resort & spa kerala booking, taj hotel wayanad', '/storage/hotel/seo/b9W26esuH86azxge8MahjvWp8MxPEVr4SbvMJuQo.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/YJ9Ami1W7wDRjZXBp9F5PSQkSJxLisymsw25mZNd.jpg', 'Taj Wayanad Resort And Spa kerala', 'Kunnampetta, Kalpetta, Wayanad, Kerala 673122, India', '15018', '180 Minutes', '<p>When the lake meets the hills, celebrations naturally slow down, and that is exactly the mood at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Wayanad Resort &amp; Spa, Kerala</strong>. Recently opened in 2022, this 10-acre lakeside retreat sits above the Banasura Sagar reservoir, where mist, water and forest create a setting that feels almost untouched. Built with earthy Kerala architecture using stone, timber and bamboo,&nbsp;<strong>Taj Hotel, Wayanad&nbsp;</strong>brings a calm, nature-first ambience that shifts beautifully from bright open mornings to quiet, mist-covered evenings.</p><p>What makes gatherings feel special at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Wayanad Resort &amp; Spa</strong> is how naturally the landscape becomes part of every function. The resort is spread across cascading levels, so events move through lawns, villas and open viewpoints without feeling forced or crowded. The indoor banquet space, around 300+ sq. metres, works well for ceremonies that need structure, while still staying visually connected to the outdoors. At&nbsp;<strong>Taj Hotel, Wayanad</strong>, even small moments feel framed by water and greenery.</p><p>Located about 2.5 hours from Calicut International Airport,&nbsp;<strong>Taj Wayanad Resort &amp; Spa, Kerala,&nbsp;</strong>is reached via winding hill roads. Inside this 5-star luxury resort property, guests have access to infinity pools, lakeside walkways, wellness spaces and viewpoints that support both relaxation and wedding events.</p>', '61 keys, 5 pool villas and 43 waterfront cottages', 'Ballroom', 'Amphitheatre and Yoga Pavilion', '250', '250', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/7It4XN3l06gVsAnwvcQn1wdrNY8zSP20EwMEeJUg.jpg", "title": "4+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/feG95woEJydoaKmhdXqC7h6niXPjTfqvISx1ATiu.jpg", "title": "Personalised candlelit chef-led dining moments"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/HAdaGAvjXvwMJA0jHECdmilbFt00usHmGByoa21O.jpg", "title": "Private villa stargazing dining"}]', '[{"id": 867, "question": "What is the ideal cost of a 2-night wedding at Taj Wayanad Resort & Spa, Kerala?", "answer": "<p>On average, the&nbsp;<strong>Taj Wayanad Resort &amp; Spa, Kerala,</strong>&nbsp;<strong>wedding cost&nbsp;</strong>ranges between INR 65 lakhs and INR 1.1 Cr for a 200-person guest list. Get an accurate quote based on your guest count and other logistical requirements by entering all details into Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator.</p>"}, {"id": 868, "question": "Can guests get an early check-in to Taj Wayanad Resort & Spa, Kerala?", "answer": "<p>Yes, guests can get an early check-in to the property; accommodation is subject to hotel availability. The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Wayanad Resort &amp; Spa&nbsp;</strong>is 2:00 pm, and guests can check out by 12:00 noon.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 869, "question": "Can we bring our own wedding planner to the Taj Hotel, Wayanad?", "answer": "<p>Yes, the&nbsp;<strong>Taj Hotel in Wayanad</strong> usually allows you to bring your own wedding coordinator. Although the hotel team works well with outside planners, management or Viraaya Weddings should check final vendor permissions.</p>"}, {"id": 870, "question": "Can photographers use hotel spaces before the wedding day at the Taj Hotel, Wayanad?", "answer": "<p>Yes, photographers can use select spaces at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Wayanad Resort &amp; Spa, Kerala,</strong> for pre-wedding shoots. Permissions, timing and any applicable charges depend on hotel approval and availability, so it’s best to confirm in advance with the team or Viraaya Weddings.</p>"}, {"id": 871, "question": "What is the standard liquor policy at Taj Wayanad Resort & Spa, Kerala?", "answer": "<p>At&nbsp;<strong>Taj Wayanad Resort &amp; Spa</strong>, alcohol for weddings is served through the hotel’s in-house bar service. Outside liquor is generally not permitted, and all beverages are billed based on actual consumption.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '317', '61'
