SELECT 'khimsar', 'welcomhotel-by-itc-hotels-fort-and-dunes-khimsar', 'published', 'WelcomHotel Khimsar Fort & Dunes - Weddings Cost & Bookings', 'Experience a royal desert wedding at WelcomHotel Khimsar Fort & Dunes. Discover premium packages, wedding costs & seamless booking for an iconic event. Book Now', 'khimsar fort and dunes hotel wedding cost, khimsar fort and dunes hotel, khimsar fort and dunes, welcomhotel khimsar fort and dunes', '/storage/hotel/seo/CMACk0jptNkxmo73tOT3O2tR27nwoIwqeCKzhBig.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/HJWdIAGRmvAW3mlp0NB7xISdwiQXAJhbRyz5x4sD.jpg', 'Welcomhotel By ITC Hotels Fort And Dunes Khimsar', 'P.O, Kheenvsar, Rajasthan 341025, India', '120 Minutes', '60 Minutes', '<p>Standing proudly amid the Marwar desert,&nbsp;<strong>Khimsar Fort</strong> is a 500-year-old, authentic palace that represents the grandeur of Rajasthan. This palace-turned-hotel, constructed by Rao Karamsiji in 1523, features grand walls and courtyards that are well-known examples of Marwari architecture.</p><p>The wedding venues at&nbsp;<strong>Khimsar Fort in Rajasthan</strong> are a great way to honour the city''s long history and natural beauty. The wide, open lawns and well-kept gardens are ideal for evening pheras under the stars, and the heritage halls are perfect for small gatherings. Sunsets over the dunes cast a golden glow, making every party feel special and memorable.</p><p>Hospitality at Khimsar Fort focuses on comfort and care. Tailored menus, luxurious rooms and suites and 24-hour butler service ensure national and international guests are looked after throughout their stay. With its beautiful desert landscapes and thoughtful service, Khimsar Fort creates a perfect getaway for a destination wedding in Rajasthan.</p>', '71 rooms with suites', 'Rang Mahal, Inner Courtyard,', 'Outer Courtyard, Open Lawns', '200', '200', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/78T2FMtaYsN03JuUm8PCQkXR8N8LJYujmSNQToho.jpg", "title": "9+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/RMiK9LeGnjrJSBgUoWo36zmW86kLsUVwrPFNWGWn.jpg", "title": "Desert dune stays with camel safaris"}]', '[{"id": 1278, "question": "How much does a destination wedding at Khimsar Fort cost?", "answer": "<p>On average,&nbsp;<strong>Khimsar Fort weddings cost&nbsp;</strong>between INR 40 lakhs and INR 70 lakhs. However, if you wish to host an ultra-luxury wedding at the property, the budget can reach INR 1.25 Cr for a 3-day, 2-night celebration. Refer to Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator to get an instant quote within seconds. Just enter your preferred dates of stay, total number of rooms required, total residential guest capacity and other necessary details to get an exact estimate on your wedding budget.</p>"}, {"id": 1279, "question": "Which is the nearest airport to the Khimsar Fort, and how can I reach the hotel?", "answer": "<p>The nearest airport to the Khimsar Fort Hotel is the Jodhpur Airport. This airport is located approximately 90 to 95 kilometres away from the fort, and it can take you around 1.5 to 2 hours, if you are travelling by car. Pre-booking a private transfer to reach the hotel is recommended.</p>"}, {"id": 1280, "question": "When was the Khimsar Fort built?", "answer": "<p>Khimsar Fort in Nagaur, Rajasthan, is a 500-year-old fort that was built by Rao Karamsiji in 1523. This authentic palace is highly valued for its heritage setting and is one of the many reasons why couples choose this fort as the venue for their destination wedding in Rajasthan.</p>"}, {"id": 1281, "question": "What are the check-in and check-out times at Khimsar Fort Hotel, and can guests check-in early?", "answer": "<p>As per the hotel policy, the standard check-in time at Khimsar Fort is 2:00 pm, and check-out is usually by 11:00 am. If guests need an early check-in or a late check-out, they can request it at the hotel, subject to availability.</p>"}, {"id": 1282, "question": "What is the Khimsar Fort’s liquor policy?", "answer": "<p>Alcohol is served at Khimsar Fort through the hotel bar exclusively. Guests are not allowed to carry outside liquor onto the property premises. All beverages and drinks are usually billed separately and are not a part of the standard wedding package offered by the Khimsar Fort.</p>"}]', '385', '71'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'khimsar' AND `slug` = 'welcomhotel-by-itc-hotels-fort-and-dunes-khimsar');
