SELECT 'kolkata', 'novotel-kolkata-hotel-and-residences', 'published', 'Novotel Kolkata - Reviews, Wedding Cost & Direct Booking', 'Novotel Kolkata Hotel & Residences offers premium event spaces & personalised wedding packages. Check costs, read reviews & book your special day today!', 'novotel kolkata wedding cost, novotel kolkata wedding, novotel kolkata booking, novotel kolkata, novotel hotel kolkata, novotel kolkata review', '/storage/hotel/seo/qr4Hj7aI14JI5PlM1XwPxRPoYCDI8oni1892oa28.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/dgCq8TXVC85ylB5LtYWHAqjrYDEazuIeb0SJ0ByH.jpg', 'Novotel Kolkata Hotel And Residences', 'CF 11, Action Area 1C, New Town, Kolkata 700156, India', '30 minutes', '25 Minutes', '<p>Glass-lined architecture, soaring atriums and bright contemporary spaces give&nbsp;<strong>Novotel Kolkata Hotel &amp; Residences</strong> the feeling of a modern city celebration hub designed for large, lively weddings. Located in New Town’s fast-growing Rajarhat district, this 5-star luxury hotel places guests close to Eco Park, Biswa Bangla Gate and Kolkata’s buzzing cultural scene while offering seamless airport connectivity for travelling families and international guests. For couples planning a&nbsp;<strong>wedding at Novotel Kolkata Hotel &amp; Residences</strong> or a grand&nbsp;<strong>wedding in Kolkata</strong>, the property balances cosmopolitan energy with warm hospitality in a way that feels welcoming from the very first arrival.</p><p>Step further inside&nbsp;<strong>Novotel Kolkata Hotel &amp; Residences</strong> and the atmosphere shifts into something social, vibrant and celebration-ready. The Eiffel Ballroom spans over 500 sq metres of pillarless event space, while the rooftop terrace, pool deck and Le Garden Lawn add open-air charm for pheras and evening celebrations. The hotel’s 340 rooms, suites and serviced residences also make extended wedding stays comfortable for families travelling together.</p><p>What guests often remember about&nbsp;<strong>Novotel Kolkata Hotel &amp; Residences</strong> is that the celebrations never feel limited to the venue alone. One moment you find yourself relishing Bengali meals with your family at The Square, and the next, heading out for a relaxing outing to Eco Park or one of the city’s energetic cultural corners.</p>', '340 rooms with suites', 'The Eiffel, The Pierre', 'Rooftop Terrace, Pool Deck, Le Garden Lawn', '700', '700', '[{"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal02.png", "title": "3+ dining venues onsite"}, {"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal03.png", "title": "Traditional Bengali feast in brassware"}, {"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal04.png", "title": "Candlelit rooftop cabana dining nights"}]', '[{"id": 1128, "question": "When is the peak wedding season at Novotel Kolkata Hotel & Residences?", "answer": "<p>The peak wedding season at&nbsp;<strong>Novotel Kolkata Hotel &amp; Residences</strong> usually runs from November to February. April and May also remain popular around favourable Bengali wedding dates and Muhurat periods.</p>"}, {"id": 1129, "question": "What are the standard check-in and check-out times at Novotel Kolkata Hotel & Residences, and is early check-in available?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Novotel Kolkata Hotel &amp; Residences</strong> is 3:00 pm, while check-out is by 12:00 noon. An early check-in to the hotel can be arranged; however, it is subject to availability.</p>"}, {"id": 1130, "question": "Are engagement shoots allowed at Novotel Kolkata Hotel & Residences?", "answer": "<p>Yes, engagement and pre-wedding shoots are allowed at&nbsp;<strong>Novotel Kolkata Hotel &amp; Residences</strong>, with prior permission. Access to venues, photography spaces and charges depend on the hotel’s event policies.</p>"}, {"id": 1131, "question": "Is outside catering allowed at Novotel Kolkata Hotel & Residences?", "answer": "<p><strong>Novotel Kolkata Hotel &amp; Residences</strong> usually prefers hosting weddings with its own in-house catering services. Couples can connect with the hotel team for any customised dining requirements or special requests.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 1132, "question": "What is the standard liquor policy at Novotel Kolkata Hotel & Residences for weddings?", "answer": "<p><strong>Novotel Kolkata Hotel &amp; Residences&nbsp;</strong>serves alcohol exclusively through its in-house bar services. Outside liquor is not allowed inside the property, and beverage selections are usually charged separately from standard wedding packages.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '318', '340'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'kolkata' AND `slug` = 'novotel-kolkata-hotel-and-residences');
