SELECT 'kolkata', 'taj-bengal-kolkata', 'published', 'Taj Bengal Kolkata Grand Wedding Cost & Banquet Hall Pricing', 'Explore Taj Bengal Kolkata wedding cost, banquet hall details, booking info, luxury venues, premium stays, catering, décor & elegant wedding experiences.', 'taj bengal kolkata wedding cost cost​, taj bengal kolkata wedding cost, taj bengal hotel kolkata​, taj bengal kolkata price, taj bengal kolkata buffet price​, taj bengal kolkata restaurants, taj bengal kolkata booking', '/storage/hotel/seo/bB1K3oGecXWJIPqHxNRlnLsD2bOdlo9x98tFoKV6.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/15cVdKICmakQrb5njAN0RQ3J8yDfBPG2MinO1XMQ.jpg', 'Taj Bengal Kolkata', 'No. 34-B, Belvedere Rd, near ALIPORE ZOO, Alipore, Kolkata, West Bengal 700027, India', '45 Minutes', '30 Minutes', '<p>On Belvedere Road in Alipore,<strong> Taj Bengal</strong> sits within walking distance of the Victoria Memorial and the National Library. The hotel was designed by the celebrated architect Bob Fox, whose vision is evident in the dramatic five-storey marble-and-stone atrium. Two credentials set it apart from every other luxury hotel in the city: it is powered entirely by 100% renewable energy, and it is home to The Chambers, India''s Premier Business Club.&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Taj Bengal''s</strong> event spaces are as varied as they are striking. The Crystal Hall is the hotel''s pillarless grand ballroom that can hold up to 800 guests in a reception setup, making it the centrepiece for pheras and receptions. The Terrace Garden, at 10,000 sq ft and framed by a signature curved wall with a terracotta roof canopy, handles outdoor gatherings of up to 1,200 guests and is one of the finest garden wedding venues in Kolkata. The Taj Timeless Weddings programme ensures dedicated planning support for every function throughout the multi-day celebration, backed by the legendary service that the hotel has upheld since it first opened its doors.</p>', '224 rooms with suites', 'Crystal Hall, Mandarin, Portico, Kanchenjunga Room', 'Terrace Garden, Banquet Lawns, The Poolside', '450', '450', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/yI2VnzufpJjQ1fJ6zGKCXvH1LqDRA9QykYcOlVxE.jpg", "title": "7 dining and bar destinations"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/wNzZFlLoXsAQ5SeNHvNPkUNmNet5CwJWprlv1ars.jpg", "title": "Dedicated specialists for décor, catering, photography and guest coordination"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/LBltyMqJstS1MDYRDA94A4zihcv8lt5Tgpg4fyWp.jpg", "title": "Private poolside dinner"}]', '[{"id": 832, "question": "What are the check-in and check-out timings at Taj Bengal, Kolkata, and are there early check-in or late check-out options for wedding guests?", "answer": "<p>Standard check-in at Taj Bengal, Kolkata is at 2:00 PM, and check-out is at 12:00 noon. Guests requiring early check-in or late check-out are requested to inform the hotel in advance, as availability on the day will determine whether the request can be accommodated.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 833, "question": "How far in advance should I book Taj Bengal in Kolkata for wedding events?", "answer": "<p>For weddings at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Bengal, Kolkata</strong>, it is highly recommended to book 6 to 12 months in advance, especially for peak season (October to February).</p>"}, {"id": 834, "question": "How far is Taj Bengal, Kolkata, from the airport, and can the hotel arrange transfers?", "answer": "<p>Taj Bengal, Kolkata, is located approximately 60 minutes (around 23 kilometres) by road from Netaji Subhas Chandra Bose International Airport, depending on traffic conditions. The hotel can arrange airport pick-up and drop-off services on request.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 835, "question": "What are some of the best places for wedding guests to explore near Taj Bengal, Kolkata?", "answer": "<p><strong>Taj Bengal, Kolkata''s</strong> Alipore location, places guests within easy reach of some of the city''s most iconic landmarks. The grand Victoria Memorial is a short drive away, as are Howrah Bridge, the Indian Museum (one of the oldest in Asia) and the Dakshineswar Kali Temple.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 836, "question": "What is the official liquor policy at Taj Bengal, Kolkata, for wedding events?", "answer": "<p><strong>Taj Bengal, Kolkata,</strong> operates a licensed in-house bar and beverage services, and all alcohol served at weddings or private events on the premises must be sourced through the hotel. Outside alcohol is not permitted. These drinks will be billed separately from food and venue charges.</p>"}]', '278', '224'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'kolkata' AND `slug` = 'taj-bengal-kolkata');
