SELECT 'kovalam', 'the-leela-kovalam-a-raviz-hotel', 'published', 'The Leela Raviz Kovalam Wedding Cost & Venue Booking', 'Get married with the Arabian Sea as your backdrop! Explore The Leela Raviz Kovalam wedding cost, beachfront venues & exclusive packages. Book your date!', 'the leela raviz kovalam wedding cost, the leela raviz kovalam wedding, the leela raviz kovalam booking, the leela raviz kovalam', '/storage/hotel/seo/DGCoD1LWMLALCvIm0CdtIFKcAxiMljpAtcySwwvJ.png', '/storage/hotels/banners/Ujo4BXJiVmLxLYkm5tT3kK8jquYF70HKGq4zhhxF.jpg', 'The Leela Kovalam A Raviz Hotel', 'Beach Rd, Kovalam, Thiruvananthapuram, Kerala 695527, India', '30 Minutes', '40 Minutes', '<p>A destination wedding at The Leela Kovalam, a Raviz Hotel, feels rooted in its setting more than anything else. Sitting on a cliff above the Arabian Sea, the resort stretches across 67 acres where sea views, old-world architecture and open lawns sit naturally together. The presence of the Halcyon Castle within the property adds a quiet sense of history without taking away from the coastal openness. Trivandrum airport is around 20 to 30 minutes away, which keeps arrivals fairly smooth for guests coming in from different places.</p><p>Weddings here move across different spaces in a very natural way. A large gathering on the lawn, a dinner in the ballroom, or a smaller moment by the edge of the sea all feel part of the same experience rather than separate setups. Nothing feels overly staged, which is really what makes it work.</p><p>Guests usually settle into sea-facing rooms and spend time moving between the pool, dining areas and functions at their own pace. It feels open, unforced and shaped by the coastline rather than just the event plan.</p>', '188', 'Convention Centre, Grand Ballrooms', 'Beachfront Venues, Pandal', '380', '400', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/mxFEzjeXDGyu6Utww8vWmJhsaZVMMusWWsqnhurs.jpg", "title": "6+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/itv52czg3huEs0O2B2bjhf02LaXJQg2FnZjAm1FO.jpg", "title": "Romantic couples’ sunset beach walks"}]', '[{"id": 381, "question": "What is the wedding cost at The Leela Kovalam, a Raviz Hotel?", "answer": "<p>Usually, the average cost of a destination wedding at&nbsp;<strong>The Leela Kovalam, a Raviz Hotel,</strong> ranges from INR 75 to INR 1.2 Cr for a 3-day, 2-night celebration. To get an accurate estimate as per your requirements, refer to Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator and get a precise quote within seconds.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 382, "question": "What is the check-in time at The Leela Kovalam, a Raviz Hotel, and is an early check-in available?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>The Leela Kovalam, a Raviz Hotel,</strong> is 2:00 pm, and check-out time is at 12:00 noon. Early check-in can be accommodated by the hotel, but is subject to availability.</p>"}, {"id": 383, "question": "Are there nearby attractions or activities for international guests around The Leela Kovalam, a Raviz Hotel?", "answer": "<p>Yes, guests can easily explore Kovalam Lighthouse, Vizhinjam Cave Temple and Poovar backwaters nearby. Scuba diving, surfing and catamaran rides are also popular activities to indulge in around the hotel.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 384, "question": "Should I choose The Leela Kovalam, a Raviz Hotel, or Taj Kumarakom Resort & Spa, Kerala for my wedding?", "answer": "<p>The Leela Kovalam suits larger, luxury weddings (INR 38-75 lakhs) with 188 rooms and easy access from Thiruvananthapuram International Airport (20-30 mins). Taj Kumarakom is ideal for intimate weddings (INR 8-12 lakhs) with just 28 villas and a serene backwater setting, about 1.5–2.5 hours from Cochin International Airport.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 385, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol to The Leela Kovalam, a Raviz Hotel?", "answer": "<p>No, bringing alcohol from outside the property is not permitted at&nbsp;<strong>The Leela Kovalam, a Raviz Hotel.</strong> All beverages are charged per consumption, as they are not usually included in the standard wedding package.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '86', '188'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'kovalam' AND `slug` = 'the-leela-kovalam-a-raviz-hotel');
