SELECT 'lucknow', 'hyatt-regency-lucknow', 'published', 'Hyatt Regency Lucknow Wedding Cost & Hotel Booking', 'Check Hyatt Regency Lucknow wedding cost, booking & price options. Plan your destination wedding at Hyatt Regency Lucknow with best packages & reviews.', 'hyatt regency lucknow wedding cost, hyatt regency lucknow wedding, hyatt regency lucknow booking, hyatt regency lucknow price', '/storage/hotel/seo/WZzimnKvb9iV8BvX6zhWRSiAXPjcXcgO2kBw0ckH.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/DsyYA2Ak0Fozog334Bz5Y1bdpQnnz4LJlizN0QWw.jpg', 'Hyatt Regency Lucknow', 'Regency Rd, Vibhuti Khand, Gomti Nagar, Lucknow, Uttar Pradesh 226010, India', '35 Minutes', '15 Minutes', '<p>Located in the budding business district of Gomti Nagar,&nbsp;<strong>Hyatt Regency Lucknow&nbsp;</strong>is the perfect place for city stays and large gatherings. The hotel sits close to important commercial hubs and is a short drive from Chaudhary Charan Singh International Airport, making it convenient for guests travelling in for celebrations. Its modern layout and elegant interiors create an ambience that is suited to formal events while still offering easy access to Lucknow’s cultural landmarks and shopping areas.</p><p><strong>Hyatt Regency Lucknow</strong> has ample room to host every function under one roof, with 18,000 sq. ft. of event space. The pillarless Regency Ballroom spans 4,200 sq. ft. and comes with a dedicated 1,885 sq. ft. pre-function area and a separate entrance. It also opens directly onto a landscaped lawn, so a ceremony and a cocktail evening can follow each other without a break in flow. A banqueting floor houses seven breakout halls for smaller functions such as mehndi or family dinners, and the manicured lawns span 8,500 sq. ft. for larger outdoor gatherings.&nbsp;</p>', 'Na', 'Regency Ballroom, Salon I, Salon II', 'Regency Lawns', '450', '450', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/bSVTJeZrLjSUZXbpV0vqe7bu4AuHj73nNw1rz9bA.jpg", "title": "5 global cuisine restaurants and bars"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/ZFYrLK60LJCa3JeWBcThKCBwPRbXrJCF2zroGCTX.jpg", "title": "Authentic Lucknowi catering"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/B7Oi5kPnfrsGvImf7e2bmNJfe0ldBDpK0jd6732l.jpg", "title": "Themed decorations and stage setups for pre-wedding events"}]', '[{"id": 243, "question": "What is the nearest airport to Hyatt Regency Lucknow?", "answer": "<p>The nearest airport to the&nbsp;<strong>Hyatt Regency Lucknow&nbsp;</strong>is Chaudhary Charan Singh International Airport (LKO). It is approximately 25 kilometres away, usually a 20-30 minute drive from the hotel.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 244, "question": "Are drones or fireworks allowed at the Hyatt Regency Lucknow?", "answer": "<p><strong>Hyatt Regency Lucknow&nbsp;</strong>prohibits fireworks and firecrackers. Drone usage is strictly regulated and requires prior management approval or coordination through the hotel’s own authorised panel of vendors.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 245, "question": "Is outside catering allowed at the Hyatt Regency Lucknow?", "answer": "<p><strong>Hyatt Regency Lucknow</strong> generally provides all food and beverages in-house to ensure quality. We recommend confirming current policies directly with hotel management.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 246, "question": "What are the official check-in and check-out timings at the Hyatt Regency Lucknow? Are there any late check-in or check-out privileges available for wedding couples?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in and check-out timings at the Hyatt Regency Lucknow are 2:00 PM and 12:00 noon, respectively. Wedding couples can request late check-out or early check-in, which are usually granted based on availability or Hyatt membership status.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 247, "question": "What is the official liquor policy of the Hyatt Regency Lucknow?", "answer": "<p>The&nbsp;<strong>Hyatt Regency Lucknow&nbsp;</strong>allows in-house alcohol consumption, as long as all the drinks and cocktails for wedding events are purchased from the hotel’s in-house restaurants and bars. These are billed separately and not included in your standard wedding package.&nbsp;</p>"}]', '379', '206'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'lucknow' AND `slug` = 'hyatt-regency-lucknow');
