SELECT 'lucknow', 'novotel-lucknow-gomti-nagar', 'published', 'Novotel Lucknow Gomti Nagar - Wedding Costs, Banquets & Stay', 'Novotel Lucknow Gomti Nagar offers world-class banquet spaces & tailored wedding packages. Check pricing, hall capacity & easy booking options. Book Now!', 'novotel lucknow wedding, novotel lucknow booking, novotel lucknow gomti nagar​ banquet, novotel lucknow gomti nagar​ review, novotel lucknow gomti nagar​ wedding, novotel lucknow gomti nagar​ wedding cost', '/storage/hotel/seo/CKR00UMLkGmnSK3RIdaGqAu7DKbbevpLa5JvrMna.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/MIalRuADtzyjNBJwz8kFvY9xXVfLJbhxx1nLDCvc.jpg', 'Novotel Lucknow Gomti Nagar', 'Viraj Khand-4, Viraj Khand, Gomti Nagar, Lucknow, Uttar Pradesh 226010, India', '30 minutes', '30 Minutes', '<p>Lucknow has always celebrated gatherings with a certain warmth and old-world grace, and&nbsp;<strong>a wedding at Novotel Lucknow Gomti Nagar</strong> captures that feeling beautifully in a more modern setting. Located in the heart of Viraj Khand,&nbsp;<strong>Novotel Lucknow Gomti Nagar</strong> combines sleek contemporary design, rooftop social spaces and polished hospitality with the easy charm the city is known for. It feels lively without being overwhelming, making multi-day wedding celebrations feel comfortable, stylish and genuinely enjoyable for guests.</p><p>Celebrations unfold beautifully across&nbsp;<strong>Novotel Lucknow Gomti Nagar</strong>. The pillarless Grand Ballroom spans nearly 2,475 sq. ft, making it ideal for elegant indoor functions, while the rooftop Alfresco Lawn suits cocktail evenings, mehendi brunches and skyline dinners under Gomti Nagar’s city lights. Couples planning a&nbsp;<strong>wedding in Lucknow</strong> also appreciate the hotel’s convenient location near Lucknow Airport, Phoenix Palassio and Ekana Stadium.</p><p>What truly stays with guests after a celebration at&nbsp;<strong>Novotel Lucknow Gomti Nagar</strong> is how enjoyable the wedding weekend feels beyond the functions themselves. The 106 rooms and suites are calm, contemporary and spacious, while venues like The Street Republic and The Deli keep the energy going long after ceremonies end. Between rooftop pool views, café-hopping and nearby Lucknow landmarks, the stay never feels rushed or routine.</p>', '106 rooms with suites', 'The Grand Ballroom, Celebration Hall', 'Alfresco Lawn, Open Terrace', '250', '250', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/aMVv39cy1OX8sdDLlR9GB4nymAwQhOwiRqNhNqj2.jpg", "title": "4+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/9s087yOhmQAMMtZyt7qqacTVO7DEp4KA3KD3590V.jpg", "title": "Skyline rooftop cocktail lounge evenings"}, {"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal04.png", "title": "Infinity pool candlelit dining experiences"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/I3OBHyHRO3nsMO01yDZ5CMPlmGf7dcTkmts6g3DX.jpg", "title": "Private bridal suite preparation spaces"}]', '[{"id": 1022, "question": "Can guests explore local sights during their stay at Novotel Lucknow Gomti Nagar?", "answer": "<p>Guests staying at&nbsp;<strong>Novotel Lucknow Gomti Nagar</strong> often explore Bara Imambara, Rumi Darwaza, Hazratganj, Ambedkar Memorial Park and Janeshwar Mishra Park nearby. Many also spend evenings café-hopping and shopping around Gomti Nagar during the wedding stay.</p>"}, {"id": 1023, "question": "What is the standard check-in and check-out time at Novotel Lucknow Gomti Nagar, and can I get an early check-in?", "answer": "<p>The standard time to check-in to&nbsp;<strong>Novotel Lucknow Gomti Nagar</strong> is 2:00 pm, and check-out time is by 12:00 noon. Guests can request an early check-in to the hotel, but it is entirely subject to the hotel’s discretion.</p>"}, {"id": 1024, "question": "Is outside catering allowed for weddings at Novotel Lucknow Gomti Nagar?", "answer": "<p><strong>Novotel Lucknow Gomti Nagar&nbsp;</strong>usually manages wedding catering through its own in-house culinary team. It is best to confirm any special catering requests directly with the hotel.</p>"}, {"id": 1025, "question": "Can we bring our own wedding planner/decorator to Novotel Lucknow Gomti Nagar?", "answer": "<p>Yes, couples can usually work with their own wedding planners and decorators at&nbsp;<strong>Novotel Lucknow Gomti Nagar.</strong> The hotel team usually coordinates directly with external vendors for approvals and event planning.</p>"}, {"id": 1026, "question": "What is the standard liquor policy at Novotel Lucknow Gomti Nagar for a destination wedding?", "answer": "<p><strong>Novotel Lucknow Gomti Nagar&nbsp;</strong>usually serves alcohol through its own bar service for destination weddings. Outside liquor is generally not permitted, and beverage packages are charged separately from standard wedding packages.</p>"}]', '281', '106'
