SELECT 'lucknow', 'taj-mahal-lucknow', 'published', 'Taj Mahal Lucknow Luxury Wedding Cost, and Venue Packages', 'Discover Taj Mahal Lucknow wedding cost, packages, luxury venue details, guest experiences & grand celebration options. Check availability for your day!', 'taj mahal lucknow wedding cost, taj mahal lucknow wedding, taj mahal lucknow wedding price, taj mahal lucknow wedding packages, taj mahal hotel lucknow, hotel taj mahal lucknow', '/storage/hotel/seo/mGJdYXpLWpKEAiwsIavuSy2cwX3q3wNgmc6EybBB.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/cNTntIRMgPTq1arKUBN3bUeVy7Xs8B6rvC1e6l7B.jpg', 'Taj Mahal Lucknow', 'Gomti Nagar Ext Bypass Rd, near Beena cinema hall, Vipin Khand, Gomti Nagar, Lucknow, Uttar Pradesh 226010, India', '40 Minutes', '25 Minutes', '<p>Lucknow has always had a more graceful way of hosting people, and&nbsp;<strong>Taj Mahal Lucknow</strong> reflects that beautifully through its warm, unhurried style of hospitality. Spread across 25 acres near the Gomti River, the 5-star hotel brings together domed architecture, landscaped gardens and interiors inspired by Lucknow’s chikankari and zardozi craftsmanship. Even though it is a contemporary luxury hotel rather than a historic palace,<strong> Taj Mahal Lucknow&nbsp;</strong>still carries the atmosphere of a classic Nawabi residence.</p><p>For couples planning a&nbsp;<strong>wedding at Taj Mahal Lucknow,</strong> the biggest advantage is the generous scale of the property without it ever feeling impersonal. The hotel was established in 1995 and sits across 25 acres along the Gomti River, giving weddings a rare sense of openness in the middle of the city. Its indoor banquet spaces, including the Crystal Room, span approximately 990 sq. ft. (about 92 sq. metres), making them well-suited for receptions and formal functions, while the vast lawns comfortably support larger celebrations.</p><p>At&nbsp;<strong>Taj Mahal Lucknow, weddings</strong> unfold at a relaxed pace, with little breathing spaces between functions that guests actually get to enjoy. With Awadhi dining and quietly attentive service in the background, everything comes together in a way that feels smooth, easy and genuinely well-paced.</p>', '98 rooms with 10 suites', 'Mehfil Ballroom, The Crystal Room', 'Pool Lawns', '250', '250', '[{"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal02.png", "title": "4+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal03.png", "title": "Romantic barbecue evenings under the stars"}]', '[{"id": 1082, "question": "Are drones, fireworks or baraat allowed at Taj Mahal, Lucknow?", "answer": "<p>Wedding hosts are usually allowed to bring baraat processions at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Mahal, Lucknow</strong>. However, drone usage and fireworks remain subject to local regulations, so it’s best to confirm with the hotel or the Viraaya Weddings team beforehand.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 1083, "question": "What is the standard check-in and check-out time at Taj Mahal, Lucknow, and can guests get an early check-in?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Mahal, Lucknow,</strong> is 2:00 pm, while guests can check out by 12:00 noon. Guests can request an early check-in, but it is subject to the hotel''s availability.</p>"}, {"id": 1084, "question": "What is the ideal budget for a 2-night wedding at Taj Mahal, Lucknow?", "answer": "<p>The standard cost of a<strong> Taj Mahal, Lucknow wedding&nbsp;</strong>for 2-nights and 3-days ranges between INR 45 lakhs and INR 70 lakhs. Use Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator to get a precise quote based on your guest count, total number of days of stay, room requirements and more.</p>"}, {"id": 1085, "question": "Can guests explore local sights during their stay at Taj Mahal, Lucknow?", "answer": "<p>Yes, guests staying at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Mahal Lucknow</strong> can explore nearby highlights like Bara Imambara, Rumi Darwaza, Chota Imambara and Hazratganj. Visitors can also enjoy Awadhi food trails, heritage walks, evening market visits and cultural performances that showcase Lucknow’s old-world charm.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 1086, "question": "Does Taj Mahal, Lucknow, provide a bar service for weddings?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>Taj Mahal, Lucknow,</strong> offers an in-house bar service for weddings. Outside alcohol is usually not allowed inside the property, and all beverages, including liquor, are billed separately based on consumption.</p>"}]', '263', '108'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'lucknow' AND `slug` = 'taj-mahal-lucknow');
