SELECT 'mumbai', 'courtyard-by-marriott-mumbai-international-airport', 'published', 'Courtyard by Marriott Mumbai Wedding Hall: Booking Details', 'Discover Courtyard by Marriott Mumbai International Airport wedding hall details, booking info, guest reviews, luxury stays & event spaces. Contact Us!', 'courtyard by marriott mumbai international airport book online​, courtyard by marriott mumbai international airport booking, courtyard by marriott mumbai wedding, courtyard by marriott mumbai wedding hall', '/storage/hotel/seo/TaifUstcAZasgV1gKPib1T0MzPcUtrJ1op0ODeCs.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/oRZho9suewfD0ScDzeQITYZTKffDl3CZVegMkISI.jpg', 'Courtyard by Marriott Mumbai International Airport', 'CTS 215, Andheri Kurla Road, Andheri East, Mumbai 400059, India', '15 Minutes', '10 minutes', '<p>There is a certain ease to this part of Mumbai where everything feels within reach, yet celebrations still manage to feel private and contained. Set along Andheri-Kurla Road and developed by the Kanakia Group in 2010,&nbsp;<strong>Courtyard by Marriott Mumbai International Airport</strong> brings together glass façades, clean architectural lines and warm contemporary interiors that soften the city’s fast rhythm the moment you step in.</p><p>What makes a&nbsp;<strong>wedding at Courtyard by Marriott Mumbai International Airport</strong> feel so effortless is its location in Andheri East, one of Mumbai’s strongest transit-connected hubs. Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj International Airport is just minutes away, while JB Nagar and Chakala metro stations make movement across the city simple for guests. Nearby attractions like Jio World Drive, Phoenix Marketcity, Powai Lake and Bandra’s dining and cultural spaces are all within easy driving distance.</p><p>Across Amber Halls, Pearl Halls and the poolside spaces, the hotel adapts easily from intimate ceremonies to larger celebrations, hosting around 700+ guests across its event venues. With 340 rooms and suites,&nbsp;<strong>Courtyard by Marriott Mumbai International Airport Hotel&nbsp;</strong>becomes a natural home for wedding guests, while Marriott hospitality ensures every detail, from check-ins to event flow, is handled with quiet precision, even in the middle of Mumbai’s constant pace.</p>', '340 rooms with suites', 'Amber Halls, Pearl Halls, Pre-Function Lobby', 'CYM Lawns, Pool Lawns', '700', '700', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/APBg8jSaBU2C8XWkP7bXIUxuCIE0VM3EYMa9yKvH.jpg", "title": "4+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/gQ2CaBDpg9wiKyX0j4Wxx99IaY2Fxfp8OLQCQCL2.jpg", "title": "Secluded poolside couple lounging"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/ACaJJyKanyYeEG4hOi3ZErnNSWmoYjZtgJ03Tf8T.jpg", "title": "Royal Awadhi fine dining evenings"}]', '[{"id": 887, "question": "Can I host a pre-wedding photoshoot at Courtyard by Marriott Mumbai International Airport?", "answer": "<p>Yes, pre-wedding photoshoots are allowed at Courtyard by Marriott Mumbai International Airport, but you have to take prior permission from the hotel. Additional charges and time restrictions may apply.</p>"}, {"id": 888, "question": "What is the standard check-in and check-out time at Courtyard by Marriott Mumbai International Airport Hotel, and can guests get an early check-in?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Courtyard by Marriott Mumbai International Airport&nbsp;</strong>is 3:00 pm, and guests can check out by 12:00 noon. Guests can request an early check-in, but it is subject to the hotel’s discretion.</p>"}, {"id": 889, "question": "What are the timing restrictions for events/music at Courtyard by Marriott Mumbai International Airport?", "answer": "<p>Event and music timings at&nbsp;<strong>Courtyard by Marriott Mumbai International Airport Hotel&nbsp;</strong>are subject to hotel policies and local Mumbai regulations. Final schedules are confirmed in coordination with the hotel events team and the Viraaya Weddings team.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 890, "question": "Is outside catering allowed at Courtyard by Marriott Mumbai International Airport, Mumbai?", "answer": "<p>Outside catering at&nbsp;<strong>Courtyard by Marriott Mumbai International Airport Hotel</strong> is generally allowed for select requirements and curated setups. It is best confirmed directly with the hotel management for approval and guidelines.</p>"}, {"id": 891, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol to Courtyard by Marriott Mumbai International Airport for weddings?", "answer": "<p>No,&nbsp;<strong>Courtyard by Marriott Mumbai International Airport&nbsp;</strong>does not allow outside alcohol for weddings. All beverages are managed through the hotel’s in-house bar service and billed as per consumption.</p>"}]', '316', '340'
