SELECT 'mumbai', 'fairmont-mumbai', 'published', 'Fairmont Mumbai Wedding Cost & Packages – Book Now!', 'Planning your dream wedding in Mumbai? Fairmont Mumbai delivers stunning venues, clear wedding cost breakdowns & exclusive wedding packages. Check Out Now!', 'fairmont mumbai wedding, fairmont mumbai wedding cost, fairmont mumbai wedding packages, fairmont hotel mumbai, fairmont mumbai photos', '/storage/hotel/seo/RI55b6tlSrytIILDwZwj0VovcTzP81dI8Cqf1SwV.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/J4ySDZYSlnbmDeurXiZTDWAXb7phbDejW8YDvbGt.jpg', 'Fairmont Mumbai', 'T2 C06, CTS No. 1405 (Part), Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj International Airport, Mumbai, Maharashtra – 400099, India, India', '10 Minutes', '45 Minutes', '<p>A&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at Fairmont Mumbai</strong> feels less like a hotel event and more like stepping into a space designed for grandeur. The moment guests arrive, the hotel''s tone shifts to make them feel at ease. Featuring dramatic interiors, tall atriums and a sense of movement that suits big, high-energy celebrations, it doesn’t try to feel quiet or tucked away. Instead, this 5-star luxury property leans into Mumbai’s pace in a way that feels polished and controlled.</p><p>What works well at&nbsp;<strong>Fairmont Mumbai</strong> for a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Mumbai&nbsp;</strong>is how naturally the celebrations fall into place. The ballrooms are known to host large gatherings of up to 650 guests without feeling packed, while the poolside and outdoor spaces are better suited for smaller, more relaxed functions. Moving from a high-energy sangeet to a quieter evening doesn’t feel forced, and guests aren’t left waiting or figuring out where to go next.</p><p>With over 400 rooms, everyone stays together, and that changes the mood of the wedding. Guests aren’t commuting or scattered across the city. Service stays steady even with large groups, and the food holds up across events. It’s built for weddings that are big, social and full of energy, without becoming chaotic.</p>', '446', 'Eon Ballroom, Infinity Ballrooms', 'Samaa Dining, Poolside Areas', '900', '900', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/uKVwb2hYexuR8HUugQiCLXqcw0Ym6xzZKu998cUc.jpg", "title": "5+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/CzhsjXvX1Pz0Ursl8Q0s58Ro8jVwQIfkLfyio8QU.jpg", "title": "Elegant bridal high tea gatherings"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/ZYVLPa6JfT4uxnks3sWjbhwMktZ5Nkhum0ZNvC9o.jpg", "title": "Lantern-lit Mediterranean dining by pool"}]', '[{"id": 591, "question": "Which is the nearest airport to Fairmont Mumbai?", "answer": "<p>The nearest airport to&nbsp;<strong>Fairmont Mumbai</strong> is Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj International Airport (BOM), just 350 metres away, around a quick 4 to 6-minute drive.</p>"}, {"id": 592, "question": "What is the standard check-in time at Fairmont Mumbai, and can guests request an early check-in?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Fairmont Mumbai&nbsp;</strong>is 3:00 pm, and guests can check-out by 12:00 noon. Guests can request an early check-in, which may be accommodated subject to availability.</p>"}, {"id": 593, "question": "Are there suggested excursions or experiences near Fairmont Mumbai?", "answer": "<p>Staying at&nbsp;<strong>Fairmont Mumbai&nbsp;</strong>puts you close to Mahakali Caves, Gilbert Hill, Juhu Beach, Powai Lake and Phoenix Marketcity, offering a mix of culture, views, shopping and relaxed outings.</p>"}, {"id": 594, "question": "How much can I save if I book a stay at Fairmont Mumbai through Viraaya Weddings?", "answer": "<p>Booking a wedding stay at&nbsp;<strong>Fairmont Mumbai</strong> through Viraaya Weddings can help you save around 10–15% or more. You also get easier planning support and access to trusted vendors, all in one place.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 595, "question": "What is the standard liquor policy of Fairmont Mumbai?", "answer": "<p>Outside alcohol is not allowed in&nbsp;<strong>Fairmont Mumbai.</strong> All beverages must be purchased exclusively through the hotel and will be charged separately based on consumption.</p>"}]', '376', '446'
