SELECT 'mumbai', 'grand-hyatt-mumbai-hotel-and-residences', 'published', 'Grand Hyatt Mumbai Luxury Wedding Cost & Booking Offers', 'Explore Grand Hyatt Mumbai Hotel & Serviced Apartments wedding cost, wedding packages, booking info, luxury venues, premium stays & grand celebrations.', 'grand hyatt mumbai wedding, grand hyatt mumbai wedding cost, grand hyatt mumbai wedding package, grand hyatt wedding package mumbai , grand hyatt hotel mumbai booking, grand hyatt mumbai price for wedding', '/storage/hotel/seo/hO5eQwbqOMTdAOuJzyhPyt5L5if54tkPJcqv8TMR.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/b7luKBkC7boijHpR9YvdPCWCi5CCtq2WNeKBrQi3.jpg', 'Grand Hyatt Mumbai Hotel And Residences', 'Bandra Kurla Complex, Siddharath Nagar, Vakola, Vicinity, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400055, India', '15 Minutes', '45 Minutes', '<p>Mumbai weddings are usually associated with packed schedules and traffic planning. A&nbsp;<strong>wedding at Grand Hyatt Mumbai Hotel &amp; Residences</strong> changes that rhythm completely. Spread across nearly 12 acres right off the Western Express Highway, the hotel feels like its own private world tucked inside the city. Guests move through open courtyards, art-filled walkways, towering atriums and palm-lined outdoor spaces that make the property feel far more relaxed and expansive than most&nbsp;<strong>luxury hotels in Mumbai.</strong></p><p>A&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Mumbai</strong> at&nbsp;<strong>Grand Hyatt Mumbai Hotel &amp; Residences</strong> is ideal for large guest lists that need space without losing ease. The 30,000 sq. ft. Grand Ballroom hosts grand receptions comfortably, while the lush green Grand Lawns and alfresco zones seem to be the perfect venues for mehendi and sangeet functions, without feeling congested. With the airport and BKC just 10-15 minutes away, guests'' travel stays simple, leaving more time for celebrations rather than long city transfers.</p><p>What gives&nbsp;<strong>Grand Hyatt Mumbai Hotel &amp; Residences</strong> its personality is how social the entire property feels. Someone is always gathering for late-night Italian dinners at Celini, poolside conversations stretch unexpectedly long and families naturally settle into the hotel as though they are staying at a luxury city resort rather than attending a formal wedding venue.</p>', '548 rooms with suites', 'The Grand Showroom, Grand Ballroom, Grand Salon', 'Grand Lawns, The Grand Alfresco', '1150', '1150', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/kuoMLxJfgxFQrjtnEtV06VNIg5DDbnGgB6LU8n3D.jpg", "title": "6+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/wvrrcYyOTJBLQ6iSl4g6GxxLW6anTfeFnolFeoxU.jpg", "title": "Candlelit Italian terrace dining experiences"}]', '[{"id": 932, "question": "Where did Deepika Padukone and Ranveer Singh host their wedding reception?", "answer": "<p>Actors Deepika Padukone and Ranveer Singh hosted their wedding reception at the&nbsp;<strong>Grand Hyatt Mumbai Hotel &amp; Residences</strong> in November 2018.</p>"}, {"id": 933, "question": "What is the standard check-in and check-out time at Grand Hyatt Mumbai Hotel & Residences, and can guests get an early check-in?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Grand Hyatt Mumbai Hotel &amp; Residences</strong> is 3:00 pm, and guests can check out by 12:00 noon. Guests can get an early check-in, but it is completely subject to the hotel''s discretion.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 934, "question": "Are there suggested excursions or experiences near the Grand Hyatt Hotel Mumbai?", "answer": "<p>Guests staying at&nbsp;<strong>Grand Hyatt Hotel Mumbai</strong> can explore Bandra’s cafés and nightlife, shop at Jio World Drive, visit Marine Drive or admire the beauty of the Gateway of India. Art lovers also enjoy Kala Ghoda galleries and nearby Bollywood studio tours.</p>"}, {"id": 935, "question": "Is there an indoor backup at Grand Hyatt Mumbai in case of rain?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>Grand Hyatt Mumbai&nbsp;</strong>offers indoor backup venues like the Grand Ballroom, Grand Salon and The Grand Showroom for weather disruptions. These venues are located within close proximity for smoother events.</p>"}, {"id": 936, "question": "Does Grand Hyatt Mumbai Hotel & Residences provide a bar service for weddings?", "answer": "<p>Yes, Grand Hyatt Hotel Mumbai offers an in-house bar service for weddings. All beverages and drinks must be sourced through the hotel itself, as outside alcohol is not permitted. Beverages are charged per consumption, separate from wedding packages.</p>"}]', '271', '548'
