SELECT 'mumbai', 'intercontinental-marine-drive-mumbai-by-ihg', 'published', 'InterContinental Marine Drive Mumbai Wedding Cost & Venue', 'Discover InterContinental Marine Drive Mumbai wedding cost, luxury venue details, premium stays, catering & elegant wedding celebrations. Check & Book Now!', 'intercontinental marine drive mumbai wedding, intercontinental marine drive mumbai wedding cost, intercontinental marine drive, intercontinental hotel marine drive, intercontinental hotel marine drive mumbai', '/storage/hotel/seo/Er2ZCCxYLcUxezJyQCZFupnPHz0pPS6ZtoJbRrjO.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/ucEHoTbesvqwB5oULCpgkRAI63DMS9cFRn9V1riv.jpg', 'InterContinental Marine Drive Mumbai by IHG', '135, Marine Dr, Churchgate, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400020, India', '60 Minutes', '15 minutes', '<p>Marine Drive at sunset has a way of making Mumbai feel almost unreal. A&nbsp;<strong>wedding at InterContinental Marine Drive Mumbai&nbsp;</strong>captures that exact feeling, where the city’s pace softens into sea breeze and open horizon. Tucked into an elegant Art Deco-inspired eight-story boutique hotel, the space feels more like a private oceanfront residence than a conventional wedding venue. With just 59 rooms and suites, it naturally stays intimate, which is why celebrations here feel personal, unhurried and quietly exclusive.​</p><p>There is something about&nbsp;<strong>Marine Drive, Mumbai,</strong> at dusk that slows everything down as the Queen’s Necklace begins to glow. A&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Mumbai</strong> at this 5-star luxury hotel makes the most of that rare sea-facing setting, where the Arabian Sea feels ever-present. From relaxed daytime moments to rooftop pheras at Dome, the view naturally frames each function. Inside, Onyx and Atellier keep a&nbsp;<strong>wedding at InterContinental Marine Drive Mumbai</strong> intimate, letting celebrations feel personal, calm and close to the water.</p><p>What lingers after a&nbsp;<strong>wedding at InterContinental Marine Drive Mumbai</strong> is the calm atmosphere more than scale. Guests recall long dinners at Dome, seamless hospitality and how even well-travelled visitors feel at ease. Despite being in the heart of Mumbai, the city buzz fades into quiet, coastal comfort.</p>', '59 rooms with suites', 'Onyx Banquet Hall, Atellier Hall', 'Rooftop Dome, Atellier Terrace', '150', '150', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/j5fVPnDLDklJXUQ5H5Mgh7rhYd0jzt9Chu8QSOkE.jpg", "title": "3+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/5H6mcEBLHCfITcfAqIvFru23oewUdPFaUTVDGYQe.jpg", "title": "Romantic sea-view celebration room styling"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/2A6Csmz8BMqSUaC68O9j4Cbg5wSFDSIuhhLIZccW.jpg", "title": "Queen’s Necklace rooftop sunset cocktails"}]', '[{"id": 927, "question": "Can I host a pre-wedding photoshoot at InterContinental Marine Drive Mumbai?", "answer": "<p>Yes, pre-wedding photoshoots at&nbsp;<strong>InterContinental Marine Drive Mumbai</strong> are allowed with prior hotel permission. The timing and areas used may incur an extra charge for couples and specific permissions may be required.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 928, "question": "Is early check-in available for wedding guests at InterContinental Marine Drive?", "answer": "<p>Yes, an early check-in request can be accommodated at&nbsp;<strong>InterContinental Marine Drive Mumbai</strong>, subject to availability. The standard check-in time at the hotel is 2:00 pm, and guests can check out by 12:00 noon.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 930, "question": "Can we bring our own wedding planner or decorator for a wedding at the InterContinental Marine Drive, Mumbai?", "answer": "<p>Yes, couples can usually bring their own wedding planner or decorator to&nbsp;<strong>InterContinental Marine Drive Mumbai.&nbsp;</strong>Final coordination and approvals are managed with the hotel team and Viraaya Weddings.</p>"}, {"id": 931, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol to InterContinental Marine Drive Mumbai for weddings?", "answer": "<p>No, outside alcohol is not permitted at&nbsp;<strong>InterContinental Marine Drive Mumbai</strong> for weddings. All beverages must be arranged through the hotel’s in-house bar service and are charged separately.</p>"}]', '272', '59'
