SELECT 'mumbai', 'itc-maratha-mumbai', 'published', 'ITC Maratha Luxury Collection Mumbai Wedding Cost', 'ITC Maratha a Luxury Collection Hotel Mumbai wedding cost, booking & hotel details. Plan your wedding at ITC Grand Maratha Mumbai. Explore & book now.', 'itc maratha mumbai wedding cost, itc maratha mumbai wedding, itc maratha mumbai booking, itc maratha mumbai, itc maratha hotel mumbai, itc grand maratha mumbai', '/storage/hotel/seo/AUwzR2U3yMmWliUPOgj4AD9n5xk4VDNw0bWmPFbI.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/KVV3Pr1L0WkkxoRjYvifKMDD5vm2uiXyHNv1rvUC.jpg', 'ITC Maratha Mumbai', 'Sahar Airport Road, Andheri East, close to Mumbai International Airport., India', '10 Minutes', '15 minutes', '<p>A&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at ITC Maratha, a Luxury Collection Hotel, Mumbai,&nbsp;</strong>feels rooted in the city''s rush the moment you walk in. The property’s rich architecture draws on Indo-Saracenic design with strong local influences, so you’re surrounded by arches, courtyards and artwork that reflect the region. It doesn’t feel overdone, just detailed in a way that gives your wedding a strong sense of place without needing to build everything from scratch.</p><p>For a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Mumbai,</strong> the location makes a real difference.&nbsp;<strong>ITC Maratha, a Luxury Collection Hotel, Mumbai,</strong> sits just minutes from the airport, which simplifies arrivals for guests flying in across schedules. The hotel is experienced with large celebrations, so timing, movement between functions and check-ins are handled with ease.</p><p>The venues at&nbsp;<strong>ITC Maratha</strong> are spacious and well-suited for large celebrations, making the décor feel effortless. Dining is a strong point, with curated menus that go beyond standard wedding fare. Guests who are used to travelling often feel at ease here, thanks to the scale of the property, comfortable accommodations and steady hospitality that keeps everything running quietly in the background.</p>', '380', 'Green Banquets, The Grand Ballroom', 'The Royal Gardens', '800', '800', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/BNBgOp80h0pkA9wDoLTNWgkJl3cdN2BPn2tx51yy.jpg", "title": "8+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/gXEHnyHvkjmK2FdyP6ym0ZmjcIUkfXalaB5vNkRM.jpg", "title": "Dining shaped by ITC’s signature culinary repertoire"}]', '[{"id": 268, "question": "How to reach ITC Maratha, a Luxury Collection Hotel, Mumbai?", "answer": "<p>Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj International Airport, located around 1.5 km away, is the closest airport to&nbsp;<strong>ITC Maratha, a Luxury Collection Hotel, Mumbai</strong> is. A car ride from the airport to the resort takes about 5 to 10 minutes.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 269, "question": "Is an early check-in available at ITC Maratha, a Luxury Collection Hotel, Mumbai?", "answer": "<p>Yes, an early check-in to the hotel can be requested, and accommodation is subject to availability. The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>ITC Maratha, a Luxury Collection Hotel, Mumbai,</strong> is 3:00 pm, and the check-out time is 12:00 noon.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 270, "question": "How much can I save if I make a booking at ITC Maratha, a Luxury Collection Hotel, Mumbai, through Viraaya Weddings?", "answer": "<p>When you book<strong> ITC Maratha, a Luxury Collection Hotel, Mumbai</strong> through Viraaya Weddings, you can typically save 10 to 15% or more through specially negotiated wedding rates. Along with better pricing, you also get access to trusted vendors, planning support and a smoother booking experience.</p>"}, {"id": 271, "question": "Are drones, fireworks or baraat allowed at ITC Maratha, a Luxury Collection Hotel, Mumbai?", "answer": "<p>At&nbsp;<strong>ITC Maratha, a Luxury Collection Hotel, Mumbai,</strong> baraat processions are generally allowed, while drones and fireworks are subject to local regulations and hotel approvals. It’s best to confirm permissions in advance with the hotel and the Viraaya Weddings team.</p>"}, {"id": 272, "question": "Does ITC Maratha, a Luxury Collection Hotel, Mumbai, provide a bar service for weddings?", "answer": "<p>Yes,<strong> ITC Maratha, a Luxury Collection Hotel, Mumbai,&nbsp;</strong>provides a full bar service for weddings, with beverages curated and billed separately. Outside alcohol is not permitted inside the property.</p>"}]', '101', '380'
