SELECT 'mumbai', 'jw-marriott-mumbai-juhu', 'published', 'JW Marriott Mumbai Juhu Wedding Cost and Booking Details', 'Explore JW Marriott Mumbai Juhu wedding cost, booking details, luxury packages, beachfront venues, premium stays & décor. Check availability. Book Now!', 'jw marriott mumbai juhu buffet price​, jw marriott mumbai juhu booking​, jw marriott juhu wedding cost, jw marriott juhu wedding, jw marriott juhu wedding packages​, jw marriott mumbai wedding​, jw marriott mumbai wedding cost', '/storage/hotel/seo/bIbgIGYe6p0YRdVMApIYyM3QY5kGyPLLsCRebIXE.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/U25AHJo5qBbZIL0LgjwFy3EsIHKlK13oa0kAOi8J.jpg', 'JW Marriott Mumbai Juhu', 'Juhu Tara Rd, Juhu Tara, Juhu, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400049, India', '25 Minutes', '20 Minutes', '<p>If Mumbai ever feels like it takes a pause, it is usually here, by the sea. A&nbsp;<strong>wedding at JW Marriott Mumbai Juhu</strong> features the Arabian Sea right across Juhu Beach, where the usual noise of the city just seems to fall away a little. This&nbsp;<strong>renowned 5-star beachfront hotel</strong>, opened in 2002, mixes carved sandstone, marble and glass in a way that feels elegant but not overdone, with the sunlight lighting up every corner of the property.</p><p>A&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Mumbai&nbsp;</strong>at this 5-star property is well-suited for a grand scale as well as intimate ceremonies. The Grand Sangam Ballroom carries the big, high-energy moments, while spaces like Mahi and the poolside lawns slow things down a bit, especially when the sun starts setting over Juhu. Even though you are right in the middle of one of Mumbai’s busiest stretches, the hotel somehow feels tucked away from it all. The airport is also just about 20 minutes away, which makes arrivals and departures fairly easy for most guests.</p><p>What stays with people after a&nbsp;<strong>wedding at JW Marriott Mumbai Juhu</strong> is the experience itself. Guests settle into 358 rooms and suites, slip between spa sessions, beach walks and long dinners, and the celebration naturally slows down in the best way. With&nbsp;<strong>signature JW Marriott hospitality</strong>, it becomes less of an event and more of a coastal memory.</p>', '358 rooms with suites', 'The Grand Sangam Ballroom', 'Mahi, Poolside Areas', '750', '750', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/S8vhElMdasnaJmufDQL7Lv06YF6Y9wwXRujQFnts.jpg", "title": "5+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/nP5VjCgH4BP1UDJVIrQQf5e4hCvpE3UNPRhhB5zh.jpg", "title": "Sunset champagne Asian lounge evenings"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/ne7aNXMWZAItNfAcxi8Xd8YXTf1jmAFcosC89svc.jpg", "title": "Private beachfront candlelit canopy dinners"}]', '[{"id": 902, "question": "Is outside catering allowed at JW Marriott Mumbai Juhu?", "answer": "<p>Outside catering is usually not allowed at&nbsp;<strong>JW Marriott Mumbai Juhu</strong> for weddings. Couples can confirm specific requirements directly with hotel management for any exceptions or special arrangements.</p>"}, {"id": 903, "question": "Is early check-in available for guests at JW Marriott Mumbai Juhu, and what are the standard check-in and check-out times?", "answer": "<p>Yes, an early check-in can be arranged at&nbsp;<strong>JW Marriott Mumbai Juhu</strong>, subject to availability. The standard check-in time at the hotel is 3:00 pm, and guests can check out by 12:00 noon.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 904, "question": "How much can I save if I book JW Marriott Mumbai Juhu through Viraaya Weddings?", "answer": "<p>Through Viraaya Weddings'' hospitality partnerships, couples can often save 10-15% or more on&nbsp;<strong>JW Marriott Mumbai Juhu</strong> bookings. You also get access to negotiated rates, trusted vendors and smoother planning support.</p>"}, {"id": 905, "question": "⁠How early should I book JW Marriott Mumbai Juhu, Mumbai, for a wedding?", "answer": "<p>It’s usually a good idea to book JW Marriott Mumbai Juhu around 12 to 18 months in advance, especially if you’re planning a wedding in peak season. For popular dates or preferred venues, locking it in even earlier helps avoid last-minute availability issues.</p>"}, {"id": 906, "question": "Does JW Marriott Mumbai Juhu provide a bar service for destination weddings?", "answer": "<p>Yes,<strong> JW Marriott Mumbai Juhu</strong> provides an in-house bar service for destination weddings. All beverages are served through the hotel’s own bar team and are billed separately as per consumption.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '273', '358'
