SELECT 'mumbai', 'jw-marriott-mumbai-sahar', 'published', 'JW Marriott Mumbai Sahar Wedding Cost & Booking', 'Check JW Marriott Mumbai Sahar wedding cost, booking & wedding packages. Plan your grand destination wedding at JW Marriott Sahar Mumbai with best prices.', 'jw marriott mumbai sahar wedding cost, jw marriott mumbai sahar wedding, jw marriott mumbai sahar booking, jw marriott mumbai sahar spa, jw marriott sahar mumbai, jw marriott mumbai sahar reviews', '/storage/hotel/seo/vq3xpSPJZClqBYhnJCQHqqtkyPqYtho1c5mTBUM7.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/MnARJqPLPEhI4jWj3aHZfnhpeVRkXpNylym0Gs6y.jpg', 'JW Marriott Mumbai Sahar', 'Chhatrapati Shivaji International Airport, IA Project Rd, Navpada, Vile Parle East, Vile Parle, Andheri, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400099, India', '5 Minutes', '15 minutes', '<p>Set in Andheri East, close to Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj International Airport,<strong> JW Marriott Mumbai Sahar</strong> places wedding guests within the centre of the city’s hubs while offering a well-equipped space for celebrations. The hotel brings together multiple dining venues, including JW Café and Romano’s, along with a spa and poolside lounge that guests can enjoy between functions. Its size and layout make it particularly convenient for hosting large groups in one place.</p><p>The property offers 2,455 sq. metres of indoor event space distributed among 11 venues, including a large ballroom that can accommodate up to 1,500 guests. These spaces allow you to plan different wedding functions within the same hotel, without having to move between locations. Breakout rooms assist with planning and smaller gatherings, while in-house catering teams help curate menus that suit each event, making it easier to manage multi-day celebrations smoothly.</p>', '588', 'Royal Ballroom, Royal Ballroom I, Royal Ballroom II, Grand Ballroom, Grand Ballroom I, Grand Ballroom II, Grand Ballroom III', 'Gulmohar Lawns, Palm Court, JW Lawns, Poolside Studio', '1175', '1175', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/tC8qoJsIoThkyHFkRSyp9ThsBYnJ6RYgE7AGH0to.jpg", "title": "6 in-house restaurants and bars"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/tjrutGMbKtbYgxn5qLZKHNxybdCr6r23JDgHr848.jpg", "title": "Ballroom venues with pre-function areas"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/YpfBYqByGw9uTBVe9jWeDqILgv3C2UvoZQfy2JI1.jpg", "title": "Curated couple massages"}]', '[{"id": 253, "question": "What is the nearest airport to JW Marriott Mumbai Sahar?", "answer": "<p>The nearest airport to the&nbsp;<strong>JW Marriott Mumbai Sahar&nbsp;</strong>is the Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj International Airport (BOM). The hotel is located just 500 metres from Terminal 2 (T2), making it a convenient 5-10 minute walk or a very short drive.</p>"}, {"id": 254, "question": "When is the peak season for JW Marriott Mumbai Sahar?", "answer": "<p>The peak season for&nbsp;<strong>JW Marriott Mumbai Sahar</strong> is October to March. Pleasant weather and high business activity drive demand, with room rates peaking in December and January.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 255, "question": "Can I host a pre-wedding shoot at the JW Marriott Mumbai Sahar?", "answer": "<p>Yes, but you must have a confirmed event booking or pay a venue fee. All shoots require prior approval and must follow designated timings. Crew members are also required to provide a valid government ID.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 256, "question": "What are the official check-in and check-out timings at the JW Marriott Mumbai Sakar? Are there any late check-in or check-out privileges available for wedding couples?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in and check-out timings at the<strong> JW Marriott Mumbai Sahar</strong> are 3:00 PM and 12:00 noon. Wedding couples can request extensions through their coordinator, which are granted based on room availability or Marriott Bonvoy elite status.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 257, "question": "What is the official liquor policy of the JW Marriott Mumbai Sahar?", "answer": "<p>All drinks and cocktails for wedding events at the JW Marriott Mumbai Sahar should be purchased from the hotel’s in-house restaurants and bars. These are billed separately and not included in your standard wedding package.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '111', '588'
