SELECT 'mumbai', 'novotel-mumbai-juhu-beach', 'published', 'Novotel Mumbai Juhu Beach Wedding Cost, Reviews and booking', 'Explore Novotel Mumbai Juhu Beach wedding cost, guest reviews, beachfront venues, luxury stays, décor & unforgettable wedding experiences in Mumbai. Book!', 'novotel mumbai juhu beach price, novotel mumbai juhu beach rates, hotel novotel mumbai juhu beach wedding, hotel novotel mumbai juhu beach wedding cost, hotel novotel mumbai juhu beach review, novotel mumbai juhu beach rooms', '/storage/hotel/seo/shbPEWrwjahy09LI5Vn0nBEKNX2DTy4QuUNd3grM.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/EU7aXqeMrOw8mqrW48M7RBfhO4ZYZ6BLhbTFV53b.jpg', 'Novotel Mumbai Juhu Beach', 'Balraj Sahni Rd, Juhu, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400049, India', '25 Minutes', '20 Minutes', '<p>Right where Juhu Beach meets Mumbai’s coastline,&nbsp;<strong>Novotel Mumbai Juhu Beach&nbsp;</strong>has been a familiar venue for seaside weddings since the early 2,000s, with a calm, modern charm. The Arabian Sea stays in the background, offering scenic views from almost everywhere you turn, giving your wedding vows a naturally cinematic backdrop. Despite this beachfront setting, it’s still just a short drive from Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj International Airport, making arrivals smooth and uncomplicated.</p><p>Inside the&nbsp;<strong>Novotel Mumbai Juhu Beach</strong>, wedding festivities unfold across elegant ballrooms, indoor halls and breezy lawns suited for celebrations of every scale. With 204 rooms and suites overlooking the Arabian Sea, comfort feels relaxed yet refined. Located on Juhu Beach, it is close to Bandra and Versova Beach, while Mumbai’s vibrant nightlife and cultural spots add easy charm to a<strong> destination wedding in Mumbai.</strong></p><p>Weddings here feel naturally cinematic, making a&nbsp;<strong>wedding in Mumbai</strong> feel both grand and deeply personal. A&nbsp;<strong>wedding at Novotel Mumbai Juhu Beach</strong> brings together ocean sunsets, warm hospitality and the energy of Juhu’s iconic shoreline, leaving couples with memories shaped by sea, light and celebration. always remembered forever.</p>', '204 rooms with suites', 'Champagne Ballroom, Bordeaux Room, Burgundy Room', 'The Terrace, Poolside Lawn, Poolside Area', '450', '450', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/MOSVICAayPoouGZUqTPFpTvgWwB7iIINHEko0Puo.jpg", "title": "5+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/Klfu1mBQjWMT6nf81xNndM8ZyXYUhvECY4bSR6Q0.jpg", "title": "Panoramic oceanview suite upgrade experience"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/u7YbSHuWQH4PUiGCUqORE8JUakUWGB8AiIAmG1aG.jpg", "title": "Bageecha beachfront candlelit dining evenings"}]', '[{"id": 897, "question": "Which celebrity wedding took place at the Novotel Mumbai Juhu Beach?", "answer": "<p>Bollywood actors Aditya Seal and Anushka Ranjan tied the knot at&nbsp;<strong>Novotel Mumbai Juhu Beach</strong> in November 2021.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 898, "question": "What is the check-in time, and can we get an early check-in at the Novotel Mumbai Juhu Beach?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at the hotel is 3:00 pm, and guests can check out by 12:00 noon. An early check-in can be arranged at&nbsp;<strong>Novotel Mumbai Juhu Beach</strong>, but it is subject to hotel availability.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 899, "question": "Is there an indoor backup at Novotel Mumbai Juhu Beach in case of rain?", "answer": "<p>Yes, Novotel Mumbai Juhu Beach offers fully air-conditioned indoor banquet halls that serve as convenient rain-ready backups, located close to its main event spaces for easy guest flow.</p>"}, {"id": 901, "question": "What is the standard liquor policy at Novotel Mumbai Juhu Beach for weddings?", "answer": "<p><strong>Novotel Mumbai Juhu Beach&nbsp;</strong>usually follows an in-house liquor policy where all beverages are managed through the hotel’s licensed bar service. Drinks are served by the hotel and charged separately based on actual consumption during the event.</p>"}]', '274', '204'
