SELECT 'mumbai', 'radisson-blu-mumbai-international-airport', 'published', 'Radisson Blu Mumbai International Airport – Weddings & Cost', 'Radisson Blu Mumbai Airport offers stunning wedding halls & expert event planning. Explore wedding packages, venue costs & direct booking. Reserve Now!', 'radisson blu hotel wedding packages, radisson blu wedding package​, radisson blu wedding​ hall, radisson blu wedding venue​, cost of wedding at radisson blu​, wedding at radisson blu, wedding radisson blu​, radisson blu wedding cost', '/storage/hotel/seo/IA3jjOyzdhzZ1Rqp8DgV78sXT9VA6eo7q6RmtbZM.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/aDA3jtLPqNx4IDKSHG2Bqvc3v6bCM6Qz3qBEg0KJ.jpg', 'Radisson Blu Mumbai International Airport', 'Off Marol Maroshi Rd, near Metro Station Marol Naka, Bori Colony, Gamdevi, Marol, Andheri East, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400059, India', '15 Minutes', '60 Minutes', '<p>Think of a wedding where Mumbai’s city energy is right outside, yet everything inside feels calm, stylish and effortlessly put together. That is exactly the mood at&nbsp;<strong>Radisson Blu Mumbai International Airport</strong>, a recently opened 5-star luxury hotel in Andheri East, just minutes from T2. With its contemporary façade, bold art details and lively interiors, it sets a refreshing backdrop for a modern&nbsp;<strong>wedding at Radisson Blu Mumbai International Airport</strong>, especially for couples planning a chic&nbsp;<strong>wedding in Mumbai</strong>.</p><p>Inside&nbsp;<strong>Radisson Blu Mumbai International Airport</strong>, the rooms feel calm and thoughtfully designed, offering 203 spacious rooms with soundproof windows and soft, comfortable bedding. The interiors are modern yet warm, giving guests a quiet break from the city’s rush. Between events, guests can relax at the rooftop infinity pool, enjoy global dining options or simply experience the hotel’s easy, welcoming service.</p><p>What makes&nbsp;<strong>Radisson Blu Mumbai International Airport</strong> especially appealing for weddings is how naturally it balances scale and intimacy. The Mansion Ballroom and courtyard spaces spread across a few thousand square metres, comfortably hosting around 450-500 guests while still feeling connected and intimate. Add in its unbeatable airport access and nearby hotspots like BKC, Phoenix Marketcity and Powai, and it becomes a place where celebrations feel connected to Mumbai, yet somehow aloof from it.</p>', '203 rooms with suites', 'Mansion Ballroom, Altitude Banquet Halls', 'Courtyard', '450', '450', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/VqHSJrkDMhcZm0FE81KZkj9iiwTQtFFiyGXvQcDT.jpg", "title": "2+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/JIeF3QxMOimNom3j69DisczNhs8CJNOYlTYy8Jo0.jpg", "title": "Starlit rooftop pool dinners"}]', '[{"id": 967, "question": "Can guests explore local sights during their stay at Radisson Blu Mumbai International Airport?", "answer": "<p>While staying at the Radisson Hotel, Mumbai, guests can visit Juhu Beach, Bandra promenades, Powai Lake, Gateway of India and Phoenix Marketcity Kurla. Explore BKC restaurants, local shopping hubs, and vibrant Mumbai nightlife nearby.</p>"}, {"id": 968, "question": "What are the standard check-in and check-out times at Radisson Blu Mumbai International Airport, and is early check-in available?", "answer": "<p>The check-in time at Radisson Blu Mumbai International Airport is at 3:00 pm, while check-out is by 12:00 noon. Early check-in can be requested, but it depends on availability and is approved at the hotel’s discretion.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 969, "question": "How early should I book Radisson Blu Mumbai International Airport?", "answer": "<p>It’s best to book&nbsp;<strong>Radisson Blu Mumbai International Airport&nbsp;</strong>around 12 to 18 months in advance, especially for peak wedding or travel seasons. Earlier bookings ensure better availability, preferred dates and smoother planning.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 970, "question": "Is outside catering allowed at Radisson Blu Mumbai International Airport?", "answer": "<p>Yes, outside catering is usually allowed at&nbsp;<strong>Radisson Blu Mumbai.</strong> However, final approval is dependent on hotel management, and availability is confirmed later.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 971, "question": "What is the standard liquor policy at Radisson Blu Mumbai International Airport?", "answer": "<p>Outside alcohol is not allowed inside&nbsp;<strong>Radisson Blu Mumbai International Airport.&nbsp;</strong>All beverages and drinks must be purchased from the hotel’s bar, as they will be charged separately based on consumption.</p>"}]', '311', '203'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'mumbai' AND `slug` = 'radisson-blu-mumbai-international-airport');
--> statement-breakpoint
