SELECT 'mumbai', 'sofitel-mumbai-bkc', 'published', 'Sofitel Mumbai BKC Premium Wedding Cost for Grand Events', 'Explore Sofitel Mumbai BKC wedding cost, guest reviews, booking, luxury venues, premium stays, décor, catering & elegant wedding experiences. Book Now!', 'sofitel mumbai bkc wedding, sofitel mumbai bkc​ booking, sofitel mumbai bkc wedding cost, sofitel mumbai bkc hotel wedding, sofitel mumbai bkc hotel wedding Cost, sofitel mumbai bkc review', '/storage/hotel/seo/17Crfk8sxXrvL7B97fYXyAbt346FWIBj6alPa8Ni.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/nmowby0OXKznllbkDuBQk10C5b0K6Ev2LUTYn9RI.jpg', 'Sofitel Mumbai BKC', 'C 57, G Block BKC, Bandra Kurla Complex, Bandra East, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400098, India', '35 Minutes', '25 Minutes', '<p><strong>Sofitel Mumbai BKC</strong> sits right in the middle of Bandra Kurla Complex, but it does not really feel like the business district it belongs to. Designed by Isabelle Miaja and opened in 2012, the hotel has this striking mix of French elegance and Indian detail that shows up in the chandeliers, the bold colours and even the glass and stone interiors. For a&nbsp;<strong>wedding at Sofitel Mumbai BKC Hotel</strong>, that contrast becomes a part of the experience. Outside, it is all offices and city pace; inside, it slows down completely.</p><p>The 302 premium stays at the hotel offer a calm break from Mumbai’s pace, ideal for multi-day wedding stays in BKC. Club Millésime adds a more private setting for families between functions. Located only minutes from Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj International Airport,&nbsp;<strong>Sofitel Mumbai BKC</strong> also keeps guests close to Jio World Drive, Bandra cafés, and Siddhivinayak Temple for easy city exploration.</p><p>Celebrations at&nbsp;<strong>Sofitel Mumbai BKC&nbsp;</strong>flow between the Hriday Lawn and the Grand Salon Ballroom, depending on whether it’s a close family function or a larger reception. With capacity for around 600+ guests across its event spaces, it works well for both intimate and grand weddings. Being located in BKC also makes it a practical, well-connected choice for multi-day celebrations in the city.</p>', '302 rooms with suites', 'Grand Salon Ballroom, Salon Louvre', 'Hriday Lawn Areas', '650', '650', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/pr5Nk6rbCmEJrm5rDvPm5pgsa1Qusz54SoGPjoZq.jpg", "title": "6+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/l1Vj2jqk4pIqbTxq9LHK3RMQ6mi4HPaJ0aZChppc.jpg", "title": "Milestone celebration concierge surprise moments"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/PqXbm72dMkqFDW6tYofrckEpOhqo4oH3AnvuslQU.jpg", "title": "Starlit poolside curated dining experiences"}]', '[{"id": 892, "question": "When is the peak wedding season at the Sofitel Mumbai BKC?", "answer": "<p>At<strong> Sofitel Mumbai BKC</strong>, the busiest wedding season runs from October to March, when the weather is pleasant and most auspicious dates fall. During this time, the prices go up, and good weekend slots get booked early.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 893, "question": "What is the check-in and check-out time at Sofitel Mumbai BKC Hotel, and can guests get an early check-in?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Sofitel Mumbai BKC&nbsp;</strong>is 3:00 pm, and guests can check out by 12:00 noon. An early check-in can be arranged for guests, but it is subject to hotel availability.</p>"}, {"id": 894, "question": "Are there nearby attractions or activities for international guests around Sofitel Mumbai BKC?", "answer": "<p>Yes, international guests staying at<strong> Sofitel Mumbai BKC&nbsp;</strong>can explore nearby attractions like Jio World Drive, Bandra Kurla Complex art spaces, Bandra Bandstand promenade, Siddhivinayak Temple, Phoenix Palladium, Marine Drive and Worli Sea Face, all within easy driving distance.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 895, "question": "Can I bring my own wedding planner and decorator for a wedding at Sofitel Mumbai BKC, Mumbai?", "answer": "<p>Yes, you can bring your own wedding planner and decorator to Sofitel Mumbai BKC, with the hotel’s events team coordinating with them. Final approvals and vendor access are handled as per hotel guidelines.</p>"}, {"id": 896, "question": "Does Sofitel Mumbai BKC provide a bar service for weddings?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>Sofitel Mumbai BKC&nbsp;</strong>provides an in-house bar service for weddings, with all beverages managed through the hotel’s team. Drinks are served and billed separately based on actual consumption during the event.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '380', '302'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'mumbai' AND `slug` = 'sofitel-mumbai-bkc');
