SELECT 'mumbai', 'taj-lands-end-mumbai', 'published', 'Taj Lands End Mumbai Wedding Cost & Hotel Booking', 'Taj Lands End Mumbai wedding cost, booking, price, photos & reviews. Plan a luxury sea view wedding at Taj Lands End Mumbai. Check details & book now.', 'taj lands end mumbai wedding cost, taj lands end mumbai wedding, taj lands end mumbai booking, taj lands end mumbai photos, taj lands end mumbai price, taj lands end mumbai reviews', '/storage/hotel/seo/S0zp2EeVfQj3v9yRagToNEUcG0scNAfVmpiZSFKQ.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/9MNeC0wsDa3VwJP1pfgr0CtcUgH9MvYwlxqoKp1h.jpg', 'Taj Lands End Mumbai', 'BJ Road, opp. ICICI Bank, Mount Mary, Bandra West, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400050, India', '30 minutes', '15 Minutes', '<p>Set along Bandra’s seafront,&nbsp;<strong>Taj Lands End in Mumbai</strong> looks out onto the Arabian Sea and the Bandra-Worli Sea Link. Located about 10–12 km from the airport, getting guests in is fairly straightforward, and areas like BKC and South Mumbai are easy to reach for events or outings. What this really means is fewer logistics to worry about and smoother movement for everyone attending.</p><p>For a<strong> destination wedding in Mumbai,</strong> that kind of convenience, along with a sea-facing setting, makes the entire experience feel more relaxed and thoughtfully put together. At this five-star deluxe hotel, the curved façade, grand lobby and sea-facing terraces create a sense of openness that carries through every event. Guests move between elegant indoor spaces and breezy outdoor lawns, with the Arabian Sea always somewhere in the background, giving the entire celebration a relaxed, coastal rhythm.</p><p>A dedicated team at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Lands End in Mumbai</strong> handles everything, so you don''t need to follow up constantly. Excellent culinary experiences, whether they’re Indian, Asian or global menus, are served across functions. In between, guests spend time in their rooms, at the spa or just over long meals, so the entire stay feels relaxed and well looked after.</p>', '452', 'Garden View Room, Salcette Hall, Ballroom', 'Palm Garden, Poolside Lawns, Seaside Lawns', '1000', '1000', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/MKLBWSSulO6vfsCwFsl7IveJw1vO7LUMQW2ig6wB.jpg", "title": "6+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/LcUmo8n1zXFxHtum3ie65aDxagsL02BmnDoibcGN.jpg", "title": "Curated luxury couple’s retreat"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/xDR9omjQ1vH8Cz8sK7sUim7WLxjgnlNWb1l3jrk2.jpg", "title": "Starlit alfresco romantic dining"}]', '[{"id": 283, "question": "How to reach Taj Lands End, Mumbai, from the nearest airport?", "answer": "<p>Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj International Airport is about 10.8 km from&nbsp;<strong>Taj Lands End, Mumbai.</strong> A drive usually takes around 24 minutes, depending on traffic.</p>"}, {"id": 284, "question": "What is the check-in time at Taj Lands End, Mumbai, and is early check-in available?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Lands End, Mumbai,</strong> is 2:00 pm, and the check-out time is 12:00 noon. An early check-in can be accommodated, subject to hotel availability.</p>"}, {"id": 285, "question": "Where did Cricketer Rohit Sharma get married?", "answer": "<p>Rohit Sharma got hitched to his long-time girlfriend Ritika Sajdeh at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Lands End, Mumbai,</strong> in a grand ceremony in 2015.</p>"}, {"id": 286, "question": "Can guests explore local sights during their stay at Taj Lands End, Mumbai?", "answer": "<p>Yes, guests at<strong> Taj Lands End in Bandra, Mumbai,</strong> can step out to nearby spots, such as Bandra Fort, Mount Mary Church and the Bandra Bandstand Promenade, all just a short drive or walk away.</p>"}, {"id": 287, "question": "What is the standard liquor policy of Taj Lands End, Mumbai?", "answer": "<p>Outside alcohol is not allowed at Taj Lands End, Mumbai. All beverages must be arranged exclusively by the hotel and are charged on a consumption basis, separate from standard wedding packages.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '102', '452'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'mumbai' AND `slug` = 'taj-lands-end-mumbai');
