SELECT 'mumbai', 'taj-santacruz-mumbai', 'published', 'Taj Santacruz Mumbai Luxury Weddings & Hotel Reservations', 'Taj Santacruz Mumbai is the premier airport hotel for weddings & events. Get banquet capacity details, wedding costs & direct booking options. Reserve!', 'taj Santacruz Mumbai wedding, Taj Santacruz Mumbai wedding cost, taj santacruz mumbai review​, taj santacruz mumbai price', '/storage/hotel/seo/yEspgQRPAaaCrDAnQX6CHgZvkBCMyvY8IpUK24xw.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/y8YO9UpBCQY5IZJoZFftN8XOnUfvdfdpR9Mca0bI.jpg', 'Taj Santacruz Mumbai', 'off, Western Express Highway, Domestic Arpt Rd, nr. Chhatrapati Shivaji, Navpada, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400099, India', '10 Minutes', '15 minutes', '<p>Where aircraft trace the skyline and sunlight peeks in through sweeping glass façades,&nbsp;<strong>Taj Santacruz, Mumbai,</strong> begins to feel like a sculpted piece of modern luxury in Mumbai. A&nbsp;<strong>wedding at Taj Santacruz, Mumbai</strong> takes place amongst marble-clad, soundproof interiors and luminous runway-facing spaces, where crystal chandeliers and warm gold accents create a cinematic yet deeply intimate setting.</p><p>Spread across expansive banquet spaces in sq metres, along with grand indoor halls and a pillarless ballroom,&nbsp;<strong>Taj Santacruz, Mumbai,</strong> brings scale and intimacy together for grand celebrations. With curated dining, elegant accommodations and seamless hospitality, every wedding in Mumbai here feels effortlessly hosted with signature Taj warmth.</p><p>Its unmatched airport connectivity places&nbsp;<strong>Taj Santacruz, Mumbai,</strong> minutes from key hubs like BKC, Juhu Beach and Bandra, making guest travel effortless. Guests enjoy a rare Mumbai experience where aircraft views, luxury comfort and iconic surroundings blend into one seamless celebration journey. It combines modern architecture, warm Taj hospitality and tranquil interiors, ensuring every celebration feels personal, luxurious and beautifully memorable for couples and their families alike throughout the entire experience journey.</p>', '258 rooms and 21 suites', 'The Imperial Hall, The Grand Ballroom', 'The Outdoor Lawn', '600', '600', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/4ffR78aHm2dtt0QhIDVAzIPAQIyeIhLeQjPU6Sh9.jpg", "title": "4+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/zabXdfyPa5wS6ztp4iTgeTWXilJYw1pncjCsU8IF.jpg", "title": "Sommelier-led wine pairing dinner experience"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/6CYg12m2xS3DsgJQT5betZNVQvV6pNosErinJNvk.jpg", "title": "Private poolside dinner under stars"}]', '[{"id": 972, "question": "Which months are most popular for weddings at Taj Santacruz, Mumbai?", "answer": "<p>October to February are the most popular wedding months at<strong> Taj Santacruz, Mumbai</strong>, with December and January peaking due to pleasant weather and high demand.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 973, "question": "What is the standard check-in and check-out time at Taj Santacruz, Mumbai, and can guests get an early check-in?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Santacruz, Mumbai,&nbsp;</strong>is 2:00 pm, and guests can check out by 12:00 noon. An early check-in at the hotel can be requested; it is entirely at the hotel’s discretion.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 974, "question": "Is there an indoor backup venue available at Taj Santacruz, Mumbai, in case of rain during outdoor celebrations?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>Taj Santacruz, Mumbai,&nbsp;</strong>has indoor banquet and ballroom spaces that work well as rain backups, all within the same property for easy coordination.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 975, "question": "Can we bring our own wedding planner/decorator to Taj Santacruz, Mumbai?", "answer": "<p>Yes, you can usually bring your own wedding planner or decorator to&nbsp;<strong>Taj Santacruz, Mumbai,</strong> subject to hotel approval and coordination with their in-house team.</p>"}, {"id": 976, "question": "What is the standard liquor policy at Taj Santacruz, Mumbai?", "answer": "<p>Outside alcohol is not allowed inside&nbsp;<strong>Taj Santacruz, Mumbai.&nbsp;</strong>All beverages and drinks must be purchased from the hotel’s bar, and they will be charged separately based on consumption.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '312', '279'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'mumbai' AND `slug` = 'taj-santacruz-mumbai');
