SELECT 'mumbai', 'the-leela-mumbai', 'published', 'The Leela Mumbai Luxury Wedding Cost, Buffet & Reservations', 'The Leela Mumbai is synonymous with elegant weddings & fine dining. Discover banquet halls, buffet costs, wedding packages & easy booking options today.', 'the leela mumbai wedding​, the leela mumbai wedding cost​, buffet dinner cost in the leela mumbai, the leela mumbai reviews​, the leela mumbai reviews​, the leela mumbai banquet hall​, the leela mumbai booking', '/storage/hotel/seo/uJxlME8FeFdWEdiBxUo691QYdViMih47YkBTxLBH.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/HXBdGjiJmEGf3HyLG6mASXt6gMq5IVLRWoS7qGlU.jpg', 'The Leela Mumbai', 'Sahar Airport Road, Andheri - Kurla Rd, near Mumbai International Airport, Greater Indra Nagar, Andheri East, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400059, India', '20 Minutes', '20 Minutes', '<p>An 11-acre expanse of marble, water and light rising beside Mumbai’s airport sets the stage for&nbsp;<strong>The Leela Mumbai</strong>, where architecture itself feels like a grand welcome. Just minutes from the airport’s runway, this 5-star luxury hotel turns arrival into a moment of calm awe. For a wedding at The Leela Mumbai or a wedding in Mumbai, it offers a rare combination of city access and resort-like escape.</p><p>Inside&nbsp;<strong>The Leela Mumbai</strong>, European grandeur meets Indian artistry through soaring chandeliers, hand-carved detailing and serene tropical landscapes that soften the city’s edge. The 12,000 sq ft (approx. 1,115 sq metres) Grand Ballroom and sprawling lawns create a canvas for celebrations of every scale, from intimate rituals to opulent receptions, all supported by 398 elegantly designed rooms and suites.</p><p>What makes&nbsp;<strong>The Leela Mumbai</strong> unforgettable is how seamlessly it extends beyond events, where guests flow into award-winning dining, curated wellness spaces and effortless access to BKC, Juhu Beach and Mumbai’s cultural hotspots, making every wedding at The Leela Mumbai feel like a complete luxury experience.</p>', '398 rooms with suites', 'The Grand Ballroom', 'Poolside & Lawns', '850', '850', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/T3rph9XdAWrtjX1XiFuSKR5sCH84TmTQoVIbj4yO.jpg", "title": "6+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/IvPblzcHnQl7jMJBUNippXbcFiYbUaHVFAnNw9hY.jpg", "title": "Regal arrival with live classical music"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/mYvGbFO2IuPwghARO6QTsjhtCY1FNufU3VFrDPPY.jpg", "title": "Private candlelit waterfall side dining"}]', '[{"id": 962, "question": "Are there any special offers for wedding couples at The Leela Mumbai?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>The Leela Mumbai&nbsp;</strong>offers wedding couples with tailored seasonal packages under Viraaya Weddings deals, combining luxury stays, venues and curated experiences instead of fixed discounts.</p>"}, {"id": 963, "question": "Is early check-in available for wedding guests at The Leela Mumbai?", "answer": "<p>Yes, guests can get an early check-in at the hotel, but availability is subject to change. The standard check-in time at The Leela Mumbai is at 2:00 pm, while check-out is by 12:00 noon.</p>"}, {"id": 964, "question": "Can I host a pre-wedding photoshoot at The Leela Mumbai?", "answer": "<p>Yes, you can host a pre-wedding photoshoot at&nbsp;<strong>The Leela Mumbai&nbsp;</strong>with prior approval, it is subject to the property’s guidelines and event-specific terms.</p>"}, {"id": 965, "question": "Is The Leela Mumbai the right fit for your guest size, style and budget?", "answer": "<p>The Leela Mumbai is the ideal wedding venue for mid to large weddings, comfortably hosting around 200 to 800 guests depending on the setup. It is quite convenient for visitors from other countries because it is close to the airport and other popular places in the city. The property’s location is ideal for opulent, modern weddings with sophisticated décor.</p>"}, {"id": 966, "question": "Does The Leela Mumbai provide a bar service for weddings?", "answer": "<p>Yes, The Leela Mumbai provides an in-house bar for weddings and celebrations. Outside alcohol is not allowed inside the property<strong>.&nbsp;</strong>All beverages and drinks must be purchased from the hotel’s bar, as they are charged separately based on consumption.</p>"}]', '382', '398'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'mumbai' AND `slug` = 'the-leela-mumbai');
