SELECT 'mumbai', 'the-oberoi-mumbai', 'published', 'The Oberoi Mumbai Wedding Cost & Hotel Booking', 'Explore The Oberoi Mumbai wedding cost, booking & hotel packages. Plan your luxury destination wedding at The Oberoi Mumbai with the best prices & deals.', 'the oberoi mumbai wedding cost, the oberoi mumbai wedding, the oberoi mumbai hotel wedding, the oberoi mumbai booking, the oberoi mumbai reviews', '/storage/hotel/seo/0MyuRhvUEgnGuysQoGmm3uJlTDZk6SAWUpRrTn8g.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/L2PNemrX7cwanuDCxrAMYO6rBmIUmkh98VrFkzqu.jpg', 'The Oberoi Mumbai', 'Nariman Point, Mumbai, Maharashtra – 400021, India, India', '60 Minutes', '20 Minutes', '<p>Overlooking the iconic Marine Drive,&nbsp;<strong>The Oberoi, Mumbai,</strong> gives you clear views of the Arabian Sea and the curve of the Queen’s Necklace. Large windows bring in natural light throughout the day, while the hotel’s quiet setting offers a contrast to the pace of South Mumbai. Accommodations feature views of Mumbai’s iconic skyline, the lively stretch of Marine Drive and the open sea at Nariman Point.&nbsp;</p><p>The hotel is the perfect venue for intimate wedding celebrations and private functions. Two sea-facing function suites feature large windows and timeless, understated interiors, accommodating up to 50 guests. These spaces are perfect for engagement ceremonies, small receptions and gatherings centred around close family and friends. The hotel effortlessly impresses guests with its unparalleled bars and dining experiences, set in the heart of one of India’s most vibrant metropolitan cities.&nbsp;</p>', '287', 'Udaipur Suite, Jaipur Suite', 'Na', '600', '600', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/qSKjuFSJ4HF7gIL5pib7Jge8vmL2NiSrpUqt5N61.jpg", "title": "5 in-house restaurants, bars and lounges"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/14i886IkvBtSFfQu3yIXHaGseK3IiauKeBcYYQD4.jpg", "title": "Seaside location"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/yADRH8QfRiiIvtrhOiAQ1c3yp8zyAg1DkWDvmvcs.jpg", "title": "Private poolside dinner for couples"}]', '[{"id": 258, "question": "What is the nearest airport to The Oberoi, Mumbai?", "answer": "<p>The nearest airport to&nbsp;<strong>The Oberoi,</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Mumbai,&nbsp;</strong>is the Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj International Airport (BOM). The hotel is 25 km away, with travel time ranging from 45 minutes to an hour, depending on traffic conditions.</p>"}, {"id": 259, "question": "When is the peak season for The Oberoi, Mumbai?", "answer": "<p>Peak wedding season at&nbsp;<strong>The Oberoi, Mumba</strong>i, runs from November to February. These cooler months are highly coveted for ceremonies, making early bookings essential for the hotel’s premium venues.</p>"}, {"id": 260, "question": "Can I host a pre-wedding shoot at The Oberoi, Mumbai?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>The Oberoi, Mumbai,</strong> allows pre-wedding shoots, usually for couples hosting their ceremony there. These sessions capture stunning views of the Marine Drive skyline and elegant hotel interiors.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 261, "question": "What are the official check-in and check-out timings at The Oberoi, Mumbai? Are there any late check-in or check-out privileges available for wedding couples?", "answer": "<p>At&nbsp;<strong>The Oberoi, Mumbai</strong>, check-in is at 2:00 PM, and check-out is at 12:00 noon. Wedding couples may request late check-out privileges, subject to room availability and prior arrangement.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 262, "question": "What is the official liquor policy of The Oberoi, Mumbai?", "answer": "<p>Alcohol consumption is allowed inside&nbsp;<strong>The Oberoi, Mumbai.&nbsp;</strong>However, all drinks and cocktails for wedding events should be purchased from the hotel’s in-house restaurants and bars. These are billed separately and not included in your standard wedding package.&nbsp;</p>"}]', '371', '287'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'mumbai' AND `slug` = 'the-oberoi-mumbai');
