SELECT 'mumbai', 'the-st-regis-mumbai', 'published', 'The St. Regis Mumbai Wedding Cost, Packages & Hotel Booking', 'The St Regis Mumbai wedding cost, wedding packages, hotel booking & venue details. Plan your luxury wedding at The St Regis Mumbai India. Book now.', 'the st regis mumbai wedding cost, the st regis mumbai wedding packages, the st regis mumbai wedding hotel booking, the st regis mumbai booking, the st regis mumbai mumbai india', '/storage/hotel/seo/tDUTJqt0z0POxRP6C1E8QabBmLXeBKVucEwhTNx7.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/Rj9rXOAw7NiXmZx6uDPABaNVJCD6ihmGx5y7tMpb.jpg', 'The St Regis Mumbai', '462, Senapati Bapat Marg, Lower Parel, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400013., India', '40 Minutes', '5 Minutes', '<p>A&nbsp;<strong>wedding at The St. Regis Mumbai&nbsp;</strong>feels unapologetically grand, right from the moment you look up at the building. Rising above Lower Parel, it’s one of the tallest hotel towers in the city, with sweeping skyline views and a setting that feels very &ldquo;Mumbai” in its energy. For couples planning to host a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at The St. Regis Mumbai</strong>, the location works in your favour, with shopping, nightlife and business districts all within walking distance.</p><p>The Astor Ballroom is where most of the magic happens. Large, pillarless and framed by statement chandeliers, this grand venue holds its scale beautifully without feeling overwhelming. What stands out is how the spaces feel naturally well-lit, even before décor comes in. As you step into this five-star luxury hotel, the scale is clear right away. High ceilings, wide pre-function areas and statement lighting set the tone.</p><p>What really stays with people is how a&nbsp;<strong>wedding experience at The St. Regis Mumbai</strong> is managed. The team is sharp and attentive, but never intrusive. Food is a highlight, with strong Indian and regional menus. Between events, guests move between their rooms, the bars and Lower Parel, so the entire stay feels easy and well-paced.</p>', '395', 'The Astor Ballroom, Celebration Rooms, Legacy Room', 'Astor Terrace', '800', '800', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/U5lr2ScEKjwY66ovuXFcoeSMnvS9qYyeFeuAcoDq.jpg", "title": "7+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/fCmdEd4MiHn6yCHfrTVSvnwg2Uxrwb6wudlQDVKx.jpg", "title": "Bespoke multi-cuisine chef-curated menus"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/d9OK0Lyw1p02fiGso2M1EBERRSeXHVQNiXw40cQD.jpg", "title": "Personalised romantic in-room celebrations"}]', '[{"id": 278, "question": "Which is the nearest airport to The St. Regis Mumbai?", "answer": "<p>Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj International Airport is about 18-20 km from&nbsp;<strong>The St. Regis Mumbai</strong>. A car ride from the airport to the hotel usually takes around 35-45 minutes, depending on traffic.</p>"}, {"id": 279, "question": "What is the check-in time at The St. Regis Mumbai, and is early check-in available?", "answer": "<p>The standard time to check-in at&nbsp;<strong>The St. Regis Mumbai</strong> is 3:00 pm, and the check-out time is 12:00 noon. An early check-in service can be arranged, subject to hotel availability.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 280, "question": "Where did Virat Kohli and Anushka Sharma host their wedding reception?", "answer": "<p><strong>The St. Regis Mumbai</strong> hosted Virat Kohli and Anushka Sharma’s Mumbai reception at The Astor Ballroom.</p>"}, {"id": 281, "question": "How much can I save if I make a booking at The St. Regis Mumbai through Viraaya Weddings?", "answer": "<p>Booking<strong> The St. Regis Mumbai</strong> through Viraaya Weddings can help you save around 10-15% or more. You also benefit from smoother planning, trusted vendor access and better on-ground coordination.</p>"}, {"id": 282, "question": "What is the standard liquor policy of The St. Regis Mumbai?", "answer": "<p>Outside alcohol is not allowed at&nbsp;<strong>The St. Regis Mumbai.</strong> All beverages must be purchased exclusively from the hotel and are charged on a per-consumption basis, separate from standard wedding packages.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '96', '395'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'mumbai' AND `slug` = 'the-st-regis-mumbai');
