SELECT 'mumbai', 'the-taj-mahal-palace-mumbai', 'published', 'The Taj Mahal Palace Mumbai Wedding Cost & Booking', 'The Taj Mahal Palace Mumbai wedding cost, booking & venue details. Plan a royal wedding at Taj Mahal Palace Hotel Mumbai. Check price & book now.', 'the taj mahal palace mumbai wedding cost, the taj mahal palace mumbai wedding , taj mahal palace mumbai wedding cost, hotel taj mahal palace mumbai booking, taj mahal palace mumbai booking, hotel taj mahal palace mumbai booking, taj mahal palace hotel mumbai', '/storage/hotel/seo/f95McxGBCCpsfLy4EyOqlhZXgoZ8waJQvafddldA.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/ZWbD2K3xydVYSXfcq72xR5zKY32ue7zn3LnTWori.jpg', 'The Taj Mahal Palace Mumbai', 'Apollo Bandar, Colaba, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400001, India', '60 Minutes', '15 minutes', '<p>A&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at The Taj Mahal Palace, Mumbai,</strong> feels different the moment you see it. The grand Indo-Saracenic architecture, the red dome, the sea-facing façade, it’s instantly recognisable and undeniably 5-star. There’s history in every corridor, but it never feels dated. Instead, it gives your wedding a setting that already feels iconic, without needing heavy décor to make a statement.</p><p>What makes a<strong> destination wedding at this 5-star deluxe property in Mumbai</strong> truly stand out is how everything comes together. Taj’s hospitality feels dependable, with teams that handle everything, so things run smoothly without you having to step in. The airport is located about an hour away, and the hotel’s Colaba location keeps you close to Mumbai’s popular spots. Inside, you get multiple dining options, spa and wellness centres, so your&nbsp;<strong>wedding stay at The Taj Mahal Palace, Mumbai,&nbsp;</strong>feels like an immersive experience.</p><p>The venues do most of the talking. Ornate ballrooms, sea-facing lawns and elegant indoor spaces give you the flexibility to design each function your way. Add to that the food, the service and the setting, and it becomes a celebration people don’t easily forget.</p>', '246', 'Crystal Ballroom, Ballroom, Rendezvous, Gateway Room, Prince’s Room, Golden Room', 'Baradari Lawn, Poolside Lawns', '560', '560', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/nkanzmM5qdSydC8IZ5v5iYDLZ1Rcho5xzhvGtQSK.jpg", "title": "9+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/OCYiHaaPCWDwaHKu9eBeq8GfxJEzzwSLlIspmIs3.jpg", "title": "Exclusive poolside cabana retreat"}]', '[{"id": 273, "question": "Which is the closest airport to The Taj Mahal Palace, Mumbai?", "answer": "<p>Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj International Airport is the nearest airport to<strong> The Taj Mahal Palace, Mumbai,</strong> located around 25-27 km away. A taxi or cab usually takes around 40 minutes, depending on traffic.</p>"}, {"id": 274, "question": "Is an early check-in available at The Taj Mahal Palace, Mumbai?", "answer": "<p>Yes, an early check-in facility can be requested, and accommodation is subject to availability. The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>The Taj Mahal Palace, Mumbai,</strong> is 2:00 pm, and the check-out time is 12:00 noon.</p>"}, {"id": 275, "question": "Where was Saif Ali Khan and Kareena Kapoor’s wedding reception held?", "answer": "<p><strong>The Taj Mahal Palace, Mumbai,&nbsp;</strong>hosted one of Saif Ali Khan and Kareena Kapoor’s wedding receptions in 2012.</p>"}, {"id": 276, "question": "Are there any special offers for wedding couples at The Taj Mahal Palace, Mumbai?", "answer": "<p>At&nbsp;<strong>The Taj Mahal Palace, Mumbai,</strong> Viraaya Weddings'' seasonal wedding deals can help you get better pricing, plus planning support and trusted vendor access.</p>"}, {"id": 277, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol to The Taj Mahal Palace, Mumbai?", "answer": "<p>No, you can’t bring your own alcohol to<strong> The Taj Mahal Palace, Mumbai</strong>. All beverages are arranged by the hotel and charged separately on a per-consumption basis.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '99', '246'
