SELECT 'mumbai', 'the-westin-mumbai-powai-lake', 'published', 'The Westin Mumbai Powai Lake Wedding Cost & Hotel Booking', 'The Westin Mumbai Powai Lake is a stunning lakeside wedding destination. Discover wedding cost, booking options & packages for your perfect wedding today.', 'the westin mumbai powai lake wedding cost, the westin mumbai powai lake wedding, the westin mumbai powai lake booking, the westin mumbai powai lake mumbai, westin mumbai powai lake', '/storage/hotel/seo/uii6zwjZNanf6S1nzx9uDzarrVGhW93b0Bwka6PP.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/ghTtgOoPScHoHarnmV72ERmXFdpALS3jObKvbrmS.jpg', 'The Westin Mumbai Powai Lake', '2 & 3B, near Chinmayanand Ashram, Kailash Nagar, Mayur Nagar, Morarji Nagar, Powai, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400087, India', '30 minutes', '20 Minutes', '<p>A&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at The Westin Mumbai Powai Lake&nbsp;</strong>feels calm in a way you don’t usually associate with Mumbai. Situated right alongside the Powai Lake, this 5-star property gives you open views, greenery and a sense of space that instantly slows things down. It’s still very much in the city, but once you’re inside, it doesn’t feel like it.</p><p>If you’re planning a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Mumbai</strong>, this is where the setting really works in your favour. The hotel''s grand scale means you can host multiple functions without any of your wedding festivities overlapping or feeling cramped. Guests can enjoy the 15-acre property at their own pace, and the whole celebration flows naturally since everything is in one place.</p><p>What makes the wedding experience at&nbsp;<strong>The Westin Mumbai Powai Lake</strong> feel immersive is how guests experience it. The lake views, expansive lawns and comfortable accommodations come together in a way that feels relaxed rather than staged. People don’t feel like they’re rushing from one event to another, which is often what makes a wedding memorable here.</p>', '604', 'Grand Ballroom, Powai Ballroom', 'Upper Gardens', '1210', '1210', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/7a4IeK13KjLe7gZl6hL95VsZevJAgpMacCm0lhmd.jpg", "title": "6+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/qMToOn6qwd5OUq1k3c5tmP9cc2jwZGkpJmLcT5PV.jpg", "title": "Skyline rooftop dining experiences"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/SzyzxeUJkKqm6Y2k18mqKJ8iTCJe11Wm7b9o7A72.jpg", "title": "Lakeview candlelit private dining"}]', '[{"id": 263, "question": "Are early check-ins and late check-outs available at The Westin Mumbai Powai Lake?", "answer": "<p>Yes, early check-in and late check-out at&nbsp;<strong>The Westin Mumbai Powai Lake</strong> can be arranged, subject to availability. The standard time to check-in is 3:00 pm, and the check-out time is 12:00 noon.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 264, "question": "Which is the nearest airport to The Westin Mumbai Powai Lake?", "answer": "<p>Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj International Airport is the nearest airport to&nbsp;<strong>The Westin Mumbai Powai Lake,&nbsp;</strong>located about 6 km away. A car ride roughly takes 15–20 minutes, depending on traffic conditions.</p>"}, {"id": 265, "question": "Are there nearby attractions or activities for international guests around The Westin Mumbai Powai Lake?", "answer": "<p>Yes, near&nbsp;<strong>The Westin Mumbai Powai Lake,</strong> guests can enjoy the Powai Lake promenade, dining at Hiranandani Gardens, shopping at R City Mall and visits to the nearby Mahakali Caves and the IIT Bombay campus.</p>"}, {"id": 266, "question": "Can I host a pre-wedding photoshoot at The Westin Mumbai Powai Lake?", "answer": "<p>Yes, as a lakeside wedding venue in Mumbai,&nbsp;<strong>The Westin Mumbai Powai Lake</strong> allows pre-wedding shoots, subject to permission, availability and applicable charges.</p>"}, {"id": 267, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol to The Westin Mumbai Powai Lake?", "answer": "<p>No, outside alcohol is not allowed at<strong> The Westin Mumbai Powai Lake.&nbsp;</strong>All beverages must be exclusively sourced through the hotel and will be billed separately based on consumption.</p>"}]', '106', '604'
