SELECT 'mumbai', 'trident-nariman-point-mumbai', 'published', 'Trident Hotel Nariman Point Mumbai Grand Wedding Cost', 'Discover Trident Nariman Point Mumbai wedding cost, luxury venue details, premium accommodations, catering, décor & guest experiences. Check availability!', 'trident hotel nariman point mumbai wedding, trident hotel nariman point mumbai wedding cost, trident nariman point mumbai wedding, trident nariman point mumbai wedding cost, trident nariman point, trident nariman point mumbai', '/storage/hotel/seo/nhmTo1XJ3aSOMGAQ4suI9NEQunQ1RyMzwq6dFEjP.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/SKMlOnqnqQGdKIWKLgkV2OkCvv2Fzah8kulwwine.jpg', 'Trident Nariman Point Mumbai', 'Marine Drive, Nariman Point, Mumbai., India', '60 Minutes', '15 minutes', '<p>Holding space along the iconic Marine Drive,&nbsp;<strong>Trident Hotel, Nariman Point, Mumbai,</strong> offers panoramic views of the Arabian Sea and the glittering arc of the Queen''s Necklace. Part of The Oberoi Group, one of India''s most respected names in luxury hospitality, the property combines warm and attentive service with a setting that few venues in Mumbai can rival. Within walking distance of Mumbai''s major financial institutions, cultural centres and boutique shopping, the hotel is also approximately 28 kilometres from the domestic terminal, making it convenient for travelling guests.&nbsp;</p><p><strong>The Trident Hotel, Nariman Point</strong>, offers close to 1,000 square metres of dedicated event space across multiple venues, accommodating celebrations of up to 750 guests. The Regal Room, the flagship banquet hall, has previously hosted international celebrities and high-profile events. A dedicated banqueting team oversees every event, coordinating décor, catering, music and logistics from planning to execution.</p>', '586 rooms with suites', 'The Regal Room, Sunset Lounge, Malabar, Mexican Room', 'The Roof Top', '1200', '1200', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/EtEFs2E7ZxyLECzU4JAkWhEYiXcCRcfmxWhyKQio.jpg", "title": "4 in-house dining and bar destinations"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/Ns2BAVNPzocS8thGIRCUKUOCb1T83PWy2YUZAmRp.jpg", "title": "Trident spa with signature treatments"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/zcLhAffvT2XJnj114LCdZfnrIzTiLLqGYCejb3Rb.jpg", "title": "Dedicated banqueting team"}]', '[{"id": 1067, "question": "What are the check-in and check-out timings at Trident Hotel, Nariman Point, Mumbai, and are there any early check-in or late check-out privileges?", "answer": "<p>Standard check-in at<strong> Trident Hotel, Nariman Point, Mumbai</strong> is at 2:00 PM, and check-out is at 12:00 noon. Wedding couples and guests may request early check-in or late check-out, subject to room availability on the day of arrival or departure.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 1068, "question": "Can I host a pre-wedding photoshoot at Trident, Nariman Point, Mumbai?", "answer": "<p><strong>Trident Hotel, Nariman Point, Mumbai</strong>, offers a range of visually compelling features that make for striking pre-wedding photographs. Photoshoots at the property require prior approval from the hotel''s events team and are subject to venue availability. Couples who have an active booking are encouraged to discuss photoshoot access and any applicable fees directly with their designated events coordinator.</p>"}, {"id": 1069, "question": "Are drones and fireworks permitted at Trident, Nariman Point, Mumbai?", "answer": "<p>Drone usage and fireworks at&nbsp;<strong>Trident Hotel, Nariman Point, Mumbai,</strong> are subject to the hotel''s operational guidelines as well as applicable civil aviation and municipal regulations, particularly given the property''s location in a dense urban and coastal zone.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 1070, "question": "How far in advance should I book Trident Hotel, Nariman Point, Mumbai, for my wedding?", "answer": "<p>Given the high demand for&nbsp;<strong>Trident Hotel, Nariman Point, Mumbai</strong>, particularly during the peak wedding season from October to February, it is strongly recommended to secure your booking at least 12 to 18 months in advance.</p>"}, {"id": 1071, "question": "What is the official liquor policy at Trident Hotel, Nariman Point, for wedding events?", "answer": "<p><strong>The Trident Hotel at Nariman Point</strong> does not permit outside alcohol to be brought onto the premises for any wedding or private event. All alcoholic and non-alcoholic beverages served at your celebration must be sourced exclusively through the hotel''s licensed in-house bar and beverage service.&nbsp;</p>"}]', '105', '586'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'mumbai' AND `slug` = 'trident-nariman-point-mumbai');
