SELECT 'mussoorie', 'jaypee-residency-manor', 'published', 'Jaypee Residency Manor Mussoorie Wedding Cost & Booking', 'Jaypee Residency Manor Mussoorie wedding cost, packages & booking details. Plan a scenic hill destination wedding at Jaypee Manor Mussoorie. Enquire now.', 'jaypee residency manor mussoorie wedding, jaypee residency manor mussoorie wedding cost, jaypee residency manor mussoorie package, jaypee residency manor mussoorie booking, jaypee hotel mussoorie wedding cost, jaypee manor mussoorie wedding, jaypee mussoorie destination wedding, jaypee mussoorie wedding cost', '/storage/hotel/seo/fhBhb9WrQD8KKp0EWe55Osp6nE5FHLCxfq7f9xIg.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/5FiPNT5vmPQlFjmELOF1jw4ZLKn89UskM93bsPRA.jpg', 'Jaypee Residency Manor', 'Road, Barlow Ganj, Mussoorie, Uttarakhand 248122, India', '120 Minutes', '60 Minutes', '<p>The&nbsp;<strong>Jaypee Residency Manor, Mussoorie</strong> offers 360-degree views of the Doon Valley and the snow-capped Himalayan ranges. Drawing inspiration from the colonial era, the property’s misty surroundings create a hill-station setting ideal for a fairytale wedding in Mussoorie.</p><p>As evening falls, couples can exchange their wedding vows with the stunning winter line behind them. Rejoice as you host intimate gatherings in terraced gardens and soak in a starlit evening. The hotel’s dining and event spaces add sophistication to every celebration, while attentive, personalised service ensures each celebration runs smoothly.</p><p>Accommodations at the property range from cosy Manor Rooms with sweeping valley views to luxurious Executive Suites where floor-to-ceiling windows showcase the majestic peaks.&nbsp;<strong>Jaypee Residency Manor in Mussoorie</strong> offers a picturesque setting for a wedding celebration. It’s got everything a new couple could possibly want: modern amenities, vintage charm and an unbeatable view in the heart of Mussoorie.</p>', '135 rooms and suites', 'Ballroom, Oak Hall, Pine Hall', 'Western Court, Eastern Court', '310', '310', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/w0fH4NZl7RBNcRQ8SpmgsmKMDhOX1BM0gQDpmjOl.jpg", "title": "4+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/S0QdmBkpFO17RwlAdiZDci942VsVNvlxlLHlU5kH.jpg", "title": "Private mountain-top dining under stars"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/cbreJrUIddDFm0icua1jAewjlSNxvtq92dJXZ5oS.jpg", "title": "Romantic picnic by a waterfall experience"}]', '[{"id": 193, "question": "How much does a Jaypee Residency Manor, Mussoorie wedding cost?", "answer": "<p>The standard cost of a destination wedding at&nbsp;<strong>Jaypee Residency Manor, Mussoorie,&nbsp;</strong>usually falls within the range of INR 75 lakhs to INR 1 Cr for a 3-day, 2-night celebration. To get an exact quote within seconds, enter your preferred dates of stay, the total number of rooms required, the total guest capacity and other relevant details in Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator.</p>"}, {"id": 194, "question": "Can I host a pre-wedding photoshoot at Jaypee Residency Manor, Mussoorie?", "answer": "<p>Yes, you can host a pre-wedding photoshoot at Jaypee Residency Manor, Mussoorie. Some of the best spots for photography at this property include the terrace gardens and landscaped lawns that offer panoramic views of the Himalayan Hills. However, you may need to contact the hotel authorities in advance regarding availability, photo shoot permissions, and any additional costs.</p>"}, {"id": 195, "question": "Which is better: Jaypee Residency Manor, Mussoorie, or Taj Mussoorie Foothills, Dehradun?", "answer": "<p>Jaypee Residency Manor has 135 rooms and a wedding budget of INR 75 lakhs to 1 Cr. It is a beautiful hilltop setting located at least 2 hours from Jolly Grant Airport. Taj Mussoorie Foothills has 115 rooms, and a wedding here can cost between INR 90 lakhs and INR 1.25 Cr. It has a classy, private feel and is only 55–65 minutes from Jolly Grant Airport, making it easily accessible. Both offer luxury and beautiful surroundings, so the choice comes down to whether you value a slightly larger guest capacity or ease of travel.</p>"}, {"id": 196, "question": "What is the check-in time at Jaypee Residency Manor in Mussoorie, and can we check in early?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at Jaypee Residency Manor, Mussoorie is 3:00 pm, and the check-out time is by 12:00 noon. Guests can request an early check-in, but it is subject to hotel availability.</p>"}, {"id": 197, "question": "What is the Jaypee Residency Manor, Mussoorie’s liquor policy?", "answer": "<p>Guests can enjoy alcohol at Jaypee Residency Manor, Mussoorie, but all drinks in public areas and banquet spaces must be purchased from the hotel. Alcohol from outside the property is not allowed. Beverages are billed per consumption and are generally not included in standard wedding packages.</p>"}]', '64', '135'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'mussoorie' AND `slug` = 'jaypee-residency-manor');
--> statement-breakpoint
