SELECT 'mussoorie', 'jw-marriott-mussoorie-walnut-grove-resort-and-spa', 'published', 'JW Marriott Mussoorie Walnut Grove Resort & Spa Wedding Cost', 'JW Marriott Mussoorie wedding cost, destination wedding packages & venue booking details. Plan your luxury hill wedding at Walnut Grove Resort & Spa. Book now.', 'jw marriott mussoorie destination wedding cost, jw marriott mussoorie wedding cost, jw marriott mussoorie wedding, jw marriott mussoorie wedding package, wedding cost at jw marriott mussoorie, jw marriott mussoorie destination wedding, jw marriott mussoorie walnut grove mussoorie', '/storage/hotel/seo/DjcKRYlM3YsfsQpj2e0cSN7l9EW3dZmZ8cBngSJS.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/NPHSjd64kp8oo4lsWVWPeXX7cAf3GWTUPHuDg1Y9.jpg', 'JW Marriott Mussoorie Walnut Grove Resort And Spa', 'Village - Siya, Kempty Fall Rd, Mussoorie, Uttarakhand 248179, India', '120 Minutes', '90 Minutes', '<p>JW Marriott Mussoorie Walnut Grove Resort &amp; Spa sits high above the Garhwal valleys, framed by oak forests and mountain pathways. Terraces and verandas overlook uninterrupted Himalayan views, giving the entire setting a sense of calm seclusion.</p><p>Imagine a wedding morning with sunlight streaming onto the immaculate lawns, and petals arranged along paths leading to a mandap framed by the stunning view of the hills. As the chilly breeze carries a faint pine scent, guests can unwind while photographers capture every last detail. At larger celebrations, candlelit dinners and starlit get-togethers create an enchanting atmosphere, perfect for a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in the Mussoorie&nbsp;</strong>Hills.</p><p>JW Marriott Mussoorie Walnut Grove Resort &amp; Spa brings together exceptional dining experiences with both local and international flavours. Marriott’s personalised service and impeccable hospitality ensure every wedding feels deeply memorable for couples and their guests.</p>', '105 rooms with 10 suites', 'Grand Orchard Ballroom, Amphitheatre', 'JW Lawn, Landscaped Gardens', '270', '270', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/eSVS2MF3PQQpl6vC389YBAod1goSuC1ic3HOKLog.jpg", "title": "6+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/ohsFUmzTH1dPMSwszkPBKC4eRnbbCK1BCJEJVA5o.jpg", "title": "JW dome dining starlit dinner"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/SlPCIVTVBuImTvaGgQkU52WJbJmH8nwcqclpPkqi.jpg", "title": "Cedar Spa couples’ treatments"}]', '[{"id": 188, "question": "How much does a JW Marriott Mussoorie Walnut Grove Resort & Spa wedding cost?", "answer": "<p>Usually,&nbsp;<strong>JW Marriott Mussoorie destination wedding costs</strong> fall within the range of INR 90 lakhs to INR 1.5 Cr for a 3-day, 2-night wedding celebration. Use Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator to estimate the wedding cost. Simply enter your preferred dates of stay, the total number of rooms required, the total guest capacity and any other details, then click on ‘Calculate Hotel Cost’ to get the exact quote within seconds.</p>"}, {"id": 189, "question": "Which is the nearest airport to the JW Marriott Mussoorie Walnut Grove Resort & Spa?", "answer": "<p>The nearest airport to the JW Marriott Mussoorie Walnut Grove Resort &amp; Spa is the Jolly Grant Airport (DED) in Dehradun. Located approximately 60 to 66 km away, the travel time by car is around 2 to 2.5 hours, depending on weather and traffic</p>"}, {"id": 190, "question": "Which is better: JW Marriott Mussoorie Walnut Grove Resort & Spa or Hyatt Regency Dehradun Resort and Spa?", "answer": "<p>With 115 rooms and a more picturesque, mountain-led aesthetic, JW Marriott Mussoorie Walnut Grove Resort &amp; Spa is perfect for high-end weddings with a budget of INR 90 lakhs to INR 1.35 Cr for 250 guests and a 2–2.5 hour car transfer. Meanwhile, with 263 rooms, easier 1-hour access and price range of&nbsp; INR 1.6 Cr&nbsp; INR 1.9 Cr for 400 guests. Hyatt Regency boasts a modern resort aesthetic. While making a choice, select Hyatt for its convenience and scale, and JW for its breathtaking ambience and exclusivity</p>"}, {"id": 191, "question": "What is the check-in time at JW Marriott Mussoorie Walnut Grove Resort & Spa, and can we check-in early?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at JW Marriott Mussoorie Walnut Grove Resort &amp; Spa is 3:00 pm, and guests can check-out by 12:00 noon. Guests who come to attend a wedding at the property can request an early check-in, and it can be accommodated, subject to hotel availability.</p>"}, {"id": 192, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol for a JW Marriott Mussoorie Walnut Grove Resort & Spa destination wedding?", "answer": "<p>No, liquor from outside is not allowed at JW Marriott Mussoorie Walnut Grove Resort &amp; Spa. All alcoholic and non-alcoholic drinks are served in public areas and banquet spaces through the hotel itself. Please note that beverages are billed separately, depending on consumption and are not a part of the standard destination wedding package.</p>"}]', '65', '115'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'mussoorie' AND `slug` = 'jw-marriott-mussoorie-walnut-grove-resort-and-spa');
