SELECT 'mussoorie', 'royal-orchid-fort-resort-mussoorie', 'published', 'Royal Orchid Fort Resort Mussoorie Wedding Cost – Book Now!', 'Royal Orchid Fort Resort Mussoorie blends colonial charm with modern luxury. Check wedding costs, guest reviews & direct booking for a memorable stay.', 'royal orchid fort resort mussoorie wedding, royal orchid fort resort mussoorie wedding cost, royal orchid fort resort mussoorie india, royal orchid fort resort mussoorie reviews, the royal orchid fort resort mussoorie', '/storage/hotel/seo/nThPj9Xd3W2aeVWyq2mlfLWOeRTexRgj1rsySA7x.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/Eyo6crooKIgYQK5w2f0is2Hcd2YRjrkmJhiyafRi.jpg', 'Royal Orchid Fort Resort Mussoorie', 'Tara Hall Estate, Picture Palace Road, The Mall Road, Mussoorie, Uttarakhand 248179, India', '90 minutes', '60 Minutes', '<p>There is something quietly magical about a&nbsp;<strong>wedding at Royal Orchid Fort Resort, Mussoorie</strong>. Spread across the historic 6-acre Tara Hall Estate,&nbsp;<strong>Royal Orchid Fort Resort, Mussoorie</strong> feels less like a typical hotel and more like a mountain retreat suspended above the Doon Valley. Recently refreshed with contemporary interiors, the property blends fortress-style stone architecture with warm teakwood finishes, panoramic terraces and uninterrupted Himalayan views, creating a setting that feels naturally grand without trying too hard.</p><p>For couples planning a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Mussoorie</strong>,&nbsp;<strong>Royal Orchid Fort Resort, Mussoorie,</strong> offers venues that each bring a different mood to the celebration. The Courtyard opens directly towards the valley for sunset pheras, the Pine Terrace comes alive for cocktail evenings under the stars and the Sundeck feels perfect for intimate haldi brunches with mountain air all around. Its location near Mall Road also keeps guests close to Mussoorie’s cafés, viewpoints and local experiences, while Jolly Grant Airport sits around 51 km away for easier wedding travel.</p><p>The stay itself becomes part of the celebration at&nbsp;<strong>Royal Orchid Fort Resort, Mussoorie</strong>. The 91 rooms and suites overlook cloudy hills or Dehradun’s sparkling night lights, while Pinxx serves comforting Garhwali flavours alongside classic celebratory dining experiences.</p>', '91 rooms with suites', 'Summer Hall, Winter Hall', 'Courtyard, Sundeck, Pine Terrace', '200', '200', '[{"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal02.png", "title": "2+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal03.png", "title": "Skyline candlelit balcony dining"}]', '[{"id": 862, "question": "Which months are most popular for weddings at Royal Orchid Fort Resort, Mussoorie?", "answer": "<p>April to June and October to November are the busiest wedding months at Royal Orchid Fort Resort, Mussoorie. Pleasant weather and clear valley views make outdoor celebrations especially popular during this time.</p>"}, {"id": 863, "question": "What is the standard check-in, check-out time at Royal Orchid Fort Resort, Mussoorie, and can we get an early check-in?", "answer": "<p>The standard time to check-in to&nbsp;<strong>Royal Orchid Fort Resort, Mussoorie</strong> is 3:00 pm, and check-out is at 11:00 am. Guests can request an early check-in to the hotel, but it is entirely subject to the hotel’s discretion.</p>"}, {"id": 864, "question": "Are there suggested excursions or experiences near Royal Orchid Fort, Mussoorie?", "answer": "<p>Guests staying at&nbsp;<strong>Royal Orchid Fort Resort, Mussoorie</strong> often explore Mall Road, Camel’s Back Road, Kempty Falls, Gun Hill ropeway rides and Lal Tibba viewpoints nearby. Short drives from the resort also lead to George Everest Peak, Cloud’s End and charming hillside cafés.</p>"}, {"id": 865, "question": "How early should I book Royal Orchid Fort Resort, Mussoorie, for a destination wedding?", "answer": "<p>It is best to book&nbsp;<strong>Royal Orchid Fort Resort, Mussoorie</strong> at least 8 to 12 months in advance. Peak summer and autumn wedding dates usually get reserved much earlier.</p>"}, {"id": 866, "question": "What is the standard liquor policy at Royal Orchid Fort Resort, Mussoorie?", "answer": "<p><strong>Royal Orchid Fort Resort, Mussoorie,</strong> usually serves alcohol through its own bar service. Outside liquor is generally not allowed for wedding events. and beverages are billed based on actual consumption.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '249', '91'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'mussoorie' AND `slug` = 'royal-orchid-fort-resort-mussoorie');
