SELECT 'mussoorie', 'welcomhotel-by-itc-hotels-the-savoy', 'published', 'Welcomhotel ITC The Savoy Mussoorie Wedding Cost & Booking', 'Dreaming of a hill station wedding? Welcomhotel ITC The Savoy Mussoorie offers scenic venues & packages. Check wedding cost & book via Viraaya Weddings today!', 'welcomhotel the savoy mussoorie wedding, welcome hotel savoy mussoorie wedding, itc savoy mussoorie wedding, the savoy mussoorie wedding package, welcomhotel the savoy mussoorie', '/storage/hotel/seo/EU9dReru3WLcKG8oMkSDJa8DyI50u93O0e1LmPt4.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/LjMp1RHPnEHpzmloX2S6fnDOJvxx09JQ9p0ojYI5.jpg', 'Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels The Savoy', 'Library Bazar, Gandhi Chowk, P.O. Savoy - 248179, Mussoorie, Uttarakhand, India', '150 Minutes', '90 Minutes', '<p>Nestled between 11 acres of gardens and rolling lawns in Mussoorie, the ‘Queen of Hills’,&nbsp;<strong>Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels, The Savoy, Mussoorie</strong> is a stunning example of English Gothic architecture. Featuring pointed arches and fortified rooftops, this property exudes classic hill-station charm, with the interiors and indoor venues offering a beautiful blend of comfort and modernity.</p><p>The hotel offers the perfect setting for a destination wedding in the foothills of the Himalayas. Couples can host unique gatherings on the property''s sunlit terraces or lawns, marvelling at the stunning backdrop of snow-covered hills. ITC Hotels’ hospitality legacy ensures that everything, from planning the event to welcoming guests, is seamlessly taken care of.</p><p>Curated dining adds to the experience, with memorable meals at The Royal Afghan and quiet, peaceful evenings at the Writer’s Bar. Luxurious rooms and suites at&nbsp;<strong>Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels, The Savoy, Mussoorie,</strong> most of them with serene hillside views, offer guests a peaceful and comfortable retreat.&nbsp;</p>', '80 rooms with suites', 'Royal Ballroom', 'Central Lawn, Beer Garden', '200', '200', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/G2FX9F0a7Bl4yeqANpclBBNY2M9I1oK1wPrbxRHM.jpg", "title": "3+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/jJlnrhpmPbysOeX6N2CISf3OVDVxJ1cBkokgrh5z.jpg", "title": "Lively bonfire and storytelling sessions"}]', '[{"id": 198, "question": "How much does a destination wedding at Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels, The Savoy, Mussoorie resort cost?", "answer": "<p>A 3-day, 2-night wedding celebration at the&nbsp;<strong>Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels, The Savoy, Mussoorie,&nbsp;</strong>usually falls within the range of INR 65 lakhs and INR 85 lakhs. To get an estimate of the wedding budget, use Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator. Enter your preferred dates, the total number of rooms required, the guest count and any other details to get an instant, exact quote.</p>"}, {"id": 199, "question": "How to reach Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels, The Savoy, Mussoorie?", "answer": "<p>The nearest airport to the Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels, The Savoy, Mussoorie, is Jolly Grant Airport in Dehradun, around 55 km away, a 1.5 to 2-hour drive by car. On the other hand, the closest railway station to the hotel is Dehradun Railway Station, located 34 km away, about a 1-1.5-hour drive.</p>"}, {"id": 200, "question": "Which is better-suited for a destination wedding: Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels, The Savoy, Mussoorie, or Taj Mussoorie Foothills, Dehradun?", "answer": "<p>The Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels, The Savoy in Mussoorie features 80 premium rooms and suites, with a higher wedding budget ranging from INR 65 lakhs and INR 85 lakhs. It is located 55 km from the airport and offers expansive views of the hill station. On the other hand, the Taj Mussoorie Foothills has 115 rooms and comes with budget options ranging between INR 80 lakhs and INR 1.2 crore. The venue enjoys easy access from Jolly Grant Airport (approximately 30–38 km) and its sophisticated and modern design makes it ideal for intimate gatherings. Choose Welcomhotel for exclusivity, heritage-style settings, and breathtaking mountain views, while Taj is ideal for convenience and a grand scale.</p>"}, {"id": 201, "question": "What is the check-in time at Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels, The Savoy, Mussoorie?", "answer": "<p>The check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels, The Savoy, Mussoorie&nbsp;</strong>is 3:00 pm, and guests should check out by 12:00 noon. If guests need to check in early or check out later than usual, they can contact the hotel directly, and their request can be accommodated, subject to hotel availability.</p>"}, {"id": 202, "question": "What is the liquor policy for destination weddings at Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels, The Savoy, Mussoorie?", "answer": "<p>Alcohol is permitted at Welcomhotel by ITC Hotels, The Savoy, Mussoorie; however, all beverages served in public spaces and banquet halls should be purchased exclusively from the hotel. Getting alcohol from outside the property is not permitted. Beverages are charged separately based on consumption and are typically not included in wedding packages.</p>"}]', '52', '80'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'mussoorie' AND `slug` = 'welcomhotel-by-itc-hotels-the-savoy');
