SELECT 'noida', 'crown-plaza-greater-noida-by-ihg', 'published', 'Crowne Plaza Greater Noida Wedding Cost & Booking', 'Crowne Plaza Greater Noida wedding cost, packages, booking, price & hotel details. Explore Hotel Crowne Plaza Greater Noida for wedding planning. Book now!', 'crowne plaza greater noida wedding cost, crowne plaza greater noida wedding, crowne plaza greater noida booking, hotel crowne plaza greater noida, crowne plaza greater noida price', '/storage/hotel/seo/h0bRdcflpYsvKqkWwWfQVHIc5wVbcevOqZbkNM79.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/mI2oSBxNxzeD3W8BQUBxDBaOIMQPaTn45sLub9td.jpg', 'Crown plaza Greater Noida By IHG', 'Surajpur Chowk, Institutional Green, Greater Noida, Uttar Pradesh 201306, India, India', '90 minutes', '60 Minutes', '<p>A&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at Crowne Plaza Greater Noida by IHG</strong> suits couples planning a large celebration in Delhi NCR. Spread across 8.5 acres, the property clearly separates open-air lawns like Lumbini and Kalpataru from indoor venues such as Tapas and Vedas, making it easy to assign each function its own setting. The 5-star hotel’s contemporary design, with glass façades and wide event spaces, keeps the overall atmosphere open, modern and event-focused.</p><p>For a&nbsp;<strong>wedding in Noida</strong>, the advantage is how easily the hotel manages movement across functions. Baraat entries, poolside events at Tattva and ballroom transitions all sit within a compact, well-linked layout, which helps when you’re hosting back-to-back ceremonies with a large guest list. It reduces the usual stress of coordinating spaces across a big property.</p><p>What also adds value to a wedding experience at Crowne Plaza Greater Noida by IHG is the consistency across dining and hospitality. With multiple in-house restaurants and flexible banquet catering, the experience stays steady even with high guest volumes, which is often where larger weddings tend to feel stretched.</p>', '398', 'Tapas Ballroom, Laksh Banquet Hall, Vedas Banquet Hall, Sadhya Hall', 'Lumbini Lawns, Kalpatru Lawns, Tattva - Premium Al-Fresco', '800', '800', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/H5axoBUrLG0rtjy0lgsqVBknW6TpXSNgF1zcX92Y.jpg", "title": "6+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/WquoxblL8HOKeq7DWEa5uyYb8iButGS9Qe3Ntsj9.jpg", "title": "Intimate alfresco dining experience"}]', '[{"id": 233, "question": "How to reach Crowne Plaza Greater Noida by IHG from the nearest airport?", "answer": "<p>The nearest airport to&nbsp;<strong>Crowne Plaza Greater Noida by IHG is&nbsp;</strong>Hindon Airport (HDO). It is located around 25–33 km away, taking roughly 45 minutes to 1 hour by taxi or cab, depending on traffic. Indira Gandhi International Airport (DEL) is the main international gateway, located around 45–60 km from the hotel.</p>"}, {"id": 234, "question": "Can I bring my own wedding planner/decorator for a wedding at Crowne Plaza Greater Noida by IHG?", "answer": "<p>Yes, you can bring your own wedding planner or decorator to&nbsp;<strong>Crowne Plaza Greater Noida by IHG&nbsp;</strong>for wedding planning. Please ensure that you have the required permits beforehand.</p>"}, {"id": 235, "question": "Are drones, fireworks or baraat allowed at Crowne Plaza Greater Noida by IHG?", "answer": "<p>Baraat, dhol and traditional ceremonies are allowed at<strong> Crowne Plaza Greater Noida</strong>&nbsp;<strong>by IHG</strong>. Fireworks and drones are permitted only with the hotel''s approval and in accordance with local regulations.</p>"}, {"id": 236, "question": "Is an early check-in available at Crowne Plaza Greater Noida by IHG for wedding guests?", "answer": "<p>Yes, an early check-in request can be accommodated, subject to hotel availability. The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Crowne Plaza Greater Noida by IHG&nbsp;</strong>is 3:00 pm, and the check-out time is 12:00 noon.</p>"}, {"id": 237, "question": "What is the standard liquor policy at Crowne Plaza Greater Noida by IHG?", "answer": "<p>Outside alcohol isn’t allowed at&nbsp;<strong>Crowne Plaza Greater Noida by IHG</strong>. All beverages must be arranged exclusively through the hotel itself and are charged separately based on consumption.</p>"}]', '359', '398'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'noida' AND `slug` = 'crown-plaza-greater-noida-by-ihg');
