SELECT 'pune', 'conrad-pune', 'published', 'Conrad Pune Wedding Cost – Check Out Full Package Breakdown', 'Conrad Pune offers breathtaking wedding venues with honest wedding cost details, seamless hotel booking & glowing guest reviews. Enquire Now!', 'conrad pune wedding cost, conrad pune wedding, conrad pune hotel booking, conrad pune booking, conrad hotel pune, conrad pune review', '/storage/hotel/seo/Hetabkfxcd6J9NVvcNGXM1Mv6ZBqay5upL4ktGxN.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/WC7rn80fNNUGZHrox8f6WzYrqQzOjJnQmFjcmASi.jpg', 'Conrad Pune', '7, Mangaldas Rd, Sangamvadi, Pune, Maharashtra 411001, India', '25 Minutes', '15 Minutes', '<p>Some wedding venues impress you with size. A&nbsp;<strong>wedding at Conrad Pune</strong> impresses with its atmosphere. The moment guests walk past its dramatic water features and into the Art Deco-inspired interiors, the hotel feels less like a business retreat and more like a polished urban retreat built for stylish celebrations. Golden lighting, towering ceilings and carefully curated artwork give every event a dressed-up, black-tie energy without ever feeling intimidating.</p><p>For couples planning a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Pune, Conrad</strong> turns the celebration into an immersive wedding weekend filled with movement, glamour and memorable gatherings. Guests drift from indulgent brunches at Coriander Kitchen to sunset cocktails at Al Di La rooftop bar, while intimate moments unfold beside softly lit poolside venues. Inside, the Grand Ballroom stuns with towering 40-foot ceilings, sparkling Czech-crystal chandeliers and a sense of scale that feels made for lavish entrances, grand pheras and unforgettable wedding nights.</p><p>What makes&nbsp;<strong>Conrad Pune</strong> memorable is its visual balance. It feels grand but never overwhelming, luxurious yet deeply welcoming. From personalised hospitality to beautifully choreographed celebrations, the hotel knows how to make a wedding feel social, elegant and effortlessly modern.</p>', '351 rooms with suites', 'Grand Ballroom, Ballroom Sections', 'Poolside Venues, Alfresco Courtyard', '750', '750', '[{"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal02.png", "title": "7+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal03.png", "title": "Candlelit poolside dining for couples"}]', '[{"id": 767, "question": "Which is the nearest airport to Conrad Pune?", "answer": "<p>Pune International Airport (PNQ) is the nearest airport to Conrad Pune. The hotel is around 6 kilometres away, with a drive of about 15 to 25 minutes.</p>"}, {"id": 768, "question": "What are the standard check-in and check-out times at Conrad Pune, and can guests check in early?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Conrad Pune</strong> is 3:00 pm, while guests can check out by 12:00 noon. An early check-in request can be accommodated, subject to hotel availability.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 769, "question": "Can guests explore local sights during their stay at Conrad Pune?", "answer": "<p>Yes, guests staying at&nbsp;<strong>Conrad Pune</strong> can easily explore some of the city’s most popular attractions. Visit Aga Khan Palace, Shaniwar Wada, Koregaon Park, Osho Garden, Raja Dinkar Kelkar Museum and MG Road during your stay.</p>"}, {"id": 770, "question": "Are engagement shoots allowed inside Conrad Pune?", "answer": "<p>Yes, engagement shoots are usually allowed at&nbsp;<strong>Conrad Pune</strong> with prior permission. Additional charges and venue access policies may apply.</p>"}, {"id": 771, "question": "Does Conrad Pune provide a bar service for weddings?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>Conrad Pune&nbsp;</strong>offers dedicated bar service for weddings through the hotel’s in-house catering team. Beverage packages are usually customised separately based on guest preferences and consumption.</p>"}]', '72', '351'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'pune' AND `slug` = 'conrad-pune');
