SELECT 'pune', 'jw-marriott-hotel-pune', 'published', 'JW Marriott Hotel Pune – Luxury Wedding Venue & Cost', 'From grand ballrooms to rooftop celebrations, JW Marriott Hotel Pune offers transparent wedding cost, bespoke packages & unbeatable price. Contact Us!', 'jw marriott pune wedding, jw marriott pune wedding cost, jw marriott pune wedding package, jw marriott hotel pune price, jw marriott pune wedding price', '/storage/hotel/seo/PgKOM36LuQrLHbOhwX2x0VkESr2fD3QbKgG1EoXa.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/U2hCX5Dz3bpVKCSeP7mULRvcz8jchUSxV2WR7vWY.jpg', 'JW Marriott Hotel Pune', 'Senapati Bapat Rd, Laxmi Society, Model Colony, Gokhalenagar, Pune, Maharashtra 411016, India', '35 Minutes', '25 Minutes', '<p>A&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at JW Marriott Hotel Pune</strong> feels closest to the kind of wedding where nobody really wants the weekend to end. At JW Marriott Hotel Pune, guests drift from breakfasts overlooking the hills to shopping next door at Pavillion Mall, disappear for spa appointments in the afternoon and then slowly gather again by evening for cocktails at Paasha as the skyline lights up around them.</p><p>For couples planning a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Pune</strong>, JW Marriott Hotel Pune works well because guests genuinely enjoy spending time at the hotel even when no function is happening. Some end up by the pool for hours, others step out around the area before coming back for the next event, while families settle into the suites and treat the stay like a proper getaway instead of just attending a wedding.</p><p>What gives&nbsp;<strong>JW Marriott Hotel Pune</strong> its edge is the balance between scale and atmosphere. The Grand Ballroom handles large celebrations effortlessly, yet the hotel never feels impersonal. Even with hundreds of guests moving between functions, rooftop dinners, music nights and post-wedding brunches, JW Marriott Hotel Pune still manages to feel warm, social and full of energy right until the very end of the wedding weekend.</p>', '414 rooms with suites', 'The Grand Ballroom, Sabha Rooms', 'Poolside Area', '850', '850', '[{"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal02.png", "title": "8+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal03.png", "title": "Starlit rooftop dinners at Paasha"}]', '[{"id": 807, "question": "Which is the nearest airport to the JW Marriott Hotel Pune?", "answer": "<p>Pune International Airport (PNQ) is the nearest airport to JW Marriott Hotel Pune, around 11-13 km away. A car ride usually takes 20-45 minutes, depending on traffic.</p>"}, {"id": 808, "question": "What is the standard check-in and check-out timing at JW Marriott Hotel Pune, and is early check-in available?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>JW Marriott Hotel Pune</strong> is by 3:00 pm, while check-out time is at 12:00 noon. Guests can request an early check-in, but it is subject to hotel availability.</p>"}, {"id": 809, "question": "What is the ideal budget for a 2-night wedding at the JW Marriott Hotel Pune?", "answer": "<p>The standard cost of a<strong> destination wedding at JW Marriott Hotel Pune&nbsp;</strong>usually falls within the range of INR 80 lakhs to INR 1.2 Cr for a 3-day, 2-night event. Refer to Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator to get an accurate estimate based on your logistical requirements.</p>"}, {"id": 810, "question": "How much can I save if I make a booking at the JW Marriott Hotel Pune through Viraaya Weddings?", "answer": "<p>Booking&nbsp;<strong>JW Marriott Hotel Pune</strong> through Viraaya Weddings can help you save 10–15% or more through negotiated rates, while also giving you easier vendor coordination and wedding planning support.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 811, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol to the JW Marriott Hotel Pune for a wedding?", "answer": "<p>Outside alcohol is generally not permitted at the&nbsp;<strong>JW Marriott Hotel Pune&nbsp;</strong>for weddings, as liquor service is usually managed directly through the hotel. Beverage packages are typically charged separately from wedding packages, based on consumption.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '386', '414'
