SELECT 'pune', 'radisson-blu-hotel-pune-kharadi', 'published', 'Radisson Blu Pune Kharadi Wedding Cost & Booking', 'Celebrate your wedding in style at Radisson Blu Pune Kharadi. Discover all-inclusive wedding packages, detailed cost guides & direct booking options today.', 'radisson blu pune wedding, radisson blu pune wedding cost, radisson blu hotel pune kharadi wedding, radisson blu hotel pune kharadi wedding cost, radisson blu pune kharadi wedding', '/storage/hotel/seo/HlqARoVmwkYdMvIPqLPcMcuUpf2bJieKLQIxRE6j.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/RxqwixLfg0tTFINGLKi9amrR3wdcdSy8NdgktsLM.jpg', 'Radisson Blu Hotel Pune Kharadi', 'Nagar Bypass Road, Pandhari Nagar, Kharadi, Pune, Maharashtra 411014, India', '20 Minutes', '30 Minutes', '<p><strong>Radisson Blu Hotel, Pune Kharadi,&nbsp;</strong>feels closely tied to the city around it. Step outside and you’re in Kharadi’s business stretch with glass offices, traffic and a steady urban rhythm. Built on a compact 1.5-acre space, everything inside feels close and easy to move through, almost like a well-planned city block. Inside, the look is modern and simple, with warm lighting and clean finishes that keep the hotel grounded in its urban setting.</p><p>Location makes things very easy here. Pune International Airport is about 15 to 20 minutes away, so guests can travel smooth and easy. EON IT Park and the wider Kharadi business area are also nearby, keeping the hotel connected to the city’s work core even during wedding days. Inside&nbsp;<strong>Radisson Blu Hotel, Pune Kharadi,&nbsp;</strong>the Thisienna Ballroom spans around 2,600 sq. ft. and works well for main wedding functions, while the Alfresco terrace is better for relaxed evening celebrations.</p><p>Rather than relying on scale or dramatic décor, the hotel works through organisation. Everything from movement between events to service flow is designed to stay efficient at&nbsp;<strong>Radisson Blu Hotel, Pune Kharadi,&nbsp;</strong>even with large guest lists. It suits couples who want a wedding that feels city-led, well-paced and easy to manage, where the focus stays on coordination and guest comfort rather than spectacle.</p>', '141 rooms with suites', 'Thisienna Hall (Grand Ballroom), Sienna Hall, Thistle Hall', 'Rooftop Terrace, Alfresco', '300', '300', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/SuOnLvWNYT1ow6C667ukCK3n1Cwzp01RR2p1iPMY.jpg", "title": "6+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/nrNODkVGvGBlUMQeLjktlqWc6PwBOAlkQZi4vwAy.jpg", "title": "Rooftop skyline dining experience"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/puHfvPMCHcsiQnDNcr5gm3NIp8I9TOBF519M7ImU.jpg", "title": "Curated bridal couture collaborations"}]', '[{"id": 852, "question": "Are there suggested excursions or experiences near Radisson Blu Hotel, Pune Kharadi?", "answer": "<p>Yes, guests at&nbsp;<strong>Radisson Blu Hotel, Pune Kharadi&nbsp;</strong>can easily explore Phoenix Marketcity, Aga Khan Palace, Koregaon Park cafés, Osho Garden, EON IT Park, Shaniwar Wada and local Maharashtrian street food trails nearby.</p>"}, {"id": 853, "question": "What is the standard check-in and check-out time at Radisson Blu Hotel, Pune Kharadi, and can I get an early check-in?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Radisson Blu Hotel, Pune Kharadi&nbsp;</strong>is 2:00 pm, and guests can check out by 12:00 noon. Guests can get an early check-in to the hotel, subject to availability.</p>"}, {"id": 854, "question": "Is outside catering allowed at Radisson Blu Hotel, Pune Kharadi?", "answer": "<p>Outside catering is usually not allowed at&nbsp;<strong>Radisson Blu Hotel, Pune Kharadi.</strong> However, final approvals may depend, so it’s best to confirm directly with the hotel.</p>"}, {"id": 855, "question": "How much can I save if I book the Radisson Blu Hotel, Pune Kharadi through Viraaya Weddings?", "answer": "<p>You can typically save 10-15% or more when booking the&nbsp;<strong>Radisson Blu Hotel, Pune Kharadi</strong> through Viraaya Weddings'' partnered rates. It also offers smoother planning, curated vendors and better coordination support.</p>"}, {"id": 856, "question": "Does Radisson Blu Hotel, Pune Kharadi provide a bar service for weddings?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>Radisson Blu Hotel, Pune Kharadi&nbsp;</strong>offers an in-house bar service for weddings. All beverages are served by the hotel and billed based on actual consumption.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '307', '141'
