SELECT 'pune', 'sheraton-grand-pune-bund-garden-hotel', 'published', 'Sheraton Grand Pune Bund Garden Wedding Cost & Packages', 'The Sheraton Grand Pune blends five-star hospitality with world-class event spaces. Get wedding package details, cost estimates & hotel booking today.', 'sheraton grand pune, sheraton grand pune wedding, sheraton grand pune wedding package, sheraton grand pune bund garden hotel wedding, sheraton grand pune bund garden hotel wedding cost', '/storage/hotel/seo/ye2YkOQhy0JDVRqqor9eAAD2rNtXVdk8pEqMNBzj.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/8tglOVDiKAXzaaDqfXXHGLOvPgI4YQ7n7orLi4Nh.jpg', 'Sheraton Grand Pune Bund Garden Hotel', 'Sheraton Grand Pune Bund Garden Hotel, Raja Bahadur Motilal Rd, Bund Garden, Sangamvadi, Pune, Maharashtra 411001, India', '30 minutes', '10 minutes', '<p><strong>Sheraton Grand Pune Bund Garden Hotel&nbsp;</strong>feels perfectly suited for couples who want a wedding that is grand and effortlessly well-organised. From the moment guests step into the dramatic atrium lobby with its elegant chandeliers, marble finishes and tall arched interiors, the hotel carries a sense of understated luxury. Its central location near Bund Garden and Pune Junction also makes it especially convenient for guests travelling in from different cities during multi-day celebrations.</p><p>For couples planning a&nbsp;<strong>wedding in Pune</strong>, the property works especially well for grand indoor celebrations with a modern luxury feel. The Majestic Ballroom, spread across nearly 6,100 sq. ft., comfortably accommodates large guest lists, elaborate stage setups and multi-event wedding schedules. Meanwhile, the rooftop poolside venue offers a completely different mood altogether, ideal for intimate cocktail evenings, sundowner Mehendi functions or relaxed after-parties overlooking Pune’s skyline.</p><p>What makes a&nbsp;<strong>wedding at Sheraton Grand Pune Bund Garden Hotel</strong> stand out is how smoothly everything comes together behind the scenes. The 179 rooms and suites, dedicated concierge service, award-winning dining spaces, bridal-friendly facilities and custom catering experiences make the hotel particularly practical for multi-day celebrations. It feels luxurious, organised and guest-focused in a way that genuinely supports the flow of a large wedding weekend.</p>', '179 rooms with suites', 'Regal Ballroom, The Majestic Ballroom, The Majestic Hall', 'Poolside, Open Lawns', '400', '400', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/c2exCUBQ9mKW08ttnfhMr4z8OPJGkKoHjJEOWwhm.jpg", "title": "5+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/4XvnU08POV8yijgTDwu1Pn84WjDFBxVRsRuyEkCe.jpg", "title": "Rooftop candlelit dining beside the pool"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/DJMUI6NYN4ctau644Avmfq9Rp2SbXJhLaJSxl222.jpg", "title": "Custom live wedding food stations"}]', '[{"id": 847, "question": "Can we bring our own wedding planner/decorator for a wedding at Sheraton Grand Pune Bund Garden Hotel?", "answer": "<p>Yes, outside wedding planners are generally allowed at&nbsp;<strong>Sheraton Grand Pune Bund Garden Hotel.&nbsp;</strong>External decorators may be permitted, too, subject to hotel guidelines and approvals.</p>"}, {"id": 848, "question": "Is an early check-in available for guests attending a wedding at Sheraton Grand Pune Bund Garden Hotel?", "answer": "<p>Yes, guests can avail an early check-in to the hotel, subject to availability. The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Sheraton Grand Pune Bund Garden Hotel&nbsp;</strong>is 3:00 pm, and guests can check out by 12:00 noon.</p>"}, {"id": 849, "question": "Does Sheraton Grand Pune Bund Garden Hotel have salons, laundry service and iron boards?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>Sheraton Grand Pune Bund Garden Hotel</strong> offers salon services, laundry facilities and in-room irons with ironing boards for added guest convenience during wedding stays.</p>"}, {"id": 850, "question": "Can guests explore local sights during their stay at Hotel Sheraton Grand Pune?", "answer": "<p>Yes, guests staying at&nbsp;<strong>Sheraton Grand Pune Bund Garden Hotel</strong> can easily explore some of Pune’s well-known attractions between wedding festivities. Popular nearby experiences include Aga Khan Palace, Shaniwar Wada, Osho Garden, Bund Garden, FC Road cafés, local Maharashtrian dining spots and shopping at Phoenix Marketcity.</p>"}, {"id": 851, "question": "What is the standard liquor policy at Sheraton Grand Pune Bund Garden Hotel?", "answer": "<p><strong>Sheraton Grand Pune Bund Garden Hotel&nbsp;</strong>usually serves alcohol through its in-house bar service. Beverage charges are typically billed based on actual wedding consumption.</p>"}]', '283', '179'
