SELECT 'pune', 'the-ritz-carlton-pune', 'published', 'The Ritz Carlton Pune – Luxury Wedding Venue & Cost', 'Planning a luxury wedding in Pune Maharashtra? The Ritz Carlton Pune delivers stunning venues, clear wedding cost breakdowns & verified reviews. Book Now!', 'the ritz carlton pune Wedding, the ritz carlton pune Wedding Cost, the ritz carlton pune review, the ritz carlton pune, the ritz carlton pune pune maharashtra', '/storage/hotel/seo/R3OT7LFW6HoxW1NpnHDeZJBRI34BQeEAst4jNPip.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/MsIMmm1Mc7aZHAN1C32VTpS3SjjEUqN60w5c8c4f.jpg', 'The Ritz Carlton Pune', 'Golf Course Square, Airport Rd, Jayprakash Nagar, Yerawada, Pune, Maharashtra 411006, India', '20 Minutes', '15 minutes', '<p>Positioned along Airport Road in Yerwada,&nbsp;<strong>The Ritz-Carlton, Pune</strong> overlooks the prestigious Poona Club Golf Course, placing it among the city''s most coveted addresses. Its spacious rooms and suites offer sweeping views of the golf course and downtown skyline, with a residential Club Lounge delivering bespoke services for discerning guests. Striking architectural elements, a curated art collection, signature Sans Souci chandeliers and custom wall panels referencing India''s cultural heritage fill its grand public spaces. Dining destinations, including Aasmana rooftop lounge and The Ritz-Carlton Tea Lounge, provide varied, memorable settings for wedding dinners and pre-wedding celebrations.</p><p>The hotel''s 7,200-sq-ft Ritz-Carlton Ballroom, divisible into two sections and complemented by a private open-to-sky foyer, accommodates up to 600 guests. The outdoor Crown Deck offers an open-air venue for ceremonies and receptions with a view of the Pune skyline. Bridal Suite spa treatments and curated Afternoon Tea experiences at The Ritz-Carlton Spa complete the wedding journey for the couple and their party.</p>', '199 rooms with suits', 'The Ritz-Carlton Ballroom, The Ritz-Carlton Ballroom 1, The Ritz-Carlton Ballroom 2, The Imperial, The Imperial 1, The Imperial 2, The Crown, The Foyer', 'The Crown Deck', '400', '400', '[{"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal02.png", "title": "5 in-house restaurants and bars"}, {"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal03.png", "title": "Dedicated Wedding Studio"}, {"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal04.png", "title": "Bridal Suite spa treatments and curated afternoon tea"}]', '[{"id": 777, "question": "Are there any special offers for wedding couples at The Ritz-Carlton, Pune?", "answer": "<p><strong>The Ritz-Carlton, Pune</strong> extends wedding couples complimentary luxury suite stays, personalised romantic dining experiences, exclusive spa discounts at The Ritz-Carlton Spa and chauffeur-driven transfers to ensure a truly legendary celebration.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 778, "question": "What is the peak wedding season for The Ritz-Carlton, Pune?", "answer": "<p>The peak season for&nbsp;<strong>The Ritz-Carlton, Pune</strong> is from November to February, when Pune''s winter weather (with temperatures ranging from 9°C to 26°C) creates ideal conditions for grand outdoor weddings and high-profile celebrations.</p>"}, {"id": 779, "question": "What are the check-in and check-out timings at The Ritz-Carlton, Pune? Are there any early check-in or late check-out privileges for wedding couples?", "answer": "<p>Standard check-in at&nbsp;<strong>The Ritz-Carlton, Pune</strong> is 3:00 PM, and check-out is 12:00 noon. Wedding couples may request early check-in or late check-out, subject to room availability.</p>"}, {"id": 780, "question": "Can I host a pre-wedding photoshoot at The Ritz-Carlton, Pune?", "answer": "<p><strong>The Ritz-Carlton, Pune</strong> permits pre-wedding photoshoots for couples who have booked wedding events or guest rooms at the property. Access to grand backdrops such as the Ritz-Carlton Ballroom and golf course-facing spaces requires prior approval and applicable venue fees.</p>"}, {"id": 781, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol for wedding celebrations at The Ritz-Carlton, Pune?", "answer": "<p>Outside alcohol is not permitted at The Ritz-Carlton, Pune. All beverages must be sourced through the hotel''s in-house bars and outlets, which offer curated beverage packages or charge on actual consumption, billed separately from your wedding package.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '70', '199'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'pune' AND `slug` = 'the-ritz-carlton-pune');
