SELECT 'pune', 'the-westin-pune-koregaon-park', 'published', 'The Westin Pune Koregaon Park – Wedding Cost & More', 'Dreaming of a Koregaon Park wedding? The Westin Pune Koregaon Park India offers exotic venues, honest wedding cost & world-class hospitality. Book Now!', 'the westin pune koregaon park wedding, the westin pune koregaon park wedding cost, the westin pune koregaon park pune india, the westin pune koregaon', '/storage/hotel/seo/83IijqHVioNoBJlyiBygq9KfsJoLkCKkT0K9Nh9Z.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/Ov7wrlLe0dPWaA2UTTHVuMvuxmpgm2tRH8LvlbY7.jpg', 'The Westin Pune Koregaon Park', '36/3-B, Mundhwa Rd, Koregaon Park Annexe, Ghorpadi, Pune, Maharashtra 411001, India', '15 Minutes', '25 Minutes', '<p>A&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at The Westin Pune Koregaon Park</strong> works especially well for couples who don’t want their wedding to feel stiff or overly planned. Guests naturally spread out through the day here. Some sit by the river with coffee in the morning, others step out to Koregaon Park’s cafés before the celebrations begin, and by evening everyone slowly gathers again for rooftop drinks at Asilo or music out on the lawns. The whole place settles into the pace of the wedding without things ever feeling too formal.</p><p>For a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Pune</strong>, the location does a lot of the work for you. Families flying in from different cities reach the hotel quickly from the airport, yet once inside, the pace softens completely. The spaces feel modern, open and bright, with glass-lined interiors, greenery woven through the property and rooms designed for guests to properly settle in rather than just sleep between events.</p><p>What makes weddings at&nbsp;<strong>The Westin Pune Koregaon Park&nbsp;</strong>memorable is that people genuinely enjoy staying back after the functions end. Conversations stretch by the pool, dinners turn into late-night catch-ups and guests move easily between celebrations and downtime, which gives the entire wedding a more relaxed, effortless energy.</p>', '277 rooms with suites', 'The Jewel Ballroom, Pre-Function Area', 'Jewel Lawns, Lawn Grass Area', '550', '550', '[{"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal02.png", "title": "4+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal03.png", "title": "Private terrace stargazing suite stays"}, {"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal04.png", "title": "Rooftop sunset cocktails at Asilo"}, {"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal05.png", "title": "Candlelit cabana dinners by poolside"}]', '[{"id": 772, "question": "Which is the nearest airport to The Westin Pune Koregaon Park?", "answer": "<p>Pune International Airport (PNQ) is the nearest airport to&nbsp;<strong>The Westin Pune Koregaon Park,&nbsp;</strong>around 5-7 km away. A car ride usually takes 15-25 minutes, depending on traffic.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 773, "question": "Is an early check-in available for guests at The Westin Pune Koregaon Park?", "answer": "<p>Yes, guests can request an early check-in, which is subject to availability. The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>The Westin Pune Koregaon Park</strong> is by 3:00 pm, while check-out time is at 12:00 noon.</p>"}, {"id": 774, "question": "Can guests explore local sights during their stay at The Westin Pune Koregaon Park?", "answer": "<p>Yes, guests can easily explore nearby spots like Aga Khan Palace, Osho Garden, Koregaon Park cafés, Shaniwar Wada, FC Road, Pune nightlife and local shopping streets during their stay at&nbsp;<strong>The Westin Pune Koregaon Park</strong>.</p>"}, {"id": 775, "question": "Can we bring our own wedding planner to The Westin Pune Koregaon Park?", "answer": "<p>Yes, couples are usually allowed to bring their own wedding planner or decorator to&nbsp;<strong>The Westin Pune Koregaon Park</strong>. External vendors are generally permitted, with coordination and approvals managed directly by the hotel.</p>"}, {"id": 776, "question": "What is the standard liquor policy of The Westin Pune Koregaon Park?", "answer": "<p><strong>The Westin Pune Koregaon Park</strong> generally follows an in-house liquor policy for weddings. Alcohol service is managed by the hotel, with beverage packages charged separately based on consumption.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '73', '277'
