SELECT 'pushkar', 'ananta-resort-pushkar', 'published', 'Ananta Spa & Resort Pushkar Wedding Cost & Booking', 'Plan your destination wedding at Ananta Spa & Resort Pushkar. Check wedding cost, exclusive packages & booking options for a divine Pushkar wedding experience.', 'ananta spa and resort pushkar wedding cost, ananta spa and resort pushkar wedding, ananta pushkar wedding cost, ananta pushkar wedding packages, ananta pushkar wedding, ananta spa and resort pushkar booking', '/storage/hotel/seo/yKDwXGsW32oFIiWaM3dvZVTmAY740bQZK7Xp0QFl.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/23RpDBSklueOTdo4goQ8QZRoxhQUhAI6L4cCK6SY.jpg', 'Ananta Resort Pushkar', 'Village-Leela Sevri, Ajmer, Pushkar Rd, Pushkar, Rajasthan 305022, India', '45 Minutes', '25 Minutes', '<p>A&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at Ananta Spa &amp; Resort, Pushkar,</strong> feels easy to settle into from the moment you arrive. Set across 11 acres on the outskirts of Pushkar, the property opens out to the Aravalli hills, with wide pathways, scattered cottages and enough green cover to give it a sense of calm without feeling isolated. It’s about a 45-minute drive from Kishangarh Airport, so getting guests in and out is fairly smooth.</p><p>When you start planning the functions, the layout actually helps. The Central and Big Lawn can accommodate larger gatherings without feeling crowded, while the amphitheatre and a few quieter corners are better for smaller, more personal events. Evenings at the resort feel a bit different, and the ambience changes how each function comes together, so you don''t have to do much.</p><p>For a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Rajasthan</strong>, this place feels relaxed without losing its charm. Guests are spread across cottages, tents and suites, so there’s room to slow down, but no one ever feels too far from the celebrations.</p>', '101', 'Aravali Banquet, Jashan (Pre-Function)', 'Central Lawn, Big Lawn, Amphitheatre', '205', '250', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/PrE61AJf5JopDOVyhudRv5xDvdGy9aS0EOSYRIZl.jpg", "title": "3+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/ne2EhsWTSLA4NmGcnMMIUpAKmcDRKghx6Vqzj2PO.jpg", "title": "Private jacuzzi romance with butler service"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/EI8DJhT6yHfGPClw7gmJaNoJHyPWhWKkEYYxJk5C.jpg", "title": "Gazebo candlelight dining by poolside"}]', '[{"id": 396, "question": "What is the cost of a destination wedding at Ananta Spa & Resort, Pushkar?", "answer": "<p>On average, a wedding package at&nbsp;<strong>Ananta Spa &amp; Resort, Pushkar,&nbsp;</strong>ranges from INR 80 lakhs to INR 1.1 Cr for about 150-200 guests, on a 3-day, 2-night celebration. Based on your requirements, refer to Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator to get an accurate quote instantly.</p>"}, {"id": 397, "question": "What is the check-in time at Ananta Spa & Resort, Pushkar, and is early check-in available?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Ananta Spa &amp; Resort, Pushkar,</strong> is 2:00 pm, and check-out time is at 11:00 am. Early check-in can be arranged, subject to hotel availability.</p>"}, {"id": 398, "question": "Are there any nearby attractions or activities for international guests around Ananta Spa & Resort in Pushkar?", "answer": "<p>Yes, guests can explore nearby spots like Brahma Temple, Pushkar Lake and local bazaars. Activities include camel safaris, short hikes and evening aarti experiences.</p>"}, {"id": 399, "question": "Which is the nearest airport to Ananta Spa & Resort in Pushkar?", "answer": "<p>Kishangarh Airport (KQH) is about 35 km away from&nbsp;<strong>Ananta Spa &amp; Resort in Pushkar</strong>. The drive to Ananta Spa &amp; Resort, Pushkar, usually takes around 45 minutes to an hour.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 400, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol to Ananta Spa & Resort, Pushkar?", "answer": "<p>No, outside alcohol isn’t allowed at&nbsp;<strong>Ananta Spa &amp; Resort, Pushkar</strong>. All beverages must be arranged through the hotel and are charged separately based on consumption.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '134', '101'
