SELECT 'pushkar', 'pushkara-resort-and-spa', 'published', 'Pushkara Resort and Spa Wedding Cost & Hotel Booking', 'Planning a wedding in Pushkar? Pushkara Resort and Spa delivers stunning venues, honest wedding cost breakdowns & serene spa retreats. Book Now!', 'pushkara resort wedding cost, pushkara resort and spa wedding cost, pushkara resort wedding, pushkara resort and spa wedding, pushkara resort pushkar', '/storage/hotel/seo/oX4WOiTmlfTUhfK1gacENUbzwmiBZaYDCmInDzbF.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/2l3AMJYRrEwuJ9hFkVmaLHRuwjfzOzsv5VX1zqtv.jpg', 'Pushkara Resort and Spa', 'Pushkar Bypass Rd, near Sudha Bai Budha, Nedaliya, Rajasthan 305022, India', '40 Minutes', '30 Minutes', '<p><strong>Pushkara Resort and Spa&nbsp;</strong>feels like one of those venues where everything sits in one place, yet nothing feels crowded. You’re a short drive from Pushkar, but once you’re inside, it’s mostly dunes, open lawns and the Aravallis in the background. The white buildings, sandstone pathways and open layouts give it a clean, easygoing look that works well across day and night functions.</p><p>If you’re planning a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at Pushkara Resort and Spa,</strong> the variety of indoor and outdoor venues helps. You can host a larger function on the main lawn, move to the poolside for an evening event and keep smaller ceremonies tucked into terraces or garden pockets. There’s also the option of using the sand dunes within the property, which adds a setting you don’t usually get without stepping out.</p><p>For a<strong> destination wedding in Rajasthan,</strong> what makes&nbsp;<strong>Pushkara Resort and Spa</strong> practical is its spread-out layout. Guests are accommodated across cottages, tents and suites, so it doesn’t feel like everyone is in one block. Add steady service and good in-house dining, and the overall flow stays easy to manage.</p>', 'NA', 'Jashn Banquet Hall, Jashn Pre-Function Area, Jalsa Banquet Hall, Jalsa Pre-Function Area', 'Pushkara Bagh, Poolside Area, Terrace & Private Gardens', '185', '230', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/jIDUApHfm51B5Obkf7UIEhSbykmcuOeakhvMOcoQ.jpg", "title": "2+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/H9oCiGDUOS5BSBXcznUR530kK8qfIh45qmTjgLiQ.jpg", "title": "Private cottages and luxury tent stays"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/2Ao9NgjtISVXcw8RInpRan0SOh20XhARK762NJUl.jpg", "title": "Pre-wedding spa and bridal rituals"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/VRNQFPUb7zSvB6Xxb321FvgRZLRdRz56ZkQjHQwU.jpg", "title": "Infinity pool and garden leisure moments"}]', '[{"id": 701, "question": "How to reach Pushkara Resort and Spa from the nearest airport?", "answer": "<p>The nearest airport to&nbsp;<strong>Pushkara Resort and Spa</strong> is Kishangarh Airport in Ajmer. From there, it’s a 33-35 km drive, taking around 40-45 minutes by road.</p>"}, {"id": 702, "question": "What is the standard check-in time at Pushkara Resort and Spa, and is an early check-in available for wedding guests?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Pushkara Resort and Spa</strong> is 2:00 pm, and guests can check out by 11:00 am. Guests attending a wedding can request an early check-in, subject to hotel availability.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 703, "question": "Are there nearby attractions or activities for international guests around Pushkara Resort and Spa?", "answer": "<p>While you’re staying at Pushkara Resort and Spa, explore the ghats and temples of Pushkar, visit the Brahma Temple and walk through local bazaars. Enjoy camel safaris, desert sunsets and cultural performances, or take a short drive to Ajmer Sharif Dargah.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 704, "question": "What is the cost of a 2-night destination wedding at Pushkara Resort and Spa?", "answer": "<p>A wedding at&nbsp;<strong>Pushkara Resort and Spa</strong> for a 3-day, 2-night celebration usually costs within the range of INR 80 lakhs and INR 1.2 Cr for around 300 guests. To get an accurate quote within seconds, enter your guest count and room details in Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 705, "question": "Does Pushkara Resort and Spa provide a bar service for weddings?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>Pushkara Resort and Spa</strong> provides in-house bar service for weddings. Outside alcohol is not permitted, and all drinks are billed on actual consumption, separate from wedding packages.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '136', '91'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'pushkar' AND `slug` = 'pushkara-resort-and-spa');
