SELECT 'pushkar', 'regenta-spa-and-resort-pushkar', 'published', 'Regenta Resort Pushkar Fort Wedding Cost & Booking Details', 'Regenta Resort Pushkar Fort offers royal wedding venues with transparent wedding cost details & hassle-free resort booking for every guest. Contact Us Now', 'regenta resort pushkar fort wedding, regenta resort pushkar fort wedding cost, regenta resort pushkar wedding, regenta resort pushkar wedding cost', '/storage/hotel/seo/xJraS1tikiS6egYZsBzyeVKYY95y59uZHeyxoJCx.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/npAIStGNvJlsTfU7m3Zgn02HRtq9xspVuJ5ieSvX.jpg', 'Regenta Spa And Resort Pushkar', 'Killa, Badighati, Road, Pushkar, Rajasthan 341031, India', '60 Minutes', '30 Minutes', '<p>A&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at Regenta Resort Pushkar Fort</strong> brings together the charm of a fort-inspired setting and the ease of a modern boutique resort. Spread across around 4 acres at the base of Savitri Temple hill, the property is designed like a themed ‘fort’, with sandstone-toned walls, arched gateways and chhatri-style domes that create a distinctly Rajasthani silhouette. This resort serves as the perfect venue for a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Rajasthan,</strong> by offering a regal backdrop without being overwhelming.</p><p>Premium accommodations at the resort property include Haveli Rooms, Regal Heritage Rooms and Swiss Cottage Tents during peak seasons. Interiors follow a simple traditional theme with regional motifs and warm colour tones, while still keeping modern essentials in place for guests. The overall experience is designed to feel thematic rather than antique, making it suitable for contemporary celebrations with a cultural backdrop.</p><p>Wedding events are hosted across multiple spaces such as Darbar Hall, Kesar Hall and outdoor lawns, allowing flexibility for different functions. Dining is managed at Rajwada Restaurant with multi-cuisine options, supported by standard resort hospitality services. A&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at Regenta Resort Pushkar Fort</strong> is entirely themed around rich Rajasthani heritage and timeless design.</p>', '72', 'Darbar Hall, Kesar Hall', 'Poolside Garden, Lawns 1, 2, 3, Rajwada Terrace', '150', '190', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/mYU2yqzU5A4Qn6UhqsaYJgfX7cceXXjBy0SUauW8.jpg", "title": "2+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/LelEStRCrS88b4pgBAkOEUV6YnOCMz0YjPMSctRB.jpg", "title": "Royal elephant or camel entry"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/900mANJN5W0BWg51mYVCKKXiFuMY5ZqI3pNsGxbz.jpg", "title": "Sunrise desert camel safari"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/2oytSfg8nx1lncIHkrlNr6QSDLadBof24nde4LVH.jpg", "title": "Champagne breakfast with hill views"}]', '[{"id": 722, "question": "Which is the nearest airport to the Regenta Resort Pushkar Fort?", "answer": "<p>Kishangarh Airport (KQH) is the nearest to&nbsp;<strong>Regenta Resort Pushkar Fort,</strong> about 40 km away and a 45–60-minute drive by road.</p>"}, {"id": 723, "question": "What is the standard check-in time at Regenta Resort Pushkar Fort, and can guests request an early check-in?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Regenta Resort Pushkar Fort</strong> is 2:00 pm, and guests can check out by 12:00 noon. Yes, an early check-in request can be arranged, subject to hotel availability.</p>"}, {"id": 724, "question": "What is the ideal budget for a 2-night wedding at Regenta Resort Pushkar Fort?", "answer": "<p><strong>Regenta Resort Pushkar Fort</strong> works well for intimate weddings within INR 40-70 lakhs and 72 rooms, while&nbsp;<strong>Ananta Spa &amp; Resort, Pushkar&nbsp;</strong>suits grand celebrations with INR 80 lakhs-1.1 Cr and 101 rooms. Both are about 45 to 60 minutes from the Kishangarh Airport.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 725, "question": "Should I choose the Regenta Resort Pushkar Fort or the Ananta Spa & Resort, Pushkar?", "answer": "<p><strong>Regenta Resort Pushkar Fort</strong> works well for intimate weddings within INR 25-45 lakhs and 72 rooms, while&nbsp;<strong>Ananta Spa &amp; Resort, Pushkar&nbsp;</strong>suits grand celebrations with INR 80 lakhs-1.1 Cr and 101 rooms. Both are about 45 to 60 minutes from the Kishangarh Airport.</p>"}, {"id": 726, "question": "Does Regenta Resort Pushkar Fort provide a bar service for destination weddings?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>Regenta Resort Pushkar Fort&nbsp;</strong>offers an in-house bar service for destination weddings. Outside alcohol is not allowed, and all beverages are served and billed as per consumption.</p>"}]', '164', '72'
