SELECT 'raipur', 'courtyard-by-marriott-raipur', 'published', 'Courtyard Marriott Raipur - Luxury Events & Weddings Cost', 'Courtyard Marriott Raipur offers premium wedding spaces & personalised event packages. Explore wedding cost guides, inclusions & booking for your big day.', 'courtyard marriott raipur wedding cost, courtyard marriott raipur wedding, courtyard by marriott raipur wedding, courtyard by marriott raipur wedding cost, courtyard marriott raipur, marriott raipur, hotel marriott raipur', '/storage/hotel/seo/zFsDlbPLrOkb20cYVsE38s3hwVMUP30jJjNHRSUW.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/OnUBblyA5LioraLNmvM4MtUX1z5FjwwfyqAmSbo3.jpg', 'Courtyard by Marriott Raipur', 'NH-6, Labhandi, opposite Indira Gandhi Agriculture University, Raipur, Chhattisgarh 492001, India', '25 Minutes', '20 Minutes', '<p>The first thing you notice about&nbsp;<strong>Courtyard by Marriott Raipur</strong> is how effortlessly modern yet welcoming it feels. Located along NH-6 near Swami Vivekananda Airport, this 5-star luxury hotel sits beside the greenery of Indira Gandhi Agricultural University, giving it a calmer setting away from the city rush. For couples planning a&nbsp;<strong>wedding in Chhattisgarh</strong>, the location works beautifully for hosting guests travelling in from different cities while still feeling refined, comfortable and celebration-ready.</p><p>A&nbsp;<strong>wedding at Courtyard by Marriott Raipur</strong> flows beautifully across its indoor and outdoor venues. The Jade Ballroom hosts grand receptions with sleek modern interiors, while the Courtyard Garden and Terrace create a softer open-air setting for pheras, cocktail evenings and sundowner functions. With over 8,500 square feet of event space, Marriott’s dedicated wedding planners, infinity poolside dining experiences and curated hospitality, the celebrations feel organised without losing warmth or personality.</p><p>The hotel’s 108 rooms and suites make hosting families and wedding guests seamless. Spacious suites overlooking the city, contemporary lounges, MoMo Café’s global menus, B&amp;W The Bar and the calming Tattva Spa together create the feeling of a full wedding retreat rather than just a venue. Between functions, guests can also explore Vivekananda Sarovar, Purkhouti Muktangan and Nandan Van Zoo nearby, adding a local Raipur touch to the celebrations.</p>', '108 rooms with suites', 'Jade Ballroom', 'Courtyard Garden, Courtyard Terrace', '250', '250', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/UsdJ1zTfQD26uB1mt3YwilBlVVJXqfhmVRf3Wp5P.jpg", "title": "3+ dining venues onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/aSn7hi4YCE36LlGJ0kKg0pExblWRX3C5hI32R4rO.jpg", "title": "Infinity poolside candlelit dining experience"}]', '[{"id": 1208, "question": "Can guests explore local sights during their wedding stay at the Courtyard by Marriott Raipur?", "answer": "<p>Guests staying at<strong> Courtyard by Marriott Raipur&nbsp;</strong>can explore Nandan Van Zoo, Purkhouti Muktangan, Mahant Ghasidas Memorial Museum, Vivekananda Sarovar, MM Fun City and nearby temples between wedding celebrations. The hotel’s central location also makes local shopping and food outings convenient.</p>"}, {"id": 1209, "question": "What is the standard time to check-in and check-out at Courtyard by Marriott Raipur?", "answer": "<p>The standard time to check-in at&nbsp;<strong>Courtyard by Marriott Raipur</strong> is 3:00 pm, and the check-out time is 12:00 noon. An early check-in facility is available at the hotel, but it is subject to the hotel’s discretion.</p>"}, {"id": 1210, "question": "Does Courtyard by Marriott Raipur offer salon, laundry and ironing facilities?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>Courtyard by Marriott Raipur&nbsp;</strong>offers laundry services, while ironing facilities are usually available in rooms or on request. Salon availability should be confirmed with the hotel or Viraaya Weddings team.</p>"}, {"id": 1211, "question": "Can we hire our own wedding planner or decorator at Courtyard by Marriott Raipur?", "answer": "<p>Yes, outside wedding planners and decorators are generally allowed at&nbsp;<strong>Courtyard by Marriott Raipur,</strong> with prior coordination and approvals that are managed directly through the hotel’s events team.</p>"}, {"id": 1212, "question": "Does Courtyard by Marriott Raipur provide a bar service for weddings?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>Courtyard by Marriott Raipur</strong> manages wedding bar services in-house with curated beverage selections. Outside alcohol is generally not permitted at the hotel, and liquor consumption is charged separate from standard wedding packages.</p>"}]', '172', '108'
