SELECT 'ranthambore', 'nahargarh-ranthambhore', 'published', 'Nahargarh Ranthambhore Wedding Cost, Packages & Bookings', 'Experience royal luxury at Nahargarh Ranthambhore in Sawai Madhopur. Explore exclusive wedding packages, cost details & easy online booking options.', 'nahargarh ranthambhore wedding, nahargarh ranthambhore wedding cost, nahargarh ranthambhore booking, nahargarh ranthambhore wedding price, nahargarh ranthambhore wedding package', '/storage/hotel/seo/uWDrwMkJj7ToJIg2rSclG8iVG67BzCDz5GdqjjET.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/tLmkBzD1onis9wMBi3vdTDzEGC1DNdLYtXUHmfSh.jpg', 'Nahargarh Ranthambhore', 'Ranthambhore Rd, Khilchipur, Sawai Madhopur, Rajasthan 322001, India', '240 Minutes', '20 Minutes', '<p>Hidden near the forests of Ranthambhore,&nbsp;<strong>Nahargarh Ranthambhore&nbsp;</strong>feels like a fortified royal residence rising out of the Aravalli landscape. Towering bastions, intricate mirror-work, marble courtyards and softly lit archways give the property an unmistakably palatial character. Inspired by the grandeur of old Rajput hunting lodges, the hotel creates an immersive setting that feels grand yet deeply connected to Rajasthan’s heritage.</p><p>For couples planning a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Ranthambhore</strong>,&nbsp;<strong>Nahargarh&nbsp;</strong>offers the kind of space that allows celebrations to unfold effortlessly. Spread across nearly 10 acres, the property comfortably hosts weddings with around 200 to 300 guests across its lawns, courtyards and banquet spaces. The Hathi Kund stepwell creates a striking setting for Mehendi or Sangeet evenings, while the larger lawns and palace-style halls work beautifully for grand receptions, pheras and late-night festivities.</p><p>What makes a&nbsp;<strong>wedding at Nahargarh Ranthambhore</strong> memorable is how naturally the experience flows for guests. The 99 heritage-style rooms, traditional Rajasthani welcomes, candlelit dining experiences and peaceful courtyards create a stay that feels warm and immersive rather than overly commercial. Surrounded by wilderness yet wrapped in royal architecture, the hotel delivers a grand, wow-worthy wedding experience that feels truly specific to Ranthambhore.</p>', '99 rooms with suites', 'Sunehri Mahal, Arjun Mahal Banquet Hall, Sheesh Mahal, Chandra Mahal, Gulabi Mahal', 'Poolside, Front Lawns, Hathi Kund, Bageechi, Amphitheatre', '250', '250', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/YnmscaCYEJRtLeJajUuzbJ3QBu7X2QOtTmESFHiu.jpg", "title": "3+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/JKf8ZJlRHnw1U7IswaddDghAvedvRd1iJd1lCNNU.jpg", "title": "Private candlelit dinners in royal settings"}]', '[{"id": 877, "question": "What is the ideal cost of a 2-night wedding at Nahargarh Ranthambhore, Sawai Madhopur, India?", "answer": "<p>On average, a&nbsp;<strong>Nahargarh Ranthambhore wedding costs</strong> usually range from INR 80 lakhs to INR 1.2 Cr for a 3-day, 2-night celebration. The budget may vary as per your guest count and room requirements. Use Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator to get an instant estimate of your wedding budget.</p>"}, {"id": 878, "question": "What are the standard check-in and check-out times at Nahargarh Ranthambhore, and can I get an early check-in?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Nahargarh Ranthambhore&nbsp;</strong>is 2:00 pm, and guests can check out by 12:00 noon. An early check-in to the hotel can be arranged, but it is completely subject to the hotel’s discretion.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 879, "question": "What is the history of Hotel Nahargarh Ranthambhore?", "answer": "<p><strong>Hotel Nahargarh Ranthambhore</strong> traces its roots to an 18th-century royal hunting lodge commissioned by Maharaja Sawai Madho Singh I. Reconstructed in 2004, the hotel was thoughtfully built as a grand palace-inspired property near Ranthambhore National Park.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 880, "question": "Are drones, fireworks or baraat allowed at Nahargarh Ranthambhore?", "answer": "<p>Baraat processions are usually allowed at&nbsp;<strong>Nahargarh Ranthambhore</strong>. Drone usage and fireworks, however, are subject to local regulations and may face restrictions or bans.</p>"}, {"id": 881, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol to Nahargarh Ranthambhore for a destination wedding?", "answer": "<p>No, outside alcohol is generally not permitted at&nbsp;<strong>Nahargarh Ranthambhore</strong>. The hotel offers its own in-house bar service, with beverages billed on actual consumption during the wedding.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '153', '99'
