SELECT 'ranthambore', 'taj-sawai-ranthambore', 'published', 'Taj Sawai Ranthambore Wedding Cost & Venue Details', 'Taj Sawai Ranthambore wedding cost fits every dream. Get transparent pricing, seamless booking & read glowing reviews before you decide. Easy Bookings', 'taj sawai ranthambore wedding, taj sawai ranthambore wedding cost, taj sawai ranthambore booking, taj sawai ranthambore reviews, taj sawai madhopur lodge ranthambore', '/storage/hotel/seo/BYPn7OCTPjdoK6e3Qk4nYTZONu16D0FL7li0sIT9.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/nFDrNStB7da3ys5efTYntvY6A1CY2ACPTfj4PYKC.jpg', 'Taj Sawai Ranthambore', 'Ranthambore Road, Sawai Madhopur, Rajasthan 322001, India, India', '180 Minutes', '30 Minutes', '<p>A&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at Taj Sawai Ranthambore</strong> works best when you want space, nature and ease to sit at the centre of your celebration. The property is set at the edge of the Ranthambore forest, so instead of city views or heavy architecture, you get open landscapes, low-rise structures and constant visual connection to the Aravalli hills. That setting alone changes how the entire wedding feels across three days.</p><p>For a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Rajasthan,</strong> the layout here is actually quite easy to work with. The Talai waterbody tends to naturally draw evening events like sangeet or reception, while the lawns are large enough for pheras without needing much division or setup changes. Lastly, the Mahua banquet hall can be reserved for haldi and mehendi rituals when you want something more intimate.</p><p>What really stands out is the time between events. Guests are not just attending functions and going back to their rooms; they’re moving between safaris and relaxed in-room breaks that fit the pace of&nbsp;<strong>Taj Sawai Ranthambore</strong>. With Taj’s impeccable hospitality, the team quietly manages timing and small details so things don’t feel rushed or chaotic, which makes multi-day celebrations feel more settled.</p>', '60', 'Mahua Banquet Hall', 'Poolside Areas, Open Terraces and Lawns', '120', '150', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/46it6crvAsn7VODzzuni7HLLH9uGYMrrcGdaWpU1.jpg", "title": "4+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/IdFBqhxKwKWScuIQLIXTRKUhA0jI1v4FzN6PNjNC.jpg", "title": "Romantic herb garden dining strolls"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/RcvUoyJoiYKTYcnBpWIKjlWydj6aJ111qL8O3k5m.jpg", "title": "Couple curated farm-to-table feasts"}]', '[{"id": 696, "question": "How to reach Taj Sawai Ranthambore from the nearest airport?", "answer": "<p>Jaipur Airport is the closest airport to&nbsp;<strong>Taj Sawai Ranthambore</strong>. From there, it’s about a 3-hour drive covering 160-170 km by road. Private cabs and hotel transfers are used for a smooth journey from and to the resort.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 697, "question": "Is an early check-in available at Taj Sawai Ranthambore?", "answer": "<p>Yes, guests can request an early check-in at the hotel; it is subject to availability. The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Sawai Ranthambore</strong> is 2:00 pm, and guests can check out by 12:00 noon.</p>"}, {"id": 698, "question": "Does Taj Sawai Ranthambore have salons, laundry service and an ironing board in rooms?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>Taj Sawai Ranthambore</strong> offers salon services and laundry facilities. Ironing boards are typically available in rooms or provided on request.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 699, "question": "What is the standard cost of a destination wedding at Taj Sawai Ranthambore?", "answer": "<p>On average, the&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding cost at Taj Sawai Ranthambore</strong> for a 3-day, 2-night celebration ranges between INR 60 lakhs and INR 1 Cr for around 150-200 guests. Enter your guest count and room details in Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator to get an accurate quote within seconds.</p>"}, {"id": 700, "question": "What is the standard liquor policy at Taj Sawai Ranthambore for destination weddings?", "answer": "<p><strong>Taj Sawai Ranthambore</strong> serves alcohol through its in-house bar for destination weddings. Outside liquor is not allowed, and all beverages are billed based on actual consumption, not included in wedding packages.</p>"}]', '345', '60'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'ranthambore' AND `slug` = 'taj-sawai-ranthambore');
