SELECT 'rishikesh', 'taj-rishikesh-resort-and-spa', 'published', 'Taj Rishikesh Resort & Spa Uttarakhand Wedding Cost & Venue', 'Host a luxury riverside wedding at Taj Rishikesh Resort & Spa Uttarakhand. Explore wedding cost, venue options, packages & secure booking for your big day.', 'taj rishikesh resort & spa uttarakhand wedding, taj rishikesh resort & spa uttarakhand wedding cost, taj rishikesh resort & spa uttarakhand wedding price, taj rishikesh resort & spa uttarakhand destination wedding, taj rishikesh wedding, taj rishikesh resort and spa pre wedding', '/storage/hotel/seo/PayscxDJkIFJzboWQP5uEZQEQRXlacDGyjtSSSiS.png', '/storage/hotels/banners/bvBw5dasWtm7qjUqMrR1ap0uHMgUxJnfrMWPNzKg.jpg', 'Taj Rishikesh Resort And Spa', 'Singthali, near Pebble Beach, Byasi, Rishikesh, Uttarakhand 249192, India', '120 Minutes', '50 Minutes', '<p>With the Ganges always in view<strong>, Taj Rishikesh Resort &amp; Spa in Uttarakhand</strong> stretches across 12.5 acres of hillside, carefully terraced to preserve the terrain. Its architecture reflects the traditional&nbsp;<i>kath-kuni</i> style, with detailed use of river stone, slate and timber, allowing the property to sit naturally within the landscape.</p><p>For couples planning a wedding, the resort offers a truly memorable setting. Imagine exchanging vows with the holy Ganges as your backdrop, hosting wedding festivities on open terraces, and capturing special moments framed by green trees and foggy mountains.&nbsp;</p><p>With Taj’s impeccable hospitality and efficient services, every guest at the property is bound to feel welcomed and cared for. Weddings here are more than events; they become unforgettable experiences where nature, design, and heartfelt service come together beautifully.</p>', '79 rooms with villas', 'Salle', 'Sports Lawn', '200', '200', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/gIfeRskkSByxugU9RIs01bkKpbztKKwY6TX9R8an.jpg", "title": "4+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/m0sPdIGNGWrAq4IpdsZxBX7EYbGpVvYnqeRDXoj6.jpg", "title": "Private Pebble Beach nature walk"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/PKaJwpn4FTk2Id7BnTdrnmtzQGMj91ExomXzRj1o.jpg", "title": "Himalayan mountain drive trek"}]', '[{"id": 203, "question": "How much does a wedding at Taj Rishikesh Resort & Spa, Uttarakhand resort cost?", "answer": "<p>As per reviews, a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at Taj Rishikesh Resort &amp; Spa, Uttarakhand,</strong> costs between INR 1.5 Cr and INR 2 Cr. To get a fair estimate of the total budget based on your guest capacity, required rooms and preferred dates of stay, use Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator. Enter the necessary details, click on ‘Calculate Hotel Cost’ and get the exact quote instantly.</p>"}, {"id": 204, "question": "How to reach the Taj Rishikesh Resort & Spa, Uttarakhand?", "answer": "<p>The closest airport to<strong> Taj Rishikesh Resort &amp; Spa in Uttarakhand&nbsp;</strong>is Jolly Grant Airport in Dehradun (DED), which is about 50–51 km away. The resort is in Singthali, Tehri Garhwal, about 30 km from Rishikesh. To reach the hotel, you can either book a private transfer or call the property to arrange a chauffeur-driven car.</p>"}, {"id": 205, "question": "How does Taj Rishikesh Resort & Spa in Uttarakhand compare to The Westin Resort & Spa, Himalayas?", "answer": "<p>Taj Rishikesh Resort &amp; Spa has 79 rooms with a wedding budget of INR 1.5–2 Cr, making it ideal for more intimate weddings. For larger celebrations, you may need extra accommodation nearby. The Westin Resort &amp; Spa, Himalayas, provides 141 luxurious rooms with an average wedding budget of INR 2.75–3 Cr, perfect for larger, residential celebrations. Both are accessible from Jolly Grant Airport, but Taj is 50–60 km away (1.5–2 hours), while Westin is closer at 28–30 km (45–55 minutes).</p>"}, {"id": 206, "question": "Is early check-in available at Taj Rishikesh Resort & Spa in Uttarakhand for wedding guests?", "answer": "<p>Yes, an early check-in can be accommodated at the&nbsp;<strong>Taj Rishikesh Resort &amp; Spa in Uttarakhand.</strong> However, it is subject to availability. The standard check-in time at the resort is 2:00 pm, and guests can check-out until 12:00 noon.</p>"}, {"id": 207, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol to a wedding at Taj Rishikesh Resort & Spa in Uttarakhand?", "answer": "<p>Alcohol consumption is permitted at Taj Rishikesh Resort &amp; Spa in Uttarakhand, but you cannot bring alcohol from outside the hotel premises. All beverages, including alcoholic drinks, must be purchased from the hotel itself. Charges for drinks are based on consumption, and they are usually not included in the standard wedding package.</p>"}]', '66', '79'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'rishikesh' AND `slug` = 'taj-rishikesh-resort-and-spa');
