SELECT 'shimla', 'taj-theog-resort-and-spa-shimla', 'published', 'Taj Theog Resort Shimla Wedding Cost & Easy Online Booking', 'Taj Theog Resort & Spa Shimla offers iconic Himalayan wedding venues, crystal-clear wedding costs & instant resort booking for your dream day. Check Now!', 'taj theog resort & spa shimla wedding cost, taj theog resort and spa wedding venue, taj theog resort & spa shimla booking', '/storage/hotel/seo/ngYLDWPFfPWr09DfdvoUnNp81QggjgU6wbuXkKTZ.png', '/storage/hotels/banners/uX5Gb9sbU35Bnizo0OyyFKUB8bZun0VmpOZt5rnQ.jpg', 'Taj Theog Resort And Spa Shimla', 'Men Market, Theog, Himachal Pradesh 171201, India', '90 minutes', '35 Minutes', '<p>In Shimla, weddings take on a completely different mood; cooler air, pine-covered slopes and wide, open views replace the usual city settings.&nbsp;<strong>Taj Theog Resort &amp; Spa&nbsp;</strong>sits high above the valley, where the mountains feel close, and the surroundings naturally create a sense of calm and privacy for your celebrations.</p><p>Picture wedding ceremonies framed by snow-capped peaks, gatherings in pine-scented gardens and evenings that unfold under breezy, open skies. With colonial-inspired architecture, elaborate wooden details and rooms overlooking the mountains, a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at Taj Theog Resort &amp; Spa, Shimla</strong> creates a wedding experience that is scenic and deeply memorable.</p><p>What adds to the experience is the warmth of Taj hospitality, making sure guests feel comfortable and relaxed throughout. With comfortable rooms and thoughtful service, everything feels easy. In winter, a light snowfall can make the setting feel even more special and memorable.</p>', '97', 'Azalea Ballroom, Daffodil', 'North Garden, West Garden Lawns', '200', '225', '[{"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal02.png", "title": "3+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal03.png", "title": "Starlit bonfire barbecue dining experience"}, {"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal04.png", "title": "Apple orchard chef curated dining"}]', '[{"id": 676, "question": "What is the cost of a destination wedding at Taj Theog Resort & Spa, Shimla?", "answer": "<p>On average, the cost of a destination wedding at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Theog Resort &amp; Spa, Shimla,&nbsp;</strong>starts at INR 70 lakhs and goes up to INR 1.2 Cr. For a premium 3-day, 2-night wedding experience, the budget can range from INR 70-90 lakhs. To get an accurate estimate, use Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator and get an exact quote within seconds.</p>"}, {"id": 677, "question": "How to reach Taj Theog Resort & Spa, Shimla?", "answer": "<p>Shimla Airport (SLV) is the nearest airport to&nbsp;<strong>Taj Theog Resort &amp; Spa in Shimla</strong>, about 48-52 km away. It takes roughly 1.5 to 2 hours by road, depending on traffic and weather conditions. Guests are recommended to travel in a four-wheel-drive (4x4) vehicle during extreme weather.</p>"}, {"id": 678, "question": "How much can I save if I book Taj Theog Resort & Spa, Shimla, through Viraaya Weddings?", "answer": "<p>A&nbsp;<strong>Taj Theog Resort &amp; Spa, Shimla</strong>&nbsp;<strong>booking&nbsp;</strong>through Viraaya Weddings can help you save 10-15% or more with better negotiated rates. It also makes planning easier by providing reliable vendors and smoother coordination throughout your wedding.</p>"}, {"id": 679, "question": "What is the check-in time at Taj Theog Resort & Spa, Shimla, and can we get early check-in?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Theog Resort &amp; Spa, Shimla,</strong> is 2:00 pm, and check-out is by 12:00 noon. Early check-in can be requested and arranged, subject to hotel availability.</p>"}, {"id": 680, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol to Taj Theog Resort & Spa in Shimla?", "answer": "<p><strong>Taj Theog Resort &amp; Spa, Shimla,&nbsp;</strong>serves alcohol, but all beverages must be arranged through the hotel. Outside alcohol isn’t allowed on the property, and charges are based on consumption, separate from wedding packages.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '69', '97'
