SELECT 'surat', 'hilton-garden-inn-surat-city-centre', 'published', 'Hilton Garden Inn Surat City Centre Wedding Cost', 'Hilton Garden Inn Surat City Centre offers elegant wedding venues and premium hospitality. Check wedding costs, room prices & guest reviews before booking.', 'Hilton Garden Inn Surat City Centre reviews, Hilton Garden Inn Surat City Centre booking, Hilton Garden Inn Surat City Centre wedding, Hilton Garden Inn Surat City Centre wedding cost, hilton garden inn', '/storage/hotel/seo/Z3ZbVkJVjeBOV4GnCwQqWOKjbQX4CFnm7eZr3CoH.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/2BSeKkIChNab7gYKhO0Qnpx6fbzXEtkCuaN4rC2V.jpg', 'Hilton Garden Inn Surat City Centre', 'City Survey No:7/39, opposite Railway Station Road, Sufi Baug, Railway Station Area, Varachha, Surat, Gujarat 395003, India', '35 Minutes', '5 Minutes', '<p>A celebration in Surat feels noticeably more streamlined when it takes place at&nbsp;<strong>Hilton Garden Inn Surat City Centre</strong>, where the city’s energy is close yet the experience inside feels carefully composed. Opened in 2021 as a relatively new 4-star Hilton property,&nbsp;<strong>Hilton Garden Inn Surat City Centre</strong> combines glass-heavy contemporary architecture with warm, minimal interiors right in the heart of Station Road’s busy commercial district, creating a setting that feels both central and surprisingly composed for multi-day celebrations.</p><p>At&nbsp;<strong>Hilton Garden Inn Surat City Centre</strong>, wedding functions are designed to stay efficient without losing their sense of occasion. The Solitaire Ballroom offers a pillarless indoor space of around 2,706 sq. ft., ideal for receptions, sangeets and ceremonial setups, while the rooftop pool deck provides a more intimate backdrop for pre-wedding gatherings. For a&nbsp;<strong>wedding in Gujarat</strong>, the biggest advantage is how connected everything feels, with the railway station within walking distance and the airport easily accessible from the property.</p><p>What stays with guests at&nbsp;<strong>Hilton Garden Inn Surat City Centre</strong> is the ease of the overall flow. The 104 rooms and suites are designed for comfort and practicality, helping families settle in between functions without friction. Beyond the hotel, Surat’s textile markets, heritage spots like Surat Castle, Gopi Talav and nearby leisure escapes such as Dumas Beach naturally extend the wedding experience into the city itself.</p>', '104 rooms with suites', 'The Ballroom, The Solitaire Ballrooms', 'The Rooftop Pool Deck', '250', '250', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/eBvRo2Bb2h6ACOcUoMvIKXj8WvBkZ7mqCJwHqaBo.jpg", "title": "2+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/tEuOvmn2afAmKTPrzTOu9XYjsq37F4wHGbT78UyR.jpg", "title": "Rooftop skyline sundowner mixer evenings"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/SoPkj9S41a3RlGKlA7dnJmv6XGUUzvIz66w3radB.jpg", "title": "Luxury bridal vanity suite lounges"}]', '[{"id": 1027, "question": "Which months are most popular for weddings at Hilton Garden Inn Surat City Centre?", "answer": "<p>November to February are the busiest wedding months at&nbsp;<strong>Hilton Garden Inn Surat City Centre</strong>. April and May also see strong demand because of the city’s popular wedding dates and indoor venues.</p>"}, {"id": 1028, "question": "What are the regular check-in and check-out timings at Hilton Garden Inn Surat City Centre? Is early check-in possible?", "answer": "<p><strong>Hilton Garden Inn Surat City Centre</strong> usually offers check-in from 3:00 pm and check-out by 11:00 am. Guests can request an early check-in, subject to room availability at the hotel.</p>"}, {"id": 1029, "question": "Are drones, fireworks or baraat allowed for weddings at Hilton Garden Inn Surat City Centre?", "answer": "<p><strong>Hilton Garden Inn Surat City Centre</strong> may allow baraat entries, fireworks and drone photography for weddings, subject to local Surat regulations and hotel permissions.</p>"}, {"id": 1030, "question": "Can guests explore local sights during their stay at Hilton Garden Inn Surat?", "answer": "<p>Guests staying at&nbsp;<strong>Hilton Garden Inn Surat</strong> often explore nearby Dumas Beach, Dutch Garden, Science Centre, Gopi Talav and Surat Castle. Many also enjoy shopping and café-hopping around VR Surat and city markets during the wedding stay.</p>"}, {"id": 1031, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol to the Hilton Garden Inn Surat City Centre for a destination wedding?", "answer": "<p><strong>Hilton Garden Inn Surat&nbsp;</strong>usually does not permit outside alcohol for destination weddings. The hotel manages all beverage service in-house, with packages charged separately from standard wedding arrangements.</p>"}]', '282', '104'
