SELECT 'trivandrum', 'hilton-garden-inn-trivandrum', 'published', 'Hilton Garden Inn Trivandrum Wedding Cost & Booking', 'Hilton Garden Inn Trivandrum wedding cost, package & booking. Book your dream wedding at Hilton Garden Trivandrum with premium venues & luxury hospitality.', 'hilton garden inn trivandrum wedding, hilton garden inn trivandrum wedding cost, hilton garden inn trivandrum wedding price, hilton garden inn trivandrum wedding package, hilton garden trivandrum', '/storage/hotel/seo/6NoVB0AeZirhZ7WVIh88HfTqGajYYh7tuRkbT353.png', '/storage/hotels/banners/tAuXtB0MNgTFhPweLa9JnKqoTC5NdeMOyJDbLqON.jpg', 'Hilton Garden Inn Trivandrum', 'Punnen Rd, Statue, Palayam, Thiruvananthapuram, Kerala 695039, India', '20 Minutes', '10 Minutes', '<p>A&nbsp;<strong>wedding at Hilton Garden Inn Trivandrum</strong> feels like a well-planned city celebration in the heart of Kerala’s capital. Located on Punnen Road, the hotel keeps guests close to key landmarks like Sree Padmanabhaswamy Temple, Napier Museum and the Zoo. A wedding in Kerala here feels connected to the city while still offering a calm, organised setting for celebrations.</p><p>The Grand Ballroom at the&nbsp;<strong>Hilton Garden Inn Trivandrum</strong> is usually set up for larger functions like receptions and sangeets, while the poolside area suits smaller, relaxed gatherings. With Hilton’s hospitality team taking care of the arrangements, dining, decor and everything else, families can simply enjoy the celebration without getting involved in the day-to-day coordination.</p><p>What stands out at&nbsp;<strong>Hilton Garden Inn Trivandrum</strong> is how uncomplicated the experience feels. The rooms are modern and comfortable, the service is attentive without being overbearing, and guests can move from formal events to relaxed evenings without any sense of effort. It works well for couples who want a<strong> wedding in Kerala</strong> that feels organised, comfortable and grounded in the city rather than aloof from it.</p>', '132 rooms with suites', 'Grand Ballroom', 'Pool Area', '300', '300', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/GkGxEQdqE3Yr6hPRR6Eys3mUarnfnCreThLWrKWH.jpg", "title": "2+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/KjI3pPPnzMOwlhUxFE8E4NEZCcLjA8NwLacyOy9z.jpg", "title": "Curated romantic garden dining experience"}]', '[{"id": 1102, "question": "Which is the nearest airport to the Hilton Garden Inn Trivandrum?", "answer": "<p>Trivandrum International Airport (TRV) is the nearest airport to&nbsp;<strong>Hilton Garden Inn Trivandrum</strong>. It is just about 5-6 km away, with a short 15-20 minute drive.</p>"}, {"id": 1103, "question": "What is the standard check-in time at Hilton Garden Inn Trivandrum, and can guests request an early check-in?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Hilton Garden Inn Trivandrum</strong> is 3:00 pm, while guests can check out by 12:00 noon. Guests can request an early check-in to the property, subject to hotel availability.</p>"}, {"id": 1104, "question": "Is there an indoor backup in case of rain at the Hilton Garden Inn Trivandrum?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>Hilton Garden Inn Trivandrum</strong> offers indoor banquet and dining spaces close to outdoor areas, ensuring smooth rain backup without disrupting events.</p>"}, {"id": 1105, "question": "How much can I save if I book the Hilton Garden Inn Trivandrum through Viraaya Weddings?", "answer": "<p>Booking&nbsp;<strong>Hilton Garden Inn Trivandrum</strong> through Viraaya Weddings can help you save around 10-15% or more via partnered rates, along with access to curated vendors and simplified wedding planning support.</p>"}, {"id": 1106, "question": "What is the standard liquor policy of Hilton Garden Inn Trivandrum?", "answer": "<p><strong>Hilton Garden Inn Trivandrum</strong> handles all liquor service through its in-house bar for weddings. Outside alcohol is generally not allowed, with curated beverage packages tailored to your guest count and celebration style.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '89', '132'
