SELECT 'udaipur', 'aurika-udaipur', 'published', 'Aurika Hotel Udaipur Wedding Cost for Grand Events', 'Discover Aurika Hotel Udaipur with wedding cost insights, seamless booking options and luxury hospitality experiences. Book now for exclusive stays today!', 'aurika udaipur wedding cost, aurika udaipur wedding price , aurika udaipur booking , aurika hotels and resorts, aurika hotel udaipur , aurika resort udaipur', '/storage/hotel/seo/SjaJhxtHG5kE3STXKPkvg5wF3JW7xjzqy4QCt2Ke.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/Yh0p8XSjzf5kOUlMAtDLsxURBvMgiQlBi2jsqTAc.jpg', 'Aurika Udaipur', '01, Kala Rohi, Rani Rd, Udaipur, Rajasthan 313001, India', '50 Minutes', '35 Minutes', '<p>A&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Udaipur</strong> at&nbsp;<strong>Aurika Udaipur Luxury by Lemon Tree Hotels</strong> sits along the gentle slopes of the lush Aravallis, where rocky contours, open courtyards and still water blend into one beautiful landscape. The design is chic and contemporary, opening outward so the surroundings always feel closely tied and a part of the experience.</p><p>The surroundings of this 5-star luxury resort carry the quiet charm of the City of Lakes, with soft light, layered hills and distant water views forming a calm, natural backdrop throughout the property. Even spaces like the Ekaara Ballroom feel open and connected, with terraces that keep the outdoors within sight at all times.</p><p>What stands out is how easy it all feels. The landscape, the design and Lemon Tree’s warm hospitality come together in a way that feels relaxed and natural, leaving guests with a lasting sense of place and calm.</p>', '139', 'Ekaara Ballroom', 'Ekaara Terrace', '280', '300', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/oIv7W8MJsV0VfnTtZctH66ev9TS4nREUPJOmCXDj.jpg", "title": "2+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/wHjrCgAQuxXCCYqBwTVNnzUdXB24w53Ay6iF460A.jpg", "title": "Private starlit candlelight dining escapes"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/Vb1ZtVQavuFhWfL6pkyJpJKRhLRcKrRbpIe1ZcaE.jpg", "title": "Hidden garden riddle and wine quest"}]', '[{"id": 559, "question": "How much does a wedding at Aurika Hotel, Udaipur cost?", "answer": "<p>The standard cost of a destination wedding at&nbsp;<strong>Aurika, Udaipur,&nbsp;</strong>ranges between INR&nbsp; 1.3 Cr to INR 1.5 Cr for a 300-guest celebration. Get an exact quote by using Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator. Simply, enter your duration of stay, guest count, room requirements and other details to get a precise estimate within seconds.</p>"}, {"id": 560, "question": "Which is the nearest airport to Aurika Hotel, Udaipur?", "answer": "<p><strong>Aurika Udaipur, Luxury by Lemon Tree Hotels,</strong> is around 27–43 km from Maharana Pratap Airport, with a travel time of roughly 35–45 minutes by road.</p>"}, {"id": 561, "question": "Should I choose Aurika, Udaipur or Holymont Resort Udaipur for my wedding?", "answer": "<p>Choose&nbsp;<strong>Aurika Hotel, Udaipur,&nbsp;</strong>for a more premium wedding experience (INR 1.3–1.5 Cr) with 139 rooms and 35–45 minute airport access. Go for Holymont Resort Udaipur for a more budget-friendly celebration (INR 90 lakh–1.2 Cr) with 150 rooms and similar connectivity.</p>"}, {"id": 562, "question": "Is early check-in available for wedding guests at Aurika Hotel, Udaipur?", "answer": "<p>Yes, early check-in can be arranged by the hotel, but it is subject to availability. The standard check-in time is at 2:00 pm, and check-out is usually by 12:00 noon.</p>"}, {"id": 563, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol to a wedding at Aurika Hotel, Udaipur?", "answer": "<p>At&nbsp;<strong>Aurika Udaipur Luxury by Lemon Tree Hotels</strong>, outside alcohol is not allowed on the property. All beverages must be sourced through the hotel itself, and all drinks served in the banquet spaces are charged separately.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '149', '139'
