SELECT 'udaipur', 'chunda-palace-udaipur', 'published', 'Chunda Palace Udaipur Wedding Cost, Packages & Hotel Booking', 'Explore Chunda Palace with details on Chunda Palace Udaipur wedding cost and Chunda Palace Udaipur wedding packages. Plan your dream wedding celebration', 'chunda palace udaipur wedding cost, chunda palace wedding cost, chunda palace udaipur wedding packages, chunda palace udaipur wedding', '/storage/hotel/seo/iHBMOP751xDYq1FfNXt0VE0pvewr48gJPVzOhyz8.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/3xCQ7QQHCKGNnctI5n0L9BZwbR7tFw2jS2Uge1PE.jpg', 'Chunda Palace Udaipur', '1 Haridas Ji Ki Magri, Main Road, Udaipur, Rajasthan 313001, India, India', '60 Minutes', '15 Minutes', '<p><strong>Chunda Palace&nbsp;</strong>is set on a quiet hill in Udaipur with clear views of Lake Pichola and the old city. This 5-star luxury boutique property feels calm and visually rich, with every corner opening to a different angle of the cityscape. Since it is a short drive from Maharana Pratap Airport, key attractions are located in proximity. For couples planning to host a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Udaipur,</strong> this palace setting offers a balance of privacy, scenic views and convenience.</p><p>What sets&nbsp;<strong>Chunda Palace&nbsp;</strong>apart is the level of craftsmanship. The entire property has been hand-painted over the years, with frescoes, gold-leaf ceilings and intricate inlay work running through corridors, rooms and banquet spaces. No two rooms look the same, which makes guests feel far more considered. With around 50 rooms and suites, the scale stays manageable, making it easier to host close-knit celebrations.</p><p>Weddings here typically centre around the rooftop terrace, especially for sunset pheras overlooking the lake. Indoor spaces like Aravali Hall bring in a more ornate setting for evenings. Add warm, attentive service and traditional dining and a<strong> destination wedding at Chunda Palace&nbsp;</strong>feels immersive, artistic and quietly memorable rather than overwhelming.</p>', '50', 'Mantrana Conference Hall, Aravali Hall', 'Open Terrace, Poolside Terrace', '100', '150', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/a7FUNdYioiavfJdqhkBTeIzWYtf9YD3JBmxAxYz3.jpg", "title": "3+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/BDNRHS4PvuAwCC1NwUBMcHnyCZMrSFy9DzfSnT0v.jpg", "title": "Marwari arrival with rose petals"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/38NvTLlIUsAMMiH6H4nzyPzy6cTJZrMAWgnfpKoC.jpg", "title": "Sufi night with live traditional music"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/joZ1JRd7JHqfaPYgQOG940YyL4sas5BoeiNI1T2c.jpg", "title": "Rooftop candlelit dining with lake views"}]', '[{"id": 742, "question": "How to reach Chunda Palace from the nearest airport?", "answer": "<p><strong>Chunda Palace</strong> is about 25-26 km from Maharana Pratap Airport (UDR). A car ride from the airport to the palace usually takes 30-45 minutes by car, depending on traffic.</p>"}, {"id": 743, "question": "What are the standard check-in check out timings at Chunda Palace, and can guests check-in early?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Chunda Palace</strong> is 2:00 pm, and guests can check out by 12:00 noon. Guests can request an early check-in, but it is completely subject to hotel availability.</p>"}, {"id": 744, "question": "Are there suggested excursions or experiences near the Chunda Palace?", "answer": "<p>Around&nbsp;<strong>Chunda Palace,&nbsp;</strong>guests can visit Ambamata Temple, walk to Lake Pichola viewpoints, explore Bahubali Hills, enjoy Sajjangarh Monsoon Palace sunsets, stroll near Rani Road cafés or take quiet village walks nearby.</p>"}, {"id": 745, "question": "What is the ideal budget for a 2-night destination wedding at Chunda Palace?", "answer": "<p>The standard cost of a destination wedding for a guest list of 150-200 at&nbsp;<strong>Chunda Palace</strong> usually ranges between INR 30 lakhs and INR 55 lakhs for a 3-day, 2-night celebration. To get an accurate quote based on your room requirements and guest count, refer to Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator.</p>"}, {"id": 746, "question": "What is the standard liquor policy at Chunda Palace for weddings?", "answer": "<p><strong>Chunda Palace&nbsp;</strong>follows an in-house bar policy for weddings. Outside alcohol is not allowed, and all beverages are served and billed based on consumption, separate from standard wedding packages.</p>"}]', '342', '50'
