SELECT 'udaipur', 'fairmont-udaipur-palace', 'published', 'Fairmont Udaipur Palace Wedding Cost & Venue Booking', 'Reign over a lakeside royal wedding at Fairmont Udaipur Palace. Check wedding cost, stunning palace venues & exclusive packages for your Udaipur wedding.', 'fairmont udaipur wedding cost, fairmont udaipur wedding, fairmont udaipur palace wedding, fairmont udaipur wedding package, fairmont udaipur palace booking, fairmont udaipur palace price, fairmont udaipur palace resort', '/storage/hotel/seo/xFxwPWiAUoFklHLEIvnu84M98zjNDaFWSZiS1rfJ.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/o1tBD0dLpGBZzZSFKAbvne8rharfjGP9k7xQ7dD6.jpg', 'Fairmont Udaipur Palace', 'Next to HP Gas Godown, Seesarma, Udaipur, Rajasthan 313031, India', '45 minutes', '', '<p>Inspired by Udaipur’s iconic City Palace and royal forts, the Fairmont Udaipur Palace is a palatial property that is widely regarded as one of the most premier destination wedding places in Udaipur.</p><p>Crafted as a labour of love, the palace is layered with local Pichwai and Indo-Islamic influences and surrounded by the Aravallis. For couples who choose this Udaipur hotel for their wedding, sky and hills frame the mandap, while birdsong carries through the sangeet, drawing the landscape into the celebration.</p><p>With 142,743 square feet of event space spread across three distinct palaces, an in-house team dedicated exclusively to weddings and an extensive range of culinary possibilities, this destination wedding venue in Udaipur is designed for celebrations of extraordinary scale and families with an instinct for the exceptional. Its sheer footprint and capacity set it apart as the most versatile Udaipur wedding venue, designed to host celebrations that bridge the instant and the eternal.</p>', '327 rooms and suites.', 'Imperial Ballroom, Udai Mahal, Jewel Ballroom, Dialogue Rooms (5), Regal Room.', 'Noor Bagh, Udai Bagh, Jashn Palace Garden, Chand Baori, Ivory Garden & Pool, Sitara Rooftop and Infinity Terrace.', '700', '700', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/lt1pdZEJLquD5SAMeBxmlPBlPCx8R1dTXAZpd1TS.jpg", "title": "Varied and disability-friendly accommodations"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/Pla8ZGnXMRlvNucyjzdg5kRM0C45A7G2yOlQQUBY.jpg", "title": "Multi-cuisine dining across 5 on-site restaurants"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/1bNz7lM7eMuNricOxXS7tKiSh9LYfGnC7QHIHGuD.jpg", "title": "Fitness and spa sanctuary for pre- and post-wedding rejuvenation"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/VCSlw7dJKN8SsDhnG8ZKzoxQHVLnHwf1T4voNjet.jpg", "title": "On-site bicycle rentals to explore the expansive grounds"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/xBJOrtLpzQRoSEERRGx4egCOvcAEAcVJJrKT26dn.jpg", "title": "Dedicated wedding specialists to curate every detail"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/QBHZOw3CpRW5BFpshhHepdLW54TQhX2xt7A8ZXym.jpg", "title": "All-inclusive wedding packages covering venue rental, stays, dining and more"}]', '[{"id": 651, "question": "How much does a wedding cost at Fairmont Udaipur Palace?", "answer": "<p>A&nbsp;<strong>wedding at Fairmont Udaipur Palace</strong> can cost anywhere between ₹5 crore and ₹6.5 crore for 2 nights and 3 days, depending on factors such as the number of required rooms, preferred dates and more. For a personalised estimate based on your celebration details, you can use our Cost Calculator.</p>"}, {"id": 652, "question": "Which is better: Fairmont Udaipur Palace or The Oberoi Udaivilas, Udaipur?", "answer": "<p>It depends on your vision, guest count and wedding budget. Fairmont Udaipur Palace, with around 327 rooms, is designed for large-scale residential weddings. Set against the Aravalli hills, it offers expansive venues and scenic views, making it ideal for grand, multi-day celebrations with out-of-state guests.</p><p>The Oberoi Udaivilas, on the other hand, is located along Lake Pichola and features 87 rooms. It is better suited for intimate, luxury ceremonies. Guest accommodation may need to be spread across nearby properties for larger weddings. Weddings at this venue typically range between ₹3.5 to ₹4.5 crore.</p>"}, {"id": 653, "question": "What is the alcohol policy for weddings at Fairmont Udaipur Palace?", "answer": "<p>Alcohol service at&nbsp;<strong>Fairmont Udaipur Palace</strong> is managed exclusively by the hotel. All alcoholic beverages served during wedding functions must be purchased through the hotel. Outside alcohol is generally not permitted within the hotel’s event spaces or public areas. Beverage consumption is typically billed separately.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 654, "question": "What is the check-in time at Fairmont Udaipur, and is early check-in allowed?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at Fairmont Udaipur Palace is typically at 3:00 pm, while check-out is scheduled around 12:00 noon, in line with most luxury hospitality properties. Early check-in or late check-out requests can usually be arranged, but these are subject to room availability and the hotel’s occupancy on the day of arrival or departure.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 655, "question": "How early should I book Fairmont Udaipur Palace for a wedding?", "answer": "<p>As a premier wedding venue in a high-demand destination like Udaipur, it is best to secure your dates as early as possible. We recommend booking Fairmont Udaipur Palace at least 12 to 14 months in advance, especially if you are planning your wedding during the peak season between November and March.&nbsp;<br>If you want to verify availability before booking, you can use our Venue Availability Check service. It gives you instant visibility into your preferred dates and also suggests suitable alternatives if your chosen venues are unavailable.</p>"}]', '9', '327'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'udaipur' AND `slug` = 'fairmont-udaipur-palace');
--> statement-breakpoint
