SELECT 'udaipur', 'hotel-lakend-udaipur', 'published', 'Hotel Lakend Udaipur – Wedding Venue Costs and Booking', 'Hotel Lakend Udaipur offers stunning lakeside wedding venues with honest wedding cost, transparent venue cost details & seamless booking. Book Now!', 'hotel lakend udaipur wedding cost, hotel lakend udaipur wedding, hotel lakend udaipur wedding venue cost, hotel lakend udaipur booking, hotel lakend udaipur india, hotel lakend udaipur price', '/storage/hotel/seo/XTfxtI7hfROxK50bDetbA5qQqUrxepPqI6YN9eQC.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/ug3m0q6k063emqdztQdi1e8BakMT4Kux5ndhGvw9.jpg', 'Hotel Lakend Udaipur', 'Alkapuri, Fateh Sagar Lake Shores, Udaipur, Rajasthan 313001, India, India', '50 Minutes', '20 Minutes', '<p><strong>A destination wedding in Udaipur</strong> often feels magical on its own, but Hotel Lakend, Udaipur, adds a front-row seat to Lake Pichola’s changing moods. As the City of Lakes features ornate palaces, ghats and Aravalli silhouettes, the property sits right by the water. Every moment here feels like a movie scene, calm and beautifully relaxed.</p><p>A&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at Hotel Lakend, Udaipur,</strong> shifts across lakeside lawns, regal courtyards and open terraces that seem perfect for giddy celebrations. Imagine golden hour sunset views and the sacred pheras taking place beside the shimmering waters, as guests move easily between open, airy spaces surrounded by nature.</p><p>What makes it truly special is how it brings everyone together without effort. With thoughtfully designed rooms, warm hospitality and uninterrupted lake views, the stay experience at&nbsp;<strong>Hotel Lakend in Udaipu</strong>r carries a relaxed elegance that never feels forced. A destination wedding in Udaipur here becomes a memory shaped by shining water, light and togetherness.</p>', '78', 'The Aravalli Ballroom, Banquet Halls', 'The Royal Lawns, Bougainvillaea Terrace by the lake, The Courtyard', '210', '210', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/V5xqV09ypQw4VIUfMWmOPWjF8tiMAjWpjffprVTe.jpg", "title": "4+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/T6Be84shzi1vMwPlQRv0hkzSh41iiMn1yHbrwr8T.jpg", "title": "Royal boat and camel rides"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/9aQWdwAObohxHcePmFcfnVviJrzGOkqLhOPbWNXl.jpg", "title": "Scenic lakeside rooftop dining experience"}]', '[{"id": 516, "question": "What is the Hotel Lakend, Udaipur destination wedding cost?", "answer": "<p>The standard Hotel Lakend Udaipur wedding venue cost ranges between INR 60 lakhs and INR 90 lakhs for a guest list of 150–200 people. To get an instant, exact quote based on your room requirements, guest count, dates of stay and other factors, use Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator.</p>"}, {"id": 517, "question": "Which is the nearest airport to Hotel Lakend, Udaipur?", "answer": "<p>The nearest airport to&nbsp;<strong>Hotel Lakend in Udaipur&nbsp;</strong>is Maharana Pratap Airport, located about 25–28 km away. It takes roughly 45–50 minutes to reach the hotel by road.</p>"}, {"id": 518, "question": "How much can I save if I book Hotel Lakend in Udaipur through Viraaya Weddings?", "answer": "<p>If you complete&nbsp;<strong>Hotel Lakend Udaipur booking</strong> through Viraaya Weddings, you can save 10–15% or more by negotiating the price. It also makes it easier to work together and get in touch with reliable vendors for easy planning.</p>"}, {"id": 519, "question": "Is early check-in at Hotel Lakend, Udaipur, allowed?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>Hotel Lakend in Udaipur</strong> accommodates early check-ins, subject to availability. The standard check-in time at the hotel is 1:00 pm, and check-out is by 11:00 am.</p>"}, {"id": 520, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol to Hotel Lakend, Udaipur?", "answer": "<p><strong>Hotel Lakend, Udaipur,</strong> serves alcohol within the property, but all beverages must be sourced directly from the hotel. Bringing outside alcohol is not allowed. Billing is done separately based on consumption and is not part of standard wedding packages.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '349', '78'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'udaipur' AND `slug` = 'hotel-lakend-udaipur');
