SELECT 'udaipur', 'justa-sajjangarh-resort-and-spa-udaipur', 'published', 'Justa Sajjangarh Resort & Spa Wedding Cost & Booking', 'Justa Sajjangarh Resort & Spa blends Udaipur''s royal charm with spa luxury. Get honest wedding cost, read real reviews & plan your dream day. Call Us Now!', 'justa sajjangarh wedding, justa sajjangarh resort & spa wedding, justa sajjangarh resort & spa wedding cost, justa sajjangarh wedding', '/storage/hotel/seo/TxzKvvg6ExTJwaQznkbTL4e3KSiXYqTMGZt6Id7n.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/tquhdhJRTmyyTzy49Si3UomvvyYfcUh5Vqpn7WJ6.jpg', 'Justa Sajjangarh Resort And Spa Udaipur', 'Opposite Biological Park, Near Sajjangarh Main Gate, Udaipur, Rajasthan 313001, India, India', '50 Minutes', '25 Minutes', '<p>A<strong> destination wedding at jüSTa Sajjangarh Resort &amp; Spa</strong> feels lively from the moment guests arrive. Set against the backdrop of the Sajjangarh hills and close to the Monsoon Palace, the resort carries the energy of a modern celebration retreat rather than a formal heritage property. Open spaces, mountain views and sunset skies naturally become part of every event here, especially during outdoor functions and evening gatherings.</p><p>Inside, the design blends contemporary comfort with subtle Mewari influences through arches, jali-inspired detailing and vibrant Rajasthani artwork. The atmosphere feels warm, social and easy-going, which works beautifully for couples planning a<strong> destination wedding in Udaipur</strong> with multiple functions, large guest lists and celebrations that continue well beyond the main ceremony. Venues like Raas Mahal and the poolside areas allow events to shift seamlessly from elegant to festive.</p><p>What makes a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at jüSTa Sajjangarh Resort &amp; Spa&nbsp;</strong>especially appealing is its balance of scale and comfort. With spacious accommodations, rooftop dining experiences and relaxed hospitality, the property creates the feeling of a private celebration escape where guests can truly settle in and enjoy the wedding like a holiday.</p>', '96 rooms with suites', 'Raas Mahal, Prithvi Banquet', 'Raas Bageecha, Poolside Area', '250', '250', '[{"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal02.png", "title": "2+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal03.png", "title": "Sunset candlelit dining over Aravallis"}, {"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal04.png", "title": "Royal baraat entry on horseback"}]', '[{"id": 792, "question": "Which is the nearest airport to jüSTa Sajjangarh Resort & Spa, Udaipur?", "answer": "<p>Maharana Pratap Airport (UDR) is the closest airport to&nbsp;<strong>jüSTa Sajjangarh Resort &amp; Spa,</strong> located around 28 km away. The drive usually takes about 40 to 60 minutes, depending on traffic.</p>"}, {"id": 793, "question": "Is an early check-in allowed for guests at jüSTa Sajjangarh Resort & Spa?", "answer": "<p>Yes, guests can request an early check-in, and it can be accommodated based on hotel availability. The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>jüSTa Sajjangarh Resort &amp; Spa</strong> is 2:00 pm, and check-out time is at 11:00 am.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 794, "question": "Is outside catering allowed at jüSTa Sajjangarh Resort & Spa for a destination wedding?", "answer": "<p>Outside catering may be allowed at&nbsp;<strong>jüSTa Sajjangarh Resort &amp; Spa for destination weddings</strong>. However, it is best to confirm directly with the hotel management based on your event requirements.</p>"}, {"id": 795, "question": "What is the ideal budget for a 2-night destination wedding at jüSTa Sajjangarh Resort & Spa?", "answer": "<p>For a guest list of about 150-200, the standard cost of a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at jüSTa Sajjangarh Resort &amp; Spa</strong> usually ranges from INR 35 lakhs to INR 60 lakhs for a 3-day, 2-night celebration. Get an accurate quote based on your guest count and room requirements through Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 796, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol for a wedding at jüSTa Sajjangarh Resort & Spa in Udaipur?", "answer": "<p>No, outside alcohol is generally not permitted for&nbsp;<strong>weddings at jüSTa Sajjangarh Resort &amp; Spa in Udaipur</strong>. The hotel serves beverages through its in-house bar, with charges based on actual consumption.</p>"}]', '343', '96'
