SELECT 'udaipur', 'labh-garh-palace-resort-and-spa-udaipur', 'published', 'Labh Garh Palace Udaipur Resort & Spa Luxury Wedding Cost', 'Labh Garh Palace Resort & Spa is Udaipur''s crown jewel for weddings & wellness. Explore wedding cost details & luxury spa escapes. Plan Your Stay Now!', 'labh garh palace udaipur wedding cost, labh garh palace udaipur wedding, labh garh palace wedding, labh garh palace wedding cost, labh garh palace udaipur', '/storage/hotel/seo/JaK69MPod9LuiIzVtQxnaMnHZrvKQsODaBKJ5TwJ.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/LO5lqZJgaihMZg3kifoFuqNI2ozZsyrBzSCO6ulR.jpg', 'Labh Garh Palace Resort And Spa Udaipur', 'Cheerwa Ghats, Eklingji Road, NH-8, Udaipur, Rajasthan 313001, India, India', '45 Minutes', '35 Minutes', '<p>From the moment you arrive at&nbsp;<strong>Labh Garh Palace Resort &amp; Spa,&nbsp;</strong>the setting feels ready for a wedding. It sits in the Aravalli hills at Cheerwa Ghats, slightly away from the city. The layout is open and easy to move through. Courtyards, pools and lawns connect naturally. For a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Udaipur,</strong> this property offers sweeping hill views and a more relaxed pace without feeling isolated.</p><p>The design takes cues from old Mewari forts, but it doesn’t try to feel historic for the sake of it. You’ll notice domes, wide arches and sandstone details, but also large pools, open courtyards and terraces that are clearly made for gatherings. The 80 rooms and suites are spread out enough to give guests their own space, many with views of the hills or the central pool, which quietly becomes the heart of the property during a wedding.</p><p>What really stands out is how the venues come together. The Baradari makes for a striking mandap setup, Labh Vatika handles larger celebrations with ease and indoor functions slip into the Darbar Hall without feeling disconnected. A<strong> destination wedding at Labh Garh Palace Resort &amp; Spa</strong> feels lively, well-paced and thoughtfully laid out rather than overwhelming.</p>', '80', 'Darbar Hall', 'Courtyard and Baradari, Sagar Poolside Garden, Labh Vatika, Helipad Garden', '160', '200', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/eFXNoh2SZPzIHaNIQBgUE9OCxLAsvuAOiycd9HR5.jpg", "title": "3+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/WDOFVw1B5MgKYkpUwVJ3wQPrwUmjuO1D8t9bXZ0d.jpg", "title": "Royal baradari entry for the couple"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/eqB52MJeAAXqOIpqnQl6SHhYPJ23qTDK5LLAFLmw.jpg", "title": "Private dining under palace arches"}]', '[{"id": 737, "question": "Which is the nearest airport to the Labh Garh Palace Resort & Spa?", "answer": "<p>Maharana Pratap Airport (UDR) is the nearest airport to&nbsp;<strong>Labh Garh Palace Resort &amp; Spa</strong>, around 28 km away. A car ride usually takes about 30–45 minutes, depending on traffic.</p>"}, {"id": 738, "question": "What are the standard check-in check out timings at Labh Garh Palace Resort & Spa, and is an early check-in allowed?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Labh Garh Palace Resort &amp; Spa</strong> is 12:30 pm, and guests can check out by 11:00 am. An early check-in can be accommodated, subject to hotel availability.</p>"}, {"id": 739, "question": "Are there nearby attractions or activities for international guests around Labh Garh Palace Resort & Spa?", "answer": "<p>Guests can explore City Palace, Lake Pichola, Jag Mandir, Sajjangarh Monsoon Palace, Fateh Sagar Lake, Saheliyon Ki Bari and local markets, all offering a mix of heritage views and cultural experiences.</p>"}, {"id": 740, "question": "What is the ideal budget for a 2-night destination wedding at Labh Garh Palace Resort & Spa?", "answer": "<p>The standard cost of a destination wedding at&nbsp;<strong>Labh Garh Palace Resort &amp; Spa</strong> usually ranges between INR 40 lakhs and INR 60 lakhs for a 3-day, 2-night celebration. To get an accurate quote based on your requirements, refer to Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 741, "question": "Does Labh Garh Palace Resort & Spa provide a bar service for weddings?", "answer": "<p>Yes,&nbsp;<strong>Labh Garh Palace Resort &amp; Spa</strong> provides an in-house bar service for weddings. Outside alcohol is not permitted, and all beverages are served and charged on consumption.</p>"}]', '341', '80'
