SELECT 'udaipur', 'mementos-by-itc-hotels-ekaaya-udaipur', 'published', 'Mementos ITC Ekaaya Udaipur Wedding Cost & Packages', 'Celebrate your wedding at Mementos by ITC Ekaaya Udaipur. Discover curated destination wedding packages, venue pricing & luxury arrangements by the lake.', 'mementos udaipur wedding, mementos ekaaya udaipur, mementos by itc hotels ekaya udaipur, ekaaya udaipur, itc ekaaya udaipur, ekaaya resort udaipur, itc hotels ekaaya udaipur', '/storage/hotel/seo/7aVxtY1ugTzAuT0DCIEqk75Lt0oF33FQ7YM1Xh2l.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/L2uKAOWgQSakv20ZQ3wPIx5DZVfZwHNf76P679h3.jpg', 'Mementos by ITC Hotels Ekaaya Udaipur', 'near Eklingji Temple, Raya, Udaipur, Rajasthan 313202, India', '60 Minutes', '35 Minutes', '<p><strong>Mementos by ITC Hotels, Ekaaya Udaipur&nbsp;</strong></p><p>Overlooking the majesty of the Aravalli Hills,&nbsp;<strong>Mementos by ITC Hotels, Ekaaya Udaipur&nbsp;</strong>displays a more secluded side of the city away from its lakes and palace-lined streets. The hillside resort’s suites and villas rise gently along the landscape, opening out to views of greenery and tranquil waters. Verdant lawns planted with frangipani trees give a unique elegance to the surroundings, while the property’s modern design creates a serene and luxurious setting.</p><p>A grand&nbsp;<strong>wedding at Mementos Udaipur</strong> can be easily accommodated within its 6 distinct venues. Manicured gardens and poolside settings provide beautiful backdrops for ceremonies and sunset gatherings. Exclusive dining options and unforgettable sundowners further upgrade the experience, allowing couples to host lively ceremonies under open skies. With its sweeping views and impeccable service, the resort creates a picturesque stage for weddings that are not only lavish but memorable.&nbsp;</p>', '148 rooms with suites', 'Udaipur Stateroom, Reya', 'Magical Garden, Magical Forest, Poolside Lawn, Frangipani Lawn', '350', '700', '[{"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal02.png", "title": "Restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal03.png", "title": "Signature celebration experiences"}, {"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal04.png", "title": "Private dining and hospitality"}]', '[{"id": 35, "question": "What is the price of hosting a wedding at the Ekaaya resort in Udaipur?", "answer": "<p>A 2-day wedding accommodating 275 to 300 guests at&nbsp;<strong>Mementos by ITC, Ekaaya</strong> costs around ₹2 crore–2.5 crore (+GST) inclusive of meals and stay. The cost is exclusive of soft drinks, alcohol, décor and any event-related activities, but food like Hi-Tea, Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner and multiple venues inside the premises for hosting the events are included. For a more transparent estimate, you can refer to our Cost Calculator. Just enter your check-in, check-out and guest details to get a near-accurate budget.</p>"}, {"id": 36, "question": "Which is better for hosting a grand wedding: Mementos by ITC, Ekaaya Udaipur or Raffles Udaipur?", "answer": "<p><strong>Mementos by ITC Hotels, Ekaaya Udaipur,&nbsp;</strong>and Raffles Udaipur are equally nice choices for a grand wedding. However, Mementos suits couples seeking an outdoor wedding with multiple event spaces, while Raffles offers an ultra-luxury island with a more palatial ambience. The better choice depends on your guest count and preferred atmosphere.</p>"}, {"id": 37, "question": "Are there any late check-out privileges available at Mementos Ekaaya Udaipur?", "answer": "<p>While specific, guaranteed late check-out policies are not listed, such services are commonly available upon request, subject to availability and potential extra charges. It is recommended to contact the resort directly to arrange this in advance.</p>"}, {"id": 38, "question": "What is the official liquor policy of Mementos Ekaaya Udaipur?", "answer": "<p>Alcohol is allowed at&nbsp;<strong>Mementos Ekaaya Udaipur</strong>; however, spirits and cocktails to be served at banquet events must be purchased from the hotel’s licensed bars. These are charged separately and are not included as part of your wedding package. Privately bought alcohol is not permitted on the property.&nbsp;</p>"}]', '34', '148'
