SELECT 'udaipur', 'raajsa-resort-kumbhalgarh-ihcl-seleqtions-udaipur', 'published', 'Raajsa Resort Kumbhalgarh Wedding Cost – IHCL Seleqtions', 'Raajsa Resort Kumbhalgarh, an IHCL Seleqtions property, offers fort-view wedding venues with honest wedding cost details for every couple. Enquire Now!', 'raajsa resort kumbhalgarh wedding cost, raajsa resort kumbhalgarh wedding price, raajsa resort kumbhalgarh price, raajsa resort kumbhalgarh ihcl seleqtions, raajsa resort kumbhalgarh wedding', '/storage/hotel/seo/WTfAoW9Yu6FoEXm0q89m8vJjjh4Qo0CNBck5imDH.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/bUZXGQqvPUbTBx16ELpEQlgbx87k77bbOAZzPnBf.jpg', 'Raajsa Resort Kumbhalgarh IHCL SeleQtions Udaipur', 'Beer Ki Bhagal Village, Kumbhalgarh, Rajsamand, Rajasthan 313325, India, India', '90 Minutes', '120 Minutes', '<p>A destination wedding in Rajasthan often brings lakes and palaces to mind, but<strong> Raajsa, Kumbhalgarh - IHCL SeleQtions&nbsp;</strong>brings a very different aesthetic into the picture. Set at the foothills of the rugged Aravalli range, offering scenic views of Kumbhalgarh Fort and the calm expanse of Lakhela Lake, entering the resort feels like stepping into a living heritage landscape where history and nature quietly meet.</p><p>At golden hour, the mandap is staged in such a manner that it begins to feel straight out of a fairytale, with the venue decked like a bride under warm, glowing lights. Spread across 11 acres, the stone architecture and open courtyards come alive, creating a dreamy, cinematic atmosphere that makes the ceremony feel truly unforgettable.</p><p>What truly defines the stay experience at&nbsp;<strong>Raajsa Resort Kumbhalgarh&nbsp;</strong>is its easy connectivity and being well-connected despite being set in a secluded heritage landscape. Guests can explore Kumbhalgarh Fort, visit Ranakpur temples or simply unwind in the peaceful hills around the resort. The overall experience feels authentic, cultural and deeply rooted in Rajasthan’s rich historical character.</p>', '176', 'Darbar Hall, Choupal Hall, Darikhana', 'Baradari Lawn, Kalash Lawn, Poolside Areas', '350', '380', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/wu5qpzNofAHMakFAyFqHN46wulIUl58oyWHnVd5p.jpg", "title": "2+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/XNveDp1RRsduEGLrLc0qoK0YduXibdl5Ax6LxB81.jpg", "title": "Curated outdoor picnic experience"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/cXahNo1J7M87ZcSqvfoTS6w70MyyUd0pjqgsYzKV.jpg", "title": "Intimate candlelit private dining"}]', '[{"id": 521, "question": "What is the cost of a destination wedding at Raajsa Resort Kumbhalgarh?", "answer": "<p>The standard price of a destination wedding at&nbsp;<strong>Raajsa Resort Kumbhalgarh&nbsp;</strong>ranges between INR 70 lakhs and INR 1.2 Cr for a 3-day, 2-night event. To get a better estimate based on your guest count, room requirements and other factors, use Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator to get a quote within seconds.</p>"}, {"id": 522, "question": "Which is the nearest airport to Raajsa Resort Kumbhalgarh?", "answer": "<p>The nearest airport to&nbsp;<strong>Raajsa Resort in Kumbhalgarh</strong> is Maharana Pratap Airport (UDR), Udaipur. It is about 91-92 km away, and a car ride from the airport to the resort takes about 1 hour and 45 minutes.</p>"}, {"id": 523, "question": "When is the peak wedding season at Raajsa Resort Kumbhalgarh?", "answer": "<p>Peak wedding season at&nbsp;<strong>Raajsa Resort Kumbhalgarh</strong> is November, December and February. December sees the highest demand with frequent bookings. February is also popular due to pleasant weather.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 524, "question": "What is the check-in time at Raajsa Resort Kumbhalgarh, and can we get early check-in?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Raajsa Resort Kumbhalgarh</strong> is 2:00 pm, and guests can check out by 11:00 am. Early check-in can be requested and arranged, subject to hotel availability.</p>"}, {"id": 525, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol to Raajsa Resort Kumbhalgarh for a wedding?", "answer": "<p>Alcohol is served at&nbsp;<strong>Raajsa Resort Kumbhalgarh,</strong> but all beverages must be purchased exclusively through the hotel. Outside alcohol is not permitted within the property. All drinks are charged separately on a consumption basis and are not included in standard wedding packages.</p>"}]', '350', '176'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'udaipur' AND `slug` = 'raajsa-resort-kumbhalgarh-ihcl-seleqtions-udaipur');
--> statement-breakpoint
