SELECT 'udaipur', 'raffles-udaipur', 'published', 'Raffles Udaipur Wedding Packages & Venue Booking', 'Explore Raffles Udaipur wedding packages and venue booking with royal boat arrival and stunning lakefront luxury. Make your dream wedding a reality.', 'raffles udaipur wedding, raffles udaipur wedding cost, raffles udaipur wedding package, raffles udaipur location, raffles booking, raffles udaipur contact number, raffles udaipur booking, Raffles Udaipur luxury resort, Raffles Udaipur booking deals, Raffles Udaipur resort packages, Raffles Udaipur latest offers', '/storage/hotel/seo/fjeRQptK62IcCYlvGTkJZ1GXPDj7sI8SdQhBI352.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/nYT1cGVKI26rzHD5klXd2O17oKOlQvgUFgr6RRmB.jpg', 'Raffles Udaipur', 'Arrival Limited, Raffles Udaipur Lakeshore, Plot No 1, Udaipur, Rajasthan 313024, India', '60 Minutes', '60 Minutes', '<p>Situated on a private island across 21 hectares,&nbsp;<strong>Raffles Udaipur’s location</strong> is set against a tranquil landscape. Surrounded by the lush green of the Aravallis and the Udai Sagar Lake, it takes inspiration from the classic European Palladian and Rajput-Mughal architecture, standing as a testament to an incredible fusion of the two.</p><p>Renowned for the on-site garden inspired by a 400-year-old Mahadeva Temple in the Aravallis<strong>,</strong> the property carries a rare sense of sacred heritage within the island. It sets the stage for an intimate mandap setting where heritage and lakeside opulence come together to create an awe-inspiring experience.</p><p>The&nbsp;<strong>Raffles Udaipur wedding package</strong> includes a dedicated 24-hour butler service, ensuring every function is seamlessly tailored to your vision. Nestled away from the hustle and bustle of the city,<strong> the Raffles&nbsp;</strong>Udaipur resort is home to exceptionally crafted ballrooms, expansive lawns, and delectable cuisines. Its sheer magnificence sets it apart as a sought-after&nbsp;<strong>wedding destination in Udaipur</strong>, where grandeur and privacy meet halfway.</p>', '137 / 101 rooms With 3 suites', 'The Grand Ballroom, Flexible Meeting Rooms', 'Garden Temple, Intimate Terraces, Lakeside Lawns', '1000', '1000', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/1mY4L61vOrC1CY3ai9S3pihosHibvl1EIghvq1G2.jpg", "title": "7+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/RK5oFT3tFvIa2wVnYbR4DQOh7FJ2sRVJR20J0UJq.jpg", "title": "Lakeshore rooms with a complimentary breakfast"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/ZzLP77iw4p02M4BQqvlRvdPuQwk0F2RzYEaj13qW.jpg", "title": "21 acres of gardens and grounds"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/ODAj3dKxqznSruNaJOfea5jjg3H2VGNdEALp25oI.jpg", "title": "Private garden temple by the lake"}]', '[{"id": 168, "question": "How much does a wedding at Raffles Udaipur resort cost?", "answer": "<p>On average, a&nbsp;<strong>wedding at Raffles Udaipur</strong> will approximately cost you around INR 2.3 Cr to INR 3 Cr for 3 days and 2 nights. Consider using our Cost Calculator, where you can enter your check-in and check-out details, total number of guests and other details to get an instant estimate.</p>"}, {"id": 169, "question": "Does Raffles Udaipur offer an outdoor wedding?", "answer": "<p>Yes, Raffles Udaipur offers several beautiful outdoor venues for weddings. One of the most popular is the grand varmala setup, where the palace serves as a stunning backdrop. The property also features expansive lawns and open-air spaces that are ideal for hosting various wedding functions in a scenic, elegant setting.</p>"}, {"id": 170, "question": "Which is better: Raffles Udaipur or Fairmont Udaipur?", "answer": "<p>It depends on your vision, budget and the size of your celebration. Raffles Udaipur has 137 rooms, making it ideal for intimate residential weddings with around 300 to 350 guests. Its exclusive island setting suits couples looking for a private, close-knit celebration, though its ultra-luxurious positioning necessitates a higher budget. Fairmont Udaipur, with 250 rooms, is better suited for larger residential weddings accommodating around 500 to 600 guests, and works well for couples envisioning a grander, more theatrical celebration against the backdrop of the Aravallis.</p>"}, {"id": 171, "question": "What is the liquor policy for destination weddings at Raffles Udaipur?", "answer": "<p>Alcohol is permitted at Raffles Udaipur; however, all beverages served in public areas and banquet spaces must be purchased exclusively through the hotel. Outside alcohol is not permitted on the premises. Beverages are charged separately based on consumption and are typically not included in the standard wedding package.</p>"}, {"id": 172, "question": "What is the check-in time at Raffles Udaipur, and can we check-in early?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at Raffles Udaipur is 3:00 pm and check-out is at 12:00 noon. Early check-in and late check-out can be requested and are accommodated subject to hotel availability.&nbsp;</p>"}]', '19', '137'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'udaipur' AND `slug` = 'raffles-udaipur');
--> statement-breakpoint
