SELECT 'udaipur', 'ramada-by-wyndham-udaipur-resort-and-spa', 'published', 'Ramada by Wyndham Udaipur Destination Wedding Venue', 'Ramada by Wyndham Udaipur Resort and Spa is your perfect destination wedding venue. Get clear wedding cost details & easy resort booking. Enquire Now!', 'ramada udaipur destination wedding, ramada udaipur wedding, ramada udaipur wedding cost, ramada resort udaipur booking', '/storage/hotel/seo/m6qbCIS98Ng5UoYY5JM74D5KST0vwHUYy0AmnQtD.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/ajbNABNjPkPYZi3C7s5FoeDgmhrqRziQ6NApjsOZ.jpg', 'Ramada by Wyndham Udaipur Resort and Spa', 'Rampura Circle, Khodiyat Road, Udaipur, Rajasthan – 313001, India, India', '30 minutes', '20 Minutes', '<p>A&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at Ramada by Wyndham Udaipur Resort and Spa</strong> offers a setting that feels elevated, both in location and experience. Built across 6.6 acres on a hilltop, the resort is designed in tiers, so almost every space opens out to views of the Aravalli Hills, Sajjangarh Fort and Udaipur’s lakes in the distance. For a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Udaipur</strong>, this resort strikes a balance between a palace-style backdrop and the comfort of a modern resort, away from the city’s busier pockets.</p><p>The architecture follows a strong Mewari influence, with sandstone facades, carved details and open courtyards that connect rooms, terraces and gathering spaces. Accommodations at Ramada Udaipur Resort are positioned to make the most of the landscape, many with private sit-outs, while Peacock-themed suites add a distinct local touch. The layout naturally creates multiple levels, which works well when hosting different wedding functions without overlap.</p><p>Celebrations move between venues like Sajjan Terrace with its Monsoon Palace views, and larger indoor spaces such as The Meridian. With multi-cuisine dining, spa facilities and attentive event support, a<strong> destination wedding at Ramada by Wyndham Udaipur Resort and Spa&nbsp;</strong>feels well-paced, scenic and thoughtfully put together.</p>', '72', 'The Meridian, The Panghat, Zuma', 'Sajjan Terrace, Monsoon Deck, Ambar, Rock Garden, Wind Garden', '150', '190', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/mIUqmhnjgvC3CHmcOPDRKhhs7tXjQHHTyNLi9SQO.jpg", "title": "3+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/qoKkVtho1BWJ9pSUJb8D0d4qjRKRr4a5WF1gffRt.jpg", "title": "Couple-led cooking session with a chef"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/ex33KQIZjHPoLtCXrUNClrMTT9BomEQ1UlWi33jN.jpg", "title": "Grand couple entry with themed flair"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/lZS8tzW11N3BIv5kb6GsHzQuCmTuuRVMSpGRtZp1.jpg", "title": "Styled mehndi, haldi and pooja setups"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/1jf4i0tC3BcN55qqUaojK5abPSUR8Jrq8qxuBtWO.jpg", "title": "Sunset terrace dining with city views"}]', '[{"id": 727, "question": "Which is the nearest airport to the Ramada by Wyndham Udaipur Resort and Spa?", "answer": "<p>Maharana Pratap Airport (UDR) is the nearest airport to&nbsp;<strong>Ramada by Wyndham Udaipur Resort and Spa</strong>, about 28 km away, a 45-60-minute drive.</p>"}, {"id": 728, "question": "Is an early check-in available for guests at Ramada by Wyndham Udaipur Resort and Spa?", "answer": "<p>Yes, an early check-in for guests can be arranged, subject to hotel availability. The standard time to check-in at&nbsp;<strong>Ramada by Wyndham Udaipur Resort and Spa</strong> is 2:00 pm, and guests can check out by 12:00 noon.</p>"}, {"id": 729, "question": "What is the ideal budget for a 2-night wedding at Ramada by Wyndham Udaipur Resort and Spa?", "answer": "<p>The standard cost of a destination wedding at&nbsp;<strong>Ramada by Wyndham Udaipur Resort and Spa&nbsp;</strong>for a 2-night event ranges from INR 50 lakhs to INR 80 lakhs. To get an estimate on your wedding budget, enter all logistical details into Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator.</p>"}, {"id": 730, "question": "How much can I save if I make a booking at Ramada by Wyndham Udaipur Resort through Viraaya Weddings?", "answer": "<p>Booking the&nbsp;<strong>Ramada Udaipur Resort</strong> through Viraaya Weddings can help you save 10-15% or more with negotiated rates, plus access to trusted vendors and smoother planning support.</p>"}, {"id": 731, "question": "What is the standard liquor policy of Ramada by Wyndham Udaipur Resort and Spa?", "answer": "<p><strong>Ramada by Wyndham Udaipur Resort and Spa</strong> follows an in-house bar policy for weddings. Outside alcohol is not permitted, and all beverages are served and charged on consumption.</p>"}]', '373', '72'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'udaipur' AND `slug` = 'ramada-by-wyndham-udaipur-resort-and-spa');
