SELECT 'udaipur', 'taj-aravali-resort-and-spa-udaipur', 'published', 'Taj Aravali Resort & Spa Udaipur Wedding Cost & Booking', 'Planning a Taj Aravali Udaipur wedding? Explore wedding cost, booking & luxury packages at Taj Aravali Resort for your dream Udaipur destination wedding.', 'taj aravali resort & spa udaipur wedding, taj aravali udaipur wedding, taj aravali udaipur wedding cost, taj aravali udaipur booking, taj aravali resort & spa udaipur booking, taj aravali resort udaipur, taj aravali resort & spa udaipur price, udaipur taj aravali resort', '/storage/hotel/seo/WigxOfMt2lMBkrNBZGYl1WVLAIvIZ2dPcdYAFCqD.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/7i0AjcUmIXD1zfL5Ry0Jo9dlUGLixrnOInGLKjEG.jpg', 'Taj Aravali Resort And Spa Udaipur', 'No. 1, near Kodiyat, Forest, Kodiyat, Udaipur, Rajasthan 313031, India', '45 Minutes', '20 Minutes', '<p>Tucked into the lush greens of the Aravallis, <strong>Taj Aravali Resort &amp; Spa, Udaipur</strong>, feels closely connected to its surroundings. Spread across 30 acres, the luxurious design brings together clean, modern lines with subtle nods to Mewar’s equestrian heritage. Details like gokhra-style seating and natural textures add warmth, giving the space a distinct sense of character.</p><p>The venues at Taj Aravali, Udaipur resort open out into the landscape. Open lawns, peaceful courtyards and elegant indoor spaces offer a relaxed setting for celebrations, with the flexibility to honour different traditions in a meaningful way. A wedding mandap here sits against the hills and the wide-open sky, with soft lighting and a beautiful atmosphere that lingers with your guests.&nbsp;</p><p>With 181 premium accommodations, attentive hospitality and carefully planned dining experiences, the celebration flows smoothly from start to finish. It’s a place that brings people together comfortably, making it a natural choice for international and Indian families planning a destination wedding in Udaipur.</p>', '181 rooms with suites', 'Grand Ballroom, Celebration Room', 'Aravali Lawn, Mewar Lawn 1, Mewar Lawn 2,', '400', '400', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/ywI7Rg6B1we49js1pOfQjWHl4YcGoeeK1OoshJWz.jpg", "title": "1.\t4+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/4t0moHbeCp9CCS1GH0E6wH0T1raNPwxazRkSQB5D.jpg", "title": "2.\tPrivate sundowners at Alsigarh Lake"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/8XkUFLQyBcyApM9n9SM2Hriyht0royJzQCEWl02F.jpg", "title": "3.\tHillside dining experiences at Rayta Hills"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/RVLKeqKMYDZU4EwbJR2w7OBGGbWMINwhjDCS5RRG.jpg", "title": "4.\tBonfire evenings with wine and canapés"}]', '[{"id": 89, "question": "How much does a wedding at Taj Aravali Resort & Spa, Udaipur resort cost?", "answer": "<p>On average, the <strong>Taj Aravali Udaipur wedding cost</strong> usually ranges from INR 1 Cr to INR 2.5 Cr for a 3-day 2-night celebration. To get an exact quote, refer to our Cost Calculator and enter your preferred dates of stay, the total number of guests, the total number of rooms required and any other details. With this tool, you will be able to instantly find out the precise estimate for a destination wedding in Udahipur.</p>"}, {"id": 90, "question": "Which is the nearest airport to the Taj Aravali Resort & Spa, Udaipur?", "answer": "<p>The nearest airport to the Taj Aravali Resort &amp; Spa, Udaipur, is Maharana Pratap Airport (UDR), located about 38 km from the resort. To get here, you can take a private transfer, which will drop you off at the location in 60 to 80 minutes</p>"}, {"id": 91, "question": "Does the Taj Aravali Resort & Spa, Udaipur, offer seasonal wedding discounts?", "answer": "<p>Yes, the Taj Aravali Udaipur resort offers both seasonal and group wedding packages, with discounted rates. During the off-peak season, the hotel offers complimentary suites and accommodations, along with special rates. You can access special pricing and deals through Viraaya Weddings'' exclusive seasonal offers.</p>"}, {"id": 92, "question": "What is the check-in time at Taj Aravali Resort & Spa, Udaipur, and can we check-in early?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at Taj Aravali Resort &amp; Spa, Udaipur is 2:00 pm, and guests can check out by 12:00 noon. If guests require an early check-in, they can request an early check-in, and it can be accommodated, subject to availability.</p>"}, {"id": 93, "question": "What is the liquor policy for destination weddings at Taj Aravali Resort & Spa, Udaipur?", "answer": "<p>Alcohol is available at Taj Aravali Resort &amp; Spa, Udaipur, and all drinks for events and shared spaces are exclusively provided by the hotel. Outside liquor is not permitted. Charges are based on what is consumed and are usually billed separately from the wedding package.</p>"}]', '43', '181'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'udaipur' AND `slug` = 'taj-aravali-resort-and-spa-udaipur');
--> statement-breakpoint
