SELECT 'udaipur', 'taj-fateh-prakash-palace-udaipur', 'published', 'Taj Fateh Prakash Palace Udaipur Wedding Cost & Booking', 'Marry in a real Udaipur palace! Check Taj Fateh Prakash Palace wedding cost, royal venues & booking options for your grand lakeside destination wedding.', 'taj fateh prakash palace wedding cost, taj fateh prakash udaipur price, taj fateh prakash palace in udaipur, taj fateh prakash palace udaipur', '/storage/hotel/seo/sG9VyQWAwWEAEiMWT6BgRIYQJxK3RatrsyEtC21v.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/uUnZYd4gefGHKMUbBCU3MR5DRokljiqIZdNSzeDH.jpg', 'Taj Fateh Prakash Palace Udaipur', 'The City Palace Complex, Lake, City Palace Rd, near Zenana Mahal, Old City, Pichola, Udaipur, Rajasthan 313004, India', '45 Minutes', '15 minutes', '<p>Set along the banks of Lake Pichola, the <strong>Taj Fateh Prakash Palace, Udaipur,</strong> is an authentic 19th-century royal residence. Marked by detailed marble work, mirror inlay and ivory-finished furnishings, this palace-turned-hotel brings a sense of richness without seeming overwhelming. The property’s tall arched windows, high ceilings and ornate balconies open out to stunning lake views.</p><p>The palace offers a selection of heritage spaces suited for wedding celebrations, including courtyards and the iconic Durbar Hall, where pheras or mandap ceremonies can be held in a setting carved by the city’s rich history.</p><p>The thoughtful décor and attentive service at the palace come together in a way that feels personal, leaving a lasting impression on even the most well-travelled of your guests.</p>', '65 rooms with suites', 'Durbal Hall Sabhagaar, Durbal Hall Satkar', 'Poolside Area, Palace Courtyards', '150', '150', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/ynDDnOdybb6vRPyoWLPDTfic9z4tt90l0l17Jnp5.jpg", "title": "Poolside Area, Palace Courtyards"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/FyjBPWO8DTDs8Y7WCeRPErWTtWrgMqOJKAcfLwpX.jpg", "title": "Private dining at Rang Chowk"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/HCRvAHUt4UYj7i0GrfDa67juLmJ0M9Xm188Msuq5.jpg", "title": "2+ restaurants and bars onsite"}]', '[{"id": 94, "question": "1.\tHow much does a wedding at Taj Fateh Prakash Palace in Udaipur cost?", "answer": "<p>On average, the <strong>Taj Fateh Prakash Palace wedding costs</strong> between INR 80 lakhs and INR 1.5 Cr for a 2-day event. To get an exact estimate, refer to our Cost Calculator. Simply enter your room requirements, preferred dates and other details to get an instant quote for your wedding budget.</p>"}, {"id": 95, "question": "2.\tWhat is the check-in time at Taj Fateh Prakash Palace, Udaipur, and is early check-in allowed?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at Taj Fateh Prakash Palace, Udaipur, is 2:00 pm, and check-out time is by 12:00 noon. Early check-in or a late check-out can be arranged, subject to availability.</p>"}, {"id": 96, "question": "3.\tWhich is the nearest airport to the Taj Fateh Prakash Palace in Udaipur?", "answer": "<p>Maharana Pratap Airport (UDR), which is about 23–26 km away, is the closest airport to Taj Fateh Prakash Palace in Udaipur. It usually takes 40 to 50 minutes by car to get from the airport to the hotel, which is in the City Palace complex on Lake Pichola.</p>"}, {"id": 97, "question": "4.\tIs Taj Fateh Prakash Palace, Udaipur, an ideal destination wedding venue?", "answer": "<p>Yes, the Taj Fateh Prakash Palace in Udaipur is a great place for a destination wedding. It has a 400-year-old heritage setting, beautiful views of Lake Pichola and royal architecture in the City Palace complex. It is great for weddings, with a reception capacity of 200 to 1,000 guests, and features beautiful spaces such as the Durbar Hall and the poolside location. Additionally, Jagmandir Island Palace is 400 metres away from the hotel, making it another beautiful wedding location that can be used by the host.</p>"}, {"id": 98, "question": "5.\tWhat is the liquor policy for a destination wedding at Taj Fateh Prakash Palace in Udaipur?", "answer": "<p>Taj Fateh Prakash Palace in Udaipur allows alcohol, but all drinks served in public areas and banquet rooms are provided by the hotel. You can''t bring alcohol onto the property from outside. The standard wedding package usually doesn''t cover the cost of drinks, which are charged separately based on how much you consume.</p>"}]', '33', '65'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'udaipur' AND `slug` = 'taj-fateh-prakash-palace-udaipur');
--> statement-breakpoint
INSERT INTO `hotels` (city, slug, status, seo_title, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, banner_image, name, address, airport_time, station_time, description, room_inventory, indoor_venues, outdoor_venues, guest_capacity, reception_capacity, highlights, faqs, external_hotel_id, total_rooms)
SELECT 'udaipur', 'taj-lake-palace-udaipur', 'published', 'Taj Lake Palace Udaipur – Wedding Packages & Venue Costs', 'Taj Lake Palace Udaipur is Rajasthan''s most iconic wedding venue. Discover exclusive packages, transparent costs & easy booking options. Book Now Today!', 'taj lake palace udaipur wedding, taj palace udaipur wedding cost, taj lake palace wedding, lake palace udaipur, udaipur lake palace, taj lake palace in udaipur, udaipur taj lake palace', '/storage/hotel/seo/D3FkmThfKbPKmFVWqHvYw3Fog7iXe3pw5i8Q1uMx.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/Yt19jFYMqvFMqwZLxumlrGykKdlOPeXYx5CKbHBM.jpg', 'Taj Lake Palace Udaipur', 'Lake Pichola, Pichola, Udaipur, Rajasthan 313004, India', '45 Minutes', '20 Minutes', '<p>Bathed in fairy-tale charm,&nbsp;<strong>Taj Lake Palace in Udaipur&nbsp;</strong>stands as a tapestry of India’s heritage. Considered to be an exceptional fusion of Mughal and Rajasthani Rajput architecture, this 18th-century resort is set on the pristine banks of Lake Pichola. Surrounded by the lush greens of the Aravallis, this palatial resort is situated on the Jag Niwas island, offering breathtaking views of the City Palace amidst its serene grandeur.</p><p>Renowned for its iconic, romantic feel, the&nbsp;<strong>Udaipur Taj Lake Palace&nbsp;</strong>appears to float at the heart of the lake. Its immaculate marble craftsmanship and intricate jharokha detailing create a sense of timeless elegance. Every courtyard and garden reflects meticulous artistry, making it one of the most sought-after wedding destinations in the City of Lakes.</p><p>With personalised assistance thoughtfully tailored to your vision, a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at Taj Lake Palace in Udaipur</strong> seems mystical. As the sun dips into the horizon and the stars seem to come to life, the shimmering waters surrounding the resort create an enchanting lakeside mandap setting. In such a celestial atmosphere, it feels as though the entire landscape was destined to unite two souls forever in holy matrimony.</p>', '83', 'Mewar Mahal, Jagmandir, Jharokha', 'Lily Pond Courtyard, Garden Areas, Scenic Rooftop Spots, Bhairo', '170', '200', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/B9MVstjH2YZmfu1TMHxFwemSSgZ68DsfJU85QluF.jpg", "title": "4+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/ASL9ckwrSqMvf5YyMpYRGj75a6FCchYkCNXkjNde.jpg", "title": "Luxurious accommodations with lake-side views"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/oDEU4AgQrDazwNKwNgmbR10lxpptlJsMipNJ2tzo.jpg", "title": "Lakeside marble palace with private gardens"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/aRnfhNaz6yIkPP7wtTTrqC9HIELlRUGwIKiUXelg.jpg", "title": "4 acres of lakeside views, gardens, and private celebration areas"}]', '[{"id": 661, "question": "What is the cost of a wedding at Taj Palace, Udaipur?", "answer": "<p>It is estimated that a&nbsp;<strong>wedding venue at the Taj Lake Palace in Udaipur</strong> can cost between INR 3 Cr and INR 3.5 Cr for 3 days and 2 nights. To get an exact quote, enter your trip details and requirements into our Cost Calculator to get an instant estimate.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 662, "question": "What hotel amenities are offered at the Taj Lake Palace, Udaipur?", "answer": "<p>Luxurious rooms, in-house dining, 24-hour in-room dining, boat rides, cultural performances, regal welcome arrival, wellness sessions, butler service and airport transfers, among others, are some of the hotel amenities that you can look forward to.</p>"}, {"id": 663, "question": "Is Taj Udaipur Lake Palace better than Oberoi Udaivillas, Udaipur?", "answer": "<p>The Taj Lake Palace in Udaipur has a beautiful, historic setting by the lake, with luxurious rooms, delicious food and a royal atmosphere. Couples who want a romantic, ultra-luxury wedding can get married here for a budget between INR 3 and 3.5 crore. The Oberoi Udaivillas has 87 rooms with beautiful Mewari architecture and lake views. It has elegant food and peaceful, opulent venues that make it perfect for a grand wedding with a budget of around INR 3.5 to 4.5 crore.</p>"}, {"id": 664, "question": "What is the check-in time at Udaipur Lake Palace, and can we check-in early?", "answer": "<p>At the Taj Lake Palace in Udaipur, check-in is usually by 2:00 pm and check-out is by 12:00 noon. Early check-in or late check-out can be requested if needed, and is subject to hotel availability.</p>"}, {"id": 665, "question": "Is alcohol permitted for a destination wedding at Taj Lake Palace, Udaipur?", "answer": "<p>Alcohol is allowed at Taj Lake Palace, Udaipur; however, all drinks served in public areas and banquet spaces must be purchased through the hotel. Bringing outside alcohol onto the property is not permitted. You will be charged for beverages separately based on consumption and are generally not included in the standard wedding package.</p>"}]', '24', '83'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'udaipur' AND `slug` = 'taj-lake-palace-udaipur');
--> statement-breakpoint
