SELECT 'udaipur', 'taj-lalit-bagh-udaipur', 'published', 'Taj Lalit Bagh Udaipur – Wedding Cost, Rooms & Booking', 'Plan your dream wedding at Taj Lalit Bagh Udaipur. Explore wedding cost, room options, venue photos & easy booking details for your special day.', 'taj lalit bagh udaipur, taj lalit bagh udaipur wedding, taj lalit bagh udaipur wedding cost', '/storage/hotel/seo/RfkbVJn622sYFgcshucdKShYGYe10HKlLwNjQaLE.png', '/storage/hotels/banners/nyCRZUQVlwymjTtokaf618VJVyurlZfWF6I3pOaG.jpg', 'Taj Lalit Bagh Udaipur', 'Mavli Road, Dabok, Naharmagra, Rajasthan 313201, India', '20 Minutes', '50 Minutes', '<p>Not every wedding venue tells a story before your celebrations even start. However, built around a century-old royal estate once linked with the Maharanas of Mewar,&nbsp;<strong>Taj Lalit Bagh Udaipur</strong> brings together rich architecture, landscaped gardens and luxury stays across an expansive 36-acre estate. For couples planning to host a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding in Udaipur</strong>, it offers the rare combination of grandeur, privacy and seamless accessibility, located just 15 minutes from Maharana Pratap Airport.</p><p>What makes a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at Taj Lalit Bagh, Udaipur</strong> particularly memorable is the sense of arrival. An ancient stepwell anchors the property, while open courtyards, garden squares and elegant pavilions create natural settings for every celebration. With over 930 sq m of indoor event space complemented by sprawling outdoor venues, the hotel comfortably accommodates everything from intimate ceremonies to lavish multi-day wedding festivities.</p><p><strong>Taj Lalit Bagh Udaipur&nbsp;</strong>houses 139 rooms and 16 suites, allowing families and guests to stay together within the estate. Between curated dining experiences, signature Taj hospitality, wellness facilities and easy access to attractions such as City Palace, Lake Pichola and Fateh Sagar Lake, the property creates a wedding experience that feels both regal and deeply personal.</p>', '139 rooms with 16 suites', 'Pratap Hall, Kumbha Pre-Function Area, Sanga Pre-Function Area, Chawand', 'Saheliyon Ki Baori, Chandra Chowk, Rang Chowk, Utsav Chowk, Durbar Chowk, Swarn Van, Raj Van', '350', '350', '[{"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal02.png", "title": "4+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal03.png", "title": "Private dining amidst hilltop vistas"}]', '[{"id": 1293, "question": "What is the standard check-in time at Taj Lalit Bagh Udaipur, and is early check-in available?", "answer": "<p>The check-in time at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Lalit Bagh Udaipur&nbsp;</strong>is 2:00 pm, and guests can check-out by 12:00 noon. Yes, guests can be accommodated with an early check-in, but it is entirely subject to the hotel’s discretion.</p>"}, {"id": 1294, "question": "Are there any special offers for wedding couples at Taj Lalit Bagh Udaipur?", "answer": "<p>Wedding offers at&nbsp;<strong>Taj Lalit Bagh, Udaipur</strong> may vary by season and package. For the latest wedding deals, exclusive inclusions and seasonal offers, check out the current listings on Viraaya Weddings.</p>"}, {"id": 1295, "question": "What is the history of Taj Lalit Bagh Udaipur?", "answer": "<p>Inaugurated in 2025,&nbsp;<strong>Taj Lalit Bagh, Udaipur</strong> is built around a century-old estate that reflects the city’s architectural heritage and legacy. An ancient stepwell at the heart of the 5-star property and its preserved historical character make it a distinctive wedding venue that connects modern luxury with Udaipur’s rich past.</p>"}, {"id": 1296, "question": "What is included in the wedding package at Taj Lalit Bagh Udaipur?", "answer": "<p>Wedding packages at Taj Lalit Bagh, Udaipur generally include the venue, guest accommodation, catering, décor and entertainment. Inclusions may vary based on your celebration requirements, so it is best to confirm the latest package details with the Viraaya Weddings team.</p>"}, {"id": 1297, "question": "What is the standard liquor policy at Taj Lalit Bagh Udaipur?", "answer": "<p>Outside alcohol is not allowed inside&nbsp;<strong>Taj Lalit Bagh Udaipur</strong>. All beverages and drinks must be sourced through the hotel’s in-house bar. Please note that all beverages are charged separately and are usually billed on a consumption basis.</p>"}]', '152', '155'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'udaipur' AND `slug` = 'taj-lalit-bagh-udaipur');
