SELECT 'udaipur', 'the-ananta-udaipur', 'published', 'The Ananta Udaipur – Wedding Costs & Packages', 'Planning a lakeside wedding in Udaipur? The Ananta Udaipur delivers breathtaking venues, clear wedding cost, venue cost details & exclusive packages. Book!', 'the ananta udaipur wedding cost, the ananta udaipur wedding price the ananta udaipur wedding venue cost, the ananta udaipur wedding, the ananta udaipur packages', '/storage/hotel/seo/miv1pgtGfyh1bBeWUmv8JxCOLkX8wSoNa5SiEM2N.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/SmNaJKEUGqbyOSlTxqNFD18yTb4PEh4GU3H1QAwd.jpg', 'The Ananta Udaipur', 'Village Bujhda, Tehsil Girwa, Kodiyat Road, Udaipur, Rajasthan 313031, India, India', '60 Minutes', '35 Minutes', '<p>Udaipur is often called the crown jewel of Rajasthan, known for its lakes, palaces and timeless architecture that give it the charm of the ‘Venice of the East’. Surrounded by the Aravalli Hills, the city feels scenic and relaxed, making it a beautiful setting for a&nbsp;<strong>destination wedding at The Ananta Udaipur</strong> that feels both grand and meaningful.</p><p>Set within this scenic landscape,&nbsp;<strong>The Ananta Udaipur</strong> offers hillside views that lend an unhurried feel to the stay. Spread across 90 acres of wide grounds, its accommodations open into winding pathways and open skies, making every celebration feel like a relaxed retreat. The property also features large lawns, elegant banquet halls and curated dining experiences that make the entire experience worthwhile.</p><p>Located around 30 km from Maharana Pratap Airport, it remains well-connected while still feeling peaceful and away from the city rush. With warm hospitality, spacious event areas and a natural hillside setting,&nbsp;<strong>The Ananta Udaipur</strong> feels more like a destination where wedding moments come together beautifully.</p>', '244', 'Neelgiri Banquet Hall, Aravali Banquet Hall', 'Neelgiri Lawn, Party Lawn Aravali', '500', '530', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/PIJv0u8nmDIZOymIDSQyDaT3rSoj4iSSwU9ldVr3.jpg", "title": "4+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/r9lJenWInFTyAlZY1NbkvNTNPZ3mLx3qreGXBZdR.jpg", "title": "Couple’s private spa therapy"}]', '[{"id": 511, "question": "What is the cost of a destination wedding at The Ananta Udaipur?", "answer": "<p>On average,&nbsp;<strong>the Ananta Udaipur wedding venue cost&nbsp;</strong>ranges from INR 90 lakhs to INR 2.5 Cr for a 3-day, 2-night event. Refer to Viraaya Weddings'' Cost Calculator to instantly get an exact quote based on your guest capacity, room requirements, and preferred dates of stay.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": 512, "question": "Can I host a pre-wedding photoshoot at The Ananta Udaipur?", "answer": "<p>Yes, you can host a pre-wedding photoshoot at&nbsp;<strong>The Ananta Udaipur</strong>, but you’ll need prior permission and may have to pay additional charges depending on usage.</p>"}, {"id": 513, "question": "How much can I save if I book through Viraaya Weddings?", "answer": "<p>Viraaya Weddings'' hotel partnerships at Ananta Udaipur can help you save 10-15% or more on your stay at negotiated rates. You also get better coordination and easier planning with trustworthy vendors.</p>"}, {"id": 514, "question": "Is early check-in at The Ananta Udaipur allowed?", "answer": "<p>Yes, The Ananta Udaipur can accommodate early check-ins, subject to availability. The standard check-in time at the hotel is 2:00 pm, and check-out is by 11:00 am.</p>"}, {"id": 515, "question": "Can I bring my own alcohol to The Ananta Udaipur?", "answer": "<p><strong>The Ananta Udaipur</strong> does serve alcohol, but all beverages need to be arranged through the hotel. Outside alcohol is not permitted on the property. Charges are applied separately based on actual consumption, as it is not included in standard wedding packages.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"}]', '348', '244'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'udaipur' AND `slug` = 'the-ananta-udaipur');
