SELECT 'udaipur', 'the-leela-palace-udaipur', 'published', 'The Leela Palace Udaipur Wedding Cost & Venue Booking', 'Check The Leela Palace Udaipur wedding cost, venue details, and availability. Book your luxury destination wedding with best pricing and seamless planning.', 'leela palace wedding cost, the leela palace udaipur wedding cost, The Leela Palace Udaipur wedding, leela palace udaipur price, the leela palace udaipur price, leela palace udaipur wedding, leela palace booking, the leela palace udaipur booking, the leela palace udaipur reviews, udaipur leela palace, leela palace udaipur cost', '/storage/hotel/seo/znWpedORGfILJlpdJmFzwYgtfPjUz4h0bywGqal8.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/M1MXNmoRSLqm3AWgHOJcWAaKkeTPqAtujN3446sZ.jpg', 'The Leela Palace Udaipur', 'Naga Nagari, Lake, 88, Outside Chandpole, Pichola, Udaipur, Rajasthan 313001, India', '40 Minutes', '20 Minutes', '<p>Set by the serene waters of Lake Pichola, The Leela Palace, Udaipur, is a premium property regarded as one of the most popular wedding destinations in the City of Lakes. Evoking the grandeur of the Land of Mewars, the&nbsp;<strong>Udaipur Leela Palace</strong> is built to epitomise Rajasthani royal heritage, surrounded by the lush Aravallis.</p><p>Posing as one of the most exquisite celebratory venues in Udaipur, a&nbsp;<strong>wedding at The Leela Palace Udaipur&nbsp;</strong>is no less than a fairy-tale experience. Every wedding function is rooted in tradition, from glittering lakefront ceremonies to lavish palace soirées, creating an experience that is both intimate and breathtaking.</p><p>With a dedicated in-house team offering exclusive services at the&nbsp;<strong>Leela Palace Udaipur wedding</strong>, each wedding function is seamlessly managed through personalised plans, bespoke décor, impeccable hospitality, and culinary experiences, as per your vision.</p>', '89 rooms with suites', 'Marwar Conference Hall With Open Terrace, Mewar Conference Hall, Inner Courtyard', 'Outer Courtyard, Guava Garden, Croquet Lawn, Sheesh Mahal Terrace', '200', '200', '[{"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal02.png", "title": "Restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal03.png", "title": "Signature celebration experiences"}, {"image": "/user/assets/images/hotal04.png", "title": "Private dining and hospitality"}]', '[]', '12', '89'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'udaipur' AND `slug` = 'the-leela-palace-udaipur');
