SELECT 'udaipur', 'udaipur-marriott-hotel', 'published', 'Udaipur Marriott Hotel Destination Wedding Venue & Booking', 'Book your destination wedding at Udaipur Marriott Hotel. Explore venue details, wedding cost, packages & plan a luxury celebration in Udaipur today.', 'udaipur marriott hotel wedding cost, jw marriott udaipur price, jw marriott udaipur resort & spa, marriott udaipur rajasthan, hotel jw marriott udaipur, udaipur marriott hotel wedding, udaipur marriott wedding, marriott udaipur wedding, udaipur marriott destination wedding, marriott udaipur destination', '/storage/hotel/seo/FBOAc48bSNXmmERTzgcrVTKjAJXBepJEa6fLPARe.jpg', '/storage/hotels/banners/bPrPlCTMYuTAXRdbG6ti5DjYt6piUeq7EQA4v0nI.jpg', 'Udaipur Marriott Hotel', 'Tiger Hills, Badi Road, near Fateh Sagar Lake, Shilpgram, Udaipur, Hawala Khurd, Rajasthan 313011, India', '40 Minutes', '20 Minutes', '<p>Spanning 1.05 hectares along the serene Fateh Sagar Lake, <strong>Udaipur Marriott Hotel&nbsp;</strong>draws inspiration from Udaipur’s iconic City Palace. Traditional elements such as jharokha balconies, chhatris and subtle Pichwai-style motifs blend with modern design to create an unbeatable setting.</p><p>Its expansive lawns and sophisticated ballrooms offer versatile venues for weddings. Couples can host mandap ceremonies or sunset pheras by the lake, with the Aravalli Hills acting as a stunning backdrop. Thoughtful lighting and décor enhance the ambience, making each celebration feel extraordinary.</p><p>The Udaipur Marriott’s legacy and combination of comfort, style and attention to detail make it ideal for families seeking a memorable destination wedding experience in the City of Lakes.</p>', '226 rooms with suites', 'Grand Crystal Ballroom, Ruby Hall, Emerald Hall', 'Jasper Courtyard, Crystal Lawn, Mewar Royal Rooftop', '500', '500', '[{"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/Ouahs1BpWSXggGm5Mu6kT7oUrlePZu3k1xNBoaYd.jpg", "title": "4+ restaurants and bars onsite"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/bkwUQpkiEhKFTBoQLKP821JgAgqH9qSSmp7aE9In.jpg", "title": "Serene boat rides across Udaipur’s lakes"}, {"image": "/storage/hotels/amenities/dvOu721UuiV1RwUEBIwKF9IkUK8rDi8MR0qB55Kr.jpg", "title": "Immersive visits to iconic Udaipur landmarks"}]', '[{"id": 69, "question": "How much does a wedding at the Udaipur Marriott Hotel resort cost?", "answer": "<p>The standard price of a <strong>destination wedding at Udaipur Marriott Hotel&nbsp;</strong>ranges from INR 75 lakhs to over INR 5 Cr for a 3-day 2-night event. Use our Cost Calculator to get accurate pricing. Enter your preferred dates of stay, the duration of your stay, the number of rooms required and the total guest capacity to get an exact quote within seconds.</p>"}, {"id": 70, "question": "Can I host a pre-wedding photoshoot at Udaipur Marriott Hotel, Rajasthan?", "answer": "<p>Yes, couples can arrange a pre-wedding photoshoot at the Udaipur Marriott. It is best to check with the hotel in advance for availability, applicable fees and any required permissions.</p>"}, {"id": 71, "question": "Which is a better venue for a destination wedding in Udaipur: Udaipur Marriott Hotel or Aurika, Udaipur?", "answer": "<p>Udaipur Marriott Hotel is around 40 minutes from the airport and has 226 rooms. It works well if you are planning a large, lively celebration, with wedding budgets usually ranging from INR 75 lakhs to INR 5 crore.</p><p>Aurika, Udaipur is about 35 to 45 minutes from the airport and has 139 rooms. It is better suited for a more private, design-focused wedding, with budgets typically between INR 1 crore and INR 1.85 crore.</p>"}, {"id": 72, "question": "What is the check-in time at the Udaipur Marriott Hotel, and can we check in early?", "answer": "<p>The standard check-in time at Udaipur Marriott Hotel is 3:00 pm, and check-out is usually by 12:00 noon. If required, an early check-in can be requested and accommodated, subject to hotel availability.</p>"}, {"id": 73, "question": "What is the liquor policy for destination weddings at Udaipur Marriott Hotel?", "answer": "<p>The Udaipur Marriott Hotel allows alcohol, but all drinks served in banquet areas and public areas must be purchased directly from the hotel. Alcohol from outside is not allowed on the property. Beverages are usually not part of the standard wedding package and are charged separately based on consumption.</p>"}]', '41', '226'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `hotels` WHERE `city` = 'udaipur' AND `slug` = 'udaipur-marriott-hotel');
